r best practices\n- Need help with api development skills covering rest, graphql, openapi, authentication, and api design patterns.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for rest endpoint designer\n2. Follows industry best practices and patterns\n3. Generates production-ready code and configurations\n4. Validates outputs against common standards\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example: Basic Usage**\nRequest: \"Help me with rest endpoint designer\"\nResult: Provides step-by-step guidance and generates appropriate configurations\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Relevant development environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of api development concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **API Development** skill category.\nTags: api, rest, graphql, openapi, swagger\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:06:57.138Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for API Development Agents needing automated REST endpoint design and development capabilities.","zh":"适合需要自动化REST端点设计和开发能力的API开发代理。","ja":"自動化されたRESTエンドポイントの設計および開発機能を必要とするAPI開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 REST 엔드포인트 디자인 및 개발 기능을 필요로 하는 API 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de API que necesitan capacidades de diseño y desarrollo automatizado de puntos de conexión de REST.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement d''API nécessitant des capacités de conception et de développement automatisées de points de terminaison REST.","de":"Perfekt für API-Entwicklungsagenten, die automatisierte REST-Endpunkt-Design- und Entwicklungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de API que necessitam de capacidades de design e desenvolvimento de pontos de extremidade REST automatizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки API, которым необходимы автоматические возможности проектирования и разработки конечных точек REST.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء API التي تحتاج إلى قدرات تصميم وتنفيذ نقطة النهاية REST أوتوماتيكيًا."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and develop robust REST APIs using best practices, including OpenAPI, GraphQL, and authentication protocols, streamlining API development workflows.","zh":"赋予代理设计和开发强大的REST API的能力，使用最佳实践，包括OpenAPI、GraphQL和身份验证协议，简化API开发工作流程。","ja":"エージェントがOpenAPI、GraphQL、および認証プロトコルを含むベストプラクティスを使用して強力なREST APIを設計および開発できるようにし、API開発ワークフローを合理化します。","ko":"에이전트가 OpenAPI, GraphQL 및 인증 프로토콜을 포함한 최적의 방법을 사용하여 강력한 REST API를 설계 및 개발할 수 있도록 하며, API 개발 워크플ロー를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar y desarrollar APIs REST robustas utilizando las mejores prácticas, incluyendo OpenAPI, GraphQL y protocolos de autenticación, simplificando los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de développer des API REST robustes en utilisant les meilleures pratiques, y compris OpenAPI, GraphQL et les protocoles d''authentification, simplifiant les flux de travail de développement d''API.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, robuste REST-APIs unter Verwendung von Best Practices, einschließlich OpenAPI, GraphQL und Authentifizierungsprotokollen, zu entwerfen und zu entwickeln, wodurch API-Entwicklungsworkflows gestreamt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e desenvolver APIs REST robustas usando as melhores práticas, incluindo OpenAPI, GraphQL e protocolos de autenticação, simplificando os fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и развивать прочные REST API, используя лучшие практики, включая OpenAPI, GraphQL и протоколы аутентификации, оптимизируя рабочие процессы разработки API.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم وتنفيذ APIs REST قوية باستخدام أفضل الممارسات، بما في ذلك OpenAPI وGraphQL وبروتوكولات التحقق، وبذلك يتم تبسيط سير عمل تطوير API."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating REST endpoint design patterns","Generating API documentation using OpenAPI","Debugging API authentication and authorization issues"],"zh":["自动化REST端点设计模式","使用OpenAPI生成API文档","调试API身份验证和授权问题"],"ja":["RESTエンドポイントの設計パターンを自動化する","OpenAPIを使用してAPIドキュメントを生成する","APIの認証および認可の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["REST 엔드포인트 디자인 패턴 자동화","OpenAPI를 사용하여 API 문서 생성","API 인증 및 권한 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de patrones de diseño de puntos de conexión de REST","Generación de documentación de API mediante OpenAPI","Depuración de problemas de autenticación y autorización de API"],"fr":["Automatisation des modèles de conception de points de terminaison REST","Génération de documentation d''API à l''aide d''OpenAPI","Débogage des problèmes d''authentification et d''autorisation d''API"],"de":["Automatisierung von REST-Endpunkt-Designmustern","Generierung von API-Dokumentation mithilfe von OpenAPI","Fehlerbehebung bei API-Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungsproblemen"],"pt":["Automatizar padrões de design de pontos de extremidade REST","Gerar documentação de API usando OpenAPI","Depurar problemas de autenticação e autorização de API"],"ru":["Автоматизировать шаблоны проектирования конечных точек REST","Генерировать документацию API с помощью OpenAPI","Отлаживать проблемы аутентификации и авторизации API"],"ar":["تأتميم أنماط تصميم نقطة النهاية REST","توليد توثيق API باستخدام OpenAPI","تصحيح أخطاء مصادقة وتصريح API"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of REST, GraphQL, and OpenAPI specifications","Limited to API development domain"],"zh":["需要了解REST、GraphQL和OpenAPI规范","仅限于API开发领域"],"ja":["REST、GraphQL、およびOpenAPIの仕様を理解する必要がある","API開発ドメインに限定される"],"ko":["REST, GraphQL 및 OpenAPI 사양을 이해해야 함","API 개발 도메인에 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de las especificaciones de REST, GraphQL y OpenAPI","Limitado al dominio de desarrollo de API"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des spécifications REST, GraphQL et OpenAPI","Limité au domaine du développement d''API"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse der REST-, GraphQL- und OpenAPI-Spezifikationen","Begrenzt auf das API-Entwicklungsbereich"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento das especificações REST, GraphQL e OpenAPI","Limitado ao domínio do desenvolvimento de API"],"ru":["Требует знания спецификаций REST, GraphQL и OpenAPI","Ограничен областью разработки API"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمواصفات REST وGraphQL وOpenAPI","محدود بنطاق تطوير API"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c0b1c72e61308bdd58084021bdcc5a3c8071501c56efd0b0ffabb4770b196f8c","qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/serialization', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'serialization', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z', '2026-02-20T05:06:52.790Z', '0f1f254521079e26f086132d639c959b4ac7be6ad2ec8fe64be61724d9021779', '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/serialization","name":"serialization","description":{"pt":"Serialização em .NET é um processo fundamental para APIs, mensagens e persistência de dados. Aprenda sobre as melhores práticas e como implementá-las","ru":"Сериализация в .NET является фундаментальным процессом для API, сообщений и хранения данных. Узнайте о лучших практиках и том, как их реализовать","ar":"الترميز في .NET هو عملية أساسية للواجهات البرمجية، والرسائل، ومحو الأمثلة. تعرف على أفضل الممارسات وكيفية تنفيذها","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"pt":"Serialização em .NET: Guia Completo","ru":"Сериализация в .NET: Всё, что нужно знать","ar":"الترميز في .NET: دليل شاملة","en":"serialization"},"description":{"pt":"Serialização em .NET é um processo fundamental para APIs, mensagens e persistência de dados. Aprenda sobre as melhores práticas e como implementá-las","ru":"Сериализация в .NET является фундаментальным процессом для API, сообщений и хранения данных. Узнайте о лучших практиках и том, как их реализовать","ar":"الترميز في .NET هو عملية أساسية للواجهات البرمجية، والرسائل، ومحو الأمثلة. تعرف على أفضل الممارسات وكيفية تنفيذها","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"pt":["Escolha do formato de serialização","Migração de Newtonsoft.Json para System.Text.Json","Implementação de serialização compatível com AOT","Projeto de formatos de fio para sistemas distribuídos","Otimização do desempenho de serialização"],"ru":["Выбор формата сериализации","Миграция с Newtonsoft.Json на System.Text.Json","Реализация сериализации, совместимой с AOT","Проектирование форматов передачи для распределённых систем","Оптимизация производительности сериализации"],"ar":["اختيار صيغة الترميز","هجرة من Newtonsoft.Json إلى System.Text.Json","تنفيذ الترميز المتوافق مع AOT","تصميم صيغ الكابل لمنظومة موزعة","تحسين أداء الترميز"]},"keywords":{"pt":["serialização em .NET","formatos de serialização","System.Text.Json","Newtonsoft.Json","AOT","sistemas distribuídos","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["сериализация в .NET","форматы сериализации","System.Text.Json","Newtonsoft.Json","AOT","распределённые системы","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["الترميز في .NET","صيغ الترميز","System.Text.Json","Newtonsoft.Json","AOT","منظومة موزعة","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"serialization","description":"Choose the right serialization format for .NET applications. Prefer schema-based formats (Protobuf, MessagePack) over reflection-based (Newtonsoft.Json). Use System.Text.Json with AOT source generators for JSON scenarios.","bodyPreview":"# Serialization in .NET\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Choosing a serialization format for APIs, messaging, or persistence\n- Migrating from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json\n- Implementing AOT-compatible serialization\n- Designing wire formats for distributed systems\n- Optimizing serialization performance\n\n---\n\n## Schema-Based vs Reflection-Based\n\n| Aspect | Schema-Based | Reflection-Based |\n|--------|--------------|------------------|\n| **Examples** | Protobuf, MessagePack,","body":"# Serialization in .NET\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Choosing a serialization format for APIs, messaging, or persistence\n- Migrating from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json\n- Implementing AOT-compatible serialization\n- Designing wire formats for distributed systems\n- Optimizing serialization performance\n\n---\n\n## Schema-Based vs Reflection-Based\n\n| Aspect | Schema-Based | Reflection-Based |\n|--------|--------------|------------------|\n| **Examples** | Protobuf, MessagePack, System.Text.Json (source gen) | Newtonsoft.Json, BinaryFormatter |\n| **Type info in payload** | No (external schema) | Yes (type names embedded) |\n| **Versioning** | Explicit field numbers/names | Implicit (type structure) |\n| **Performance** | Fast (no reflection) | Slower (runtime reflection) |\n| **AOT compatible** | Yes | No |\n| **Wire compatibility** | Excellent | Poor |\n\n**Recommendation**: Use schema-based serialization for anything that crosses process boundaries.\n\n---\n\n## Format Recommendations\n\n| Use Case | Recommended Format | Why |\n|----------|-------------------|-----|\n| **REST APIs** | System.Text.Json (source gen) | Standard, AOT-compatible |\n| **gRPC** | Protocol Buffers | Native format, excellent versioning |\n| **Actor messaging** | MessagePack or Protobuf | Compact, fast, version-safe |\n| **Event sourcing** | Protobuf or MessagePack | Must handle old events forever |\n| **Caching** | MessagePack | Compact, fast |\n| **Configuration** | JSON (System.Text.Json) | Human-readable |\n| **Logging** | JSON (System.Text.Json) | Structured, parseable |\n\n### Formats to Avoid\n\n| Format | Problem |\n|--------|---------|\n| **BinaryFormatter** | Security vulnerabilities, deprecated, never use |\n| **Newtonsoft.Json default** | Type names in payload break on rename |\n| **DataContractSerializer** | Complex, poor versioning |\n| **XML** | Verbose, slow, complex |\n\n---\n\n## System.Text.Json with Source Generators\n\nFor JSON serialization, use System.Text.Json with source generators for AOT compatibility and performance.\n\n### Setup\n\n```csharp\n// Define a JsonSerializerContext with all your types\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(Order))]\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(OrderItem))]\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(Customer))]\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(List<Order>))]\n[JsonSourceGenerationOptions(\n    PropertyNamingPolicy = JsonKnownNamingPolicy.CamelCase,\n    DefaultIgnoreCondition = JsonIgnoreCondition.WhenWritingNull)]\npublic partial class AppJsonContext : JsonSerializerContext { }\n```\n\n### Usage\n\n```csharp\n// Serialize with context\nvar json = JsonSerializer.Serialize(order, AppJsonContext.Default.Order);\n\n// Deserialize with context\nvar order = JsonSerializer.Deserialize(json, AppJsonContext.Default.Order);\n\n// Configure in ASP.NET Core\nbuilder.Services.ConfigureHttpJsonOptions(options =>\n{\n    options.SerializerOptions.TypeInfoResolverChain.Insert(0, AppJsonContext.Default);\n});\n```\n\n### Benefits\n\n- **No reflection at runtime** - All type info generated at compile time\n- **AOT compatible** - Works with Native AOT publishing\n- **Faster** - No runtime type analysis\n- **Trim-safe** - Linker knows exactly what''s needed\n\n---\n\n## Protocol Buffers (Protobuf)\n\nBest for: Actor systems, gRPC, event sourcing, any long-lived wire format.\n\n### Setup\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package Google.Protobuf\ndotnet add package Grpc.Tools\n```\n\n### Define Schema\n\n```protobuf\n// orders.proto\nsyntax = \"proto3\";\n\nmessage Order {\n    string id = 1;\n    string customer_id = 2;\n    repeated OrderItem items = 3;\n    int64 created_at_ticks = 4;\n\n    // Adding new fields is always safe\n    string notes = 5;  // Added in v2 - old readers ignore it\n}\n\nmessage OrderItem {\n    string product_id = 1;\n    int32 quantity = 2;\n    int64 price_cents = 3;\n}\n```\n\n### Versioning Rules\n\n```protobuf\n// SAFE: Add new fields with new numbers\nmessage Order {\n    string id = 1;\n    string customer_id = 2;\n    string shipping_address = 5;  // NEW - safe\n}\n\n// SAFE: Remove fields (old readers ignore unknown, new readers use default)\n// Just stop using the field, keep the number reserved\nmessage Order {\n    string id = 1;\n    // customer_id removed, but field 2 is reserved\n    reserved 2;\n}\n\n// UNSAFE: Change field types\nmessage Order {\n    int32 id = 1;  // Was: string - BREAKS!\n}\n\n// UNSAFE: Reuse field numbers\nmessage Order {\n    reserved 2;\n    string new_field = 2;  // Reusing 2 - BREAKS!\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## MessagePack\n\nBest for: High-performance scenarios, compact payloads, actor messaging.\n\n### Setup\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package MessagePack\ndotnet add package MessagePack.Annotations\n```\n\n### Usage with Contracts\n\n```csharp\n[MessagePackObject]\npublic sealed class Order\n{\n    [Key(0)]\n    public required string Id { get; init; }\n\n    [Key(1)]\n    public required string CustomerId { get; init; }\n\n    [Key(2)]\n    public required IReadOnlyList<OrderItem> Items { get; init; }\n\n    [Key(3)]\n    public required DateTimeOffset CreatedAt { get; init; }\n\n    // New field - old readers skip unknown keys\n    [Key(4)]\n    public string? Notes { get; init; }\n}\n\n// Serialize\nvar bytes = MessagePackSerializer.Serialize(order);\n\n// Deserialize\nvar order = MessagePackSerializer.Deserialize<Order>(bytes);\n```\n\n### AOT-Compatible Setup\n\n```csharp\n// Use source generator for AOT\n[MessagePackObject]\npublic partial class Order { }  // partial enables source gen\n\n// Configure resolver\nvar options = MessagePackSerializerOptions.Standard\n    .WithResolver(CompositeResolver.Create(\n        GeneratedResolver.Instance,  // Generated\n        StandardResolver.Instance));\n```\n\n---\n\n## Migrating from Newtonsoft.Json\n\n### Common Issues\n\n| Newtonsoft | System.Text.Json | Fix |\n|------------|------------------|-----|\n| `$type` in JSON | Not supported by default | Use discriminators or custom converters |\n| `JsonProperty` | `JsonPropertyName` | Different attribute |\n| `DefaultValueHandling` | `DefaultIgnoreCondition` | Different API |\n| `NullValueHandling` | `DefaultIgnoreCondition` | Different API |\n| Private setters | Requires `[JsonInclude]` | Explicit opt-in |\n| Polymorphism | `[JsonDerivedType]` (.NET 7+) | Explicit discriminators |\n\n### Migration Pattern\n\n```csharp\n// Newtonsoft (reflection-based)\npublic class Order\n{\n    [JsonProperty(\"order_id\")]\n    public string Id { get; set; }\n\n    [JsonProperty(NullValueHandling = NullValueHandling.Ignore)]\n    public string? Notes { get; set; }\n}\n\n// System.Text.Json (source-gen compatible)\npublic sealed record Order(\n    [property: JsonPropertyName(\"order_id\")]\n    string Id,\n\n    string? Notes  // Null handling via JsonSerializerOptions\n);\n\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(Order))]\n[JsonSourceGenerationOptions(\n    PropertyNamingPolicy = JsonKnownNamingPolicy.SnakeCaseLower,\n    DefaultIgnoreCondition = JsonIgnoreCondition.WhenWritingNull)]\npublic partial class OrderJsonContext : JsonSerializerContext { }\n```\n\n### Polymorphism with Discriminators\n\n```csharp\n// .NET 7+ polymorphism\n[JsonDerivedType(typeof(CreditCardPayment), \"credit_card\")]\n[JsonDerivedType(typeof(BankTransferPayment), \"bank_transfer\")]\npublic abstract record Payment(decimal Amount);\n\npublic sealed record CreditCardPayment(decimal Amount, string Last4) : Payment(Amount);\npublic sealed record BankTransferPayment(decimal Amount, string AccountNumber) : Payment(Amount);\n\n// Serializes as:\n// { \"$type\": \"credit_card\", \"amount\": 100, \"last4\": \"1234\" }\n```\n\n---\n\n## Wire Compatibility Patterns\n\n### Tolerant Reader\n\nOld code must safely ignore unknown fields:\n\n```csharp\n// Protobuf/MessagePack: Automatic - unknown fields skipped\n// System.Text.Json: Configure to allow\nvar options = new JsonSerializerOptions\n{\n    UnmappedMemberHandling = JsonUnmappedMemberHandling.Skip\n};\n```\n\n### Introduce Read Before Write\n\nDeploy deserializers before serializers for new formats:\n\n```csharp\n// Phase 1: Add deserializer (deployed everywhere)\npublic Order Deserialize(byte[] data, string manifest) => manifest switch\n{\n    \"Order.V1\" => DeserializeV1(data),\n    \"Order.V2\" => DeserializeV2(data),  // NEW - can read V2\n    _ => throw new NotSupportedException()\n};\n\n// Phase 2: Enable serializer (next release, after V1 deployed everywhere)\npublic (byte[] data, string manifest) Serialize(Order order) =>\n    _useV2Format\n        ? (SerializeV2(order), \"Order.V2\")\n        : (SerializeV1(order), \"Order.V1\");\n```\n\n### Never Embed Type Names\n\n```csharp\n// BAD: Type name in payload - renaming class breaks wire format\n{\n    \"$type\": \"MyApp.Order, MyApp.Core\",\n    \"id\": \"123\"\n}\n\n// GOOD: Explicit discriminator - refactoring safe\n{\n    \"type\": \"order\",\n    \"id\": \"123\"\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Comparison\n\nApproximate throughput (higher is better):\n\n| Format | Serialize | Deserialize | Size |\n|--------|-----------|-------------|------|\n| MessagePack | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ |\n| Protobuf | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ |\n| System.Text.Json (source gen) | ★★★★☆ | ★★★★☆ | ★★★☆☆ |\n| System.Text.Json (reflection) | ★★★☆☆ | ★★★☆☆ | ★★★☆☆ |\n| Newtonsoft.Json | ★★☆☆☆ | ★★☆☆☆ | ★★★☆☆ |\n\nFor hot paths, prefer MessagePack or Protobuf.\n\n---\n\n## Akka.NET Serialization\n\nFor Akka.NET actor systems, use schema-based serialization:\n\n```hocon\nakka {\n  actor {\n    serializers {\n      messagepack = \"Akka.Serialization.MessagePackSerializer, Akka.Serialization.MessagePack\"\n    }\n    serialization-bindings {\n      \"MyApp.Messages.IMessage, MyApp\" = messagepack\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nSee [Akka.NET Serialization Docs](https://getakka.net/articles/networking/serialization.html).\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### DO\n\n```csharp\n// Use source generators for System.Text.Json\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(Order))]\npublic partial class AppJsonContext : JsonSerializerContext { }\n\n// Use explicit field numbers/keys\n[MessagePackObject]\npublic class Order\n{\n    [Key(0)] public string Id { get; init; }\n}\n\n// Use records for immutable message types\npublic sealed record OrderCreated(OrderId Id, CustomerId CustomerId);\n```\n\n### DON''T\n\n```csharp\n// Don''t use BinaryFormatter (ever)\nvar formatter = new BinaryFormatter();  // Security risk!\n\n// Don''t embed type names in wire format\nsettings.TypeNameHandling = TypeNameHandling.All;  // Breaks on rename!\n\n// Don''t use reflection serialization for hot paths\nJsonConvert.SerializeObject(order);  // Slow, not AOT-compatible\n```\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- **System.Text.Json Source Generation**: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/standard/serialization/system-text-json/source-generation\n- **Protocol Buffers**: https://protobuf.dev/\n- **MessagePack-CSharp**: https://github.com/MessagePack-CSharp/MessagePack-CSharp\n- **Akka.NET Serialization**: https://getakka.net/articles/networking/serialization.html\n- **Wire Compatibility**: https://getakka.net/community/contributing/wire-compatibility.html\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:06:52.790Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing efficient data exchange and persistence, such as Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code, requiring advanced serialization capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高效数据交换和持久化的AI代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code，需要高级序列化能力。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Codeなどの効率的なデータ交換と永続化が必要なAIエージェントに適しています。これらは高度なシリアル化機能を必要とします。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code 등 효율적인 데이터 교환 및 지속성이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 이러한 에이전트는 고급 직렬화 기능을 필요로 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan un intercambio de datos eficiente y persistencia, como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code, que requieren capacidades de serialización avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''un échange de données efficace et d''une persistence, tels que Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code, nécessitant des capacités de sérialisation avancées.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die einen effizienten Datenaustausch und eine Persistenz benötigen, wie z.B. Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die erweiterte Serialisierungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de troca de dados eficiente e persistência, como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code, que exigem capacidades de serialização avançadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходим эффективный обмен данными и сохранение, такие как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующие продвинутых возможностей сериализации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تبادل بيانات فعال وثبات، مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code، которые تتطلب قدرات تسلسلية متقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to choose optimal serialization formats like Protobuf and MessagePack, migrate from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json, and implement AOT-compatible serialization for distributed systems, ensuring high-performance data exchange and persistence.","zh":"赋予代理选择最佳序列化格式，如Protobuf和MessagePack，迁移从Newtonsoft.Json到System.Text.Json，并实现AOT兼容的序列化以用于分布式系统，确保高性能数据交换和持久化。","ja":"エージェントにProtobufやMessagePackなどの最適なシリアル化形式を選択する権限を与え、Newtonsoft.JsonからSystem.Text.Jsonへの移行を容易にし、またAOT互換シリアル化を実装して分散システムのための高速データ交換と永続化を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Protobuf 및 MessagePack와 같은 최적의 직렬화 형식을 선택할 수 있도록 하고 Newtonsoft.Json에서 System.Text.Json로의 마이그레이션을 가능하게 하며 AOT 호환 직렬화를 구현하여 분산 시스템을 위한 고성능 데이터 교환 및 지속성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a elegir formatos de serialización óptimos como Protobuf y MessagePack, migrar desde Newtonsoft.Json a System.Text.Json y implementar una serialización compatible con AOT para sistemas distribuidos, garantizando un intercambio y persistencia de datos de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de choisir des formats de sérialisation optimaux comme Protobuf et MessagePack, de migrer de Newtonsoft.Json à System.Text.Json et de mettre en œuvre une sérialisation compatible AOT pour les systèmes distribués, assurant un échange et une persistence de données haute performance.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, optimale Serialisierungsformate wie Protobuf und MessagePack zu wählen, von Newtonsoft.Json zu System.Text.Json zu migrieren und eine AOT-kompatible Serialisierung für verteilte Systeme zu implementieren, um einen hochleistungsfähigen Datenaustausch und eine Persistenz zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escolher formatos de serialização ótimos, como Protobuf e MessagePack, migrar de Newtonsoft.Json para System.Text.Json e implementar serialização compatível com AOT para sistemas distribuídos, garantindo troca de dados e persistência de alto desempenho.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность выбирать оптимальные форматы сериализации, такие как Protobuf и MessagePack, мигрировать с Newtonsoft.Json на System.Text.Json и реализовать сериализацию, совместимую с AOT, для распределенных систем, обеспечивая высокопроизводительный обмен данными и сохранение.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من اختيار تنسيقات تسلسلية مثالية مثل Protobuf و MessagePack، والهجرة من Newtonsoft.Json إلى System.Text.Json، وتطبيق التسلسل المتوافق مع AOT لأنظمة التوزيع، مما يضمن تبادل بيانات وثبات عالي الأداء."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating APIs from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json for improved performance","Implementing schema-based serialization with Protobuf for distributed systems","Optimizing serialization performance for large-scale data persistence"],"zh":["将API从Newtonsoft.Json迁移到System.Text.Json以提高性能","使用Protobuf实现分布式系统的基于模式的序列化","优化大规模数据持久化的序列化性能"],"ja":["Newtonsoft.JsonからSystem.Text.Jsonへの移行を通じてAPIのパフォーマンスを向上させる","分散システムのためのスキーマベースのシリアル化をProtobufで実装する","大規模なデータ永続化のためのシリアル化パフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["Newtonsoft.Json에서 System.Text.Json로의 마이그레이션을 통해 API 성능 개선","Protobuf를 사용하여 분산 시스템의 스키마 기반 직렬화를 구현","대규모 데이터 지속성의 직렬화 성능 최적화"],"es":["Migrar APIs de Newtonsoft.Json a System.Text.Json para mejorar el rendimiento","Implementar una serialización basada en esquemas con Protobuf para sistemas distribuidos","Optimizar el rendimiento de la serialización para una persistencia de datos a gran escala"],"fr":["Migrer des API de Newtonsoft.Json à System.Text.Json pour améliorer les performances","Mettre en œuvre une sérialisation basée sur des schémas avec Protobuf pour les systèmes distribués","Optimiser les performances de la sérialisation pour une persistence de données à grande échelle"],"de":["APIs von Newtonsoft.Json zu System.Text.Json migrieren, um die Leistung zu verbessern","Eine schemabasierte Serialisierung mit Protobuf für verteilte Systeme implementieren","Die Serialisierungsleistung für eine große Datenpersistenz optimieren"],"pt":["Migrar APIs de Newtonsoft.Json para System.Text.Json para melhorar o desempenho","Implementar serialização baseada em esquema com Protobuf para sistemas distribuídos","Otimizar o desempenho da serialização para persistência de dados em larga escala"],"ru":["Мигрировать API с Newtonsoft.Json на System.Text.Json для улучшения производительности","Реализовать сериализацию на основе схемы с Protobuf для распределенных систем","Оптимизировать производительность сериализации для сохранения данных в крупном масштабе"],"ar":["هجرة واجهات برمجة التطبيقات من Newtonsoft.Json إلى System.Text.Json لتحسين الأداء","تطبيق التسلسل القائم على مخطط مع Protobuf لأنظمة التوزيع","تحسين أداء التسلسل لثبات البيانات على نطاق كبير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET compatibility for System.Text.Json integration","Limited to serialization formats supported by the skill, such as Protobuf and MessagePack"],"zh":["需要.NET兼容性以实现System.Text.Json集成","仅限于该技能支持的序列化格式，如Protobuf和MessagePack"],"ja":[".NETの互換性が必要なSystem.Text.Jsonの統合","このスキルでサポートされているシリアル化形式、たとえばProtobufやMessagePackに限定される"],"ko":[".NET 호환성이 System.Text.Json 통합에 필요","이 스킬에서 지원하는 직렬화 형식인 Protobuf 및 MessagePack에 제한"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con .NET para la integración de System.Text.Json","Limitado a los formatos de serialización compatibles con la habilidad, como Protobuf y MessagePack"],"fr":["Nécessite une compatibilité avec .NET pour l''intégration de System.Text.Json","Limité aux formats de sérialisation pris en charge par la compétence, tels que Protobuf et MessagePack"],"de":["Benötigt .NET-Kompatibilität für die Integration von System.Text.Json","Begrenzt auf Serialisierungsformate, die von der Fähigkeit unterstützt werden, wie z.B. Protobuf und MessagePack"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com .NET para integração com System.Text.Json","Limitado a formatos de serialização suportados pela habilidade, como Protobuf e MessagePack"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с .NET для интеграции с System.Text.Json","Ограничен форматами сериализации, поддерживаемыми навыком, такими как Protobuf и MessagePack"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع .NET لدمج System.Text.Json","محدود بتنسيقات التسلسل المدعومة من قبل المهارة، مثل Protobuf و MessagePack"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0f1f254521079e26f086132d639c959b4ac7be6ad2ec8fe64be61724d9021779","qualityScore":75}');
