cript サポート","様々な UI コンポーネントを提供"],"ko":["컴포넌트화된 프로젝트 구조","크로스 플랫폼 지원","자바스크립트와 리액트를 사용하여 구축","타입스크립트 지원","各种 UI 컴포넌트 제공"],"es":["Estructura de proyecto flexible","Componentes reutilizables","Pantallas personalizables","Soporte para TypeScript","Pruebas unitarias y de integración"],"fr":["Structure de projet flexible","Composants réutilisables","Écrans personnalisables","Prise en charge de TypeScript","Tests unitaires et d''intégration"],"de":["Flexible Projektstruktur","Wiederverwendbare Komponenten","Anpassbare Bildschirme","Unterstützung für TypeScript","Einheitliche und Integrationsprüfungen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis para Android e iOS","Uso de JavaScript e React para criar aplicativos nativos","Compartilhamento de código entre plataformas","Suporte a componentes personalizados","Integração com bibliotecas de terceiros"],"ru":["Разработка мобильных приложений для Android и iOS","Использование JavaScript и React для создания родных приложений","Общий код для платформ","Поддержка пользовательских компонентов","Интеграция с библиотеками третьих лиц"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات المتنقلة للأندرويد وآي أو إس","استخدام جافاسكريبت ورياكت لإنشاء تطبيقات الأصلية","مشاركة الكود بين المنصات","دعم المكونات المخصصة","التكامل مع المكتبات الخارجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native","跨平台应用","JavaScript 框架","移动应用开发","React","TypeScript"],"ja":["React Native","クロスプラットフォームアプリ","JavaScript フレームワーク","モバイルアプリ開発","React","TypeScript"],"ko":["React Native","크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션","자바스크립트 프레임워크","모바일 애플리케이션 개발","리액트","타입스크립트"],"es":["React Native","Desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","Estructura de proyecto","Componentes reutilizables","TypeScript","Pruebas unitarias","Pruebas de integración","Aplicaciones móviles híbridas"],"fr":["React Native","Développement d''applications mobiles","Structure de projet","Composants réutilisables","TypeScript","Tests unitaires","Tests d''intégration","Applications mobiles hybrides"],"de":["React Native","Entwicklung von Mobilen Anwendungen","Projektstruktur","Wiederverwendbare Komponenten","TypeScript","Einheitliche Prüfungen","Integrationsprüfungen","Hybride Mobile Anwendungen"],"pt":["React Native","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","JavaScript","React","Android","iOS","Aplicativos nativos"],"ru":["React Native","Разработка мобильных приложений","JavaScript","React","Android","iOS","Родные приложения"],"ar":["رياكت نيتيف","تطوير التطبيقات المتنقلة","جافاسكريبت","رياكت","الأندرويد","آي أو إس","تطبيقات الأصلية"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-native","description":"React Native mobile patterns, platform-specific code","bodyPreview":"# React Native Skill\n\n*Load with: base.md + typescript.md*\n\n---\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nproject/\n├── src/\n│   ├── core/                   # Pure business logic (no React)\n│   │   ├── types.ts\n│   │   └── services/\n│   ├── components/             # Reusable UI components\n│   │   ├── Button/\n│   │   │   ├── Button.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── Button.test.tsx\n│   │   │   └── index.ts\n│   │   └── index.ts            # Barrel export\n│   ├── screens/                # Screen components\n│   │   ├── Home/\n│","body":"# React Native Skill\n\n*Load with: base.md + typescript.md*\n\n---\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nproject/\n├── src/\n│   ├── core/                   # Pure business logic (no React)\n│   │   ├── types.ts\n│   │   └── services/\n│   ├── components/             # Reusable UI components\n│   │   ├── Button/\n│   │   │   ├── Button.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── Button.test.tsx\n│   │   │   └── index.ts\n│   │   └── index.ts            # Barrel export\n│   ├── screens/                # Screen components\n│   │   ├── Home/\n│   │   │   ├── HomeScreen.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── useHome.ts      # Screen-specific hook\n│   │   │   └── index.ts\n│   │   └── index.ts\n│   ├── navigation/             # Navigation configuration\n│   ├── hooks/                  # Shared custom hooks\n│   ├── store/                  # State management\n│   └── utils/                  # Utilities\n├── __tests__/\n├── android/\n├── ios/\n└── CLAUDE.md\n```\n\n---\n\n## Component Patterns\n\n### Functional Components Only\n```typescript\n// Good - simple, testable\ninterface ButtonProps {\n  label: string;\n  onPress: () => void;\n  disabled?: boolean;\n}\n\nexport function Button({ label, onPress, disabled = false }: ButtonProps): JSX.Element {\n  return (\n    <Pressable onPress={onPress} disabled={disabled}>\n      <Text>{label}</Text>\n    </Pressable>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Extract Logic to Hooks\n```typescript\n// useHome.ts - all logic here\nexport function useHome() {\n  const [items, setItems] = useState<Item[]>([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);\n\n  const refresh = useCallback(async () => {\n    setLoading(true);\n    const data = await fetchItems();\n    setItems(data);\n    setLoading(false);\n  }, []);\n\n  return { items, loading, refresh };\n}\n\n// HomeScreen.tsx - pure presentation\nexport function HomeScreen(): JSX.Element {\n  const { items, loading, refresh } = useHome();\n  \n  return (\n    <ItemList items={items} loading={loading} onRefresh={refresh} />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Props Interface Always Explicit\n```typescript\n// Always define props interface, even if simple\ninterface ItemCardProps {\n  item: Item;\n  onPress: (id: string) => void;\n}\n\nexport function ItemCard({ item, onPress }: ItemCardProps): JSX.Element {\n  ...\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## State Management\n\n### Local State First\n```typescript\n// Start with useState, escalate only when needed\nconst [value, setValue] = useState('''');\n```\n\n### Zustand for Global State (if needed)\n```typescript\n// store/useAppStore.ts\nimport { create } from ''zustand'';\n\ninterface AppState {\n  user: User | null;\n  setUser: (user: User | null) => void;\n}\n\nexport const useAppStore = create<AppState>((set) => ({\n  user: null,\n  setUser: (user) => set({ user }),\n}));\n```\n\n### React Query for Server State\n```typescript\n// hooks/useItems.ts\nimport { useQuery, useMutation, useQueryClient } from ''@tanstack/react-query'';\n\nexport function useItems() {\n  return useQuery({\n    queryKey: [''items''],\n    queryFn: fetchItems,\n  });\n}\n\nexport function useCreateItem() {\n  const queryClient = useQueryClient();\n  \n  return useMutation({\n    mutationFn: createItem,\n    onSuccess: () => {\n      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [''items''] });\n    },\n  });\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Testing\n\n### Component Testing with React Native Testing Library\n```typescript\nimport { render, fireEvent } from ''@testing-library/react-native'';\nimport { Button } from ''./Button'';\n\ndescribe(''Button'', () => {\n  it(''calls onPress when pressed'', () => {\n    const onPress = jest.fn();\n    const { getByText } = render(<Button label=\"Click me\" onPress={onPress} />);\n    \n    fireEvent.press(getByText(''Click me''));\n    \n    expect(onPress).toHaveBeenCalledTimes(1);\n  });\n\n  it(''does not call onPress when disabled'', () => {\n    const onPress = jest.fn();\n    const { getByText } = render(<Button label=\"Click me\" onPress={onPress} disabled />);\n    \n    fireEvent.press(getByText(''Click me''));\n    \n    expect(onPress).not.toHaveBeenCalled();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Hook Testing\n```typescript\nimport { renderHook, act } from ''@testing-library/react-hooks'';\nimport { useCounter } from ''./useCounter'';\n\ndescribe(''useCounter'', () => {\n  it(''increments counter'', () => {\n    const { result } = renderHook(() => useCounter());\n    \n    act(() => {\n      result.current.increment();\n    });\n    \n    expect(result.current.count).toBe(1);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Platform-Specific Code\n\n### Use Platform.select Sparingly\n```typescript\nimport { Platform } from ''react-native'';\n\nconst styles = StyleSheet.create({\n  shadow: Platform.select({\n    ios: {\n      shadowColor: ''#000'',\n      shadowOffset: { width: 0, height: 2 },\n      shadowOpacity: 0.1,\n    },\n    android: {\n      elevation: 2,\n    },\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n### Separate Files for Complex Differences\n```\nComponent/\n├── Component.tsx          # Shared logic\n├── Component.ios.tsx      # iOS-specific\n├── Component.android.tsx  # Android-specific\n└── index.ts\n```\n\n---\n\n## React Native Anti-Patterns\n\n- ❌ Inline styles - use StyleSheet.create\n- ❌ Logic in render - extract to hooks\n- ❌ Deep component nesting - flatten hierarchy\n- ❌ Anonymous functions in props - use useCallback\n- ❌ Index as key in lists - use stable IDs\n- ❌ Direct state mutation - always use setter\n- ❌ Mixing business logic with UI - keep core/ pure\n- ❌ Ignoring TypeScript errors - fix them\n- ❌ Large components - split into smaller pieces\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:07:31.952Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile Application Agents requiring cross-platform development with React Native","zh":"适用于需要使用 React Native 进行跨平台开发的移动应用程序代理","ja":"React Native を使用したクロスプラットフォーム開発を必要とするモバイルアプリケーションエージェントに最適","ko":"React Native를 사용하여 크로스 플랫폼 개발을 필요로 하는 모바일 애플리케이션 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que requieren desarrollo multiplataforma con React Native","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Applications Mobiles nécessitant un développement multiplateforme avec React Native","de":"Ideal für Mobile Application Agents, die eine cross-plattformübergreifende Entwicklung mit React Native erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que requerem desenvolvimento cross-platform com React Native","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильных приложений, требующих разработки кроссплатформенных приложений с помощью React Native","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيقات الجوال التي تتطلب تطويرًا متقاطعًا منصة باستخدام React Native"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build native mobile applications using TypeScript, leveraging project structures with pure business logic separation and reusable UI components, while utilizing protocols like JavaScript and file formats such as .tsx","zh":"赋予代理构建使用 TypeScript 的原生移动应用程序的能力，利用项目结构以实现纯业务逻辑分离和可重用的 UI 组件，同时利用诸如 JavaScript 的协议和诸如 .tsx 的文件格式","ja":"TypeScript を使用したネイティブモバイルアプリケーションの構築を可能にし、プロジェクト構造を使用して純粋なビジネスロジックの分離と再利用可能な UI コンポーネントを実現し、JavaScript や .tsx などのプロトコルやファイル形式を利用する","ko":"에이전트가 TypeScript를 사용하여 네이티브 모바일 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여純粋한 비즈니스 논리의 분리와 재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트가 가능한 프로젝트 구조를 활용하며 JavaScript 및 .tsx와 같은 프로토콜과 파일 형식을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones móviles nativas utilizando TypeScript, aprovechando estructuras de proyectos con separación lógica de negocio pura y componentes de interfaz de usuario reutilizables, mientras se utilizan protocolos como JavaScript y formatos de archivo como .tsx","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications mobiles natives en utilisant TypeScript, en exploitant les structures de projet avec une séparation de la logique métier pure et des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables, tout en utilisant des protocoles tels que JavaScript et des formats de fichiers tels que .tsx","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, native Mobile-Anwendungen mit TypeScript zu erstellen, indem sie Projektstrukturen mit reiner Geschäftslogik-Trennung und wiederverwendbaren Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten nutzen, während sie Protokolle wie JavaScript und Dateiformate wie .tsx verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos móveis nativos usando TypeScript, aproveitando estruturas de projeto com separação lógica de negócios pura e componentes de interface do usuário reutilizáveis, além de utilizar protocolos como JavaScript e formatos de arquivo como .tsx","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать родные мобильные приложения с помощью TypeScript, используя структуры проектов с чистой разделением бизнес-логики и многократно используемые компоненты интерфейса пользователя, а также использует протоколы như JavaScript и форматы файлов, такие как .tsx","ar":"يُمكن العميل من بناء تطبيقات الجوال الأصلية باستخدام TypeScript، و الاستفادة من هياكل المشروع مع فصل منطقي للأعمال النقية و مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام، بالإضافة إلى استخدام بروتوكولات مثل JavaScript وتنسيقات الملفات مثل .tsx"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing cross-platform mobile apps","Creating reusable UI components with TypeScript","Organizing project structures for scalable mobile applications"],"zh":["开发跨平台移动应用程序","使用 TypeScript 创建可重用的 UI 组件","组织项目结构以实现可扩展的移动应用程序"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォームモバイルアプリケーションの開発","TypeScript を使用した再利用可能な UI コンポーネントの作成","拡張可能なモバイルアプリケーションのためのプロジェクト構造の組織化"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 모바일 애플리케이션 개발","TypeScript를 사용하여 재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 생성","확장 가능한 모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 프로젝트 구조 조직화"],"es":["Desarrollar aplicaciones móviles multiplataforma","Crear componentes de interfaz de usuario reutilizables con TypeScript","Organizar estructuras de proyectos para aplicaciones móviles escalables"],"fr":["Développer des applications mobiles multiplateformes","Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables avec TypeScript","Organiser les structures de projet pour des applications mobiles évolutives"],"de":["Entwickeln von cross-plattformübergreifenden Mobile-Anwendungen","Erstellen von wiederverwendbaren Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten mit TypeScript","Organisieren von Projektstrukturen für skalierbare Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Desenvolver aplicativos móveis cross-platform","Criar componentes de interface do usuário reutilizáveis com TypeScript","Organizar estruturas de projeto para aplicativos móveis escaláveis"],"ru":["Разработка кроссплатформенных мобильных приложений","Создание многократно используемых компонентов интерфейса пользователя с помощью TypeScript","Организация структур проектов для масштабируемых мобильных приложений"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات الجوال متقاطع المنصة","إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع TypeScript","تنظيم هياكل المشروع لتطبيقات الجوال القابلة للتطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript knowledge","Limited to React Native ecosystem","Needs understanding of native mobile application development"],"zh":["需要 TypeScript 知识","仅限 React Native 生态系统","需要对原生移动应用程序开发的理解"],"ja":["TypeScript の知識が必要","React Native エコシステムに限定される","ネイティブモバイルアプリケーションの開発に関する理解が必要"],"ko":["TypeScript 지식이 필요","React Native 생태계에만 제한","네이티브 모바일 애플리케이션 개발에 대한 이해가 필요"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de TypeScript","Limitado al ecosistema de React Native","Necesita comprensión del desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles nativas"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en TypeScript","Limité à l''écosystème React Native","Nécessite une compréhension du développement d''applications mobiles natives"],"de":["Benötigt TypeScript-Kenntnisse","Begrenzt auf das React-Native-Ökosystem","Benötigt das Verständnis der Entwicklung von nativen Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de TypeScript","Limitado ao ecossistema React Native","Necessita compreensão do desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis nativos"],"ru":["Требует знания TypeScript","Ограничен экосистемой React Native","Требует понимания разработки родных мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بتحويل النص إلى كود TypeScript","محدود بنظام React Native","يحتاج إلى فهم لتطوير تطبيقات الجوال الأصلية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e08c94f85ed0dfda9f5223f8682b1ec4083d963089ed46a208b060999b49dedc","qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/m09-domain', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'm09-domain', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z', '2026-02-20T05:07:25.583Z', 'a05f32b475b01d630d54a38a4b9942499b8ea873bc6d2627144fcd8b85b8b53a', '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/m09-domain","name":"m09-domain","description":{"zh":"Domain Modeling 是软件开发中的关键概念，涉及识别实体和值对象。了解其在代码中的实现和 Rust 模式的应用","ja":"ドメインモデリングはソフトウェア開発の重要な概念であり、エンティティと値オブジェクトの識別を含みます。コードでの実装と Rust パターンの適用について","ko":"도메인 모델링은 소프트웨어 개발의 핵심 개념으로, 엔티티와 값 객체의 식별을 포함합니다. 코드에서의 구현과 러스트 패턴의 적용에 대해","es":"El modelado de dominio es fundamental para mantener la integridad de los datos. Aprende a distinguir entre entidades y objetos de valor en Rust","fr":"La modélisation de domaine est essentielle pour maintenir l''intégrité des données. Apprenez à distinguer entre les entités et les objets de valeur en Rust","de":"Die Domänenmodellierung ist entscheidend für die Aufrechterhaltung der Datenintegrität. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie in Rust zwischen Entitäten und Wertobjekten unterscheiden","pt":"Entenda como aplicar conceitos de modelagem de domínio em Rust para melhorar a sua codificação","ru":"Узнайте, как применять концепции доменного моделирования в Rust, чтобы улучшить ваш код","ar":"تعلم كيفية تطبيق مفاهيم نمذجة النطاق في Rust لتحسين 编碼 الخاص بك","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Domain Modeling 技术","ja":"ドメインモデリング技術","ko":"도메인 모델링 기술","es":"Modelado de Dominio: Entidades y Objetos de Valor","fr":"Modélisation de Domaine: Entités et Objets de Valeur","de":"Domain-Modellierung: Entitäten und Wertobjekte","pt":"Modelagem de Domínio com Rust","ru":"Доменное моделирование с Rust","ar":"نمذجة النطاق مع Rust","en":"m09-do