"Unterscheiden zwischen Entitäten und Wertobjekten","Entwurfsmuster anwenden, um die Integrität der Daten zu erhalten","Agreggate und Aggregate-Grenzen definieren","Rust verwenden, um die Domänenmodellierung zu implementieren"],"pt":["Entidade vs Objeto de Valor","Invariantes e limites de agregação","Padrões de Rust para modelagem de domínio","Propriedade e identidade única","Desenvolvimento de software orientado a domínio"],"ru":["Сущность vs Объект значения","Инварианты и границы агрегации","Паттерны Rust для доменного моделирования","Владение и уникальная идентичность","Разработка программного обеспечения, ориентированного на домен"],"ar":["الكيان مقابل كائن القيمة","اللامتثال والحدود التجميعية","أنماط Rust لنمذجة النطاق","الملكية والهوية الفريدة","تطوير البرمجيات الموجهة إلى النطاق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Domain Modeling","软件开发","实体","值对象","Rust 模式","代码实现","所有权","唯一标识"],"ja":["ドメインモデリング","ソフトウェア開発","エンティティ","値オブジェクト","Rust パターン","コード実装","所有権","一意性"],"ko":["도메인 모델링","소프트웨어 개발","엔티티","값 객체","러스트 패턴","코드 구현","소유권","고유 식별자"],"es":["modelado de dominio","entidades","objetos de valor","Rust","patrones de diseño","integridad de datos","agregados","fronteras de agregados"],"fr":["modélisation de domaine","entités","objets de valeur","Rust","patrons de conception","intégrité des données","agrégats","limites des agrégats"],"de":["Domänenmodellierung","Entitäten","Wertobjekte","Rust","Entwurfsmuster","Datenintegrität","Agreggate","Aggregate-Grenzen"],"pt":["modelagem de domínio","Rust","desenvolvimento de software","design de software","padrões de Rust","entidade","objeto de valor","invariantes","agregação"],"ru":["доменное моделирование","Rust","разработка программного обеспечения","проектирование программного обеспечения","паттерны Rust","сущность","объект значения","инварианты","агрегация"],"ar":["نمذجة النطاق","Rust","تطوير البرمجيات","تصميم البرمجيات","أنماط Rust","الكيان","كائن القيمة","اللامتثال","التجميع"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"m09-domain","description":"CRITICAL: Use for domain modeling. Triggers: domain model, DDD, domain-driven design, entity, value object, aggregate, repository pattern, business rules, validation, invariant, 领域模型, 领域驱动设计, 业务规则","bodyPreview":"# Domain Modeling\n\n> **Layer 2: Design Choices**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**What is this concept''s role in the domain?**\n\nBefore modeling in code, understand:\n- Is it an Entity (identity matters) or Value Object (interchangeable)?\n- What invariants must be maintained?\n- Where are the aggregate boundaries?\n\n---\n\n## Domain Concept → Rust Pattern\n\n| Domain Concept | Rust Pattern | Ownership Implication |\n|----------------|--------------|----------------------|\n| Entity | struct + Id | Owned, unique ident","body":"# Domain Modeling\n\n> **Layer 2: Design Choices**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**What is this concept''s role in the domain?**\n\nBefore modeling in code, understand:\n- Is it an Entity (identity matters) or Value Object (interchangeable)?\n- What invariants must be maintained?\n- Where are the aggregate boundaries?\n\n---\n\n## Domain Concept → Rust Pattern\n\n| Domain Concept | Rust Pattern | Ownership Implication |\n|----------------|--------------|----------------------|\n| Entity | struct + Id | Owned, unique identity |\n| Value Object | struct + Clone/Copy | Shareable, immutable |\n| Aggregate Root | struct owns children | Clear ownership tree |\n| Repository | trait | Abstracts persistence |\n| Domain Event | enum | Captures state changes |\n| Service | impl block / free fn | Stateless operations |\n\n---\n\n## Thinking Prompt\n\nBefore creating a domain type:\n\n1. **What''s the concept''s identity?**\n   - Needs unique identity → Entity (Id field)\n   - Interchangeable by value → Value Object (Clone/Copy)\n\n2. **What invariants must hold?**\n   - Always valid → private fields + validated constructor\n   - Transition rules → type state pattern\n\n3. **Who owns this data?**\n   - Single owner (parent) → owned field\n   - Shared reference → Arc/Rc\n   - Weak reference → Weak\n\n---\n\n## Trace Up ↑\n\nTo domain constraints (Layer 3):\n\n```\n\"How should I model a Transaction?\"\n    ↑ Ask: What domain rules govern transactions?\n    ↑ Check: domain-fintech (audit, precision requirements)\n    ↑ Check: Business stakeholders (what invariants?)\n```\n\n| Design Question | Trace To | Ask |\n|-----------------|----------|-----|\n| Entity vs Value Object | domain-* | What makes two instances \"the same\"? |\n| Aggregate boundaries | domain-* | What must be consistent together? |\n| Validation rules | domain-* | What business rules apply? |\n\n---\n\n## Trace Down ↓\n\nTo implementation (Layer 1):\n\n```\n\"Model as Entity\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Owned, unique\n    ↓ m05-type-driven: Newtype for Id\n\n\"Model as Value Object\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Clone/Copy OK\n    ↓ m05-type-driven: Validate at construction\n\n\"Model as Aggregate\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Parent owns children\n    ↓ m02-resource: Consider Rc for shared within aggregate\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| DDD Concept | Rust Pattern | Example |\n|-------------|--------------|---------|\n| Value Object | Newtype | `struct Email(String);` |\n| Entity | Struct + ID | `struct User { id: UserId, ... }` |\n| Aggregate | Module boundary | `mod order { ... }` |\n| Repository | Trait | `trait UserRepo { fn find(...) }` |\n| Domain Event | Enum | `enum OrderEvent { Created, ... }` |\n\n## Pattern Templates\n\n### Value Object\n\n```rust\nstruct Email(String);\n\nimpl Email {\n    pub fn new(s: &str) -> Result<Self, ValidationError> {\n        validate_email(s)?;\n        Ok(Self(s.to_string()))\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Entity\n\n```rust\nstruct UserId(Uuid);\n\nstruct User {\n    id: UserId,\n    email: Email,\n    // ... other fields\n}\n\nimpl PartialEq for User {\n    fn eq(&self, other: &Self) -> bool {\n        self.id == other.id  // Identity equality\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Aggregate\n\n```rust\nmod order {\n    pub struct Order {\n        id: OrderId,\n        items: Vec<OrderItem>,  // Owned children\n        // ...\n    }\n\n    impl Order {\n        pub fn add_item(&mut self, item: OrderItem) {\n            // Enforce aggregate invariants\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Why Wrong | Better |\n|---------|-----------|--------|\n| Primitive obsession | No type safety | Newtype wrappers |\n| Public fields with invariants | Invariants violated | Private + accessor |\n| Leaked aggregate internals | Broken encapsulation | Methods on root |\n| String for semantic types | No validation | Validated newtype |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| When | See |\n|------|-----|\n| Type-driven implementation | m05-type-driven |\n| Ownership for aggregates | m01-ownership |\n| Domain error handling | m13-domain-error |\n| Specific domain rules | domain-* |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:07:25.583Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Generation Agents like Claude Code, requiring advanced domain modeling capabilities with Rust patterns.","zh":"适合于像 Claude Code 这样的代码生成代理，需要高级的领域建模能力和 Rust 模式。","ja":"Claude Code のようなコード生成エージェントに適しています。高度なドメインモデリング能力と Rust パターンが必要です。","ko":"Claude Code 같은 코드 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다. 고급 도메인 모델링 기능과 Rust 패턴이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Generación de Código como Claude Code, que requieren capacidades avanzadas de modelado de dominio con patrones de Rust.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de code tels que Claude Code, nécessitant des capacités de modélisation de domaine avancées avec des modèles Rust.","de":"Ideal für Code-Generierungsagenten wie Claude Code, die erweiterte Domänenmodellierungs-Funktionen mit Rust-Mustern erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de geração de código como Claude Code, que exigem capacidades avançadas de modelagem de domínio com padrões Rust.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации кода, таких как Claude Code, требующих продвинутых возможностей моделирования домена с шаблонами Rust.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء توليد التعليمات البرمجية مثل Claude Code ، والذي يتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لنمذجة المجال باستخدام أنماط Rust."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design robust domain models by identifying entities and value objects, maintaining invariants, and setting aggregate boundaries using Rust structs and ownership implications, ensuring unique identifiers and data integrity.","zh":"通过识别实体和值对象、维护不变量、使用 Rust 结构和所有权含义设置聚合边界，确保唯一标识符和数据完整性，从而使代理能够设计强大的领域模型。","ja":"エンティティと値オブジェクトを識別し、不変性を維持し、Rust 構造体と所有権の含意を使用して集約の境界を設定することで、ユニークな識別子とデータの整合性を確保し、エージェントが強力なドメインモデルを設計できるようにします。","ko":"엔티티와 값 객체를 식별하고, 불변성을 유지하며, Rust 구조체와 소유권 의미를 사용하여 집계 경계를 설정하여 고유 식별자와 데이터 일관성을 보장함으로써 에이전트가 강력한 도메인 모델을 설계하도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar modelos de dominio robustos identificando entidades y objetos de valor, manteniendo invariantes y estableciendo límites de agregados utilizando structs y implicaciones de propiedad de Rust, garantizando identificadores únicos y la integridad de los datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des modèles de domaine robustes en identifiant les entités et les objets de valeur, en maintenant les invariants et en définissant les limites d''agrégat en utilisant des structs et des implications de propriété Rust, garantissant des identificateurs uniques et l''intégrité des données.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, robuste Domänenmodelle zu entwerfen, indem Entitäten und Wertobjekte identifiziert, Invarianten aufrechterhalten und Aggregate-Grenzen mithilfe von Rust-Structs und Eigentumsimplikationen festgelegt werden, um eindeutige Identifikatoren und Datenintegrität sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar modelos de domínio robustos identificando entidades e objetos de valor, mantendo invariantes e definindo limites de agregados usando structs Rust e implicações de propriedade, garantindo identificadores exclusivos e integridade de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать прочные модели домена, выявляя сущности и объекты значений, сохраняя инварианты и задавая границы агрегатов с помощью структур Rust и последствий владения, обеспечивая уникальные идентификаторы и целостность данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تصميم نماذج مجال قوية من خلال تحديد الكيانات وأجسام القيمة ، والحفاظ على الثوابت وتحديد حدود التجميع باستخدام هيكل Rust وآثار الملكية ، مما يضمن معرّفات فريدة وسلامة البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Modeling complex business domains with entity-relationship mapping","Generating Rust code for domain concepts with ownership implications","Validating domain invariants and aggregate boundaries for data consistency"],"zh":["使用实体关系映射对复杂业务领域进行建模","为领域概念生成 Rust 代码，包括所有权含义","验证领域不变量和聚合边界以确保数据一致性"],"ja":["エンティティ関係マッピングを使用して複雑なビジネスドメインをモデル化する","所有権の含意を含むドメイン概念のための Rust コードを生成する","データ整合性を確保するためにドメイン不変性と集約境界を検証する"],"ko":["엔티티 관계 매핑을 사용하여 복잡한 비즈니스 도메인을 모델링하는 것","소유권 의미를 포함한 도메인 개념에 대한 Rust 코드를 생성하는 것","데이터 일관성을 보장하기 위해 도메인 불변성과 집계 경계를 검증하는 것"],"es":["Modelado de dominios comerciales complejos con mapeo de entidad-relación","Generación de código Rust para conceptos de dominio con implicaciones de propiedad","Validación de invariantes de dominio y límites de agregados para la coherencia de los datos"],"fr":["Modélisation de domaines d''entreprise complexes avec mappage d''entité-relation","Génération de code Rust pour des concepts de domaine avec des implications de propriété","Validation des invariants de domaine et des limites d''agrégat pour la cohérence des données"],"de":["Modellierung komplexer Geschäftsbereiche mit Entitäts-Beziehungs-Zuordnung","Generierung von Rust-Code für Domänenkonzepte mit Eigentumsimplikationen","Validierung von Domäneninvarianten und Aggregatgrenzen für Datenkonsistenz"],"pt":["Modelagem de domínios de negócios complexos com mapeamento de entidade-relacionamento","Geração de código Rust para conceitos de domínio com implicações de propriedade","Validação de invariantes de domínio e limites de agregados para consistência de dados"],"ru":["Моделирование сложных бизнес-доменов с отображением сущность-отношение","Генерация кода Rust для концепций домена с последствиями владения","Проверка инвариантов домена и границ агрегатов для согласованности данных"],"ar":["نمذجة مجالات الأعمال المعقدة مع تحويل الكيان-العلاقة","توليد التعليمات البرمجية لغة روست للمفاهيم المجالية مع آثار الملكية","التحقق من الثوابت المجالية وحدود التجميع لاتساق البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Rust programming language","Limited to domain modeling with predefined Rust patterns","May require additional implementation for complex domain logic"],"zh":["需要了解 Rust 编程语言","仅限于使用预定义的 Rust 模式进行领域建模","可能需要为复杂的领域逻辑添加额外的实现"],"ja":["Rust プログラミング言語の理解が必要","事前に定義された Rust パターンを使用したドメインモデリングに限定される","複雑なドメインロジックの場合、追加の実装が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["Rust 프로그래밍 언어를 이해해야 함","사전에 정의된 Rust 패턴을 사용한 도메인 모델링에만 제한됨","복잡한 도메인 로직의 경우 추가 구현이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del lenguaje de programación Rust","Limitado al modelado de dominio con patrones de Rust predefinidos","Puede requerir implementación adicional para lógica de dominio compleja"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du langage de programmation Rust","Limité à la modélisation de domaine avec des modèles Rust prédéfinis","Peut nécessiter une mise en œuvre supplémentaire pour une logique de domaine complexe"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse der Rust-Programmiersprache","Begrenzt auf die Domänenmodellierung mit vordefinierten Rust-Mustern","Kann eine zusätzliche Implementierung für komplexe Domänenlogik erfordern"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da linguagem de programação Rust","Limitado à modelagem de domínio com padrões Rust predefinidos","Pode exigir implementação adicional para lógica de domínio complexa"],"ru":["Требует понимания языка программирования Rust","Ограничен моделированием домена с предопределенными шаблонами Rust","Может потребовать дополнительной реализации для сложной логики домена"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم لغة برمجة روست","محدود بنمذجة المجال باستخدام أنماط روست مُحددة مسبقًا","يمكن أن يتطلب تنفيذًا إضافيًا لمعالجة منطق المجال المعقد"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a05f32b475b01d630d54a38a4b9942499b8ea873bc6d2627144fcd8b85b8b53a","qualityScore":0}');
