","ja":"Cloudflare Python Workers は、Python でアプリケーションを書き込みデプロイできるエッジコンピューティングプラットフォームです。快速入門ガイドで始めましょう","ko":"Cloudflare Python Workers는 Python으로 애플리케이션을 작성하고 배포할 수 있는 에지 컴퓨팅 플랫폼입니다. 빠른 시작 가이드로 시작하세요","es":"Los trabajadores de Python de Cloudflare permiten ejecutar código Python en el borde de la red con Pyodide y WebAssembly","fr":"Les workers Python de Cloudflare permettent d''exécuter du code Python au bord du réseau avec Pyodide et WebAssembly","de":"Cloudflare Python Worker ermöglicht die Ausführung von Python-Code am Netzwerkrand mit Pyodide und WebAssembly","pt":"Os trabalhadores Python Cloudflare são uma ferramenta poderosa para melhorar a segurança e o desempenho da sua aplicação web.","ru":"Работники Python Cloudflare являются мощным инструментом для улучшения безопасности и производительности вашего веб-приложения.","ar":"عمال بايثون كلاودفلير هم أداة قوية لتحسين أمان وتحسين أداء تطبيق الويب الخاص بك.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用 Python 3.12+ 编写应用","基于 WebAssembly 的 Pyodide 运行时","workers-py 和 workers-runtime-sdk 包","Wrangler 支持","快速入门指南"],"ja":["Python 3.12+ でアプリケーションを書く","WebAssembly ベースの Pyodide ランタイム","workers-py と workers-runtime-sdk パッケージ","Wrangler サポート","快速入門ガイド"],"ko":["Python 3.12+로 애플리케이션을 작성","WebAssembly 기반의 Pyodide 런타임","workers-py와 workers-runtime-sdk 패키지","Wrangler 지원","빠른 시작 가이드"],"es":["Compatibilidad con Pyodide y WebAssembly","Soporte para Python 3.12+","Integración con Wrangler","Mejora del rendimiento del sitio web","Seguridad mejorada con Cloudflare"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec Pyodide et WebAssembly","Prise en charge de Python 3.12+","Intégration avec Wrangler","Amélioration des performances du site web","Sécurité renforcée avec Cloudflare"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit Pyodide und WebAssembly","Unterstützung für Python 3.12+","Integration mit Wrangler","Leistungsverbesserung der Website","Erhöhte Sicherheit mit Cloudflare"],"pt":["Execução de código Python no edge da rede","Melhoria da segurança com validação de solicitações","Otimização do desempenho com cache e compressão","Integração com Wrangler para gerenciamento de projetos","Suporte a Python 3.12+ compilado para WebAssembly"],"ru":["Выполнение кода Python на краю сети","Улучшение безопасности с помощью проверки запросов","Оптимизация производительности с помощью кэширования и сжатия","Интеграция с Wrangler для управления проектами","Поддержка Python 3.12+ скомпилированного в WebAssembly"],"ar":["تشغيل رمز بايثون على حافة الشبكة","تحسين الأمان مع التحقق من الطلبات","تحسين الأداء مع الذاكرة المؤقتة والضغط","التكامل مع Wrangler لإدارة المشاريع","دعم بايثون 3.12+ المترجمة إلى WebAssembly"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cloudflare Python Workers","边缘计算","Python","WebAssembly","Pyodide","workers-py","workers-runtime-sdk","Wrangler"],"ja":["Cloudflare Python Workers","エッジコンピューティング","Python","WebAssembly","Pyodide","workers-py","workers-runtime-sdk","Wrangler"],"ko":["Cloudflare Python Workers","에지 컴퓨팅","Python","WebAssembly","Pyodide","workers-py","workers-runtime-sdk","Wrangler"],"es":["trabajadores de Python de Cloudflare","Pyodide","WebAssembly","desarrollo web","rendimiento del sitio web","seguridad web","Cloudflare","Python 3.12+","Wrangler"],"fr":["workers Python de Cloudflare","Pyodide","WebAssembly","développement web","performances du site web","sécurité web","Cloudflare","Python 3.12+","Wrangler"],"de":["Cloudflare Python Worker","Pyodide","WebAssembly","Webentwicklung","Website-Leistung","Web-Sicherheit","Cloudflare","Python 3.12+","Wrangler"],"pt":["trabalhadores python cloudflare","desenvolvimento web","segurança da rede","otimização de desempenho","python no edge","wrangler","webassembly"],"ru":["работники python cloudflare","веб-разработка","безопасность сети","оптимизация производительности","python на краю","wrangler","webassembly"],"ar":["عمال بايثون كلاودفلير","تطوير الويب","أمان الشبكة","تحسين الأداء","بايثون على الحافة","wrangler","webassembly"]}},"owner":"ma1orek","repo":"replay","repoPath":"ma1orek/replay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cloudflare-python-workers","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare Python Workers\n\n**Status**: Beta (requires `python_workers` compatibility flag)\n**Runtime**: Pyodide (Python 3.12+ compiled to WebAssembly)\n**Package Versions**: workers-py@1.7.0, workers-runtime-sdk@0.3.1, wrangler@4.58.0\n**Last Verified**: 2026-01-21\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Prerequisites\n\nEnsure you have installed:\n- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/#installation) - Python package manager\n- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) - Required for Wrangler\n\n### 2. Initialize Project","body":"# Cloudflare Python Workers\n\n**Status**: Beta (requires `python_workers` compatibility flag)\n**Runtime**: Pyodide (Python 3.12+ compiled to WebAssembly)\n**Package Versions**: workers-py@1.7.0, workers-runtime-sdk@0.3.1, wrangler@4.58.0\n**Last Verified**: 2026-01-21\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Prerequisites\n\nEnsure you have installed:\n- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/#installation) - Python package manager\n- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) - Required for Wrangler\n\n### 2. Initialize Project\n\n```bash\n# Create project directory\nmkdir my-python-worker && cd my-python-worker\n\n# Initialize Python project\nuv init\n\n# Install pywrangler\nuv tool install workers-py\n\n# Initialize Worker configuration\nuv run pywrangler init\n```\n\n### 3. Create Entry Point\n\nCreate `src/entry.py`:\n\n```python\nfrom workers import WorkerEntrypoint, Response\n\nclass Default(WorkerEntrypoint):\n    async def fetch(self, request):\n        return Response(\"Hello from Python Worker!\")\n```\n\n### 4. Configure wrangler.jsonc\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-python-worker\",\n  \"main\": \"src/entry.py\",\n  \"compatibility_date\": \"2025-12-01\",\n  \"compatibility_flags\": [\"python_workers\"]\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Run Locally\n\n```bash\nuv run pywrangler dev\n# Visit http://localhost:8787\n```\n\n### 6. Deploy\n\n```bash\nuv run pywrangler deploy\n```\n\n---\n\n## Migration from Pre-December 2025 Workers\n\nIf you created a Python Worker before December 2025, you were limited to built-in packages. With pywrangler (Dec 2025), you can now deploy with external packages.\n\n**Old Approach** (no longer needed):\n```python\n# Limited to built-in packages only\n# Could only use httpx, aiohttp, beautifulsoup4, etc.\n# Error: \"You cannot yet deploy Python Workers that depend on\n# packages defined in requirements.txt [code: 10021]\"\n```\n\n**New Approach** (pywrangler):\n```toml\n# pyproject.toml\n[project]\ndependencies = [\"fastapi\", \"any-pyodide-compatible-package\"]\n```\n\n```bash\nuv tool install workers-py\nuv run pywrangler deploy  # Now works!\n```\n\n**Historical Timeline**:\n- **April 2024 - Dec 2025**: Package deployment completely blocked\n- **Dec 8, 2025**: Pywrangler released, enabling package deployment\n- **Jan 2026**: Open beta with full package support\n\n**See**: [Package deployment issue history](https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/issues/6613)\n\n---\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### WorkerEntrypoint Class Pattern\n\nAs of August 2025, Python Workers use a class-based pattern (not global handlers):\n\n```python\nfrom workers import WorkerEntrypoint, Response\n\nclass Default(WorkerEntrypoint):\n    async def fetch(self, request):\n        # Access bindings via self.env\n        value = await self.env.MY_KV.get(\"key\")\n\n        # Parse request\n        url = request.url\n        method = request.method\n\n        return Response(f\"Method: {method}, URL: {url}\")\n```\n\n### Accessing Bindings\n\nAll Cloudflare bindings are accessed via `self.env`:\n\n```python\nclass Default(WorkerEntrypoint):\n    async def fetch(self, request):\n        # D1 Database\n        result = await self.env.DB.prepare(\"SELECT * FROM users\").all()\n\n        # KV Storage\n        value = await self.env.MY_KV.get(\"key\")\n        await self.env.MY_KV.put(\"key\", \"value\")\n\n        # R2 Object Storage\n        obj = await self.env.MY_BUCKET.get(\"file.txt\")\n\n        # Workers AI\n        response = await self.env.AI.run(\"@cf/meta/llama-2-7b-chat-int8\", {\n            \"prompt\": \"Hello!\"\n        })\n\n        return Response(\"OK\")\n```\n\n**Supported Bindings**:\n- D1 (SQL database)\n- KV (key-value storage)\n- R2 (object storage)\n- Workers AI\n- Vectorize\n- Durable Objects\n- Queues\n- Analytics Engine\n\nSee [Cloudflare Bindings Documentation](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/bindings/) for details.\n\n### Request/Response Handling\n\n```python\nfrom workers import WorkerEntrypoint, Response\nimport json\n\nclass Default(WorkerEntrypoint):\n    async def fetch(self, request):\n        # Parse JSON body\n        if request.method == \"POST\":\n            body = await request.json()\n            return Response(\n                json.dumps({\"received\": body}),\n                headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}\n            )\n\n        # Query parameters\n        url = URL(request.url)\n        name = url.searchParams.get(\"name\", \"World\")\n\n        return Response(f\"Hello, {name}!\")\n```\n\n### Scheduled Handlers (Cron)\n\n```python\nfrom workers import handler\n\n@handler\nasync def on_scheduled(event, env, ctx):\n    # Run on cron schedule\n    print(f\"Cron triggered at {event.scheduledTime}\")\n\n    # Do work...\n    await env.MY_KV.put(\"last_run\", str(event.scheduledTime))\n```\n\nConfigure in wrangler.jsonc:\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"triggers\": {\n    \"crons\": [\"*/5 * * * *\"]  // Every 5 minutes\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Python Workflows\n\nPython Workflows enable durable, multi-step automation with automatic retries and state persistence.\n\n### Why Decorator Pattern?\n\nPython Workflows use the `@step.do()` decorator pattern because **Python does not easily support anonymous callbacks** (unlike JavaScript/TypeScript which allows inline arrow functions). This is a fundamental language difference, not a limitation of Cloudflare''s implementation.\n\n**JavaScript Pattern** (doesn''t translate):\n```javascript\nawait step.do(\"my step\", async () => {\n  // Inline callback\n  return result;\n});\n```\n\n**Python Pattern** (required):\n```python\n@step.do(\"my step\")\nasync def my_step():\n    # Named function with decorator\n    return result\n\nresult = await my_step()\n```\n\n**Source**: [Python Workflows Blog](https://blog.cloudflare.com/python-workflows/)\n\n### Concurrency with asyncio.gather\n\nPyodide captures JavaScript promises (thenables) and proxies them as Python awaitables. This enables `Promise.all`-equivalent behavior using standard Python async patterns:\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\n@step.do(\"step_a\")\nasync def step_a():\n    return \"A\"\n\n@step.do(\"step_b\")\nasync def step_b():\n    return \"B\"\n\n# Concurrent execution (like Promise.all)\nresults = await asyncio.gather(step_a(), step_b())\n# results = [\"A\", \"B\"]\n```\n\n**Why This Works**: JavaScript promises from workflow steps are proxied as Python awaitables, allowing standard asyncio concurrency primitives.\n\n**Source**: [Python Workflows Blog](https://blog.cloudflare.com/python-workflows/)\n\n### Basic Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom workers import WorkflowEntrypoint, WorkerEntrypoint, Response\n\nclass MyWorkflow(WorkflowEntrypoint):\n    async def run(self, event, step):\n        # Step 1\n        @step.do(\"fetch data\")\n        async def fetch_data():\n            response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/data\")\n            return await response.json()\n\n        data = await fetch_data()\n\n        # Step 2: Sleep\n        await step.sleep(\"wait\", \"10 seconds\")\n\n        # Step 3: Process\n        @step.do(\"process data\")\n        async def process_data():\n            return {\"processed\": True, \"count\": len(data)}\n\n        result = await process_data()\n        return result\n\n\nclass Default(WorkerEntrypoint):\n    async def fetch(self, request):\n        # Create workflow instance\n        instance = await self.env.MY_WORKFLOW.create()\n        return Response(f\"Workflow started: {instance.id}\")\n```\n\n### DAG Dependencies\n\nDefine step dependencies for parallel execution:\n\n```python\nclass MyWorkflow(WorkflowEntrypoint):\n    async def run(self, event, step):\n        @step.do(\"step_a\")\n        async def step_a():\n            return \"A done\"\n\n        @step.do(\"step_b\")\n        async def step_b():\n            return \"B done\"\n\n        # step_c waits for both step_a and step_b\n        @step.do(\"step_c\", depends=[step_a, step_b], concurrent=True)\n        async def step_c(result_a, result_b):\n            return f\"C received: {result_a}, {result_b}\"\n\n        return await step_c()\n```\n\n### Workflow Configuration\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"compatibility_flags\": [\"python_workers\", \"python_workflows\"],\n  \"compatibility_date\": \"2025-12-01\",\n  \"workflows\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"my-workflow\",\n      \"binding\": \"MY_WORKFLOW\",\n      \"class_name\": \"MyWorkflow\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Package Management\n\n### pyproject.toml Configuration\n\n```toml\n[project]\nname = \"my-python-worker\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\nrequires-python = \">=3.12\"\ndependencies = [\n    \"beautifulsoup4\",\n    \"httpx\"\n]\n\n[dependency-groups]\ndev = [\n    \"workers-py\",\n    \"workers-runtime-sdk\"\n]\n```\n\n### Supported Packages\n\nPython Workers support:\n- **Pure Python packages** from PyPI\n- **Pyodide packages** (pre-built for WebAssembly)\n\nSee [Pyodide packages list](https://pyodide.org/en/stable/usage/packages-in-pyodide.html).\n\n### HTTP Clients\n\nOnly **async** HTTP libraries work:\n\n```python\n# ✅ WORKS - httpx (async)\nimport httpx\n\nasync with httpx.AsyncClient() as client:\n    response = await client.get(\"https://api.example.com\")\n\n# ✅ WORKS - aiohttp\nimport aiohttp\n\nasync with aiohttp.ClientSession() as session:\n    async with session.get(\"https://api.example.com\") as response:\n        data = await response.json()\n\n# ❌ DOES NOT WORK - requests (sync)\nimport requests  # Will fail!\n```\n\n### Requesting New Packages\n\nRequest support for new packages at:\nhttps://github.com/cloudflare/workerd/discussions/categories/python-packages\n\n---\n\n## FFI (Foreign Function Interface)\n\nAccess JavaScript APIs from Python via Pyodide''s FFI:\n\n### JavaScript Globals\n\n```python\nfrom js import fetch, console, Response as JSResponse\n\nclass Default(WorkerEntrypoint):\n    async def fetch(self, request):\n        # Use JavaScript fetch\n        response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com\")\n        data = await response.json()\n\n        # Console logging\n        console.log(\"Fetched data:\", data)\n\n        # Return JavaScript Response\n        return JSResponse.new(\"Hello!\")\n```\n\n### Type Conversions\n\n**Important**: `to_py()` is a METHOD on JavaScript objects, not a standalone function. Only `to_js()` is a function.\n\n```python\nfrom js import Object\nfrom pyodide.ffi import to_js\n\n# ❌ WRONG - ImportError!\nfrom pyodide.ffi import to_py\npython_data = to_py(js_data)\n\n# ✅ CORRECT - to_py() is a method\nasync def fetch(self, request):\n    data = await request.json()  # Returns JS object\n    python_data = data.to_py()   # Convert to Python dict\n\n# Convert Python dict to JavaScript object\npython_dict = {\"name\": \"test\", \"count\": 42}\njs_object = to_js(python_dict, dict_converter=Object.fromEntries)\n\n# Use in Response\nreturn Response(to_js({\"status\": \"ok\"}))\n```\n\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #3322](https://github.com/cloudflare/workerd/issues/3322) (Pyodide maintainer clarification)\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\nThis skill prevents **11 documented issues**:\n\n### Issue #1: Legacy Handler Pattern\n\n**Error**: `TypeError: on_fetch is not defined`\n\n**Why**: Handler pattern changed in August 2025.\n\n```python\n# ❌ OLD (deprecated)\n@handler\nasync def on_fetch(request):\n    return Response(\"Hello\")\n\n# ✅ NEW (current)\nclass Default(WorkerEntrypoint):\n    async def fetch(self, request):\n        return Response(\"Hello\")\n```\n\n### Issue #2: Sync HTTP Libraries\n\n**Error**: `RuntimeError: cannot use blocking call in async context`\n\n**Why**: Python Workers run async-only. Sync libraries block the event loop.\n\n```python\n# ❌ FAILS\nimport requests\nresponse = requests.get(\"https://api.example.com\")\n\n# ✅ WORKS\nimport httpx\nasync with httpx.AsyncClient() as client:\n    response = await client.get(\"https://api.example.com\")\n```\n\n### Issue #3: Native/Compiled Packages\n\n**Error**: `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named ''numpy''` (or similar)\n\n**Why**: Only pure Python packages work. Native C extensions are not supported.\n\n**Solution**: Use Pyodide-compatible alternatives or check [Pyodide packages](https://pyodide.org/en/stable/usage/packages-in-pyodide.html).\n\n### Issue #4: Missing Compatibility Flags\n\n**Error**: `Error: Python Workers require the python_workers compatibility flag`\n\n**Fix**: Add to wrangler.jsonc:\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"compatibility_flags\": [\"python_workers\"]\n}\n```\n\nFor Workflows, also add `\"python_workflows\"`.\n\n### Issue #5: I/O Outside Workflow Steps\n\n**Error**: Workflow state not persisted correctly\n\n**Why**: All I/O must happen inside `@step.do` for durability.\n\n```python\n# ❌ BAD - fetch outside step\nresponse = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com\")\n@step.do(\"use data\")\nasync def use_data():\n    return await response.json()  # response may be stale on retry\n\n# ✅ GOOD - fetch inside step\n@step.do(\"fetch and use\")\nasync def fetch_and_use():\n    response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com\")\n    return await response.json()\n```\n\n### Issue #6: Type Serialization Errors\n\n**Error**: `TypeError: Object of type X is not JSON serializable`\n\n**Why**: Workflow step return values must be JSON-serializable.\n\n**Fix**: Convert complex objects before returning:\n\n```python\n@step.do(\"process\")\nasync def process():\n    # Convert datetime to string\n    return {\"timestamp\": datetime.now().isoformat()}\n```\n\n### Issue #7: Cold Start Performance\n\n**Note**: Python Workers have higher cold starts than JavaScript. With Wasm memory snapshots (Dec 2025), heavy packages like FastAPI and Pydantic now load in **~1 second** (down from ~10 seconds previously), but this is still ~2x slower than JavaScript Workers (~50ms).\n\n**Performance Numbers** (as of Dec 2025):\n- **Before snapshots**: ~10 seconds for FastAPI/Pydantic\n- **After snapshots**: ~1 second (10x improvement)\n- **JavaScript equivalent**: ~50ms\n\n**Mitigation**:\n- Minimize top-level imports\n- Use lazy loading for heavy packages\n- Consider JavaScript Workers for latency-critical paths\n- Wasm snapshots automatically improve cold starts (no config needed)\n\n**Source**: [Python Workers Redux Blog](https://blog.cloudflare.com/python-workers-advancements/) | [InfoQ Coverage](https://www.infoq.com/news/2025/12/cloudflare-wasm-python-snapshot/)\n\n### Issue #8: Package Installation Failures\n\n**Error**: `Failed to install package X`\n\n**Causes**:\n- Package has native dependencies\n- Package not in Pyodide ecosystem\n- Network issues during bundling\n\n**Fix**: Check package compatibility, use alternatives, or request support.\n\n### Issue #9: Dev Registry Breaks JS-to-Python RPC\n\n**Error**: `Network connection lost` when calling Python Worker from JavaScript Worker\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #11438](https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/issues/11438)\n\n**Why It Happens**: Dev registry doesn''t properly route RPC calls between separately-run Workers in different terminals.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```bash\n# ❌ Doesn''t work - separate terminals\n# Terminal 1: npx wrangler dev (JS worker)\n# Terminal 2: npx wrangler dev (Python worker)\n# Result: Network connection lost error\n\n# ✅ Works - single wrangler instance\nnpx wrangler dev -c ts/wrangler.jsonc -c py/wrangler.jsonc\n```\n\nRun both workers in a single wrangler instance to enable proper RPC communication.\n\n### Issue #10: HTMLRewriter Memory Limit with Data URLs\n\n**Error**: `TypeError: Parser error: The memory limit has been exceeded`\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #10814](https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/issues/10814)\n\n**Why It Happens**: Large inline `data:` URLs (>10MB) in HTML trigger parser memory limits. This is NOT about response size—10MB plain text works fine, but 10MB HTML with embedded data URLs fails. Common with Python Jupyter Notebooks that use inline images for plots.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```python\n# ❌ FAILS - HTMLRewriter triggered on notebook HTML with data: URLs\nresponse = await fetch(\"https://origin.example.com/notebook.html\")\nreturn response  # Crashes if HTML contains large data: URLs\n\n# ✅ WORKS - Stream directly or use text/plain\nresponse = await fetch(\"https://origin.example.com/notebook.html\")\nheaders = {\"Content-Type\": \"text/plain\"}  # Bypass parser\nreturn Response(await response.text(), headers=headers)\n```\n\n**Workarounds**:\n- Avoid HTMLRewriter on notebook content (stream directly)\n- Pre-process notebooks to extract data URLs to external files\n- Use `text/plain` content-type to bypass parser\n\n### Issue #11: PRNG Cannot Be Seeded During Initialization\n\n**Error**: Deployment fails with user error\n**Source**: [Python Workers Redux Blog](https://blog.cloudflare.com/python-workers-advancements/)\n\n**Why It Happens**: Wasm snapshots don''t support PRNG initialization before request handlers. If you call pseudorandom number generator APIs (like `random.seed()`) during module initialization, deployment FAILS.\n\n**Prevention**:\n```python\nimport random\n\n# ❌ FAILS deployment - module-level PRNG call\nrandom.seed(42)\n\nclass Default(WorkerEntrypoint):\n    async def fetch(self, request):\n        return Response(str(random.randint(1, 100)))\n\n# ✅ WORKS - PRNG calls inside handlers\nclass Default(WorkerEntrypoint):\n    async def fetch(self, request):\n        random.seed(42)  # Initialize inside handler\n        return Response(str(random.randint(1, 100)))\n```\n\nOnly call PRNG functions inside request handlers, not at module level.\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Always Do\n\n- Use `WorkerEntrypoint` class pattern\n- Use async HTTP clients (httpx, aiohttp)\n- Put all I/O inside workflow steps\n- Add `python_workers` compatibility flag\n- Use `self.env` for all bindings\n- Return JSON-serializable data from workflow steps\n\n### Never Do\n\n- Use sync HTTP libraries (requests)\n- Use native/compiled packages\n- Perform I/O outside workflow steps\n- Use legacy `@handler` decorator for fetch\n- Expect JavaScript-level cold start times\n\n---\n\n## Framework Note: FastAPI\n\nFastAPI can work with Python Workers but with limitations:\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom workers import WorkerEntrypoint\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\n@app.get(\"/\")\nasync def root():\n    return {\"message\": \"Hello from FastAPI\"}\n\nclass Default(WorkerEntrypoint):\n    async def fetch(self, request):\n        # Route through FastAPI\n        return await app(request)\n```\n\n**Limitations**:\n- Async-only (no sync endpoints)\n- No WSGI middleware\n- Beta stability\n\nSee [Cloudflare FastAPI example](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/languages/python/) for details.\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- [Python Workers Overview](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/languages/python/)\n- [Python Workers Basics](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/languages/python/basics/)\n- [How Python Workers Work](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/languages/python/how-python-workers-work/)\n- [Python Packages](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/languages/python/packages/)\n- [FFI (Foreign Function Interface)](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/languages/python/ffi/)\n- [Python Workflows](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workflows/python/)\n- [Pywrangler CLI](https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-py)\n- [Pyodide Package List](https://pyodide.org/en/stable/usage/packages-in-pyodide.html)\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```json\n{\n  \"workers-py\": \"1.7.0\",\n  \"workers-runtime-sdk\": \"0.3.1\",\n  \"wrangler\": \"4.58.0\"\n}\n```\n\n**Note**: Always pin versions for reproducible builds. Check [PyPI workers-py](https://pypi.org/project/workers-py/) for latest releases.\n\n---\n\n## Production Validation\n\n- Cloudflare changelog: Dec 8, 2025 (Pywrangler + cold start improvements)\n- workers-py 1.7.0: Latest stable (Jan 2026)\n- Python Workflows beta: Aug 22, 2025\n- Handler pattern change: Aug 14, 2025\n\n**Compatibility Date Guidance**:\n- Use `2025-12-01` for new projects (latest features including pywrangler improvements)\n- Use `2025-08-01` only if you need to match older production Workers\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:10:50.760Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Computing Agents needing advanced Python-based edge computing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Python 基础的边缘计算能力的云计算代理。","ja":"クラウドコンピューティングエージェントが高度なPythonベースのエッジコンピューティング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"클라우드 컴퓨팅 에이전트가 고급 Python 기반 에지 컴퓨팅 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de computación en la nube que necesitan capacidades de computación de borde avanzadas basadas en Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de calcul en cloud nécessitant des capacités de calcul de bord avancées basées sur Python.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Computing-Agents, die erweiterte Python-basierte Edge-Computing-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Computação em Nuvem que necessitam de capacidades de computação de bordo avançadas baseadas em Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов облачных вычислений, которым требуются продвинутые возможности边евого вычисления на основе Python.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الحوسبة السحابية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات حوسبة حافة متقدمة تعتمد على بايثون."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute Python 3.12+ code compiled to WebAssembly, leveraging libraries like workers-py and workers-runtime-sdk, and utilizing Node.js for Wrangler functionality, all within the Cloudflare ecosystem.","zh":"使代理能够执行编译为WebAssembly的Python 3.12+代码，利用像workers-py和workers-runtime-sdk这样的库，并利用Node.js进行Wrangler功能，全都在Cloudflare生态系统中。","ja":"エージェントがWebAssemblyにコンパイルされたPython 3.12+コードを実行できるようにし、workers-pyやworkers-runtime-sdkなどのライブラリを利用し、Node.jsを使用してWranglerの機能を実現する。これらはすべてCloudflareのエコシステム内で実行されます。","ko":"에이전트가 웹 어셈블리로 컴파일된 Python 3.12+ 코드를 실행할 수 있도록 하며, workers-py 및 workers-runtime-sdk와 같은 라이브러리를 활용하고, 노드.js를 사용하여 Wrangler 기능을 사용할 수 있도록 합니다. 모든 것이 Cloudflare 생태계 내에서 실행됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar código Python 3.12+ compilado a WebAssembly, aprovechando bibliotecas como workers-py y workers-runtime-sdk, y utilizando Node.js para la funcionalidad de Wrangler, todo dentro del ecosistema de Cloudflare.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter du code Python 3.12+ compilé en WebAssembly, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme workers-py et workers-runtime-sdk, et en utilisant Node.js pour la fonctionnalité Wrangler, le tout dans l''écosystème Cloudflare.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Python 3.12+ Code auszuführen, der zu WebAssembly kompiliert wurde, indem Bibliotheken wie workers-py und workers-runtime-sdk genutzt und Node.js für die Wrangler-Funktionalität innerhalb des Cloudflare-Ökosystems verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar código Python 3.12+ compilado para WebAssembly, aproveitando bibliotecas como workers-py e workers-runtime-sdk, e utilizando Node.js para funcionalidade Wrangler, tudo dentro do ecossistema Cloudflare.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять код Python 3.12+, скомпилированный в WebAssembly, используя библиотеки như workers-py и workers-runtime-sdk, и использует Node.js для функциональности Wrangler, все внутри экосистемы Cloudflare.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تشغيل код بايثون 3.12+ المترجم إلى WebAssembly، مستفيداً من مكتبات مثل workers-py و workers-runtime-sdk، واستخدام Node.js لتشغيل Wrangler، كل ذلك داخل نظام بيئة Cloudflare."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying serverless Python applications to the edge","Automating content delivery network (CDN) configurations","Debugging Pyodide-compiled Python code for WebAssembly compatibility"],"zh":["将无服务器Python应用程序部署到边缘","自动化内容分发网络（CDN）配置","调试Pyodide编译的Python代码以便于WebAssembly兼容性"],"ja":["サーバーレスPythonアプリケーションをエッジにデプロイする","コンテンツ配信ネットワーク（CDN）構成を自動化する","PyodideでコンパイルされたPythonコードをWebAssemblyと互換性のあるようにデバッグする"],"ko":["서버리스 Python 애플리케이션을 에지에 배포하는 것","콘텐츠 전송 네트워크(CDN) 구성 자동화","Pyodide로 컴파일된 Python 코드를 웹 어셈블리와 호환되도록 디버깅"],"es":["Implementar aplicaciones Python sin servidor en el borde","Automatizar configuraciones de red de entrega de contenido (CDN)","Depurar código Python compilado por Pyodide para compatibilidad con WebAssembly"],"fr":["Déployer des applications Python sans serveur sur le bord","Automatiser les configurations de réseau de distribution de contenu (CDN)","Déboguer le code Python compilé par Pyodide pour la compatibilité WebAssembly"],"de":["Serverlose Python-Anwendungen an den Edge bereitstellen","Automatisieren von Content-Delivery-Netzwerk-(CDN)-Konfigurationen","Debuggen von Pyodide-kompiliertem Python-Code für WebAssembly-Kompatibilität"],"pt":["Implantação de aplicações Python sem servidor na borda","Automação de configurações de rede de entrega de conteúdo (CDN)","Depuração de código Python compilado Pyodide para compatibilidade com WebAssembly"],"ru":["Развертывание серверных приложений Python на краю","Автоматизация конфигураций сети доставки контента (CDN)","Отладка кода Python, скомпилированного Pyodide, для совместимости с WebAssembly"],"ar":["نشر تطبيقات بايثون بدون خادم على الحافة","أتمتة إعدادات شبكة توصيل المحتوى (CDN)","تصحيح أخطاء في رمز بايثون المترجم بواسطة Pyodide لتوافق مع WebAssembly"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires python_workers compatibility flag","Needs uv package manager and Node.js installed","Limited to Beta status, with package versions workers-py@1.7.0, workers-runtime-sdk@0.3.1, and wrangler@4.58.0"],"zh":["需要python_workers兼容性标志","需要uv包管理器和Node.js安装","仅限于Beta状态，包版本为workers-py@1.7.0、workers-runtime-sdk@0.3.1和wrangler@4.58.0"],"ja":["python_workers互換性フラグが必要","uvパッケージマネージャーとNode.jsのインストールが必要","ベータ版に限定され、パッケージバージョンはworkers-py@1.7.0、workers-runtime-sdk@0.3.1、wrangler@4.58.0"],"ko":["python_workers 호환성 플래그가 필요함","uv 패키지 관리자 및 노드.js 설치가 필요함","베타 버전으로 제한되며, 패키지 버전은 workers-py@1.7.0, workers-runtime-sdk@0.3.1, wrangler@4.58.0"],"es":["Requiere la marca de compatibilidad python_workers","Necesita el administrador de paquetes uv y Node.js instalado","Limitado al estado beta, con versiones de paquetes workers-py@1.7.0, workers-runtime-sdk@0.3.1 y wrangler@4.58.0"],"fr":["Nécessite le flag de compatibilité python_workers","A besoin du gestionnaire de paquets uv et de Node.js installé","Limité au statut bêta, avec des versions de paquets workers-py@1.7.0, workers-runtime-sdk@0.3.1 et wrangler@4.58.0"],"de":["Benötigt die Kompatibilitätsflagge python_workers","Benötigt den uv-Paket-Manager und Node.js installiert","Begrenzt auf den Betastatus, mit Paketversionen workers-py@1.7.0, workers-runtime-sdk@0.3.1 und wrangler@4.58.0"],"pt":["Exige a flag de compatibilidade python_workers","Necessita do gerenciador de pacotes uv e do Node.js instalados","Limitado ao status Beta, com versões de pacotes workers-py@1.7.0, workers-runtime-sdk@0.3.1 e wrangler@4.58.0"],"ru":["Требует флага совместимости python_workers","Требует установленного пакетного менеджера uv и Node.js","Ограничен статусом бета-версии, с версиями пакетов workers-py@1.7.0, workers-runtime-sdk@0.3.1 и wrangler@4.58.0"],"ar":["يتطلب علم الاشارة التوافق python_workers","يحتاج إلى مدير حزم uv و Node.js المثبت","محدود بالوضع التجريبي، مع إصدارات حزم workers-py@1.7.0 و workers-runtime-sdk@0.3.1 و wrangler@4.58.0"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"12a6035f83a48fea0cb08443b291e018dafe97a2f14b21db685e7176cbaaaa1c","qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/iOS Localization & Assets', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'iOS Localization & Assets', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z', '2026-02-20T05:11:54.378Z', '92928cc653b564577a07486f7d841dd1b550a10036ceb5dd8e209a4d0a7660b6', '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/iOS Localization & Assets","name":"iOS Localization & Assets","description":{"es":"La localización y los activos en iOS son cruciales para una experiencia de usuario óptima. Aprende a implementarlas de manera efectiva con nuestras mejores prácticas.","fr":"La localisation et les actifs dans iOS sont essentielles pour une expérience utilisateur optimale. Découvrez comment les implémenter de manière efficace avec nos meilleures pratiques.","de":"Die Lokalisierung und Assets in iOS sind entscheidend für eine optimale Benutzererfahrung. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie effektiv implementieren mit unseren Best Practices.","pt":"Localização e ativos iOS são fundamentais para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos de sucesso. Aprenda sobre as melhores práticas","ru":"Локализация и активы iOS являются фундаментальными для разработки успешных приложений. Узнайте о лучших практиках","ar":"تعريب وملحقات آيفون أساسيان لنجاح التطبيقات. تعرف على أفضل الممارسات","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"es":"iOS Localización y Activos: Mejores Prácticas","fr":"iOS Localisation et Actifs: Bonnes Pratiques","de":"iOS Lokalisierung und Assets: Best Practices","pt":"Localização e Ativos iOS: Melhores Práticas","ru":"Локализация и активы iOS: лучшие практики","ar":"تعريب وملحقات آيفون: أفضل الممارسات","en":"iOS Localization & Assets"},"description":{"es":"La localización y los activos en iOS son cruciales para una experiencia de usuario óptima. Aprende a implementarlas de manera efectiva con nuestras mejores p...","fr":"La localisation et les actifs dans iOS sont essentielles pour une expérience utilisateur optimale. Découvrez comment les implémenter de manière efficace avec...","de":"Die Lokalisierung und Assets in iOS sind entscheidend für eine optimale Benutzererfahrung. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie effektiv implementieren mit unseren Best...","pt":"Localização e ativos iOS são fundamentais para o desenvolvimento de aplicativos de sucesso. Aprenda sobre as melhores práticas","ru":"Локализация и активы iOS являются фундаментальными для разработки успешных приложений. Узнайте о лучших практиках","ar":"تعريب وملحقات آيفون أساسيان لنجاح التطبيقات. تعرف على أفضل الممارسات","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"es":["Uso de catálogos de cadenas (.stringcatalog) para la localización","Implementación de pluralización con String Catalogs","Uso de String(localized: \"key\") o LocalizedStringResource para la localización","Evitación de NSLocalizedString manual cuando sea posible","Soporte para diferentes idiomas y regiones"],"fr":["Utilisation de catalogues de chaînes (.stringcatalog) pour la localisation","Implémentation de la pluralisation avec String Catalogs","Utilisation de String(localized: \"key\") ou LocalizedStringResource pour la localisation","Évitement de NSLocalizedString manuel lorsque possible","Prise en charge de différentes langues et régions"],"de":["Verwendung von Zeichenfolgenkatalogen (.stringcatalog) für die Lokalisierung","Implementierung der Pluralisierung mit String Catalogs","Verwendung von String(localized: \"key\") oder LocalizedStringResource für die Lokalisierung","Vermeidung von manualen NSLocalizedString wenn möglich","Unterstützung für verschiedene Sprachen und Regionen"],"pt":["Catálogos de strings para localização","Suporte à pluralização","Implementação nativa de localização","Uso de recursos de localização de string","Melhores práticas para desenvolvedores iOS"],"ru":["Каталоги строк для локализации","Поддержка формула множественного числа","Нативная реализация локализации","Использование ресурсов локализации строк","Лучшие практики для разработчиков iOS"],"ar":["قوائم السلاسل للتعريب","دعم تنوع الأشكال","تنفيذ تعريب أصلي","استخدام موارد تعريب السلاسل","أفضل الممارسات لمطوري آيفون"]},"keywords":{"es":["iOS localización","activos en iOS","mejores prácticas de localización","String Catalogs","pluralización en iOS","LocalizedStringResource","NSLocalizedString","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["localisation iOS","actifs dans iOS","bonnes pratiques de localisation","String Catalogs","pluralisation dans iOS","LocalizedStringResource","NSLocalizedString","développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["iOS Lokalisierung","Assets in iOS","Best Practices für die Lokalisierung","String Catalogs","Pluralisierung in iOS","LocalizedStringResource","NSLocalizedString","Mobile-App-Entwicklung"],"pt":["localização ios","ativos ios","catálogos de strings","pluralização","desenvolvimento ios","melhores práticas ios","aplicativos ios","tradução ios","internacionalização ios"],"ru":["локализация ios","активы ios","каталоги строк","формула множественного числа","разработка ios","лучшие практики ios","приложения ios","перевод ios","интернационализация ios"],"ar":["تعريب آيفون","ملحقات آيفون","قوائم السلاسل","تنوع الأشكال","تطوير آيفون","أفضل الممارسات آيفون","تطبيقات آيفون","ترجمة آيفون","عالمية آيفون"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"iOS Localization & Assets","description":"Standards for String Catalogs, L10n, and Asset Management.","bodyPreview":"# iOS Localization & Assets Standards\n\n## **Priority: P1**\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### Localization (L10n)\n\n- **String Catalogs (.stringcatalog)**: Use for primary localization in Xcode 15+. It provides a visual editor and compile-time checks for missing translations.\n- **Native Implementation**: Use `String(localized: \"key\")` or `LocalizedStringResource`. Avoid manual `NSLocalizedString` where possible.\n- **Pluralization**: Use String Catalogs'' built-in pluralization support instead of c","body":"# iOS Localization & Assets Standards\n\n## **Priority: P1**\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### Localization (L10n)\n\n- **String Catalogs (.stringcatalog)**: Use for primary localization in Xcode 15+. It provides a visual editor and compile-time checks for missing translations.\n- **Native Implementation**: Use `String(localized: \"key\")` or `LocalizedStringResource`. Avoid manual `NSLocalizedString` where possible.\n- **Pluralization**: Use String Catalogs'' built-in pluralization support instead of complex code logic.\n- **Formatting**: Use `Formatted` API for dates, numbers, and currencies to respect the user''s locale.\n\n### Asset Management\n\n- **Asset Catalogs (.xcassets)**: Keep assets organized. Use folders with \"Provides Namespace\" enabled for large projects.\n- **SF Symbols**: Use for standard icons to ensure consistency and accessibility.\n- **Vector Assets**: Use PDF or SVG and enable \"Preserve Vector Data\" for resolution independence.\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- **Hardcoded Strings**: Never use hardcoded strings in UI. Every user-facing string must be localized.\n- **Base Bundle**: Ensure `Base` localization is complete before adding other languages.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **Manual String Formatting**: `**No manual currency symbol concat**: Use NumberFormatter or .formatted(.currency).`\n- **Loose Asset Files**: `**No loose png/jpg files in repo**: Always use Asset Catalogs.`\n- **Untranslated Keys**: `**No placeholder strings**: Ensure 100% coverage in String Catalogs.`\n\n## References\n\n- [L10n & Asset Organization](references/implementation.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:11:54.378Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for iOS Development Agents specializing in automating localization workflows and asset management.","zh":"非常适合专门从事自动化本地化工作流和资产管理的iOS开发代理。","ja":"iOS開発エージェントがローカライズのワークフローとアセット管理を自動化するのに最適です。","ko":"로컬라이제이션 워크플ロー 및 자산 관리를 자동화하는 iOS 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de iOS que se especializan en automatizar flujos de trabajo de localización y administración de activos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement iOS spécialisés dans l''automatisation des flux de travail de localisation et de gestion d''actifs.","de":"Perfekt für iOS-Entwicklungsagenten, die sich auf die Automatisierung von Lokalisierungsworkflows und die Verwaltung von Assets spezialisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do iOS especializados em automação de fluxos de trabalho de localização e gerenciamento de ativos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки iOS, специализирующихся на автоматизации рабочих процессов локализации и управления активами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير iOS المتخصص في توفير автоматизации سير عمل الترجمة وتحویل الإدارة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate String Catalog (.stringcatalog) management in Xcode 15+, implement compile-time checks for missing translations, and handle pluralization natively. Provides direct integration with modern Swift paradigms like `String(localized:)` and `LocalizedStringResource` for streamlined localization.","zh":"赋予代理自动化Xcode 15+中的字符串目录（.stringcatalog）管理，实现编译时检查缺失的翻译，并以本地方式处理复数形式。提供与现代Swift范式（如`String(localized:)`和`LocalizedStringResource`）的直接集成，以实现本地化的简化。","ja":"Xcode 15+でのString Catalog（.stringcatalog）管理の自動化、コンパイル時の欠落している翻訳のチェック、ネイティブでの複数形の処理をエージェントに可能にします。`String(localized:)`や`LocalizedStringResource`などのモダンなSwiftパラダイムとの直接的な統合を提供し、ローカライズの簡素化を実現します。","ko":"Xcode 15+에서 문자열 카탈로그(.stringcatalog) 관리를 자동화하고, 컴파일 타임에 누락된 번역을 확인하며, 네이티브로 복수형을 처리할 수 있도록 에이전트를 구축합니다. `String(localized:)` 및 `LocalizedStringResource`와 같은 현대적인 Swift 패러다임과의 직접 통합을 제공하여 로컬라이제이션을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la administración del catálogo de cadenas (.stringcatalog) en Xcode 15+, implementar controles de tiempo de compilación para traducciones que faltan y controlar la pluralización de forma nativa. Proporciona una integración directa con paradigmas Swift modernos como `String(localized:)` y `LocalizedStringResource` para una localización optimizada.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la gestion du catalogue de chaînes (.stringcatalog) dans Xcode 15+, de mettre en œuvre des contrôles de temps de compilation pour les traductions manquantes et de gérer la pluralisation de manière native. Fournit une intégration directe avec les paradigmes Swift modernes tels que `String(localized:)` et `LocalizedStringResource` pour une localisation optimisée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Verwaltung des Zeichenfolgenkatalogs (.stringcatalog) in Xcode 15+ zu automatisieren, Compile-Time-Checks für fehlende Übersetzungen zu implementieren und die Pluralisierung nativ zu handhaben. Bietet eine direkte Integration mit modernen Swift-Paradigmen wie `String(localized:)` und `LocalizedStringResource` für eine optimierte Lokalisierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a gestão do Catálogo de Strings (.stringcatalog) no Xcode 15+, implementar verificações de tempo de compilação para traduções ausentes e lidar com a pluralização de forma nativa. Fornece integração direta com paradigmas Swift modernos como `String(localized:)` e `LocalizedStringResource` para localização simplificada.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать управление каталогом строк (.stringcatalog) в Xcode 15+, реализовывать проверки во время компиляции на отсутствующие переводы и обрабатывать форму множественного числа в родном режиме. Предоставляет прямую интеграцию со современными парадигмами Swift, такими как `String(localized:)` и `LocalizedStringResource`, для упрощенной локализации.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تمكين الوكلاء من توفير автоматизации إدارة كتالوج السلاسل (.stringcatalog) في Xcode 15+، وتنفيذ عمليات التحقق في وقت الترجمة للترجمات الناقصة، ومعالجة التعددية بشكل أصلي. يوفر التكامل المباشر مع أنماط Swift الحديثة مثل `String(localized:)` و `LocalizedStringResource` للتدويل المبسّط."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating String Catalog validation and synchronization","Generating localized asset variants for multiple regions","Implementing native pluralization rules without manual NSLocalizedString"],"zh":["自动化字符串目录的验证和同步","为多个地区生成本地化资产变体","实施本地复数规则，无需手动使用NSLocalizedString"],"ja":["String Catalogの検証と同期の自動化","複数の地域向けにローカライズされたアセットのバリアントを生成する","NSLocalizedStringを手動で使用せずにネイティブの複数形ルールを実装する"],"ko":["문자열 카탈로그의 유효성 검사 및 동기화를 자동화하는 것","여러 지역을 위한 로컬라이제이션된 자산 변형체를 생성하는 것","수동으로 NSLocalizedString를 사용하지 않고 네이티브 복수형 규칙을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la validación y sincronización del catálogo de cadenas","Generación de variantes de activos localizados para múltiples regiones","Implementación de reglas de pluralización nativas sin NSLocalizedString manual"],"fr":["Automatisation de la validation et de la synchronisation du catalogue de chaînes","Génération de variantes d''actifs localisés pour plusieurs régions","Mise en œuvre de règles de pluralisation natives sans NSLocalizedString manuel"],"de":["Automatisierung der Überprüfung und Synchronisation des Zeichenfolgenkatalogs","Generierung von lokalisierten Asset-Varianten für mehrere Regionen","Implementierung von Pluralisierungsregeln ohne manuelle Nutzung von NSLocalizedString"],"pt":["Automação de validação e sincronização do Catálogo de Strings","Geração de variantes de ativos localizados para várias regiões","Implementação de regras de pluralização nativas sem NSLocalizedString manual"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверки и синхронизации каталога строк","Генерация вариантов локализованных активов для нескольких регионов","Реализация родных правил множественного числа без ручного NSLocalizedString"],"ar":["توفير автоматизации التحقق والتزامن لكتالوج السلاسل","توليد متغيرات الأصول المترجمة لمножة من المناطق","تنفيذ قواعد التعددية الأصلية بدون NSLocalizedString اليدوي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Xcode 15+ for String Catalog features","iOS/macOS development environment only"],"zh":["需要Xcode 15+才能使用字符串目录功能","仅限iOS/macOS开发环境"],"ja":["String Catalogの機能を使用するにはXcode 15+が必要","iOS/macOS開発環境のみ"],"ko":["문자열 카탈로그 기능을 사용하려면 Xcode 15+가 필요합니다.","iOS/macOS 개발 환경만 지원"],"es":["Requiere Xcode 15+ para las características del catálogo de cadenas","Entorno de desarrollo de iOS/macOS solo"],"fr":["Nécessite Xcode 15+ pour les fonctionnalités du catalogue de chaînes","Environnement de développement iOS/macOS uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Xcode 15+ für die Funktionen des Zeichenfolgenkatalogs","Nur iOS/macOS-Entwicklungsumgebung"],"pt":["Requer Xcode 15+ para recursos do Catálogo de Strings","Ambiente de desenvolvimento do iOS/macOS apenas"],"ru":["Требуется Xcode 15+ для функций каталога строк","Только среда разработки iOS/macOS"],"ar":["يتطلب Xcode 15+ لميزات كتالوج السلاسل","بيئة تطوير iOS/macOS فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"92928cc653b564577a07486f7d841dd1b550a10036ceb5dd8e209a4d0a7660b6","qualityScore":30}');
