와줍니다","es":"Aprende a optimizar el rendimiento de tus aplicaciones Angular con técnicas como OnPush y carga diferida","fr":"Découvrez comment optimiser les performances de vos applications Angular avec des techniques comme OnPush et chargement différé","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Leistung Ihrer Angular-Anwendungen mit Techniken wie OnPush und verzögerter Ladung optimieren","pt":"Otimização de desempenho em Angular para melhorar a velocidade e eficiência do seu aplicativo","ru":"Оптимизация производительности в Angular для улучшения скорости и эффективности вашего приложения","ar":"تحسين الأداء في أنجولار لتحسين السرعة والكفاءة لتطبيقك","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["OnPush变更检测策略","Deferrable Views延迟加载","Images优化","Zoneless Angular支持","TrackBy功能"],"ja":["OnPush変化検出戦略","Deferrable Views遅延ロード","Images最適化","Zoneless Angularサポート","TrackBy機能"],"ko":["OnPush 변경 감지 전략","Deferrable Views 지연 로딩","Images 최적화","Zoneless Angular 지원","TrackBy 기능"],"es":["Estrategia de detección de cambios OnPush","Carga diferida de componentes pesados","Optimización de imágenes con NgOptimizedImage","Preparación para Zoneless Angular","Uso de Signals para evitar hacks de Zone.runOutsideAngular","Implementación de TrackBy para mejorar el rendimiento"],"fr":["Stratégie de détection de changements OnPush","Chargement différé de composants lourds","Optimisation d''images avec NgOptimizedImage","Préparation pour Zoneless Angular","Utilisation de Signals pour éviter les hacks de Zone.runOutsideAngular","Implémentation de TrackBy pour améliorer les performances"],"de":["Änderungserkennungsstrategie OnPush","Verzögerte Ladung von schweren Komponenten","Optimierung von Bildern mit NgOptimizedImage","Vorbereitung auf Zoneless Angular","Verwendung von Signals, um Zone.runOutsideAngular-Hacks zu vermeiden","Implementierung von TrackBy zur Leistungsverbesserung"],"pt":["Uso de ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Carregamento lento de componentes com @defer","Otimização de imagens com NgOptimizedImage","Preparação para Zoneless Angular","Uso de TrackBy para melhorar a performance"],"ru":["Использование ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Ленивая загрузка компонентов с @defer","Оптимизация изображений с NgOptimizedImage","Подготовка к Zoneless Angular","Использование TrackBy для улучшения производительности"],"ar":["استخدام ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","تحميل متأخر للمكونات باستخدام @defer","تحسين الصور باستخدام NgOptimizedImage","الاستعداد ل Zoneless Angular","استخدام TrackBy لتحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular性能优化","OnPush","Deferrable Views","Images优化","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy","Angular开发","性能优化最佳实践"],"ja":["Angularパフォーマンス最適化","OnPush","Deferrable Views","Images最適化","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy","Angular開発","パフォーマンス最適化ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Angular 성능 최적화","OnPush","Deferrable Views","Images 최적화","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy","Angular 개발","성능 최적화最佳 실천 방법"],"es":["optimización de rendimiento","Angular","OnPush","carga diferida","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","Signals","TrackBy","desarrollo de aplicaciones","mejora del rendimiento"],"fr":["optimisation des performances","Angular","OnPush","chargement différé","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","Signals","TrackBy","développement d''applications","amélioration des performances"],"de":["Leistungsoptimierung","Angular","OnPush","verzögerte Ladung","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","Signals","TrackBy","Anwendungsentwicklung","Leistungsverbesserung"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho","angular","ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","carregamento lento","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности","angular","ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","ленивая загрузка","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","أنجولار","ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","تحميل متأخر","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Performance","description":"Optimization techniques including OnPush, @defer, and Image Optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Performance\n\n## **Priority: P1 (HIGH)**\n\n## Principles\n\n- **OnPush**: Always use `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`. Components should only update when Inputs change or Signals fire.\n- **Deferrable Views**: Use `@defer` to lazy load heavy components/chunks below the fold.\n- **Images**: Use `NgOptimizedImage` (`ngSrc`) for LCP optimization.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Zoneless**: Prepare for Zoneless Angular by avoiding `Zone.runOutsideAngular` hacks. Use Signals.\n- **TrackBy**: Always provide a tracking","body":"# Performance\n\n## **Priority: P1 (HIGH)**\n\n## Principles\n\n- **OnPush**: Always use `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`. Components should only update when Inputs change or Signals fire.\n- **Deferrable Views**: Use `@defer` to lazy load heavy components/chunks below the fold.\n- **Images**: Use `NgOptimizedImage` (`ngSrc`) for LCP optimization.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Zoneless**: Prepare for Zoneless Angular by avoiding `Zone.runOutsideAngular` hacks. Use Signals.\n- **TrackBy**: Always provide a tracking function in loops (`@for (item of items; track item.id)`).\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **Functions in Template**: `{{ calculate() }}` causes re-evaluation on every change detection cycle. Use `computed()` signals or pure pipes.\n- **Heavy Constructors**: Keep constructors empty. Use `ngOnInit` or effects.\n\n## References\n\n- [Defer Usage](references/defer-usage.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:12:05.337Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Angular-based AI Agents requiring optimized rendering and change detection strategies.","zh":"适用于需要优化渲染和变更检测策略的 Angular 基础 AI 代理。","ja":"Angular ベースの AI エージェントが最適なレンダリングと変更検出戦略を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"최적화된 렌더링 및 변경 감지 전략이 필요한 Angular 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Angular que requieren estrategias de renderizado y detección de cambios optimizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA basés sur Angular nécessitant des stratégies de rendu et de détection de modifications optimisées.","de":"Ideal für Angular-basierte KI-Agents, die optimierte Rendering- und Änderungserkennungsstrategien erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Angular que necessitam de renderização otimizada e estratégias de detecção de alterações.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Angular, требующих оптимизированного рендеринга и стратегий обнаружения изменений.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستند إلى Angular الذي يتطلب تصييرًا محسّنًا واستراتيجيات كشف التغييرات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize component updates using ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, lazy load heavy components with @defer, and leverage NgOptimizedImage for LCP optimization, ensuring seamless user experiences with reduced latency.","zh":"赋予代理使用 ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush 优化组件更新，使用 @defer 延迟加载重组件，并利用 NgOptimizedImage 进行 LCP 优化，从而确保用户体验顺畅，延迟减少。","ja":"ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush を使用してコンポーネントの更新を最適化し、@defer を使用して重いコンポーネントを遅延ロードし、NgOptimizedImage を使用して LCP を最適化することで、ユーザー エクスペリエンスがスムーズになり、待ち時間が短縮されるようにエージェントをエンパワーメントします。","ko":"에이전트가 ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush를 사용하여 컴포넌트 업데이트를 최적화하고, @defer를 사용하여 무거운 컴포넌트를 지연 로딩하며, NgOptimizedImage를 사용하여 LCP를 최적화하여 사용자 경험을 개선하고 대기 시간을 줄이는 데 도움이 됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar las actualizaciones de componentes utilizando ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, cargar con retraso componentes pesados con @defer y aprovechar NgOptimizedImage para la optimización de LCP, garantizando experiencias de usuario fluidas con latencia reducida.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les mises à jour de composants en utilisant ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, de charger avec retard les composants lourds avec @defer et d''utiliser NgOptimizedImage pour l''optimisation de LCP, garantissant ainsi des expériences utilisateur fluides avec une latence réduite.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Komponenten-Updates mit ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush zu optimieren, schwere Komponenten mit @defer lazy zu laden und NgOptimizedImage für die LCP-Optimierung zu nutzen, um so eine nahtlose Benutzererfahrung mit reduzierter Latenz zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar as atualizações de componentes usando ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, carregar componentes pesados com @defer e aproveitar NgOptimizedImage para otimização do LCP, garantindo experiências de usuário sem interrupções com latência reduzida.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать обновления компонентов с помощью ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, отложенно загружать тяжелые компоненты с @defer и использовать NgOptimizedImage для оптимизации LCP, обеспечивая бесперебойный пользовательский опыт с уменьшенной задержкой.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحسين تحديثات المكونات باستخدام ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush وتحميل المكونات الثقيلة باستخدام @defer وتحسين NgOptimizedImage لتحسين نتائج LCP، مما يضمن تجربة المستخدم دون انقطاع مع تقليل التأخير."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing OnPush change detection for efficient component updates","Lazy loading deferrable views to enhance page load times","Optimizing images with NgOptimizedImage for improved LCP scores"],"zh":["实现 OnPush 变更检测以高效更新组件","延迟加载可延迟视图以提高页面加载速度","使用 NgOptimizedImage 优化图像以提高 LCP 得分"],"ja":["効率的なコンポーネントの更新のために OnPush 変更検出を実装する","ページの読み込み時間を向上させるために遅延可能なビューを遅延ロードする","LCP スコアを向上させるために NgOptimizedImage を使用して画像を最適化する"],"ko":["효율적인 컴포넌트 업데이트를 위한 OnPush 변경 감지 구현","페이지 로딩 시간을 개선하기 위한 지연 가능한 뷰의 지연 로딩","LCP 점수를 개선하기 위한 NgOptimizedImage를 사용한 이미지 최적화"],"es":["Implementación de la detección de cambios OnPush para actualizaciones de componentes eficientes","Carga diferida de vistas posponibles para mejorar los tiempos de carga de página","Optimización de imágenes con NgOptimizedImage para mejorar las puntuaciones de LCP"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de la détection de modifications OnPush pour des mises à jour de composants efficaces","Chargement différé de vues différables pour améliorer les temps de chargement de page","Optimisation des images avec NgOptimizedImage pour améliorer les scores de LCP"],"de":["Implementierung der OnPush-Änderungserkennung für effiziente Komponenten-Updates","Lazy-Laden von verschiebbaren Ansichten, um die Ladezeiten von Seiten zu verbessern","Optimierung von Bildern mit NgOptimizedImage, um die LCP-Bewertungen zu verbessern"],"pt":["Implementação da detecção de alterações OnPush para atualizações de componentes eficientes","Carregamento lento de visualizações adiáveis para melhorar os tempos de carregamento de página","Otimização de imagens com NgOptimizedImage para melhorar os resultados do LCP"],"ru":["Реализация обнаружения изменений OnPush для эффективных обновлений компонентов","Ленивая загрузка отложенных представлений для улучшения времени загрузки страницы","Оптимизация изображений с помощью NgOptimizedImage для улучшения результатов LCP"],"ar":["تنفيذ كشف التغييرات OnPush لتحديثات المكونات الفعالة","تحميل متأخر للمشاهد القابلة للتأجيل لتحسين أوقات تحميل الصفحة","تحسين الصور مع NgOptimizedImage لتحسين نتائج LCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular framework","Zoneless Angular preparation necessary","NgOptimizedImage dependency needed"],"zh":["需要 Angular 框架","Zoneless Angular 准备是必要的","需要 NgOptimizedImage 依赖"],"ja":["Angular フレームワークが必要","Zoneless Angular の準備が必要","NgOptimizedImage 依存関係が必要"],"ko":["Angular 프레임워크가 필요합니다","Zoneless Angular 준비가 필요합니다","NgOptimizedImage 의존성이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere el marco de Angular","Preparación de Angular sin zona necesaria","Se requiere la dependencia de NgOptimizedImage"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Angular","Préparation d''Angular sans zone nécessaire","Dépendance de NgOptimizedImage requise"],"de":["Benötigt das Angular-Framework","Vorbereitung von Angular ohne Zone erforderlich","NgOptimizedImage-Abhängigkeit erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige estrutura Angular","Preparação do Angular sem zona necessária","Dependência de NgOptimizedImage necessária"],"ru":["Требует框架 Angular","Необходима подготовка Angular без зоны","Требуется зависимость от NgOptimizedImage"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار Angular","التحضير بدون منطقة للانجولار ضروري","التع赖 على NgOptimizedImage ضروري"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"430b6d4b302f7276424b89ed0b11a8b59e9fb9c672db17b69b40a700266a1775","qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mosif16/codex-Skills/build-iphone-apps', 'community', 'mosif16', 'codex-Skills', 'mosif16/codex-Skills', 'build-iphone-apps', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z', '2026-02-20T05:11:52.084Z', '4d8b89d7f4430129008879473210e5fc7a4327c2e788438317a93f5ce52a337c', '{"id":"mosif16/codex-Skills/build-iphone-apps","name":"build-iphone-apps","description":{"zh":"iPhone, xcodebuild ","ja":"iPhone, xcodebuild ","ko":"iPhone, xcodebuild ","es":"Desarrolla aplicaciones para iPhone con Claude, un desarrollador que implementa y verifica tus ideas sin necesidad de codificar","fr":"Créez des applications iPhone avec Claude, un développeur qui met en œuvre et vérifie vos idées sans nécessité de coder","de":"Erstellen Sie iPhone-Apps mit Claude, einem Entwickler, der Ihre Ideen umsetzt und überprüft, ohne dass Sie Code schreiben müssen","pt":"Desenvolva aplicativos iPhone com Claude, onde o usuário é o proprietário do produto e não precisa escrever ou ler código.","ru":"Разрабатывайте приложения для iPhone с Claude, где пользователь является владельцем продукта и не necesita писать или читать код.","ar":"تطوير تطبيقات آيفون مع كلود، حيث المستخدم هو صاحب المنتج ولا يحتاج إلى كتابة أو قراءة رمز.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"iPhone ","ja":"iPhone","ko":"iPhone ","es":"Desarrolla Aplicaciones para iPhone con Claude","fr":"Créez des Applications iPhone avec Claude","de":"Erstellen Sie iPhone-Apps mit Claude","pt":"Construa Aplicativos iPhone com Claude","ru":"Создайте приложения для iPhone с Claude","ar":"ابني تطبيقات آيفون مع كلود","en":"build-iphone-apps"},"description":{"zh":"iPhone, xcodebuild ","ja":"iPhone, xcodebuild ","ko":"iPhone, xcodebuild ","es":"Desarrolla aplicaciones para iPhone con Claude, un desarrollador que implementa y verifica tus ideas sin necesidad de codificar","fr":"Créez des applications iPhone avec Claude, un développeur qui met en œuvre et vérifie vos idées sans nécessité de coder","de":"Erstellen Sie iPhone-Apps mit Claude, einem Entwickler, der Ihre Ideen umsetzt und überprüft, ohne dass Sie Code schreiben müssen","pt":"Desenvolva aplicativos iPhone com Claude, onde o usuário é o proprietário do produto e não precisa escrever ou ler código.","ru":"Разрабатывайте приложения для iPhone с Claude, где пользователь является владельцем продукта и не necesita писать или читать код.","ar":"تطوير تطبيقات آيفون مع كلود، حيث المستخدم هو صاحب المنتج ولا يحتاج إلى كتابة أو قراءة رمز.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["xcodebuild","iPhone","iOS","Simulator","xcsift"],"ja":["xcodebuild","iPhone","iOS","Simulator","xcsift"],"ko":["xcodebuild","iPhone","iOS","Simulator","xcsift"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones sin codificar","Implementación y verificación de ideas","Creación de aplicaciones móviles de alta calidad","Uso de Xcode y simuladores de iOS","Pruebas y depuración de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Développement d''applications sans coder","Mise en œuvre et vérification d''idées","Création d''applications mobiles de haute qualité","Utilisation de Xcode et de simulateurs iOS","Tests et débogage d''applications"],"de":["Entwicklung von Anwendungen ohne Codierung","Umsetzung und Überprüfung von Ideen","Erstellung von mobilen Anwendungen hoher Qualität","Verwendung von Xcode und iOS-Simulatoren","Tests und Fehlersuche von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos iPhone sem código","Implementação e verificação de resultados","Relatórios de resultados","Utilização do Xcode para simulação e teste","Integração com o iOS Simulator","Desenvolvimento ágil e iterativo"],"ru":["Разработка приложений для iPhone без кода","Реализация и верификация результатов","Отчеты о результатах","Использование Xcode для симуляции и тестирования","Интеграция с iOS Simulator","Разработка по гибкой и итеративной методологии"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات آيفون بدون رمز","تنفيذ وتصديق النتائج","تقارير النتائج","استخدام Xcode للتحاكي والاختبار","التكامل مع محاكي آيفون","تطوير سريع ومتكرر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["iPhone","xcodebuild","iOS","Simulator","xcsift","iOS","iPhone"],"ja":["iPhone","xcodebuild","iOS","Simulator","xcsift","iOS","iPhone"],"ko":["iPhone","xcodebuild","iOS","Simulator","xcsift","iOS","iPhone"],"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones para iPhone","creación de aplicaciones móviles","Xcode","simuladores de iOS","pruebas de aplicaciones","depuración de aplicaciones","desarrollo de software para iOS"],"fr":["développement d''applications iPhone","création d''applications mobiles","Xcode","simulateurs iOS","tests d''applications","débogage d''applications","développement de logiciels pour iOS"],"de":["Entwicklung von iPhone-Apps","Erstellung von mobilen Anwendungen","Xcode","iOS-Simulatoren","Anwendungstests","Fehlersuche von Anwendungen","Softwareentwicklung für iOS"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de aplicativos iPhone","construir aplicativos iPhone","aplicativos iOS","desenvolvedor de aplicativos","Xcode","iOS Simulator","desenvolvimento ágil","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["разработка приложений для iPhone","создание приложений для iPhone","приложения iOS","разработчик приложений","Xcode","iOS Simulator","гибкая разработка","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات آيفون","بناء تطبيقات آيفون","تطبيقات آيفون","مطور تطبيقات","Xcode","محاكي آيفون","تطوير سريع","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"mosif16","repo":"codex-Skills","repoPath":"mosif16/codex-Skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"build-iphone-apps","description":"Build professional native iPhone apps in Swift with SwiftUI and UIKit. Full lifecycle - build, debug, test, optimize, ship. CLI-only, no Xcode. Targets iOS 26 with iOS 18 compatibility.","bodyPreview":"<essential_principles>\n## How We Work\n\n**The user is the product owner. Claude is the developer.**\n\nThe user does not write code. The user does not read code. The user describes what they want and judges whether the result is acceptable. Claude implements, verifies, and reports outcomes.\n\n### 1. Prove, Don''t Promise\n\nNever say \"this should work.\" Prove it:\n```bash\nxcodebuild -destination ''platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 16'' build 2>&1 | xcsift\nxcodebuild test -destination ''platform=iOS Simula","body":"<essential_principles>\n## How We Work\n\n**The user is the product owner. Claude is the developer.**\n\nThe user does not write code. The user does not read code. The user describes what they want and judges whether the result is acceptable. Claude implements, verifies, and reports outcomes.\n\n### 1. Prove, Don''t Promise\n\nNever say \"this should work.\" Prove it:\n```bash\nxcodebuild -destination ''platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 16'' build 2>&1 | xcsift\nxcodebuild test -destination ''platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 16''\nxcrun simctl boot \"iPhone 16\" && xcrun simctl launch booted com.app.bundle\n```\nIf you didn''t run it, you don''t know it works.\n\n### 2. Tests for Correctness, Eyes for Quality\n\n| Question | How to Answer |\n|----------|---------------|\n| Does the logic work? | Write test, see it pass |\n| Does it look right? | Launch in simulator, user looks at it |\n| Does it feel right? | User uses it |\n| Does it crash? | Test + launch |\n| Is it fast enough? | Profiler |\n\nTests verify *correctness*. The user verifies *desirability*.\n\n### 3. Report Outcomes, Not Code\n\n**Bad:** \"I refactored DataService to use async/await with weak self capture\"\n**Good:** \"Fixed the memory leak. `leaks` now shows 0 leaks. App tested stable for 5 minutes.\"\n\nThe user doesn''t care what you changed. The user cares what''s different.\n\n### 4. Small Steps, Always Verified\n\n```\nChange → Verify → Report → Next change\n```\n\nNever batch up work. Never say \"I made several changes.\" Each change is verified before the next. If something breaks, you know exactly what caused it.\n\n### 5. Ask Before, Not After\n\nUnclear requirement? Ask now.\nMultiple valid approaches? Ask which.\nScope creep? Ask if wanted.\nBig refactor needed? Ask permission.\n\nWrong: Build for 30 minutes, then \"is this what you wanted?\"\nRight: \"Before I start, does X mean Y or Z?\"\n\n### 6. Always Leave It Working\n\nEvery stopping point = working state. Tests pass, app launches, changes committed. The user can walk away anytime and come back to something that works.\n</essential_principles>\n\n<intake>\n**Ask the user:**\n\nWhat would you like to do?\n1. Build a new app\n2. Debug an existing app\n3. Add a feature\n4. Write/run tests\n5. Optimize performance\n6. Ship/release\n7. Something else\n\n**Then read the matching workflow from `workflows/` and follow it.**\n</intake>\n\n<routing>\n| Response | Workflow |\n|----------|----------|\n| 1, \"new\", \"create\", \"build\", \"start\" | `workflows/build-new-app.md` |\n| 2, \"broken\", \"fix\", \"debug\", \"crash\", \"bug\" | `workflows/debug-app.md` |\n| 3, \"add\", \"feature\", \"implement\", \"change\" | `workflows/add-feature.md` |\n| 4, \"test\", \"tests\", \"TDD\", \"coverage\" | `workflows/write-tests.md` |\n| 5, \"slow\", \"optimize\", \"performance\", \"fast\" | `workflows/optimize-performance.md` |\n| 6, \"ship\", \"release\", \"TestFlight\", \"App Store\" | `workflows/ship-app.md` |\n| 7, other | Clarify, then select workflow or references |\n</routing>\n\n<verification_loop>\n## After Every Change\n\n```bash\n# 1. Does it build?\nxcodebuild -scheme AppName -destination ''platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 16'' build 2>&1 | xcsift\n\n# 2. Do tests pass?\nxcodebuild -scheme AppName -destination ''platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 16'' test\n\n# 3. Does it launch? (if UI changed)\nxcrun simctl boot \"iPhone 16\" 2>/dev/null || true\nxcrun simctl install booted ./build/Build/Products/Debug-iphonesimulator/AppName.app\nxcrun simctl launch booted com.company.AppName\n```\n\nReport to the user:\n- \"Build: ✓\"\n- \"Tests: 12 pass, 0 fail\"\n- \"App launches in simulator, ready for you to check [specific thing]\"\n</verification_loop>\n\n<when_to_test>\n## Testing Decision\n\n**Write a test when:**\n- Logic that must be correct (calculations, transformations, rules)\n- State changes (add, delete, update operations)\n- Edge cases that could break (nil, empty, boundaries)\n- Bug fix (test reproduces bug, then proves it''s fixed)\n- Refactoring (tests prove behavior unchanged)\n\n**Skip tests when:**\n- Pure UI exploration (\"make it blue and see if I like it\")\n- Rapid prototyping (\"just get something on screen\")\n- Subjective quality (\"does this feel right?\")\n- One-off verification (launch and check manually)\n\n**The principle:** Tests let the user verify correctness without reading code. If the user needs to verify it works, and it''s not purely visual, write a test.\n</when_to_test>\n\n<reference_index>\n## Domain Knowledge\n\nAll in `references/`:\n\n**Architecture:** app-architecture, swiftui-patterns, navigation-patterns\n**Data:** data-persistence, networking\n**Platform Features:** push-notifications, storekit, background-tasks\n**Quality:** polish-and-ux, accessibility, performance\n**Assets & Security:** app-icons, security, app-store\n**Development:** project-scaffolding, cli-workflow, cli-observability, testing, ci-cd\n</reference_index>\n\n<workflows_index>\n## Workflows\n\nAll in `workflows/`:\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| build-new-app.md | Create new iOS app from scratch |\n| debug-app.md | Find and fix bugs |\n| add-feature.md | Add to existing app |\n| write-tests.md | Write and run tests |\n| optimize-performance.md | Profile and speed up |\n| ship-app.md | TestFlight, App Store submission |\n</workflows_index>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:11:52.084Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Generation Agents that act as iOS developers, handling Xcode project execution without user intervention.","zh":"非常适合作为iOS开发者的代码生成代理，能够在无需用户干预的情况下处理Xcode项目执行。","ja":"iOS開発者としてのコード生成エージェントに最適で、ユーザーの介入なしにXcodeプロジェクトを実行できます。","ko":"iOS 개발자로서의 코드 생성 에이전트에 적합하며, 사용자 개입 없이 Xcode 프로젝트를 실행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de código que actúan como desarrolladores de iOS, manejando la ejecución de proyectos de Xcode sin intervención del usuario.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de code qui agissent comme des développeurs iOS, gérant l''exécution de projets Xcode sans intervention utilisateur.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Generierungsagenten, die als iOS-Entwickler agieren, die Ausführung von Xcode-Projekten ohne Benutzereingriff verwalten.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Código que atuam como desenvolvedores iOS, manipulando a execução de projetos Xcode sem intervenção do usuário.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации кода, которые действуют как разработчики iOS, обрабатывая выполнение проектов Xcode без вмешательства пользователя.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء مولدين للرمز الذين يتصرفون كمطورين iOS ، وتشغيل مشاريع Xcode دون تدخل المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to autonomously build and test iOS applications using xcodebuild commands, proving functionality through compilation and simulator testing rather than making promises. Directly integrates with Apple''s development toolchain for iOS Simulator deployment.","zh":"赋予代理自主构建和测试iOS应用的能力，使用xcodebuild命令，通过编译和模拟器测试来证明功能，而不是做出承诺。直接集成到Apple的iOS模拟器部署开发工具链中。","ja":"エージェントに、xcodebuildコマンドを使用してiOSアプリケーションを自律的にビルドおよびテストする能力を与え、コンパイルおよびシミュレータテストによって機能を証明する。Appleの開発ツールチェーンと直接統合して、iOSシミュレーターのデプロイを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 xcodebuild 명령을 사용하여 iOS 애플리케이션을 자율적으로 빌드하고 테스트할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 컴파일과 시뮬레이터 테스트를 통해 기능을 증명한다. Apple의 개발 도구 체인과 직접 통합하여 iOS 시뮬레이터 배포를 가능하게 한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a compilar y probar aplicaciones iOS de forma autónoma utilizando comandos xcodebuild, probando la funcionalidad a través de la compilación y las pruebas del simulador en lugar de hacer promesas. Se integra directamente con la cadena de herramientas de desarrollo de Apple para la implementación del simulador de iOS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de compiler et de tester des applications iOS de manière autonome en utilisant des commandes xcodebuild, prouvant la fonctionnalité grâce à la compilation et aux tests du simulateur plutôt que de faire des promesses. S''intègre directement à la chaîne d''outils de développement d''Apple pour le déploiement du simulateur d''iOS.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, iOS-Anwendungen autonom zu erstellen und zu testen, indem xcodebuild-Befehle verwendet werden, die Funktionalität durch Kompilierung und Simulatortests anstelle von Versprechungen nachweist. Integriert sich direkt in die Entwicklungstoolchain von Apple für die Bereitstellung des iOS-Simulators.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir e testar aplicativos iOS de forma autônoma usando comandos xcodebuild, comprovando a funcionalidade por meio da compilação e testes no simulador, em vez de fazer promessas. Integra-se diretamente com a cadeia de ferramentas de desenvolvimento da Apple para implantação no iOS Simulator.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автономного сборки и тестирования приложений iOS с помощью команд xcodebuild, доказывая функциональность путем компиляции и тестирования в симуляторе, а не обещания. Прямо интегрируется с инструментальной цепочкой разработки Apple для развертывания в симуляторе iOS.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء وتجريب تطبيقات iOS بشكل مستقل باستخدام أوامر xcodebuild ، مما يثبت الوظيفة من خلال الترجمة والاختبار على المحاكي ، بدلاً من الوعد. يتكامل مباشرة مع سلسلة أدوات تطوير شركة Apple لنشر محاكي iOS."},"useCases":{"en":["Building iOS app binaries for simulator testing","Running automated test suites in iOS Simulator environments","Verifying Xcode project compilation without manual intervention"],"zh":["为模拟器测试构建iOS应用二进制文件","在iOS模拟器环境中运行自动化测试套件","在无需手动干预的情况下验证Xcode项目编译"],"ja":["シミュレータテスト用のiOSアプリケーション二進数をビルドする","iOSシミュレータ環境で自動テストスイートを実行する","手動介入不要でXcodeプロジェクトのコンパイルを検証する"],"ko":["시뮬레이터 테스트를 위한 iOS 애플리케이션 바이너리 빌드","iOS 시뮬레이터 환경에서 자동화된 테스트 스위트 실행","수동 개입 없이 Xcode 프로젝트 컴파일 검증"],"es":["Generar binarios de aplicaciones iOS para pruebas de simulador","Ejecutar suites de pruebas automatizadas en entornos de simulador de iOS","Verificar la compilación de proyectos de Xcode sin intervención manual"],"fr":["Générer des binaires d''applications iOS pour des tests de simulateur","Exécuter des suites de tests automatisées dans des environnements de simulateur d''iOS","Vérifier la compilation de projets Xcode sans intervention manuelle"],"de":["Erstellen von iOS-App-Binärdateien für Simulatortests","Ausführen von automatisierten Test-Suiten in iOS-Simulatoren-Umgebungen","Überprüfen der Xcode-Projekt-Kompilierung ohne manuelle Eingriffe"],"pt":["Construir binários de aplicativos iOS para testes no simulador","Executar conjuntos de testes automatizados em ambientes do iOS Simulator","Verificar a compilação do projeto Xcode sem intervenção manual"],"ru":["Создание бинарных файлов приложений iOS для тестирования в симуляторе","Запуск автоматизированных наборов тестов в средах симулятора iOS","Проверка компиляции проекта Xcode без ручного вмешательства"],"ar":["بناء ثنائيات تطبيقات iOS لاختبار المحاكي","تشغيل حزم اختبار أوتوماتيكية في بيئات محاكي iOS","التحقق من ترجمة مشروع Xcode دون تدخل يدوي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Xcode command line tools installed","iOS Simulator destination must be available","Limited to xcodebuild workflow execution"],"zh":["需要安装Xcode命令行工具","iOS模拟器目标必须可用","仅限xcodebuild工作流执行"],"ja":["Xcodeコマンドラインツールのインストールが必要","iOSシミュレーターの宛先が利用可能であること","xcodebuildワークフローの実行のみに対応"],"ko":["Xcode 명령줄 도구 설치 필요","iOS 시뮬레이터 대상이 사용 가능해야 함","xcodebuild 워크플로우 실행만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de herramientas de línea de comandos de Xcode","El destino del simulador de iOS debe estar disponible","Limitado a la ejecución del flujo de trabajo de xcodebuild"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation des outils de ligne de commande Xcode","La destination du simulateur d''iOS doit être disponible","Limité à l''exécution du workflow xcodebuild"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Xcode-Befehlszeilen-Tools","Das Ziel des iOS-Simulators muss verfügbar sein","Begrenzt auf die Ausführung des xcodebuild-Workflows"],"pt":["Exige ferramentas de linha de comando Xcode instaladas","O destino do iOS Simulator deve estar disponível","Limitado à execução do fluxo de trabalho xcodebuild"],"ru":["Требует установку инструментов командной строки Xcode","Назначение симулятора iOS должно быть доступно","Ограничен выполнением рабочего процесса xcodebuild"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أدوات سطر الأوامر Xcode","يجب أن يكون وجهة محاكي iOS متاحة","محدود بالتنفيذ سير عمل xcodebuild"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4d8b89d7f4430129008879473210e5fc7a4327c2e788438317a93f5ce52a337c","qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('fierzone/agent-skills-standard/Performance', 'community', 'fierzone', 'agent-skills-standard', 'fierzone/agent-skills-standard', 'Performance', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z', '2026-02-20T05:12:21.217Z', '430b6d4b302f7276424b89ed0b11a8b59e9fb9c672db17b69b40a700266a1775', '{"id":"fierzone/agent-skills-standard/Performance","name":"Performance","description":{"zh":"Angular性能优化指南，包括OnPush、Deferrable Views、Images优化等","ja":"Angularパフォーマンス最適化ガイド。OnPush、Deferrable Views、Images最適化など","ko":"Angular 성능 최적화 가이드: OnPush, Deferrable Views, Images 최적화 등","es":"Mejora el rendimiento de tus aplicaciones Angular con estrategias de detección de cambios y carga diferida","fr":"Améliorez les performances de vos applications Angular avec des stratégies de détection de changements et de chargement différé","de":"Verbessern Sie die Leistung Ihrer Angular-Anwendungen mit Strategien zur Änderungserkennung und verzögerter Ladung","pt":"Otimize o desempenho do seu aplicativo Angular com estratégias de detecção de mudanças e carregamento diferido. Aprenda a usar ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush e @defer para melhorar a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Оптимизируйте производительность вашего приложения Angular с помощью стратегий обнаружения изменений и отложенной загрузки. Узнайте, как использовать ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush и @defer для улучшения пользовательского опыта.","ar":"احسن أداء تطبيق Angular الخاص بك باستخدام استراتيجيات الكشف عن التغييرات والتحميل المتأخر. تعلم كيفية استخدام ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush و @defer لتحسين تجربة المستخدم.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Angular性能优化","ja":"Angularパフォーマンス最適化","ko":"Angular 성능 최적화","es":"Optimización de Rendimiento en Angular","fr":"Performances Optimisées dans Angular","de":"Leistungsoptimierung in Angular","pt":"Otimização de Desempenho em Angular","ru":"Оптимизация производительности в Angular","ar":"تحسين الأداء في Angular","en":"Performance"},"description":{"zh":"Angular性能优化指南，包括OnPush、Deferrable Views、Images优化等","ja":"Angularパフォーマンス最適化ガイド。OnPush、Deferrable Views、Images最適化など","ko":"Angular 성능 최적화 가이드: OnPush, Deferrable Views, Images 최적화 등","es":"Mejora el rendimiento de tus aplicaciones Angular con estrategias de detección de cambios y carga diferida","fr":"Améliorez les performances de vos applications Angular avec des stratégies de détection de changements et de chargement différé","de":"Verbessern Sie die Leistung Ihrer Angular-Anwendungen mit Strategien zur Änderungserkennung und verzögerter Ladung","pt":"Otimize o desempenho do seu aplicativo Angular com estratégias de detecção de mudanças e carregamento diferido. Aprenda a usar ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush...","ru":"Оптимизируйте производительность вашего приложения Angular с помощью стратегий обнаружения изменений и отложенной загрузки. Узнайте, как использовать ChangeD...","ar":"احسن أداء تطبيق Angular الخاص بك باستخدام استراتيجيات الكشف عن التغييرات والتحميل المتأخر. تعلم كيفية استخدام ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush و @defer لتحسين ...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["OnPush变化检测","Deferrable Views懒加载","Images优化","Zoneless支持","TrackBy功能"],"ja":["OnPush変化検出","Deferrable Views遅延ロード","Images最適化","Zoneless対応","TrackBy機能"],"ko":["OnPush 변경 감지","Deferrable Views 지연 로딩","Images 최적화","Zoneless 지원","TrackBy 기능"],"es":["Estrategia de detección de cambios OnPush","Carga diferida de componentes pesados","Optimización de imágenes para LCP","Preparación para Zoneless Angular","Uso de señales en lugar de Zone.runOutsideAngular","Implementación de TrackBy para mejorar el rendimiento"],"fr":["Stratégie de détection de changements OnPush","Chargement différé de composants lourds","Optimisation d''images pour LCP","Préparation pour Zoneless Angular","Utilisation de signaux au lieu de Zone.runOutsideAngular","Implémentation de TrackBy pour améliorer les performances"],"de":["Änderungserkennungsstrategie OnPush","Verzögerte Ladung von schweren Komponenten","Optimierung von Bildern für LCP","Vorbereitung auf Zoneless Angular","Verwendung von Signalen anstelle von Zone.runOutsideAngular","Implementierung von TrackBy zur Leistungsverbesserung"],"pt":["Uso de ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Carregamento diferido com @defer","Otimização de imagens com NgOptimizedImage","Preparação para Zoneless Angular","Uso de TrackBy para melhorar a performance"],"ru":["Использование ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Отложенная загрузка с помощью @defer","Оптимизация изображений с помощью NgOptimizedImage","Подготовка к Zoneless Angular","Использование TrackBy для улучшения производительности"],"ar":["استخدام ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","التحميل المتأخر باستخدام @defer","تحسين الصور باستخدام NgOptimizedImage","التحضير ل Angular Zoneless","استخدام TrackBy لتحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular性能优化","OnPush","Deferrable Views","Images优化","Zoneless","TrackBy","Angular优化"],"ja":["Angularパフォーマンス最適化","OnPush","Deferrable Views","Images最適化","Zoneless","TrackBy","Angular最適化"],"ko":["Angular 성능 최적화","OnPush","Deferrable Views","Images 최적화","Zoneless","TrackBy","Angular 최적화"],"es":["optimización de rendimiento en Angular","mejora de rendimiento en aplicaciones web","estrategias de detección de cambios","carga diferida de componentes","optimización de imágenes","Zoneless Angular","señales en Angular","TrackBy en Angular"],"fr":["optimisation des performances dans Angular","amélioration des performances dans les applications web","stratégies de détection de changements","chargement différé de composants","optimisation d''images","Zoneless Angular","signaux dans Angular","TrackBy dans Angular"],"de":["Leistungsoptimierung in Angular","Leistungsverbesserung in Webanwendungen","Änderungserkennungsstrategien","verzögerte Ladung von Komponenten","Optimierung von Bildern","Zoneless Angular","Signale in Angular","TrackBy in Angular"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho","angular performance","ChangeDetectionStrategy","carregamento diferido","otimização de imagens","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности","angular производительность","ChangeDetectionStrategy","отложенная загрузка","оптимизация изображений","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","أداء Angular","ChangeDetectionStrategy","التحميل المتأخر","تحسين الصور","Angular Zoneless","TrackBy"]}},"owner":"fierzone","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"fierzone/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Performance","description":"Optimization techniques including OnPush, @defer, and Image Optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Performance\n\n## **Priority: P1 (HIGH)**\n\n## Principles\n\n- **OnPush**: Always use `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`. Components should only update when Inputs change or Signals fire.\n- **Deferrable Views**: Use `@defer` to lazy load heavy components/chunks below the fold.\n- **Images**: Use `NgOptimizedImage` (`ngSrc`) for LCP optimization.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Zoneless**: Prepare for Zoneless Angular by avoiding `Zone.runOutsideAngular` hacks. Use Signals.\n- **TrackBy**: Always provide a tracking","body":"# Performance\n\n## **Priority: P1 (HIGH)**\n\n## Principles\n\n- **OnPush**: Always use `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`. Components should only update when Inputs change or Signals fire.\n- **Deferrable Views**: Use `@defer` to lazy load heavy components/chunks below the fold.\n- **Images**: Use `NgOptimizedImage` (`ngSrc`) for LCP optimization.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Zoneless**: Prepare for Zoneless Angular by avoiding `Zone.runOutsideAngular` hacks. Use Signals.\n- **TrackBy**: Always provide a tracking function in loops (`@for (item of items; track item.id)`).\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **Functions in Template**: `{{ calculate() }}` causes re-evaluation on every change detection cycle. Use `computed()` signals or pure pipes.\n- **Heavy Constructors**: Keep constructors empty. Use `ngOnInit` or effects.\n\n## References\n\n- [Defer Usage](references/defer-usage.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:12:21.217Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized Angular performance capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 Angular 性能的前端代理。","ja":"Angular のパフォーマンスを最適化する必要があるフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Angular 성능을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de rendimiento de Angular optimizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de performances Angular optimisées.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die optimierte Angular-Leistungsmerkmale benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de desempenho otimizado do Angular.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, требующих оптимизированных возможностей Angular.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات أداء مُحسّنة من Angular."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize ChangeDetectionStrategy using OnPush, leverage deferrable views with @defer, and enhance LCP optimization with NgOptimizedImage, ensuring seamless zoneless interactions and efficient tracking with TrackBy.","zh":"赋予代理优化使用 OnPush 的 ChangeDetectionStrategy、利用 @defer 实现可延迟视图，并使用 NgOptimizedImage 提高 LCP 优化，从而确保无缝的无区域交互和使用 TrackBy 进行高效跟踪。","ja":"エージェントが OnPush を使用した ChangeDetectionStrategy を最適化し、@defer で遅延可能なビューを利用し、NgOptimizedImage で LCP 最適化を強化し、無区域のシームレスな相互作用と TrackBy での効率的な追跡を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 OnPush를 사용한 ChangeDetectionStrategy를 최적화하고, @defer로 지연 가능한 뷰를 활용하며, NgOptimizedImage로 LCP 최적화를 강화하여, 무영역의 무결점 상호 작용과 TrackBy를 통한 효율적인 추적을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar ChangeDetectionStrategy utilizando OnPush, a aprovechar vistas diferibles con @defer y a mejorar la optimización de LCP con NgOptimizedImage, garantizando interacciones sin zona y un seguimiento eficiente con TrackBy.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser ChangeDetectionStrategy en utilisant OnPush, de tirer parti de vues différables avec @defer et d''améliorer l''optimisation de LCP avec NgOptimizedImage, garantissant des interactions sans zone et un suivi efficace avec TrackBy.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ChangeDetectionStrategy mithilfe von OnPush zu optimieren, deferrable Views mit @defer zu nutzen und die LCP-Optimierung mit NgOptimizedImage zu verbessern, wodurch eine nahtlose Interaktion ohne Zonen und eine effiziente Nachverfolgung mit TrackBy gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizarem a estratégia de detecção de alterações usando OnPush, aproveitar vistas adiáveis com @defer e melhorar a otimização do LCP com NgOptimizedImage, garantindo interações sem problemas e rastreamento eficiente com TrackBy.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать стратегию обнаружения изменений с помощью OnPush, использовать отложенные представления с @defer и улучшить оптимизацию LCP с помощью NgOptimizedImage, обеспечивая бесперебойное взаимодействие зон и эффективный отслеживание с помощью TrackBy.","ar":"يُمَكِّن الوكلاء من تحسين استراتيجية اكتشاف التغيير باستخدام OnPush، واستخدام العروض المؤجلة مع @defer، وتحسين تحسين LCP باستخدام NgOptimizedImage، مما يضمن تفاعلات بدون مشاكل وتحديدًا فعالًا مع TrackBy."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing component updates with ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Lazy loading heavy components with @defer","Enhancing LCP optimization with NgOptimizedImage"],"zh":["使用 ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush 优化组件更新","使用 @defer 延迟加载重型组件","使用 NgOptimizedImage 增强 LCP 优化"],"ja":["ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush を使用してコンポーネントの更新を最適化する","@defer を使用して重いコンポーネントを遅延ロードする","NgOptimizedImage を使用して LCP の最適化を強化する"],"ko":["ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush를 사용하여 컴포넌트 업데이트를 최적화하는 것","@defer를 사용하여 무거운 컴포넌트를 지연 로딩하는 것","NgOptimizedImage를 사용하여 LCP 최적화를 강화하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar las actualizaciones de componentes con ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Carga diferida de componentes pesados con @defer","Mejorar la optimización de LCP con NgOptimizedImage"],"fr":["Optimiser les mises à jour de composants avec ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Chargement différé de composants lourds avec @defer","Améliorer l''optimisation de LCP avec NgOptimizedImage"],"de":["Optimieren von Komponenten-Updates mit ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Lazy-Laden von schweren Komponenten mit @defer","Verbessern der LCP-Optimierung mit NgOptimizedImage"],"pt":["Otimização de atualizações de componentes com ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Carregamento lento de componentes pesados com @defer","Melhoria da otimização do LCP com NgOptimizedImage"],"ru":["Оптимизация обновлений компонентов с помощью ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Ленивая загрузка тяжелых компонентов с помощью @defer","Улучшение оптимизации LCP с помощью NgOptimizedImage"],"ar":["تحسين تحديثات المكونات باستخدام ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","تحميل مكونات ثقيلة بطيئة مع @defer","تحسين تحسين LCP باستخدام NgOptimizedImage"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular framework","Zoneless Angular preparation necessary"],"zh":["需要 Angular 框架","需要无区域 Angular 准备"],"ja":["Angular フレームワークが必要","無区域の Angular 準備が必要"],"ko":["Angular 프레임워크가 필요","무영역 Angular 준비가 필요"],"es":["Requiere el marco de Angular","Preparación de Angular sin zona necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Angular","Préparation d''Angular sans zone nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt das Angular-Framework","Vorbereitung von Angular ohne Zone erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige o framework Angular","Preparação de Angular sem zona necessária"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка Angular","Необходимо подготовить зону Angular"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار Angular","التحضير المسبق لمنطقة Angular ضروري"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"430b6d4b302f7276424b89ed0b11a8b59e9fb9c672db17b69b40a700266a1775","qualityScore":45}');
