过优化 FlatList、渲染和其他因素来提高 React Native 应用的性能和用户体验。","ja":"React Native パフォーマンス最適化は、FlatList、レンダリング、他の要因を最適化することで React Native アプリのパフォーマンスとユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させることです。","ko":"React Native 성능 최적화는 FlatList, 렌더링 및 기타 요인을 최적화하여 React Native 앱의 성능과 사용자 경험을 향상시키는 것을 의미합니다.","es":"Aprende a optimizar el rendimiento de tus aplicaciones React Native con técnicas como la optimización de FlatList y el uso de useCallback","fr":"Découvrez comment optimiser les performances de vos applications React Native avec des techniques comme l''optimisation de FlatList et l''utilisation de useCal...","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Leistung Ihrer React Native-Anwendungen mit Techniken wie der Optimierung von FlatList und der Verwendung von useCallback optimieren","pt":"Otimização de desempenho do React Native para melhorar a experiência do usuário","ru":"Оптимизация производительности React Native для улучшения пользовательского опыта","ar":"تحسين أداء رياكت نيتيف لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["FlatList 优化","渲染优化","windowSize 调整","getItemLayout 提供","removeClippedSubviews 启用"],"ja":["FlatList 最適化","レンダリング最適化","windowSize 調整","getItemLayout 提供","removeClippedSubviews 有効化"],"ko":["FlatList 최적화","렌더링 최적화","windowSize 조정","getItemLayout 제공","removeClippedSubviews 활성화"],"es":["Optimización de FlatList","Uso de useCallback","Reducir el tamaño de la ventana","Limitar la cantidad de elementos renderizados","Uso de IDs únicos para los elementos","Evitar funciones anónimas"],"fr":["Optimisation de FlatList","Utilisation de useCallback","Réduction de la taille de la fenêtre","Limitation du nombre d''éléments rendus","Utilisation d''IDs uniques pour les éléments","Évitement des fonctions anonymes"],"de":["Optimierung von FlatList","Verwendung von useCallback","Reduzierung der Fenstergröße","Begrenzung der Anzahl der gerenderten Elemente","Verwendung eindeutiger IDs für die Elemente","Vermeidung von anonymen Funktionen"],"pt":["Otimização do FlatList","Uso de getItemLayout para itens de altura fixa","Ativação de removeClippedSubviews para Android","Limitação de maxToRenderPerBatch para melhorar o desempenho","Uso de keyExtractor com IDs únicos","Evitar funções anônimas no renderItem"],"ru":["Оптимизация FlatList","Использование getItemLayout для элементов с фиксированной высотой","Включение removeClippedSubviews для Android","Ограничение maxToRenderPerBatch для улучшения производительности","Использование keyExtractor с уникальными идентификаторами","Избегание анонимных функций в renderItem"],"ar":["تحسين قائمة.FlatList","استخدام getItemLayout للأصناف مع ارتفاع ثابت","تفعيل removeClippedSubviews لمنصة أندرويد","تحديد الحد الأقصى ل maxToRenderPerBatch لتحسين الأداء","استخدام keyExtractor مع معرفات فريدة","تجنب الدوال غير المسمى في renderItem"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native 性能优化","FlatList 优化","渲染优化","React Native 开发","移动应用性能优化"],"ja":["React Native パフォーマンス最適化","FlatList 最適化","レンダリング最適化","React Native 開発","モバイルアプリパフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["React Native 성능 최적화","FlatList 최적화","렌더링 최적화","React Native 개발","모바일 앱 성능 최적화"],"es":["React Native","Optimización de rendimiento","FlatList","useCallback","Desempeño de aplicaciones móviles","Eficiencia de aplicaciones","Técnicas de optimización","Programación de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["React Native","Optimisation des performances","FlatList","useCallback","Performances des applications mobiles","Efficacité des applications","Techniques d''optimisation","Programmation d''applications mobiles"],"de":["React Native","Leistungsoptimierung","FlatList","useCallback","Leistung von mobilen Anwendungen","Effizienz von Anwendungen","Optimierungstechniken","Mobile Anwendungsprogrammierung"],"pt":["React Native","Otimização de desempenho","FlatList","getItemLayout","removeClippedSubviews","maxToRenderPerBatch","keyExtractor","Desempenho de aplicativos","Experiência do usuário"],"ru":["React Native","Оптимизация производительности","FlatList","getItemLayout","removeClippedSubviews","maxToRenderPerBatch","keyExtractor","Производительность приложений","Пользовательский опыт"],"ar":["رياكت نيتيف","تحسين الأداء","قائمة.FlatList","getItemLayout","removeClippedSubviews","maxToRenderPerBatch","keyExtractor","أداء التطبيقات","تجربة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"fierzone","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"fierzone/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"React Native Performance","description":"Optimization strategies for smooth 60fps mobile apps.","bodyPreview":"# React Native Performance\n\n## **Priority: P0 (CRITICAL)**\n\n## FlatList Optimization\n\n- **windowSize**: Reduce to 5-10 for long lists (default 21).\n- **getItemLayout**: Provide for fixed-height items. Skips measurement.\n- **removeClippedSubviews**: Enable for Android (default true).\n- **maxToRenderPerBatch**: Limit to 5-10 items per frame.\n- **keyExtractor**: Use stable unique IDs, never index.\n- **Avoid Anonymous Functions**: Define `renderItem` outside component or use `useCallback`.\n\n## React","body":"# React Native Performance\n\n## **Priority: P0 (CRITICAL)**\n\n## FlatList Optimization\n\n- **windowSize**: Reduce to 5-10 for long lists (default 21).\n- **getItemLayout**: Provide for fixed-height items. Skips measurement.\n- **removeClippedSubviews**: Enable for Android (default true).\n- **maxToRenderPerBatch**: Limit to 5-10 items per frame.\n- **keyExtractor**: Use stable unique IDs, never index.\n- **Avoid Anonymous Functions**: Define `renderItem` outside component or use `useCallback`.\n\n## React Optimization\n\n- **React.memo**: Wrap presentational components to prevent re-renders.\n- **useMemo**: Cache expensive calculations.\n- **useCallback**: Stabilize function refs for child props.\n- **Avoid Inline Objects**: Extract to constants or `useMemo`.\n\n## Navigation\n\n- **Lazy Screens**: Use `lazy` prop for stack screens (enabled by default).\n- **Avoid Listeners**: Remove navigation event listeners in cleanup.\n\n## Images\n\n- **Image Caching**: Use `react-native-fast-image` for network images.\n- **Resize**: Provide `resizeMode` and fixed dimensions.\n- **Format**: Use WebP for smaller size.\n\n## Bundle Size\n\n- **Hermes**: Enable for faster startup (default in RN 0.70+).\n- **Tree Shaking**: Remove unused imports.\n- **ProGuard/R8**: Enable code shrinking on Android.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **No ScrollView for Large Lists**: Use FlatList.\n- **No Inline Styles**: Use `StyleSheet.create` (optimized).\n- **No console.log in Production**: Strip with babel plugin.\n\n## Reference & Examples\n\nSee [references/optimization-guide.md](references/optimization-guide.md) for FlatList configuration, memoization rules, and bundle analysis.\n\n## Related Topics\n\nreact/performance | common/performance-engineering\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:13:44.398Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Agents needing optimized React Native app performance.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 React Native 应用程序性能的移动代理。","ja":"React Native アプリのパフォーマンスを最適化する必要があるモバイル エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React Native 앱 성능을 최적화해야 하는 모바일 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Móviles que necesitan un rendimiento óptimo de la aplicación React Native.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents mobiles nécessitant des performances optimales de l''application React Native.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Agents, die ein optimiertes React Native-App-Performance benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Móveis que necessitam de desempenho otimizado de aplicativos React Native.","ru":"Идеально подходит для мобильных агентов, которым требуется оптимизированное производительность приложений React Native.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المحمول الذي يحتاج إلى أداء تطبيق React Native محسّن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Native performance by leveraging FlatList features like windowSize, getItemLayout, and removeClippedSubviews, while avoiding anonymous functions and utilizing stable unique IDs with keyExtractor.","zh":"通过利用 windowSize、getItemLayout 和 removeClippedSubviews 等 FlatList 功能，同时避免匿名函数并利用 keyExtractor 实现稳定的唯一 ID，从而使代理能够优化 React Native 性能。","ja":"windowSize、getItemLayout、removeClippedSubviews などの FlatList 機能を活用し、同時に匿名関数を避け、keyExtractor を使用して安定した一意の ID を実現することで、エージェントが React Native のパフォーマンスを最適化できるようにします。","ko":"windowSize, getItemLayout, removeClippedSubviews 등 FlatList 기능을 활용하고 동시에 익명 함수를 피하며 keyExtractor를 사용하여 안정적인 고유 ID를 구현함으로써 에이전트가 React Native 성능을 최적화할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar el rendimiento de React Native aprovechando las características de FlatList como windowSize, getItemLayout y removeClippedSubviews, mientras evitan las funciones anónimas y utilizan identificadores únicos estables con keyExtractor.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les performances de React Native en exploitant les fonctionnalités de FlatList comme windowSize, getItemLayout et removeClippedSubviews, tout en évitant les fonctions anonymes et en utilisant des ID uniques stables avec keyExtractor.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die React Native-Leistung zu optimieren, indem sie FlatList-Features wie windowSize, getItemLayout und removeClippedSubviews nutzen, während sie anonyme Funktionen vermeiden und stabile eindeutige IDs mit keyExtractor verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o desempenho do React Native utilizando recursos do FlatList como windowSize, getItemLayout e removeClippedSubviews, evitando funções anônimas e utilizando IDs únicos estáveis com keyExtractor.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать производительность React Native, используя функции FlatList, такие как windowSize, getItemLayout и removeClippedSubviews, избегая анонимных функций и используя стабильные уникальные идентификаторы с keyExtractor.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحسين أداء React Native من خلال استخدام ميزات FlatList مثل windowSize وgetItemLayout وremoveClippedSubviews، مع تجنّب الدوال المجهولة واستخدام معرفات فريدة مستقرة مع keyExtractor."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing long lists with windowSize and maxToRenderPerBatch","Improving Android performance with removeClippedSubviews","Enhancing rendering efficiency with getItemLayout and keyExtractor"],"zh":["使用 windowSize 和 maxToRenderPerBatch 优化长列表","使用 removeClippedSubviews 改善 Android 性能","使用 getItemLayout 和 keyExtractor 提高渲染效率"],"ja":["windowSize と maxToRenderPerBatch を使用して長いリストを最適化する","removeClippedSubviews を使用して Android のパフォーマンスを改善する","getItemLayout と keyExtractor を使用してレンダリングの効率を高める"],"ko":["windowSize와 maxToRenderPerBatch를 사용하여 긴 목록 최적화","removeClippedSubviews를 사용하여 안드로이드 성능 개선","getItemLayout와 keyExtractor를 사용하여 렌더링 효율성 향상"],"es":["Optimizar listas largas con windowSize y maxToRenderPerBatch","Mejorar el rendimiento de Android con removeClippedSubviews","Mejorar la eficiencia de renderizado con getItemLayout y keyExtractor"],"fr":["Optimiser les listes longues avec windowSize et maxToRenderPerBatch","Améliorer les performances Android avec removeClippedSubviews","Améliorer l''efficacité de rendu avec getItemLayout et keyExtractor"],"de":["Optimieren von langen Listen mit windowSize und maxToRenderPerBatch","Verbesserung der Android-Leistung mit removeClippedSubviews","Verbesserung der Rendering-Effizienz mit getItemLayout und keyExtractor"],"pt":["Otimizando listas longas com windowSize e maxToRenderPerBatch","Melhorando o desempenho do Android com removeClippedSubviews","Aumentando a eficiência de renderização com getItemLayout e keyExtractor"],"ru":["Оптимизация длинных списков с помощью windowSize и maxToRenderPerBatch","Улучшение производительности Android с помощью removeClippedSubviews","Повышение эффективности рендеринга с помощью getItemLayout и keyExtractor"],"ar":["تحسين القوائم الطويلة مع windowSize و maxToRenderPerBatch","تحسين أداء Android مع removeClippedSubviews","تحسين كفاءة العرض مع getItemLayout و keyExtractor"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Native environment","Limited to optimizing FlatList components","May require adjustments to existing component code"],"zh":["需要 React Native 环境","仅限优化 FlatList 组件","可能需要调整现有的组件代码"],"ja":["React Native 環境が必要","FlatList コンポーネントの最適化のみ","既存のコンポーネント コードの調整が必要になる場合あり"],"ko":["React Native 환경이 필요","FlatList 컴포넌트 최적화에만 국한","既存의 컴포넌트 코드 조정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere un entorno React Native","Limitado a la optimización de componentes FlatList","Puede requerir ajustes en el código de componentes existentes"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React Native","Limité à l''optimisation des composants FlatList","Peut nécessiter des ajustements dans le code de composants existants"],"de":["Erfordert eine React Native-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung von FlatList-Komponenten","Kann Anpassungen im bestehenden Komponenten-Code erfordern"],"pt":["Requer ambiente React Native","Limitado à otimização de componentes FlatList","Pode exigir ajustes no código de componente existente"],"ru":["Требуется среда React Native","Ограничен оптимизацией компонентов FlatList","Может потребовать корректировки существующего кода компонента"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة React Native","محدود بتحسين مكونات FlatList","قد يتطلب تعديلات في رمز المكون الموجود"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"06763d1c451303cb236d53be0bd99260296270d4ca621a6bf4387a1ca8ee469d","qualityScore":0}');
