onfiguration"],"de":["Anpassbare Komponenten","Integration mit Radix UI und Base UI","Kompatibilität mit Tailwind CSS","Best Practices für die Integration","Komponenten-Entdeckung","Installation und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Componentes personalizáveis","Integração fácil com Radix UI ou Base UI e Tailwind CSS","Melhores práticas para desenvolvedores","Descoberta e instalação de componentes","Customização de componentes"],"ru":["Настраиваемые компоненты","Легкая интеграция с Radix UI или Base UI и Tailwind CSS","Лучшие практики для разработчиков","Обнаружение и установка компонентов","Настройка компонентов"],"ar":["مكونات قابلة للتعديل","دمج سهل مع Radix UI أو Base UI و Tailwind CSS","أفضل الممارسات للمطورين","اكتشاف وتثبيت المكونات","مخصصة المكونات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","AI智能工具","组件集成","前端开发","React","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","AIエージェント","コンポーネント統合","フロントエンド開発","React","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","AI 에이전트","컴포넌트 통합","프론트엔드 개발","React","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"es":["shadcn-ui","integración de componentes","desarrollo web","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","mejores prácticas","personalización de componentes","herramientas de AI"],"fr":["shadcn-ui","intégration de composants","développement web","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","meilleures pratiques","personnalisation de composants","outils d''IA"],"de":["shadcn-ui","Integration von Komponenten","Webentwicklung","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","Best Practices","Anpassung von Komponenten","KI-Tools"],"pt":["shadcn-ui","componentes personalizáveis","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","desenvolvedores","integração de componentes","melhores práticas"],"ru":["shadcn-ui","настраиваемые компоненты","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","разработчики","интеграция компонентов","лучшие практики"],"ar":["shadcn-ui","مكونات قابلة للتعديل","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","مطورين","دمج المكونات","أفضل الممارسات"]}},"owner":"google-labs-code","repo":"stitch-skills","repoPath":"google-labs-code/stitch-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:52:28.983Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Expert guidance for integrating and building applications with shadcn/ui components, including component discovery, installation, customization, and best practices.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full owner","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full ownership**: Components live in your codebase, not node_modules\n- **Complete customization**: Modify styling, behavior, and structure freely, including choosing between Radix UI or Base UI primitives\n- **No version lock-in**: Update components selectively at your own pace\n- **Zero runtime overhead**: No library bundle, just the code you need\n\n## Component Discovery and Installation\n\n### 1. Browse Available Components\n\nUse the shadcn MCP tools to explore the component catalog and Registry Directory:\n- **List all components**: Use `list_components` to see the complete catalog\n- **Get component metadata**: Use `get_component_metadata` to understand props, dependencies, and usage\n- **View component demos**: Use `get_component_demo` to see implementation examples\n\n### 2. Component Installation\n\nThere are two approaches to adding components:\n\n**A. Direct Installation (Recommended)**\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add [component-name]\n```\n\nThis command:\n- Downloads the component source code (adapting to your config: Radix vs Base UI)\n- Installs required dependencies\n- Places files in `components/ui/`\n- Updates your `components.json` config\n\n**B. Manual Integration**\n1. Use `get_component` to retrieve the source code\n2. Create the file in `components/ui/[component-name].tsx`\n3. Install peer dependencies manually\n4. Adjust imports if needed\n\n### 3. Registry and Custom Registries\n\nIf working with a custom registry (defined in `components.json`) or exploring the Registry Directory:\n- Use `get_project_registries` to list available registries\n- Use `list_items_in_registries` to see registry-specific components\n- Use `view_items_in_registries` for detailed component information\n- Use `search_items_in_registries` to find specific components\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Initial Configuration\n\nFor **new projects**, use the `create` command to customize everything (style, fonts, component library):\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest create\n```\n\nFor **existing projects**, initialize configuration:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `components.json` with your configuration:\n- **style**: default, new-york (classic) OR choose new visual styles like Vega, Nova, Maia, Lyra, Mira\n- **baseColor**: slate, gray, zinc, neutral, stone\n- **cssVariables**: true/false for CSS variable usage\n- **tailwind config**: paths to Tailwind files\n- **aliases**: import path shortcuts\n- **rsc**: Use React Server Components (yes/no)\n- **rtl**: Enable RTL support (optional)\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\nshadcn/ui components require:\n- **React** (18+)\n- **Tailwind CSS** (3.0+)\n- **Primitives**: Radix UI OR Base UI (depending on your choice)\n- **class-variance-authority** (for variant styling)\n- **clsx** and **tailwind-merge** (for class composition)\n\n## Component Architecture\n\n### File Structure\n```\nsrc/\n├── components/\n│   ├── ui/              # shadcn components\n│   │   ├── button.tsx\n│   │   ├── card.tsx\n│   │   └── dialog.tsx\n│   └── [custom]/        # your composed components\n│       └── user-card.tsx\n├── lib/\n│   └── utils.ts         # cn() utility\n└── app/\n    └── page.tsx\n```\n\n### The `cn()` Utility\n\nAll shadcn components use the `cn()` helper for class merging:\n\n```typescript\nimport { clsx, type ClassValue } from \"clsx\"\nimport { twMerge } from \"tailwind-merge\"\n\nexport function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {\n  return twMerge(clsx(inputs))\n}\n```\n\nThis allows you to:\n- Override default styles without conflicts\n- Conditionally apply classes\n- Merge Tailwind classes intelligently\n\n## Customization Best Practices\n\n### 1. Theme Customization\n\nEdit your Tailwind config and CSS variables in `app/globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 221.2 83.2% 53.3%;\n    /* ... more variables */\n  }\n  \n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    /* ... dark mode overrides */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Component Variants\n\nUse `class-variance-authority` (cva) for variant logic:\n\n```typescript\nimport { cva } from \"class-variance-authority\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground\",\n        outline: \"border border-input\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Extending Components\n\nCreate wrapper components in `components/` (not `components/ui/`):\n\n```typescript\n// components/custom-button.tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\"\n\nexport function LoadingButton({ \n  loading, \n  children, \n  ...props \n}: ButtonProps & { loading?: boolean }) {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled={loading} {...props}>\n      {loading && <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />}\n      {children}\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Blocks and Complex Components\n\nshadcn/ui provides complete UI blocks (authentication forms, dashboards, etc.):\n\n1. **List available blocks**: Use `list_blocks` with optional category filter\n2. **Get block source**: Use `get_block` with the block name\n3. **Install blocks**: Many blocks include multiple component files\n\nBlocks are organized by category:\n- **calendar**: Calendar interfaces\n- **dashboard**: Dashboard layouts\n- **login**: Authentication flows\n- **sidebar**: Navigation sidebars\n- **products**: E-commerce components\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll shadcn/ui components are built on Radix UI primitives, ensuring:\n- **Keyboard navigation**: Full keyboard support out of the box\n- **Screen reader support**: Proper ARIA attributes\n- **Focus management**: Logical focus flow\n- **Disabled states**: Proper disabled and aria-disabled handling\n\nWhen customizing, maintain accessibility:\n- Keep ARIA attributes\n- Preserve keyboard handlers\n- Test with screen readers\n- Maintain focus indicators\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Form Building\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\n// Use with react-hook-form for validation\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\n```\n\n### Dialog/Modal Patterns\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n```\n\n### Data Display\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Import Errors\n- Check `components.json` for correct alias configuration\n- Verify `tsconfig.json` includes the `@` path alias:\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"compilerOptions\": {\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"@/*\": [\"./src/*\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n### Style Conflicts\n- Ensure Tailwind CSS is properly configured\n- Check that `globals.css` is imported in your root layout\n- Verify CSS variable names match between components and theme\n\n### Missing Dependencies\n- Run component installation via CLI to auto-install deps\n- Manually check `package.json` for required Radix UI packages\n- Use `get_component_metadata` to see dependency lists\n\n### Version Compatibility\n- shadcn/ui v4 requires React 18+ and Next.js 13+ (if using Next.js)\n- Some components require specific Radix UI versions\n- Check documentation for breaking changes between versions\n\n## Validation and Quality\n\nBefore committing components:\n1. **Type check**: Run `tsc --noEmit` to verify TypeScript\n2. **Lint**: Run your linter to catch style issues\n3. **Test accessibility**: Use tools like axe DevTools\n4. **Visual QA**: Test in light and dark modes\n5. **Responsive check**: Verify behavior at different breakpoints\n\n## Resources\n\nRefer to the following resource files for detailed guidance:\n- `resources/setup-guide.md` - Step-by-step project initialization\n- `resources/component-catalog.md` - Complete component reference\n- `resources/customization-guide.md` - Theming and variant patterns\n- `resources/migration-guide.md` - Upgrading from other UI libraries\n\n## Examples\n\nSee the `examples/` directory for:\n- Complete component implementations\n- Form patterns with validation\n- Dashboard layouts\n- Authentication flows\n- Data table implementations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-24T11:56:28.883Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing accessible and customizable UI components built with Radix UI, Base UI, and Tailwind CSS.","zh":"非常适合需要可访问和可定制的UI组件的前端代理，使用Radix UI、Base UI和Tailwind CSS构建。","ja":"Radix UI、Base UI、Tailwind CSSで構築されたアクセスしやすくカスタマイズ可能なUIコンポーネントを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Radix UI, Base UI 및 Tailwind CSS로 구축된 액세스하기 쉽고 사용자 지정 가능한 UI 구성 요소를 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan componentes de interfaz de usuario accesibles y personalizables creados con Radix UI, Base UI y Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur accessibles et personnalisables créés avec Radix UI, Base UI et Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die zugängliche und anpassbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten benötigen, die mit Radix UI, Base UI und Tailwind CSS erstellt wurden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis construídos com Radix UI, Base UI e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуются доступные и настраиваемые компоненты пользовательского интерфейса, построенные с помощью Radix UI, Base UI и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول والقابلة للتخصيص المصنوعة من Radix UI و Base UI و Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate and customize shadcn/ui components, following best practices for component discovery, installation, and customization, leveraging Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS for seamless UI development.","zh":"赋予代理集成和定制shadcn/ui组件的能力，遵循组件发现、安装和定制的最佳实践，利用Radix UI或Base UI和Tailwind CSS进行无缝的UI开发。","ja":"shadcn/uiコンポーネントを統合およびカスタマイズするエージェントを可能にし、コンポーネントの検出、インストール、カスタマイズのベストプラクティスに従い、Radix UIまたはBase UIとTailwind CSSを使用してシームレスなUI開発を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 shadcn/ui 구성 요소를 통합 및 사용자 지정할 수 있도록 하여 구성 요소 검색, 설치 및 사용자 지정의 최선의 방법을 따르며 Radix UI 또는 Base UI와 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 무결점의 UI 개발을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar y personalizar los componentes de shadcn/ui, siguiendo las mejores prácticas para el descubrimiento, la instalación y la personalización de componentes, aprovechando Radix UI o Base UI y Tailwind CSS para un desarrollo de interfaz de usuario sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer et de personnaliser les composants shadcn/ui, en suivant les meilleures pratiques pour la découverte, l''installation et la personnalisation des composants, en exploitant Radix UI ou Base UI et Tailwind CSS pour un développement d''interface utilisateur sans accroc.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, shadcn/ui-Komponenten zu integrieren und anzupassen, indem sie bewährte Verfahren für die Komponentenentdeckung, -installation und -anpassung befolgen und Radix UI oder Base UI und Tailwind CSS für eine reibungslose Benutzeroberflächenentwicklung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar e personalizar os componentes shadcn/ui, seguindo as melhores práticas para a descoberta, instalação e personalização de componentes, utilizando Radix UI ou Base UI e Tailwind CSS para um desenvolvimento de UI sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрировать и настраивать компоненты shadcn/ui, соблюдая лучшие практики для обнаружения, установки и настройки компонентов, используя Radix UI или Base UI и Tailwind CSS для бесперебойной разработки пользовательского интерфейса.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على دمج وتخصيص مكونات shadcn/ui، اتباعًا لأفضل الممارسات لاكتشاف المكونات وتثبيتها وتخصيصها، باستخدام Radix UI أو Base UI و Tailwind CSS من أجل تطوير واجهة مستخدم دون مشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Discovering and installing shadcn/ui components for application development","Customizing shadcn/ui components for tailored user experiences","Implementing accessible UI designs using shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS"],"zh":["发现和安装shadcn/ui组件进行应用程序开发","为定制用户体验而定制shadcn/ui组件","使用shadcn/ui和Tailwind CSS实现无障碍UI设计"],"ja":["アプリケーション開発のためのshadcn/uiコンポーネントの検出とインストール","カスタムユーザーエクスペリエンスのためのshadcn/uiコンポーネントのカスタマイズ","shadcn/uiとTailwind CSSを使用したアクセシブルUIデザインの実装"],"ko":["애플리케이션 개발을 위한 shadcn/ui 구성 요소의 검색 및 설치","사용자 지정 사용자 경험을 위한 shadcn/ui 구성 요소의 사용자 지정","shadcn/ui 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용한 액세스 가능한 UI 디자인 구현"],"es":["Descubrir e instalar componentes de shadcn/ui para el desarrollo de aplicaciones","Personalizar componentes de shadcn/ui para experiencias de usuario personalizadas","Implementar diseños de interfaz de usuario accesibles utilizando shadcn/ui y Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Découvrir et installer des composants shadcn/ui pour le développement d''applications","Personnaliser des composants shadcn/ui pour des expériences utilisateur sur mesure","Mettre en œuvre des conceptions d''interface utilisateur accessibles en utilisant shadcn/ui et Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Entdecken und Installieren von shadcn/ui-Komponenten für die Anwendungsentwicklung","Anpassen von shadcn/ui-Komponenten für maßgeschneiderte Benutzererfahrungen","Umsetzen von zugänglichen Benutzeroberflächendesigns mit shadcn/ui und Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["Descobrir e instalar componentes shadcn/ui para desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Personalizar componentes shadcn/ui para experiências de usuário personalizadas","Implementar projetos de UI acessíveis usando shadcn/ui e Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Обнаружение и установка компонентов shadcn/ui для разработки приложений","Настройка компонентов shadcn/ui для индивидуальных пользовательских опытов","Реализация доступных проектов пользовательского интерфейса с помощью shadcn/ui и Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["اكتشاف وتثبيت مكونات shadcn/ui لتطوير التطبيقات","تخصيص مكونات shadcn/ui لتجارب المستخدم المخصصة","تنفيذ تصاميم واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول باستخدام shadcn/ui و Tailwind CSS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Radix UI, Base UI, or Tailwind CSS","Not a traditional component library, but rather a collection of reusable components"],"zh":["需要Radix UI、Base UI或Tailwind CSS的知识","不是传统的组件库，而是一个可重用的组件集合"],"ja":["Radix UI、Base UI、またはTailwind CSSの知識が必要","従来のコンポーネントライブラリではなく、再利用可能なコンポーネントのコレクション"],"ko":["Radix UI, Base UI 또는 Tailwind CSS에 대한 지식이 필요","전통적인 구성 요소 라이브러리가 아니라 재사용 가능한 구성 요소의 컬렉션"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Radix UI, Base UI o Tailwind CSS","No es una biblioteca de componentes tradicional, sino más bien una colección de componentes reutilizables"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en Radix UI, Base UI ou Tailwind CSS","Ce n''est pas une bibliothèque de composants traditionnelle, mais plutôt une collection de composants réutilisables"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Radix UI, Base UI oder Tailwind CSS","Keine herkömmliche Komponentenbibliothek, sondern eher eine Sammlung von wiederverwendbaren Komponenten"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Radix UI, Base UI ou Tailwind CSS","Não é uma biblioteca de componentes tradicional, mas sim uma coleção de componentes reutilizáveis"],"ru":["Требует знания Radix UI, Base UI или Tailwind CSS","Не является традиционной библиотекой компонентов, а rather коллекцией многократно используемых компонентов"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Radix UI و Base UI و Tailwind CSS","ليست مكتبة مكونات تقليدية، بل مجموعة من المكونات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2ddfe599ac2ba631ca019f7b6e37ee5df9cd34f83fc016f6ea9d4ba5bbfa0304","qualityScore":100}');
