de codage C++ basées sur C++ Core","Sécurité des types et des ressources","Immutabilité et clarté","Compatibilité avec C++17/20/23","Amélioration de la productivité"],"de":["C++-Codierungsstandards basierend auf C++ Core","Sicherheit von Typen und Ressourcen","Unveränderlichkeit und Klarheit","Kompatibilität mit C++17/20/23","Erhöhung der Produktivität"],"pt":["Padronização de código com base nas Diretrizes Centrais de C++","Garantia de práticas modernas e seguras","Otimização do desempenho do código","Melhoria da legibilidade do código","Redução de erros e bugs"],"ru":["Стандартизация кода на основе Руководства по ядру C++","Обеспечение современных и безопасных практик","Оптимизация производительности кода","Улучшение читаемости кода","Сокращение ошибок и багов"],"ar":["تحقيق معايير البرمجة وفقًا لدليل سي بلس الأساسي","ضمان الممارسات الحديثة والأمنة","تحسين أداء البرمجيات","تحسين قراءة البرمجيات","تقليل الأخطاء والعيوب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["C++编码标准","AI智能工具","C++ Core Guidelines","代码质量","代码安全","C++17","C++20","C++23"],"ja":["C++コーディングスタンダード","AIエージェント","C++ Core Guidelines","コード品質","コード安全","C++17","C++20","C++23"],"ko":["C++ 코딩 표준","AI 에이전트","C++ Core Guidelines","코드 품질","코드 안전","C++17","C++20","C++23"],"es":["estándares de codificación C++","Agentes de IA","C++ Core","seguridad de tipos","inmutabilidad","claridad","productividad","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["normes de codage C++","Agents IA","C++ Core","sécurité des types","immutabilité","clarté","productivité","développement de logiciels"],"de":["C++-Codierungsstandards","KI-Agenten","C++ Core","Sicherheit von Typen","Unveränderlichkeit","Klarheit","Produktivität","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para c++","padronização de código","diretrizes centrais de c++","desenvolvimento de software","programação c++","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["ии агенты для c++","стандартизация кода","руководство по ядру c++","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование на c++","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للسي بلس","معايير البرمجة","دليل سي بلس الأساسي","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة سي بلس","تحسين الأداء"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing to enforce modern C++ coding standards and best practices.","zh":"非常适合需要强制执行现代C++编码标准和最佳实践的代码审查代理。","ja":"モダンなC++コーディングスタンダードとベストプラクティスを適用する必要があるコードレビューエージェントに最適です。","ko":"현대 C++ 코딩 표준 및 모범 사례를 적용해야 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan hacer cumplir los estándares y las mejores prácticas de codificación C++ modernas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de revue de code qui ont besoin de faire respecter les normes et les meilleures pratiques de codage C++ modernes.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die moderne C++-Codierungsstandards und -best Practices durchsetzen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam aplicar padrões e boas práticas de codificação C++ modernas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодового обзора, которым необходимо обеспечить соблюдение современных стандартов и лучших практик кодирования на C++.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى فرض معايير وافتراضات برمجة سي++ الحديثة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce type safety, resource safety, immutability, and clarity in C++ codebases using the C++ Core Guidelines, ensuring idiomatic and safe coding practices for C++17, C++20, and C++23.","zh":"赋予代理人使用C++ Core Guidelines在C++代码库中执行类型安全、资源安全、不可变性和清晰度，确保C++17、C++20和C++23的惯用和安全的编码实践。","ja":"C++ Core Guidelinesを使用して、C++17、C++20、C++23の慣用的な安全なコーディング実践を確保するために、C++コードベースでタイプセーフティ、リソースセーフティ、イミュータビリティ、クリアネスを適用するエージェントを可能にします。","ko":"C++ Core Guidelines를 사용하여 C++17, C++20, C++23의 관용적이고 안전한 코딩 관행을 보장하기 위해 C++ 코드베이스에서 유형 안전성, 리소스 안전성, 불변성 및 명확성을 적용할 수 있는 에이전트를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir la seguridad de tipos, la seguridad de recursos, la inmutabilidad y la claridad en las bases de código C++ utilizando las C++ Core Guidelines, garantizando prácticas de codificación idiomáticas y seguras para C++17, C++20 y C++23.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter la sécurité des types, la sécurité des ressources, l''immuabilité et la clarté dans les bases de code C++ en utilisant les C++ Core Guidelines, garantissant des pratiques de codage idiomatiques et sécurisées pour C++17, C++20 et C++23.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Typsicherheit, Ressourcensicherheit, Unveränderlichkeit und Klarheit in C++-Codebasen mithilfe der C++ Core Guidelines durchzusetzen, um idiomatische und sichere Codierungspraktiken für C++17, C++20 und C++23 sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar segurança de tipo, segurança de recursos, imutabilidade e clareza em bases de código C++ usando as Diretrizes Centrais C++, garantindo práticas de codificação idiomáticas e seguras para C++17, C++20 e C++23.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить безопасность типов, безопасность ресурсов, неизменность и ясность в базах кода C++ с помощью Руководящих принципов ядра C++, гарантируя идиоматичные и безопасные практики кодирования для C++17, C++20 и C++23.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تطبيق سلامة النوع و سلامة المصدر و غير القابلية للتغيير و الوضوح في قواعد الكود سي++ باستخدام إرشادات النواة سي++، مما يضمن ممارسات برمجة محدثة وآمنة لسي++17 و سي++20 و سي++23."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing consistent coding style across large C++ projects","Reviewing and refactoring existing C++ code for modern standards","Generating C++ code snippets that adhere to the C++ Core Guidelines","Making informed architectural decisions in C++ projects"],"zh":["在大型C++项目中执行一致的编码样式","审查和重构现有的C++代码以满足现代标准","生成符合C++ Core Guidelines的C++代码片段","在C++项目中做出明智的架构决策"],"ja":["大規模なC++プロジェクト全体で一貫したコーディングスタイルを適用する","既存のC++コードをレビューしてリファクタリングし、モダンな基準に適合させる","C++ Core Guidelinesに準拠したC++コードスニペットを生成する","C++プロジェクトで情報に基づいたアーキテクチャ上の決定を下す"],"ko":["대형 C++ 프로젝트에서 일관된 코딩 스타일을 적용","기존 C++ 코드를 검토 및 리팩토링하여 현대의 표준을 충족","C++ Core Guidelines를 준수하는 C++ 코드 조각 생성","C++ 프로젝트에서 정보에 기반한 아키텍처 결정"],"es":["Hacer cumplir un estilo de codificación coherente en grandes proyectos C++","Revisar y refactorizar el código C++ existente para los estándares modernos","Generar fragmentos de código C++ que se adhieran a las C++ Core Guidelines","Tomar decisiones arquitectónicas informadas en proyectos C++"],"fr":["Faire respecter un style de codage cohérent dans les grands projets C++","Réviser et refactoriser le code C++ existant pour les normes modernes","Générer des extraits de code C++ qui se conforment aux C++ Core Guidelines","Prendre des décisions architecturales éclairées dans les projets C++"],"de":["Durchsetzen eines konsistenten Codierungsstils in großen C++-Projekten","Überprüfen und Refaktorisieren des vorhandenen C++-Codes für moderne Standards","Generieren von C++-Code-Snippets, die den C++ Core Guidelines entsprechen","Treffen von informierten architektonischen Entscheidungen in C++-Projekten"],"pt":["Aplicar um estilo de codificação consistente em projetos C++ grandes","Revisar e reestruturar o código C++ existente para padrões modernos","Gerar trechos de código C++ que aderem às Diretrizes Centrais C++","Tomar decisões arquiteturais informadas em projetos C++"],"ru":["Обеспечить последовательный стиль кодирования в крупных проектах на C++","Просмотреть и переработать существующий код C++ для современных стандартов","Генерировать фрагменты кода C++, соответствующие Руководящим принципам ядра C++","Принимать обоснованные архитектурные решения в проектах на C++"],"ar":["تطبيق نمط ترميز متسق عبر مشاريع سي++ الكبيرة","مراجعة و إعادة هيكلة الكود سي++ الحالي لتحقيق المعايير الحديثة","توليد شفرات الكود سي++ التي تتوافق مع إرشادات النواة سي++","اتخاذ قرارات معمارية مدروسة في مشاريع سي++"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of C++ programming language","Limited to C++17, C++20, and C++23 standards"],"zh":["需要C++编程语言知识","仅限C++17、C++20和C++23标准"],"ja":["C++プログラミング言語の知識が必要","C++17、C++20、C++23の基準のみ"],"ko":["C++ 프로그래밍 언어 지식 필요","C++17, C++20, C++23 표준만 해당"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del lenguaje de programación C++","Limitado a los estándares C++17, C++20 y C++23"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en langage de programmation C++","Limité aux normes C++17, C++20 et C++23"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der C++-Programmiersprache","Begrenzt auf die Standards C++17, C++20 und C++23"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da linguagem de programação C++","Limitado aos padrões C++17, C++20 e C++23"],"ru":["Требует знания языка программирования C++","Ограничен стандартами C++17, C++20 и C++23"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة لغة البرمجة سي++","محدود بمعايير سي++17 و سي++20 و سي++23"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ab975af3f2aac71b3c923575db8d8bb529700535ee6be5ffb0421875899bce7d","repoEtag":"W/\"364f268e25511efbc6f9c2152da6805d934c8ccbaa49ea479a3da0f27c55af07\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/cpp-testing', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'cpp-testing', 50960, 6308, 100, '2026-02-24T12:02:48Z', '2026-02-24T12:04:36.928Z', 'c76663b2af0b002a2fcd99ad98bc929d04fd460de8cafa464152d00724953ed1', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/cpp-testing","name":"cpp-testing","description":{"zh":"C++测试AI工具是用于提高C++测试效率的工具，支持GoogleTest/CTest，用于诊断失败或不稳定的测试","ja":"C++テスト用AIエージェントは、C++のテスト効率を高めるためのツールです。GoogleTest/CTestを使用して、失敗または不安定なテストを診断します","ko":"C++ 테스트를 위한 AI 에이전트는 C++ 테스트 효율성을 높이는 도구로, GoogleTest/CTest를 사용하여 실패 또는 불안정한 테스트를 진단합니다","es":"Nuestro agente de pruebas de C++ utiliza GoogleTest y CMake para mejorar la eficiencia de tus pruebas","fr":"Notre agent de test C++ utilise GoogleTest et CMake pour améliorer l''efficacité de vos tests","de":"Unser C++-Test-Agent verwendet GoogleTest und CMake, um die Effizienz Ihrer Tests zu verbessern","pt":"O skill de teste C++ é uma ferramenta para melhorar a produtividade dos desenvolvedores, incluindo configuração de GoogleTest e CMake","ru":"Навык тестирования C++ - это инструмент для улучшения производительности разработчиков, включая настройку GoogleTest и CMake","ar":"مهارة اختبار سي++ هي أداة لتحسين الإنتاجية للمطورين، بما في ذلك تكوين GoogleTest و CMake","en":"Use only when writing/updating/fixing C++ tests, configuring GoogleTest/CTest, diagnosing failing or flaky tests, or adding coverage/sanitizers."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":50960,"forks":6308,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:48Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"cpp-testing","description":"Use only when writing/updating/fixing C++ tests, configuring GoogleTest/CTest, diagnosing failing or flaky tests, or adding coverage/sanitizers.","bodyPreview":"# C++ Testing (Agent Skill)\n\nAgent-focused testing workflow for modern C++ (C++17/20) using GoogleTest/GoogleMock with CMake/CTest.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Writing new C++ tests or fixing existing tests\n- Designing unit/integration test coverage for C++ components\n- Adding test coverage, CI gating, or regression protection\n- Configuring CMake/CTest workflows for consistent execution\n- Investigating test failures or flaky behavior\n- Enabling sanitizers for memory/race diagnostics\n\n### When NOT to Use","body":"# C++ Testing (Agent Skill)\n\nAgent-focused testing workflow for modern C++ (C++17/20) using GoogleTest/GoogleMock with CMake/CTest.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Writing new C++ tests or fixing existing tests\n- Designing unit/integration test coverage for C++ components\n- Adding test coverage, CI gating, or regression protection\n- Configuring CMake/CTest workflows for consistent execution\n- Investigating test failures or flaky behavior\n- Enabling sanitizers for memory/race diagnostics\n\n### When NOT to Use\n\n- Implementing new product features without test changes\n- Large-scale refactors unrelated to test coverage or failures\n- Performance tuning without test regressions to validate\n- Non-C++ projects or non-test tasks\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n- **TDD loop**: red → green → refactor (tests first, minimal fix, then cleanups).\n- **Isolation**: prefer dependency injection and fakes over global state.\n- **Test layout**: `tests/unit`, `tests/integration`, `tests/testdata`.\n- **Mocks vs fakes**: mock for interactions, fake for stateful behavior.\n- **CTest discovery**: use `gtest_discover_tests()` for stable test discovery.\n- **CI signal**: run subset first, then full suite with `--output-on-failure`.\n\n## TDD Workflow\n\nFollow the RED → GREEN → REFACTOR loop:\n\n1. **RED**: write a failing test that captures the new behavior\n2. **GREEN**: implement the smallest change to pass\n3. **REFACTOR**: clean up while tests stay green\n\n```cpp\n// tests/add_test.cpp\n#include <gtest/gtest.h>\n\nint Add(int a, int b); // Provided by production code.\n\nTEST(AddTest, AddsTwoNumbers) { // RED\n  EXPECT_EQ(Add(2, 3), 5);\n}\n\n// src/add.cpp\nint Add(int a, int b) { // GREEN\n  return a + b;\n}\n\n// REFACTOR: simplify/rename once tests pass\n```\n\n## Code Examples\n\n### Basic Unit Test (gtest)\n\n```cpp\n// tests/calculator_test.cpp\n#include <gtest/gtest.h>\n\nint Add(int a, int b); // Provided by production code.\n\nTEST(CalculatorTest, AddsTwoNumbers) {\n    EXPECT_EQ(Add(2, 3), 5);\n}\n```\n\n### Fixture (gtest)\n\n```cpp\n// tests/user_store_test.cpp\n// Pseudocode stub: replace UserStore/User with project types.\n#include <gtest/gtest.h>\n#include <memory>\n#include <optional>\n#include <string>\n\nstruct User { std::string name; };\nclass UserStore {\npublic:\n    explicit UserStore(std::string /*path*/) {}\n    void Seed(std::initializer_list<User> /*users*/) {}\n    std::optional<User> Find(const std::string &/*name*/) { return User{\"alice\"}; }\n};\n\nclass UserStoreTest : public ::testing::Test {\nprotected:\n    void SetUp() override {\n        store = std::make_unique<UserStore>(\":memory:\");\n        store->Seed({{\"alice\"}, {\"bob\"}});\n    }\n\n    std::unique_ptr<UserStore> store;\n};\n\nTEST_F(UserStoreTest, FindsExistingUser) {\n    auto user = store->Find(\"alice\");\n    ASSERT_TRUE(user.has_value());\n    EXPECT_EQ(user->name, \"alice\");\n}\n```\n\n### Mock (gmock)\n\n```cpp\n// tests/notifier_test.cpp\n#include <gmock/gmock.h>\n#include <gtest/gtest.h>\n#include <string>\n\nclass Notifier {\npublic:\n    virtual ~Notifier() = default;\n    virtual void Send(const std::string &message) = 0;\n};\n\nclass MockNotifier : public Notifier {\npublic:\n    MOCK_METHOD(void, Send, (const std::string &message), (override));\n};\n\nclass Service {\npublic:\n    explicit Service(Notifier &notifier) : notifier_(notifier) {}\n    void Publish(const std::string &message) { notifier_.Send(message); }\n\nprivate:\n    Notifier &notifier_;\n};\n\nTEST(ServiceTest, SendsNotifications) {\n    MockNotifier notifier;\n    Service service(notifier);\n\n    EXPECT_CALL(notifier, Send(\"hello\")).Times(1);\n    service.Publish(\"hello\");\n}\n```\n\n### CMake/CTest Quickstart\n\n```cmake\n# CMakeLists.txt (excerpt)\ncmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.20)\nproject(example LANGUAGES CXX)\n\nset(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 20)\nset(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD_REQUIRED ON)\n\ninclude(FetchContent)\n# Prefer project-locked versions. If using a tag, use a pinned version per project policy.\nset(GTEST_VERSION v1.17.0) # Adjust to project policy.\nFetchContent_Declare(\n  googletest\n  URL https://github.com/google/googletest/archive/refs/tags/${GTEST_VERSION}.zip\n)\nFetchContent_MakeAvailable(googletest)\n\nadd_executable(example_tests\n  tests/calculator_test.cpp\n  src/calculator.cpp\n)\ntarget_link_libraries(example_tests GTest::gtest GTest::gmock GTest::gtest_main)\n\nenable_testing()\ninclude(GoogleTest)\ngtest_discover_tests(example_tests)\n```\n\n```bash\ncmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug\ncmake --build build -j\nctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure\n```\n\n## Running Tests\n\n```bash\nctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure\nctest --test-dir build -R ClampTest\nctest --test-dir build -R \"UserStoreTest.*\" --output-on-failure\n```\n\n```bash\n./build/example_tests --gtest_filter=ClampTest.*\n./build/example_tests --gtest_filter=UserStoreTest.FindsExistingUser\n```\n\n## Debugging Failures\n\n1. Re-run the single failing test with gtest filter.\n2. Add scoped logging around the failing assertion.\n3. Re-run with sanitizers enabled.\n4. Expand to full suite once the root cause is fixed.\n\n## Coverage\n\nPrefer target-level settings instead of global flags.\n\n```cmake\noption(ENABLE_COVERAGE \"Enable coverage flags\" OFF)\n\nif(ENABLE_COVERAGE)\n  if(CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_ID MATCHES \"GNU\")\n    target_compile_options(example_tests PRIVATE --coverage)\n    target_link_options(example_tests PRIVATE --coverage)\n  elseif(CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_ID MATCHES \"Clang\")\n    target_compile_options(example_tests PRIVATE -fprofile-instr-generate -fcoverage-mapping)\n    target_link_options(example_tests PRIVATE -fprofile-instr-generate)\n  endif()\nendif()\n```\n\nGCC + gcov + lcov:\n\n```bash\ncmake -S . -B build-cov -DENABLE_COVERAGE=ON\ncmake --build build-cov -j\nctest --test-dir build-cov\nlcov --capture --directory build-cov --output-file coverage.info\nlcov --remove coverage.info ''/usr/*'' --output-file coverage.info\ngenhtml coverage.info --output-directory coverage\n```\n\nClang + llvm-cov:\n\n```bash\ncmake -S . -B build-llvm -DENABLE_COVERAGE=ON -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=clang++\ncmake --build build-llvm -j\nLLVM_PROFILE_FILE=\"build-llvm/default.profraw\" ctest --test-dir build-llvm\nllvm-profdata merge -sparse build-llvm/default.profraw -o build-llvm/default.profdata\nllvm-cov report build-llvm/example_tests -instr-profile=build-llvm/default.profdata\n```\n\n## Sanitizers\n\n```cmake\noption(ENABLE_ASAN \"Enable AddressSanitizer\" OFF)\noption(ENABLE_UBSAN \"Enable UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer\" OFF)\noption(ENABLE_TSAN \"Enable ThreadSanitizer\" OFF)\n\nif(ENABLE_ASAN)\n  add_compile_options(-fsanitize=address -fno-omit-frame-pointer)\n  add_link_options(-fsanitize=address)\nendif()\nif(ENABLE_UBSAN)\n  add_compile_options(-fsanitize=undefined -fno-omit-frame-pointer)\n  add_link_options(-fsanitize=undefined)\nendif()\nif(ENABLE_TSAN)\n  add_compile_options(-fsanitize=thread)\n  add_link_options(-fsanitize=thread)\nendif()\n```\n\n## Flaky Tests Guardrails\n\n- Never use `sleep` for synchronization; use condition variables or latches.\n- Make temp directories unique per test and always clean them.\n- Avoid real time, network, or filesystem dependencies in unit tests.\n- Use deterministic seeds for randomized inputs.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### DO\n\n- Keep tests deterministic and isolated\n- Prefer dependency injection over globals\n- Use `ASSERT_*` for preconditions, `EXPECT_*` for multiple checks\n- Separate unit vs integration tests in CTest labels or directories\n- Run sanitizers in CI for memory and race detection\n\n### DON''T\n\n- Don''t depend on real time or network in unit tests\n- Don''t use sleeps as synchronization when a condition variable can be used\n- Don''t over-mock simple value objects\n- Don''t use brittle string matching for non-critical logs\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Using fixed temp paths** → Generate unique temp directories per test and clean them.\n- **Relying on wall clock time** → Inject a clock or use fake time sources.\n- **Flaky concurrency tests** → Use condition variables/latches and bounded waits.\n- **Hidden global state** → Reset global state in fixtures or remove globals.\n- **Over-mocking** → Prefer fakes for stateful behavior and only mock interactions.\n- **Missing sanitizer runs** → Add ASan/UBSan/TSan builds in CI.\n- **Coverage on debug-only builds** → Ensure coverage targets use consistent flags.\n\n## Optional Appendix: Fuzzing / Property Testing\n\nOnly use if the project already supports LLVM/libFuzzer or a property-testing library.\n\n- **libFuzzer**: best for pure functions with minimal I/O.\n- **RapidCheck**: property-based tests to validate invariants.\n\nMinimal libFuzzer harness (pseudocode: replace ParseConfig):\n\n```cpp\n#include <cstddef>\n#include <cstdint>\n#include <string>\n\nextern \"C\" int LLVMFuzzerTestOneInput(const uint8_t *data, size_t size) {\n    std::string input(reinterpret_cast<const char *>(data), size);\n    // ParseConfig(input); // project function\n    return 0;\n}\n```\n\n## Alternatives to GoogleTest\n\n- **Catch2**: header-only, expressive matchers\n- **doctest**: lightweight, minimal compile overhead\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:04:36.928Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"C++测试AI工具","ja":"C++テスト用AIエージェント","ko":"C++ 테스트를 위한 AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de Pruebas de C++ con Agentes de IA","fr":"Outils de Test C++ avec Agents IA","de":"C++-Test-Tools mit KI-Agenten","pt":"Ferramentas de Teste C++ com Agentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты для тестирования C++","ar":"أدوات اختبار سي++ مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"cpp-testing"},"description":{"zh":"C++测试AI工具是用于提高C++测试效率的工具，支持GoogleTest/CTest，用于诊断失败或不稳定的测试","ja":"C++テスト用AIエージェントは、C++のテスト効率を高めるためのツールです。GoogleTest/CTestを使用して、失敗または不安定なテストを診断します","ko":"C++ 테스트를 위한 AI 에이전트는 C++ 테스트 효율성을 높이는 도구로, GoogleTest/CTest를 사용하여 실패 또는 불안정한 테스트를 진단합니다","es":"Nuestro agente de pruebas de C++ utiliza GoogleTest y CMake para mejorar la eficiencia de tus pruebas","fr":"Notre agent de test C++ utilise GoogleTest et CMake pour améliorer l''efficacité de vos tests","de":"Unser C++-Test-Agent verwendet GoogleTest und CMake, um die Effizienz Ihrer Tests zu verbessern","pt":"O skill de teste C++ é uma ferramenta para melhorar a produtividade dos desenvolvedores, incluindo configuração de GoogleTest e CMake","ru":"Навык тестирования C++ - это инструмент для улучшения производительности разработчиков, включая настройку GoogleTest и CMake","ar":"مهارة اختبار سي++ هي أداة لتحسين الإنتاجية للمطورين، بما في ذلك تكوين GoogleTest و CMake","en":"Use only when writing/updating/fixing C++ tests, configuring GoogleTest/CTest, diagnosing failing or flaky tests, or adding coverage/sanitizers."},"definition":{"en":"Use only when writing/updating/fixing C++ tests, configuring GoogleTest/CTest, diagnosing failing or flaky tests, or adding coverage/sanitizers."},"features":{"zh":["支持GoogleTest/CTest","诊断失败或不稳定的测试","提高测试效率","支持C++17/20","集成CMake/CTest工作流"],"ja":["GoogleTest/CTestをサポート","失敗または不安定なテストを診断","テスト効率を高める","C++17/20をサポート","CMake/CTestワークフローを統合"],"ko":["GoogleTest/CTest 지원","실패 또는 불안정한 테스트 진단","테스트 효율성 높이기","C++17/20 지원","CMake/CTest 워크플로 통합"],"es":["Pruebas unitarias e integradas con GoogleTest","Configuración de CMake para una ejecución consistente","Cobertura de pruebas y prot