uration settings","zh":"赋予代理设计RESTful API的能力，使用Django REST Framework，实施ORM最佳实践，并利用缓存、信号和中间件来构建生产级的Django应用，利用Django的项目结构和配置设置","ja":"エージェントがRESTful APIを設計する機能を与え、Django REST Frameworkを使用し、ORMのベストプラクティスを実施し、キャッシュ、シグナル、ミドルウェアを利用して本番レベルのDjangoアプリケーションを構築する、Djangoのプロジェクト構造と設定を利用","ko":"에이전트가 RESTful API를 설계할 수 있는 기능을 부여하고 Django REST Framework를 사용하여 ORM의 최적의 관행을 구현하고 캐싱, 신호 및 미들웨어를 활용하여 프로덕션급 Django 애플리케이션을 구축하며 Django의 프로젝트 구조 및 설정을 활용","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar APIs RESTful con Django REST Framework, implementar las mejores prácticas de ORM, y aprovechar el caché, las señales y el middleware para aplicaciones Django de nivel de producción, utilizando la estructura de proyecto y la configuración de Django","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des API RESTful avec Django REST Framework, de mettre en œuvre les meilleures pratiques de ORM, et d''utiliser le cache, les signaux et le middleware pour des applications Django de production, en utilisant la structure de projet et les paramètres de configuration de Django","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, RESTful-APIs mit Django REST Framework zu entwerfen, ORM-Best-Practices umzusetzen und Caching, Signale und Middleware für produktionsreife Django-Anwendungen zu nutzen, unter Verwendung der Projektstruktur und Konfigurationseinstellungen von Django","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar APIs RESTful com Django REST Framework, implementar as melhores práticas de ORM, e aproveitar o cache, sinais e middleware para aplicações Django de produção, utilizando a estrutura do projeto e as configurações do Django","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать RESTful API с помощью Django REST Framework, реализовывать лучшие практики ORM, а также использовать кэш, сигналы и middleware для приложений Django уровня производства, используя структуру проекта и настройки Django","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تصميم APIs RESTful باستخدام Django REST Framework، وتنفيذ أفضل الممارسات لبروتوكول ORM، وتحقيق التخزين المؤقت والإشارات والبرامج الوسيطة لتحقيق تطبيقات Django من درجة الإنتاج، باستخدام بنية المشروع وإعدادات Django"},"useCases":{"en":["Building scalable Django web applications","Designing and implementing Django REST Framework APIs","Optimizing Django project structure and configuration for production environments"],"zh":["构建可扩展的Django Web应用程序","设计和实现Django REST Framework API","优化Django项目结构和配置以适应生产环境"],"ja":["拡張可能なDjango Webアプリケーションの構築","Django REST Framework APIの設計と実装","本番環境向けのDjangoプロジェクト構造と設定の最適化"],"ko":["확장 가능한 Django 웹 애플리케이션 구축","Django REST Framework API 설계 및 구현","프로덕션 환경을 위한 Django 프로젝트 구조 및 설정 최적화"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones web Django escalables","Diseñar e implementar APIs Django REST Framework","Optimizar la estructura y configuración del proyecto Django para entornos de producción"],"fr":["Construire des applications Web Django évolutives","Concevoir et mettre en œuvre des API Django REST Framework","Optimiser la structure et la configuration du projet Django pour les environnements de production"],"de":["Skalierbare Django-Webanwendungen erstellen","Django-REST-Framework-APIs entwerfen und implementieren","Django-Projektstruktur und -konfiguration für Produktionsumgebungen optimieren"],"pt":["Construir aplicações web Django escaláveis","Projetar e implementar APIs Django REST Framework","Otimizar a estrutura do projeto e a configuração Django para ambientes de produção"],"ru":["Строить масштабируемые веб-приложения Django","Проектировать и реализовывать API Django REST Framework","Оптимизировать структуру проекта и настройки Django для производственных сред"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات الويب Django القابلة للتحجيم","تصميم وتنفيذ APIs Django REST Framework","تحسين هيكل المشروع وإعدادات Django للأماكن الإنتاجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python and Django installation","Django-specific, may not be compatible with other frameworks"],"zh":["需要Python和Django安装","特定于Django，可能不兼容其他框架"],"ja":["PythonとDjangoのインストールが必要","Django固有のため、他のフレームワークと互換性がない可能性がある"],"ko":["Python 및 Django 설치가 필요","Django 전용이므로 다른 프레임워크와 호환되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Python y Django","Específico de Django, puede que no sea compatible con otros frameworks"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Python et de Django","Spécifique à Django, peut ne pas être compatible avec d''autres frameworks"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Python und Django","Django-spezifisch, kann möglicherweise nicht mit anderen Frameworks kompatibel sein"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Python e do Django","Específico do Django, pode não ser compatível com outros frameworks"],"ru":["Требует установки Python и Django","Специфичен для Django, может быть несовместим с другими фреймворками"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Python و Django","محدد لبرنامج Django، قد لا يكون متوافقًا مع الإطارات الأخرى"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"70fcf7f23d71f7045f501b32ba09db8f943e3030844743dcdc78780d5997f0dc","repoEtag":"W/\"364f268e25511efbc6f9c2152da6805d934c8ccbaa49ea479a3da0f27c55af07\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/django-security', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'django-security', 50960, 6308, 100, '2026-02-24T12:02:48Z', '2026-02-24T12:04:38.967Z', '91984088c61d8840701423fe9165c6b39c479ff618f829cfe42f29e5d16dceac', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/django-security","name":"django-security","description":{"zh":"Django安全最佳实践，用于保护您的应用免受常见漏洞。包括身份验证、授权、CSRF保护、SQL注入防护和XSS防护","ja":"Djangoセキュリティベストプラクティスを使用して、アプリを一般的な脆弱性から保護します。認証、認可、CSRF保護、SQLインジェクション防止、XSS防止が含まれます","ko":"Django 보안 최적화를 사용하여 애플리케이션을 일반적인 취약점으로부터 보호합니다. 인증, 권한 부여, CSRF 보호, SQL 인젝션 방지, XSS 방지가 포함됩니다","es":"Conoce las mejores prácticas de seguridad para Django y cómo utilizar herramientas de Agentes de IA para proteger tus aplicaciones","fr":"Découvrez les meilleures pratiques de sécurité pour Django et comment utiliser les outils d''Agents d''IA pour sécuriser vos applications","de":"Erfahren Sie die besten Sicherheitspraktiken für Django und wie Sie KI-Agenten-Tools verwenden, um Ihre Anwendungen zu schützen","pt":"Melhores práticas de segurança para aplicações Django, incluindo autenticação, autorização e proteção contra vulnerabilidades","ru":"Лучшие практики безопасности для приложений Django, включая аутентификацию, авторизацию и защиту от уязвимостей","ar":"أفضل الممارسات الأمنية لتطبيقات ديانجو، بما في ذلك المصادقة والتفويض والحماية من الثغرات","en":"Django security best practices, authentication, authorization, CSRF protection, SQL injection prevention, XSS prevention, and secure deployment configurations."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":50960,"forks":6308,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:48Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"django-security","description":"Django security best practices, authentication, authorization, CSRF protection, SQL injection prevention, XSS prevention, and secure deployment configurations.","bodyPreview":"# Django Security Best Practices\n\nComprehensive security guidelines for Django applications to protect against common vulnerabilities.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Setting up Django authentication and authorization\n- Implementing user permissions and roles\n- Configuring production security settings\n- Reviewing Django application for security issues\n- Deploying Django applications to production\n\n## Core Security Settings\n\n### Production Settings Configuration\n\n```python\n# settings/production.py\nimport","body":"# Django Security Best Practices\n\nComprehensive security guidelines for Django applications to protect against common vulnerabilities.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Setting up Django authentication and authorization\n- Implementing user permissions and roles\n- Configuring production security settings\n- Reviewing Django application for security issues\n- Deploying Django applications to production\n\n## Core Security Settings\n\n### Production Settings Configuration\n\n```python\n# settings/production.py\nimport os\n\nDEBUG = False  # CRITICAL: Never use True in production\n\nALLOWED_HOSTS = os.environ.get(''ALLOWED_HOSTS'', '''').split('','')\n\n# Security headers\nSECURE_SSL_REDIRECT = True\nSESSION_COOKIE_SECURE = True\nCSRF_COOKIE_SECURE = True\nSECURE_HSTS_SECONDS = 31536000  # 1 year\nSECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS = True\nSECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD = True\nSECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF = True\nSECURE_BROWSER_XSS_FILTER = True\nX_FRAME_OPTIONS = ''DENY''\n\n# HTTPS and Cookies\nSESSION_COOKIE_HTTPONLY = True\nCSRF_COOKIE_HTTPONLY = True\nSESSION_COOKIE_SAMESITE = ''Lax''\nCSRF_COOKIE_SAMESITE = ''Lax''\n\n# Secret key (must be set via environment variable)\nSECRET_KEY = os.environ.get(''DJANGO_SECRET_KEY'')\nif not SECRET_KEY:\n    raise ImproperlyConfigured(''DJANGO_SECRET_KEY environment variable is required'')\n\n# Password validation\nAUTH_PASSWORD_VALIDATORS = [\n    {\n        ''NAME'': ''django.contrib.auth.password_validation.UserAttributeSimilarityValidator'',\n    },\n    {\n        ''NAME'': ''django.contrib.auth.password_validation.MinimumLengthValidator'',\n        ''OPTIONS'': {\n            ''min_length'': 12,\n        }\n    },\n    {\n        ''NAME'': ''django.contrib.auth.password_validation.CommonPasswordValidator'',\n    },\n    {\n        ''NAME'': ''django.contrib.auth.password_validation.NumericPasswordValidator'',\n    },\n]\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Custom User Model\n\n```python\n# apps/users/models.py\nfrom django.contrib.auth.models import AbstractUser\nfrom django.db import models\n\nclass User(AbstractUser):\n    \"\"\"Custom user model for better security.\"\"\"\n\n    email = models.EmailField(unique=True)\n    phone = models.CharField(max_length=20, blank=True)\n\n    USERNAME_FIELD = ''email''  # Use email as username\n    REQUIRED_FIELDS = [''username'']\n\n    class Meta:\n        db_table = ''users''\n        verbose_name = ''User''\n        verbose_name_plural = ''Users''\n\n    def __str__(self):\n        return self.email\n\n# settings/base.py\nAUTH_USER_MODEL = ''users.User''\n```\n\n### Password Hashing\n\n```python\n# Django uses PBKDF2 by default. For stronger security:\nPASSWORD_HASHERS = [\n    ''django.contrib.auth.hashers.Argon2PasswordHasher'',\n    ''django.contrib.auth.hashers.PBKDF2PasswordHasher'',\n    ''django.contrib.auth.hashers.PBKDF2SHA1PasswordHasher'',\n    ''django.contrib.auth.hashers.BCryptSHA256PasswordHasher'',\n]\n```\n\n### Session Management\n\n```python\n# Session configuration\nSESSION_ENGINE = ''django.contrib.sessions.backends.cache''  # Or ''db''\nSESSION_CACHE_ALIAS = ''default''\nSESSION_COOKIE_AGE = 3600 * 24 * 7  # 1 week\nSESSION_SAVE_EVERY_REQUEST = False\nSESSION_EXPIRE_AT_BROWSER_CLOSE = False  # Better UX, but less secure\n```\n\n## Authorization\n\n### Permissions\n\n```python\n# models.py\nfrom django.db import models\nfrom django.contrib.auth.models import Permission\n\nclass Post(models.Model):\n    title = models.CharField(max_length=200)\n    content = models.TextField()\n    author = models.ForeignKey(User, on_delete=models.CASCADE)\n\n    class Meta:\n        permissions = [\n            (''can_publish'', ''Can publish posts''),\n            (''can_edit_others'', ''Can edit posts of others''),\n        ]\n\n    def user_can_edit(self, user):\n        \"\"\"Check if user can edit this post.\"\"\"\n        return self.author == user or user.has_perm(''app.can_edit_others'')\n\n# views.py\nfrom django.contrib.auth.mixins import LoginRequiredMixin, PermissionRequiredMixin\nfrom django.views.generic import UpdateView\n\nclass PostUpdateView(LoginRequiredMixin, PermissionRequiredMixin, UpdateView):\n    model = Post\n    permission_required = ''app.can_edit_others''\n    raise_exception = True  # Return 403 instead of redirect\n\n    def get_queryset(self):\n        \"\"\"Only allow users to edit their own posts.\"\"\"\n        return Post.objects.filter(author=self.request.user)\n```\n\n### Custom Permissions\n\n```python\n# permissions.py\nfrom rest_framework import permissions\n\nclass IsOwnerOrReadOnly(permissions.BasePermission):\n    \"\"\"Allow only owners to edit objects.\"\"\"\n\n    def has_object_permission(self, request, view, obj):\n        # Read permissions allowed for any request\n        if request.method in permissions.SAFE_METHODS:\n            return True\n\n        # Write permissions only for owner\n        return obj.author == request.user\n\nclass IsAdminOrReadOnly(permissions.BasePermission):\n    \"\"\"Allow admins to do anything, others read-only.\"\"\"\n\n    def has_permission(self, request, view):\n        if request.method in permissions.SAFE_METHODS:\n            return True\n        return request.user and request.user.is_staff\n\nclass IsVerifiedUser(permissions.BasePermission):\n    \"\"\"Allow only verified users.\"\"\"\n\n    def has_permission(self, request, view):\n        return request.user and request.user.is_authenticated and request.user.is_verified\n```\n\n### Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n\n```python\n# models.py\nfrom django.contrib.auth.models import AbstractUser, Group\n\nclass User(AbstractUser):\n    ROLE_CHOICES = [\n        (''admin'', ''Administrator''),\n        (''moderator'', ''Moderator''),\n        (''user'', ''Regular User''),\n    ]\n    role = models.CharField(max_length=20, choices=ROLE_CHOICES, default=''user'')\n\n    def is_admin(self):\n        return self.role == ''admin'' or self.is_superuser\n\n    def is_moderator(self):\n        return self.role in [''admin'', ''moderator'']\n\n# Mixins\nclass AdminRequiredMixin:\n    \"\"\"Mixin to require admin role.\"\"\"\n\n    def dispatch(self, request, *args, **kwargs):\n        if not request.user.is_authenticated or not request.user.is_admin():\n            from django.core.exceptions import PermissionDenied\n            raise PermissionDenied\n        return super().dispatch(request, *args, **kwargs)\n```\n\n## SQL Injection Prevention\n\n### Django ORM Protection\n\n```python\n# GOOD: Django ORM automatically escapes parameters\ndef get_user(username):\n    return User.objects.get(username=username)  # Safe\n\n# GOOD: Using parameters with raw()\ndef search_users(query):\n    return User.objects.raw(''SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = %s'', [query])\n\n# BAD: Never directly interpolate user input\ndef get_user_bad(username):\n    return User.objects.raw(f''SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = {username}'')  # VULNERABLE!\n\n# GOOD: Using filter with proper escaping\ndef get_users_by_email(email):\n    return User.objects.filter(email__iexact=email)  # Safe\n\n# GOOD: Using Q objects for complex queries\nfrom django.db.models import Q\ndef search_users_complex(query):\n    return User.objects.filter(\n        Q(username__icontains=query) |\n        Q(email__icontains=query)\n    )  # Safe\n```\n\n### Extra Security with raw()\n\n```python\n# If you must use raw SQL, always use parameters\nUser.objects.raw(\n    ''SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = %s AND status = %s'',\n    [user_input_email, status]\n)\n```\n\n## XSS Prevention\n\n### Template Escaping\n\n```django\n{# Django auto-escapes variables by default - SAFE #}\n{{ user_input }}  {# Escaped HTML #}\n\n{# Explicitly mark safe only for trusted content #}\n{{ trusted_html|safe }}  {# Not escaped #}\n\n{# Use template filters for safe HTML #}\n{{ user_input|escape }}  {# Same as default #}\n{{ user_input|striptags }}  {# Remove all HTML tags #}\n\n{# JavaScript escaping #}\n<script>\n    var username = {{ username|escapejs }};\n</script>\n```\n\n### Safe String Handling\n\n```python\nfrom django.utils.safestring import mark_safe\nfrom django.utils.html import escape\n\n# BAD: Never mark user input as safe without escaping\ndef render_bad(user_input):\n    return mark_safe(user_input)  # VULNERABLE!\n\n# GOOD: Escape first, then mark safe\ndef render_good(user_input):\n    return mark_safe(escape(user_input))\n\n# GOOD: Use format_html for HTML with variables\nfrom django.utils.html import format_html\n\ndef greet_user(username):\n    return format_html(''<span class=\"user\">{}</span>'', escape(username))\n```\n\n### HTTP Headers\n\n```python\n# settings.py\nSECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF = True  # Prevent MIME sniffing\nSECURE_BROWSER_XSS_FILTER = True  # Enable XSS filter\nX_FRAME_OPTIONS = ''DENY''  # Prevent clickjacking\n\n# Custom middleware\nfrom django.conf import settings\n\nclass SecurityHeaderMiddleware:\n    def __init__(self, get_response):\n        self.get_response = get_response\n\n    def __call__(self, request):\n        response = self.get_response(request)\n        response[''X-Content-Type-Options''] = ''nosniff''\n        response[''X-Frame-Options''] = ''DENY''\n        response[''X-XSS-Protection''] = ''1; mode=block''\n        response[''Content-Security-Policy''] = \"default-src ''self''\"\n        return response\n```\n\n## CSRF Protection\n\n### Default CSRF Protection\n\n```python\n# settings.py - CSRF is enabled by default\nCSRF_COOKIE_SECURE = True  # Only send over HTTPS\nCSRF_COOKIE_HTTPONLY = True  # Prevent JavaScript access\nCSRF_COOKIE_SAMESITE = ''Lax''  # Prevent CSRF in some cases\nCSRF_TRUSTED_ORIGINS = [''https://example.com'']  # Trusted domains\n\n# Template usage\n<form method=\"post\">\n    {% csrf_token %}\n    {{ form.as_p }}\n    <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\n</form>\n\n# AJAX requests\nfunction getCookie(name) {\n    let cookieValue = null;\n    if (document.cookie && document.cookie !== '''') {\n        const cookies = document.cookie.split('';'');\n        for (let i = 0; i < cookies.length; i++) {\n            const cookie = cookies[i].trim();\n            if (cookie.substring(0, name.length + 1) === (name + ''='')) {\n                cookieValue = decodeURIComponent(cookie.substring(name.length + 1));\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return cookieValue;\n}\n\nfetch(''/api/endpoint/'', {\n    method: ''POST'',\n    headers: {\n        ''X-CSRFToken'': getCookie(''csrftoken''),\n        ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'',\n    },\n    body: JSON.stringify(data)\n});\n```\n\n### Exempting Views (Use Carefully)\n\n```python\nfrom django.views.decorators.csrf import csrf_exempt\n\n@csrf_exempt  # Only use when absolutely necessary!\ndef webhook_view(request):\n    # Webhook from external service\n    pass\n```\n\n## File Upload Security\n\n### File Validation\n\n```python\nimport os\nfrom django.core.exceptions import ValidationError\n\ndef validate_file_extension(value):\n    \"\"\"Validate file extension.\"\"\"\n    ext = os.path.splitext(value.name)[1]\n    valid_extensions = [''.jpg'', ''.jpeg'', ''.png'', ''.gif'', ''.pdf'']\n    if not ext.lower() in valid_extensions:\n        raise ValidationError(''Unsupported file extension.'')\n\ndef validate_file_size(value):\n    \"\"\"Validate file size (max 5MB).\"\"\"\n    filesize = value.size\n    if filesize > 5 * 1024 * 1024:\n        raise ValidationError(''File too large. Max size is 5MB.'')\n\n# models.py\nclass Document(models.Model):\n    file = models.FileField(\n        upload_to=''documents/'',\n        validators=[validate_file_extension, validate_file_size]\n    )\n```\n\n### Secure File Storage\n\n```python\n# settings.py\nMEDIA_ROOT = ''/var/www/media/''\nMEDIA_URL = ''/media/''\n\n# Use a separate domain for media in production\nMEDIA_DOMAIN = ''https://media.example.com''\n\n# Don''t serve user uploads directly\n# Use whitenoise or a CDN for static files\n# Use a separate server or S3 for media files\n```\n\n## API Security\n\n### Rate Limiting\n\n```python\n# settings.py\nREST_FRAMEWORK = {\n    ''DEFAULT_THROTTLE_CLASSES'': [\n        ''rest_framework.throttling.AnonRateThrottle'',\n        ''rest_framework.throttling.UserRateThrottle''\n    ],\n    ''DEFAULT_THROTTLE_RATES'': {\n        ''anon'': ''100/day'',\n        ''user'': ''1000/day'',\n        ''upload'': ''10/hour'',\n    }\n}\n\n# Custom throttle\nfrom rest_framework.throttling import UserRateThrottle\n\nclass BurstRateThrottle(UserRateThrottle):\n    scope = ''burst''\n    rate = ''60/min''\n\nclass SustainedRateThrottle(UserRateThrottle):\n    scope = ''sustained''\n    rate = ''1000/day''\n```\n\n### Authentication for APIs\n\n```python\n# settings.py\nREST_FRAMEWORK = {\n    ''DEFAULT_AUTHENTICATION_CLASSES'': [\n        ''rest_framework.authentication.TokenAuthentication'',\n        ''rest_framework.authentication.SessionAuthentication'',\n        ''rest_framework_simplejwt.authentication.JWTAuthentication'',\n    ],\n    ''DEFAULT_PERMISSION_CLASSES'': [\n        ''rest_framework.permissions.IsAuthenticated'',\n    ],\n}\n\n# views.py\nfrom rest_framework.decorators import api_view, permission_classes\nfrom rest_framework.permissions import IsAuthenticated\n\n@api_view([''GET'', ''POST''])\n@permission_classes([IsAuthenticated])\ndef protected_view(request):\n    return Response({''message'': ''You are authenticated''})\n```\n\n## Security Headers\n\n### Content Security Policy\n\n```python\n# settings.py\nCSP_DEFAULT_SRC = \"''self''\"\nCSP_SCRIPT_SRC = \"''self'' https://cdn.example.com\"\nCSP_STYLE_SRC = \"''self'' ''unsafe-inline''\"\nCSP_IMG_SRC = \"''self'' data: https:\"\nCSP_CONNECT_SRC = \"''self'' https://api.example.com\"\n\n# Middleware\nclass CSPMiddleware:\n    def __init__(self, get_response):\n        self.get_response = get_response\n\n    def __call__(self, request):\n        response = self.get_response(request)\n        response[''Content-Security-Policy''] = (\n            f\"default-src {CSP_DEFAULT_SRC}; \"\n            f\"script-src {CSP_SCRIPT_SRC}; \"\n            f\"style-src {CSP_STYLE_SRC}; \"\n            f\"img-src {CSP_IMG_SRC}; \"\n            f\"connect-src {CSP_CONNECT_SRC}\"\n        )\n        return response\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n### Managing Secrets\n\n```python\n# Use python-decouple or django-environ\nimport environ\n\nenv = environ.Env(\n    # set casting, default value\n    DEBUG=(bool, False)\n)\n\n# reading .env file\nenviron.Env.read_env()\n\nSECRET_KEY = env(''DJANGO_SECRET_KEY'')\nDATABASE_URL = env(''DATABASE_URL'')\nALLOWED_HOSTS = env.list(''ALLOWED_HOSTS'')\n\n# .env file (never commit this)\nDEBUG=False\nSECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-here\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/dbname\nALLOWED_HOSTS=example.com,www.example.com\n```\n\n## Logging Security Events\n\n```python\n# settings.py\nLOGGING = {\n    ''version'': 1,\n    ''disable_existing_loggers'': False,\n    ''handlers'': {\n        ''file'': {\n            ''level'': ''WARNING'',\n            ''class'': ''logging.FileHandler'',\n            ''filename'': ''/var/log/django/security.log'',\n        },\n        ''console'': {\n            ''level'': ''INFO'',\n            ''class'': ''logging.StreamHandler'',\n        },\n    },\n    ''loggers'': {\n        ''django.security'': {\n            ''handlers'': [''file'', ''console''],\n            ''level'': ''WARNING'',\n            ''propagate'': True,\n        },\n        ''django.request'': {\n            ''handlers'': [''file''],\n            ''level'': ''ERROR'',\n            ''propagate'': False,\n        },\n    },\n}\n```\n\n## Quick Security Checklist\n\n| Check | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `DEBUG = False` | Never run with DEBUG in production |\n| HTTPS only | Force SSL, secure cookies |\n| Strong secrets | Use environment variables for SECRET_KEY |\n| Password validation | Enable all password validators |\n| CSRF protection | Enabled by default, don''t disable |\n| XSS prevention | Django auto-escapes, don''t use `&#124;safe` with user input |\n| SQL injection | Use ORM, never concatenate strings in queries |\n| File uploads | Validate file type and size |\n| Rate limiting | Throttle API endpoints |\n| Security headers | CSP, X-Frame-Options, HSTS |\n| Logging | Log security events |\n| Updates | Keep Django and dependencies updated |\n\nRemember: Security is a process, not a product. Regularly review and update your security practices.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:04:38.967Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Django 安全最佳实践 - AI智能工具","ja":"Django セキュリティベストプラクティス - AIエージェント","ko":"Django 보안 최적화 - AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de seguridad Django con Agentes de IA","fr":"Outils de sécurité Django avec Agents d''IA","de":"Django-Sicherheitstools mit KI-Agenten","pt":"Melhores Práticas de Segurança Django com Ferramentas de IA","ru":"Найти ИИ Агенты для Безопасности Django","ar":"أفضل ممارسات أمن ديانجو مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"django-security"},"description":{"zh":"Django安全最佳实践，用于保护您的应用免受常见漏洞。包括身份验证、授权、CSRF保护、SQL注入防护和XSS防护","ja":"Djangoセキュリティベストプラクティスを使用して、アプリを一般的な脆弱性から保護します。認証、認可、CSRF保護、SQLインジェクション防止、XSS防止が含まれます","ko":"Django 보안 최적화를 사용하여 애플리케이션을 일반적인 취약점으로부터 보호합니다. 인증, 권한 부여, CSRF 보호, SQL 인젝션 방지, XSS 방지가 포함됩니다","es":"Conoce las mejores prácticas de seguridad para Django y cómo utilizar herramientas de Agentes de IA para proteger tus aplicaciones","fr":"Découvrez les meilleures pratiques de sécurité pour Django et comment utiliser les outils d''Agents d''IA pour sécuriser vos applications","de":"Erfahren Sie die besten Sicherheitspraktiken für Django und wie Sie KI-Agenten-Tools verwenden, um Ihre Anwendungen zu schützen","pt":"Melhores práticas de segurança para aplicações Django, incluindo autenticação, autorização e proteção contra vulnerabilidades","ru":"Лучшие практики безопасности для приложений Django, включая аутентификацию, авторизацию и защиту от уязвимостей","ar":"أفضل الممارسات الأمنية لتطبيقات ديانجو، بما في ذلك المصادقة والتفويض والحماية من الثغرات","en":"Django security best practices, authentication, authorization, CSRF protection, SQL injection prevention, XSS prevention, and secure deployment configurations."},"definition":{"en":"Django security best practices, authentication, authorization, CSRF protection, SQL injection prevention, XSS prevention, and secure deployment configurations."},"features":{"zh":["身份验证和授权","CSRF保护","SQL注入防护","XSS防护","生产安全设置配置"],"ja":["認証と認可","CSRF保護","SQLインジェクション防止","XSS防止","生産性の高いセキュリティ設定の構成"],"ko":["인증 및 권한 부여","CSRF 보호","SQL 인젝션 방지","XSS 방지","생산성 높은 보안 설정 구성"],"es":["Autenticación y autorización de Django","Protección contra CSRF y SQL injection","Prevención de XSS y configuraciones de seguridad de producción","Revisión de aplicaciones Django para problemas de seguridad","Implementación de permisos y roles de usuario"],"fr":["Authentification et autorisation de Django","Protection contre les attaques CSRF et les injections SQL","Prévention des XSS et configurations de sécurité de production","Révision des applications Django pour les problèmes de sécurité","Mise en œuvre des permissions et des rôles d''utilisateur"],"de":["Django-Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Schutz vor CSRF- und SQL-Injection-Angriffen","Verhinderung von XSS und Produktions-Sicherheitseinstellungen","Überprüfung von Django-Anwendungen auf Sicherheitsprobleme","Implementierung von Benutzerberechtigungen und -rollen"],"pt":["Autenticação e autorização","Proteção contra CSRF e injeção SQL","Prevenção de XSS e configurações de segurança","Implementação de permissões e papéis de usuário","Configuração de produção e revisão de segurança"],"ru":["Аутентификация и авторизация","Защита от CSRF и внедрения SQL","Предотвращение XSS и настройки безопасности","Реализация разрешений и ролей пользователей","Настройка производства и проверка безопасности"],"ar":["المصادقة والتفويض","حماية ضد CSRF والحقن SQL","منع XSS وتكوين أمان","تنفيذ صلاحيات وأدوار المستخدم","تكوين الإنتاج والمراجعة الأمنية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Django安全","AI智能工具","身份验证","授权","CSRF保护","SQL注入防护","XSS防护"],"ja":["Djangoセキュリティ","AIエージェント","認証","認可","CSRF保護","SQLインジェクション防止","XSS防止"],"ko":["Django 보안","AI 에이전트","인증","권한 부여","CSRF 보호","SQL 인젝션 방지","XSS 방지"],"es":["seguridad Django","Agentes de IA","herramientas de desarrollo","autenticación y autorización","protección contra vulnerabilidades","despliegue seguro de aplicaciones"],"fr":["sécurité Django","Agents d''IA","outils de développement","authentification et autorisation","protection contre les vulnérabilités","déploiement sécurisé d''applications"],"de":["Django-Sicherheit","KI-Agenten","Entwicklungstools","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Schutz vor Schwachstellen","sichere Bereitstellung von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Django security","Ferramentas de IA","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","Segurança de aplicações","Autenticação e autorização","Proteção contra vulnerabilidades"],"ru":["Безопасность Django","ИИ Агенты","Разработка приложений","Безопасность приложений","Аутентификация и авторизация","Защита от уязвимостей"],"ar":["أمن ديانجو","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير التطبيقات","أمان التطبيقات","المصادقة والتفويض","حماية من الثغرات"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring advanced Django security configurations and best practices.","zh":"适用于需要高级 Django 安全配置和最佳实践的 Web 开发代理。","ja":"高度な Django のセキュリティ設定とベストプラクティスを必要とする Web 開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 Django 보안 구성 및 모범 사례가 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo web que requieren configuraciones de seguridad avanzadas de Django y mejores prácticas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement web nécessitant des configurations de sécurité avancées Django et des meilleures pratiques.","de":"Ideal für Webentwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Django-Sicherheitskonfigurationen und Best Practices erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de desenvolvimento web que exigem configurações de segurança avançadas do Django e melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для веб-агентов, требующих продвинутых конфигураций безопасности Django и рекомендаций.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الويب الذي يتطلب تكوينات أمان متقدمة ل Django وأفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement robust security measures, including authentication, authorization, CSRF protection, SQL injection prevention, and XSS prevention, using Django''s built-in security features and secure deployment configurations.","zh":"赋予代理实现强大的安全措施的能力，包括身份验证、授权、CSRF 保护、SQL 注入防御和 XSS 防御，使用 Django 的内置安全功能和安全部署配置。","ja":"エージェントに、認証、認可、CSRF 保護、SQL インジェクション防止、XSS 防止などの強力なセキュリティ対策を実装する能力を与え、Django の組み込みのセキュリティ機能とセキュアなデプロイ構成を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 인증, 권한 부여, CSRF 보호, SQL 인젝션 방지, XSS 방지와 같은 강력한 보안 조치를 구현할 수 있도록 하며, Django의 내장 보안 기능과 안전한 배포 구성 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar medidas de seguridad robustas, incluyendo autenticación, autorización, protección contra CSRF, prevención de inyección SQL y prevención de XSS, utilizando las características de seguridad integradas de Django y configuraciones de implementación seguras.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des mesures de sécurité robustes, notamment l''authentification, l''autorisation, la protection contre les attaques CSRF, la prévention des injections SQL et la prévention des XSS, en utilisant les fonctionnalités de sécurité intégrées de Django et les configurations de déploiement sécurisées.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, robuste Sicherheitsmaßnahmen umzusetzen, einschließlich Authentifizierung, Autorisierung, CSRF-Schutz, SQL-Injection-Prävention und XSS-Prävention, unter Verwendung der integrierten Sicherheitsfunktionen von Django und sicherer Bereitstellungskonfigurationen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar medidas de segurança robustas, incluindo autenticação, autorização, proteção contra CSRF, prevenção de injeção de SQL e prevenção de XSS, usando os recursos de segurança integrados do Django e configurações de implantação seguras.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать надежные меры безопасности, включая аутентификацию, авторизацию, защиту от CSRF, предотвращение внедрения SQL и предотвращение XSS, с использованием встроенных функций безопасности Django и безопасных конфигураций развертывания.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تنفيذ إجراءات أمنية متينة، تشمل المصادقة والتفويض وحماية CSRF ومنع الحقن SQL ومنع XSS، باستخدام ميزات الأمان المدمجة في Django وتكوينات النشر الآمنة."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring production security settings","Implementing user permissions and roles","Reviewing Django applications for security vulnerabilities","Deploying Django applications securely"],"zh":["配置生产安全设置","实现用户权限和角色","审查 Django 应用程序的安全漏洞","安全部署 Django 应用程序"],"ja":["生産環境のセキュリティ設定の構成","ユーザーの権限と役割の実装","Django アプリケーションのセキュリティ脆弱性のレビュー","Django アプリケーションのセキュアなデプロイ"],"ko":["생산 보안 설정 구성","사용자 권한 및 역할 구현","Django 애플리케이션의 보안 취약성 검토","Django 애플리케이션의 안전한 배포"],"es":["Configuración de la configuración de seguridad de producción","Implementación de permisos y roles de usuario","Revisión de aplicaciones Django para vulnerabilidades de seguridad","Implementación segura de aplicaciones Django"],"fr":["Configuration des paramètres de sécurité de production","Mise en œuvre des autorisations et des rôles des utilisateurs","Examen des applications Django pour les vulnérabilités de sécurité","Déploiement sécurisé des applications Django"],"de":["Konfiguration der Produktions-Sicherheitseinstellungen","Implementierung von Benutzerberechtigungen und -rollen","Überprüfung von Django-Anwendungen auf Sicherheitslücken","Sichere Bereitstellung von Django-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Configurando configurações de segurança de produção","Implementando permissões e funções de usuário","Revisando aplicações Django em busca de vulnerabilidades de segurança","Implantando aplicações Django de forma segura"],"ru":["Настройка настроек безопасности для производства","Реализация разрешений и ролей пользователей","Проверка приложений Django на наличие уязвимостей безопасности","Безопасное развертывание приложений Django"],"ar":["تكوين إعدادات أمان الإنتاج","تنفيذ صلاحيات وأدوار المستخدم","مراجعة تطبيقات Django للكشف عن نقاط الضعف الأمنية","نشر تطبيقات Django بشكل آمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Django framework","Python knowledge necessary","Specific to Django security best practices"],"zh":["需要 Django 框架","需要 Python 知识","特定于 Django 安全最佳实践"],"ja":["Django フレームワークが必要","Python の知識が必要","Django のセキュリティベストプラクティスに特化"],"ko":["Django 프레임워크 필요","Python 지식 필요","Django 보안 모범 사례에 특화"],"es":["Requiere el framework Django","Conocimientos de Python necesarios","Específico para las mejores prácticas de seguridad de Django"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Django","Connaissances de Python nécessaires","Spécifique aux meilleures pratiques de sécurité de Django"],"de":["Benötigt das Django-Framework","Python-Kenntnisse erforderlich","Spezifisch für die Sicherheitsbest-Practices von Django"],"pt":["Exige framework Django","Conhecimento de Python necessário","Específico para as melhores práticas de segurança do Django"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка Django","Необходимо знание Python","Относится конкретно к рекомендациям по безопасности Django"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار Django","مطلوب معرفة Python","محدد لافضل الممارسات الأمنية لبرنامج Django"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"91984088c61d8840701423fe9165c6b39c479ff618f829cfe42f29e5d16dceac","repoEtag":"W/\"364f268e25511efbc6f9c2152da6805d934c8ccbaa49ea479a3da0f27c55af07\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/django-verification', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'django-verification', 50960, 6308, 100, '2026-02-24T12:02:48Z', '2026-02-24T12:04:40.006Z', '1f9afb0b99d21ec43e393da234fa6747b65a2b54365f4fbc5c04d2c67dc0f750', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/django-verification","name":"django-verification","description":{"zh":"Django 验证循环是一种确保 Django 应用质量和安全的工具，运行环境检查、lint、测试、安全扫描和部署准备检查","ja":"Django 検証ループは、Django アプリケーションの品質とセキュリティを確保するためのツールです。環境チェック、lint、テスト、セキュリティスキャン、デプロイ準備チェックを実行します","ko":"Django 검증 루프는 Django 애플리케이션의 품질과 보안을 보장하는 도구입니다. 환경 확인, lint, 테스트, 보안 스캔, 배포 준비 확인을 실행합니다","es":"El ciclo de verificación de Django garantiza la calidad y seguridad de tus aplicaciones antes de su lanzamiento o PR","fr":"La boucle de vérification Django assure la qualité et la sécurité de vos applications avant leur lancement ou PR","de":"Der Django-Überprüfungszyklus gewährleistet die Qualität und Sicherheit Ihrer Anwendungen vor der Veröffentlichung oder PR","pt":"O ciclo de verificação em Django é uma ferramenta essencial para garantir a qualidade e segurança do seu projeto, executando migrações, linting, testes e análise de segurança","ru":"Цикл верификации Django - это необходимый инструмент для обеспечения качества и безопасности вашего проекта, выполняющий миграции, linting, тесты и анализ безопасности","ar":"دورة التحقق في Django هي أداة أساسية لضمان جودة وأمان مشروعك، حيث تقوم بتنفيذ الهجرات والتنسيق والاختبارات وتحليل الأمان","en":"Verification loop for Django projects: migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks before release or PR."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":50960,"forks":6308,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:48Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"django-verification","description":"Verification loop for Django projects: migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks before release or PR.","bodyPreview":"# Django Verification Loop\n\nRun before PRs, after major changes, and pre-deploy to ensure Django application quality and security.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Before opening a pull request for a Django project\n- After major model changes, migration updates, or dependency upgrades\n- Pre-deployment verification for staging or production\n- Running full environment → lint → test → security → deploy readiness pipeline\n- Validating migration safety and test coverage\n\n## Phase 1: Environment Check\n\n```bash","body":"# Django Verification Loop\n\nRun before PRs, after major changes, and pre-deploy to ensure Django application quality and security.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Before opening a pull request for a Django project\n- After major model changes, migration updates, or dependency upgrades\n- Pre-deployment verification for staging or production\n- Running full environment → lint → test → security → deploy readiness pipeline\n- Validating migration safety and test coverage\n\n## Phase 1: Environment Check\n\n```bash\n# Verify Python version\npython --version  # Should match project requirements\n\n# Check virtual environment\nwhich python\npip list --outdated\n\n# Verify environment variables\npython -c \"import os; import environ; print(''DJANGO_SECRET_KEY set'' if os.environ.get(''DJANGO_SECRET_KEY'') else ''MISSING: DJANGO_SECRET_KEY'')\"\n```\n\nIf environment is misconfigured, stop and fix.\n\n## Phase 2: Code Quality & Formatting\n\n```bash\n# Type checking\nmypy . --config-file pyproject.toml\n\n# Linting with ruff\nruff check . --fix\n\n# Formatting with black\nblack . --check\nblack .  # Auto-fix\n\n# Import sorting\nisort . --check-only\nisort .  # Auto-fix\n\n# Django-specific checks\npython manage.py check --deploy\n```\n\nCommon issues:\n- Missing type hints on public functions\n- PEP 8 formatting violations\n- Unsorted imports\n- Debug settings left in production configuration\n\n## Phase 3: Migrations\n\n```bash\n# Check for unapplied migrations\npython manage.py showmigrations\n\n# Create missing migrations\npython manage.py makemigrations --check\n\n# Dry-run migration application\npython manage.py migrate --plan\n\n# Apply migrations (test environment)\npython manage.py migrate\n\n# Check for migration conflicts\npython manage.py makemigrations --merge  # Only if conflicts exist\n```\n\nReport:\n- Number of pending migrations\n- Any migration conflicts\n- Model changes without migrations\n\n## Phase 4: Tests + Coverage\n\n```bash\n# Run all tests with pytest\npytest --cov=apps --cov-report=html --cov-report=term-missing --reuse-db\n\n# Run specific app tests\npytest apps/users/tests/\n\n# Run with markers\npytest -m \"not slow\"  # Skip slow tests\npytest -m integration  # Only integration tests\n\n# Coverage report\nopen htmlcov/index.html\n```\n\nReport:\n- Total tests: X passed, Y failed, Z skipped\n- Overall coverage: XX%\n- Per-app coverage breakdown\n\nCoverage targets:\n\n| Component | Target |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Models | 90%+ |\n| Serializers | 85%+ |\n| Views | 80%+ |\n| Services | 90%+ |\n| Overall | 80%+ |\n\n## Phase 5: Security Scan\n\n```bash\n# Dependency vulnerabilities\npip-audit\nsafety check --full-report\n\n# Django security checks\npython manage.py check --deploy\n\n# Bandit security linter\nbandit -r . -f json -o bandit-report.json\n\n# Secret scanning (if gitleaks is installed)\ngitleaks detect --source . --verbose\n\n# Environment variable check\npython -c \"from django.core.exceptions import ImproperlyConfigured; from django.conf import settings; settings.DEBUG\"\n```\n\nReport:\n- Vulnerable dependencies found\n- Security configuration issues\n- Hardcoded secrets detected\n- DEBUG mode status (should be False in production)\n\n## Phase 6: Django Management Commands\n\n```bash\n# Check for model issues\npython manage.py check\n\n# Collect static files\npython manage.py collectstatic --noinput --clear\n\n# Create superuser (if needed for tests)\necho \"from apps.users.models import User; User.objects.create_superuser(''admin@example.com'', ''admin'')\" | python manage.py shell\n\n# Database integrity\npython manage.py check --database default\n\n# Cache verification (if using Redis)\npython -c \"from django.core.cache import cache; cache.set(''test'', ''value'', 10); print(cache.get(''test''))\"\n```\n\n## Phase 7: Performance Checks\n\n```bash\n# Django Debug Toolbar output (check for N+1 queries)\n# Run in dev mode with DEBUG=True and access a page\n# Look for duplicate queries in SQL panel\n\n# Query count analysis\ndjango-admin debugsqlshell  # If django-debug-sqlshell installed\n\n# Check for missing indexes\npython manage.py shell << EOF\nfrom django.db import connection\nwith connection.cursor() as cursor:\n    cursor.execute(\"SELECT table_name, index_name FROM information_schema.statistics WHERE table_schema = ''public''\")\n    print(cursor.fetchall())\nEOF\n```\n\nReport:\n- Number of queries per page (should be < 50 for typical pages)\n- Missing database indexes\n- Duplicate queries detected\n\n## Phase 8: Static Assets\n\n```bash\n# Check for npm dependencies (if using npm)\nnpm audit\nnpm audit fix\n\n# Build static files (if using webpack/vite)\nnpm run build\n\n# Verify static files\nls -la staticfiles/\npython manage.py findstatic css/style.css\n```\n\n## Phase 9: Configuration Review\n\n```python\n# Run in Python shell to verify settings\npython manage.py shell << EOF\nfrom django.conf import settings\nimport os\n\n# Critical checks\nchecks = {\n    ''DEBUG is False'': not settings.DEBUG,\n    ''SECRET_KEY set'': bool(settings.SECRET_KEY and len(settings.SECRET_KEY) > 30),\n    ''ALLOWED_HOSTS set'': len(settings.ALLOWED_HOSTS) > 0,\n    ''HTTPS enabled'': getattr(settings, ''SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT'', False),\n    ''HSTS enabled'': getattr(settings, ''SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS'', 0) > 0,\n    ''Database configured'': settings.DATABASES[''default''][''ENGINE''] != ''django.db.backends.sqlite3'',\n}\n\nfor check, result in checks.items():\n    status = ''✓'' if result else ''✗''\n    print(f\"{status} {check}\")\nEOF\n```\n\n## Phase 10: Logging Configuration\n\n```bash\n# Test logging output\npython manage.py shell << EOF\nimport logging\nlogger = logging.getLogger(''django'')\nlogger.warning(''Test warning message'')\nlogger.error(''Test error message'')\nEOF\n\n# Check log files (if configured)\ntail -f /var/log/django/django.log\n```\n\n## Phase 11: API Documentation (if DRF)\n\n```bash\n# Generate schema\npython manage.py generateschema --format openapi-json > schema.json\n\n# Validate schema\n# Check if schema.json is valid JSON\npython -c \"import json; json.load(open(''schema.json''))\"\n\n# Access Swagger UI (if using drf-yasg)\n# Visit http://localhost:8000/swagger/ in browser\n```\n\n## Phase 12: Diff Review\n\n```bash\n# Show diff statistics\ngit diff --stat\n\n# Show actual changes\ngit diff\n\n# Show changed files\ngit diff --name-only\n\n# Check for common issues\ngit diff | grep -i \"todo\\|fixme\\|hack\\|xxx\"\ngit diff | grep \"print(\"  # Debug statements\ngit diff | grep \"DEBUG = True\"  # Debug mode\ngit diff | grep \"import pdb\"  # Debugger\n```\n\nChecklist:\n- No debugging statements (print, pdb, breakpoint())\n- No TODO/FIXME comments in critical code\n- No hardcoded secrets or credentials\n- Database migrations included for model changes\n- Configuration changes documented\n- Error handling present for external calls\n- Transaction management where needed\n\n## Output Template\n\n```\nDJANGO VERIFICATION REPORT\n==========================\n\nPhase 1: Environment Check\n  ✓ Python 3.11.5\n  ✓ Virtual environment active\n  ✓ All environment variables set\n\nPhase 2: Code Quality\n  ✓ mypy: No type errors\n  ✗ ruff: 3 issues found (auto-fixed)\n  ✓ black: No formatting issues\n  ✓ isort: Imports properly sorted\n  ✓ manage.py check: No issues\n\nPhase 3: Migrations\n  ✓ No unapplied migrations\n  ✓ No migration conflicts\n  ✓ All models have migrations\n\nPhase 4: Tests + Coverage\n  Tests: 247 passed, 0 failed, 5 skipped\n  Coverage:\n    Overall: 87%\n    users: 92%\n    products: 89%\n    orders: 85%\n    payments: 91%\n\nPhase 5: Security Scan\n  ✗ pip-audit: 2 vulnerabilities found (fix required)\n  ✓ safety check: No issues\n  ✓ bandit: No security issues\n  ✓ No secrets detected\n  ✓ DEBUG = False\n\nPhase 6: Django Commands\n  ✓ collectstatic completed\n  ✓ Database integrity OK\n  ✓ Cache backend reachable\n\nPhase 7: Performance\n  ✓ No N+1 queries detected\n  ✓ Database indexes configured\n  ✓ Query count acceptable\n\nPhase 8: Static Assets\n  ✓ npm audit: No vulnerabilities\n  ✓ Assets built successfully\n  ✓ Static files collected\n\nPhase 9: Configuration\n  ✓ DEBUG = False\n  ✓ SECRET_KEY configured\n  ✓ ALLOWED_HOSTS set\n  ✓ HTTPS enabled\n  ✓ HSTS enabled\n  ✓ Database configured\n\nPhase 10: Logging\n  ✓ Logging configured\n  ✓ Log files writable\n\nPhase 11: API Documentation\n  ✓ Schema generated\n  ✓ Swagger UI accessible\n\nPhase 12: Diff Review\n  Files changed: 12\n  +450, -120 lines\n  ✓ No debug statements\n  ✓ No hardcoded secrets\n  ✓ Migrations included\n\nRECOMMENDATION: ⚠️ Fix pip-audit vulnerabilities before deploying\n\nNEXT STEPS:\n1. Update vulnerable dependencies\n2. Re-run security scan\n3. Deploy to staging for final testing\n```\n\n## Pre-Deployment Checklist\n\n- [ ] All tests passing\n- [ ] Coverage ≥ 80%\n- [ ] No security vulnerabilities\n- [ ] No unapplied migrations\n- [ ] DEBUG = False in production settings\n- [ ] SECRET_KEY properly configured\n- [ ] ALLOWED_HOSTS set correctly\n- [ ] Database backups enabled\n- [ ] Static files collected and served\n- [ ] Logging configured and working\n- [ ] Error monitoring (Sentry, etc.) configured\n- [ ] CDN configured (if applicable)\n- [ ] Redis/cache backend configured\n- [ ] Celery workers running (if applicable)\n- [ ] HTTPS/SSL configured\n- [ ] Environment variables documented\n\n## Continuous Integration\n\n### GitHub Actions Example\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/django-verification.yml\nname: Django Verification\n\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  verify:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    services:\n      postgres:\n        image: postgres:14\n        env:\n          POSTGRES_PASSWORD: postgres\n        options: >-\n          --health-cmd pg_isready\n          --health-interval 10s\n          --health-timeout 5s\n          --health-retries 5\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v3\n\n      - name: Set up Python\n        uses: actions/setup-python@v4\n        with:\n          python-version: ''3.11''\n\n      - name: Cache pip\n        uses: actions/cache@v3\n        with:\n          path: ~/.cache/pip\n          key: ${{ runner.os }}-pip-${{ hashFiles(''**/requirements.txt'') }}\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: |\n          pip install -r requirements.txt\n          pip install ruff black mypy pytest pytest-django pytest-cov bandit safety pip-audit\n\n      - name: Code quality checks\n        run: |\n          ruff check .\n          black . --check\n          isort . --check-only\n          mypy .\n\n      - name: Security scan\n        run: |\n          bandit -r . -f json -o bandit-report.json\n          safety check --full-report\n          pip-audit\n\n      - name: Run tests\n        env:\n          DATABASE_URL: postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/test\n          DJANGO_SECRET_KEY: test-secret-key\n        run: |\n          pytest --cov=apps --cov-report=xml --cov-report=term-missing\n\n      - name: Upload coverage\n        uses: codecov/codecov-action@v3\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Check | Command |\n|-------|---------|\n| Environment | `python --version` |\n| Type checking | `mypy .` |\n| Linting | `ruff check .` |\n| Formatting | `black . --check` |\n| Migrations | `python manage.py makemigrations --check` |\n| Tests | `pytest --cov=apps` |\n| Security | `pip-audit && bandit -r .` |\n| Django check | `python manage.py check --deploy` |\n| Collectstatic | `python manage.py collectstatic --noinput` |\n| Diff stats | `git diff --stat` |\n\nRemember: Automated verification catches common issues but doesn''t replace manual code review and testing in staging environment.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:04:40.006Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Django 验证循环 - AI 工具","ja":"Django 検証ループ - AIエージェント","ko":"Django 검증 루프 - AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de verificación de Django con Agentes de IA","fr":"Outils de vérification Django avec Agents IA","de":"Django-Überprüfungstools mit KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de Verificação em Django com Agentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты для верификации Django-проектов","ar":"أدوات التحقق في Django مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"django-verification"},"description":{"zh":"Django 验证循环是一种确保 Django 应用质量和安全的工具，运行环境检查、lint、测试、安全扫描和部署准备检查","ja":"Django 検証ループは、Django アプリケーションの品質とセキュリティを確保するためのツールです。環境チェック、lint、テスト、セキュリティスキャン、デプロイ準備チェックを実行します","ko":"Django 검증 루프는 Django 애플리케이션의 품질과 보안을 보장하는 도구입니다. 환경 확인, lint, 테스트, 보안 스캔, 배포 준비 확인을 실행합니다","es":"El ciclo de verificación de Django garantiza la calidad y seguridad de tus aplicaciones antes de su lanzamiento o PR","fr":"La boucle de vérification Django assure la qualité et la sécurité de vos applications avant leur lancement ou PR","de":"Der Django-Überprüfungszyklus gewährleistet die Qualität und Sicherheit Ihrer Anwendungen vor der Veröffentlichung oder PR","pt":"O ciclo de verificação em Django é uma ferramenta essencial para garantir a qualidade e segurança do seu projeto, executando migrações, linting, testes e aná...","ru":"Цикл верификации Django - это необходимый инструмент для обеспечения качества и безопасности вашего проекта, выполняющий миграции, linting, тесты и анализ бе...","ar":"دورة التحقق في Django هي أداة أساسية لضمان جودة وأمان مشروعك، حيث تقوم بتنفيذ الهجرات والتنسيق والاختبارات وتحليل الأمان","en":"Verification loop for Django projects: migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks before release or PR."},"definition":{"en":"Verification loop for Django projects: migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks before release or PR."},"features":{"zh":["环境检查","lint 和代码检查","测试和覆盖率检查","安全扫描和漏洞检测","部署准备检查"],"ja":["環境チェック","lint とコードチェック","テストとカバレッジチェック","セキュリティスキャンと脆弱性検出","デプロイ準備チェック"],"ko":["환경 확인","lint 및 코드 확인","테스트 및 커버리지 확인","보안 스캔 및 취약점 탐지","배포 준비 확인"],"es":["Verificación de entorno","Análisis de seguridad","Pruebas con cobertura","Verificación de migraciones","Preparación para la implementación"],"fr":["Vérification de l''environnement","Analyse de sécurité","Tests avec couverture","Vérification des migrations","Préparation à la mise en production"],"de":["Umgebungüberprüfung","Sicherheitsanalyse","Tests mit Abdeckung","Überprüfung von Migrationen","Bereitstellung für die Implementierung"],"pt":["Verificação de migrações","Linting de código","Testes com cobertura","Análise de segurança","Verificação de prontidão para deploy"],"ru":["Верификация миграций","Linting кода","Тесты с покрытием","Анализ безопасности","Верификация готовности к deploy"],"ar":["التحقق من الهجرات","تنسيق الكود","الاختبارات مع التغطية","تحليل الأمان","التحقق من جاهزية النشر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Django 验证循环","AI 工具","自动化测试","代码检查","安全扫描","部署准备","Django 应用质量","Django 应用安全"],"ja":["Django 検証ループ","AIエージェント","自動テスト","コードチェック","セキュリティスキャン","デプロイ準備","Django アプリケーションの品質","Django アプリケーションのセキュリティ"],"ko":["Django 검증 루프","AI 에이전트","자동 테스트","코드 확인","보안 스캔","배포 준비","Django 애플리케이션 품질","Django 애플리케이션 보안"],"es":["Agentes de IA para Django","Herramientas de verificación de Django","Pruebas de seguridad para Django","Análisis de código para Django","Implementación de Django","Desarrollo de aplicaciones Django"],"fr":["Agents IA pour Django","Outils de vérification Django","Tests de sécurité pour Django","Analyse de code pour Django","Mise en production Django","Développement d''applications Django"],"de":["KI-Agents für Django","Überprüfungstools für Django","Sicherheitstests für Django","Code-Analyse für Django","Django-Implementierung","Django-Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Django","Verificação","Migrações","Linting","Testes","Segurança","Deploy","Agentes de IA","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Django","Верификация","Миграции","Linting","Тесты","Безопасность","Deploy","ИИ Агенты","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Django","التحقق","الهجرات","التنسيق","الاختبارات","الأمان","النشر","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات التطوير"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents specializing in Django project verification and security","zh":"非常适合专门从事Django项目验证和安全的Python分析代理","ja":"Djangoプロジェクトの検証とセキュリティに特化したPython分析エージェントに最適","ko":"Django 프로젝트의 검증 및 보안에 전문적인 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de Python que se especializan en la verificación y seguridad de proyectos Django","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Python spécialisés dans la vérification et la sécurité des projets Django","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyseagenten, die sich auf die Überprüfung und Sicherheit von Django-Projekten spezialisieren","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python especializados em verificação e segurança de projetos Django","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа Python, специализирующихся на верификации и безопасности проектов Django","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل بايثون المتخصصة في التحقق والأمان لمشاريع Django"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run comprehensive verification loops for Django projects, including migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks using protocols like Git for pre-deploy and PR validation","zh":"赋予代理运行Django项目的全面验证循环的能力，包括迁移、linting、测试覆盖、安全扫描和部署就绪检查，使用类似Git的协议进行预部署和PR验证","ja":"エージェントがDjangoプロジェクトの包括的な検証ループを実行する機能を提供する、包括マイグレーション、linting、テストカバレッジ、セキュリティスキャン、およびデプロイの準備状況チェックを使用するGitのようなプロトコルを使用して事前デプロイとPRの検証","ko":"에이전트가 Django 프로젝트의 포괄적인 검증 루프를 실행할 수 있는 기능을 제공한다. 이는 마이그레이션, linting, 테스트 커버리지, 보안 스캔 및 배포 준비 상태 확인을 포함하며 Git와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 사전 배포 및 PR 검증을 수행한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para ejecutar bucles de verificación comprehensivos para proyectos Django, incluyendo migraciones, linting, pruebas con cobertura, análisis de seguridad y comprobaciones de preparación para la implementación utilizando protocolos como Git para la validación pre-deploy y PR","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des boucles de vérification complètes pour les projets Django, y compris les migrations, le linting, les tests avec une couverture, les analyses de sécurité et les vérifications de préparation au déploiement en utilisant des protocoles comme Git pour la validation pré-déploiement et PR","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, umfassende Überprüfungsschleifen für Django-Projekte auszuführen, einschließlich Migrationen, Linting, Tests mit Abdeckung, Sicherheitsprüfungen und Bereitschaftsprüfungen für die Bereitstellung unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Git für die Vor-Deploy- und PR-Validierung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar loops de verificação abrangentes para projetos Django, incluindo migrações, linting, testes com cobertura, verificação de segurança e verificações de prontidão para implantação usando protocolos como Git para validação pré-implantação e PR","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать полные циклы проверки для проектов Django, включая миграции, linting, тесты с покрытием, сканирование безопасности и проверки готовности к развертыванию с использованием протоколов như Git для предразвертывания и валидации PR","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تشغيل حلقات التحقق الشاملة لمشاريع Django، بما في ذلك الهجرات، وlinting، والاختبارات مع تغطية، وفحوصات الأمان، واختبارات الجاهزية للنشر باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Git للتحقق من صحة ما قبل النشرและการ التحقق من PR"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Django application security scans","Validating migration safety and test coverage","Running full environment checks for staging or production deployment readiness"],"zh":["自动化Django应用程序安全扫描","验证迁移安全性和测试覆盖","运行完整环境检查以检查是否准备好进行分段或生产环境部署"],"ja":["Djangoアプリケーションのセキュリティスキャンを自動化する","マイグレーションの安全性とテストカバレッジを検証する","ステージングまたはプロダクション環境へのデプロイの準備状況を確認するための完全な環境チェックを実行する"],"ko":["Django 애플리케이션 보안 스캔 자동화","마이그레이션 안전성 및 테스트 커버리지 확인","스테이징 또는 프로덕션 배포 준비 상태 확인을 위한 전체 환경 확인 실행"],"es":["Automatización de análisis de seguridad de aplicaciones Django","Validación de la seguridad de las migraciones y la cobertura de las pruebas","Ejecución de comprobaciones de entorno completo para la preparación del despliegue en entornos de staging o producción"],"fr":["Automatisation des analyses de sécurité des applications Django","Validation de la sécurité des migrations et de la couverture des tests","Exécution de vérifications d''environnement complet pour la préparation du déploiement en environnements de staging ou de production"],"de":["Automatisierung von Django-Anwendungssicherheitsprüfungen","Überprüfung der Migrationssicherheit und Testabdeckung","Ausführung von umfassenden Umgebungsprüfungen für die Bereitstellungsbereitschaft in Staging- oder Produktionsumgebungen"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de segurança de aplicações Django","Validar segurança de migração e cobertura de testes","Executar verificações ambientais completas para prontidão de implantação em staging ou produção"],"ru":["Автоматизация сканирования безопасности приложений Django","Проверка безопасности миграции и покрытия тестов","Запуск полных проверок окружения для готовности к развертыванию в staging или production"],"ar":["أتمتة فحوصات أمان تطبيقات Django","التحقق من سلامة الهجرة وتغطية الاختبار","تشغيل فحوصات بيئة كاملة للنشر الجاهزية في مرحلة ما 