enforces minimal documentation style.","bodyPreview":"# Maintaining AGENTS.md\n\nAGENTS.md is the canonical agent-facing documentation. Keep it minimal—agents are capable and don''t need hand-holding.\n\n## File Setup\n\n1. Create `AGENTS.md` at project root\n2. Create symlink: `ln -s AGENTS.md CLAUDE.md`\n\n## Before Writing\n\nDiscover local skills to reference:\n\n```bash\nfind .claude/skills -name \"SKILL.md\" 2>/dev/null\nls plugins/*/skills/*/SKILL.md 2>/dev/null\n```\n\nRead each skill''s frontmatter to understand when to reference it.\n\n## Writing Rules\n\n- **Head","body":"# Maintaining AGENTS.md\n\nAGENTS.md is the canonical agent-facing documentation. Keep it minimal—agents are capable and don''t need hand-holding.\n\n## File Setup\n\n1. Create `AGENTS.md` at project root\n2. Create symlink: `ln -s AGENTS.md CLAUDE.md`\n\n## Before Writing\n\nDiscover local skills to reference:\n\n```bash\nfind .claude/skills -name \"SKILL.md\" 2>/dev/null\nls plugins/*/skills/*/SKILL.md 2>/dev/null\n```\n\nRead each skill''s frontmatter to understand when to reference it.\n\n## Writing Rules\n\n- **Headers + bullets** - No paragraphs\n- **Code blocks** - For commands and templates\n- **Reference, don''t duplicate** - Point to skills: \"Use `db-migrate` skill. See `.claude/skills/db-migrate/SKILL.md`\"\n- **No filler** - No intros, conclusions, or pleasantries\n- **Trust capabilities** - Omit obvious context\n- **Skill updates** - ALWAYS use `/skill-creator` when creating or updating skills\n\n## Required Sections\n\n### Package Manager\nWhich tool and key commands only:\n```markdown\n## Package Manager\nUse **pnpm**: `pnpm install`, `pnpm dev`, `pnpm test`\n```\n\n### Commit Attribution\nAlways include this section. Agents should use their own identity:\n```markdown\n## Commit Attribution\nAI commits MUST include:\n```\nCo-Authored-By: (the agent model''s name and attribution byline)\n```\nExample: `Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4 <noreply@example.com>`\n```\n\n### Key Conventions\nProject-specific patterns agents must follow. Keep brief.\n\n### Local Skills\nReference each discovered skill:\n```markdown\n## Database\nUse `db-migrate` skill for schema changes. See `.claude/skills/db-migrate/SKILL.md`\n\n## Testing\nUse `write-tests` skill. See `.claude/skills/write-tests/SKILL.md`\n```\n\n## Optional Sections\n\nAdd only if truly needed:\n- API route patterns (show template, not explanation)\n- CLI commands (table format)\n- File naming conventions\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\nOmit these:\n- \"Welcome to...\" or \"This document explains...\"\n- \"You should...\" or \"Remember to...\"\n- Content duplicated from skills (reference instead)\n- Obvious instructions (\"run tests\", \"write clean code\")\n- Explanations of why (just say what)\n- Long prose paragraphs\n\n## Example Structure\n\n```markdown\n# Agent Instructions\n\n## Package Manager\nUse **pnpm**: `pnpm install`, `pnpm dev`\n\n## Commit Attribution\nAI commits MUST include:\n```\nCo-Authored-By: (the agent model''s name and attribution byline)\n```\n\n## API Routes\n[Template code block]\n\n## Database\nUse `db-migrate` skill. See `.claude/skills/db-migrate/SKILL.md`\n\n## Testing\nUse `write-tests` skill. See `.claude/skills/write-tests/SKILL.md`\n\n## CLI\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `pnpm cli sync` | Sync data |\n```\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:10:32.820Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"agents-md 技能：创建和维护 AGENTS.md 文档","ja":"agents-md スキル：AGENTS.md ドキュメントの作成とメンテナンス","ko":"agents-md 스킬: AGENTS.md 문서 생성 및 유지","es":"AGENTS.md: Guía para Documentación de Agentes","fr":"AGENTS.md : Guide pour la Documentation des Agents","de":"AGENTS.md: Leitfaden für Agenten-Dokumentation","pt":"Criar AGENTS.md: Guia de Documentação Mínima","ru":"Создание AGENTS.md: Руководство по минималистичной докуме...","ar":"إنشاء AGENTS.md: دليل للتوثيق المحدود","en":"agents-md"},"description":{"zh":"agents-md 技能用于创建和维护 AGENTS.md 文档，确保代理文档的简洁和完整","ja":"AGENTS.md ドキュメントの作成とメンテナンスを容易にする agents-md スキル","ko":"agents-md 스킬은 AGENTS.md 문서 생성 및 유지 보수를 쉽게 해줍니다","es":"AGENTS.md es la documentación oficial para agentes, manténla minimalista y enfócate en la descubierta de habilidades locales","fr":"AGENTS.md est la documentation officielle pour les agents, maintenez-la minimaliste et concentrez-vous sur la découverte des compétences locales","de":"AGENTS.md ist die offizielle Dokumentation für Agenten, halten Sie sie minimal und konzentrieren Sie sich auf die Entdeckung lokaler Fähigkeiten","pt":"O arquivo AGENTS.md é a documentação oficial para agentes. Mantenha-o minimalista e conciso.","ru":"Файл AGENTS.md является официальной документацией для агентов. Держите его минималистичным и кратким.","ar":"الملف AGENTS.md هو التوثيق الرسمي للوكلاء. احتفظ به بأسلوب محدد ومختصر.","en":"This skill should be used when the user asks to create AGENTS.md, update AGENTS.md, maintain agent docs, set up CLAUDE.md, or needs to keep agent instruction..."},"definition":{"en":"This skill should be used when the user asks to create AGENTS.md, update AGENTS.md, maintain agent docs, set up CLAUDE.md, or needs to keep agent instructions concise. Guides discovery of local skills and enforces minimal documentation style."},"features":{"zh":["创建和更新 AGENTS.md 文档","维护代理文档","保持指令简洁","发现本地技能","创建 CLAUDE.md 链接"],"ja":["AGENTS.md ドキュメントの作成と更新","エージェント ドキュメントのメンテナンス","指示の簡素化","ローカル スキルの検出","CLAUDE.md のリンクを作成"],"ko":["AGENTS.md 문서 생성 및 업데이트","에이전트 문서 유지 보수","지침 단순화","로컬 스킬 검색","CLAUDE.md 링크 생성"],"es":["Creación de AGENTS.md en la raíz del proyecto","Configuración de enlaces simbólicos para CLAUDE.md","Descubierta de habilidades locales","Estilo de documentación minimalista","Guía para escritura de documentación efectiva"],"fr":["Création de AGENTS.md à la racine du projet","Configuration de liens symboliques pour CLAUDE.md","Découverte de compétences locales","Style de documentation minimaliste","Guide pour l''écriture de documentation efficace"],"de":["Erstellung von AGENTS.md im Projektverzeichnis","Einrichtung von Symbolverknüpfungen für CLAUDE.md","Entdeckung lokaler Fähigkeiten","Minimalistischer Dokumentationsstil","Leitfaden für effektive Dokumentation"],"pt":["Criação do arquivo AGENTS.md","Configuração do arquivo CLAUDE.md","Descoberta de habilidades locais","Estilo de documentação minimalista","Manutenção de instruções concisas","Referência a habilidades de agente"],"ru":["Создание файла AGENTS.md","Настройка файла CLAUDE.md","Обнаружение локальных навыков","Минималистичный стиль документации","Поддержание кратких инструкций","Ссылка на навыки агента"],"ar":["إنشاء ملف AGENTS.md","تكوين ملف CLAUDE.md","اكتشاف المهارات المحلية","أسلوب توثيق محدد","صيانة تعليمات محددة","مرجع إلى مهارات الوكيل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["agents-md","AGENTS.md","代理文档","文档维护","指令简洁","本地技能","CLAUDE.md"],"ja":["agents-md","AGENTS.md","エージェント ドキュメント","ドキュメント メンテナンス","指示の簡素化","ローカル スキル","CLAUDE.md"],"ko":["agents-md","AGENTS.md","에이전트 문서","문서 유지 보수","지침 단순화","로컬 스킬","CLAUDE.md"],"es":["AGENTS.md","documentación de agentes","descubierta de habilidades","estilo minimalista","guía de escritura","desarrollo de proyectos","documentación de proyectos"],"fr":["AGENTS.md","documentation d''agents","découverte de compétences","style minimaliste","guide d''écriture","développement de projets","documentation de projets"],"de":["AGENTS.md","Agenten-Dokumentation","Entdeckung lokaler Fähigkeiten","minimalistischer Stil","Leitfaden für Dokumentation","Projektentwicklung","Projekt-Dokumentation"],"pt":["AGENTS.md","documentação minimalista","agentes capazes","criação de arquivo","configuração de arquivo","descoberta de habilidades","manutenção de instruções","referência a habilidades","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["AGENTS.md","минималистичная документация","способные агенты","создание файла","настройка файла","обнаружение навыков","поддержание инструкций","ссылка на навыки","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["AGENTS.md","توثيق محدد","وكلاء قادرون","إنشاء ملف","تكوين ملف","اكتشاف مهارات","صيانة تعليمات","مرجع إلى مهارات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing to maintain concise documentation and discover local skills.","zh":"非常适合需要维护简洁文档和发现本地技能的AI代理。","ja":"コンサイスなドキュメントを維持し、ローカルスキルを発見する必要があるAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"간결한 문서를 유지하고 로컬 스킬을 발견해야 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan mantener documentación concisa y descubrir habilidades locales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA qui ont besoin de maintenir une documentation concise et de découvrir des compétences locales.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine knappe Dokumentation aufrechterhalten und lokale Fähigkeiten entdecken müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam manter documentação concisa e descobrir habilidades locais.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимо поддерживать краткую документацию и обнаруживать локальные навыки.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى الحفاظ على وثائق موجزة واكتشاف المهارات المحلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and update AGENTS.md files efficiently, utilizing minimal documentation style and enforcing standardization through symlink creation, while discovering local skills via bash commands and referencing their frontmatter.","zh":"赋予代理生成和更新AGENTS.md文件的能力，使用最小的文档样式，并通过软链接创建强制标准化，同时通过bash命令发现本地技能并引用其前置内容。","ja":"エージェントがAGENTS.mdファイルを効率的に生成および更新できるようにし、最小のドキュメントスタイルを使用して標準化を強制し、シンボリックリンクの作成を通じて標準化を施行し、bashコマンドを使用してローカルスキルを発見し、それらのフロントマターを参照します。","ko":"에이전트가 효율적으로 AGENTS.md 파일을 생성 및 업데이트할 수 있도록 하며, 최소한의 문서 스타일을 사용하여 표준화를 강제하고 심볼릭 링크 생성을 통해 표준화를 적용하며, bash 명령어를 사용하여 로컬 스킬을 발견하고 해당 프론트매터를 참조합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y actualizar archivos AGENTS.md de manera eficiente, utilizando un estilo de documentación mínimo y aplicando estandarización a través de la creación de enlaces simbólicos, mientras descubren habilidades locales a través de comandos de bash y hacen referencia a su frontmatter.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de mettre à jour des fichiers AGENTS.md de manière efficace, en utilisant un style de documentation minimal et en appliquant une standardisation via la création de liens symboliques, tout en découvrant des compétences locales via des commandes bash et en référençant leur frontmatter.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, AGENTS.md-Dateien effizient zu generieren und zu aktualisieren, indem sie einen minimalen Dokumentationsstil verwenden und Standardisierung durch die Erstellung von Symbolverknüpfungen durchsetzen, während sie lokale Fähigkeiten über Bash-Befehle entdecken und auf deren Frontmatter verweisen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e atualizar arquivos AGENTS.md de forma eficiente, utilizando estilo de documentação mínima e aplicando padronização por meio da criação de links simbólicos, enquanto descobrem habilidades locais por meio de comandos bash e fazem referência ao frontmatter.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно генерировать и обновлять файлы AGENTS.md, используя минимальный стиль документации и обеспечивая стандартизацию посредством создания символических ссылок, а также обнаруживая локальные навыки через команды bash и ссылаясь на frontmatter.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد وتحديث ملفات AGENTS.md بفعالية، باستخدام أسلوب توثيق мінімي وتطبيق معايير عبر إنشاء روابط رمزية، وفي الوقت نفسه اكتشاف المهارات المحلية من خلال أوامر الباش والاطلاع على.frontmatter."},"useCases":{"en":["Updating AGENTS.md for new agent onboarding","Creating symlinks for CLAUDE.md compatibility","Discovering local skills for documentation purposes"],"zh":["为新代理员工更新AGENTS.md","为CLAUDE.md兼容性创建软链接","为文档目的发现本地技能"],"ja":["新しいエージェントのオンボーディングのためにAGENTS.mdを更新する","CLAUDE.mdの互換性のためにシンボリックリンクを作成する","ドキュメントの目的でローカルスキルを発見する"],"ko":["새 에이전트 온보딩을 위해 AGENTS.md 업데이트하기","CLAUDE.md 호환성을 위해 심볼릭 링크 생성하기","문서 목적으로 로컬 스킬 발견하기"],"es":["Actualizar AGENTS.md para la integración de nuevos agentes","Crear enlaces simbólicos para la compatibilidad con CLAUDE.md","Descubrir habilidades locales con fines de documentación"],"fr":["Mettre à jour AGENTS.md pour l''intégration de nouveaux agents","Créer des liens symboliques pour la compatibilité avec CLAUDE.md","Découvrir des compétences locales à des fins de documentation"],"de":["AGENTS.md für die Integration neuer Agenten aktualisieren","Erstellen von Symbolverknüpfungen für die Kompatibilität mit CLAUDE.md","Entdecken lokaler Fähigkeiten zu Dokumentationszwecken"],"pt":["Atualizar AGENTS.md para integração de novos agentes","Criar links simbólicos para compatibilidade com CLAUDE.md","Descobrir habilidades locais para fins de documentação"],"ru":["Обновление AGENTS.md для интеграции новых агентов","Создание символических ссылок для совместимости с CLAUDE.md","Обнаружение локальных навыков для целей документации"],"ar":["تحديث AGENTS.md لتكامل وكلاء جدد","إنشاء روابط رمزية للتوافق مع CLAUDE.md","اكتشاف المهارات المحلية لأغراض التوثيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access for file creation and modification","Limited to Markdown file format"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限以创建和修改文件","仅限于Markdown文件格式"],"ja":["ファイルの作成および変更のためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","Markdownファイル形式のみに限定される"],"ko":["파일 생성 및 수정을 위해 파일 시스템 액세스 권한이 필요함","Markdown 파일 형식만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para la creación y modificación de archivos","Limitado al formato de archivo Markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour la création et la modification de fichiers","Limité au format de fichier Markdown"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem für die Erstellung und Änderung von Dateien","Begrenzt auf das Markdown-Dateiformat"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos para criação e modificação de arquivos","Limitado ao formato de arquivo Markdown"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе для создания и модификации файлов","Ограничен форматом файла Markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لإنشاء وتعديل الملفات","محدود بالتنسيق Markdown"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"35d79ad94d0fa6191faea384d627ba9815bdfac8402ed2bb77a778f357eb18f1","repoEtag":"W/\"2a524a36d10d78094c72f484233406f0cd4722cd88b5444674b33d0b91d29676\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('getsentry/skills/claude-settings-audit', 'official', 'getsentry', 'skills', 'getsentry/skills', 'claude-settings-audit', 302, 7, 100, '2026-02-24T10:49:39Z', '2026-02-24T12:13:24.905Z', '767ec8e9ade624311354f5664885a7cb9c266a22736e23348f76d01d660e79e7', '{"id":"getsentry/skills/claude-settings-audit","name":"claude-settings-audit","description":{"zh":"Claude代码设置审计是一种自动化工具，用于检测技术栈、构建工具和单体仓库结构，生成推荐的Claude Code设置","ja":"Claudeコード設定監査は、テクノロジースタック、ビルドツール、モノレポ構造を検出して、推奨のClaude Code設定を生成する自動化ツールです","ko":"클로드 코드 설정 감사는 기술 스택, 빌드 도구 및 모노리포 구조를 감지하여 클로드 코드 설정을 추천하는 자동화 도구입니다","es":"El audit de configuración de Claude analiza un repositorio para generar recomendaciones de configuración de settings.json. Detecta la pila tecnológica, herramientas de compilación y estructura de monorepo","fr":"L''audit de configuration de Claude analyse un référentiel pour générer des recommandations de configuration de settings.json. Il détecte la pile technologique, les outils de construction et la structure de monorepo","de":"Der Claude-Konfigurationsaudit analysiert ein Repository, um Empfehlungen für die Konfiguration von settings.json zu generieren. Er erkennt die Technologie-Stack, Build-Tools und Monorepo-Struktur","pt":"O Claude Settings Audit é uma ferramenta que analisa o repositório e gera configurações recomendadas de permissões para comandos somente leitura","ru":"Аудит настроек Claude - это инструмент, который анализирует репозиторий и генерирует рекомендуемые настройки прав доступа для команд только для чтения","ar":"تدقيق إعدادات Claude هو أداة تحليل مستودع وتوليد إعدادات صلاحيات موصى بها للأوامر القراءة فقط","en":"Analyze a repository to generate recommended Claude Code settings.json permissions. Use when setting up a new project, auditing existing settings, or determining which read-only bash commands to allow. Detects tech stack, build tools, and monorepo structure."},"owner":"getsentry","repo":"skills","repoPath":"getsentry/skills","stars":302,"forks":7,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T10:49:39Z","topics":["tag-production"],"skillMd":{"name":"claude-settings-audit","description":"Analyze a repository to generate recommended Claude Code settings.json permissions. Use when setting up a new project, auditing existing settings, or determining which read-only bash commands to allow. Detects tech stack, build tools, and monorepo structure.","bodyPreview":"# Claude Settings Audit\n\nAnalyze this repository and generate recommended Claude Code `settings.json` permissions for read-only commands.\n\n## Phase 1: Detect Tech Stack\n\nRun these commands to detect the repository structure:\n\n```bash\nls -la\nfind . -maxdepth 2 \\( -name \"*.toml\" -o -name \"*.json\" -o -name \"*.lock\" -o -name \"*.yaml\" -o -name \"*.yml\" -o -name \"Makefile\" -o -name \"Dockerfile\" -o -name \"*.tf\" \\) 2>/dev/null | head -50\n```\n\nCheck for these indicator files:\n\n| Category     | Files to Ch","body":"# Claude Settings Audit\n\nAnalyze this repository and generate recommended Claude Code `settings.json` permissions for read-only commands.\n\n## Phase 1: Detect Tech Stack\n\nRun these commands to detect the repository structure:\n\n```bash\nls -la\nfind . -maxdepth 2 \\( -name \"*.toml\" -o -name \"*.json\" -o -name \"*.lock\" -o -name \"*.yaml\" -o -name \"*.yml\" -o -name \"Makefile\" -o -name \"Dockerfile\" -o -name \"*.tf\" \\) 2>/dev/null | head -50\n```\n\nCheck for these indicator files:\n\n| Category     | Files to Check                                                                        |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Python**   | `pyproject.toml`, `setup.py`, `requirements.txt`, `Pipfile`, `poetry.lock`, `uv.lock` |\n| **Node.js**  | `package.json`, `package-lock.json`, `yarn.lock`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`                    |\n| **Go**       | `go.mod`, `go.sum`                                                                    |\n| **Rust**     | `Cargo.toml`, `Cargo.lock`                                                            |\n| **Ruby**     | `Gemfile`, `Gemfile.lock`                                                             |\n| **Java**     | `pom.xml`, `build.gradle`, `build.gradle.kts`                                         |\n| **Build**    | `Makefile`, `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml`                                        |\n| **Infra**    | `*.tf` files, `kubernetes/`, `helm/`                                                  |\n| **Monorepo** | `lerna.json`, `nx.json`, `turbo.json`, `pnpm-workspace.yaml`                          |\n\n## Phase 2: Detect Services\n\nCheck for service integrations:\n\n| Service    | Detection                                                                       |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Sentry** | `sentry-sdk` in deps, `@sentry/*` packages, `.sentryclirc`, `sentry.properties` |\n| **Linear** | Linear config files, `.linear/` directory                                       |\n\nRead dependency files to identify frameworks:\n\n- `package.json` → check `dependencies` and `devDependencies`\n- `pyproject.toml` → check `[project.dependencies]` or `[tool.poetry.dependencies]`\n- `Gemfile` → check gem names\n- `Cargo.toml` → check `[dependencies]`\n\n## Phase 3: Check Existing Settings\n\n```bash\ncat .claude/settings.json 2>/dev/null || echo \"No existing settings\"\n```\n\n## Phase 4: Generate Recommendations\n\nBuild the allow list by combining:\n\n### Baseline Commands (Always Include)\n\n```json\n[\n  \"Bash(ls:*)\",\n  \"Bash(pwd:*)\",\n  \"Bash(find:*)\",\n  \"Bash(file:*)\",\n  \"Bash(stat:*)\",\n  \"Bash(wc:*)\",\n  \"Bash(head:*)\",\n  \"Bash(tail:*)\",\n  \"Bash(cat:*)\",\n  \"Bash(tree:*)\",\n  \"Bash(git status:*)\",\n  \"Bash(git log:*)\",\n  \"Bash(git diff:*)\",\n  \"Bash(git show:*)\",\n  \"Bash(git branch:*)\",\n  \"Bash(git remote:*)\",\n  \"Bash(git tag:*)\",\n  \"Bash(git stash list:*)\",\n  \"Bash(git rev-parse:*)\",\n  \"Bash(gh pr view:*)\",\n  \"Bash(gh pr list:*)\",\n  \"Bash(gh pr checks:*)\",\n  \"Bash(gh pr diff:*)\",\n  \"Bash(gh issue view:*)\",\n  \"Bash(gh issue list:*)\",\n  \"Bash(gh run view:*)\",\n  \"Bash(gh run list:*)\",\n  \"Bash(gh run logs:*)\",\n  \"Bash(gh repo view:*)\",\n  \"Bash(gh api:*)\"\n]\n```\n\n### Stack-Specific Commands\n\nOnly include commands for tools actually detected in the project.\n\n#### Python (if any Python files or config detected)\n\n| If Detected                        | Add These Commands                      |\n| ---------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| Any Python                         | `python --version`, `python3 --version` |\n| `poetry.lock`                      | `poetry show`, `poetry env info`        |\n| `uv.lock`                          | `uv pip list`, `uv tree`                |\n| `Pipfile.lock`                     | `pipenv graph`                          |\n| `requirements.txt` (no other lock) | `pip list`, `pip show`, `pip freeze`    |\n\n#### Node.js (if package.json detected)\n\n| If Detected                  | Add These Commands                     |\n| ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| Any Node.js                  | `node --version`                       |\n| `pnpm-lock.yaml`             | `pnpm list`, `pnpm why`                |\n| `yarn.lock`                  | `yarn list`, `yarn info`, `yarn why`   |\n| `package-lock.json`          | `npm list`, `npm view`, `npm outdated` |\n| TypeScript (`tsconfig.json`) | `tsc --version`                        |\n\n#### Other Languages\n\n| If Detected    | Add These Commands                                                   |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `go.mod`       | `go version`, `go list`, `go mod graph`, `go env`                    |\n| `Cargo.toml`   | `rustc --version`, `cargo --version`, `cargo tree`, `cargo metadata` |\n| `Gemfile`      | `ruby --version`, `bundle list`, `bundle show`                       |\n| `pom.xml`      | `java --version`, `mvn --version`, `mvn dependency:tree`             |\n| `build.gradle` | `java --version`, `gradle --version`, `gradle dependencies`          |\n\n#### Build Tools\n\n| If Detected          | Add These Commands                                                   |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Dockerfile`         | `docker --version`, `docker ps`, `docker images`                     |\n| `docker-compose.yml` | `docker-compose ps`, `docker-compose config`                         |\n| `*.tf` files         | `terraform --version`, `terraform providers`, `terraform state list` |\n| `Makefile`           | `make --version`, `make -n`                                          |\n\n### Skills (for Sentry Projects)\n\nIf this is a Sentry project (or sentry-skills plugin is installed), include:\n\n```json\n[\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:commit)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:create-pr)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:code-review)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:find-bugs)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:iterate-pr)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:claude-settings-audit)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:agents-md)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:brand-guidelines)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:doc-coauthoring)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:security-review)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:django-perf-review)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:code-simplifier)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:skill-creator)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:skill-scanner)\",\n  \"Skill(sentry-skills:blog-writing-guide)\"\n]\n```\n\n### WebFetch Domains\n\n#### Always Include (Sentry Projects)\n\n```json\n[\n  \"WebFetch(domain:docs.sentry.io)\",\n  \"WebFetch(domain:develop.sentry.dev)\",\n  \"WebFetch(domain:docs.github.com)\",\n  \"WebFetch(domain:cli.github.com)\"\n]\n```\n\n#### Framework-Specific\n\n| If Detected    | Add Domains                                     |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Django**     | `docs.djangoproject.com`                        |\n| **Flask**      | `flask.palletsprojects.com`                     |\n| **FastAPI**    | `fastapi.tiangolo.com`                          |\n| **React**      | `react.dev`                                     |\n| **Next.js**    | `nextjs.org`                                    |\n| **Vue**        | `vuejs.org`                                     |\n| **Express**    | `expressjs.com`                                 |\n| **Rails**      | `guides.rubyonrails.org`, `api.rubyonrails.org` |\n| **Go**         | `pkg.go.dev`                                    |\n| **Rust**       | `docs.rs`, `doc.rust-lang.org`                  |\n| **Docker**     | `docs.docker.com`                               |\n| **Kubernetes** | `kubernetes.io`                                 |\n| **Terraform**  | `registry.terraform.io`                         |\n\n### MCP Server Suggestions\n\nMCP servers are configured in `.mcp.json` (not `settings.json`). Check for existing config:\n\n```bash\ncat .mcp.json 2>/dev/null || echo \"No existing .mcp.json\"\n```\n\n#### Sentry MCP (if Sentry SDK detected)\n\nAdd to `.mcp.json` (replace `{org-slug}` and `{project-slug}` with your Sentry organization and project slugs):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"sentry\": {\n      \"type\": \"http\",\n      \"url\": \"https://mcp.sentry.dev/mcp/{org-slug}/{project-slug}\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### Linear MCP (if Linear usage detected)\n\nAdd to `.mcp.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"linear\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@linear/mcp-server\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"LINEAR_API_KEY\": \"${LINEAR_API_KEY}\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Note**: Never suggest GitHub MCP. Always use `gh` CLI commands for GitHub.\n\n## Output Format\n\nPresent your findings as:\n\n1. **Summary Table** - What was detected\n2. **Recommended settings.json** - Complete JSON ready to copy\n3. **MCP Suggestions** - If applicable\n4. **Merge Instructions** - If existing settings found\n\nExample output structure:\n\n```markdown\n## Detected Tech Stack\n\n| Category        | Found          |\n| --------------- | -------------- |\n| Languages       | Python 3.x     |\n| Package Manager | poetry         |\n| Frameworks      | Django, Celery |\n| Services        | Sentry         |\n| Build Tools     | Docker, Make   |\n\n## Recommended .claude/settings.json\n\n\\`\\`\\`json\n{\n\"permissions\": {\n\"allow\": [\n// ... grouped by category with comments\n],\n\"deny\": []\n}\n}\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Recommended .mcp.json (if applicable)\n\nIf you use Sentry or Linear, add the MCP config to `.mcp.json`...\n```\n\n## Important Rules\n\n### What to Include\n\n- Only READ-ONLY commands that cannot modify state\n- Only tools that are actually used by the project (detected via lock files)\n- Standard system commands (ls, cat, find, etc.)\n- The `:*` suffix allows any arguments to the base command\n\n### What to NEVER Include\n\n- **Absolute paths** - Never include user-specific paths like `/home/user/scripts/foo` or `/Users/name/bin/bar`\n- **Custom scripts** - Never include project scripts that may have side effects (e.g., `./scripts/deploy.sh`)\n- **Alternative package managers** - If the project uses pnpm, do NOT include npm/yarn commands\n- **Commands that modify state** - No install, build, run, write, or delete commands\n\n### Package Manager Rules\n\nOnly include the package manager actually used by the project:\n\n| If Detected         | Include         | Do NOT Include                         |\n| ------------------- | --------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `pnpm-lock.yaml`    | pnpm commands   | npm, yarn                              |\n| `yarn.lock`         | yarn commands   | npm, pnpm                              |\n| `package-lock.json` | npm commands    | yarn, pnpm                             |\n| `poetry.lock`       | poetry commands | pip (unless also has requirements.txt) |\n| `uv.lock`           | uv commands     | pip, poetry                            |\n| `Pipfile.lock`      | pipenv commands | pip, poetry                            |\n\nIf multiple lock files exist, include only the commands for each detected manager.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:13:24.905Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Claude代码设置审计","ja":"Claudeコード設定監査","ko":"클로드 코드 설정 감사","es":"Audit de configuración de Claude","fr":"Audit de configuration Claude","de":"Claude-Konfigurationsaudit","pt":"Claude Settings Audit: Otimização de Permissões","ru":"Аудит Настроек Claude: Оптимизация Прав доступа","ar":"تدقيق إعدادات Claude: تحسين الصلاحيات","en":"claude-settings-audit"},"description":{"zh":"Claude代码设置审计是一种自动化工具，用于检测技术栈、构建工具和单体仓库结构，生成推荐的Claude Code设置","ja":"Claudeコード設定監査は、テクノロジースタック、ビルドツール、モノレポ構造を検出して、推奨のClaude Code設定を生成する自動化ツールです","ko":"클로드 코드 설정 감사는 기술 스택, 빌드 도구 및 모노리포 구조를 감지하여 클로드 코드 설정을 추천하는 자동화 도구입니다","es":"El audit de configuración de Claude analiza un repositorio para generar recomendaciones de configuración de settings.json. Detecta la pila tecnológica, herra...","fr":"L''audit de configuration de Claude analyse un référentiel pour générer des recommandations de configuration de settings.json. Il détecte la pile technologiqu...","de":"Der Claude-Konfigurationsaudit analysiert ein Repository, um Empfehlungen für die Konfiguration von settings.json zu generieren. Er erkennt die Technologie-S...","pt":"O Claude Settings Audit é uma ferramenta que analisa o repositório e gera configurações recomendadas de permissões para comandos somente leitura","ru":"Аудит настроек Claude - это инструмент, который анализирует репозиторий и генерирует рекомендуемые настройки прав доступа для команд только для чтения","ar":"تدقيق إعدادات Claude هو أداة تحليل مستودع وتوليد إعدادات صلاحيات موصى بها للأوامر القراءة فقط","en":"Analyze a repository to generate recommended Claude Code settings.json permissions. Use when setting up a new project, auditing existing settings, or determi..."},"definition":{"en":"Analyze a repository to generate recommended Claude Code settings.json permissions. Use when setting up a new project, auditing existing settings, or determining which read-only bash commands to allow. Detects tech stack, build tools, and monorepo structure."},"features":{"zh":["自动化代码设置审计","检测技术栈和构建工具","生成推荐的Claude Code设置","支持单体仓库结构检测","可用于新项目设置、现有设置审计和只读命令允许"],"ja":["コード設定を自動化","テクノロジースタックとビルドツールを検出","推奨のClaude Code設定を生成","モノレポ構造の検出をサポート","新規プロジェクトの設定、既存の設定の監査、読み取り専用コマンドの許可に使用可能"],"ko":["코드 설정을 자동화","기술 스택 및 빌드 도구를 감지","클로드 코드 설정을 추천","모노리포 구조 감지를 지원","새 프로젝트 설정, 기존 설정 감사, 읽기 전용 명령 허용에 사용 가능"],"es":["Análisis de la estructura del repositorio","Detección de la pila tecnológica","Detección de herramientas de compilación","Detección de la estructura de monorepo","Generación de recomendaciones de configuración de settings.json","Mejora de la seguridad del proyecto"],"fr":["Analyse de la structure du référentiel","Détection de la pile technologique","Détection des outils de construction","Détection de la structure de monorepo","Génération de recommandations de configuration de settings.json","Amélioration de la sécurité du projet"],"de":["Analyse der Repository-Struktur","Erkennung der Technologie-Stack","Erkennung von Build-Tools","Erkennung der Monorepo-Struktur","Generierung von Empfehlungen für die Konfiguration von settings.json","Verbesserung der Projektsicherheit"],"pt":["Análise de repositório para geração de configurações de permissões","Detecção de tecnologias e ferramentas de construção","Estrutura de monorepo","Comandos somente leitura","Otimização de permissões"],"ru":["Анализ репозитория для генерации настроек прав доступа","Обнаружение технологий и инструментов сборки","Структура монорепа","Команды только для чтения","Оптимизация прав доступа"],"ar":["تحليل المستودع لتوليد إعدادات الصلاحيات","اكتشاف التكنولوجيا وأدوات البناء","هيكل مونوريبو","أوامر القراءة فقط","تحسين الصلاحيات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Claude代码设置审计","代码设置自动化","技术栈检测","构建工具检测","单体仓库结构检测","代码安全"],"ja":["Claudeコード設定監査","コード設定自動化","テクノロジースタックの検出","ビルドツールの検出","モノレポ構造の検出","コードのセキュリティ"],"ko":["클로드 코드 설정 감사","코드 설정 자동화","기술 스택 감지","빌드 도구 감지","모노리포 구조 감지","코드 보안"],"es":["audit de configuración","seguridad del proyecto","configuración de settings.json","análisis de repositorio","detección de tecnologías","mejora de la seguridad","desarrollo de software","seguridad de código"],"fr":["audit de configuration","sécurité du projet","configuration de settings.json","analyse de référentiel","détection de technologies","amélioration de la sécurité","développement de logiciels","sécurité de code"],"de":["Konfigurationsaudit","Projektsicherheit","Konfiguration von settings.json","Repository-Analyse","Technologie-Erkennung","Sicherheitsverbesserung","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Sicherheit"],"pt":["Claude Settings Audit","otimização de permissões","segurança de repositório","auditoria de permissões","comandos somente leitura","tecnologias de construção","monorepo"],"ru":["Аудит настроек Claude","оптимизация прав доступа","безопасность репозитория","аудит прав доступа","команды только для чтения","технологии сборки","монорепа"],"ar":["تدقيق إعدادات Claude","تحسين الصلاحيات","أمان المستودع","تدقيق الصلاحيات","أوامر القراءة فقط","تكنولوجيا البناء","مونوريبو"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Claude Code Configuration Agents that need automated repository analysis for permission optimization.","zh":"适用于需要自动仓库分析以进行权限优化的 Claude Code 配置代理。","ja":"Claude Code 構成エージェントが自動リポジトリ分析を必要とする場合に不可欠です。","ko":"권한 최적화를 위한 자동 저장소 분석이 필요한 Claude Code 구성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de configuración de Claude Code que necesitan un análisis de repositorio automatizado para la optimización de permisos.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de configuration Claude Code qui ont besoin d''une analyse de référentiel automatisée pour l''optimisation des autorisations.","de":"Wichtig für Claude Code-Konfigurationsagenten, die eine automatisierte Repository-Analyse für die Optimierung von Berechtigungen benötigen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Configuração de Código Claude que precisam de análise de repositório automatizada para otimização de permissões.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов конфигурации кода Claude, которым требуется автоматический анализ репозитория для оптимизации разрешений.","ar":"ضروري لعميل تكوين كلاود كلود الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل مستودع آلي لتحسين الصلاحيات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Automatically detects tech stacks and monorepo structures through comprehensive file analysis (.toml, .json, .lock, .yaml, Makefile, Dockerfile, .tf files) to generate precise read-only bash command permissions. Provides intelligent settings.json configuration based on actual project requirements rather than generic defaults.","zh":"通过对 .toml、.json、.lock、.yaml、Makefile、Dockerfile、.tf 文件的全面文件分析，自动检测技术栈和 monorepo 结构，以生成精确的只读 bash 命令权限。根据实际项目需求而非通用默认值提供智能的 settings.json 配置。","ja":"comprehensive file analysis (.toml、.json、.lock、.yaml、Makefile、Dockerfile、.tf ファイル) を介して、tech stacks や monorepo 構造を自動的に検出して、正確な read-only bash コマンドの権限を生成します。実際のプロジェクト要件に基づいて、汎用の既定値ではなく、インテリジェントな settings.json 構成を提供します。","ko":"comprehensive file analysis (.toml, .json, .lock, .yaml, Makefile, Dockerfile, .tf 파일)를 통해 기술 스택과 모노리포 구조를 자동으로检测하여 정확한 읽기 전용 bash 명령 권한을 생성합니다. 실제 프로젝트 요구 사항에 따라 일반 기본값이 아닌 지능형 settings.json 구성 제공합니다.","es":"Detecta automáticamente las pilas tecnológicas y las estructuras de monorepo a través de un análisis de archivos completo (.toml, .json, .lock, .yaml, Makefile, Dockerfile, .tf files) para generar permisos de comando bash de solo lectura precisos. Proporciona una configuración inteligente de settings.json basada en los requisitos reales del proyecto en lugar de valores predeterminados genéricos.","fr":"Detecte automatiquement les piles technologiques et les structures de monorepo grâce à une analyse de fichiers complète (.toml, .json, .lock, .yaml, Makefile, Dockerfile, .tf files) pour générer des autorisations de commande bash en lecture seule précises. Fournit une configuration intelligente de settings.json basée sur les exigences réelles du projet plutôt que sur des valeurs par défaut génériques.","de":"Ermittelt automatisch die Technologiestapel und Monorepo-Strukturen durch eine umfassende Dateianalyse (.toml, .json, .lock, .yaml, Makefile, Dockerfile, .tf-Dateien), um präzise Leseberechtigungen für Bash-Befehle zu generieren. Bietet eine intelligente settings.json-Konfiguration basierend auf den tatsächlichen Projektanforderungen anstelle generischer Standardwerte.","pt":"Detecta automaticamente pilhas de tecnologia e estruturas de monorepo por meio de análise de arquivos abrangente (.toml, .json, .lock, .yaml, Makefile, Dockerfile, arquivos .tf) para gerar permissões de comando bash somente leitura precisas. Fornece configuração inteligente do settings.json com base nas necessidades reais do projeto, em vez de configurações padrão genéricas.","ru":"Автоматически обнаруживает технологические стеки и структуры монореpositorия посредством всестороннего анализа файлов (.toml, .json, .lock, .yaml, Makefile, Dockerfile, файлы .tf), чтобы сгенерировать точные разрешения только для чтения команд bash. Предоставляет интеллектуальную настройку settings.json на основе фактических требований проекта, а не общих стандартных настроек.","ar":"يكتشف تلقائيًا هياكل التكنولوجيا ومονو ريبوزيتوري من خلال تحليل ملفات شامل (.toml, .json, .lock, .yaml, Makefile, Dockerfile, ملفات .tf) لتوليد أذونات bash للقراءة فقط الدقيقة. يوفر إعدادات ذكية settings.json بناءً على متطلبات المشروع الفعلية بدلاً من الإعدادات الافتراضية العامة."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing existing Claude Code settings for security compliance","Generating optimized permissions for new project setups","Determining safe read-only bash commands for specific tech stacks","Detecting monorepo structures for granular access control"],"zh":["审计现有的 Claude Code 设置以进行安全合规性检查","为新项目设置生成优化的权限","确定特定技术栈的安全读取のみ bash 命令","检测 monorepo 结构以进行细粒度访问控制"],"ja":["セキュリティ コンプライアンスのために既存の Claude Code 設定を監査する","新しいプロジェクト設定用に最適化された権限を生成する","特定の tech stacks 用に安全な read-only bash コマンドを決定する","細粒度のアクセス制御のために monorepo 構造を検出する"],"ko":["보안 규정 준수를 위해 기존 Claude Code 설정을 감사합니다.","새 프로젝트 설정을 위한 최적의 권한 생성","특정 기술 스택에 대한 안전한 읽기 전용 bash 명령 결정","세부적인 접근 제어를 위한 모노리포 구조 감지"],"es":["Auditoría de la configuración existente de Claude Code para el cumplimiento de la seguridad","Generación de permisos optimizados para la configuración de nuevos proyectos","Determinación de comandos bash de solo lectura seguros para pilas tecnológicas específicas","Detección de estructuras de monorepo para un control de acceso granular"],"fr":["Audit des paramètres existants de Claude Code pour la conformité aux exigences de sécurité","Génération d''autorisations optimisées pour la configuration de nouveaux projets","Détermination de commandes bash en lecture seule sûres pour des piles technologiques spécifiques","Détecter les structures de monorepo pour un contrôle d''accès granulaire"],"de":["Prüfung der bestehenden Claude Code-Konfiguration auf Sicherheitskonformität","Generierung optimierter Berechtigungen für die Einrichtung neuer Projekte","Bestimmung sicherer Leseberechtigungen für Bash-Befehle für bestimmte Technologiestapel","Erkennung von Monorepo-Strukturen für eine granulare Zugriffskontrolle"],"pt":["Auditoria de configurações de código Claude existentes para conformidade de segurança","Geração de permissões otimizadas para configurações de projeto novas","Determinação de comandos bash seguros somente leitura para pilhas de tecnologia específicas","Detecção de estruturas de monorepo para controle de acesso granular"],"ru":["Аудит существующих конфигураций кода Claude для соблюдения требований безопасности","Генерация оптимизированных разрешений для новых настроек проекта","Определение безопасных команд bash только для чтения для конкретных технологических стеков","Обнаружение структур монореpositorия для детального контроля доступа"],"ar":["تدقيق إعدادات كود كلود كلود الحالية لامتثال أمان","توليد صلاحيات محسنة لإعدادات مشروع جديدة","تحديد أوامر bash آمنة للقراءة فقط لهياكل تكنولوجية محددة","كشف هياكل مونو ريبوزيتوري للتحكم في الوصول المتقن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires filesystem access for repository analysis","Limited to detecting technologies through specific file patterns","Maxdepth 2 restriction may miss nested project structures","Read-only command focus excludes write permission recommendations"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限以进行仓库分析","仅限通过特定文件模式检测技术","Maxdepth 2 限制可能会错过嵌套的项目结构","只读命令焦点排除写入权限推荐"],"ja":["リポジトリ分析のためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","特定のファイル パターンを介して技術を検出することのみに限定","Maxdepth 2 の制限により、ネストされたプロジェクト構造が見逃される可能性がある","read-only コマンドの焦点は、書き込み権限の推奨を除外する"],"ko":["저장소 분석을 위해 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요합니다.","특정 파일 패턴을 통해 기술을 감지하는 것만으로 제한됩니다.","Maxdepth 2 제한으로 인해 중첩된 프로젝트 구조가 누락될 수 있습니다.","읽기 전용 명령어에 대한焦点은 쓰기 권한 推奨을 제외합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para el análisis del repositorio","Limitado a la detección de tecnologías a través de patrones de archivos específicos","La restricción Maxdepth 2 puede pasar por alto estructuras de proyecto anidadas","El enfoque en comandos de solo lectura excluye recomendaciones de permisos de escritura"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour l''analyse du référentiel","Limité à la détection des technologies via des modèles de fichiers spécifiques","La restriction Maxdepth 2 peut manquer les structures de projet imbriquées","L''accent mis sur les commandes en lecture seule exclut les recommandations de permissions d''écriture"],"de":["Benötigt Dateizugriff für die Repository-Analyse","Begrenzt auf die Erkennung von Technologien durch bestimmte Dateimuster","Die Maxdepth-2-Einschränkung kann verschachtelte Projektstrukturen übersehen","Der Fokus auf Leseberechtigungen schließt Empfehlungen für Schreibberechtigungen aus"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos para análise de repositório","Limitado à detecção de tecnologias por meio de padrões de arquivos específicos","Restrição Maxdepth 2 pode perder estruturas de projeto aninhadas","Foco em comandos somente leitura exclui recomendações de permissão de gravação"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе для анализа репозитория","Ограничен обнаружением технологий через определенные шаблоны файлов","Ограничение Maxdepth 2 может пропустить вложенные структуры проекта","Фокус на командах только для чтения исключает рекомендации по разрешению записи"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لتحليل المستودع","محدود بالكشف عن التكنولوجيا من خلال أنماط الملفات المحددة","قيود Maxdepth 2 قد تفوت هياكل المشروع المطمورة","التركيز على أوامر القراءة فقط يستثني توصيات صلاحية الكتابة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"767ec8e9ade624311354f5664885a7cb9c266a22736e23348f76d01d660e79e7","repoEtag":"W/\"2a524a36d10d78094c72f484233406f0cd4722cd88b5444674b33d0b91d29676\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('getsentry/skills/django-perf-review', 'official', 'getsentry', 'skills', 'getsentry/skills', 'django-perf-review', 302, 7, 100, '2026-02-24T10:49:39Z', '2026-02-24T12:14:44.854Z', 'd45298cb3c2b06777a28a2cadbcbb4eacc1e987ade230f4f94947ad927c92033', '{"id":"getsentry/skills/django-perf-review","name":"django-perf-review","description":{"zh":"Django性能代码审查AI工具，用于优化Django性能和查找N+1查询","ja":"Djangoパフォーマンスを最適化するためのAIエージェント。Django ORMの問題やデータベースパフォーマンスの低下を解決する","ko":"Django 성능을 최적화하고 N+1 쿼리를 찾는 AI 에이전트. Django ORM 문제와 데이터베이스 성능 문제를 해결","es":"La herramienta de revisión de rendimiento de Django analiza y optimiza el código para mejorar el rendimiento","fr":"L''outil d''analyse de performances Django analyse et optimise le code pour améliorer les performances","de":"Das Django-Leistungsüberprüfungstool analysiert und optimiert den Code, um die Leistung zu verbessern","pt":"A ferramenta django-perf-review é utilizada para revisar o desempenho do Django, encontrar consultas N+1 e otimizar a ORM.","ru":"Инструмент django-perf-review используется для обзора производительности Django, нахождения запросов N+1 и оптимизации ORM.","ar":"تُستخدم أداة django-perf-review لمراجعة أداء Django، العثور على استفسارات N+1 وتحسين أداء ORM.","en":"Django performance code review. Use when asked to review Django performance, find N+1 queries, optimize Django, check queryset performance, database performance, Django ORM issues, or audit Django code for performance problems."},"owner":"getsentry","repo":"skills","repoPath":"getsentry/skills","stars":302,"forks":7,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T10:49:39Z","topics":["tag-production"],"skillMd":{"name":"django-perf-review","description":"Django performance code review. Use when asked to review Django performance, find N+1 queries, optimize Django, check queryset performance, database performance, Django ORM issues, or audit Django code for performance problems.","bodyPreview":"# Django Performance Review\n\nReview Django code for **validated** performance issues. Research the codebase to confirm issues before reporting. Report only what you can prove.\n\n## Review Approach\n\n1. **Research first** - Trace data flow, check for existing optimizations, verify data volume\n2. **Validate before reporting** - Pattern matching is not validation\n3. **Zero findings is acceptable** - Don''t manufacture issues to appear thorough\n4. **Severity must match impact** - If you catch yourself","body":"# Django Performance Review\n\nReview Django code for **validated** performance issues. Research the codebase to confirm issues before reporting. Report only what you can prove.\n\n## Review Approach\n\n1. **Research first** - Trace data flow, check for existing optimizations, verify data volume\n2. **Validate before reporting** - Pattern matching is not validation\n3. **Zero findings is acceptable** - Don''t manufacture issues to appear thorough\n4. **Severity must match impact** - If you catch yourself writing \"minor\" in a CRITICAL finding, it''s not critical. Downgrade or skip it.\n\n## Impact Categories\n\nIssues are organized by impact. Focus on CRITICAL and HIGH - these cause real problems at scale.\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact |\n|----------|----------|--------|\n| 1 | N+1 Queries | **CRITICAL** - Multiplies with data, causes timeouts |\n| 2 | Unbounded Querysets | **CRITICAL** - Memory exhaustion, OOM kills |\n| 3 | Missing Indexes | **HIGH** - Full table scans on large tables |\n| 4 | Write Loops | **HIGH** - Lock contention, slow requests |\n| 5 | Inefficient Patterns | **LOW** - Rarely worth reporting |\n\n---\n\n## Priority 1: N+1 Queries (CRITICAL)\n\n**Impact:** Each N+1 adds `O(n)` database round trips. 100 rows = 100 extra queries. 10,000 rows = timeout.\n\n### Rule: Prefetch related data accessed in loops\n\nValidate by tracing: View → Queryset → Template/Serializer → Loop access\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: N+1 - each iteration queries profile\ndef user_list(request):\n    users = User.objects.all()\n    return render(request, ''users.html'', {''users'': users})\n\n# Template:\n# {% for user in users %}\n#     {{ user.profile.bio }}  ← triggers query per user\n# {% endfor %}\n\n# SOLUTION: Prefetch in view\ndef user_list(request):\n    users = User.objects.select_related(''profile'')\n    return render(request, ''users.html'', {''users'': users})\n```\n\n### Rule: Prefetch in serializers, not just views\n\nDRF serializers accessing related fields cause N+1 if queryset isn''t optimized.\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: SerializerMethodField queries per object\nclass UserSerializer(serializers.ModelSerializer):\n    order_count = serializers.SerializerMethodField()\n\n    def get_order_count(self, obj):\n        return obj.orders.count()  # ← query per user\n\n# SOLUTION: Annotate in viewset, access in serializer\nclass UserViewSet(viewsets.ModelViewSet):\n    def get_queryset(self):\n        return User.objects.annotate(order_count=Count(''orders''))\n\nclass UserSerializer(serializers.ModelSerializer):\n    order_count = serializers.IntegerField(read_only=True)\n```\n\n### Rule: Model properties that query are dangerous in loops\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: Property triggers query when accessed\nclass User(models.Model):\n    @property\n    def recent_orders(self):\n        return self.orders.filter(created__gte=last_week)[:5]\n\n# Used in template loop = N+1\n\n# SOLUTION: Use Prefetch with custom queryset, or annotate\n```\n\n### Validation Checklist for N+1\n- [ ] Traced data flow from view to template/serializer\n- [ ] Confirmed related field is accessed inside a loop\n- [ ] Searched codebase for existing select_related/prefetch_related\n- [ ] Verified table has significant row count (1000+)\n- [ ] Confirmed this is a hot path (not admin, not rare action)\n\n---\n\n## Priority 2: Unbounded Querysets (CRITICAL)\n\n**Impact:** Loading entire tables exhausts memory. Large tables cause OOM kills and worker restarts.\n\n### Rule: Always paginate list endpoints\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: No pagination - loads all rows\nclass UserListView(ListView):\n    model = User\n    template_name = ''users.html''\n\n# SOLUTION: Add pagination\nclass UserListView(ListView):\n    model = User\n    template_name = ''users.html''\n    paginate_by = 25\n```\n\n### Rule: Use iterator() for large batch processing\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: Loads all objects into memory at once\nfor user in User.objects.all():\n    process(user)\n\n# SOLUTION: Stream with iterator()\nfor user in User.objects.iterator(chunk_size=1000):\n    process(user)\n```\n\n### Rule: Never call list() on unbounded querysets\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: Forces full evaluation into memory\nall_users = list(User.objects.all())\n\n# SOLUTION: Keep as queryset, slice if needed\nusers = User.objects.all()[:100]\n```\n\n### Validation Checklist for Unbounded Querysets\n- [ ] Table is large (10k+ rows) or will grow unbounded\n- [ ] No pagination class, paginate_by, or slicing\n- [ ] This runs on user-facing request (not background job with chunking)\n\n---\n\n## Priority 3: Missing Indexes (HIGH)\n\n**Impact:** Full table scans. Negligible on small tables, catastrophic on large ones.\n\n### Rule: Index fields used in WHERE clauses on large tables\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: Filtering on unindexed field\n# User.objects.filter(email=email)  # full scan if no index\n\nclass User(models.Model):\n    email = models.EmailField()  # ← no db_index\n\n# SOLUTION: Add index\nclass User(models.Model):\n    email = models.EmailField(db_index=True)\n```\n\n### Rule: Index fields used in ORDER BY on large tables\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: Sorting requires full scan without index\nOrder.objects.order_by(''-created'')\n\n# SOLUTION: Index the sort field\nclass Order(models.Model):\n    created = models.DateTimeField(db_index=True)\n```\n\n### Rule: Use composite indexes for common query patterns\n\n```python\nclass Order(models.Model):\n    user = models.ForeignKey(User)\n    status = models.CharField(max_length=20)\n    created = models.DateTimeField()\n\n    class Meta:\n        indexes = [\n            models.Index(fields=[''user'', ''status'']),  # for filter(user=x, status=y)\n            models.Index(fields=[''status'', ''-created'']),  # for filter(status=x).order_by(''-created'')\n        ]\n```\n\n### Validation Checklist for Missing Indexes\n- [ ] Table has 10k+ rows\n- [ ] Field is used in filter() or order_by() on hot path\n- [ ] Checked model - no db_index=True or Meta.indexes entry\n- [ ] Not a foreign key (already indexed automatically)\n\n---\n\n## Priority 4: Write Loops (HIGH)\n\n**Impact:** N database writes instead of 1. Lock contention. Slow requests.\n\n### Rule: Use bulk_create instead of create() in loops\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: N inserts, N round trips\nfor item in items:\n    Model.objects.create(name=item[''name''])\n\n# SOLUTION: Single bulk insert\nModel.objects.bulk_create([\n    Model(name=item[''name'']) for item in items\n])\n```\n\n### Rule: Use update() or bulk_update instead of save() in loops\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: N updates\nfor obj in queryset:\n    obj.status = ''done''\n    obj.save()\n\n# SOLUTION A: Single UPDATE statement (same value for all)\nqueryset.update(status=''done'')\n\n# SOLUTION B: bulk_update (different values)\nfor obj in objects:\n    obj.status = compute_status(obj)\nModel.objects.bulk_update(objects, [''status''], batch_size=500)\n```\n\n### Rule: Use delete() on queryset, not in loops\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: N deletes\nfor obj in queryset:\n    obj.delete()\n\n# SOLUTION: Single DELETE\nqueryset.delete()\n```\n\n### Validation Checklist for Write Loops\n- [ ] Loop iterates over 100+ items (or unbounded)\n- [ ] Each iteration calls create(), save(), or delete()\n- [ ] This runs on user-facing request (not one-time migration script)\n\n---\n\n## Priority 5: Inefficient Patterns (LOW)\n\n**Rarely worth reporting.** Include only as minor notes if you''re already reporting real issues.\n\n### Pattern: count() vs exists()\n\n```python\n# Slightly suboptimal\nif queryset.count() > 0:\n    do_thing()\n\n# Marginally better\nif queryset.exists():\n    do_thing()\n```\n\n**Usually skip** - difference is <1ms in most cases.\n\n### Pattern: len(queryset) vs count()\n\n```python\n# Fetches all rows to count\nif len(queryset) > 0:  # bad if queryset not yet evaluated\n\n# Single COUNT query\nif queryset.count() > 0:\n```\n\n**Only flag** if queryset is large and not already evaluated.\n\n### Pattern: get() in small loops\n\n```python\n# N queries, but if N is small (< 20), often fine\nfor id in ids:\n    obj = Model.objects.get(id=id)\n```\n\n**Only flag** if loop is large or this is in a very hot path.\n\n---\n\n## Validation Requirements\n\nBefore reporting ANY issue:\n\n1. **Trace the data flow** - Follow queryset from creation to consumption\n2. **Search for existing optimizations** - Grep for select_related, prefetch_related, pagination\n3. **Verify data volume** - Check if table is actually large\n4. **Confirm hot path** - Trace call sites, verify this runs frequently\n5. **Rule out mitigations** - Check for caching, rate limiting\n\n**If you cannot validate all steps, do not report.**\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Django Performance Review: [File/Component Name]\n\n### Summary\nValidated issues: X (Y Critical, Z High)\n\n### Findings\n\n#### [PERF-001] N+1 Query in UserListView (CRITICAL)\n**Location:** `views.py:45`\n\n**Issue:** Related field `profile` accessed in template loop without prefetch.\n\n**Validation:**\n- Traced: UserListView → users queryset → user_list.html → `{{ user.profile.bio }}` in loop\n- Searched codebase: no select_related(''profile'') found\n- User table: 50k+ rows (verified in admin)\n- Hot path: linked from homepage navigation\n\n**Evidence:**\n```python\ndef get_queryset(self):\n    return User.objects.filter(active=True)  # no select_related\n```\n\n**Fix:**\n```python\ndef get_queryset(self):\n    return User.objects.filter(active=True).select_related(''profile'')\n```\n```\n\nIf no issues found: \"No performance issues identified after reviewing [files] and validating [what you checked].\"\n\n**Before submitting, sanity check each finding:**\n- Does the severity match the actual impact? (\"Minor inefficiency\" ≠ CRITICAL)\n- Is this a real performance issue or just a style preference?\n- Would fixing this measurably improve performance?\n\nIf the answer to any is \"no\" - remove the finding.\n\n---\n\n## What NOT to Report\n\n- Test files\n- Admin-only views\n- Management commands\n- Migration files\n- One-time scripts\n- Code behind disabled feature flags\n- Tables with <1000 rows that won''t grow\n- Patterns in cold paths (rarely executed code)\n- Micro-optimizations (exists vs count, only/defer without evidence)\n\n### False Positives to Avoid\n\n**Queryset variable assignment is not an issue:**\n```python\n# This is FINE - no performance difference\nprojects_qs = Project.objects.filter(org=org)\nprojects = list(projects_qs)\n\n# vs this - identical performance\nprojects = list(Project.objects.filter(org=org))\n```\nQuerysets are lazy. Assigning to a variable doesn''t execute anything.\n\n**Single query patterns are not N+1:**\n```python\n# This is ONE query, not N+1\nprojects = list(Project.objects.filter(org=org))\n```\nN+1 requires a loop that triggers additional queries. A single `list()` call is fine.\n\n**Missing select_related on single object fetch is not N+1:**\n```python\n# This is 2 queries, not N+1 - report as LOW at most\nstate = AutofixState.objects.filter(pr_id=pr_id).first()\nproject_id = state.request.project_id  # second query\n```\nN+1 requires a loop. A single object doing 2 queries instead of 1 can be reported as LOW if relevant, but never as CRITICAL/HIGH.\n\n**Style preferences are not performance issues:**\nIf your only suggestion is \"combine these two lines\" or \"rename this variable\" - that''s style, not performance. Don''t report it.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:14:44.854Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：Django性能优化","ja":"AIエージェント：Djangoパフォーマンスレビュー","ko":"AI 에이전트: Django 성능 리뷰","es":"Herramientas de revisión de rendimiento de Django","fr":"Outils d''analyse de performances Django","de":"Django Leistungsüberprüfungstools","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: django-perf-review para Otimização de ...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: django-perf-review для Оптимизации Производите...","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: django-perf-review لتعزيز الأداء","en":"django-perf-review"},"description":{"zh":"Django性能代码审查AI工具，用于优化Django性能和查找N+1查询","ja":"Djangoパフォーマンスを最適化するためのAIエージェント。Django ORMの問題やデータベースパフォーマンスの低下を解決する","ko":"Django 성능을 최적화하고 N+1 쿼리를 찾는 AI 에이전트. Django ORM 문제와 데이터베이스 성능 문제를 해결","es":"La herramienta de revisión de rendimiento de Django analiza y optimiza el código para mejorar el rendimiento","fr":"L''outil d''analyse de performances Django analyse et optimise le code pour améliorer les performances","de":"Das Django-Leistungsüberprüfungstool analysiert und optimiert den Code, um die Leistung zu verbessern","pt":"A ferramenta django-perf-review é utilizada para revisar o desempenho do Django, encontrar consultas N+1 e otimizar a ORM.","ru":"Инструмент django-perf-review используется для обзора производительности Django, нахождения запросов N+1 и оптимизации ORM.","ar":"تُستخدم أداة django-perf-review لمراجعة أداء Django، العثور على استفسارات N+1 وتحسين أداء ORM.","en":"Django performance code review. Use when asked to review Django performance, find N+1 queries, optimize Django, check queryset performance, database performa..."},"definition":{"en":"Django performance code review. Use when asked to review Django performance, find N+1 queries, optimize Django, check queryset performance, database performance, Django ORM issues, or audit Django code for performance problems."},"features":{"zh":["优化Django性能","查找N+1查询","提高数据库性能","审查Django ORM问题","解决数据访问问题"],"ja":["Djangoパフォーマンスの最適化","N+1クエリの検出","データベースパフォーマンスの向上","Django ORMの問題解決","データアクセスの問題解決"],"ko":["Django 성능 최적화","N+1 쿼리검색","데이터베이스 성능 향상","Django ORM 문제 해결","데이터 액세스 문제 해결"],"es":["Revisión de código de Django","Optimización de consultas","Análisis de rendimiento de la base de datos","Detección de consultas N+1","Optimización de conjuntos de consultas","Revisión de problemas de ORM de Django"],"fr":["Examen de code Django","Optimisation des requêtes","Analyse des performances de la base de données","Détection des requêtes N+1","Optimisation des ensembles de requêtes","Examen des problèmes d''ORM de Django"],"de":["Django-Code-Review","Abfrage-Optimierung","Datenbankleistungsanalyse","Erkennung von N+1-Abfragen","Optimierung von Abfrage-Sets","Überprüfung von Django-ORM-Problemen"],"pt":["Revisão de desempenho do Django","Detecção de consultas N+1","Otimização da ORM","Análise de desempenho de consultas","Análise de desempenho do banco de dados","Auditoria de código para problemas de desempenho"],"ru":["Обзор производительности Django","Обнаружение запросов N+1","Оптимизация ORM","Анализ производительности запросов","Анализ производительности базы данных","Аудит кода для проблем производительности"],"ar":["مراجعة أداء Django","اكتشاف الاستفسارات N+1","تحسين أداء ORM","تحليل أداء الاستفسارات","تحليل أداء قاعدة البيانات","فحص الكود لمشاكل الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Django性能优化","AI工具","N+1查询","Django ORM","数据库性能","代码审查"],"ja":["Djangoパフォーマンス","AIエージェント","N+1クエリ","Django ORM","データベースパフォーマンス","コードレビュー"],"ko":["Django 성능 최적화","AI 에이전트","N+1 쿼리","Django ORM","데이터베이스 성능","코드 리뷰"],"es":["herramientas de revisión de código de Django","optimización de consultas de Django","mejora del rendimiento de Django","revisión de rendimiento de Django","análisis de rendimiento de la base de datos de Django","problemas de ORM de Django","consultas N+1 en Django","optimización de conjuntos de consultas de Django"],"fr":["outils d''examen de code Django","optimisation des requêtes Django","amélioration des performances de Django","analyse de performances de Django","analyse des performances de la base de données de Django","problèmes d''ORM de Django","requêtes N+1 dans Django","optimisation des ensembles de requêtes de Django"],"de":["Django-Code-Review-Tools","Django-Abfrage-Optimierung","Django-Leistungsverbesserung","Django-Leistungsanalyse","Django-Datenbankleistungsanalyse","Django-ORM-Probleme","N+1-Abfragen in Django","Django-Abfrage-Set-Optimierung"],"pt":["django-perf-review","otimização de desempenho","consultas N+1","ORM","desempenho do Django","revisão de código","ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de software","produção de software"],"ru":["django-perf-review","оптимизация производительности","запросы N+1","ORM","производительность Django","обзор кода","ИИ Агенты","разработка программного обеспечения","производство программного обеспечения"],"ar":["django-perf-review","تحسين الأداء","الاستفسارات N+1","ORM","أداء Django","مراجعة الكود","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","إنتاج البرمجيات"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents specializing in Django codebase performance optimization and database query auditing.","zh":"非常适合专门从事 Django 代码库性能优化和数据库查询审计的 Python Analysis Agents。","ja":"Django コードベースのパフォーマンス最適化とデータベースクエリ監査を専門とする Python Analysis Agents に最適です。","ko":"Django 코드베이스 성능 최적화 및 데이터베이스 쿼리 감사에 특화된 Python Analysis Agents에 완벽하게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Python que se especializan en la optimización del rendimiento de la base de código de Django y la auditoría de consultas de base de datos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Python spécialisés dans l''optimisation des performances de la base de code Django et l''audit des requêtes de base de données.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyseagenten, die sich auf die Leistungsoptimierung der Django-Codebasis und die Überprüfung von Datenbankabfragen spezialisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python especializados em otimização de desempenho de codebase Django e auditoria de consultas de banco de dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов анализа Python, специализирующихся на оптимизации производительности кодовой базы Django и аудите запросов к базе данных.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحليل Python المتخصصين في تحسين أداء قاعدة كود Django ومراجعة استعلامات قاعدة البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct validated Django performance reviews by tracing data flows, identifying N+1 queries, and optimizing queryset performance while maintaining research-first validation principles to avoid false positives.","zh":"通过追踪数据流、识别 N+1 查询和优化 queryset 性能，使代理能够进行经过验证的 Django 性能审查，同时坚持研究优先的验证原则以避免误报。","ja":"データフローの追跡、N+1 クエリの特定、queryset パフォーマンスの最適化を通じて、エージェントが検証済みの Django パフォーマンスレビューを実施できるようにし、研究第一の検証原則を維持して誤検出を回避します。","ko":"데이터 흐름 추적, N+1 쿼리 식별, 쿼리셋 성능 최적화를 통해 에이전트가 검증된 Django 성능 검토를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 연구 중심의 검증 원칙을 유지하여 오탐지를 방지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar revisiones de rendimiento de Django validadas trazando flujos de datos, identificando consultas N+1 y optimizando el rendimiento de queryset mientras mantiene principios de validación de investigación para evitar falsos positivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des examens de performances Django validés en traçant les flux de données, en identifiant les requêtes N+1 et en optimisant les performances de queryset tout en maintenant des principes de validation de recherche pour éviter les faux positifs.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, validierte Django-Leistungsprüfungen durchzuführen, indem sie Datenflüsse verfolgen, N+1-Abfragen identifizieren und die Leistung von QuerySets optimieren, während sie forschungsbasierte Validierungsgrundsätze beibehalten, um falsche Positivergebnisse zu vermeiden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a conduzir revisões de desempenho Django validadas através do rastreamento de fluxos de dados, identificação de consultas N+1 e otimização do desempenho do queryset, mantendo os princípios de validação de pesquisa primeiro para evitar falsos positivos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проводить проверенные обзоры производительности Django путем отслеживания потоков данных, выявления запросов N+1 и оптимизации производительности queryset, при этом соблюдая принципы первоначальной исследовательской проверки для избежания ложных срабатываний.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إجراء مراجعات أداء Django المعتمدة من خلال تتبع تدفقات البيانات، وتحديد استعلامات N+1، وتحسين أداء مجموعة الاستعلامات مع الحفاظ على مبادئ التحقق القائمة على البحث أولاً لتجنب الإيجابيات الكاذبة."},"useCases":{"en":["Identifying N+1 query patterns in Django ORM","Optimizing database performance through queryset analysis","Auditing Django code for proven performance bottlenecks","Validating existing performance optimizations in codebase"],"zh":["识别 Django ORM 中的 N+1 查询模式","通过 queryset 分析优化数据库性能","审计 Django 代码以查找已证实的性能瓶颈","验证代码库中现有的性能优化"],"ja":["Django ORM における N+1 クエリパターンの特定","queryset 分析によるデータベースパフォーマンスの最適化","実証済みのパフォーマンスボトルネックに対する Django コードの監査","コードベース内の既存のパフォーマンス最適化の検証"],"ko":["Django ORM에서 N+1 쿼리 패턴 식별","쿼리셋 분석을 통한 데이터베이스 성능 최적화","입증된 성능 병목 현상에 대한 Django 코드 감사","코드베이스 내 기존 성능 최적화 검증"],"es":["Identificar patrones de consultas N+1 en Django ORM","Optimizar el rendimiento de la base de datos a través del análisis de queryset","Auditar el código de Django para identificar cuellos de botella de rendimiento comprobados","Validar las optimizaciones de rendimiento existentes en la base de código"],"fr":["Identifier les modèles de requêtes N+1 dans Django ORM","Optimiser les performances de la base de données via l''analyse de queryset","Auditer le code Django pour identifier les goulots d''étranglement de performances prouvés","Valider les optimisations de performances existantes dans la base de code"],"de":["Identifizierung von N+1-Abfragemustern in Django-ORM","Optimierung der Datenbankleistung durch QuerySet-Analyse","Prüfung des Django-Codes auf nachgewiesene Leistungsengpässe","Validierung bestehender Leistungsoptimierungen im Code"],"pt":["Identificação de padrões de consulta N+1 no Django ORM","Otimização do desempenho do banco de dados através da análise de queryset","Auditoria de código Django para gargalos de desempenho comprovados","Validação de otimizações de desempenho existentes na codebase"],"ru":["Выявление шаблонов запросов N+1 в Django ORM","Оптимизация производительности базы данных через анализ queryset","Аудит кода Django на предмет подтвержденных узких мест производительности","Проверка существующих оптимизаций производительности в кодовой базе"],"ar":["تحديد أنماط استعلام N+1 في Django ORM","تحسين أداء قاعدة البيانات من خلال تحليل مجموعة الاستعلامات","مراجعة كود Django للبحث عن اختناقات أداء مثبتة","التحقق من تحسينات الأداء الحالية في قاعدة الكود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires full codebase access for proper tracing","Django-specific framework only","Demands actual data volume verification for accurate assessment","Cannot manufacture issues - zero findings possible"],"zh":["需要完整的代码库访问权限才能进行正确的追踪","仅限 Django 特定框架","需要实际数据量验证以进行准确评估","无法制造问题 - 可能存在零发现"],"ja":["適切な追跡にはコードベースへの完全なアクセスが必要","Django 固有のフレームワークのみ対応","正確な評価には実際のデータ量検証が必須","問題を捏造できず - 所見がゼロの場合あり"],"ko":["적절한 추적을 위한 전체 코드베이스 접근 권한 필요","Django 전용 프레임워크만 해당","정확한 평가를 위한 실제 데이터 양 검증 필요","문제를 조작할 수 없음 - 발견 결과가 없을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso completo a la base de código para un seguimiento adecuado","Marco de trabajo específico de Django","Exige verificación del volumen de datos real para una evaluación precisa","No puede fabricar problemas: resultados de cero hallazgos posibles"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès complet à la base de code pour un suivi approprié","Framework spécifique à Django","Exige une vérification du volume de données réel pour une évaluation précise","Ne peut pas fabriquer des problèmes: résultats de zéro découverte possible"],"de":["Benötigt vollen Zugriff auf die Codebasis für eine ordnungsgemäße Nachverfolgung","Django-spezifisches Framework","Erfordert Überprüfung des tatsächlichen Datenvolumens für eine genaue Bewertung","Kann keine Probleme herbeiführen: Null-Ergebnisse möglich"],"pt":["Requer acesso completo à codebase para um rastreamento adequado","Específico apenas para o framework Django","Exige verificação do volume real de dados para uma avaliação precisa","Não pode fabricar problemas - zero descobertas é possível"],"ru":["Требует полного доступа к кодовой базе для правильного отслеживания","Только для фреймворка Django","Требует проверки реального объема данных для точной оценки","Не может создавать проблемы - возможны нулевые находки"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول الكامل إلى قاعدة الكود لإجراء التتبع السليم","مخصص لإطار عمل Django فقط","يتطلب التحقق من حجم البيانات الفعلي لإجراء تقييم دقيق","لا يمكن تصنيع المشكلات - من الممكن عدم العثور على أي شيء"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d45298cb3c2b06777a28a2cadbcbb4eacc1e987ade230f4f94947ad927c92033","repoEtag":"W/\"2a524a36d10d78094c72f484233406f0cd4722cd88b5444674b33d0b91d29676\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('getsentry/skills/skill-scanner', 'official', 'getsentry', 'skills', 'getsentry/skills', 'skill-scanner', 302, 7, 100, '2026-02-24T10:49:39Z', '2026-02-24T12:15:36.665Z', '48db8dc157b23cf51d55830e862c3ce3688200b4b6a7523ae841b668bb24e1f9', '{"id":"getsentry/skills/skill-scanner","name":"skill-scanner","description":{"zh":"技能安全扫描器是一种用于检测技能安全问题的工具，能够扫描技能中的安全风险","ja":"スキルセキュリティスキャナーはスキルのセキュリティ問題を検出するツールです。スキル内のセキュリティリスクをスキャンできます","ko":"스킬 보안 스캐너는 스킬의 보안 문제를 감지하는 도구입니다. 스킬 내의 보안 위험을 스캔할 수 있습니다","es":"El escáner de habilidades de agente es una herramienta que detecta problemas de seguridad en habilidades de agente antes de adoptarlas","fr":"L''analyseur de compétences d''agent est un outil qui détecte les problèmes de sécurité dans les compétences d''agent avant de les adopter","de":"Der Sicherheits-Scanner für Agentenfähigkeiten ist ein Werkzeug, das Sicherheitsprobleme in Agentenfähigkeiten vor der Übernahme erkennen kann","pt":"O Scanner de Segurança de Habilidades de Agente é uma ferramenta que verifica habilidades de agente em busca de problemas de segurança.","ru":"Сканирование навыков агентов на предмет проблем безопасности - это инструмент, который проверяет навыки агентов на наличие проблем безопасности.","ar":"ماسح أمان مهارات الوكيل هو أداة تفتيش مهارات الوكيل عن مشاكل أمان","en":"Scan agent skills for security issues. Use when asked to scan a skill,"},"owner":"getsentry","repo":"skills","repoPath":"getsentry/skills","stars":302,"forks":7,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T10:49:39Z","topics":["tag-production"],"skillMd":{"name":"skill-scanner","description":"Scan agent skills for security issues. Use when asked to scan a skill,","bodyPreview":"# Skill Security Scanner\n\nScan agent skills for security issues before adoption. Detects prompt injection, malicious code, excessive permissions, secret exposure, and supply chain risks.\n\n**Important**: Run all scripts from the repository root using the full path via `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}`.\n\n## Bundled Script\n\n### `scripts/scan_skill.py`\n\nStatic analysis scanner that detects deterministic patterns. Outputs structured JSON.\n\n```bash\nuv run ${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}/scripts/scan_skill.py <skill-directo","body":"# Skill Security Scanner\n\nScan agent skills for security issues before adoption. Detects prompt injection, malicious code, excessive permissions, secret exposure, and supply chain risks.\n\n**Important**: Run all scripts from the repository root using the full path via `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}`.\n\n## Bundled Script\n\n### `scripts/scan_skill.py`\n\nStatic analysis scanner that detects deterministic patterns. Outputs structured JSON.\n\n```bash\nuv run ${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}/scripts/scan_skill.py <skill-directory>\n```\n\nReturns JSON with findings, URLs, structure info, and severity counts. The script catches patterns mechanically — your job is to evaluate intent and filter false positives.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Input & Discovery\n\nDetermine the scan target:\n\n- If the user provides a skill directory path, use it directly\n- If the user names a skill, look for it under `plugins/*/skills/<name>/` or `.claude/skills/<name>/`\n- If the user says \"scan all skills\", discover all `*/SKILL.md` files and scan each\n\nValidate the target contains a `SKILL.md` file. List the skill structure:\n\n```bash\nls -la <skill-directory>/\nls <skill-directory>/references/ 2>/dev/null\nls <skill-directory>/scripts/ 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n### Phase 2: Automated Static Scan\n\nRun the bundled scanner:\n\n```bash\nuv run ${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}/scripts/scan_skill.py <skill-directory>\n```\n\nParse the JSON output. The script produces findings with severity levels, URL analysis, and structure information. Use these as leads for deeper analysis.\n\n**Fallback**: If the script fails, proceed with manual analysis using Grep patterns from the reference files.\n\n### Phase 3: Frontmatter Validation\n\nRead the SKILL.md and check:\n\n- **Required fields**: `name` and `description` must be present\n- **Name consistency**: `name` field should match the directory name\n- **Tool assessment**: Review `allowed-tools` — is Bash justified? Are tools unrestricted (`*`)?\n- **Model override**: Is a specific model forced? Why?\n- **Description quality**: Does the description accurately represent what the skill does?\n\n### Phase 4: Prompt Injection Analysis\n\nLoad `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}/references/prompt-injection-patterns.md` for context.\n\nReview scanner findings in the \"Prompt Injection\" category. For each finding:\n\n1. Read the surrounding context in the file\n2. Determine if the pattern is **performing** injection (malicious) or **discussing/detecting** injection (legitimate)\n3. Skills about security, testing, or education commonly reference injection patterns — this is expected\n\n**Critical distinction**: A security review skill that lists injection patterns in its references is documenting threats, not attacking. Only flag patterns that would execute against the agent running the skill.\n\n### Phase 5: Behavioral Analysis\n\nThis phase is agent-only — no pattern matching. Read the full SKILL.md instructions and evaluate:\n\n**Description vs. instructions alignment**:\n- Does the description match what the instructions actually tell the agent to do?\n- A skill described as \"code formatter\" that instructs the agent to read ~/.ssh is misaligned\n\n**Config/memory poisoning**:\n- Instructions to modify `CLAUDE.md`, `MEMORY.md`, `settings.json`, `.mcp.json`, or hook configurations\n- Instructions to add itself to allowlists or auto-approve permissions\n- Writing to `~/.claude/` or any agent configuration directory\n\n**Scope creep**:\n- Instructions that exceed the skill''s stated purpose\n- Unnecessary data gathering (reading files unrelated to the skill''s function)\n- Instructions to install other skills, plugins, or dependencies not mentioned in the description\n\n**Information gathering**:\n- Reading environment variables beyond what''s needed\n- Listing directory contents outside the skill''s scope\n- Accessing git history, credentials, or user data unnecessarily\n\n### Phase 6: Script Analysis\n\nIf the skill has a `scripts/` directory:\n\n1. Load `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}/references/dangerous-code-patterns.md` for context\n2. Read each script file fully (do not skip any)\n3. Check scanner findings in the \"Malicious Code\" category\n4. For each finding, evaluate:\n   - **Data exfiltration**: Does the script send data to external URLs? What data?\n   - **Reverse shells**: Socket connections with redirected I/O\n   - **Credential theft**: Reading SSH keys, .env files, tokens from environment\n   - **Dangerous execution**: eval/exec with dynamic input, shell=True with interpolation\n   - **Config modification**: Writing to agent settings, shell configs, git hooks\n5. Check PEP 723 `dependencies` — are they legitimate, well-known packages?\n6. Verify the script''s behavior matches the SKILL.md description of what it does\n\n**Legitimate patterns**: `gh` CLI calls, `git` commands, reading project files, JSON output to stdout are normal for skill scripts.\n\n### Phase 7: Supply Chain Assessment\n\nReview URLs from the scanner output and any additional URLs found in scripts:\n\n- **Trusted domains**: GitHub, PyPI, official docs — normal\n- **Untrusted domains**: Unknown domains, personal sites, URL shorteners — flag for review\n- **Remote instruction loading**: Any URL that fetches content to be executed or interpreted as instructions is high risk\n- **Dependency downloads**: Scripts that download and execute binaries or code at runtime\n- **Unverifiable sources**: References to packages or tools not on standard registries\n\n### Phase 8: Permission Analysis\n\nLoad `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}/references/permission-analysis.md` for the tool risk matrix.\n\nEvaluate:\n\n- **Least privilege**: Are all granted tools actually used in the skill instructions?\n- **Tool justification**: Does the skill body reference operations that require each tool?\n- **Risk level**: Rate the overall permission profile using the tier system from the reference\n\nExample assessments:\n- `Read Grep Glob` — Low risk, read-only analysis skill\n- `Read Grep Glob Bash` — Medium risk, needs Bash justification (e.g., running bundled scripts)\n- `Read Grep Glob Bash Write Edit WebFetch Task` — High risk, near-full access\n\n## Confidence Levels\n\n| Level | Criteria | Action |\n|-------|----------|--------|\n| **HIGH** | Pattern confirmed + malicious intent evident | Report with severity |\n| **MEDIUM** | Suspicious pattern, intent unclear | Note as \"Needs verification\" |\n| **LOW** | Theoretical, best practice only | Do not report |\n\n**False positive awareness is critical.** The biggest risk is flagging legitimate security skills as malicious because they reference attack patterns. Always evaluate intent before reporting.\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Skill Security Scan: [Skill Name]\n\n### Summary\n- **Findings**: X (Y Critical, Z High, ...)\n- **Risk Level**: Critical / High / Medium / Low / Clean\n- **Skill Structure**: SKILL.md only / +references / +scripts / full\n\n### Findings\n\n#### [SKILL-SEC-001] [Finding Type] (Severity)\n- **Location**: `SKILL.md:42` or `scripts/tool.py:15`\n- **Confidence**: High\n- **Category**: Prompt Injection / Malicious Code / Excessive Permissions / Secret Exposure / Supply Chain / Validation\n- **Issue**: [What was found]\n- **Evidence**: [code snippet]\n- **Risk**: [What could happen]\n- **Remediation**: [How to fix]\n\n### Needs Verification\n[Medium-confidence items needing human review]\n\n### Assessment\n[Safe to install / Install with caution / Do not install]\n[Brief justification for the assessment]\n```\n\n**Risk level determination**:\n- **Critical**: Any high-confidence critical finding (prompt injection, credential theft, data exfiltration)\n- **High**: High-confidence high-severity findings or multiple medium findings\n- **Medium**: Medium-confidence findings or minor permission concerns\n- **Low**: Only best-practice suggestions\n- **Clean**: No findings after thorough analysis\n\n## Reference Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `references/prompt-injection-patterns.md` | Injection patterns, jailbreaks, obfuscation techniques, false positive guide |\n| `references/dangerous-code-patterns.md` | Script security patterns: exfiltration, shells, credential theft, eval/exec |\n| `references/permission-analysis.md` | Tool risk tiers, least privilege methodology, common skill permission profiles |\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:15:36.665Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"技能安全扫描器","ja":"スキルセキュリティスキャナー","ko":"스킬 보안 스キャ너","es":"Escáner de Seguridad de Habilidades de Agente","fr":"Analyseur de Sécurité des Compétences d''Agent","de":"Sicherheits-Scanner für Agentenfähigkeiten","pt":"Scanner de Segurança de Habilidades de Agente","ru":"Сканирование навыков агентов на предмет проблем безопасности","ar":"ماسح أمان مهارات الوكيل","en":"skill-scanner"},"description":{"zh":"技能安全扫描器是一种用于检测技能安全问题的工具，能够扫描技能中的安全风险","ja":"スキルセキュリティスキャナーはスキルのセキュリティ問題を検出するツールです。スキル内のセキュリティリスクをスキャンできます","ko":"스킬 보안 스캐너는 스킬의 보안 문제를 감지하는 도구입니다. 스킬 내의 보안 위험을 스캔할 수 있습니다","es":"El escáner de habilidades de agente es una herramienta que detecta problemas de seguridad en habilidades de agente antes de adoptarlas","fr":"L''analyseur de compétences d''agent est un outil qui détecte les problèmes de sécurité dans les compétences d''agent avant de les adopter","de":"Der Sicherheits-Scanner für Agentenfähigkeiten ist ein Werkzeug, das Sicherheitsprobleme in Agentenfähigkeiten vor der Übernahme erkennen kann","pt":"O Scanner de Segurança de Habilidades de Agente é uma ferramenta que verifica habilidades de agente em busca de problemas de segurança.","ru":"Сканирование навыков агентов на предмет проблем безопасности - это инструмент, который проверяет навыки агентов на наличие проблем безопасности.","ar":"ماسح أمان مهارات الوكيل هو أداة تفتيش مهارات الوكيل عن مشاكل أمان","en":"Scan agent skills for security issues. Use when asked to scan a skill,"},"definition":{"en":"Scan agent skills for security issues. Use when asked to scan a skill,"},"features":{"zh":["检测提示注入","检测恶意代码","检测过度权限","检测秘密暴露","检测供应链风险"],"ja":["プロンプトインジェクションの検出","悪意のあるコードの検出","過剰な権限の検出","シークレットの暴露の検出","サプライチェーンリスクの検出"],"ko":["프롬프트 주입 감지","악의적인 코드 감지","과도한 권한 감지","비밀 노출 감지","공급망 위험 감지"],"es":["Detección de inyección de comandos","Detección de código malicioso","Detección de permisos excesivos","Detección de exposición de secretos","Detección de riesgos de cadena de suministro"],"fr":["Détection d''injection de commandes","Détection de code malveillant","Détection de permissions excessives","Détection d''exposition de secrets","Détection de risques de chaîne d''approvisionnement"],"de":["Erkennung von Befehlsinjektion","Erkennung von schädlichem Code","Erkennung von übermäßigen Berechtigungen","Erkennung von Geheimnisverletzungen","Erkennung von Lieferkettenrisiken"],"pt":["Detecção de injeção de prompt","Detecção de código malicioso","Verificação de permissões excessivas","Proteção contra exposição de segredos","Análise de riscos da cadeia de suprimentos"],"ru":["Обнаружение внедрения промпта","Обнаружение вредоносного кода","Проверка избыточных разрешений","Защита от раскрытия секретов","Анализ рисков цепочки поставок"],"ar":["كشف الحقن الإملائي","كشف الرمز الخبيث","التحقق من الصلاحيات الزائدة","حماية الكشف عن الأسرار","تحليل مخاطر سلسلة التوريد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技能安全扫描器","静态分析","安全问题检测","技能安全","代码安全","供应链安全"],"ja":["スキルセキュリティスキャナー","静的分析","セキュリティ問題検出","スキルセキュリティ","コードセキュリティ","サプライチェーンセキュリティ"],"ko":["스킬 보안 스캐너","정적 분석","보안 문제 감지","스킬 보안","코드 보안","공급망 보안"],"es":["seguridad de habilidades de agente","análisis de seguridad","detección de vulnerabilidades","seguridad de código","agentes de software","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["sécurité des compétences d''agent","analyse de sécurité","détection de vulnérabilités","sécurité de code","agents de logiciel","développement de logiciel"],"de":["Sicherheit von Agentenfähigkeiten","Sicherheitsanalyse","Erkennung von Schwachstellen","Codesicherheit","Software-Agenten","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["segurança de habilidades de agente","scanner de segurança","problemas de segurança","injeção de prompt","código malicioso","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["безопасность навыков агентов","сканирование безопасности","проблемы безопасности","внедрение промпта","вредоносный код","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أمان مهارات الوكيل","ماسح أمان","مشاكل أمان","الحقن الإملائي","الرمز الخبيث","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security-Conscious Agents needing advanced threat detection and vulnerability assessment capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级威胁检测和漏洞评估能力的安全意识强的代理。","ja":"高度な脅威検出と脆弱性評価機能を必要とするセキュリティ意識の高いエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 위협 감지 및 취약성 평가 기능이 필요한 보안 의식이 높은 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes conscientes de la seguridad que necesitan capacidades de detección de amenazas avanzadas y evaluación de vulnerabilidades.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents conscients de la sécurité ayant besoin de capacités de détection de menaces avancées et d''évaluation de vulnérabilités.","de":"Perfekt für sicherheitsbewusste Agenten, die erweiterte Bedrohungserkennungs- und Schwachstellenbewertungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Conscientes de Segurança que precisam de capacidades avançadas de detecção de ameaças e avaliação de vulnerabilidades.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, осознающих вопросы безопасности, которым необходимы расширенные возможности обнаружения угроз и оценки уязвимостей.","ar":"مثالي لعميل معني بالأمن و الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لاكتشاف التهديدات وتقييم الضعف."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect prompt injection, malicious code, excessive permissions, secret exposure, and supply chain risks using static analysis and JSON output, leveraging Python scripts like `scan_skill.py`.","zh":"通过静态分析和JSON输出，利用Python脚本（如`scan_skill.py`），赋予代理检测提示注入、恶意代码、过度权限、密钥暴露和供应链风险的能力。","ja":"静的分析とJSON出力を使用して、Pythonスクリプト（例：`scan_skill.py`）を利用し、エージェントにプロンプトインジェクション、悪性コード、過剰な権限、シークレット漏えい、サプライチェーンリスクを検出する能力を付与します。","ko":"정적 분석과 JSON 출력을 통해 Python 스크립트(`scan_skill.py` 등)를 활용하여 에이전트가 프롬프트 주입, 악성 코드, 과도한 권한, 시크릿 노출 및 공급망 위험을 감지할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a detectar inyección de comandos, código malicioso, permisos excesivos, exposición de secretos y riesgos de la cadena de suministro utilizando análisis estático y salida JSON, aprovechando scripts de Python como `scan_skill.py`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de détecter l''injection de commandes, le code malveillant, les autorisations excessives, l''exposition de secrets et les risques de la chaîne d''approvisionnement en utilisant l''analyse statique et la sortie JSON, en exploitant des scripts Python comme `scan_skill.py`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Prompt-Injection, Schadcode, übermäßige Berechtigungen, Geheimnisexposition und Lieferkettenrisiken mithilfe von statischer Analyse und JSON-Ausgabe zu erkennen, indem Python-Skripte wie `scan_skill.py` genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar injeção de prompt, código malicioso, permissões excessivas, exposição de segredos e riscos na cadeia de suprimentos usando análise estática e saída JSON, aproveitando scripts Python como `scan_skill.py`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обнаруживать внедрение промпта, вредоносный код, чрезмерные разрешения, раскрытие секретов и риски в цепочке поставок, используя статический анализ и вывод JSON, используя скрипты Python, такие как `scan_skill.py`.","ar":"تمكّن العملاء من اكتشاف حقن البرومت، والبرمجيات الخبيثة، والصلاحيات الزائدة، وانتهاك البيانات السرية، ومخاطر سلسلة التوريد باستخدام التحليل الثابت ومخرجات JSON، واستخدام سكريبتات بايثون مثل `scan_skill.py`."},"useCases":{"en":["Scanning skills for security issues before adoption","Detecting deterministic patterns in agent skills","Validating skill security using structured JSON output"],"zh":["在采用之前扫描技能的安全问题","检测代理技能中的确定性模式","使用结构化JSON输出验证技能安全性"],"ja":["採用前にスキルのセキュリティ問題をスキャンする","エージェントスキルの中の決定性パターンを検出する","構造化されたJSON出力を使用してスキルのセキュリティを検証する"],"ko":["채택하기 전에 스킬의 보안 문제를 스캔하는 것","에이전트 스킬에서 결정적 패턴을 감지하는 것","구조화된 JSON 출력을 사용하여 스킬의 보안을 검증하는 것"],"es":["Escaneo de habilidades para problemas de seguridad antes de la adopción","Detección de patrones deterministas en habilidades de agentes","Validación de la seguridad de las habilidades utilizando salida JSON estructurada"],"fr":["Analyse des compétences pour les problèmes de sécurité avant l''adoption","Détection de modèles déterministes dans les compétences des agents","Validation de la sécurité des compétences en utilisant une sortie JSON structurée"],"de":["Überprüfung von Fähigkeiten auf Sicherheitsprobleme vor der Übernahme","Erkennung deterministischer Muster in Agentenfähigkeiten","Überprüfung der Fähigkeitensicherheit unter Verwendung von strukturierter JSON-Ausgabe"],"pt":["Digitalização de habilidades para questões de segurança antes da adoção","Detecção de padrões determinísticos em habilidades de agente","Validação da segurança da habilidade usando saída JSON estruturada"],"ru":["Сканирование навыков на предмет проблем безопасности перед принятием","Обнаружение детерминированных шаблонов в навыках агентов","Проверка безопасности навыков с помощью структурированного вывода JSON"],"ar":["فحص المهارات من أجل قضايا الأمن قبل اعتمادها","اكتشاف الأنماط المتعينة في مهارات العميل","التحقق من أمان المهارة باستخدام مخرجات JSON المنظمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Must run scripts from repository root using full path via `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}`"],"zh":["需要Python环境","必须从存储库根目录运行脚本，使用完整路径通过`${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}`"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","スクリプトをリポジトリのルートディレクトリから実行する必要があり、完全なパスを使用して`${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}`"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요하다","스크립트를 저장소 루트 디렉토리에서 실행해야 하며, 전체 경로를 통해 `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}`를 사용해야 한다"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Deben ejecutarse scripts desde la raíz del repositorio utilizando la ruta completa a través de `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}`"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Les scripts doivent être exécutés à partir de la racine du référentiel en utilisant le chemin complet via `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}`"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Skripte müssen von der Wurzel des Repositories aus über den vollständigen Pfad mittels `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}` ausgeführt werden"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Python","Deve executar scripts a partir da raiz do repositório usando o caminho completo via `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}`"],"ru":["Требует среды Python","Должен запускать скрипты из корня репозитория, используя полный путь через `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}`"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","يجب تشغيل السكريبتات من根 المستودع باستخدام المسار الكامل عبر `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"48db8dc157b23cf51d55830e862c3ce3688200b4b6a7523ae841b668bb24e1f9","repoEtag":"W/\"2a524a36d10d78094c72f484233406f0cd4722cd88b5444674b33d0b91d29676\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('expo/skills/expo-api-routes', 'official', 'expo', 'skills', 'expo/skills', 'expo-api-routes', 1131, 45, 100, '2026-02-23T00:15:14Z', '2026-02-23T01:07:32.827Z', 'db4d2cd6fbce04d9a7914db6e37513c218d5fb678e962c034ebfc122c7406fd3', '{"id":"expo/skills/expo-api-routes","name":"expo-api-routes","description":{"zh":"Expo API 路由指南，介绍如何在 Expo Router 中创建 API 路由，保护服务器端秘密和数据库操作","ja":"Expo API ルーティングガイド。Expo Router で API ルートを作成し、サーバーサイドのシークレツとデータベース操作を保護する","ko":"Expo API 路由 가이드. Expo Router에서 API 路由를 생성하여 서버측 비밀과 데이터베이스 연산을 보호합니다","es":"Expo API Routes es una herramienta de AI para crear rutas de API seguras en Expo Router con EAS Hosting","fr":"Expo API Routes est un outil d''IA pour créer des routes d''API sécurisées dans Expo Router avec EAS Hosting","de":"Expo API Routes ist ein KI-Tool zum Erstellen sicherer API-Routen in Expo Router mit EAS Hosting","pt":"expo-api-routes fornece diretrizes para criar rotas de API seguras com EAS Hosting, protegendo segredos do servidor e validando dados","ru":"expo-api-routes предоставляет руководство по созданию безопасных маршрутов API с EAS Hosting, защищая секреты сервера и проверяя данные","ar":"يوفر expo-api-routes إرشادات لإنشاء طرق API آمنة مع EAS Hosting ، لحماية الأسرار الخاصة بالخادم والتحقق من البيانات","en":"Guidelines for creating API routes in Expo Router with EAS Hosting"},"owner":"expo","repo":"skills","repoPath":"expo/skills","stars":1131,"forks":45,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T00:15:14Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"expo-api-routes","description":"Guidelines for creating API routes in Expo Router with EAS Hosting","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"## When to Use API Routes\n\nUse API routes when you need:\n\n- **Server-side secrets** — API keys, database credentials, or tokens that must never reach the client\n- **Database operations** — Direct database queries that shouldn''t be exposed\n- **Third-party API proxies** — Hide API keys when calling external services (OpenAI, Stripe, etc.)\n- **Server-side validation** — Validate data before database writes\n- **Webhook endpoints** — Receive callbacks from services like Stripe or GitHub\n- **Rate limi","body":"## When to Use API Routes\n\nUse API routes when you need:\n\n- **Server-side secrets** — API keys, database credentials, or tokens that must never reach the client\n- **Database operations** — Direct database queries that shouldn''t be exposed\n- **Third-party API proxies** — Hide API keys when calling external services (OpenAI, Stripe, etc.)\n- **Server-side validation** — Validate data before database writes\n- **Webhook endpoints** — Receive callbacks from services like Stripe or GitHub\n- **Rate limiting** — Control access at the server level\n- **Heavy computation** — Offload processing that would be slow on mobile\n\n## When NOT to Use API Routes\n\nAvoid API routes when:\n\n- **Data is already public** — Use direct fetch to public APIs instead\n- **No secrets required** — Static data or client-safe operations\n- **Real-time updates needed** — Use WebSockets or services like Supabase Realtime\n- **Simple CRUD** — Consider Firebase, Supabase, or Convex for managed backends\n- **File uploads** — Use direct-to-storage uploads (S3 presigned URLs, Cloudflare R2)\n- **Authentication only** — Use Clerk, Auth0, or Firebase Auth instead\n\n## File Structure\n\nAPI routes live in the `app` directory with `+api.ts` suffix:\n\n```\napp/\n  api/\n    hello+api.ts          → GET /api/hello\n    users+api.ts          → /api/users\n    users/[id]+api.ts     → /api/users/:id\n  (tabs)/\n    index.tsx\n```\n\n## Basic API Route\n\n```ts\n// app/api/hello+api.ts\nexport function GET(request: Request) {\n  return Response.json({ message: \"Hello from Expo!\" });\n}\n```\n\n## HTTP Methods\n\nExport named functions for each HTTP method:\n\n```ts\n// app/api/items+api.ts\nexport function GET(request: Request) {\n  return Response.json({ items: [] });\n}\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const body = await request.json();\n  return Response.json({ created: body }, { status: 201 });\n}\n\nexport async function PUT(request: Request) {\n  const body = await request.json();\n  return Response.json({ updated: body });\n}\n\nexport async function DELETE(request: Request) {\n  return new Response(null, { status: 204 });\n}\n```\n\n## Dynamic Routes\n\n```ts\n// app/api/users/[id]+api.ts\nexport function GET(request: Request, { id }: { id: string }) {\n  return Response.json({ userId: id });\n}\n```\n\n## Request Handling\n\n### Query Parameters\n\n```ts\nexport function GET(request: Request) {\n  const url = new URL(request.url);\n  const page = url.searchParams.get(\"page\") ?? \"1\";\n  const limit = url.searchParams.get(\"limit\") ?? \"10\";\n\n  return Response.json({ page, limit });\n}\n```\n\n### Headers\n\n```ts\nexport function GET(request: Request) {\n  const auth = request.headers.get(\"Authorization\");\n\n  if (!auth) {\n    return Response.json({ error: \"Unauthorized\" }, { status: 401 });\n  }\n\n  return Response.json({ authenticated: true });\n}\n```\n\n### JSON Body\n\n```ts\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const { email, password } = await request.json();\n\n  if (!email || !password) {\n    return Response.json({ error: \"Missing fields\" }, { status: 400 });\n  }\n\n  return Response.json({ success: true });\n}\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nUse `process.env` for server-side secrets:\n\n```ts\n// app/api/ai+api.ts\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const { prompt } = await request.json();\n\n  const response = await fetch(\"https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions\", {\n    method: \"POST\",\n    headers: {\n      \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n      Authorization: `Bearer ${process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY}`,\n    },\n    body: JSON.stringify({\n      model: \"gpt-4\",\n      messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: prompt }],\n    }),\n  });\n\n  const data = await response.json();\n  return Response.json(data);\n}\n```\n\nSet environment variables:\n\n- **Local**: Create `.env` file (never commit)\n- **EAS Hosting**: Use `eas env:create` or Expo dashboard\n\n## CORS Headers\n\nAdd CORS for web clients:\n\n```ts\nconst corsHeaders = {\n  \"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\": \"*\",\n  \"Access-Control-Allow-Methods\": \"GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS\",\n  \"Access-Control-Allow-Headers\": \"Content-Type, Authorization\",\n};\n\nexport function OPTIONS() {\n  return new Response(null, { headers: corsHeaders });\n}\n\nexport function GET() {\n  return Response.json({ data: \"value\" }, { headers: corsHeaders });\n}\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```ts\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  try {\n    const body = await request.json();\n    // Process...\n    return Response.json({ success: true });\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(\"API error:\", error);\n    return Response.json({ error: \"Internal server error\" }, { status: 500 });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Testing Locally\n\nStart the development server with API routes:\n\n```bash\nnpx expo serve\n```\n\nThis starts a local server at `http://localhost:8081` with full API route support.\n\nTest with curl:\n\n```bash\ncurl http://localhost:8081/api/hello\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:8081/api/users -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d ''{\"name\":\"Test\"}''\n```\n\n## Deployment to EAS Hosting\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g eas-cli\neas login\n```\n\n### Deploy\n\n```bash\neas deploy\n```\n\nThis builds and deploys your API routes to EAS Hosting (Cloudflare Workers).\n\n### Environment Variables for Production\n\n```bash\n# Create a secret\neas env:create --name OPENAI_API_KEY --value sk-xxx --environment production\n\n# Or use the Expo dashboard\n```\n\n### Custom Domain\n\nConfigure in `eas.json` or Expo dashboard.\n\n## EAS Hosting Runtime (Cloudflare Workers)\n\nAPI routes run on Cloudflare Workers. Key limitations:\n\n### Missing/Limited APIs\n\n- **No Node.js filesystem** — `fs` module unavailable\n- **No native Node modules** — Use Web APIs or polyfills\n- **Limited execution time** — 30 second timeout for CPU-intensive tasks\n- **No persistent connections** — WebSockets require Durable Objects\n- **fetch is available** — Use standard fetch for HTTP requests\n\n### Use Web APIs Instead\n\n```ts\n// Use Web Crypto instead of Node crypto\nconst hash = await crypto.subtle.digest(\n  \"SHA-256\",\n  new TextEncoder().encode(\"data\")\n);\n\n// Use fetch instead of node-fetch\nconst response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com\");\n\n// Use Response/Request (already available)\nreturn new Response(JSON.stringify(data), {\n  headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n});\n```\n\n### Database Options\n\nSince filesystem is unavailable, use cloud databases:\n\n- **Cloudflare D1** — SQLite at the edge\n- **Turso** — Distributed SQLite\n- **PlanetScale** — Serverless MySQL\n- **Supabase** — Postgres with REST API\n- **Neon** — Serverless Postgres\n\nExample with Turso:\n\n```ts\n// app/api/users+api.ts\nimport { createClient } from \"@libsql/client/web\";\n\nconst db = createClient({\n  url: process.env.TURSO_URL!,\n  authToken: process.env.TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN!,\n});\n\nexport async function GET() {\n  const result = await db.execute(\"SELECT * FROM users\");\n  return Response.json(result.rows);\n}\n```\n\n## Calling API Routes from Client\n\n```ts\n// From React Native components\nconst response = await fetch(\"/api/hello\");\nconst data = await response.json();\n\n// With body\nconst response = await fetch(\"/api/users\", {\n  method: \"POST\",\n  headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n  body: JSON.stringify({ name: \"John\" }),\n});\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Authentication Middleware\n\n```ts\n// utils/auth.ts\nexport async function requireAuth(request: Request) {\n  const token = request.headers.get(\"Authorization\")?.replace(\"Bearer \", \"\");\n\n  if (!token) {\n    throw new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: \"Unauthorized\" }), {\n      status: 401,\n      headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n    });\n  }\n\n  // Verify token...\n  return { userId: \"123\" };\n}\n\n// app/api/protected+api.ts\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../../utils/auth\";\n\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const { userId } = await requireAuth(request);\n  return Response.json({ userId });\n}\n```\n\n### Proxy External API\n\n```ts\n// app/api/weather+api.ts\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const url = new URL(request.url);\n  const city = url.searchParams.get(\"city\");\n\n  const response = await fetch(\n    `https://api.weather.com/v1/current?city=${city}&key=${process.env.WEATHER_API_KEY}`\n  );\n\n  return Response.json(await response.json());\n}\n```\n\n## Rules\n\n- NEVER expose API keys or secrets in client code\n- ALWAYS validate and sanitize user input\n- Use proper HTTP status codes (200, 201, 400, 401, 404, 500)\n- Handle errors gracefully with try/catch\n- Keep API routes focused — one responsibility per endpoint\n- Use TypeScript for type safety\n- Log errors server-side for debugging\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:07:32.827Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Expo API 路由指南 - AI工具","ja":"Expo API ルーティングガイド - AIエージェント","ko":"Expo API 路由 가이드 - AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de AI: Expo API Routes para Desarrolladores","fr":"Outils d''IA: Routes API Expo pour Développeurs","de":"KI-Tools: Expo API Routes für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: expo-api-routes para Rotas de API","ru":"ИИ Агенты: expo-api-routes для маршрутов API","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: expo-api-routes لطرق API","en":"expo-api-routes"},"description":{"zh":"Expo API 路由指南，介绍如何在 Expo Router 中创建 API 路由，保护服务器端秘密和数据库操作","ja":"Expo API ルーティングガイド。Expo Router で API ルートを作成し、サーバーサイドのシークレツとデータベース操作を保護する","ko":"Expo API 路由 가이드. Expo Router에서 API 路由를 생성하여 서버측 비밀과 데이터베이스 연산을 보호합니다","es":"Expo API Routes es una herramienta de AI para crear rutas de API seguras en Expo Router con EAS Hosting","fr":"Expo API Routes est un outil d''IA pour créer des routes d''API sécurisées dans Expo Router avec EAS Hosting","de":"Expo API Routes ist ein KI-Tool zum Erstellen sicherer API-Routen in Expo Router mit EAS Hosting","pt":"expo-api-routes fornece diretrizes para criar rotas de API seguras com EAS Hosting, protegendo segredos do servidor e validando dados","ru":"expo-api-routes предоставляет руководство по созданию безопасных маршрутов API с EAS Hosting, защищая секреты сервера и проверяя данные","ar":"يوفر expo-api-routes إرشادات لإنشاء طرق API آمنة مع EAS Hosting ، لحماية الأسرار الخاصة بالخادم والتحقق من البيانات","en":"Guidelines for creating API routes in Expo Router with EAS Hosting"},"definition":{"en":"Guidelines for creating API routes in Expo Router with EAS Hosting"},"features":{"zh":["服务器端秘密保护","数据库操作保护","第三方 API 代理","服务器端验证","Webhook 端点"],"ja":["サーバーサイドのシークレツの保護","データベース操作の保護","第三者 API 代理","サーバーサイドのバリデーション","Webhook エンドポイント"],"ko":["서버측 비밀 보호","데이터베이스 연산 보호","제3자 API 프록시","서버측 검증","Webhook 엔드포인트"],"es":["Protección de secretos del servidor","Operaciones de base de datos seguras","Proxy de API de terceros","Validación de datos del lado del servidor","Puntos de conexión de webhook"],"fr":["Protection des secrets du serveur","Opérations de base de données sécurisées","Proxy d''API de tiers","Validation des données du côté du serveur","Points de terminaison de webhook"],"de":["Schutz von Server-Geheimnissen","Sichere Datenbankoperationen","Proxy von Drittanbieter-APIs","Validierung von Daten auf Server-Seite","Webhook-Endpunkte"],"pt":["Proteção de segredos do servidor","Operações de banco de dados seguras","Proxy de API de terceiros","Validação de dados no lado do servidor","Endpoints de webhook"],"ru":["Защита секретов сервера","Безопасные операции с базой данных","Прокси API третьих сторон","Проверка данных на стороне сервера","Конечные точки webhook"],"ar":["حماية الأسرار الخاصة بالخادم","عمليات قاعدة البيانات الآمنة","وكالة API للطرف الثالث","التحقق من البيانات على сторة الخادم","نقاط النهاية للويب هوك"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo API 路由","Expo Router","EAS Hosting","服务器端秘密","数据库操作","第三方 API 代理","服务器端验证","Webhook 端点","AI 工具"],"ja":["Expo API ルーティング","Expo Router","EAS Hosting","サーバーサイドのシークレツ","データベース操作","第三者 API 代理","サーバーサイドのバリデーション","Webhook エンドポイント","AI エージェント"],"ko":["Expo API 路由","Expo Router","EAS Hosting","서버측 비밀","데이터베이스 연산","제3자 API 프록시","서버측 검증","Webhook 엔드포인트","AI 에이전트"],"es":["Herramientas de AI","Expo API Routes","EAS Hosting","Rutas de API seguras","Secretos del servidor","Operaciones de base de datos","Proxy de API de terceros"],"fr":["Outils d''IA","Expo API Routes","EAS Hosting","Routes d''API sécurisées","Secrets du serveur","Opérations de base de données","Proxy d''API de tiers"],"de":["KI-Tools","Expo API Routes","EAS Hosting","Sichere API-Routen","Server-Geheimnisse","Datenbankoperationen","Proxy von Drittanbieter-APIs"],"pt":["expo-api-routes","rotas de API","EAS Hosting","segredos do servidor","validação de dados","webhook","ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de API"],"ru":["expo-api-routes","маршруты API","EAS Hosting","секреты сервера","проверка данных","вебхук","инструменты ИИ","разработка API"],"ar":["expo-api-routes","طرق API","EAS Hosting","أسرار الخادم","التحقق من البيانات","ويب هوك","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير API"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile Agents leveraging Expo Router with EAS Hosting for secure server-side operations.","zh":"适用于使用 Expo Router 和 EAS Hosting 进行安全服务器端操作的移动代理。","ja":"Expo Router と EAS Hosting を使用してセキュアなサーバーサイド操作を行うモバイルエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Expo Router와 EAS Hosting을 사용하여 보안 서버 측 작업을 수행하는 모바일 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes móviles que utilizan Expo Router con EAS Hosting para operaciones seguras en el servidor.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents mobiles utilisant Expo Router avec EAS Hosting pour des opérations sécurisées sur le serveur.","de":"Ideal für mobile Agenten, die Expo Router mit EAS Hosting für sichere Server-Seitige Operationen nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Móveis que utilizam o Expo Router com EAS Hosting para operações de servidor seguro.","ru":"Идеально подходит для мобильных агентов, использующих Expo Router с EAS Hosting для безопасных серверных операций.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل المحمول التي تستخدم Expo Router مع استضافة EAS للعمليات الجانبية للخادم آمنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create secure API routes for handling server-side secrets, database operations, and third-party API proxies, leveraging Expo Router and EAS Hosting for scalable and secure backend infrastructure, including support for rate limiting and webhook endpoints.","zh":"赋予代理创建安全的 API 路由来处理服务器端秘密、数据库操作和第三方 API 代理的能力，利用 Expo Router 和 EAS Hosting 实现可扩展和安全的后端基础设施，包括对限速和 webhook 端点的支持。","ja":"Expo Router と EAS Hosting を使用して、スケーラブルでセキュアなバックエンドインフラストラクチャを実現し、レート制限や webhook エンドポイントを含むサーバーサイドシークレット、データベース操作、およびサードパーティ API プロキシのハンドリング用のセキュアな API ルートを作成するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"Expo Router와 EAS Hosting을 사용하여 확장 가능하고 보안이 강화된 백엔드 인프라를 구현하고, 속도 제한 및 웹후크 엔드포인트를 포함하여 서버 측 비밀, 데이터베이스 작업 및 제3자 API 프록시를 처리하기 위한 보안 API 라우트를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear rutas de API seguras para el manejo de secretos en el servidor, operaciones de base de datos y proxies de API de terceros, aprovechando Expo Router y EAS Hosting para una infraestructura de backend escalable y segura, incluyendo soporte para limitación de velocidad y puntos de conexión de webhook.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des routes d''API sécurisées pour la gestion de secrets serveur, d''opérations de base de données et de proxies d''API de tiers, en exploitant Expo Router et EAS Hosting pour une infrastructure de backend scalable et sécurisée, y compris la prise en charge de la limitation de débit et des points de terminaison de webhook.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, sichere API-Routen für die Handhabung von Server-Seitigen Geheimnissen, Datenbankoperationen und API-Proxy von Drittanbietern zu erstellen, indem Expo Router und EAS Hosting für eine skalierbare und sichere Backend-Infrastruktur genutzt werden, einschließlich Unterstützung für Rate Limiting und Webhook-Endpunkte.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar rotas de API seguras para manipulação de segredos de servidor, operações de banco de dados e proxies de API de terceiros, utilizando o Expo Router e EAS Hosting para infraestrutura de backend escalável e segura, incluindo suporte a limitação de taxa e pontos de extremidade de webhook.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать безопасные маршруты API для обработки серверных секретов, операций с базами данных и прокси-API третьих сторон, используя Expo Router и EAS Hosting для масштабируемой и безопасной инфраструктуры бэкенда, включая поддержку ограничения скорости и конечных точек webhook.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء طرق API آمنة لمعالجة الأسرار الجانبية للخادم وعمليات قواعد البيانات ووكلاء API للطرف الثالث، باستخدام Expo Router و EAS Hosting لبيئة الخادم الخلفية القابلة للتوسيع والأمن، بما في ذلك دعم Rate Limiting وWebhook Endpoints."},"useCases":{"en":["Securing server-side secrets like API keys and database credentials","Proxying third-party APIs to hide sensitive information like OpenAI or Stripe API keys","Validating user data on the server-side before writing to databases"],"zh":["保护服务器端秘密，如 API 密钥和数据库凭据","代理第三方 API 以隐藏敏感信息，如 OpenAI 或 Stripe API 密钥","在写入数据库之前在服务器端验证用户数据"],"ja":["API キーまたはデータベース資格情報などのサーバーサイドシークレットを保護する","OpenAI または Stripe API キーなどの機密情報を隠すためにサードパーティ API をプロキシする","データベースに書き込む前にサーバーサイドでユーザーデータを検証する"],"ko":["API 키 또는 데이터베이스 자격 증명과 같은 서버 측 비밀을 보호하는 것","OpenAI 또는 Stripe API 키와 같은 민감한 정보를 숨기기 위해 제3자 API를 프록시하는 것","데이터베이스에 쓰기 전에 서버 측에서 사용자 데이터를 확인하는 것"],"es":["Proteger secretos en el servidor como claves de API y credenciales de base de datos","Proxy de API de terceros para ocultar información sensible como claves de API de OpenAI o Stripe","Validar datos de usuario en el servidor antes de escribir en bases de datos"],"fr":["Sécuriser les secrets serveur tels que les clés d''API et les informations d''identification de base de données","Proxy d''API de tiers pour masquer les informations sensibles telles que les clés d''API OpenAI ou Stripe","Valider les données utilisateur sur le serveur avant de les écrire dans les bases de données"],"de":["Sichere Server-Seitige Geheimnisse wie API-Schlüssel und Datenbank-Zugangsdaten schützen","Proxy von Drittanbieter-APIs, um sensible Informationen wie OpenAI- oder Stripe-API-Schlüssel zu verbergen","Validieren von Benutzerdaten auf dem Server, bevor sie in Datenbanken geschrieben werden"],"pt":["Proteger segredos do servidor, como chaves de API e credenciais de banco de dados","Fazer proxy de APIs de terceiros para ocultar informações sensíveis, como chaves de API do OpenAI ou Stripe","Validar dados de usuário no lado do servidor antes de gravar em bancos de dados"],"ru":["Защищать серверные секреты, такие как ключи API и учетные данные базы данных","Проксируйте API третьих сторон, чтобы скрыть конфиденциальную информацию, такую как ключи API OpenAI или Stripe","Проверять данные пользователя на стороне сервера перед записью в базы данных"],"ar":["حماية الأسرار الجانبية للخادم، مثل مفاتيح API وبيانات اعتماد قاعدة البيانات","التوجيه الوسيط لبروتوكولات API للطرف الثالث لإخفاء المعلومات الحساسة، مثل مفاتيح API OpenAI أو Stripe","التحقق من بيانات المستخدم على جانب الخادم قبل الكتابة إلى قواعد البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo Router and EAS Hosting setup","Limited to handling server-side operations, not client-side logic"],"zh":["需要 Expo Router 和 EAS Hosting 设置","仅限处理服务器端操作，不处理客户端逻辑"],"ja":["Expo Router と EAS Hosting の設定が必要","サーバーサイド操作の処理のみを行い、クライアントサイドロジックは処理しない"],"ko":["Expo Router와 EAS Hosting 설정이 필요함","서버 측 작업만 처리하고, 클라이언트 측 논리는 처리하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de Expo Router y EAS Hosting","Limitado al manejo de operaciones en el servidor, no a la lógica del cliente"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration d''Expo Router et EAS Hosting","Limité à la gestion des opérations serveur, et non à la logique client"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung von Expo Router und EAS Hosting","Begrenzt auf die Handhabung von Server-Seitigen Operationen, nicht auf Client-Seitige Logik"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Expo Router e EAS Hosting","Limitado ao tratamento de operações de servidor, não lógica de cliente"],"ru":["Требует настройки Expo Router и EAS Hosting","Ограничен обработкой серверных операций, а не клиентской логикой"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Expo Router و EAS Hosting","محدود بمعالجة عمليات الخادم، وليس منطق العميل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"db4d2cd6fbce04d9a7914db6e37513c218d5fb678e962c034ebfc122c7406fd3","repoEtag":"W/\"107a941bd72b6ce7813b313cd45d74048195bce8f83f76bf6a45d60c761e717a\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('expo/skills/expo-tailwind-setup', 'official', 'expo', 'skills', 'expo/skills', 'expo-tailwind-setup', 1131, 45, 100, '2026-02-23T00:15:14Z', '2026-02-23T01:07:32.913Z', '6abfc223a376571e0ee84014b3b474a3f2828ac2ebcde59c5c2b6b4bc802e233', '{"id":"expo/skills/expo-tailwind-setup","name":"expo-tailwind-setup","description":{"zh":"本指南介绍如何在 Expo 中使用 react-native-css 和 NativeWind v5 设置 Tailwind CSS v4，实现跨平台样式统一","ja":"このガイドでは、Expo で react-native-css と NativeWind v5 を使用して Tailwind CSS v4 を設定する方法を紹介します","ko":"본 가이드에서는 Expo에서 react-native-css와 NativeWind v5를 사용하여 Tailwind CSS v4를 설정하는 방법을介绍합니다","es":"Esta guía cubre la configuración de Tailwind CSS v4 en Expo con react-native-css y NativeWind v5 para estilos universales.","fr":"Ce guide couvre la configuration de Tailwind CSS v4 dans Expo avec react-native-css et NativeWind v5 pour des styles universels.","de":"Diese Anleitung behandelt die Einrichtung von Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo mit react-native-css und NativeWind v5 für universelle Styles.","pt":"Configuração do Tailwind CSS v4 no Expo com react-native-css e NativeWind v5 para estilização universal","ru":"Настройка Tailwind CSS v4 в Expo с react-native-css и NativeWind v5 для универсальной стилизации","ar":"إعداد Tailwind CSS v4 في Expo باستخدام react-native-css و NativeWind v5 لتحقيق التنسيق الشامل","en":"Set up Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo with react-native-css and NativeWind v5 for universal styling"},"owner":"expo","repo":"skills","repoPath":"expo/skills","stars":1131,"forks":45,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T00:15:14Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"expo-tailwind-setup","description":"Set up Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo with react-native-css and NativeWind v5 for universal styling","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Setup for Expo with react-native-css\n\nThis guide covers setting up Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo using react-native-css and NativeWind v5 for universal styling across iOS, Android, and Web.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis setup uses:\n\n- **Tailwind CSS v4** - Modern CSS-first configuration\n- **react-native-css** - CSS runtime for React Native\n- **NativeWind v5** - Metro transformer for Tailwind in React Native\n- **@tailwindcss/postcss** - PostCSS plugin for Tailwind v4\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Ins","body":"# Tailwind CSS Setup for Expo with react-native-css\n\nThis guide covers setting up Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo using react-native-css and NativeWind v5 for universal styling across iOS, Android, and Web.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis setup uses:\n\n- **Tailwind CSS v4** - Modern CSS-first configuration\n- **react-native-css** - CSS runtime for React Native\n- **NativeWind v5** - Metro transformer for Tailwind in React Native\n- **@tailwindcss/postcss** - PostCSS plugin for Tailwind v4\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies\nnpx expo install tailwindcss@^4 nativewind@5.0.0-preview.2 react-native-css@0.0.0-nightly.5ce6396 @tailwindcss/postcss tailwind-merge clsx\n```\n\nAdd resolutions for lightningcss compatibility:\n\n```json\n// package.json\n{\n  \"resolutions\": {\n    \"lightningcss\": \"1.30.1\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n- autoprefixer is not needed in Expo because of lightningcss\n- postcss is included in expo by default\n\n## Configuration Files\n\n### Metro Config\n\nCreate or update `metro.config.js`:\n\n```js\n// metro.config.js\nconst { getDefaultConfig } = require(\"expo/metro-config\");\nconst { withNativewind } = require(\"nativewind/metro\");\n\n/** @type {import(''expo/metro-config'').MetroConfig} */\nconst config = getDefaultConfig(__dirname);\n\nmodule.exports = withNativewind(config, {\n  // inline variables break PlatformColor in CSS variables\n  inlineVariables: false,\n  // We add className support manually\n  globalClassNamePolyfill: false,\n});\n```\n\n### PostCSS Config\n\nCreate `postcss.config.mjs`:\n\n```js\n// postcss.config.mjs\nexport default {\n  plugins: {\n    \"@tailwindcss/postcss\": {},\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### Global CSS\n\nCreate `src/global.css`:\n\n```css\n@import \"tailwindcss/theme.css\" layer(theme);\n@import \"tailwindcss/preflight.css\" layer(base);\n@import \"tailwindcss/utilities.css\";\n\n/* Platform-specific font families */\n@media android {\n  :root {\n    --font-mono: monospace;\n    --font-rounded: normal;\n    --font-serif: serif;\n    --font-sans: normal;\n  }\n}\n\n@media ios {\n  :root {\n    --font-mono: ui-monospace;\n    --font-serif: ui-serif;\n    --font-sans: system-ui;\n    --font-rounded: ui-rounded;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## IMPORTANT: No Babel Config Needed\n\nWith Tailwind v4 and NativeWind v5, you do NOT need a babel.config.js for Tailwind. Remove any NativeWind babel presets if present:\n\n```js\n// DELETE babel.config.js if it only contains NativeWind config\n// The following is NO LONGER needed:\n// module.exports = function (api) {\n//   api.cache(true);\n//   return {\n//     presets: [\n//       [\"babel-preset-expo\", { jsxImportSource: \"nativewind\" }],\n//       \"nativewind/babel\",\n//     ],\n//   };\n// };\n```\n\n## CSS Component Wrappers\n\nSince react-native-css requires explicit CSS element wrapping, create reusable components:\n\n### Main Components (`src/tw/index.tsx`)\n\n```tsx\nimport {\n  useCssElement,\n  useNativeVariable as useFunctionalVariable,\n} from \"react-native-css\";\n\nimport { Link as RouterLink } from \"expo-router\";\nimport Animated from \"react-native-reanimated\";\nimport React from \"react\";\nimport {\n  View as RNView,\n  Text as RNText,\n  Pressable as RNPressable,\n  ScrollView as RNScrollView,\n  TouchableHighlight as RNTouchableHighlight,\n  TextInput as RNTextInput,\n  StyleSheet,\n} from \"react-native\";\n\n// CSS-enabled Link\nexport const Link = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RouterLink> & { className?: string }\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(RouterLink, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\n\nLink.Trigger = RouterLink.Trigger;\nLink.Menu = RouterLink.Menu;\nLink.MenuAction = RouterLink.MenuAction;\nLink.Preview = RouterLink.Preview;\n\n// CSS Variable hook\nexport const useCSSVariable =\n  process.env.EXPO_OS !== \"web\"\n    ? useFunctionalVariable\n    : (variable: string) => `var(${variable})`;\n\n// View\nexport type ViewProps = React.ComponentProps<typeof RNView> & {\n  className?: string;\n};\n\nexport const View = (props: ViewProps) => {\n  return useCssElement(RNView, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\nView.displayName = \"CSS(View)\";\n\n// Text\nexport const Text = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RNText> & { className?: string }\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(RNText, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\nText.displayName = \"CSS(Text)\";\n\n// ScrollView\nexport const ScrollView = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RNScrollView> & {\n    className?: string;\n    contentContainerClassName?: string;\n  }\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(RNScrollView, props, {\n    className: \"style\",\n    contentContainerClassName: \"contentContainerStyle\",\n  });\n};\nScrollView.displayName = \"CSS(ScrollView)\";\n\n// Pressable\nexport const Pressable = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RNPressable> & { className?: string }\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(RNPressable, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\nPressable.displayName = \"CSS(Pressable)\";\n\n// TextInput\nexport const TextInput = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RNTextInput> & { className?: string }\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(RNTextInput, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\nTextInput.displayName = \"CSS(TextInput)\";\n\n// AnimatedScrollView\nexport const AnimatedScrollView = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof Animated.ScrollView> & {\n    className?: string;\n    contentClassName?: string;\n    contentContainerClassName?: string;\n  }\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(Animated.ScrollView, props, {\n    className: \"style\",\n    contentClassName: \"contentContainerStyle\",\n    contentContainerClassName: \"contentContainerStyle\",\n  });\n};\n\n// TouchableHighlight with underlayColor extraction\nfunction XXTouchableHighlight(\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RNTouchableHighlight>\n) {\n  const { underlayColor, ...style } = StyleSheet.flatten(props.style) || {};\n  return (\n    <RNTouchableHighlight\n      underlayColor={underlayColor}\n      {...props}\n      style={style}\n    />\n  );\n}\n\nexport const TouchableHighlight = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof RNTouchableHighlight>\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(XXTouchableHighlight, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\nTouchableHighlight.displayName = \"CSS(TouchableHighlight)\";\n```\n\n### Image Component (`src/tw/image.tsx`)\n\n```tsx\nimport { useCssElement } from \"react-native-css\";\nimport React from \"react\";\nimport { StyleSheet } from \"react-native\";\nimport Animated from \"react-native-reanimated\";\nimport { Image as RNImage } from \"expo-image\";\n\nconst AnimatedExpoImage = Animated.createAnimatedComponent(RNImage);\n\nexport type ImageProps = React.ComponentProps<typeof Image>;\n\nfunction CSSImage(props: React.ComponentProps<typeof AnimatedExpoImage>) {\n  // @ts-expect-error: Remap objectFit style to contentFit property\n  const { objectFit, objectPosition, ...style } =\n    StyleSheet.flatten(props.style) || {};\n\n  return (\n    <AnimatedExpoImage\n      contentFit={objectFit}\n      contentPosition={objectPosition}\n      {...props}\n      source={\n        typeof props.source === \"string\" ? { uri: props.source } : props.source\n      }\n      // @ts-expect-error: Style is remapped above\n      style={style}\n    />\n  );\n}\n\nexport const Image = (\n  props: React.ComponentProps<typeof CSSImage> & { className?: string }\n) => {\n  return useCssElement(CSSImage, props, { className: \"style\" });\n};\n\nImage.displayName = \"CSS(Image)\";\n```\n\n### Animated Components (`src/tw/animated.tsx`)\n\n```tsx\nimport * as TW from \"./index\";\nimport RNAnimated from \"react-native-reanimated\";\n\nexport const Animated = {\n  ...RNAnimated,\n  View: RNAnimated.createAnimatedComponent(TW.View),\n};\n```\n\n## Usage\n\nImport CSS-wrapped components from your tw directory:\n\n```tsx\nimport { View, Text, ScrollView, Image } from \"@/tw\";\n\nexport default function MyScreen() {\n  return (\n    <ScrollView className=\"flex-1 bg-white\">\n      <View className=\"p-4 gap-4\">\n        <Text className=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900\">Hello Tailwind!</Text>\n        <Image\n          className=\"w-full h-48 rounded-lg object-cover\"\n          source={{ uri: \"https://example.com/image.jpg\" }}\n        />\n      </View>\n    </ScrollView>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Custom Theme Variables\n\nAdd custom theme variables in your global.css using `@theme`:\n\n```css\n@layer theme {\n  @theme {\n    /* Custom fonts */\n    --font-rounded: \"SF Pro Rounded\", sans-serif;\n\n    /* Custom line heights */\n    --text-xs--line-height: calc(1em / 0.75);\n    --text-sm--line-height: calc(1.25em / 0.875);\n    --text-base--line-height: calc(1.5em / 1);\n\n    /* Custom leading scales */\n    --leading-tight: 1.25em;\n    --leading-snug: 1.375em;\n    --leading-normal: 1.5em;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Platform-Specific Styles\n\nUse platform media queries for platform-specific styling:\n\n```css\n@media ios {\n  :root {\n    --font-sans: system-ui;\n    --font-rounded: ui-rounded;\n  }\n}\n\n@media android {\n  :root {\n    --font-sans: normal;\n    --font-rounded: normal;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Apple System Colors with CSS Variables\n\nCreate a CSS file for Apple semantic colors:\n\n```css\n/* src/css/sf.css */\n@layer base {\n  html {\n    color-scheme: light;\n  }\n}\n\n:root {\n  /* Accent colors with light/dark mode */\n  --sf-blue: light-dark(rgb(0 122 255), rgb(10 132 255));\n  --sf-green: light-dark(rgb(52 199 89), rgb(48 209 89));\n  --sf-red: light-dark(rgb(255 59 48), rgb(255 69 58));\n\n  /* Gray scales */\n  --sf-gray: light-dark(rgb(142 142 147), rgb(142 142 147));\n  --sf-gray-2: light-dark(rgb(174 174 178), rgb(99 99 102));\n\n  /* Text colors */\n  --sf-text: light-dark(rgb(0 0 0), rgb(255 255 255));\n  --sf-text-2: light-dark(rgb(60 60 67 / 0.6), rgb(235 235 245 / 0.6));\n\n  /* Background colors */\n  --sf-bg: light-dark(rgb(255 255 255), rgb(0 0 0));\n  --sf-bg-2: light-dark(rgb(242 242 247), rgb(28 28 30));\n}\n\n/* iOS native colors via platformColor */\n@media ios {\n  :root {\n    --sf-blue: platformColor(systemBlue);\n    --sf-green: platformColor(systemGreen);\n    --sf-red: platformColor(systemRed);\n    --sf-gray: platformColor(systemGray);\n    --sf-text: platformColor(label);\n    --sf-text-2: platformColor(secondaryLabel);\n    --sf-bg: platformColor(systemBackground);\n    --sf-bg-2: platformColor(secondarySystemBackground);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Register as Tailwind theme colors */\n@layer theme {\n  @theme {\n    --color-sf-blue: var(--sf-blue);\n    --color-sf-green: var(--sf-green);\n    --color-sf-red: var(--sf-red);\n    --color-sf-gray: var(--sf-gray);\n    --color-sf-text: var(--sf-text);\n    --color-sf-text-2: var(--sf-text-2);\n    --color-sf-bg: var(--sf-bg);\n    --color-sf-bg-2: var(--sf-bg-2);\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThen use in components:\n\n```tsx\n<Text className=\"text-sf-text\">Primary text</Text>\n<Text className=\"text-sf-text-2\">Secondary text</Text>\n<View className=\"bg-sf-bg\">...</View>\n```\n\n## Using CSS Variables in JavaScript\n\nUse the `useCSSVariable` hook:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useCSSVariable } from \"@/tw\";\n\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  const blue = useCSSVariable(\"--sf-blue\");\n\n  return <View style={{ borderColor: blue }} />;\n}\n```\n\n## Key Differences from NativeWind v4 / Tailwind v3\n\n1. **No babel.config.js** - Configuration is now CSS-first\n2. **PostCSS plugin** - Uses `@tailwindcss/postcss` instead of `tailwindcss`\n3. **CSS imports** - Use `@import \"tailwindcss/...\"` instead of `@tailwind` directives\n4. **Theme config** - Use `@theme` in CSS instead of `tailwind.config.js`\n5. **Component wrappers** - Must wrap components with `useCssElement` for className support\n6. **Metro config** - Use `withNativewind` with different options (`inlineVariables: false`)\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Styles not applying\n\n1. Ensure you have the CSS file imported in your app entry\n2. Check that components are wrapped with `useCssElement`\n3. Verify Metro config has `withNativewind` applied\n\n### Platform colors not working\n\n1. Use `platformColor()` in `@media ios` blocks\n2. Fall back to `light-dark()` for web/Android\n\n### TypeScript errors\n\nAdd className to component props:\n\n```tsx\ntype Props = React.ComponentProps<typeof RNView> & { className?: string };\n```\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:07:32.913Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：Expo Tailwind CSS 设置","ja":"AIエージェント：Expo Tailwind CSS 設定","ko":"AI 에이전트: Expo Tailwind CSS 설정","es":"Configuración de Tailwind CSS en Expo con react-native-cs...","fr":"Mise en place de Tailwind CSS dans Expo avec react-native...","de":"Einrichtung von Tailwind CSS in Expo mit react-native-css...","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Configuração do Expo-Tailwind","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Настройка Expo-Tailwind","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: إعداد Expo-Tailwind","en":"expo-tailwind-setup"},"description":{"zh":"本指南介绍如何在 Expo 中使用 react-native-css 和 NativeWind v5 设置 Tailwind CSS v4，实现跨平台样式统一","ja":"このガイドでは、Expo で react-native-css と NativeWind v5 を使用して Tailwind CSS v4 を設定する方法を紹介します","ko":"본 가이드에서는 Expo에서 react-native-css와 NativeWind v5를 사용하여 Tailwind CSS v4를 설정하는 방법을介绍합니다","es":"Esta guía cubre la configuración de Tailwind CSS v4 en Expo con react-native-css y NativeWind v5 para estilos universales.","fr":"Ce guide couvre la configuration de Tailwind CSS v4 dans Expo avec react-native-css et NativeWind v5 pour des styles universels.","de":"Diese Anleitung behandelt die Einrichtung von Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo mit react-native-css und NativeWind v5 für universelle Styles.","pt":"Configuração do Tailwind CSS v4 no Expo com react-native-css e NativeWind v5 para estilização universal","ru":"Настройка Tailwind CSS v4 в Expo с react-native-css и NativeWind v5 для универсальной стилизации","ar":"إعداد Tailwind CSS v4 في Expo باستخدام react-native-css و NativeWind v5 لتحقيق التنسيق الشامل","en":"Set up Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo with react-native-css and NativeWind v5 for universal styling"},"definition":{"en":"Set up Tailwind CSS v4 in Expo with react-native-css and NativeWind v5 for universal styling"},"features":{"zh":["使用 Tailwind CSS v4 实现现代 CSS-first 配置","使用 react-native-css 实现 CSS 运行时","使用 NativeWind v5 实现 Metro 变换器","支持跨 iOS、Android 和 Web 的通用样式"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4 を使用してモダンな CSS-first 構成を実現","react-native-css を使用して CSS ランタイムを実現","NativeWind v5 を使用して Metro トランスフォーマーを実現","iOS、Android、Web でユニバーサルなスタイリングを実現"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4를 사용하여 모던 CSS-first 구성 구현","react-native-css를 사용하여 CSS 런타임 구현","NativeWind v5를 사용하여 Metro 트랜스포머 구현","iOS, Android, Web에서 유니버설 스타일링 구현"],"es":["Configuración de Tailwind CSS v4","Uso de react-native-css para estilos en React Native","Integración con NativeWind v5 para estilos universales","Compatibilidad con iOS, Android y Web","Uso de @tailwindcss/postcss para la configuración de PostCSS"],"fr":["Configuration de Tailwind CSS v4","Utilisation de react-native-css pour les styles dans React Native","Intégration avec NativeWind v5 pour les styles universels","Compatibilité avec iOS, Android et Web","Utilisation de @tailwindcss/postcss pour la configuration de PostCSS"],"de":["Konfiguration von Tailwind CSS v4","Verwendung von react-native-css für Styles in React Native","Integration mit NativeWind v5 für universelle Styles","Kompatibilität mit iOS, Android und Web","Verwendung von @tailwindcss/postcss für die Konfiguration von PostCSS"],"pt":["Tailwind CSS v4","react-native-css","NativeWind v5","Estilização universal em iOS, Android e Web","Configuração moderna do CSS","Metro transformer para Tailwind em React Native"],"ru":["Tailwind CSS v4","react-native-css","NativeWind v5","Универсальная стилизация на iOS, Android и Web","Современная конфигурация CSS","Metro-трансформер для Tailwind в React Native"],"ar":["Tailwind CSS v4","react-native-css","NativeWind v5","التنسيق الشامل على أجهزة iOS و Android والويب","إعداد حديث للCSS","مُحَوّل Metro لتحقيق Tailwind في React Native"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo","Tailwind CSS","react-native-css","NativeWind","跨平台样式","CSS-first","Metro 变换器"],"ja":["Expo","Tailwind CSS","react-native-css","NativeWind","ユニバーサルなスタイリング","CSS-first","Metro トランスフォーマー"],"ko":["Expo","Tailwind CSS","react-native-css","NativeWind","유니버설 스타일링","CSS-first","Metro 트랜스포머"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","Expo","react-native-css","NativeWind","estilos universales","iOS","Android","Web","inteligencia artificial","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","Expo","react-native-css","NativeWind","styles universels","iOS","Android","Web","intelligence artificielle","outils de développement"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","Expo","react-native-css","NativeWind","universelle Styles","iOS","Android","Web","künstliche Intelligenz","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["expo-tailwind-setup","Tailwind CSS","react-native-css","NativeWind","estilização universal","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","React Native","CSS","estilização"],"ru":["expo-tailwind-setup","Tailwind CSS","react-native-css","NativeWind","универсальная стилизация","разработка мобильных приложений","React Native","CSS","стилизация"],"ar":["expo-tailwind-setup","Tailwind CSS","react-native-css","NativeWind","التنسيق الشامل","تطوير التطبيقات النقالة","React Native","CSS","التنسيق"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing universal styling capabilities across iOS, Android, and Web with Tailwind CSS v4 and React Native","zh":"非常适合需要在 iOS、Android 和 Web 上提供通用样式功能的前端代理，使用 Tailwind CSS v4 和 React Native","ja":"iOS、Android、Web 上で汎用的なスタイリング機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適で、Tailwind CSS v4 と React Native を使用","ko":"iOS, Android, Web에서 범용 스타일 기능을 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽한 솔루션으로, Tailwind CSS v4와 React Native를 사용","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de estilo universal en iOS, Android y Web con Tailwind CSS v4 y React Native","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend nécessitant des capacités de style universel sur iOS, Android et Web avec Tailwind CSS v4 et React Native","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die universelle Styling-Fähigkeiten über iOS, Android und Web mit Tailwind CSS v4 und React Native benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades de estilização universais em iOS, Android e Web com Tailwind CSS v4 e React Native","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы универсальные возможности стилизации для iOS, Android и Web с Tailwind CSS v4 и React Native","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تنسيق عالمية عبر iOS و Android والويب مع Tailwind CSS v4 و React Native"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Tailwind CSS v4, react-native-css, and NativeWind v5 for consistent styling, utilizing PostCSS plugin @tailwindcss/postcss for seamless integration, and enabling universal styling across multiple platforms","zh":"赋予代理使用 Tailwind CSS v4、react-native-css 和 NativeWind v5 进行一致的样式设置，利用 PostCSS 插件 @tailwindcss/postcss 实现无缝集成，并在多个平台上实现通用样式","ja":"エージェントが Tailwind CSS v4、react-native-css、NativeWind v5 を使用して一貫したスタイリングを行えるようにし、PostCSS プラグイン @tailwindcss/postcss を使用してシームレスな統合を実現し、複数のプラットフォームで汎用的なスタイリングを可能にする","ko":"에이전트가 Tailwind CSS v4, react-native-css, NativeWind v5를 사용하여 일관된 스타일링을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, PostCSS 플러그인 @tailwindcss/postcss를 사용하여 무결점 통합을 구현하고, 여러 플랫폼에서 범용 스타일링을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar Tailwind CSS v4, react-native-css y NativeWind v5 para un estilo coherente, utilizando el plugin PostCSS @tailwindcss/postcss para una integración sin problemas y permitiendo un estilo universal en varias plataformas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser Tailwind CSS v4, react-native-css et NativeWind v5 pour un style cohérent, en utilisant le plugin PostCSS @tailwindcss/postcss pour une intégration sans problème et en permettant un style universel sur plusieurs plates-formes","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Tailwind CSS v4, react-native-css und NativeWind v5 für konsistentes Styling zu nutzen, unter Verwendung des PostCSS-Plugins @tailwindcss/postcss für eine nahtlose Integration und ermöglicht universelles Styling auf mehreren Plattformen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar Tailwind CSS v4, react-native-css e NativeWind v5 para estilização consistente, utilizando o plugin PostCSS @tailwindcss/postcss para integração sem problemas e permitindo estilização universal em várias plataformas","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать Tailwind CSS v4, react-native-css и NativeWind v5 для последовательного стилизации, используя плагин PostCSS @tailwindcss/postcss для бесшовной интеграции и обеспечивая универсальное стилизацию на нескольких платформах","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من Tailwind CSS v4 و react-native-css و NativeWind v5 لتنسيق متسق، مع استخدام ملحق PostCSS @tailwindcss/postcss من أجل تكامل سلس، وتمكين التنسيق العالمي عبر منصات متعددة"},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up universal styling for Expo projects","Configuring Tailwind CSS v4 with react-native-css and NativeWind v5","Debugging styling issues across iOS, Android, and Web"],"zh":["为 Expo 项目设置通用样式","配置 Tailwind CSS v4 与 react-native-css 和 NativeWind v5","跨 iOS、Android 和 Web 调试样式问题"],"ja":["Expo プロジェクト用の汎用的なスタイリングを設定","Tailwind CSS v4 と react-native-css、NativeWind v5 を構成","iOS、Android、Web 跨プラットフォームでのスタイリングの問題をデバッグ"],"ko":["Expo 프로젝트를 위한 범용 스타일 설정","Tailwind CSS v4와 react-native-css, NativeWind v5 구성","iOS, Android, Web跨 플랫폼 스타일 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Configuración de estilo universal para proyectos Expo","Configuración de Tailwind CSS v4 con react-native-css y NativeWind v5","Depuración de problemas de estilo en iOS, Android y Web"],"fr":["Configuration du style universel pour les projets Expo","Configuration de Tailwind CSS v4 avec react-native-css et NativeWind v5","Débogage des problèmes de style sur iOS, Android et Web"],"de":["Einrichtung von universellem Styling für Expo-Projekte","Konfiguration von Tailwind CSS v4 mit react-native-css und NativeWind v5","Fehlerbehebung bei Styling-Problemen unter iOS, Android und Web"],"pt":["Configurar estilização universal para projetos Expo","Configurar Tailwind CSS v4 com react-native-css e NativeWind v5","Depurar problemas de estilização em iOS, Android e Web"],"ru":["Настройка универсальной стилизации для проектов Expo","Настройка Tailwind CSS v4 с react-native-css и NativeWind v5","Отладка проблем стилизации на iOS, Android и Web"],"ar":["تكوين تنسيق عالمي لمشاريع Expo","تكوين Tailwind CSS v4 مع react-native-css و NativeWind v5","تصحيح مشاكل التنسيق عبر iOS و Android والويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo environment","Limited to React Native projects","Dependent on Tailwind CSS v4 and NativeWind v5 compatibility"],"zh":["需要 Expo 环境","仅限 React Native 项目","依赖于 Tailwind CSS v4 和 NativeWind v5 兼容性"],"ja":["Expo 環境が必要","React Native プロジェクトのみ","Tailwind CSS v4 と NativeWind v5 の互換性に依存"],"ko":["Expo 환경 필요","React Native 프로젝트만 해당","Tailwind CSS v4와 NativeWind v5 호환성에 종속"],"es":["Requiere entorno Expo","Limitado a proyectos React Native","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de Tailwind CSS v4 y NativeWind v5"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Expo","Limité aux projets React Native","Dépend de la compatibilité de Tailwind CSS v4 et NativeWind v5"],"de":["Benötigt Expo-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf React Native-Projekte","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität von Tailwind CSS v4 und NativeWind v5"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Expo","Limitado a projetos React Native","Dependente da compatibilidade de Tailwind CSS v4 e NativeWind v5"],"ru":["Требуется среда Expo","Ограничен проектами React Native","Зависит от совместимости Tailwind CSS v4 и NativeWind v5"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Expo","محدود بمشاريع React Native","يعتمد على توافق Tailwind CSS v4 و NativeWind v5"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6abfc223a376571e0ee84014b3b474a3f2828ac2ebcde59c5c2b6b4bc802e233","repoEtag":"W/\"107a941bd72b6ce7813b313cd45d74048195bce8f83f76bf6a45d60c761e717a\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('expo/skills/use-dom', 'official', 'expo', 'skills', 'expo/skills', 'use-dom', 1131, 45, 100, '2026-02-23T00:15:14Z', '2026-02-23T01:07:32.988Z', '7041bb26db02e24c45eb6c4c4879138a0f52786dd928eefd66c90a35b0e3197d', '{"id":"expo/skills/use-dom","name":"use-dom","description":{"zh":"使用DOM组件在Expo应用中运行Web代码，支持React和其他Web库","ja":"DOMコンポーネントを使用してExpoアプリでWebコードを実行します。Reactやその他のWebライブラリもサポートしています","ko":"DOM 컴포넌트를 사용하여 Expo 애플리케이션에서 웹 코드를 실행합니다. React 및 기타 웹 라이브러리도 지원합니다","es":"Use-dom permite ejecutar código web en aplicaciones nativas y web con componentes DOM de Expo","fr":"Use-dom permet d''exécuter du code web dans des applications natives et web avec des composants DOM d''Expo","de":"Use-dom ermöglicht die Ausführung von Webcode in nativen und Webanwendungen mit Expo-DOM-Komponenten","pt":"O use-dom permite que o código web seja executado sem modificações em um webview em plataformas nativas e renderizado como-is na web.","ru":"Используйте use-dom для запуска веб-кода без изменений в веб-представлении на родных платформах и отображения его как есть на вебе.","ar":"استخدم use-dom لتشغيل код الويب بدون تعديلات في عرض الويب على منصات الأصلية وعرضه كما هو على الويب.","en":"Use Expo DOM components to run web code in a webview on native and as-is on web. Migrate web code to native incrementally."},"owner":"expo","repo":"skills","repoPath":"expo/skills","stars":1131,"forks":45,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T00:15:14Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"use-dom","description":"Use Expo DOM components to run web code in a webview on native and as-is on web. Migrate web code to native incrementally.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"## What are DOM Components?\n\nDOM components allow web code to run verbatim in a webview on native platforms while rendering as-is on web. This enables using web-only libraries like `recharts`, `react-syntax-highlighter`, or any React web library in your Expo app without modification.\n\n## When to Use DOM Components\n\nUse DOM components when you need:\n\n- **Web-only libraries** — Charts (recharts, chart.js), syntax highlighters, rich text editors, or any library that depends on DOM APIs\n- **Migratin","body":"## What are DOM Components?\n\nDOM components allow web code to run verbatim in a webview on native platforms while rendering as-is on web. This enables using web-only libraries like `recharts`, `react-syntax-highlighter`, or any React web library in your Expo app without modification.\n\n## When to Use DOM Components\n\nUse DOM components when you need:\n\n- **Web-only libraries** — Charts (recharts, chart.js), syntax highlighters, rich text editors, or any library that depends on DOM APIs\n- **Migrating web code** — Bring existing React web components to native without rewriting\n- **Complex HTML/CSS layouts** — When CSS features aren''t available in React Native\n- **iframes or embeds** — Embedding external content that requires a browser context\n- **Canvas or WebGL** — Web graphics APIs not available natively\n\n## When NOT to Use DOM Components\n\nAvoid DOM components when:\n\n- **Native performance is critical** — Webviews add overhead\n- **Simple UI** — React Native components are more efficient for basic layouts\n- **Deep native integration** — Use local modules instead for native APIs\n- **Layout routes** — `_layout` files cannot be DOM components\n\n## Basic DOM Component\n\nCreate a new file with the `''use dom'';` directive at the top:\n\n```tsx\n// components/WebChart.tsx\n\"use dom\";\n\nexport default function WebChart({\n  data,\n}: {\n  data: number[];\n  dom: import(\"expo/dom\").DOMProps;\n}) {\n  return (\n    <div style={{ padding: 20 }}>\n      <h2>Chart Data</h2>\n      <ul>\n        {data.map((value, i) => (\n          <li key={i}>{value}</li>\n        ))}\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Rules for DOM Components\n\n1. **Must have `''use dom'';` directive** at the top of the file\n2. **Single default export** — One React component per file\n3. **Own file** — Cannot be defined inline or combined with native components\n4. **Serializable props only** — Strings, numbers, booleans, arrays, plain objects\n5. **Include CSS in the component file** — DOM components run in isolated context\n\n## The `dom` Prop\n\nEvery DOM component receives a special `dom` prop for webview configuration. Always type it in your props:\n\n```tsx\n\"use dom\";\n\ninterface Props {\n  content: string;\n  dom: import(\"expo/dom\").DOMProps;\n}\n\nexport default function MyComponent({ content }: Props) {\n  return <div>{content}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n### Common `dom` Prop Options\n\n```tsx\n// Disable body scrolling\n<DOMComponent dom={{ scrollEnabled: false }} />\n\n// Flow under the notch (disable safe area insets)\n<DOMComponent dom={{ contentInsetAdjustmentBehavior: \"never\" }} />\n\n// Control size manually\n<DOMComponent dom={{ style: { width: 300, height: 400 } }} />\n\n// Combine options\n<DOMComponent\n  dom={{\n    scrollEnabled: false,\n    contentInsetAdjustmentBehavior: \"never\",\n    style: { width: ''100%'', height: 500 }\n  }}\n/>\n```\n\n## Exposing Native Actions to the Webview\n\nPass async functions as props to expose native functionality to the DOM component:\n\n```tsx\n// app/index.tsx (native)\nimport { Alert } from \"react-native\";\nimport DOMComponent from \"@/components/dom-component\";\n\nexport default function Screen() {\n  return (\n    <DOMComponent\n      showAlert={async (message: string) => {\n        Alert.alert(\"From Web\", message);\n      }}\n      saveData={async (data: { name: string; value: number }) => {\n        // Save to native storage, database, etc.\n        console.log(\"Saving:\", data);\n        return { success: true };\n      }}\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// components/dom-component.tsx\n\"use dom\";\n\ninterface Props {\n  showAlert: (message: string) => Promise<void>;\n  saveData: (data: {\n    name: string;\n    value: number;\n  }) => Promise<{ success: boolean }>;\n  dom?: import(\"expo/dom\").DOMProps;\n}\n\nexport default function DOMComponent({ showAlert, saveData }: Props) {\n  const handleClick = async () => {\n    await showAlert(\"Hello from the webview!\");\n    const result = await saveData({ name: \"test\", value: 42 });\n    console.log(\"Save result:\", result);\n  };\n\n  return <button onClick={handleClick}>Trigger Native Action</button>;\n}\n```\n\n## Using Web Libraries\n\nDOM components can use any web library:\n\n```tsx\n// components/syntax-highlight.tsx\n\"use dom\";\n\nimport SyntaxHighlighter from \"react-syntax-highlighter\";\nimport { docco } from \"react-syntax-highlighter/dist/esm/styles/hljs\";\n\ninterface Props {\n  code: string;\n  language: string;\n  dom?: import(\"expo/dom\").DOMProps;\n}\n\nexport default function SyntaxHighlight({ code, language }: Props) {\n  return (\n    <SyntaxHighlighter language={language} style={docco}>\n      {code}\n    </SyntaxHighlighter>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// components/chart.tsx\n\"use dom\";\n\nimport {\n  LineChart,\n  Line,\n  XAxis,\n  YAxis,\n  CartesianGrid,\n  Tooltip,\n} from \"recharts\";\n\ninterface Props {\n  data: Array<{ name: string; value: number }>;\n  dom: import(\"expo/dom\").DOMProps;\n}\n\nexport default function Chart({ data }: Props) {\n  return (\n    <LineChart width={400} height={300} data={data}>\n      <CartesianGrid strokeDasharray=\"3 3\" />\n      <XAxis dataKey=\"name\" />\n      <YAxis />\n      <Tooltip />\n      <Line type=\"monotone\" dataKey=\"value\" stroke=\"#8884d8\" />\n    </LineChart>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## CSS in DOM Components\n\nCSS imports must be in the DOM component file since they run in isolated context:\n\n```tsx\n// components/styled-component.tsx\n\"use dom\";\n\nimport \"@/styles.css\"; // CSS file in same directory\n\nexport default function StyledComponent({\n  dom,\n}: {\n  dom: import(\"expo/dom\").DOMProps;\n}) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container\">\n      <h1 className=\"title\">Styled Content</h1>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nOr use inline styles / CSS-in-JS:\n\n```tsx\n\"use dom\";\n\nconst styles = {\n  container: {\n    padding: 20,\n    backgroundColor: \"#f0f0f0\",\n  },\n  title: {\n    fontSize: 24,\n    color: \"#333\",\n  },\n};\n\nexport default function StyledComponent({\n  dom,\n}: {\n  dom: import(\"expo/dom\").DOMProps;\n}) {\n  return (\n    <div style={styles.container}>\n      <h1 style={styles.title}>Styled Content</h1>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Expo Router in DOM Components\n\nThe expo-router `<Link />` component and router API work inside DOM components:\n\n```tsx\n\"use dom\";\n\nimport { Link, useRouter } from \"expo-router\";\n\nexport default function Navigation({\n  dom,\n}: {\n  dom: import(\"expo/dom\").DOMProps;\n}) {\n  const router = useRouter();\n\n  return (\n    <nav>\n      <Link href=\"/about\">About</Link>\n      <button onClick={() => router.push(\"/settings\")}>Settings</button>\n    </nav>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Router APIs That Require Props\n\nThese hooks don''t work directly in DOM components because they need synchronous access to native routing state:\n\n- `useLocalSearchParams()`\n- `useGlobalSearchParams()`\n- `usePathname()`\n- `useSegments()`\n- `useRootNavigation()`\n- `useRootNavigationState()`\n\n**Solution:** Read these values in the native parent and pass as props:\n\n```tsx\n// app/[id].tsx (native)\nimport { useLocalSearchParams, usePathname } from \"expo-router\";\nimport DOMComponent from \"@/components/dom-component\";\n\nexport default function Screen() {\n  const { id } = useLocalSearchParams();\n  const pathname = usePathname();\n\n  return <DOMComponent id={id as string} pathname={pathname} />;\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\n// components/dom-component.tsx\n\"use dom\";\n\ninterface Props {\n  id: string;\n  pathname: string;\n  dom?: import(\"expo/dom\").DOMProps;\n}\n\nexport default function DOMComponent({ id, pathname }: Props) {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <p>Current ID: {id}</p>\n      <p>Current Path: {pathname}</p>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Detecting DOM Environment\n\nCheck if code is running in a DOM component:\n\n```tsx\n\"use dom\";\n\nimport { IS_DOM } from \"expo/dom\";\n\nexport default function Component({\n  dom,\n}: {\n  dom?: import(\"expo/dom\").DOMProps;\n}) {\n  return <div>{IS_DOM ? \"Running in DOM component\" : \"Running natively\"}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n## Assets\n\nPrefer requiring assets instead of using the public directory:\n\n```tsx\n\"use dom\";\n\n// Good - bundled with the component\nconst logo = require(\"../assets/logo.png\");\n\nexport default function Component({\n  dom,\n}: {\n  dom: import(\"expo/dom\").DOMProps;\n}) {\n  return <img src={logo} alt=\"Logo\" />;\n}\n```\n\n## Usage from Native Components\n\nImport and use DOM components like regular components:\n\n```tsx\n// app/index.tsx\nimport { View, Text } from \"react-native\";\nimport WebChart from \"@/components/web-chart\";\nimport CodeBlock from \"@/components/code-block\";\n\nexport default function HomeScreen() {\n  return (\n    <View style={{ flex: 1 }}>\n      <Text>Native content above</Text>\n\n      <WebChart data={[10, 20, 30, 40, 50]} dom={{ style: { height: 300 } }} />\n\n      <CodeBlock\n        code=\"const x = 1;\"\n        language=\"javascript\"\n        dom={{ scrollEnabled: true }}\n      />\n\n      <Text>Native content below</Text>\n    </View>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Platform Behavior\n\n| Platform | Behavior                            |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| iOS      | Rendered in WKWebView               |\n| Android  | Rendered in WebView                 |\n| Web      | Rendered as-is (no webview wrapper) |\n\nOn web, the `dom` prop is ignored since no webview is needed.\n\n## Tips\n\n- DOM components hot reload during development\n- Keep DOM components focused — don''t put entire screens in webviews\n- Use native components for navigation chrome, DOM components for specialized content\n- Test on all platforms — web rendering may differ slightly from native webviews\n- Large DOM components may impact performance — profile if needed\n- The webview has its own JavaScript context — cannot directly share state with native\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:07:32.988Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：使用DOM组件运行Web代码","ja":"AIエージェント：DOMコンポーネントでWebコードを実行","ko":"AI 에이전트: DOM 컴포넌트로 웹 코드 실행","es":"Herramientas de AI: use-dom para Expo","fr":"Outils d''IA : use-dom pour Expo","de":"KI-Tools: use-dom für Expo","pt":"Ferramentas de Inteligência Artificial: use-dom para Dese...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: use-dom для Native и Web-разработки","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: use-dom لتنمية التطبيقات الأصلية ...","en":"use-dom"},"description":{"zh":"使用DOM组件在Expo应用中运行Web代码，支持React和其他Web库","ja":"DOMコンポーネントを使用してExpoアプリでWebコードを実行します。Reactやその他のWebライブラリもサポートしています","ko":"DOM 컴포넌트를 사용하여 Expo 애플리케이션에서 웹 코드를 실행합니다. React 및 기타 웹 라이브러리도 지원합니다","es":"Use-dom permite ejecutar código web en aplicaciones nativas y web con componentes DOM de Expo","fr":"Use-dom permet d''exécuter du code web dans des applications natives et web avec des composants DOM d''Expo","de":"Use-dom ermöglicht die Ausführung von Webcode in nativen und Webanwendungen mit Expo-DOM-Komponenten","pt":"O use-dom permite que o código web seja executado sem modificações em um webview em plataformas nativas e renderizado como-is na web.","ru":"Используйте use-dom для запуска веб-кода без изменений в веб-представлении на родных платформах и отображения его как есть на вебе.","ar":"استخدم use-dom لتشغيل код الويب بدون تعديلات في عرض الويب على منصات الأصلية وعرضه كما هو على الويب.","en":"Use Expo DOM components to run web code in a webview on native and as-is on web. Migrate web code to native incrementally."},"definition":{"en":"Use Expo DOM components to run web code in a webview on native and as-is on web. Migrate web code to native incrementally."},"features":{"zh":["在native和web平台上运行Web代码","支持React和其他Web库","使用Web-only库如recharts和react-syntax-highlighter","无需修改即可将Web代码迁移到native平台","增量迁移Web代码到native平台"],"ja":["ネイティブとWebプラットフォームでWebコードを実行","Reactやその他のWebライブラリをサポート","Web-onlyライブラリ（recharts、react-syntax-highlighter）を使用","Webコードをネイティブプラットフォームに変更せずに移行","Webコードをインクリメンタルにネイティブプラットフォームに移行"],"ko":["네이티브 및 웹 플랫폼에서 웹 코드를 실행","React 및 기타 웹 라이브러리 지원","Web-only 라이브러리(recharts, react-syntax-highlighter) 사용","변경 없이 웹 코드를 네이티브 플랫폼으로 마이그레이션","웹 코드를 증분으로 네이티브 플랫폼으로 마이그레이션"],"es":["Ejecuta código web en aplicaciones nativas","Renderiza código web sin modificaciones","Compatibilidad con bibliotecas web como recharts y react-syntax-highlighter","Migración incremental de código web a nativo","Utiliza componentes DOM de Expo"],"fr":["Exécute du code web dans des applications natives","Rendu du code web sans modification","Compatibilité avec des bibliothèques web comme recharts et react-syntax-highlighter","Migration incrémentale de code web vers natif","Utilise des composants DOM d''Expo"],"de":["Führt Webcode in nativen Anwendungen aus","Renderingt Webcode ohne Modifikationen","Kompatibilität mit Webbibliotheken wie recharts und react-syntax-highlighter","Inkrementale Migration von Webcode zu nativ","Verwenden von Expo-DOM-Komponenten"],"pt":["Execução de código web em um webview em plataformas nativas","Renderização de código web como-is na web","Compatibilidade com bibliotecas web-only como recharts e react-syntax-highlighter","Migração incremental de código web para nativo","Suporte a React e outras bibliotecas web"],"ru":["Запуск веб-кода в веб-представлении на родных платформах","Отображение веб-кода как есть на вебе","Совместимость с веб-библиотеками seperti recharts и react-syntax-highlighter","Поэтапная миграция веб-кода на родную платформу","Поддержка React и других веб-библиотек"],"ar":["تشغيل код الويب في عرض الويب على منصات الأصلية","عرض код الويب كما هو على الويب","التوافق مع مكتبات الويب مثل recharts و react-syntax-highlighter","انتقال متدرج للكود الويب إلى الأصلي","دعم React ومكتبات الويب الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","DOM组件","Expo","React","Web代码","native平台","web平台","recharts","react-syntax-highlighter"],"ja":["AIエージェント","DOMコンポーネント","Expo","React","Webコード","ネイティブプラットフォーム","Webプラットフォーム","recharts","react-syntax-highlighter"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","DOM 컴포넌트","Expo","React","웹 코드","네이티브 플랫폼","웹 플랫폼","recharts","react-syntax-highlighter"],"es":["herramientas de AI","use-dom","Expo","componentes DOM","código web","aplicaciones nativas","react","recharts","react-syntax-highlighter"],"fr":["outils d''IA","use-dom","Expo","composants DOM","code web","applications natives","react","recharts","react-syntax-highlighter"],"de":["KI-Tools","use-dom","Expo","DOM-Komponenten","Webcode","native Anwendungen","react","recharts","react-syntax-highlighter"],"pt":["use-dom","Inteligência Artificial","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos","React","Webview","Plataformas nativas","Migração de código","Bibliotecas web-only","Desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","use-dom","Разработка приложений","React","Веб-представление","Родные платформы","Миграция кода","Веб-библиотеки","Веб-разработка"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","use-dom","تنمية التطبيقات","React","عرض الويب","منصات الأصلية","انتقال الكود","مكتبات الويب","تنمية الويب"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cross-Platform Agents needing seamless web code integration with native and web environments.","zh":"适合需要在本地和 web 环境中实现无缝 web 代码集成的跨平台代理。","ja":"クロスプラットフォーム エージェントがネイティブおよび Web 環境でシームレスな Web コード統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"네이티브 및 웹 환경에서 무봉제 웹 코드 통합이 필요한 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Cross-Platform que necesitan una integración de código web sin problemas con entornos nativos y web.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cross-Platform nécessitant une intégration de code web transparente avec les environnements natifs et web.","de":"Perfekt für Cross-Platform-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration von Webcode mit nativen und Web-Umgebungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Plataforma Cruzada que necessitam de integração de código web sem problemas com ambientes nativos e web.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, работающих на нескольких платформах, которым необходима бесперебойная интеграция веб-кода с родными и веб-средами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء متعددة المنصات الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج رمز الويب بسلاسة مع البيئات الأصلية والويب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize web-only libraries like recharts, react-syntax-highlighter, and other React web libraries in Expo apps without modification, leveraging DOM APIs and webviews for incremental migration of web code to native platforms.","zh":"赋予代理利用像 recharts、react-syntax-highlighter 等 React Web 库在 Expo 应用中无需修改，利用 DOM APIs 和 webviews 实现 Web 代码到本地平台的增量迁移。","ja":"エージェントが recharts、react-syntax-highlighter などの React Web ライブラリを Expo アプリで変更せずに利用できるようにし、DOM API と webview を使用して Web コードをネイティブ プラットフォームにインクリメンタルに移行します。","ko":"에이전트가 recharts, react-syntax-highlighter와 같은 React 웹 라이브러리를 Expo 앱에서 수정 없이 사용할 수 있도록 하며, DOM API 및 webview를 사용하여 웹 코드를 네이티브 플랫폼으로 증분 마이그레이션합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a utilizar bibliotecas solo web como recharts, react-syntax-highlighter y otras bibliotecas web de React en aplicaciones Expo sin modificación, aprovechando las API de DOM y webviews para la migración incremental de código web a plataformas nativas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser des bibliothèques web uniquement comme recharts, react-syntax-highlighter et d''autres bibliothèques web React dans les applications Expo sans modification, en exploitant les API DOM et les webviews pour la migration incrémentale du code web vers les plateformes natives.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Web-only-Bibliotheken wie recharts, react-syntax-highlighter und andere React-Web-Bibliotheken in Expo-Apps ohne Modifikation zu nutzen, indem DOM-APIs und Webviews für die inkrementelle Migration von Webcode zu nativen Plattformen genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a utilizarem bibliotecas exclusivas da web, como recharts, react-syntax-highlighter e outras bibliotecas da web React em aplicativos Expo sem modificação, aproveitando as APIs do DOM e webviews para migração incremental do código web para plataformas nativas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать веб-библиотеки, такие как recharts, react-syntax-highlighter и другие веб-библиотеки React, в приложениях Expo без изменений, используя API DOM и веб-представления для инкрементальной миграции веб-кода на родные платформы.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من استخدام مكتبات الويب الحصرية مثل recharts و react-syntax-highlighter ومكتبات الويب الأخرى React في تطبيقات Expo دون تعديل ، مستفيدة من واجهات برمجة تطبيقات DOM والمتوفرة على الويب من أجل هجرة متزايدة من رمز الويب إلى منصات الأصلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating web code to native platforms incrementally","Integrating web-only libraries into Expo apps","Rendering web code verbatim in a webview on native platforms"],"zh":["增量迁移 Web 代码到本地平台","将仅限 Web 的库集成到 Expo 应用中","在本地平台的 webview 中逐字渲染 Web 代码"],"ja":["Web コードをネイティブ プラットフォームにインクリメンタルに移行する","Web 専用ライブラリを Expo アプリに統合する","ネイティブ プラットフォームの webview で Web コードを逐語的にレンダリングする"],"ko":["웹 코드를 네이티브 플랫폼으로 증분 마이그레이션","웹 전용 라이브러리를 Expo 앱에 통합","네이티브 플랫폼의 웹뷰에서 웹 코드를逐語적으로 렌더링"],"es":["Migrar el código web a plataformas nativas de forma incremental","Integrar bibliotecas solo web en aplicaciones Expo","Representar el código web sin cambios en un webview en plataformas nativas"],"fr":["Migrer le code web vers des plateformes natives de manière incrémentale","Intégrer des bibliothèques web uniquement dans les applications Expo","Afficher le code web à l''identique dans un webview sur des plateformes natives"],"de":["Webcode schrittweise auf native Plattformen migrieren","Web-only-Bibliotheken in Expo-Apps integrieren","Webcode unverändert in einem Webview auf nativen Plattformen rendern"],"pt":["Migrar código web para plataformas nativas de forma incremental","Integrar bibliotecas exclusivas da web em aplicativos Expo","Renderizar código web literalmente em uma visualização da web em plataformas nativas"],"ru":["Инкрементальная миграция веб-кода на родные платформы","Интеграция веб-библиотек в приложения Expo","Отображение веб-кода дословно в веб-представлении на родных платформах"],"ar":["هجرة رمز الويب إلى منصات الأصلية بشكل متزايد","دمج مكتبات الويب الحصرية في تطبيقات Expo","إظهار رمز الويب حرفيًا في عرض الويب على منصات الأصلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo environment","Limited to React web libraries","Dependent on DOM APIs"],"zh":["需要 Expo 环境","仅限 React Web 库","依赖于 DOM APIs"],"ja":["Expo 環境が必要","React Web ライブラリのみ","DOM API 依存"],"ko":["Expo 환경 필요","React 웹 라이브러리만","DOM API 종속"],"es":["Requiere entorno Expo","Limitado a bibliotecas web de React","Dependiente de las API de DOM"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Expo","Limité aux bibliothèques web React","Dépendant des API DOM"],"de":["Benötigt Expo-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf React-Web-Bibliotheken","Abhängig von DOM-APIs"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Expo","Limitado a bibliotecas da web React","Dependente de APIs do DOM"],"ru":["Требуется окружение Expo","Ограничен веб-библиотеками React","Зависит от API DOM"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Expo","محدود بمكتبات الويب React","يعتمد على واجهات برمجة تطبيقات DOM"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7041bb26db02e24c45eb6c4c4879138a0f52786dd928eefd66c90a35b0e3197d","repoEtag":"W/\"107a941bd72b6ce7813b313cd45d74048195bce8f83f76bf6a45d60c761e717a\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('huggingface/skills/hugging-face-datasets', 'official', 'huggingface', 'skills', 'huggingface/skills', 'hugging-face-datasets', 2623, 186, 100, '2026-02-23T01:07:27Z', '2026-02-23T01:07:33.699Z', 'ca8fb141e351ff7bd0ae81992d5219a23649cc7497ee012ac785f636cf233c0b', '{"id":"huggingface/skills/hugging-face-datasets","name":"hugging-face-datasets","description":{"zh":"Hugging Face数据集管理工具，用于创建、配置和管理数据集，支持SQL基于数据查询和转换","ja":"Hugging Faceデータセット管理ツール、データセットの作成、コンフィグ、管理をサポート、SQLベースのデータクエリと変換を実行","ko":"Hugging Face 데이터셋 관리 도구, 데이터셋 생성, 구성, 관리를 지원, SQL 기반 데이터 쿼리 및 변환을 수행","es":"hugging-face-datasets es una herramienta de AI para crear y gestionar datasets en Hugging Face Hub. Ofrece funcionalidades para inicializar repositorios, definir configuraciones y realizar consultas SQL","fr":"hugging-face-datasets est un outil d''IA pour créer et gérer des datasets sur Hugging Face Hub. Il offre des fonctionnalités pour initialiser des référentiels, définir des configurations et effectuer des requêtes SQL","de":"hugging-face-datasets ist ein KI-Tool zum Erstellen und Verwalten von Datensätzen in Hugging Face Hub. Es bietet Funktionen zum Initialisieren von Repositorien, Definieren von Konfigurationen und Ausführen von SQL-Abfragen","pt":"O hugging-face-datasets é uma ferramenta de IA para criar e gerenciar conjuntos de dados no Hugging Face Hub, com foco em criação, configuração e manipulação de dados","ru":"ИИ Агент hugging-face-datasets предназначен для создания и управления наборами данных на Hugging Face Hub, с фокусом на создании, конфигурации и манипуляции данными","ar":"وحدة الذكاء الاصطناعي هوجينج-فيس-داتاسيتس هي أداة لإنشاء وإدارة مجموعات البيانات على هوجينج فايس هاب, مع التركيز على إنشاء وتفاصيل وتحويل البيانات","en":"Create and manage datasets on Hugging Face Hub. Supports initializing repos, defining configs/system prompts, streaming row updates, and SQL-based dataset querying/transformation. Designed to work alongside HF MCP server for comprehensive dataset workflows."},"owner":"huggingface","repo":"skills","repoPath":"huggingface/skills","stars":2623,"forks":186,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T01:07:27Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"hugging-face-datasets","description":"Create and manage datasets on Hugging Face Hub. Supports initializing repos, defining configs/system prompts, streaming row updates, and SQL-based dataset querying/transformation. Designed to work alongside HF MCP server for comprehensive dataset workflows.","bodyPreview":"# Overview\nThis skill provides tools to manage datasets on the Hugging Face Hub with a focus on creation, configuration, content management, and SQL-based data manipulation. It is designed to complement the existing Hugging Face MCP server by providing dataset editing and querying capabilities.\n\n## Integration with HF MCP Server\n- **Use HF MCP Server for**: Dataset discovery, search, and metadata retrieval\n- **Use This Skill for**: Dataset creation, content editing, SQL queries, data transformat","body":"# Overview\nThis skill provides tools to manage datasets on the Hugging Face Hub with a focus on creation, configuration, content management, and SQL-based data manipulation. It is designed to complement the existing Hugging Face MCP server by providing dataset editing and querying capabilities.\n\n## Integration with HF MCP Server\n- **Use HF MCP Server for**: Dataset discovery, search, and metadata retrieval\n- **Use This Skill for**: Dataset creation, content editing, SQL queries, data transformation, and structured data formatting\n\n# Version\n2.1.0\n\n# Dependencies\n# This skill uses PEP 723 scripts with inline dependency management\n# Scripts auto-install requirements when run with: uv run scripts/script_name.py\n\n- uv (Python package manager)\n- Getting Started: See \"Usage Instructions\" below for PEP 723 usage\n\n# Core Capabilities\n\n## 1. Dataset Lifecycle Management\n- **Initialize**: Create new dataset repositories with proper structure\n- **Configure**: Store detailed configuration including system prompts and metadata\n- **Stream Updates**: Add rows efficiently without downloading entire datasets\n\n## 2. SQL-Based Dataset Querying (NEW)\nQuery any Hugging Face dataset using DuckDB SQL via `scripts/sql_manager.py`:\n- **Direct Queries**: Run SQL on datasets using the `hf://` protocol\n- **Schema Discovery**: Describe dataset structure and column types\n- **Data Sampling**: Get random samples for exploration\n- **Aggregations**: Count, histogram, unique values analysis\n- **Transformations**: Filter, join, reshape data with SQL\n- **Export & Push**: Save results locally or push to new Hub repos\n\n## 3. Multi-Format Dataset Support\nSupports diverse dataset types through template system:\n- **Chat/Conversational**: Chat templating, multi-turn dialogues, tool usage examples\n- **Text Classification**: Sentiment analysis, intent detection, topic classification\n- **Question-Answering**: Reading comprehension, factual QA, knowledge bases\n- **Text Completion**: Language modeling, code completion, creative writing\n- **Tabular Data**: Structured data for regression/classification tasks\n- **Custom Formats**: Flexible schema definition for specialized needs\n\n## 4. Quality Assurance Features\n- **JSON Validation**: Ensures data integrity during uploads\n- **Batch Processing**: Efficient handling of large datasets\n- **Error Recovery**: Graceful handling of upload failures and conflicts\n\n# Usage Instructions\n\nThe skill includes two Python scripts that use PEP 723 inline dependency management:\n\n> **All paths are relative to the directory containing this SKILL.md\nfile.**\n> Scripts are run with: `uv run scripts/script_name.py [arguments]`\n\n- `scripts/dataset_manager.py` - Dataset creation and management\n- `scripts/sql_manager.py` - SQL-based dataset querying and transformation\n\n### Prerequisites\n- `uv` package manager installed\n- `HF_TOKEN` environment variable must be set with a Write-access token\n\n---\n\n# SQL Dataset Querying (sql_manager.py)\n\nQuery, transform, and push Hugging Face datasets using DuckDB SQL. The `hf://` protocol provides direct access to any public dataset (or private with token).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Query a dataset\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py query \\\n  --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" \\\n  --sql \"SELECT * FROM data WHERE subject=''nutrition'' LIMIT 10\"\n\n# Get dataset schema\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py describe --dataset \"cais/mmlu\"\n\n# Sample random rows\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py sample --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" --n 5\n\n# Count rows with filter\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py count --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" --where \"subject=''nutrition''\"\n```\n\n## SQL Query Syntax\n\nUse `data` as the table name in your SQL - it gets replaced with the actual `hf://` path:\n\n```sql\n-- Basic select\nSELECT * FROM data LIMIT 10\n\n-- Filtering\nSELECT * FROM data WHERE subject=''nutrition''\n\n-- Aggregations\nSELECT subject, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM data GROUP BY subject ORDER BY cnt DESC\n\n-- Column selection and transformation\nSELECT question, choices[answer] AS correct_answer FROM data\n\n-- Regex matching\nSELECT * FROM data WHERE regexp_matches(question, ''nutrition|diet'')\n\n-- String functions\nSELECT regexp_replace(question, ''\\n'', '''') AS cleaned FROM data\n```\n\n## Common Operations\n\n### 1. Explore Dataset Structure\n```bash\n# Get schema\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py describe --dataset \"cais/mmlu\"\n\n# Get unique values in column\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py unique --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" --column \"subject\"\n\n# Get value distribution\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py histogram --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" --column \"subject\" --bins 20\n```\n\n### 2. Filter and Transform\n```bash\n# Complex filtering with SQL\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py query \\\n  --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" \\\n  --sql \"SELECT subject, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM data GROUP BY subject HAVING cnt > 100\"\n\n# Using transform command\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py transform \\\n  --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" \\\n  --select \"subject, COUNT(*) as cnt\" \\\n  --group-by \"subject\" \\\n  --order-by \"cnt DESC\" \\\n  --limit 10\n```\n\n### 3. Create Subsets and Push to Hub\n```bash\n# Query and push to new dataset\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py query \\\n  --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" \\\n  --sql \"SELECT * FROM data WHERE subject=''nutrition''\" \\\n  --push-to \"username/mmlu-nutrition-subset\" \\\n  --private\n\n# Transform and push\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py transform \\\n  --dataset \"ibm/duorc\" \\\n  --config \"ParaphraseRC\" \\\n  --select \"question, answers\" \\\n  --where \"LENGTH(question) > 50\" \\\n  --push-to \"username/duorc-long-questions\"\n```\n\n### 4. Export to Local Files\n```bash\n# Export to Parquet\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py export \\\n  --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" \\\n  --sql \"SELECT * FROM data WHERE subject=''nutrition''\" \\\n  --output \"nutrition.parquet\" \\\n  --format parquet\n\n# Export to JSONL\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py export \\\n  --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" \\\n  --sql \"SELECT * FROM data LIMIT 100\" \\\n  --output \"sample.jsonl\" \\\n  --format jsonl\n```\n\n### 5. Working with Dataset Configs/Splits\n```bash\n# Specify config (subset)\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py query \\\n  --dataset \"ibm/duorc\" \\\n  --config \"ParaphraseRC\" \\\n  --sql \"SELECT * FROM data LIMIT 5\"\n\n# Specify split\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py query \\\n  --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" \\\n  --split \"test\" \\\n  --sql \"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM data\"\n\n# Query all splits\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py query \\\n  --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" \\\n  --split \"*\" \\\n  --sql \"SELECT * FROM data LIMIT 10\"\n```\n\n### 6. Raw SQL with Full Paths\nFor complex queries or joining datasets:\n```bash\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py raw --sql \"\n  SELECT a.*, b.* \n  FROM ''hf://datasets/dataset1@~parquet/default/train/*.parquet'' a\n  JOIN ''hf://datasets/dataset2@~parquet/default/train/*.parquet'' b\n  ON a.id = b.id\n  LIMIT 100\n\"\n```\n\n## Python API Usage\n\n```python\nfrom sql_manager import HFDatasetSQL\n\nsql = HFDatasetSQL()\n\n# Query\nresults = sql.query(\"cais/mmlu\", \"SELECT * FROM data WHERE subject=''nutrition'' LIMIT 10\")\n\n# Get schema\nschema = sql.describe(\"cais/mmlu\")\n\n# Sample\nsamples = sql.sample(\"cais/mmlu\", n=5, seed=42)\n\n# Count\ncount = sql.count(\"cais/mmlu\", where=\"subject=''nutrition''\")\n\n# Histogram\ndist = sql.histogram(\"cais/mmlu\", \"subject\")\n\n# Filter and transform\nresults = sql.filter_and_transform(\n    \"cais/mmlu\",\n    select=\"subject, COUNT(*) as cnt\",\n    group_by=\"subject\",\n    order_by=\"cnt DESC\",\n    limit=10\n)\n\n# Push to Hub\nurl = sql.push_to_hub(\n    \"cais/mmlu\",\n    \"username/nutrition-subset\",\n    sql=\"SELECT * FROM data WHERE subject=''nutrition''\",\n    private=True\n)\n\n# Export locally\nsql.export_to_parquet(\"cais/mmlu\", \"output.parquet\", sql=\"SELECT * FROM data LIMIT 100\")\n\nsql.close()\n```\n\n## HF Path Format\n\nDuckDB uses the `hf://` protocol to access datasets:\n```\nhf://datasets/{dataset_id}@{revision}/{config}/{split}/*.parquet\n```\n\nExamples:\n- `hf://datasets/cais/mmlu@~parquet/default/train/*.parquet`\n- `hf://datasets/ibm/duorc@~parquet/ParaphraseRC/test/*.parquet`\n\nThe `@~parquet` revision provides auto-converted Parquet files for any dataset format.\n\n## Useful DuckDB SQL Functions\n\n```sql\n-- String functions\nLENGTH(column)                    -- String length\nregexp_replace(col, ''\\n'', '''')     -- Regex replace\nregexp_matches(col, ''pattern'')    -- Regex match\nLOWER(col), UPPER(col)           -- Case conversion\n\n-- Array functions  \nchoices[0]                        -- Array indexing (0-based)\narray_length(choices)             -- Array length\nunnest(choices)                   -- Expand array to rows\n\n-- Aggregations\nCOUNT(*), SUM(col), AVG(col)\nGROUP BY col HAVING condition\n\n-- Sampling\nUSING SAMPLE 10                   -- Random sample\nUSING SAMPLE 10 (RESERVOIR, 42)   -- Reproducible sample\n\n-- Window functions\nROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY col ORDER BY col2)\n```\n\n---\n\n# Dataset Creation (dataset_manager.py)\n\n### Recommended Workflow\n\n**1. Discovery (Use HF MCP Server):**\n```python\n# Use HF MCP tools to find existing datasets\nsearch_datasets(\"conversational AI training\")\nget_dataset_details(\"username/dataset-name\")\n```\n\n**2. Creation (Use This Skill):**\n```bash\n# Initialize new dataset\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py init --repo_id \"your-username/dataset-name\" [--private]\n\n# Configure with detailed system prompt\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py config --repo_id \"your-username/dataset-name\" --system_prompt \"$(cat system_prompt.txt)\"\n```\n\n**3. Content Management (Use This Skill):**\n```bash\n# Quick setup with any template\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py quick_setup \\\n  --repo_id \"your-username/dataset-name\" \\\n  --template classification\n\n# Add data with template validation\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py add_rows \\\n  --repo_id \"your-username/dataset-name\" \\\n  --template qa \\\n  --rows_json \"$(cat your_qa_data.json)\"\n```\n\n### Template-Based Data Structures\n\n**1. Chat Template (`--template chat`)**\n```json\n{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Natural user request\"},\n    {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Response with tool usage\"},\n    {\"role\": \"tool\", \"content\": \"Tool response\", \"tool_call_id\": \"call_123\"}\n  ],\n  \"scenario\": \"Description of use case\",\n  \"complexity\": \"simple|intermediate|advanced\"\n}\n```\n\n**2. Classification Template (`--template classification`)**\n```json\n{\n  \"text\": \"Input text to be classified\",\n  \"label\": \"classification_label\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.95,\n  \"metadata\": {\"domain\": \"technology\", \"language\": \"en\"}\n}\n```\n\n**3. QA Template (`--template qa`)**\n```json\n{\n  \"question\": \"What is the question being asked?\",\n  \"answer\": \"The complete answer\",\n  \"context\": \"Additional context if needed\",\n  \"answer_type\": \"factual|explanatory|opinion\",\n  \"difficulty\": \"easy|medium|hard\"\n}\n```\n\n**4. Completion Template (`--template completion`)**\n```json\n{\n  \"prompt\": \"The beginning text or context\",\n  \"completion\": \"The expected continuation\",\n  \"domain\": \"code|creative|technical|conversational\",\n  \"style\": \"description of writing style\"\n}\n```\n\n**5. Tabular Template (`--template tabular`)**\n```json\n{\n  \"columns\": [\n    {\"name\": \"feature1\", \"type\": \"numeric\", \"description\": \"First feature\"},\n    {\"name\": \"target\", \"type\": \"categorical\", \"description\": \"Target variable\"}\n  ],\n  \"data\": [\n    {\"feature1\": 123, \"target\": \"class_a\"},\n    {\"feature1\": 456, \"target\": \"class_b\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Advanced System Prompt Template\n\nFor high-quality training data generation:\n```text\nYou are an AI assistant expert at using MCP tools effectively.\n\n## MCP SERVER DEFINITIONS\n[Define available servers and tools]\n\n## TRAINING EXAMPLE STRUCTURE\n[Specify exact JSON schema for chat templating]\n\n## QUALITY GUIDELINES\n[Detail requirements for realistic scenarios, progressive complexity, proper tool usage]\n\n## EXAMPLE CATEGORIES\n[List development workflows, debugging scenarios, data management tasks]\n```\n\n### Example Categories & Templates\n\nThe skill includes diverse training examples beyond just MCP usage:\n\n**Available Example Sets:**\n- `training_examples.json` - MCP tool usage examples (debugging, project setup, database analysis)\n- `diverse_training_examples.json` - Broader scenarios including:\n  - **Educational Chat** - Explaining programming concepts, tutorials\n  - **Git Workflows** - Feature branches, version control guidance\n  - **Code Analysis** - Performance optimization, architecture review\n  - **Content Generation** - Professional writing, creative brainstorming\n  - **Codebase Navigation** - Legacy code exploration, systematic analysis\n  - **Conversational Support** - Problem-solving, technical discussions\n\n**Using Different Example Sets:**\n```bash\n# Add MCP-focused examples\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py add_rows --repo_id \"your-username/dataset-name\" \\\n  --rows_json \"$(cat examples/training_examples.json)\"\n\n# Add diverse conversational examples\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py add_rows --repo_id \"your-username/dataset-name\" \\\n  --rows_json \"$(cat examples/diverse_training_examples.json)\"\n\n# Mix both for comprehensive training data\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py add_rows --repo_id \"your-username/dataset-name\" \\\n  --rows_json \"$(jq -s ''.[0] + .[1]'' examples/training_examples.json examples/diverse_training_examples.json)\"\n```\n\n### Commands Reference\n\n**List Available Templates:**\n```bash\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py list_templates\n```\n\n**Quick Setup (Recommended):**\n```bash\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py quick_setup --repo_id \"your-username/dataset-name\" --template classification\n```\n\n**Manual Setup:**\n```bash\n# Initialize repository\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py init --repo_id \"your-username/dataset-name\" [--private]\n\n# Configure with system prompt\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py config --repo_id \"your-username/dataset-name\" --system_prompt \"Your prompt here\"\n\n# Add data with validation\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py add_rows \\\n  --repo_id \"your-username/dataset-name\" \\\n  --template qa \\\n  --rows_json ''[{\"question\": \"What is AI?\", \"answer\": \"Artificial Intelligence...\"}]''\n```\n\n**View Dataset Statistics:**\n```bash\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py stats --repo_id \"your-username/dataset-name\"\n```\n\n### Error Handling\n- **Repository exists**: Script will notify and continue with configuration\n- **Invalid JSON**: Clear error message with parsing details\n- **Network issues**: Automatic retry for transient failures\n- **Token permissions**: Validation before operations begin\n\n---\n\n# Combined Workflow Examples\n\n## Example 1: Create Training Subset from Existing Dataset\n```bash\n# 1. Explore the source dataset\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py describe --dataset \"cais/mmlu\"\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py histogram --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" --column \"subject\"\n\n# 2. Query and create subset\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py query \\\n  --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" \\\n  --sql \"SELECT * FROM data WHERE subject IN (''nutrition'', ''anatomy'', ''clinical_knowledge'')\" \\\n  --push-to \"username/mmlu-medical-subset\" \\\n  --private\n```\n\n## Example 2: Transform and Reshape Data\n```bash\n# Transform MMLU to QA format with correct answers extracted\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py query \\\n  --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" \\\n  --sql \"SELECT question, choices[answer] as correct_answer, subject FROM data\" \\\n  --push-to \"username/mmlu-qa-format\"\n```\n\n## Example 3: Merge Multiple Dataset Splits\n```bash\n# Export multiple splits and combine\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py export \\\n  --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" \\\n  --split \"*\" \\\n  --output \"mmlu_all.parquet\"\n```\n\n## Example 4: Quality Filtering\n```bash\n# Filter for high-quality examples\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py query \\\n  --dataset \"squad\" \\\n  --sql \"SELECT * FROM data WHERE LENGTH(context) > 500 AND LENGTH(question) > 20\" \\\n  --push-to \"username/squad-filtered\"\n```\n\n## Example 5: Create Custom Training Dataset\n```bash\n# 1. Query source data\nuv run scripts/sql_manager.py export \\\n  --dataset \"cais/mmlu\" \\\n  --sql \"SELECT question, subject FROM data WHERE subject=''nutrition''\" \\\n  --output \"nutrition_source.jsonl\" \\\n  --format jsonl\n\n# 2. Process with your pipeline (add answers, format, etc.)\n\n# 3. Push processed data\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py init --repo_id \"username/nutrition-training\"\nuv run scripts/dataset_manager.py add_rows \\\n  --repo_id \"username/nutrition-training\" \\\n  --template qa \\\n  --rows_json \"$(cat processed_data.json)\"\n```\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:07:33.699Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：Hugging Face数据集管理","ja":"AIエージェント：Hugging Faceデータセット管理","ko":"AI 툴: Hugging Face 데이터셋 관리","es":"Herramientas de AI: hugging-face-datasets para Desarrolla...","fr":"Outils d''IA: hugging-face-datasets pour les Développeurs","de":"KI-Tools: hugging-face-datasets für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: hugging-face-datasets para Desenvolved...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: hugging-face-datasets для Разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: hugging-face-datasets لل مطورين","en":"hugging-face-datasets"},"description":{"zh":"Hugging Face数据集管理工具，用于创建、配置和管理数据集，支持SQL基于数据查询和转换","ja":"Hugging Faceデータセット管理ツール、データセットの作成、コンフィグ、管理をサポート、SQLベースのデータクエリと変換を実行","ko":"Hugging Face 데이터셋 관리 도구, 데이터셋 생성, 구성, 관리를 지원, SQL 기반 데이터 쿼리 및 변환을 수행","es":"hugging-face-datasets es una herramienta de AI para crear y gestionar datasets en Hugging Face Hub. Ofrece funcionalidades para inicializar repositorios, def...","fr":"hugging-face-datasets est un outil d''IA pour créer et gérer des datasets sur Hugging Face Hub. Il offre des fonctionnalités pour initialiser des référentiels...","de":"hugging-face-datasets ist ein KI-Tool zum Erstellen und Verwalten von Datensätzen in Hugging Face Hub. Es bietet Funktionen zum Initialisieren von Repositori...","pt":"O hugging-face-datasets é uma ferramenta de IA para criar e gerenciar conjuntos de dados no Hugging Face Hub, com foco em criação, configuração e manipulação...","ru":"ИИ Агент hugging-face-datasets предназначен для создания и управления наборами данных на Hugging Face Hub, с фокусом на создании, конфигурации и манипуляции ...","ar":"وحدة الذكاء الاصطناعي هوجينج-فيس-داتاسيتس هي أداة لإنشاء وإدارة مجموعات البيانات على هوجينج فايس هاب, مع التركيز على إنشاء وتفاصيل وتحويل