von Metriken während des Trainings","CLI erforderlich für das Abrufen und Analysieren von protokollierten Metriken"],"pt":["Requer Hugging Face Spaces para painéis de monitorização em tempo real","API Python necessária para registrar métricas durante o treinamento","CLI necessário para recuperar e analisar métricas registradas"],"ru":["Требует Hugging Face Spaces для панелей мониторинга в режиме реального времени","Необходим API Python для регистрации метрик во время обучения","Требуется CLI для получения и анализа зарегистрированных метрик"],"ar":["يتطلب مساحات الوجه الضاحك للرؤية في الوقت الفعلي","-API Python ضروري لتسجيل المقاييس أثناء التدريب","CLI مطلوب لاسترجاع وتحليل المقاييس المسجلة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"da2f366b8181b8ca9b0a953a56ffda925027038cbd5f9b19781a88281147ce4f","repoEtag":"W/\"d4d9459564f81c1ff31ac7f0c8bef3b09fd0bddb85b49126293f0deb1bf630b8\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('google-labs-code/stitch-skills/design-md', 'official', 'google-labs-code', 'stitch-skills', 'google-labs-code/stitch-skills', 'design-md', 1902, 219, 100, '2026-02-22T23:11:02Z', '2026-02-23T01:07:34.387Z', 'eb15f44646528f3a087ce023329ae699c1b6e803662af68338e1eb1c0406b59b', '{"id":"google-labs-code/stitch-skills/design-md","name":"design-md","description":{"zh":"设计-md技能帮助您创建DESIGN.md文件，作为Stitch生成新屏幕的设计语言来源","ja":"design-mdスキルは、DESIGN.mdファイルを作成し、Stitchが新しい画面を生成するための設計言語のソースとして機能します","ko":"design-md 스킬은 DESIGN.md 파일을 생성하여 Stitch가 새로운 화면을 생성하는 데 사용하는 디자인 언어의 출처로 작용합니다","es":"El skill design-md analiza proyectos de Stitch y crea un sistema de diseño semántico en archivos DESIGN.md para una coherencia de diseño perfecta","fr":"Le skill design-md analyse les projets Stitch et crée un système de design sémantique dans des fichiers DESIGN.md pour une cohérence de design parfaite","de":"Das design-md-Skill analysiert Stitch-Projekte und erstellt ein semantisches Designsystem in DESIGN.md-Dateien für eine perfekte Designkonsistenz","pt":"O skill design-md ajuda a criar arquivos DESIGN.md para sistemas de design semânticos, permitindo que os desenvolvedores criem telas alinhadas com a linguagem de design existente","ru":"Навык design-md помогает создавать файлы DESIGN.md для семантических систем дизайна, позволяя разработчикам создавать экраны, идеально соответствующие существующему языку дизайна","ar":"تساعد مهارة design-md في إنشاء ملفات DESIGN.md لنظم التصميم الدلالي، مما يسمح للمطورين بإنشاء شاشات متوافقة مع لغة التصميم الحالية","en":"Analyze Stitch projects and synthesize a semantic design system into DESIGN.md files"},"owner":"google-labs-code","repo":"stitch-skills","repoPath":"google-labs-code/stitch-skills","stars":1902,"forks":219,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T23:11:02Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"design-md","description":"Analyze Stitch projects and synthesize a semantic design system into DESIGN.md files","bodyPreview":"# Stitch DESIGN.md Skill\n\nYou are an expert Design Systems Lead. Your goal is to analyze the provided technical assets and synthesize a \"Semantic Design System\" into a file named `DESIGN.md`.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill helps you create `DESIGN.md` files that serve as the \"source of truth\" for prompting Stitch to generate new screens that align perfectly with existing design language. Stitch interprets design through \"Visual Descriptions\" supported by specific color values.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Acc","body":"# Stitch DESIGN.md Skill\n\nYou are an expert Design Systems Lead. Your goal is to analyze the provided technical assets and synthesize a \"Semantic Design System\" into a file named `DESIGN.md`.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill helps you create `DESIGN.md` files that serve as the \"source of truth\" for prompting Stitch to generate new screens that align perfectly with existing design language. Stitch interprets design through \"Visual Descriptions\" supported by specific color values.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Access to the Stitch MCP Server\n- A Stitch project with at least one designed screen\n- Access to the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\n## The Goal\n\nThe `DESIGN.md` file will serve as the \"source of truth\" for prompting Stitch to generate new screens that align perfectly with the existing design language. Stitch interprets design through \"Visual Descriptions\" supported by specific color values.\n\n## Retrieval and Networking\n\nTo analyze a Stitch project, you must retrieve screen metadata and design assets using the Stitch MCP Server tools:\n\n1. **Namespace discovery**: Run `list_tools` to find the Stitch MCP prefix. Use this prefix (e.g., `mcp_stitch:`) for all subsequent calls.\n\n2. **Project lookup** (if Project ID is not provided):\n   - Call `[prefix]:list_projects` with `filter: \"view=owned\"` to retrieve all user projects\n   - Identify the target project by title or URL pattern\n   - Extract the Project ID from the `name` field (e.g., `projects/13534454087919359824`)\n\n3. **Screen lookup** (if Screen ID is not provided):\n   - Call `[prefix]:list_screens` with the `projectId` (just the numeric ID, not the full path)\n   - Review screen titles to identify the target screen (e.g., \"Home\", \"Landing Page\")\n   - Extract the Screen ID from the screen''s `name` field\n\n4. **Metadata fetch**: \n   - Call `[prefix]:get_screen` with both `projectId` and `screenId` (both as numeric IDs only)\n   - This returns the complete screen object including:\n     - `screenshot.downloadUrl` - Visual reference of the design\n     - `htmlCode.downloadUrl` - Full HTML/CSS source code\n     - `width`, `height`, `deviceType` - Screen dimensions and target platform\n     - Project metadata including `designTheme` with color and style information\n\n5. **Asset download**:\n   - Use `web_fetch` or `read_url_content` to download the HTML code from `htmlCode.downloadUrl`\n   - Optionally download the screenshot from `screenshot.downloadUrl` for visual reference\n   - Parse the HTML to extract Tailwind classes, custom CSS, and component patterns\n\n6. **Project metadata extraction**:\n   - Call `[prefix]:get_project` with the project `name` (full path: `projects/{id}`) to get:\n     - `designTheme` object with color mode, fonts, roundness, custom colors\n     - Project-level design guidelines and descriptions\n     - Device type preferences and layout principles\n\n## Analysis & Synthesis Instructions\n\n### 1. Extract Project Identity (JSON)\n- Locate the Project Title\n- Locate the specific Project ID (e.g., from the `name` field in the JSON)\n\n### 2. Define the Atmosphere (Image/HTML)\nEvaluate the screenshot and HTML structure to capture the overall \"vibe.\" Use evocative adjectives to describe the mood (e.g., \"Airy,\" \"Dense,\" \"Minimalist,\" \"Utilitarian\").\n\n### 3. Map the Color Palette (Tailwind Config/JSON)\nIdentify the key colors in the system. For each color, provide:\n- A descriptive, natural language name that conveys its character (e.g., \"Deep Muted Teal-Navy\")\n- The specific hex code in parentheses for precision (e.g., \"#294056\")\n- Its specific functional role (e.g., \"Used for primary actions\")\n\n### 4. Translate Geometry & Shape (CSS/Tailwind)\nConvert technical `border-radius` and layout values into physical descriptions:\n- Describe `rounded-full` as \"Pill-shaped\"\n- Describe `rounded-lg` as \"Subtly rounded corners\"\n- Describe `rounded-none` as \"Sharp, squared-off edges\"\n\n### 5. Describe Depth & Elevation\nExplain how the UI handles layers. Describe the presence and quality of shadows (e.g., \"Flat,\" \"Whisper-soft diffused shadows,\" or \"Heavy, high-contrast drop shadows\").\n\n## Output Guidelines\n\n- **Language:** Use descriptive design terminology and natural language exclusively\n- **Format:** Generate a clean Markdown file following the structure below\n- **Precision:** Include exact hex codes for colors while using descriptive names\n- **Context:** Explain the \"why\" behind design decisions, not just the \"what\"\n\n## Output Format (DESIGN.md Structure)\n\n```markdown\n# Design System: [Project Title]\n**Project ID:** [Insert Project ID Here]\n\n## 1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere\n(Description of the mood, density, and aesthetic philosophy.)\n\n## 2. Color Palette & Roles\n(List colors by Descriptive Name + Hex Code + Functional Role.)\n\n## 3. Typography Rules\n(Description of font family, weight usage for headers vs. body, and letter-spacing character.)\n\n## 4. Component Stylings\n* **Buttons:** (Shape description, color assignment, behavior).\n* **Cards/Containers:** (Corner roundness description, background color, shadow depth).\n* **Inputs/Forms:** (Stroke style, background).\n\n## 5. Layout Principles\n(Description of whitespace strategy, margins, and grid alignment.)\n```\n\n## Usage Example\n\nTo use this skill for the Furniture Collection project:\n\n1. **Retrieve project information:**\n   ```\n   Use the Stitch MCP Server to get the Furniture Collection project\n   ```\n\n2. **Get the Home page screen details:**\n   ```\n   Retrieve the Home page screen''s code, image, and screen object information\n   ```\n\n3. **Reference best practices:**\n   ```\n   Review the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide at:\n   https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n   ```\n\n4. **Analyze and synthesize:**\n   - Extract all relevant design tokens from the screen\n   - Translate technical values into descriptive language\n   - Organize information according to the DESIGN.md structure\n\n5. **Generate the file:**\n   - Create `DESIGN.md` in the project directory\n   - Follow the prescribed format exactly\n   - Ensure all color codes are accurate\n   - Use evocative, designer-friendly language\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Be Descriptive:** Avoid generic terms like \"blue\" or \"rounded.\" Use \"Ocean-deep Cerulean (#0077B6)\" or \"Gently curved edges\"\n- **Be Functional:** Always explain what each design element is used for\n- **Be Consistent:** Use the same terminology throughout the document\n- **Be Visual:** Help readers visualize the design through your descriptions\n- **Be Precise:** Include exact values (hex codes, pixel values) in parentheses after natural language descriptions\n\n## Tips for Success\n\n1. **Start with the big picture:** Understand the overall aesthetic before diving into details\n2. **Look for patterns:** Identify consistent spacing, sizing, and styling patterns\n3. **Think semantically:** Name colors by their purpose, not just their appearance\n4. **Consider hierarchy:** Document how visual weight and importance are communicated\n5. **Reference the guide:** Use language and patterns from the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide\n\n## Common Pitfalls to Avoid\n\n- ❌ Using technical jargon without translation (e.g., \"rounded-xl\" instead of \"generously rounded corners\")\n- ❌ Omitting color codes or using only descriptive names\n- ❌ Forgetting to explain functional roles of design elements\n- ❌ Being too vague in atmosphere descriptions\n- ❌ Ignoring subtle design details like shadows or spacing patterns\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:07:34.387Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AIエージェント设计-md：生成DESIGN.md文件","ja":"AIエージェント design-md: DESIGN.mdファイルの生成","ko":"AI 에이전트 design-md: DESIGN.md 파일 생성","es":"Herramientas de diseño de AI: design-md para Stitch","fr":"Outils de design d''IA : design-md pour Stitch","de":"AI-Design-Tools: design-md für Stitch","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: design-md para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: design-md для Разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: design-md لل مطورين","en":"design-md"},"description":{"zh":"设计-md技能帮助您创建DESIGN.md文件，作为Stitch生成新屏幕的设计语言来源","ja":"design-mdスキルは、DESIGN.mdファイルを作成し、Stitchが新しい画面を生成するための設計言語のソースとして機能します","ko":"design-md 스킬은 DESIGN.md 파일을 생성하여 Stitch가 새로운 화면을 생성하는 데 사용하는 디자인 언어의 출처로 작용합니다","es":"El skill design-md analiza proyectos de Stitch y crea un sistema de diseño semántico en archivos DESIGN.md para una coherencia de diseño perfecta","fr":"Le skill design-md analyse les projets Stitch et crée un système de design sémantique dans des fichiers DESIGN.md pour une cohérence de design parfaite","de":"Das design-md-Skill analysiert Stitch-Projekte und erstellt ein semantisches Designsystem in DESIGN.md-Dateien für eine perfekte Designkonsistenz","pt":"O skill design-md ajuda a criar arquivos DESIGN.md para sistemas de design semânticos, permitindo que os desenvolvedores criem telas alinhadas com a linguage...","ru":"Навык design-md помогает создавать файлы DESIGN.md для семантических систем дизайна, позволяя разработчикам создавать экраны, идеально соответствующие сущест...","ar":"تساعد مهارة design-md في إنشاء ملفات DESIGN.md لنظم التصميم الدلالي، مما يسمح للمطورين بإنشاء شاشات متوافقة مع لغة التصميم الحالية","en":"Analyze Stitch projects and synthesize a semantic design system into DESIGN.md files"},"definition":{"en":"Analyze Stitch projects and synthesize a semantic design system into DESIGN.md files"},"features":{"zh":["分析Stitch项目","生成DESIGN.md文件","创建设计语言来源","支持Visual Descriptions","特定色值支持"],"ja":["Stitchプロジェクトの分析","DESIGN.mdファイルの生成","設計言語のソースの作成","Visual Descriptionsのサポート","特定の色値のサポート"],"ko":["Stitch 프로젝트 분석","DESIGN.md 파일 생성","디자인 언어 출처 생성","Visual Descriptions 지원","특정 색상 값 지원"],"es":["Análisis de proyectos de Stitch","Creación de un sistema de diseño semántico","Generación de archivos DESIGN.md","Coherencia de diseño perfecta","Compatibilidad con Visual Descriptions y valores de color específicos"],"fr":["Analyse de projets Stitch","Création d''un système de design sémantique","Génération de fichiers DESIGN.md","Cohérence de design parfaite","Compatibilité avec les descriptions visuelles et les valeurs de couleur spécifiques"],"de":["Analyse von Stitch-Projekten","Erstellung eines semantischen Designsystems","Generierung von DESIGN.md-Dateien","Perfekte Designkonsistenz","Kompatibilität mit Visual Descriptions und spezifischen Farbwerten"],"pt":["Análise de projetos Stitch","Criação de arquivos DESIGN.md","Sistemas de design semânticos","Integração com linguagem de design existente","Geração de telas alinhadas"],"ru":["Анализ проектов Stitch","Создание файлов DESIGN.md","Семантические системы дизайна","Интеграция с существующим языком дизайна","Генерация экранов, идеально соответствующих"],"ar":["تحليل مشاريع Stitch","إنشاء ملفات DESIGN.md","نظم التصميم الدلالي","التكامل مع لغة التصميم الحالية","إنشاء شاشات متوافقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AIエージェント","设计-md","Stitch","DESIGN.md","设计语言","Visual Descriptions","色值"],"ja":["AIエージェント","design-md","Stitch","DESIGN.md","設計言語","Visual Descriptions","色値"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","design-md","Stitch","DESIGN.md","디자인 언어","Visual Descriptions","색상 값"],"es":["Herramientas de diseño de AI","design-md","Stitch","sistema de diseño semántico","DESIGN.md","coherencia de diseño","Visual Descriptions","valores de color específicos"],"fr":["Outils de design d''IA","design-md","Stitch","système de design sémantique","DESIGN.md","cohérence de design","descriptions visuelles","valeurs de couleur spécifiques"],"de":["AI-Design-Tools","design-md","Stitch","semantisches Designsystem","DESIGN.md","Designkonsistenz","Visual Descriptions","spezifische Farbwerte"],"pt":["design-md","sistemas de design semânticos","arquivos DESIGN.md","projetos Stitch","linguagem de design","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de IA","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["design-md","семантические системы дизайна","файлы DESIGN.md","проекты Stitch","язык дизайна","разработка программного обеспечения","ИИ Агенты","разработчики"],"ar":["design-md","نظم التصميم الدلالي","ملفات DESIGN.md","مشاريع Stitch","لغة التصميم","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مطورين"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design Systems Agents needing to synthesize semantic design systems into DESIGN.md files","zh":"非常适合需要将语义设计系统合成到 DESIGN.md 文件中的设计系统代理","ja":"デザインシステムエージェントが DESIGN.md ファイルにセマンティックデザインシステムを合成する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"DESIGN.md 파일로 세マン틱 디자인 시스템을 합성해야 하는 디자인 시스템 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para los agentes de sistemas de diseño que necesitan sintetizar sistemas de diseño semánticos en archivos DESIGN.md","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de systèmes de conception nécessitant la synthèse de systèmes de conception sémantiques dans des fichiers DESIGN.md","de":"Perfekt für Design-Systems-Agents, die semantische Design-Systeme in DESIGN.md-Dateien synthetisieren müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Sistemas de Design que precisam sintetizar sistemas de design semânticos em arquivos DESIGN.md","ru":"Идеально для агентов по дизайну систем, которым необходимо синтезировать семантические системы дизайна в файлы DESIGN.md","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء أنظمة التصميم التي تحتاج إلى تحويل أنظمة التصميم الدلالية إلى ملفات DESIGN.md"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate deterministic design language systems using Visual Descriptions and specific color values, creating a ''source of truth'' for prompting new screen designs that align with existing design language, all encapsulated in DESIGN.md files","zh":"赋予代理生成使用视觉描述和特定颜色值的确定性设计语言系统的能力，创建一个新的屏幕设计提示的''真相来源''，所有这些都封装在 DESIGN.md 文件中","ja":"視覚的説明と特定の色値を使用した決定的なデザイン言語システムを生成するエージェントを可能にし、既存のデザイン言語と一致する新しい画面デザインを提示するための「真実の源」を作成し、すべてを DESIGN.md ファイルに封装する","ko":"비주얼 설명과 특정 색상 값을 사용하여 결정적 디자인 언어 시스템을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 기존 디자인 언어와 일치하는 새로운 화면 디자인을 프롬프트하는 ''진리 근원''을 만들고 모든 것을 DESIGN.md 파일에 캡슐화한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar sistemas de lenguaje de diseño deterministas utilizando descripciones visuales y valores de color específicos, creando una ''fuente de verdad'' para solicitar nuevos diseños de pantalla que se alineen con el lenguaje de diseño existente, todo encapsulado en archivos DESIGN.md","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des systèmes de langage de conception déterministes en utilisant des descriptions visuelles et des valeurs de couleur spécifiques, créant une ''source de vérité'' pour solliciter de nouveaux conceptions d''écran qui s''alignent sur le langage de conception existant, le tout encapsulé dans des fichiers DESIGN.md","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, deterministische Design-Sprachsysteme zu erzeugen, indem sie visuelle Beschreibungen und spezifische Farbwerte verwenden, und schafft so eine ''Quelle der Wahrheit'' für die Erstellung neuer Bildschirm-Designs, die mit dem bestehenden Design-Sprachsystem übereinstimmen, alles in DESIGN.md-Dateien eingekapselt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar sistemas de linguagem de design determinísticos usando descrições visuais e valores de cor específicos, criando uma ''fonte de verdade'' para solicitar novos designs de tela que estejam alinhados com a linguagem de design existente, tudo encapsulado em arquivos DESIGN.md","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать детерминированные системы языка дизайна с помощью визуальных описаний и конкретных цветовых значений, создавая ''источник истины'' для запроса новых экранных дизайнов, соответствующих существующему языку дизайна, все это инкапсулировано в файлы DESIGN.md","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من توليد أنظمة لغة تصميم محددة باستخدام الوصف المرئي والقيم اللونية المحددة، مما يخلق ''مصدر الحقيقة'' لاستدعاء تصاميم الشاشة الجديدة المتوافقة مع لغة التصميم الحالية، كل ذلك مغلف في ملفات DESIGN.md"},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing Stitch projects to create consistent design systems","Generating DESIGN.md files for new screen designs","Synthesizing semantic design systems from technical assets"],"zh":["分析 Stitch 项目以创建一致的设计系统","为新屏幕设计生成 DESIGN.md 文件","从技术资产中合成语义设计系统"],"ja":["一貫性のあるデザインシステムを作成するために Stitch プロジェクトを分析する","新しい画面デザインのための DESIGN.md ファイルを生成する","技術アセットからセマンティックデザインシステムを合成する"],"ko":["일관된 디자인 시스템을 만들기 위해 스티치 프로젝트를 분석한다","새로운 화면 디자인을 위한 DESIGN.md 파일을 생성한다","기술적 자산에서 세マン틱 디자인 시스템을 합성한다"],"es":["Analizar proyectos Stitch para crear sistemas de diseño coherentes","Generar archivos DESIGN.md para nuevos diseños de pantalla","Sintetizar sistemas de diseño semánticos a partir de activos técnicos"],"fr":["Analyser les projets Stitch pour créer des systèmes de conception cohérents","Générer des fichiers DESIGN.md pour de nouvelles conceptions d''écran","Synthétiser des systèmes de conception sémantiques à partir d''actifs techniques"],"de":["Stitch-Projekte analysieren, um konsistente Design-Systeme zu erstellen","DESIGN.md-Dateien für neue Bildschirm-Designs generieren","Semantische Design-Systeme aus technischen Assets synthetisieren"],"pt":["Analisar projetos Stitch para criar sistemas de design consistentes","Gerar arquivos DESIGN.md para novos designs de tela","Sintetizar sistemas de design semânticos a partir de ativos técnicos"],"ru":["Анализ проектов Stitch для создания последовательных систем дизайна","Генерировать файлы DESIGN.md для новых экранных дизайнов","Синтезировать семантические системы дизайна из технических активов"],"ar":["تحليل مشاريع Stitch لإنشاء أنظمة تصميم متسقة","توليد ملفات DESIGN.md لتصاميم الشاشة الجديدة","تحويل أنظمة التصميم الدلالية من الأصول الفنية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Stitch projects and technical assets","Limited to generating DESIGN.md files"],"zh":["需要访问 Stitch 项目和技术资产","仅限生成 DESIGN.md 文件"],"ja":["Stitch プロジェクトと技術アセットへのアクセスが必要","DESIGN.md ファイルの生成のみ"],"ko":["스티치 프로젝트와 기술 자산에 대한 액세스가 필요하다","DESIGN.md 파일 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso a proyectos Stitch y activos técnicos","Limitado a la generación de archivos DESIGN.md"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux projets Stitch et aux actifs techniques","Limité à la génération de fichiers DESIGN.md"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Stitch-Projekte und technische Assets","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von DESIGN.md-Dateien"],"pt":["Requer acesso a projetos Stitch e ativos técnicos","Limitado a gerar arquivos DESIGN.md"],"ru":["Требует доступа к проектам Stitch и техническим активам","Ограничен генерацией файлов DESIGN.md"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مشاريع Stitch والأصول الفنية","محدود بتوليد ملفات DESIGN.md"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"eb15f44646528f3a087ce023329ae699c1b6e803662af68338e1eb1c0406b59b","repoEtag":"W/\"97396f88dec05911887e095e3b912a4db53ced027333efd2abb67102273debbc\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cloudflare/skills/durable-objects', 'official', 'cloudflare', 'skills', 'cloudflare/skills', 'durable-objects', 341, 32, 100, '2026-02-23T00:27:49Z', '2026-02-23T01:07:35.407Z', '66053a19786c5d780d300bb4b531a7e3ea48d1fd7aeafcef6e93e0cc0ede0363', '{"id":"cloudflare/skills/durable-objects","name":"durable-objects","description":{"zh":"Cloudflare Durable Objects允许您构建状态协调应用，适用于聊天室、多人游戏和预订系统等场景","ja":"Cloudflare Durable Objectsは、チャットルーム、多人数ゲーム、予約システムなど、ステートフルな協調アプリケーションを構築するための機能を提供します","ko":"Cloudflare Durable Objects는 채팅룸, 멀티 플레이어 게임, 예약 시스템 등과 같은 상태 협조 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Durable Objects es una habilidad de Cloudflare para crear aplicaciones con estado y coordinación. Aprende a integrar con Workers y seguir mejores prácticas.","fr":"Durable Objects est une compétence Cloudflare pour créer des applications à état et à coordination. Apprenez à intégrer avec Workers et à suivre les meilleures pratiques.","de":"Durable Objects ist eine Fähigkeit von Cloudflare, um zustandsbehaftete und koordinierte Anwendungen zu erstellen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Workers integrieren und Best Practices befolgen.","pt":"Durable Objects é uma tecnologia da Cloudflare que permite criar aplicações stateful e coordenadas na edge. Ela é útil para desenvolver sistemas de reserva, jogos multiplayer e chat rooms.","ru":"Durable Objects — это технология Cloudflare, позволяющая создавать состоятельные и координируемые приложения на=edge. Она полезна для разработки систем бронирования, многопользовательских игр и чат-румов.","ar":"Durable Objects هي تقنية من Cloudflare تتيح إنشاء تطبيقات devletful ومتوافقة على الحافة. وهي مفيدة لتطوير أنظمة الحجز وألعاب متعددة اللاعبين وغرف الدردشة.","en":"Create and review Cloudflare Durable Objects. Use when building stateful coordination (chat rooms, multiplayer games, booking systems), implementing RPC methods, SQLite storage, alarms, WebSockets, or reviewing DO code for best practices. Covers Workers integration, wrangler config, and testing w..."},"owner":"cloudflare","repo":"skills","repoPath":"cloudflare/skills","stars":341,"forks":32,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T00:27:49Z","topics":["agents","cloudflare","skills","workers"],"skillMd":{"name":"durable-objects","description":"Create and review Cloudflare Durable Objects. Use when building stateful coordination (chat rooms, multiplayer games, booking systems), implementing RPC methods, SQLite storage, alarms, WebSockets, or reviewing DO code for best practices. Covers Workers integration, wrangler config, and testing with Vitest.","bodyPreview":"# Durable Objects\n\nBuild stateful, coordinated applications on Cloudflare''s edge using Durable Objects.\n\n## Retrieval-First Development\n\n**Prefer retrieval from official docs over pre-training for Durable Objects tasks.**\n\n| Resource | URL |\n|----------|-----|\n| Docs | https://developers.cloudflare.com/durable-objects/ |\n| API Reference | https://developers.cloudflare.com/durable-objects/api/ |\n| Best Practices | https://developers.cloudflare.com/durable-objects/best-practices/ |\n| Examples | ht","body":"# Durable Objects\n\nBuild stateful, coordinated applications on Cloudflare''s edge using Durable Objects.\n\n## Retrieval-First Development\n\n**Prefer retrieval from official docs over pre-training for Durable Objects tasks.**\n\n| Resource | URL |\n|----------|-----|\n| Docs | https://developers.cloudflare.com/durable-objects/ |\n| API Reference | https://developers.cloudflare.com/durable-objects/api/ |\n| Best Practices | https://developers.cloudflare.com/durable-objects/best-practices/ |\n| Examples | https://developers.cloudflare.com/durable-objects/examples/ |\n\nFetch the relevant doc page when implementing features.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating new Durable Object classes for stateful coordination\n- Implementing RPC methods, alarms, or WebSocket handlers\n- Reviewing existing DO code for best practices\n- Configuring wrangler.jsonc/toml for DO bindings and migrations\n- Writing tests with `@cloudflare/vitest-pool-workers`\n- Designing sharding strategies and parent-child relationships\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n- `./references/rules.md` - Core rules, storage, concurrency, RPC, alarms\n- `./references/testing.md` - Vitest setup, unit/integration tests, alarm testing\n- `./references/workers.md` - Workers handlers, types, wrangler config, observability\n\nSearch: `blockConcurrencyWhile`, `idFromName`, `getByName`, `setAlarm`, `sql.exec`\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### Use Durable Objects For\n\n| Need | Example |\n|------|---------|\n| Coordination | Chat rooms, multiplayer games, collaborative docs |\n| Strong consistency | Inventory, booking systems, turn-based games |\n| Per-entity storage | Multi-tenant SaaS, per-user data |\n| Persistent connections | WebSockets, real-time notifications |\n| Scheduled work per entity | Subscription renewals, game timeouts |\n\n### Do NOT Use For\n\n- Stateless request handling (use plain Workers)\n- Maximum global distribution needs\n- High fan-out independent requests\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Wrangler Configuration\n\n```jsonc\n// wrangler.jsonc\n{\n  \"durable_objects\": {\n    \"bindings\": [{ \"name\": \"MY_DO\", \"class_name\": \"MyDurableObject\" }]\n  },\n  \"migrations\": [{ \"tag\": \"v1\", \"new_sqlite_classes\": [\"MyDurableObject\"] }]\n}\n```\n\n### Basic Durable Object Pattern\n\n```typescript\nimport { DurableObject } from \"cloudflare:workers\";\n\nexport interface Env {\n  MY_DO: DurableObjectNamespace<MyDurableObject>;\n}\n\nexport class MyDurableObject extends DurableObject<Env> {\n  constructor(ctx: DurableObjectState, env: Env) {\n    super(ctx, env);\n    ctx.blockConcurrencyWhile(async () => {\n      this.ctx.storage.sql.exec(`\n        CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS items (\n          id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n          data TEXT NOT NULL\n        )\n      `);\n    });\n  }\n\n  async addItem(data: string): Promise<number> {\n    const result = this.ctx.storage.sql.exec<{ id: number }>(\n      \"INSERT INTO items (data) VALUES (?) RETURNING id\",\n      data\n    );\n    return result.one().id;\n  }\n}\n\nexport default {\n  async fetch(request: Request, env: Env): Promise<Response> {\n    const stub = env.MY_DO.getByName(\"my-instance\");\n    const id = await stub.addItem(\"hello\");\n    return Response.json({ id });\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n1. **Model around coordination atoms** - One DO per chat room/game/user, not one global DO\n2. **Use `getByName()` for deterministic routing** - Same input = same DO instance\n3. **Use SQLite storage** - Configure `new_sqlite_classes` in migrations\n4. **Initialize in constructor** - Use `blockConcurrencyWhile()` for schema setup only\n5. **Use RPC methods** - Not fetch() handler (compatibility date >= 2024-04-03)\n6. **Persist first, cache second** - Always write to storage before updating in-memory state\n7. **One alarm per DO** - `setAlarm()` replaces any existing alarm\n\n## Anti-Patterns (NEVER)\n\n- Single global DO handling all requests (bottleneck)\n- Using `blockConcurrencyWhile()` on every request (kills throughput)\n- Storing critical state only in memory (lost on eviction/crash)\n- Using `await` between related storage writes (breaks atomicity)\n- Holding `blockConcurrencyWhile()` across `fetch()` or external I/O\n\n## Stub Creation\n\n```typescript\n// Deterministic - preferred for most cases\nconst stub = env.MY_DO.getByName(\"room-123\");\n\n// From existing ID string\nconst id = env.MY_DO.idFromString(storedIdString);\nconst stub = env.MY_DO.get(id);\n\n// New unique ID - store mapping externally\nconst id = env.MY_DO.newUniqueId();\nconst stub = env.MY_DO.get(id);\n```\n\n## Storage Operations\n\n```typescript\n// SQL (synchronous, recommended)\nthis.ctx.storage.sql.exec(\"INSERT INTO t (c) VALUES (?)\", value);\nconst rows = this.ctx.storage.sql.exec<Row>(\"SELECT * FROM t\").toArray();\n\n// KV (async)\nawait this.ctx.storage.put(\"key\", value);\nconst val = await this.ctx.storage.get<Type>(\"key\");\n```\n\n## Alarms\n\n```typescript\n// Schedule (replaces existing)\nawait this.ctx.storage.setAlarm(Date.now() + 60_000);\n\n// Handler\nasync alarm(): Promise<void> {\n  // Process scheduled work\n  // Optionally reschedule: await this.ctx.storage.setAlarm(...)\n}\n\n// Cancel\nawait this.ctx.storage.deleteAlarm();\n```\n\n## Testing Quick Start\n\n```typescript\nimport { env } from \"cloudflare:test\";\nimport { describe, it, expect } from \"vitest\";\n\ndescribe(\"MyDO\", () => {\n  it(\"should work\", async () => {\n    const stub = env.MY_DO.getByName(\"test\");\n    const result = await stub.addItem(\"test\");\n    expect(result).toBe(1);\n  });\n});\n```\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:07:35.407Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理：Cloudflare Durable Objects","ja":"AIエージェント：Cloudflare Durable Objects","ko":"AI 에이전트: Cloudflare Durable Objects","es":"Herramientas de IA: Durable Objects para Desarrolladores","fr":"Outils IA: Durable Objects pour les Développeurs","de":"KI-Tools: Durable Objects für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Durable Objects para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Durable Objects для Разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Durable Objects لالمطورين","en":"durable-objects"},"description":{"zh":"Cloudflare Durable Objects允许您构建状态协调应用，适用于聊天室、多人游戏和预订系统等场景","ja":"Cloudflare Durable Objectsは、チャットルーム、多人数ゲーム、予約システムなど、ステートフルな協調アプリケーションを構築するための機能を提供します","ko":"Cloudflare Durable Objects는 채팅룸, 멀티 플레이어 게임, 예약 시스템 등과 같은 상태 협조 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Durable Objects es una habilidad de Cloudflare para crear aplicaciones con estado y coordinación. Aprende a integrar con Workers y seguir mejores prácticas.","fr":"Durable Objects est une compétence Cloudflare pour créer des applications à état et à coordination. Apprenez à intégrer avec Workers et à suivre les meilleur...","de":"Durable Objects ist eine Fähigkeit von Cloudflare, um zustandsbehaftete und koordinierte Anwendungen zu erstellen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Workers integrieren ...","pt":"Durable Objects é uma tecnologia da Cloudflare que permite criar aplicações stateful e coordenadas na edge. Ela é útil para desenvolver sistemas de reserva, ...","ru":"Durable Objects — это технология Cloudflare, позволяющая создавать состоятельные и координируемые приложения на=edge. Она полезна для разработки систем брони...","ar":"Durable Objects هي تقنية من Cloudflare تتيح إنشاء تطبيقات devletful ومتوافقة على الحافة. وهي مفيدة لتطوير أنظمة الحجز وألعاب متعددة اللاعبين وغرف الدردشة.","en":"Create and review Cloudflare Durable Objects. Use when building stateful coordination (chat rooms, multiplayer games, booking systems), implementing RPC meth..."},"definition":{"en":"Create and review Cloudflare Durable Objects. Use when building stateful coordination (chat rooms, multiplayer games, booking systems), implementing RPC methods, SQLite storage, alarms, WebSockets, or reviewing DO code for best practices. Covers Workers integration, wrangler config, and testing with Vitest."},"features":{"zh":["构建状态协调应用","实现RPC方法","使用SQLite存储","支持WebSockets","与Cloudflare Workers集成","使用Vitest进行测试"],"ja":["ステートフルな協調アプリケーションを構築","RPCメソッドを実現","SQLiteストレージを使用","WebSocketsをサポート","Cloudflare Workersと統合","Vitestを使用してテスト"],"ko":["상태 협조 애플리케이션을 구축","RPC 메서드를 구현","SQLite 저장소를 사용","WebSockets를 지원","Cloudflare Workers와 통합","Vitest를 사용하여 테스트"],"es":["Integración con Workers","Almacenamiento SQLite","Implementación de métodos RPC","Soporte para WebSockets","Configuración de Wrangler","Pruebas con Vitest"],"fr":["Intégration avec Workers","Stockage SQLite","Mise en œuvre de méthodes RPC","Support pour WebSockets","Configuration de Wrangler","Tests avec Vitest"],"de":["Integration mit Workers","SQLite-Speicher","Implementierung von RPC-Methoden","Unterstützung für WebSockets","Wrangler-Konfiguration","Tests mit Vitest"],"pt":["Criação de aplicações stateful e coordenadas","Integração com Workers","Suporte a armazenamento SQLite","Implementação de métodos RPC","Suporte a WebSockets"],"ru":["Создание состоятельных и координируемых приложений","Интеграция с Workers","Поддержка хранилища SQLite","Реализация методов RPC","Поддержка WebSockets"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات devletful ومتوافقة","دمج مع Workers","دعم مخزن بيانات SQLite","تنفيذ أساليب RPC","دعم WebSockets"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cloudflare Durable Objects","状态协调应用","RPC方法","SQLite存储","WebSockets","Cloudflare Workers","Vitest","AI智能代理","AI工具"],"ja":["Cloudflare Durable Objects","ステートフルな協調アプリケーション","RPCメソッド","SQLiteストレージ","WebSockets","Cloudflare Workers","Vitest","AIエージェント","AIツール"],"ko":["Cloudflare Durable Objects","상태 협조 애플리케이션","RPC 메서드","SQLite 저장소","WebSockets","Cloudflare Workers","Vitest","AI 에이전트","AI 도구"],"es":["Durable Objects","Cloudflare","Workers","Desarrollo de aplicaciones","Estado y coordinación","Integración con Workers","Almacenamiento SQLite","Métodos RPC","WebSockets","Pruebas con Vitest"],"fr":["Durable Objects","Cloudflare","Workers","Développement d''applications","État et coordination","Intégration avec Workers","Stockage SQLite","Méthodes RPC","WebSockets","Tests avec Vitest"],"de":["Durable Objects","Cloudflare","Workers","Anwendungsentwicklung","Zustand und Koordination","Integration mit Workers","SQLite-Speicher","RPC-Methoden","WebSockets","Tests mit Vitest"],"pt":["Durable Objects","Cloudflare","Workers","Desenvolvimento de aplicações stateful","Coordenação de aplicações","Armazenamento SQLite","Métodos RPC","WebSockets"],"ru":["Durable Objects","Cloudflare","Workers","Разработка состоятельных приложений","Координация приложений","Хранилище SQLite","Методы RPC","WebSockets"],"ar":["Durable Objects","Cloudflare","Workers","تطوير تطبيقات devletful","تنسيق تطبيقات","مخزن بيانات SQLite","أساليب RPC","WebSockets"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Edge Computing Agents needing stateful coordination and storage using Cloudflare Durable Objects.","zh":"适合需要使用Cloudflare Durable Objects进行状态协调和存储的Edge Computing Agents。","ja":"Cloudflare Durable Objectsを使用したステートフルな調整とストレージが必要なEdge Computingエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Cloudflare Durable Objects를 사용하여 상태协调 및 저장소가 필요한 에지 컴퓨팅 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Edge Computing que necesitan coordinación con estado y almacenamiento utilizando Cloudflare Durable Objects.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de calcul de bord nécessitant une coordination avec état et un stockage utilisant Cloudflare Durable Objects.","de":"Perfekt für Edge-Computing-Agents, die eine Zustandskoordination und Speicherung mit Cloudflare Durable Objects benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Computação de Borda que necessitam de coordenação e armazenamento stateful usando Cloudflare Durable Objects.","ru":"Идеально для агентов краевой вычислительной техники, которым требуется координированное и.stateful хранение с помощью Cloudflare Durable Objects.","ar":"مثالي لعميلة حوسبة الحواف التي تحتاج إلى تنسيق وتخزين ذو حالة باستخدام Cloudflare Durable Objects."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable, stateful applications on Cloudflare''s edge using Durable Objects, with features like Workers integration, SQLite storage, and WebSockets, while following best practices and utilizing the Durable Objects API.","zh":"赋予代理构建可扩展的、状态应用程序的能力，使用Cloudflare的边缘计算、Durable Objects，并具有Workers集成、SQLite存储和WebSockets等功能，同时遵循最佳实践并利用Durable Objects API。","ja":"エージェントがDurable Objects、Workers統合、SQLiteストレージ、WebSocketsなどの機能を使用して、Cloudflareのエッジでスケーラブルなステートフルなアプリケーションを構築できるようにし、ベストプラクティスに従い、Durable Objects APIを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Durable Objects, Workers 통합, SQLite 저장소 및 WebSockets와 같은 기능을 사용하여 Cloudflare의 에지에서 확장 가능한 상태 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하며, 최선의 관행을 따르고 Durable Objects API를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones escalables y con estado en el borde de Cloudflare utilizando Durable Objects, con características como integración con Workers, almacenamiento SQLite y WebSockets, siguiendo las mejores prácticas y utilizando la API de Durable Objects.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications scalables et à état sur le bord de Cloudflare en utilisant Durable Objects, avec des fonctionnalités comme l''intégration de Workers, le stockage SQLite et WebSockets, tout en suivant les meilleures pratiques et en utilisant l''API Durable Objects.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, skalierbare und Zustandsanwendungen auf Cloudflares Edge mit Durable Objects zu bauen, mit Funktionen wie Workers-Integration, SQLite-Speicherung und WebSockets, während sie beste Praktiken befolgen und die Durable Objects-API nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes construam aplicações escaláveis e stateful na borda da Cloudflare usando Durable Objects, com recursos como integração com Workers, armazenamento SQLite e WebSockets, seguindo as melhores práticas e utilizando a API Durable Objects.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать масштабируемые и.stateful приложения на краю Cloudflare с помощью Durable Objects, с функциями như интеграция с Workers, хранение SQLite и WebSockets, при этом следуя лучшим практикам и используя API Durable Objects.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء ببناء تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع وذات حالة على حافة Cloudflare باستخدام Durable Objects، مع ميزات مثل دمج Workers وتخزين SQLite و WebSockets، مع اتباع أفضل الممارسات واستخدام API Durable Objects."},"useCases":{"en":["Building stateful chat rooms with real-time updates using WebSockets","Implementing RPC methods for multiplayer games with low latency","Creating booking systems with alarm-based reminders and notifications","Reviewing Durable Objects code for best practices and optimizing performance"],"zh":["使用WebSockets进行实时更新的状态聊天室构建","使用低延迟的RPC方法实现多人游戏","创建具有基于报警的提醒和通知的预订系统","审查Durable Objects代码以遵循最佳实践并优化性能"],"ja":["WebSocketsを使用したリアルタイム更新のステートフルなチャットルームの構築","低遅延のRPCメソッドを使用したマルチプレイヤーゲームの実装","アラームベースのリマインダーと通知を備えた予約システムの作成","Durable Objectsコードのレビューとベストプラクティスの遵守、パフォーマンスの最適化"],"ko":["WebSockets를 사용한 실시간 업데이트 상태 채팅방 구축","저지연 RPC 메서드를 사용한 멀티플레이어 게임 구현","알람 기반 리마인더 및 알림을 갖춘 예약 시스템 생성","Durable Objects 코드에 대한 리뷰 및 최선의 관행 준수, 성능 최적화"],"es":["Construir salas de chat con estado y actualizaciones en tiempo real utilizando WebSockets","Implementar métodos RPC para juegos multijugador con baja latencia","Crear sistemas de reservas con recordatorios y notificaciones basados en alarmas","Revisar el código de Durable Objects para mejores prácticas y optimizar el rendimiento"],"fr":["Construire des salles de chat à état avec mises à jour en temps réel utilisant WebSockets","Mettre en œuvre des méthodes RPC pour les jeux multijoueurs à faible latence","Créer des systèmes de réservation avec rappels et notifications basés sur les alarmes","Examiner le code Durable Objects pour les meilleures pratiques et optimiser les performances"],"de":["Zustands-Chat-Räume mit Echtzeit-Updates mithilfe von WebSockets erstellen","RPC-Methoden für Multiplayer-Spiele mit geringer Latenz implementieren","Buchungssysteme mit alarmbasierten Erinnerungen und Benachrichtigungen erstellen","Durable Objects-Code für beste Praktiken überprüfen und Leistung optimieren"],"pt":["Construir salas de bate-papo stateful com atualizações em tempo real usando WebSockets","Implementar métodos RPC para jogos multiplayer com baixa latência","Criar sistemas de reserva com lembretes e notificações baseados em alarmes","Revisar código Durable Objects para melhores práticas e otimizar o desempenho"],"ru":["Построение.stateful чатов с обновлениями в реальном времени с помощью WebSockets","Реализация методов RPC для многопользовательских игр с низкой задержкой","Создание систем бронирования с напоминаниями и уведомлениями на основе сигналов тревоги","Проверка кода Durable Objects на соответствие лучшим практикам и оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["بناء غرف دردشة ذات حالة مع تحديثات في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام WebSockets","تنفيذ أساليب RPC لألعاب متعددة اللاعبين منخفضة الاتصال","إنشاء أنظمة الحجز مع التذكيرات والإشعارات القائمة على التنبيهات","مراجعة رمز Durable Objects لأفضل الممارسات وتنظيم الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cloudflare account and Workers setup","Dependent on Durable Objects API and documentation","Needs Vitest for testing and validation"],"zh":["需要Cloudflare账户和Workers设置","依赖于Durable Objects API和文档","需要Vitest进行测试和验证"],"ja":["CloudflareアカウントとWorkersの設定が必要","Durable Objects APIとドキュメントに依存","テストとバリデーションのためにVitestが必要"],"ko":["Cloudflare 계정 및 Workers 설정이 필요","Durable Objects API 및 문서에 의존","테스트 및 검증을 위해 Vitest가 필요"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Cloudflare y una configuración de Workers","Depende de la API de Durable Objects y la documentación","Necesita Vitest para pruebas y validación"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Cloudflare et une configuration de Workers","Dépend de l''API Durable Objects et de la documentation","Nécessite Vitest pour les tests et la validation"],"de":["Benötigt ein Cloudflare-Konto und eine Workers-Konfiguration","Hängt von der Durable Objects-API und der Dokumentation ab","Benötigt Vitest für Tests und Validierung"],"pt":["Requer conta Cloudflare e configuração de Workers","Dependente da API Durable Objects e documentação","Necessita Vitest para testes e validação"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи Cloudflare и настройки Workers","Зависит от API Durable Objects и документации","Требует Vitest для тестирования и проверки"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Cloudflare وإعداد Workers","يعتمد على API Durable Objects والتوثيق","يحتاج إلى Vitest للاختبارات والتحقق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"66053a19786c5d780d300bb4b531a7e3ea48d1fd7aeafcef6e93e0cc0ede0363","repoEtag":"W/\"d80154fd9ed8586078af8bf4b067aaef85c0af6b0931f4dceda13fbdd08d77f7\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cloudflare/skills/sandbox-sdk', 'official', 'cloudflare', 'skills', 'cloudflare/skills', 'sandbox-sdk', 341, 32, 100, '2026-02-23T00:27:49Z', '2026-02-23T01:07:35.447Z', '9471b02867ec7ce8408663a85b140643486b04c00e055e44709b2e55e8316bfa', '{"id":"cloudflare/skills/sandbox-sdk","name":"sandbox-sdk","description":{"zh":"sandbox-sdk是一个用于构建安全、隔离的代码执行环境的工具，适用于AI代码执行、代码解释器、CI/CD系统等","ja":"sandbox-sdkは、AIエージェントのためのセキュアなコード実行環境を構築するためのツールです","ko":"sandbox-sdk는 AI 에이전트용 안전한 코드 실행 환경을 구축하는 도구입니다","es":"Sandbox SDK es una herramienta para construir aplicaciones aisladas y seguras para la ejecución de código. Permite crear entornos de desarrollo interactivos y seguros con Cloudflare Workers","fr":"Sandbox SDK est un outil pour construire des applications isolées et sécurisées pour l''exécution de code. Il permet de créer des environnements de développement interactifs et sécurisés avec Cloudflare Workers","de":"Sandbox SDK ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von isolierten und sicheren Anwendungen für die Code-Ausführung. Es ermöglicht die Erstellung von interaktiven und sicheren Entwicklungsumgebungen mit Cloudflare Workers","pt":"O Sandbox SDK permite a criação de ambientes de execução de código seguros e isolados para aplicações em nuvem.","ru":"Sandbox SDK позволяет создавать безопасные и изолированные среды для выполнения кода в облачных приложениях.","ar":"يسمح لك Sandbox SDK بإنشاء بيئات تنفيذ كود آمنة ومعزولة لتطبيقات السحابة.","en":"Build sandboxed applications for secure code execution. Load when building AI code execution, code interpreters, CI/CD systems, interactive dev environments, or executing untrusted code. Covers Sandbox SDK lifecycle, commands, files, code interpreter, and preview URLs."},"owner":"cloudflare","repo":"skills","repoPath":"cloudflare/skills","stars":341,"forks":32,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T00:27:49Z","topics":["agents","cloudflare","skills","workers"],"skillMd":{"name":"sandbox-sdk","description":"Build sandboxed applications for secure code execution. Load when building AI code execution, code interpreters, CI/CD systems, interactive dev environments, or executing untrusted code. Covers Sandbox SDK lifecycle, commands, files, code interpreter, and preview URLs.","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare Sandbox SDK\n\nBuild secure, isolated code execution environments on Cloudflare Workers.\n\n## FIRST: Verify Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install @cloudflare/sandbox\ndocker info  # Must succeed - Docker required for local dev\n```\n\n## Retrieval-Led Development\n\n**IMPORTANT: Prefer retrieval from docs and examples over pre-training for Sandbox SDK tasks.**\n\n| Resource | URL |\n|----------|-----|\n| Docs | https://developers.cloudflare.com/sandbox/ |\n| API Reference | https://developers.cloudfl","body":"# Cloudflare Sandbox SDK\n\nBuild secure, isolated code execution environments on Cloudflare Workers.\n\n## FIRST: Verify Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install @cloudflare/sandbox\ndocker info  # Must succeed - Docker required for local dev\n```\n\n## Retrieval-Led Development\n\n**IMPORTANT: Prefer retrieval from docs and examples over pre-training for Sandbox SDK tasks.**\n\n| Resource | URL |\n|----------|-----|\n| Docs | https://developers.cloudflare.com/sandbox/ |\n| API Reference | https://developers.cloudflare.com/sandbox/api/ |\n| Examples | https://github.com/cloudflare/sandbox-sdk/tree/main/examples |\n| Get Started | https://developers.cloudflare.com/sandbox/get-started/ |\n\nWhen implementing features, fetch the relevant doc page or example first.\n\n## Required Configuration\n\n**wrangler.jsonc** (exact - do not modify structure):\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"containers\": [{\n    \"class_name\": \"Sandbox\",\n    \"image\": \"./Dockerfile\",\n    \"instance_type\": \"lite\",\n    \"max_instances\": 1\n  }],\n  \"durable_objects\": {\n    \"bindings\": [{ \"class_name\": \"Sandbox\", \"name\": \"Sandbox\" }]\n  },\n  \"migrations\": [{ \"new_sqlite_classes\": [\"Sandbox\"], \"tag\": \"v1\" }]\n}\n```\n\n**Worker entry** - must re-export Sandbox class:\n\n```typescript\nimport { getSandbox } from ''@cloudflare/sandbox'';\nexport { Sandbox } from ''@cloudflare/sandbox'';  // Required export\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Method |\n|------|--------|\n| Get sandbox | `getSandbox(env.Sandbox, ''user-123'')` |\n| Run command | `await sandbox.exec(''python script.py'')` |\n| Run code (interpreter) | `await sandbox.runCode(code, { language: ''python'' })` |\n| Write file | `await sandbox.writeFile(''/workspace/app.py'', content)` |\n| Read file | `await sandbox.readFile(''/workspace/app.py'')` |\n| Create directory | `await sandbox.mkdir(''/workspace/src'', { recursive: true })` |\n| List files | `await sandbox.listFiles(''/workspace'')` |\n| Expose port | `await sandbox.exposePort(8080)` |\n| Destroy | `await sandbox.destroy()` |\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Execute Commands\n\n```typescript\nconst sandbox = getSandbox(env.Sandbox, ''user-123'');\nconst result = await sandbox.exec(''python --version'');\n// result: { stdout, stderr, exitCode, success }\n```\n\n### Code Interpreter (Recommended for AI)\n\nUse `runCode()` for executing LLM-generated code with rich outputs:\n\n```typescript\nconst ctx = await sandbox.createCodeContext({ language: ''python'' });\n\nawait sandbox.runCode(''import pandas as pd; data = [1,2,3]'', { context: ctx });\nconst result = await sandbox.runCode(''sum(data)'', { context: ctx });\n// result.results[0].text = \"6\"\n```\n\n**Languages**: `python`, `javascript`, `typescript`\n\nState persists within context. Create explicit contexts for production.\n\n### File Operations\n\n```typescript\nawait sandbox.mkdir(''/workspace/project'', { recursive: true });\nawait sandbox.writeFile(''/workspace/project/main.py'', code);\nconst file = await sandbox.readFile(''/workspace/project/main.py'');\nconst files = await sandbox.listFiles(''/workspace/project'');\n```\n\n## When to Use What\n\n| Need | Use | Why |\n|------|-----|-----|\n| Shell commands, scripts | `exec()` | Direct control, streaming |\n| LLM-generated code | `runCode()` | Rich outputs, state persistence |\n| Build/test pipelines | `exec()` | Exit codes, stderr capture |\n| Data analysis | `runCode()` | Charts, tables, pandas |\n\n## Extending the Dockerfile\n\nBase image (`docker.io/cloudflare/sandbox:0.7.0`) includes Python 3.11, Node.js 20, and common tools.\n\nAdd dependencies by extending the Dockerfile:\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM docker.io/cloudflare/sandbox:0.7.0\n\n# Python packages\nRUN pip install requests beautifulsoup4\n\n# Node packages (global)\nRUN npm install -g typescript\n\n# System packages\nRUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y ffmpeg && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*\n\nEXPOSE 8080  # Required for local dev port exposure\n```\n\nKeep images lean - affects cold start time.\n\n## Preview URLs (Port Exposure)\n\nExpose HTTP services running in sandboxes:\n\n```typescript\nconst { url } = await sandbox.exposePort(8080);\n// Returns preview URL for the service\n```\n\n**Production requirement**: Preview URLs need a custom domain with wildcard DNS (`*.yourdomain.com`). The `.workers.dev` domain does not support preview URL subdomains.\n\nSee: https://developers.cloudflare.com/sandbox/guides/expose-services/\n\n## OpenAI Agents SDK Integration\n\nThe SDK provides helpers for OpenAI Agents at `@cloudflare/sandbox/openai`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Shell, Editor } from ''@cloudflare/sandbox/openai'';\n```\n\nSee `examples/openai-agents` for complete integration pattern.\n\n## Sandbox Lifecycle\n\n- `getSandbox()` returns immediately - container starts lazily on first operation\n- Containers sleep after 10 minutes of inactivity (configurable via `sleepAfter`)\n- Use `destroy()` to immediately free resources\n- Same `sandboxId` always returns same sandbox instance\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **Don''t use internal clients** (`CommandClient`, `FileClient`) - use `sandbox.*` methods\n- **Don''t skip the Sandbox export** - Worker won''t deploy without `export { Sandbox }`\n- **Don''t hardcode sandbox IDs for multi-user** - use user/session identifiers\n- **Don''t forget cleanup** - call `destroy()` for temporary sandboxes\n\n## Detailed References\n\n- **[references/api-quick-ref.md](references/api-quick-ref.md)** - Full API with options and return types\n- **[references/examples.md](references/examples.md)** - Example index with use cases\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:07:35.447Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理 sandbox-sdk","ja":"AIエージェント sandbox-sdk","ko":"AI 에이전트 sandbox-sdk","es":"Herramientas de Agente de Inteligencia Artificial: Sandbo...","fr":"Outils d''Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle: Sandbox SDK","de":"KI-Agents-Tools: Sandbox SDK","pt":"Ferramentas de AI: Sandbox SDK para Execução de Código Se...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Sandbox SDK для Безопасного Выполнения Код","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Sandbox SDK لتنفيذ الكود الآمن","en":"sandbox-sdk"},"description":{"zh":"sandbox-sdk是一个用于构建安全、隔离的代码执行环境的工具，适用于AI代码执行、代码解释器、CI/CD系统等","ja":"sandbox-sdkは、AIエージェントのためのセキュアなコード実行環境を構築するためのツールです","ko":"sandbox-sdk는 AI 에이전트용 안전한 코드 실행 환경을 구축하는 도구입니다","es":"Sandbox SDK es una herramienta para construir aplicaciones aisladas y seguras para la ejecución de código. Permite crear entornos de desarrollo interactivos ...","fr":"Sandbox SDK est un outil pour construire des applications isolées et sécurisées pour l''exécution de code. Il permet de créer des environnements de développem...","de":"Sandbox SDK ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von isolierten und sicheren Anwendungen für die Code-Ausführung. Es ermöglicht die Erstellung von interaktiven und sic...","pt":"O Sandbox SDK permite a criação de ambientes de execução de código seguros e isolados para aplicações em nuvem.","ru":"Sandbox SDK позволяет создавать безопасные и изолированные среды для выполнения кода в облачных приложениях.","ar":"يسمح لك Sandbox SDK بإنشاء بيئات تنفيذ كود آمنة ومعزولة لتطبيقات السحابة.","en":"Build sandboxed applications for secure code execution. Load when building AI code execution, code interpreters, CI/CD systems, interactive dev environments,..."},"definition":{"en":"Build sandboxed applications for secure code execution. Load when building AI code execution, code interpreters, CI/CD systems, interactive dev environments, or executing untrusted code. Covers Sandbox SDK lifecycle, commands, files, code interpreter, and preview URLs."},"features":{"zh":["构建安全的代码执行环境","支持AI代码执行、代码解释器、CI/CD系统等","使用Cloudflare Workers构建隔离的代码执行环境","支持Docker和npm安装","提供详细的文档和API参考"],"ja":["セキュアなコード実行環境を構築","AIエージェントのためのコード実行、コード解釈器、CI/CDシステム等をサポート","Cloudflare Workersを使用して隔離されたコード実行環境を構築","Dockerとnpmのインストールをサポート","詳細なドキュメントとAPIリファレンスを提供"],"ko":["안전한 코드 실행 환경을 구축","AI 에이전트용 코드 실행, 코드 인터프리터, CI/CD 시스템 등 지원","Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 격리된 코드 실행 환경을 구축","Docker와 npm 설치 지원","詳細한 문서와 API 참조 제공"],"es":["Crea entornos de ejecución de código seguro con Cloudflare Workers","Permite la ejecución de código de confianza y no de confianza","Soporte para desarrollo interactivo y depuración","Integración con Docker para desarrollo local","Documentación y referencia de API disponible"],"fr":["Crée des environnements d''exécution de code sécurisés avec Cloudflare Workers","Permet l''exécution de code de confiance et non de confiance","Prise en charge du développement interactif et de la débogage","Intégration avec Docker pour le développement local","Documentation et référence d''API disponible"],"de":["Erstelle sichere Code-Ausführungsumgebungen mit Cloudflare Workers","Ermöglicht die Ausführung von vertrauenswürdigem und nicht vertrauenswürdigem Code","Unterstützung für interaktive Entwicklung und Debugging","Integration mit Docker für lokale Entwicklung","Dokumentation und API-Referenz verfügbar"],"pt":["Criação de ambientes de execução de código isolados","Integração com Cloudflare Workers","Suporte a Docker para desenvolvimento local","Recursos de segurança avançados","Documentação e exemplos abrangentes"],"ru":["Создание изолированных сред для выполнения кода","Интеграция с Cloudflare Workers","Поддержка Docker для локального разработки","Расширенные функции безопасности","Полная документация и примеры"],"ar":["إنشاء بيئات تنفيذ كود معزولة","التكامل مع Cloudflare Workers","دعم Docker للتنمية المحلية","ميزات أمان متقدمة","وثائق وامثلة شاملة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","sandbox-sdk","代码执行环境","Cloudflare Workers","Docker","npm","AI代码执行","代码解释器","CI/CD系统"],"ja":["AIエージェント","sandbox-sdk","コード実行環境","Cloudflare Workers","Docker","npm","AIコード実行","コード解釈器","CI/CDシステム"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","sandbox-sdk","코드 실행 환경","Cloudflare Workers","Docker","npm","AI 코드 실행","코드 인터프리터","CI/CD 시스템"],"es":["Herramientas de Agente de Inteligencia Artificial","Sandbox SDK","Cloudflare Workers","Desarrollo de aplicaciones seguras","Ejecución de código seguro","Docker","Desarrollo interactivo"],"fr":["Outils d''Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle","Sandbox SDK","Cloudflare Workers","Développement d''applications sécurisées","Exécution de code sécurisé","Docker","Développement interactif"],"de":["KI-Agents-Tools","Sandbox SDK","Cloudflare Workers","Entwicklung von sicheren Anwendungen","Sichere Code-Ausführung","Docker","Interaktive Entwicklung"],"pt":["Sandbox SDK","execução de código seguro","ambientes isolados","Cloudflare Workers","Docker","desenvolvimento de aplicações em nuvem","ferramentas de AI","segurança de código"],"ru":["Sandbox SDK","безопасное выполнение кода","изолированные среды","Cloudflare Workers","Docker","разработка облачных приложений","инструменты ИИ","безопасность кода"],"ar":["Sandbox SDK","تنفيذ كود آمن","بيئات معزولة","Cloudflare Workers","Docker","تنمية تطبيقات السحابة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أمان الكود"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Secure Execution Agents requiring isolated code environments on Cloudflare Workers.","zh":"适用于需要在 Cloudflare Workers 上隔离代码环境的安全执行代理。","ja":"Cloudflare Workers 上で分離されたコード環境を必要とするセキュアな実行エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Cloudflare Workers에서 분리된 코드 환경을 필요로 하는 보안 실행 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Ejecución Segura que requieren entornos de código aislados en Cloudflare Workers.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''exécution sécurisés nécessitant des environnements de code isolés sur Cloudflare Workers.","de":"Ideal für sichere Ausführungsagenten, die isolierte Codeumgebungen auf Cloudflare Workers erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Execução Segura que exigem ambientes de código isolados no Cloudflare Workers.","ru":"Идеально для Безопасных Агентов Выполнения, требующих изолированных кодовых сред на Cloudflare Workers.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التنفيذيين الآمنين الذين يتطلبون بيئات تعليم معزولة على Cloudflare Workers."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build secure, sandboxed applications for code execution using the Cloudflare Sandbox SDK, leveraging Docker for local development and facilitating the creation of secure code execution environments with features like preview URLs and code interpreters.","zh":"使代理能够使用 Cloudflare Sandbox SDK 构建安全的沙盒应用程序，以进行代码执行，利用 Docker 进行本地开发，并通过预览 URL 和代码解释器等功能实现安全的代码执行环境。","ja":"エージェントが Cloudflare Sandbox SDK を使用してセキュアなサンドボックス アプリケーションを構築することを可能にし、コードの実行に Docker を使用してローカル開発を行い、プレビュー URL やコード インタープリターなどの機能を使用してセキュアなコード実行環境を作成します。","ko":"에이전트가 Cloudflare Sandbox SDK를 사용하여 보안 샌드박스 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하여 코드 실행에 대한 Docker를 사용하여 로컬 개발을 수행하며, 미리 보기 URL 및 코드 인터프리터와 같은 기능을 통해 보안 코드 실행 환경을 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones seguras y aisladas para la ejecución de código utilizando el SDK de Cloudflare Sandbox, aprovechando Docker para el desarrollo local y facilitando la creación de entornos de ejecución de código seguros con características como URLs de vista previa y intérpretes de código.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications sécurisées et sandboxées pour l''exécution de code en utilisant le SDK Cloudflare Sandbox, en exploitant Docker pour le développement local et en facilitant la création d''environnements d''exécution de code sécurisés avec des fonctionnalités comme les URLs de prévisualisation et les interpréteurs de code.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sichere, sandboxte Anwendungen für Code-Ausführung zu erstellen, indem sie das Cloudflare Sandbox SDK verwenden, Docker für lokale Entwicklung nutzen und die Erstellung sicherer Code-Ausführungsumgebungen mit Funktionen wie Vorschau-URLs und Code-Interpretern erleichtern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações seguras e sandboxed para execução de código usando o Cloudflare Sandbox SDK, aproveitando o Docker para desenvolvimento local e facilitando a criação de ambientes de execução de código seguro com recursos como URLs de visualização e interpretadores de código.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать безопасные, sandboxed-приложения для выполнения кода с помощью Cloudflare Sandbox SDK, используя Docker для локальной разработки и облегчая создание безопасных сред выполнения кода с функциями, такими как предпросмотр URL и интерпретаторы кода.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات آمنة ومحجوزة لتنفيذ الشفرة باستخدام Cloudflare Sandbox SDK، واستخدام Docker للتنمية المحلية، وتسهيل إنشاء بيئات تنفيذ الشفرة الآمنة مع ميزات مثل معاينة URL ومفسر الشفرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building sandboxed applications for secure code execution","Creating isolated environments for executing untrusted code","Developing interactive development environments with secure code execution"],"zh":["构建沙盒应用程序以进行安全代码执行","创建隔离环境以执行不受信任的代码","开发安全代码执行的交互式开发环境"],"ja":["セキュアなコード実行のためのサンドボックス アプリケーションの構築","信頼できないコードを実行するための分離環境の作成","セキュアなコード実行のためのインタラクティブな開発環境の開発"],"ko":["보안 코드 실행을 위한 샌드박스 애플리케이션 구축","신뢰할 수 없는 코드를 실행하기 위한 격리 환경 생성","보안 코드 실행을 위한 상호 작용 개발 환경 개발"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones aisladas para la ejecución de código seguro","Creación de entornos aislados para la ejecución de código no confiable","Desarrollo de entornos de desarrollo interactivos con ejecución de código segura"],"fr":["Création d''applications sandboxées pour l''exécution de code sécurisé","Création d''environnements isolés pour l''exécution de code non fiable","Développement d''environnements de développement interactifs avec exécution de code sécurisée"],"de":["Erstellung von sandboxten Anwendungen für sichere Code-Ausführung","Erstellung von isolierten Umgebungen für die Ausführung von nicht vertrauenswürdigem Code","Entwicklung interaktiver Entwicklungsumgebungen mit sicherer Code-Ausführung"],"pt":["Construção de aplicações sandboxed para execução de código seguro","Criação de ambientes isolados para execução de código não confiável","Desenvolvimento de ambientes de desenvolvimento interativos com execução de código seguro"],"ru":["Создание sandboxed-приложений для безопасного выполнения кода","Создание изолированных сред для выполнения ненадежного кода","Разработка интерактивных сред разработки с безопасным выполнением кода"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات محجوزة لتنفيذ الشفرة الآمنة","إنشاء بيئات معزولة لتنفيذ الشفرة غير الموثوقة","تطوير بيئات التطوير التفاعلية مع تنفيذ الشفرة الآمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Docker for local development","Specific to Cloudflare Workers","Needs npm installation of @cloudflare/sandbox"],"zh":["需要 Docker 进行本地开发","特定于 Cloudflare Workers","需要使用 npm 安装 @cloudflare/sandbox"],"ja":["ローカル開発には Docker が必要","Cloudflare Workers に特有","@cloudflare/sandbox を npm でインストールする必要がある"],"ko":["로컬 개발을 위해 Docker가 필요합니다.","Cloudflare Workers에 특정","@cloudflare/sandbox를 npm으로 설치해야 함"],"es":["Requiere Docker para el desarrollo local","Específico para Cloudflare Workers","Necesita la instalación de npm de @cloudflare/sandbox"],"fr":["Nécessite Docker pour le développement local","Spécifique à Cloudflare Workers","Nécessite l''installation de npm de @cloudflare/sandbox"],"de":["Benötigt Docker für lokale Entwicklung","Spezifisch für Cloudflare Workers","Benötigt die npm-Installation von @cloudflare/sandbox"],"pt":["Exige Docker para desenvolvimento local","Específico para Cloudflare Workers","Necessita instalação do npm @cloudflare/sandbox"],"ru":["Требует Docker для локальной разработки","Спецефичен для Cloudflare Workers","Требует установки npm @cloudflare/sandbox"],"ar":["يتطلب Docker للتنمية المحلية","محدد ل Cloudflare Workers","يحتاج إلى تثبيت npm @cloudflare/sandbox"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9471b02867ec7ce8408663a85b140643486b04c00e055e44709b2e55e8316bfa","repoEtag":"W/\"d80154fd9ed8586078af8bf4b067aaef85c0af6b0931f4dceda13fbdd08d77f7\"","qualityScore":100}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('n8n-io/n8n/loom-transcript', 'official', 'n8n-io', 'n8n', 'n8n-io/n8n', 'loom-transcript', 175849, 55078, 100, '2026-02-23T01:04:43Z', '2026-02-23T01:08:23.301Z', 'f9a0e0f8348bf0c2cf509916c84a3a00ab06f91b3230015620f11e3a530ecdca', '{"id":"n8n-io/n8n/loom-transcript","name":"loom-transcript","description":{"zh":"Loom Transcript Fetcher是一个AI智能代理，用于获取Loom视频的完整转录。它使用Loom的GraphQL API来解析Loom URL并提取视频ID","ja":"Loom Transcript Fetcherは、Loomビデオの完全なトランスクリプトを取得するためのAIエージェントです。LoomのGraphQL APIを使用してLoom URLを解析し、ビデオIDを抽出します","ko":"Loom 전사 가져오기는 Loom 비디오의 완전한 전사를 가져오는 AI 에이전트입니다. Loom의 GraphQL API를 사용하여 Loom URL을 해석하고 비디오 ID를 추출합니다","es":"El Loom Transcript Fetcher es una herramienta de Inteligencia Artificial que extrae la transcripción de un video de Loom","fr":"L''outil Loom Transcript Fetcher est un outil d''Intelligence Artificielle qui extrait la transcription d''une vidéo Loom","de":"Der Loom-Transkript-Fetcher ist ein KI-Tool, das die Transkription eines Loom-Videos extrahiert","pt":"A ferramenta de transcrição Loom é uma solução de automação que usa a API do Loom para fornecer transcrições de vídeo.","ru":"ИИ Агент для Loom - это решение для автоматизации, которое использует API Loom для предоставления транскрипций видео.","ar":"أداة نقل نص فيديو لوم هي حل تلقائي يستخدم واجهة برمجة تطبيقات لوم لتقديم نسخة مكتوبة من الفيديوهات.","en":"Fetch and display the full transcript from a Loom video URL. Use when the user wants to get or read a Loom transcript."},"owner":"n8n-io","repo":"n8n","repoPath":"n8n-io/n8n","stars":175849,"forks":55078,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T01:04:43Z","topics":["ai","apis","automation","cli","data-flow","development","integration-framework","integrations","ipaas","low-code","low-code-platform","mcp","mcp-client","mcp-server","n8n","no-code","self-hosted","typescript","workflow","workflow-automation"],"skillMd":{"name":"loom-transcript","description":"Fetch and display the full transcript from a Loom video URL. Use when the user wants to get or read a Loom transcript.","bodyPreview":"# Loom Transcript Fetcher\n\nFetch the transcript from a Loom video using Loom''s GraphQL API.\n\n## Instructions\n\nGiven the Loom URL: $ARGUMENTS\n\n### 1. Extract the Video ID\n\nParse the Loom URL to extract the 32-character hex video ID. Supported URL formats:\n- `https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>`\n- `https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id>`\n- `https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id>`\n\nThe video ID is the 32-character hex string after `/share/` or `/embed/`.\n\n### 2. Fetch Video Metadat","body":"# Loom Transcript Fetcher\n\nFetch the transcript from a Loom video using Loom''s GraphQL API.\n\n## Instructions\n\nGiven the Loom URL: $ARGUMENTS\n\n### 1. Extract the Video ID\n\nParse the Loom URL to extract the 32-character hex video ID. Supported URL formats:\n- `https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>`\n- `https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id>`\n- `https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id>`\n\nThe video ID is the 32-character hex string after `/share/` or `/embed/`.\n\n### 2. Fetch Video Metadata\n\nUse the `WebFetch` tool to POST to `https://www.loom.com/graphql` to get the video title and details.\n\nUse this curl command via Bash:\n\n```bash\ncurl -s ''https://www.loom.com/graphql'' \\\n  -H ''Content-Type: application/json'' \\\n  -H ''Accept: application/json'' \\\n  -H ''x-loom-request-source: loom_web_45a5bd4'' \\\n  -H ''apollographql-client-name: web'' \\\n  -H ''apollographql-client-version: 45a5bd4'' \\\n  -d ''{\n    \"operationName\": \"GetVideoSSR\",\n    \"variables\": {\"id\": \"<VIDEO_ID>\", \"password\": null},\n    \"query\": \"query GetVideoSSR($id: ID!, $password: String) { getVideo(id: $id, password: $password) { ... on RegularUserVideo { id name description createdAt owner { display_name } } } }\"\n  }''\n```\n\n### 3. Fetch the Transcript URLs\n\nUse curl via Bash to call the GraphQL API:\n\n```bash\ncurl -s ''https://www.loom.com/graphql'' \\\n  -H ''Content-Type: application/json'' \\\n  -H ''Accept: application/json'' \\\n  -H ''x-loom-request-source: loom_web_45a5bd4'' \\\n  -H ''apollographql-client-name: web'' \\\n  -H ''apollographql-client-version: 45a5bd4'' \\\n  -d ''{\n    \"operationName\": \"FetchVideoTranscript\",\n    \"variables\": {\"videoId\": \"<VIDEO_ID>\", \"password\": null},\n    \"query\": \"query FetchVideoTranscript($videoId: ID!, $password: String) { fetchVideoTranscript(videoId: $videoId, password: $password) { ... on VideoTranscriptDetails { id video_id source_url captions_source_url } ... on GenericError { message } } }\"\n  }''\n```\n\nReplace `<VIDEO_ID>` with the actual video ID extracted in step 1.\n\nThe response contains:\n- `source_url` — JSON transcript URL\n- `captions_source_url` — VTT (WebVTT) captions URL\n\n### 4. Download and Parse the Transcript\n\nFetch **both** URLs returned from step 3 (if available):\n\n1. **VTT captions** (`captions_source_url`): Download with `curl -sL \"<url>\"`. This is a WebVTT file with timestamps and text.\n2. **JSON transcript** (`source_url`): Download with `curl -sL \"<url>\"`. This is a JSON file with transcript segments.\n\nPrefer the VTT captions as the primary source since they include proper timestamps. Fall back to the JSON transcript if VTT is unavailable.\n\n### 5. Present the Transcript\n\nFormat and present the full transcript to the user:\n\n**Video:** [Title from metadata]\n**Author:** [Owner name]\n**Date:** [Created date]\n\n---\n\n**0:00** - First transcript segment text...\n\n**0:14** - Second transcript segment text...\n\n(continue for all segments)\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- If the GraphQL response contains a `GenericError`, report the error message to the user.\n- If both `source_url` and `captions_source_url` are null/missing, tell the user that no transcript is available for this video.\n- If the video URL is invalid or the ID cannot be extracted, ask the user for a valid Loom URL.\n\n## Notes\n\n- No authentication or cookies are required — Loom''s transcript API is publicly accessible.\n- Only English transcripts are available through this API.\n- Transcripts are auto-generated and may contain minor errors."},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:08:23.301Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理 - Loom Transcript Fetcher","ja":"AIエージェント - Loom トラン스크リプト フェッチャー","ko":"AI 에이전트 - Loom 전사 가져오기","es":"Herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial: Loom Transcript ...","fr":"Outils d''Intelligence Artificielle: Loom Transcript Fetcher","de":"KI-Tools: Loom-Transkript-Fetcher","pt":"Ferramenta de Transcrição Loom: Ferramenta de AI para Des...","ru":"ИИ Агент для Loom: Расширение для автоматизации транскрипции","ar":"أداة نقل نص فيديو لوم: أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لل مطورين","en":"loom-transcript"},"description":{"zh":"Loom Transcript Fetcher是一个AI智能代理，用于获取Loom视频的完整转录。它使用Loom的GraphQL API来解析Loom URL并提取视频ID","ja":"Loom Transcript Fetcherは、Loomビデオの完全なトランスクリプトを取得するためのAIエージェントです。LoomのGraphQL APIを使用してLoom URLを解析し、ビデオIDを抽出します","ko":"Loom 전사 가져오기는 Loom 비디오의 완전한 전사를 가져오는 AI 에이전트입니다. Loom의 GraphQL API를 사용하여 Loom URL을 해석하고 비디오 ID를 추출합니다","es":"El Loom Transcript Fetcher es una herramienta de Inteligencia Artificial que extrae la transcripción de un video de Loom","fr":"L''outil Loom Transcript Fetcher est un outil d''Intelligence Artificielle qui extrait la transcription d''une vidéo Loom","de":"Der Loom-Transkript-Fetcher ist ein KI-Tool, das die Transkription eines Loom-Videos extrahiert","pt":"A ferramenta de transcrição Loom é uma solução de automação que usa a API do Loom para fornecer transcrições de vídeo.","ru":"ИИ Агент для Loom - это решение для автоматизации, которое использует API Loom для предоставления транскрипций видео.","ar":"أداة نقل نص فيديو لوم هي حل تلقائي يستخدم واجهة برمجة تطبيقات لوم لتقديم نسخة مكتوبة من الفيديوهات.","en":"Fetch and display the full transcript from a Loom video URL. Use when the user wants to get or read a Loom transcript."},"definition":{"en":"Fetch and display the full transcript from a Loom video URL. Use when the user wants to get or read a Loom transcript."},"features":{"zh":["使用Loom的GraphQL API获取视频转录","支持多种Loom URL格式","解析Loom URL以提取视频ID","使用TypeScript和CLI进行开发","集成到低代码平台和工作流自动化中"],"ja":["LoomのGraphQL APIを使用してビデオのトランスクリプトを取得","複数のLoom URL形式をサポート","Loom URLを解析してビデオIDを抽出","TypeScriptとCLIを使用して開発","低コードプラットフォームとワークフロー自動化に統合"],"ko":["Loom의 GraphQL API를 사용하여 비디오의 전사를 가져옵니다","複数의 Loom URL 형식을 지원합니다","Loom URL을 해석하여 비디오 ID를 추출합니다","TypeScript와 CLI를 사용하여 개발합니다","低코드 플랫폼과 워크플로 자동화에 통합합니다"],"es":["Extracción de la transcripción de un video de Loom","Uso de la API de GraphQL de Loom","Compatibilidad con múltiples formatos de URL","Implementación en TypeScript","Integración con plataformas de automatización de flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Extraction de la transcription d''une vidéo Loom","Utilisation de l''API GraphQL de Loom","Compatibilité avec plusieurs formats d''URL","Implémentation en TypeScript","Intégration avec des plateformes d''automatisation de flux de travail"],"de":["Extraktion der Transkription eines Loom-Videos","Verwendung der Loom-GraphQL-API","Kompatibilität mit mehreren URL-Formaten","Implementierung in TypeScript","Integration mit Workflow-Automatisierungsplattformen"],"pt":["Extração de ID de vídeo a partir de URL do Loom","Uso da API do Loom para obter metadados de vídeo","Suporte a vários formatos de URL do Loom","Integração com plataformas de automação de fluxo de trabalho","Código aberto e personalizável"],"ru":["Извлечение идентификатора видео из URL Loom","Использование API Loom для получения метаданных видео","Поддержка нескольких форматов URL Loom","Интеграция с платформами автоматизации рабочего процесса","Открытый исходный код и настраиваемый"],"ar":["استخراج معرف الفيديو من عنوان URL لوم","استخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات لوم للحصول على بيانات الفيديو","دعم عدة صيغ لعنوان URL لوم","التكامل مع منصات تلقائية لتدفق العمل","مفتوح المصدر وقابل للتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Loom转录","GraphQL API","TypeScript","CLI","低代码平台","工作流自动化","开发工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Loomトランスクリプト","GraphQL API","TypeScript","CLI","低コードプラットフォーム","ワークフロー自動化","開発ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Loom 전사","GraphQL API","TypeScript","CLI","低코드 플랫폼","워크플로 자동화","개발 도구"],"es":["Herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial","Loom Transcript Fetcher","API de GraphQL de Loom","Automatización de flujo de trabajo","Desarrollo de software","Integración de APIs","TypeScript"],"fr":["Outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","Loom Transcript Fetcher","API GraphQL de Loom","Automatisation de flux de travail","Développement de logiciels","Intégration d''API","TypeScript"],"de":["KI-Tools","Loom-Transkript-Fetcher","Loom-GraphQL-API","Workflow-Automatisierung","Software-Entwicklung","API-Integration","TypeScript"],"pt":["ferramenta de transcrição Loom","automação de transcrição","API do Loom","desenvolvimento de software","plataformas de automação de fluxo de trabalho","código aberto","desenvolvedores","ferramentas de AI"],"ru":["ИИ Агент для Loom","автоматизация транскрипции","API Loom","разработка программного обеспечения","платформы автоматизации рабочего процесса","открытый исходный код","разработчики","инструменты ИИ"],"ar":["أداة نقل نص فيديو لوم","توفير وقت نقل النص","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات لوم","تطوير البرمجيات","منصات تلقائية لتدفق العمل","مفتوح المصدر","مطورون","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing automated transcript fetching from Loom videos.","zh":"非常适合需要从 Loom 视频中自动获取转录文本的语言代理。","ja":"Loom ビデオから自動で転記テキストを取得する必要がある言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Loom 비디오에서 자동으로 자막을 가져오는 언어 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan una recuperación automática de transcripciones de videos de Loom.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de langage ayant besoin d''une récupération automatique de transcripts de vidéos Loom.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die eine automatisierte Transkriptabruf von Loom-Videos benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agents de Linguagem que necessitam de busca automatizada de transcrições de vídeos do Loom.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов языка, которым требуется автоматизированная загрузка транскриптов видео Loom.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى استرجاع النصوص المتواصلة التلقائي من مقاطع فيديو Loom."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch and display full transcripts from Loom videos using Loom''s GraphQL API, supporting various URL formats and extracting 32-character hex video IDs for seamless integration.","zh":"通过使用 Loom 的 GraphQL API，使代理能够从 Loom 视频中获取和显示完整的转录文本，支持各种 URL 格式，并提取 32 个字符的十六进制视频 ID，以实现无缝集成。","ja":"Loom の GraphQL API を使用して、エージェントが Loom ビデオから転記テキストを取得して表示できるようにし、様々な URL フォーマットをサポートし、32 文字の 16 進数のビデオ ID を抽出してシームレスな統合を可能にします。","ko":"Loom의 GraphQL API를 사용하여 에이전트가 Loom 비디오에서 전체 자막을 가져오고 표시할 수 있도록 하며, 다양한 URL 형식과 32개의 16진수 비디오 ID를 추출하여 무결점 통합을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recuperar y mostrar transcripciones completas de videos de Loom utilizando la API de GraphQL de Loom, que admite varios formatos de URL y extrae identificadores de video hex de 32 caracteres para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer et d''afficher des transcripts complets de vidéos Loom en utilisant l''API GraphQL de Loom, prenant en charge divers formats d''URL et extrayant des ID de vidéo hex de 32 caractères pour une intégration sans accroc.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, vollständige Transkripte von Loom-Videos mithilfe der Loom-GraphQL-API abzurufen und anzuzeigen, die verschiedene URL-Formate unterstützt und 32-stellige Hex-Video-IDs für eine nahtlose Integration extrahiert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar e exibir transcrições completas de vídeos do Loom usando a API do GraphQL do Loom, suportando vários formatos de URL e extraíndo IDs de vídeo hexadecimais de 32 caracteres para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам загружать и отображать полные транскрипты видео Loom, используя API GraphQL Loom, поддерживая различные форматы URL и извлекая 32-символьные шестнадцатеричные идентификаторы видео для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استرجاع وعرض النصوص الكاملة لمقاطع فيديو Loom باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Loom GraphQL، مع دعم لتنسيقات URL متعددة واستخراج معرفات الفيديو السداسية عشرية البالغ طولها 32 حرفًا لتكامل سلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Fetching transcripts for video analysis","Automating subtitle generation for Loom videos","Extracting video metadata for content indexing"],"zh":["用于视频分析的转录文本获取","自动为 Loom 视频生成字幕","用于内容索引的视频元数据提取"],"ja":["ビデオ分析のための転記テキストの取得","Loom ビデオの自動字幕生成","コンテンツインデックスのためのビデオメタデータの抽出"],"ko":["비디오 분석을 위한 자막 가져오기","Loom 비디오의 자동 자막 생성","콘텐츠 인덱싱을 위한 비디오 메타데이터 추출"],"es":["Recuperación de transcripciones para análisis de video","Automatización de la generación de subtítulos para videos de Loom","Extracción de metadatos de video para indexación de contenido"],"fr":["Récupération de transcripts pour analyse de vidéo","Automatisation de la génération de sous-titres pour les vidéos Loom","Extraction de métadonnées de vidéo pour indexation de contenu"],"de":["Abruf von Transkripten für VideAnalysen","Automatisierung der Erstellung von Untertiteln für Loom-Videos","Extraktion von Videometadaten für Inhaltsindexierung"],"pt":["Busca de transcrições para análise de vídeo","Geração automatizada de legendas para vídeos do Loom","Extração de metadados de vídeo para indexação de conteúdo"],"ru":["Получение транскриптов для анализа видео","Автоматизированное создание субтитров для видео Loom","Извлечение метаданных видео для индексации контента"],"ar":["استرجاع النصوص المتواصلة لتحليل الفيديو","توليد تلقائي للتعليقات التوضيحية لمقاطع فيديو Loom","استخراج بيانات الفيديو الوصفية لفهارس المحتوى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Loom video URL","Supported URL formats limited to https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>, https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id>, and https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id>"],"zh":["需要 Loom 视频 URL","支持的 URL 格式仅限于 https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>、https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id> 和 https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id>"],"ja":["Loom ビデオ URL が必要","サポートされる URL フォーマットは https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>、https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id>、https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id> に限定される"],"ko":["Loom 비디오 URL이 필요함","지원되는 URL 형식은 https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>, https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id>, https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id>로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la URL del video de Loom","Los formatos de URL admitidos están limitados a https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>, https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id> y https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id>"],"fr":["Nécessite l''URL de la vidéo Loom","Les formats d''URL pris en charge sont limités à https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>, https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id> et https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id>"],"de":["Erfordert die URL des Loom-Videos","Die unterstützten URL-Formate sind auf https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>, https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id> und https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id> beschränkt"],"pt":["Requer URL do vídeo do Loom","Formatos de URL suportados limitados a https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>, https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id>, e https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id>"],"ru":["Требуется URL-адрес видео Loom","Поддерживаемые форматы URL ограничены https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>, https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id>, и https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id>"],"ar":["يتطلب عنوان URL لمقطع فيديو Loom","تنسيقات URL المدعومة مقيدة بـ https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>، https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id>، و https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id>"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f9a0e0f8348bf0c2cf509916c84a3a00ab06f91b3230015620f11e3a530ecdca","repoEtag":"W/\"c9bf7d69bd9456481a6d829fb06e531593d80bebb362a350a33cb22d496cf4f0\"","qualityScore":100}');
