ransformación de ideas de UI vagas en prompts optimizados","Mejora de la especificidad y la generación de resultados","Incorporación de palabras clave de UI/UX","Inyección de contexto de sistema de diseño","Estructuración de la salida para mejores resultados"],"fr":["Transformation d''idées d''UI vagues en prompts optimisés","Amélioration de la spécificité et de la génération de résultats","Intégration de mots-clés d''UI/UX","Injection de contexte de système de conception","Structuration de la sortie pour de meilleurs résultats"],"de":["Transformation von vagen UI-Ideen in optimierte Prompts","Verbesserung der Spezifität und der Ergebnisgenerierung","Einbindung von UI/UX-Schlüsselwörtern","Einspeisung von Design-System-Kontext","Strukturierung der Ausgabe für bessere Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Transformação de ideias de UI vagas em prompts otimizados","Melhoria da especificidade dos prompts","Adição de palavras-chave de UI/UX","Injeção de contexto de design system","Estruturação de saída para melhores resultados de geração"],"ru":["Преобразование нечетких идей UI в оптимизированные промпты","Улучшение специфики промптов","Добавление ключевых слов UI/UX","Внедрение контекста системы дизайна","Структуризация вывода для лучших результатов генерации"],"ar":["تحويل الأفكار غير الدقيقة لUI إلى دفعات محسنة","تحسين الدقة لدفعات","إضافة كلمات مفتاحية لUI/UX","إضافة سياق نظام التصميم","هيكلة الإخراج للحصول على أفضل نتائج للгенерации"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","增强提示引擎","UI生成","Stitch","优化","提示","AI开发","UI/UX设计"],"ja":["AIエージェント","プロンプト最適化","UI生成","Stitch","最適化","プロンプト","AI開発","UI/UXデザイン"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","프롬프트 최적화","UI 생성","스티치","최적화","프롬프트","AI 개발","UI/UX 디자인"],"es":["herramientas AI","Stitch","prompts optimizados","UI/UX","diseño de sistema","generación de resultados","especificidad","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de prompts"],"fr":["outils IA","Stitch","prompts optimisés","UI/UX","conception de système","génération de résultats","spécificité","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de prompts"],"de":["KI-Tools","Stitch","optimierte Prompts","UI/UX","Design-System","Ergebnisgenerierung","Spezifität","Software-Entwicklung","Prompt-Engineering"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","enhance-prompt","stitch","ui","ux","prompts otimizados","desenvolvimento de software","ia para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["ии агенты","enhance-prompt","stitch","ui","ux","оптимизированные промпты","разработка программного обеспечения","ии для разработчиков"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","enhance-prompt","stitch","ui","ux","دفعات محسنة","تطوير البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"google-labs-code","repo":"stitch-skills","repoPath":"google-labs-code/stitch-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T06:56:35.386Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"enhance-prompt","description":"Transforms vague UI ideas into polished, Stitch-optimized prompts. Enhances specificity, adds UI/UX keywords, injects design system context, and structures output for better generation results.","bodyPreview":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the pat","body":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the patterns in this skill.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate when a user wants to:\n- Polish a UI prompt before sending to Stitch\n- Improve a prompt that produced poor results\n- Add design system consistency to a simple idea\n- Structure a vague concept into an actionable prompt\n\n## Enhancement Pipeline\n\nFollow these steps to enhance any prompt:\n\n### Step 1: Assess the Input\n\nEvaluate what''s missing from the user''s prompt:\n\n| Element | Check for | If missing... |\n|---------|-----------|---------------|\n| **Platform** | \"web\", \"mobile\", \"desktop\" | Add based on context or ask |\n| **Page type** | \"landing page\", \"dashboard\", \"form\" | Infer from description |\n| **Structure** | Numbered sections/components | Create logical page structure |\n| **Visual style** | Adjectives, mood, vibe | Add appropriate descriptors |\n| **Colors** | Specific values or roles | Add design system or suggest |\n| **Components** | UI-specific terms | Translate to proper keywords |\n\n### Step 2: Check for DESIGN.md\n\nLook for a `DESIGN.md` file in the current project:\n\n**If DESIGN.md exists:**\n1. Read the file to extract the design system block\n2. Include the color palette, typography, and component styles\n3. Format as a \"DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED)\" section in the output\n\n**If DESIGN.md does not exist:**\n1. Add this note at the end of the enhanced prompt:\n\n```\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill. This ensures all generated pages share the \nsame visual language.\n```\n\n### Step 3: Apply Enhancements\n\nTransform the input using these techniques:\n\n#### A. Add UI/UX Keywords\n\nReplace vague terms with specific component names:\n\n| Vague | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"menu at the top\" | \"navigation bar with logo and menu items\" |\n| \"button\" | \"primary call-to-action button\" |\n| \"list of items\" | \"card grid layout\" or \"vertical list with thumbnails\" |\n| \"form\" | \"form with labeled input fields and submit button\" |\n| \"picture area\" | \"hero section with full-width image\" |\n\n#### B. Amplify the Vibe\n\nAdd descriptive adjectives to set the mood:\n\n| Basic | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"modern\" | \"clean, minimal, with generous whitespace\" |\n| \"professional\" | \"sophisticated, trustworthy, with subtle shadows\" |\n| \"fun\" | \"vibrant, playful, with rounded corners and bold colors\" |\n| \"dark mode\" | \"dark theme with high-contrast accents on deep backgrounds\" |\n\n#### C. Structure the Page\n\nOrganize content into numbered sections:\n\n```markdown\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Navigation with logo and menu items\n2. **Hero Section:** Headline, subtext, and primary CTA\n3. **Content Area:** [Describe the main content]\n4. **Footer:** Links, social icons, copyright\n```\n\n#### D. Format Colors Properly\n\nWhen colors are mentioned, format them as:\n```\nDescriptive Name (#hexcode) for functional role\n```\n\nExamples:\n- \"Deep Ocean Blue (#1a365d) for primary buttons and links\"\n- \"Warm Cream (#faf5f0) for page background\"\n- \"Soft Gray (#6b7280) for secondary text\"\n\n### Step 4: Format the Output\n\nStructure the enhanced prompt in this order:\n\n```markdown\n[One-line description of the page purpose and vibe]\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: [Web/Mobile], [Desktop/Mobile]-first\n- Theme: [Light/Dark], [style descriptors]\n- Background: [Color description] (#hex)\n- Primary Accent: [Color description] (#hex) for [role]\n- Text Primary: [Color description] (#hex)\n- [Additional design tokens...]\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **[Section]:** [Description]\n2. **[Section]:** [Description]\n...\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n**Default:** Return the enhanced prompt as text for the user to copy.\n\n**Optional file output:** If the user requests, write to a file:\n- `next-prompt.md` — for use with the `stitch-loop` skill\n- Custom filename specified by user\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Vague Input → Structured Prompt\n\n**User input:**\n> \"make me a login page\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nA clean, trustworthy login page with a centered form and subtle branding.\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: Web, Desktop-first\n- Theme: Light, minimal, professional\n- Background: Clean White (#ffffff)\n- Surface: Soft Gray (#f9fafb) for form card\n- Primary Accent: Deep Blue (#2563eb) for submit button and links\n- Text Primary: Near Black (#111827) for headings\n- Text Secondary: Medium Gray (#6b7280) for labels\n- Buttons: Subtly rounded (8px), full-width on form\n- Cards: Gently rounded (12px), soft shadow for elevation\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Minimal logo, centered\n2. **Login Card:** Centered form with email, password fields, \"Forgot password?\" link\n3. **Submit Button:** Primary blue \"Sign In\" button\n4. **Footer:** \"Don''t have an account? Sign up\" link\n\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill.\n```\n\n### Example 2: Feature Request → Targeted Edit\n\n**User input:**\n> \"add a search bar\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nAdd a search bar to the header navigation.\n\n**Specific changes:**\n- Location: Header, right side before user avatar\n- Style: Pill-shaped input with subtle gray background (#f3f4f6)\n- Icon: Magnifying glass icon on the left, inside the input\n- Placeholder: \"Search...\" in light gray (#9ca3af)\n- Behavior: Expands on focus with subtle shadow\n- Width: 240px default, 320px on focus\n\n**Context:** This is a targeted edit. Make only this change while preserving all existing elements.\n```\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n1. **Be specific early** — Vague inputs need more enhancement\n2. **Match the user''s intent** — Don''t over-design if they want simple\n3. **Keep it structured** — Numbered sections help Stitch understand hierarchy\n4. **Include the design system** — Consistency is key for multi-page projects\n5. **One change at a time for edits** — Don''t bundle unrelated changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-23T07:25:23.710Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing to refine vague UI ideas into optimized prompts for Stitch.","zh":"非常适合需要完善模糊 UI 思想转化为针对 Stitch 优化的提示的语言代理","ja":"Stitch に最適化されたプロンプトを生成するために、漠然とした UI アイデアを洗練する必要がある言語エージェントに最適","ko":"Stitch를 위한 최적의 프롬프트를 생성하기 위해 모호한 UI 아이디어를 정교화해야 하는 언어 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan refinar ideas de interfaz de usuario vagas en prompts optimizados para Stitch.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage ayant besoin d''affiner des idées d''interface utilisateur vagues en prompts optimisés pour Stitch.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die vage Benutzeroberflächenideen in optimierte Prompts für Stitch verfeinern müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que precisam refinar ideias vagas de UI em prompts otimizados para o Stitch.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, которым необходимо усовершенствовать расплывчатые идеи интерфейса пользователя в оптимизированные подсказки для Stitch.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين الأفكار الغامضة لواجهة المستخدم إلى عبارات محفزة متقدمة لبرنامج Stitch."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform rough UI generation ideas into polished, Stitch-optimized prompts by enhancing specificity, adding UI/UX keywords, and injecting design system context, resulting in better generation results using the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide.","zh":"赋予代理转化粗糙的 UI 生成想法为精细的、针对 Stitch 优化的提示的能力，通过提高具体性、添加 UI/UX 关键字和注入设计系统上下文，使用 Stitch 有效提示指南，从而获得更好的生成结果","ja":"エージェントが、Stitch で最適化されたプロンプトを生成できるように、UI 生成のアイデアを洗練し、具体性を高め、UI/UX キーワードを追加し、デザイン システムのコンテキストを注入することで、Stitch 有効なプロンプト ガイドを使用して、より良い生成結果を得ることができる","ko":"에이전트가 조잡한 UI 생성 아이디어를 Stitch 최적화된 프롬프트로 변환하여 구체성을 높이고, UI/UX 키워드를 추가하며, 디자인 시스템 컨텍스트를 주입함으로써, Stitch 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드를 사용하여 더 나은 생성 결과를 얻을 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar ideas de generación de interfaz de usuario poco definidas en prompts pulidos y optimizados para Stitch, mejorando la especificidad, agregando palabras clave de UI/UX y contextualizando el sistema de diseño, lo que resulta en mejores resultados de generación utilizando la Guía de Prompts Efectivos de Stitch.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des idées de génération d''interface utilisateur peu définies en prompts polis et optimisés pour Stitch, en améliorant la spécificité, en ajoutant des mots clés UI/UX et en contextualisant le système de conception, ce qui aboutit à de meilleurs résultats de génération en utilisant le Guide de prompts efficaces de Stitch.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, vage Benutzeroberflächengenerierungs-Ideen in polierte und optimierte Prompts für Stitch zu verwandeln, indem die Spezifität verbessert, UI/UX-Schlüsselwörter hinzugefügt und der Designsystenkontext injiziert wird, was zu besseren Generierungs-Ergebnissen unter Verwendung des Stitch-Effektiven-Prompts-Leitfadens führt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar ideias de geração de UI grosseiras em prompts polidos e otimizados para o Stitch, melhorando a especificidade, adicionando palavras-chave de UI/UX e injetando contexto do sistema de design, resultando em melhores resultados de geração usando o Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовать грубые идеи генерации интерфейса пользователя в отполированные и оптимизированные для Stitch подсказки, повышая специфичность, добавляя ключевые слова интерфейса пользователя и пользовательского опыта, и вводя контекст системы дизайна, что приводит к лучшим результатам генерации с помощью Руководства по эффективному_prompting от Stitch.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تحويل الأفكار الخشنة لتوليد واجهة المستخدم إلى عبارات محفزة متقدمة وملائمة لبرنامج Stitch من خلال تحسين الدقة وإضافة كلمات مفتاحية لواجهة المستخدم وخبرة المستخدم وإضافة سياق نظام التصميم، مما يؤدي إلى نتائج جيدة لعمليات التوليد باستخدام دليل الاشارات الفعالة من برنامج Stitch."},"useCases":{"en":["Enhancing vague UI ideas for better Stitch generation results","Adding UI/UX keywords to prompts for improved specificity","Structuring prompts for optimal performance with Stitch''s design system context"],"zh":["提高模糊 UI 思想以获得更好的 Stitch 生成结果","添加 UI/UX 关键字到提示以提高具体性","使用 Stitch 的设计系统上下文结构化提示以获得最佳性能"],"ja":["Stitch 生成結果の向上のため、漠然とした UI アイデアを強化する","プロンプトに UI/UX キーワードを追加して具体性を高める","Stitch のデザイン システム コンテキストでプロンプトを構造化して最適なパフォーマンスを実現する"],"ko":["Stitch 생성 결과를 개선하기 위해 모호한 UI 아이디어를 강화","프롬프트에 UI/UX 키워드를 추가하여 구체성을 높임","Stitch의 디자인 시스템 컨텍스트로 프롬프트를 구조화하여 최적의 성능을 달성"],"es":["Mejorar ideas de interfaz de usuario vagas para mejores resultados de generación de Stitch","Agregar palabras clave de UI/UX a los prompts para mejorar la especificidad","Estructurar los prompts para un rendimiento óptimo con el contexto del sistema de diseño de Stitch"],"fr":["Améliorer les idées d''interface utilisateur vagues pour de meilleurs résultats de génération de Stitch","Ajouter des mots clés UI/UX aux prompts pour améliorer la spécificité","Structurer les prompts pour une performance optimale avec le contexte du système de conception de Stitch"],"de":["Verbesserung vager Benutzeroberflächenideen für bessere Stitch-Generierungs-Ergebnisse","Hinzufügen von UI/UX-Schlüsselwörtern zu Prompts zur Verbesserung der Spezifität","Strukturieren von Prompts für optimale Leistung mit dem Designsystenkontext von Stitch"],"pt":["Melhorar ideias vagas de UI para melhores resultados de geração do Stitch","Adicionar palavras-chave de UI/UX a prompts para melhorar a especificidade","Estruturar prompts para desempenho ótimo com o contexto do sistema de design do Stitch"],"ru":["Усовершенствовать расплывчатые идеи интерфейса пользователя для лучших результатов генерации Stitch","Добавить ключевые слова интерфейса пользователя и пользовательского опыта к подсказкам для повышения специфичности","Структурировать подсказки для оптимальной производительности с контекстом системы дизайна Stitch"],"ar":["تحسين الأفكار الغامضة لواجهة المستخدم لتحقيق نتائج جيدة لبرنامج Stitch","إضافة كلمات مفتاحية لواجهة المستخدم وخبرة المستخدم إلى العبارات المحفزة لتحسين الدقة","هيكلة العبارات المحفزة لأداء مثالي مع سياق نظام التصميم لبرنامج Stitch"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consultation of the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices","Stitch-specific, may not be compatible with other UI generation tools"],"zh":["需要参考官方的 Stitch 文档以获取最新的最佳实践","特定于 Stitch，可能与其他 UI 生成工具不兼容"],"ja":["最新のベスト プラクティスを得るために、公式の Stitch ドキュメントを参照する必要がある","Stitch 専用であり、他の UI 生成ツールとの互換性がない可能性がある"],"ko":["최신의 최선의 관행을 얻기 위해 공식 Stitch 문서를 참조해야 함","Stitch 전용이므로, 다른 UI 생성 도구와의 호환성이 없을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la consulta de la documentación oficial de Stitch para las últimas mejores prácticas","Específico de Stitch, puede no ser compatible con otras herramientas de generación de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite la consultation de la documentation officielle de Stitch pour les dernières bonnes pratiques","Spécifique à Stitch, peut ne pas être compatible avec d''autres outils de génération d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Erfordert die Konsultation der offiziellen Stitch-Dokumentation für die neuesten Best-Practices","Stitch-spezifisch, kann möglicherweise nicht mit anderen Benutzeroberflächen-Generierungstools kompatibel sein"],"pt":["Requer consulta da documentação oficial do Stitch para as melhores práticas atuais","Específico do Stitch, pode não ser compatível com outras ferramentas de geração de UI"],"ru":["Требует консультации официальной документации Stitch для получения последних рекомендаций","Специфичен для Stitch, может быть несовместим с другими инструментами генерации интерфейса пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب استشارة الوثائق الرسمية لبرنامج Stitch للحصول على أفضل الممارسات الحالية","محدد لبرنامج Stitch، قد لا يكون متوافقًا مع أدوات توليد واجهة المستخدم الأخرى"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ccb200c798072438b642b1fa6a5c515563159e2fab3d56e813d76d8afa9a7ce6","qualityScore":95}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('obra/superpowers/subagent-driven-development', 'official', 'obra', 'superpowers', 'obra/superpowers', 'subagent-driven-development', 59922, 4566, 95, '2026-02-24T12:02:25Z', '2026-02-24T12:04:15.733Z', '994b89a5d294eadd6a1611edb51377bac748d5f5fb7f4139d3c736b616b3a46a', '{"id":"obra/superpowers/subagent-driven-development","name":"subagent-driven-development","description":{"zh":"子代理驱动开发是一种使用独立任务的实现计划执行方法，通过两阶段审查确保高质量和快速迭代","ja":"サブエージェント駆動開発は、独立したタスクを持つ実装計画を実行する方法で、2段階のレビューを通じて高品質と迅速な反復を実現します","ko":"서브 에이전트 주도 개발은 독립적인 태스크를 사용하는 구현 계획을 실행하는 방법으로, 2단계의 검토를 통해 높은 품질과 빠른 반복을 실현합니다","es":"El desarrollo impulsado por subagentes es una técnica que utiliza subagentes para ejecutar planes de implementación con tareas independientes y revisiones de dos etapas","fr":"Le développement piloté par sous-agent est une technique qui utilise des sous-agents pour exécuter des plans de mise en œuvre avec des tâches indépendantes et des revues en deux étapes","de":"Die subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung ist eine Technik, die Subagenten zur Ausführung von Implementierungsplänen mit unabhängigen Aufgaben und zweistufigen Überprüfungen verwendet","pt":"O desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes é uma abordagem que executa planos por meio da criação de subagentes frescos para cada tarefa, com revisão em duas etapas","ru":"Подагент-ориентированное развитие - это подход, который выполняет планы путем создания свежих подагентов для каждой задачи, с двухэтапным обзором","ar":"التطوير الموجه بواسطة الوكلاء الفرعيين هو نهج يُنفّذ الخطط من خلال إنشاء وكلاء فرعيين mớiین لكل مهمة، مع استعراض على مرحلتين","en":"Use when executing implementation plans with independent tasks in the current session"},"owner":"obra","repo":"superpowers","repoPath":"obra/superpowers","stars":59922,"forks":4566,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:25Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"subagent-driven-development","description":"Use when executing implementation plans with independent tasks in the current session","bodyPreview":"# Subagent-Driven Development\n\nExecute plan by dispatching fresh subagent per task, with two-stage review after each: spec compliance review first, then code quality review.\n\n**Core principle:** Fresh subagent per task + two-stage review (spec then quality) = high quality, fast iteration\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Have implementation plan?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Tasks mostly independent?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Stay in this session?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"subagent-driven-d","body":"# Subagent-Driven Development\n\nExecute plan by dispatching fresh subagent per task, with two-stage review after each: spec compliance review first, then code quality review.\n\n**Core principle:** Fresh subagent per task + two-stage review (spec then quality) = high quality, fast iteration\n\n## When to Use\n\n```dot\ndigraph when_to_use {\n    \"Have implementation plan?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Tasks mostly independent?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Stay in this session?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"subagent-driven-development\" [shape=box];\n    \"executing-plans\" [shape=box];\n    \"Manual execution or brainstorm first\" [shape=box];\n\n    \"Have implementation plan?\" -> \"Tasks mostly independent?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Have implementation plan?\" -> \"Manual execution or brainstorm first\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Tasks mostly independent?\" -> \"Stay in this session?\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Tasks mostly independent?\" -> \"Manual execution or brainstorm first\" [label=\"no - tightly coupled\"];\n    \"Stay in this session?\" -> \"subagent-driven-development\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Stay in this session?\" -> \"executing-plans\" [label=\"no - parallel session\"];\n}\n```\n\n**vs. Executing Plans (parallel session):**\n- Same session (no context switch)\n- Fresh subagent per task (no context pollution)\n- Two-stage review after each task: spec compliance first, then code quality\n- Faster iteration (no human-in-loop between tasks)\n\n## The Process\n\n```dot\ndigraph process {\n    rankdir=TB;\n\n    subgraph cluster_per_task {\n        label=\"Per Task\";\n        \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\" [shape=box];\n        \"Implementer subagent asks questions?\" [shape=diamond];\n        \"Answer questions, provide context\" [shape=box];\n        \"Implementer subagent implements, tests, commits, self-reviews\" [shape=box];\n        \"Dispatch spec reviewer subagent (./spec-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [shape=box];\n        \"Spec reviewer subagent confirms code matches spec?\" [shape=diamond];\n        \"Implementer subagent fixes spec gaps\" [shape=box];\n        \"Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent (./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [shape=box];\n        \"Code quality reviewer subagent approves?\" [shape=diamond];\n        \"Implementer subagent fixes quality issues\" [shape=box];\n        \"Mark task complete in TodoWrite\" [shape=box];\n    }\n\n    \"Read plan, extract all tasks with full text, note context, create TodoWrite\" [shape=box];\n    \"More tasks remain?\" [shape=diamond];\n    \"Dispatch final code reviewer subagent for entire implementation\" [shape=box];\n    \"Use superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch\" [shape=box style=filled fillcolor=lightgreen];\n\n    \"Read plan, extract all tasks with full text, note context, create TodoWrite\" -> \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\";\n    \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\" -> \"Implementer subagent asks questions?\";\n    \"Implementer subagent asks questions?\" -> \"Answer questions, provide context\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Answer questions, provide context\" -> \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\";\n    \"Implementer subagent asks questions?\" -> \"Implementer subagent implements, tests, commits, self-reviews\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Implementer subagent implements, tests, commits, self-reviews\" -> \"Dispatch spec reviewer subagent (./spec-reviewer-prompt.md)\";\n    \"Dispatch spec reviewer subagent (./spec-reviewer-prompt.md)\" -> \"Spec reviewer subagent confirms code matches spec?\";\n    \"Spec reviewer subagent confirms code matches spec?\" -> \"Implementer subagent fixes spec gaps\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Implementer subagent fixes spec gaps\" -> \"Dispatch spec reviewer subagent (./spec-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [label=\"re-review\"];\n    \"Spec reviewer subagent confirms code matches spec?\" -> \"Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent (./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent (./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md)\" -> \"Code quality reviewer subagent approves?\";\n    \"Code quality reviewer subagent approves?\" -> \"Implementer subagent fixes quality issues\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Implementer subagent fixes quality issues\" -> \"Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent (./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md)\" [label=\"re-review\"];\n    \"Code quality reviewer subagent approves?\" -> \"Mark task complete in TodoWrite\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"Mark task complete in TodoWrite\" -> \"More tasks remain?\";\n    \"More tasks remain?\" -> \"Dispatch implementer subagent (./implementer-prompt.md)\" [label=\"yes\"];\n    \"More tasks remain?\" -> \"Dispatch final code reviewer subagent for entire implementation\" [label=\"no\"];\n    \"Dispatch final code reviewer subagent for entire implementation\" -> \"Use superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch\";\n}\n```\n\n## Prompt Templates\n\n- `./implementer-prompt.md` - Dispatch implementer subagent\n- `./spec-reviewer-prompt.md` - Dispatch spec compliance reviewer subagent\n- `./code-quality-reviewer-prompt.md` - Dispatch code quality reviewer subagent\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n```\nYou: I''m using Subagent-Driven Development to execute this plan.\n\n[Read plan file once: docs/plans/feature-plan.md]\n[Extract all 5 tasks with full text and context]\n[Create TodoWrite with all tasks]\n\nTask 1: Hook installation script\n\n[Get Task 1 text and context (already extracted)]\n[Dispatch implementation subagent with full task text + context]\n\nImplementer: \"Before I begin - should the hook be installed at user or system level?\"\n\nYou: \"User level (~/.config/superpowers/hooks/)\"\n\nImplementer: \"Got it. Implementing now...\"\n[Later] Implementer:\n  - Implemented install-hook command\n  - Added tests, 5/5 passing\n  - Self-review: Found I missed --force flag, added it\n  - Committed\n\n[Dispatch spec compliance reviewer]\nSpec reviewer: ✅ Spec compliant - all requirements met, nothing extra\n\n[Get git SHAs, dispatch code quality reviewer]\nCode reviewer: Strengths: Good test coverage, clean. Issues: None. Approved.\n\n[Mark Task 1 complete]\n\nTask 2: Recovery modes\n\n[Get Task 2 text and context (already extracted)]\n[Dispatch implementation subagent with full task text + context]\n\nImplementer: [No questions, proceeds]\nImplementer:\n  - Added verify/repair modes\n  - 8/8 tests passing\n  - Self-review: All good\n  - Committed\n\n[Dispatch spec compliance reviewer]\nSpec reviewer: ❌ Issues:\n  - Missing: Progress reporting (spec says \"report every 100 items\")\n  - Extra: Added --json flag (not requested)\n\n[Implementer fixes issues]\nImplementer: Removed --json flag, added progress reporting\n\n[Spec reviewer reviews again]\nSpec reviewer: ✅ Spec compliant now\n\n[Dispatch code quality reviewer]\nCode reviewer: Strengths: Solid. Issues (Important): Magic number (100)\n\n[Implementer fixes]\nImplementer: Extracted PROGRESS_INTERVAL constant\n\n[Code reviewer reviews again]\nCode reviewer: ✅ Approved\n\n[Mark Task 2 complete]\n\n...\n\n[After all tasks]\n[Dispatch final code-reviewer]\nFinal reviewer: All requirements met, ready to merge\n\nDone!\n```\n\n## Advantages\n\n**vs. Manual execution:**\n- Subagents follow TDD naturally\n- Fresh context per task (no confusion)\n- Parallel-safe (subagents don''t interfere)\n- Subagent can ask questions (before AND during work)\n\n**vs. Executing Plans:**\n- Same session (no handoff)\n- Continuous progress (no waiting)\n- Review checkpoints automatic\n\n**Efficiency gains:**\n- No file reading overhead (controller provides full text)\n- Controller curates exactly what context is needed\n- Subagent gets complete information upfront\n- Questions surfaced before work begins (not after)\n\n**Quality gates:**\n- Self-review catches issues before handoff\n- Two-stage review: spec compliance, then code quality\n- Review loops ensure fixes actually work\n- Spec compliance prevents over/under-building\n- Code quality ensures implementation is well-built\n\n**Cost:**\n- More subagent invocations (implementer + 2 reviewers per task)\n- Controller does more prep work (extracting all tasks upfront)\n- Review loops add iterations\n- But catches issues early (cheaper than debugging later)\n\n## Red Flags\n\n**Never:**\n- Start implementation on main/master branch without explicit user consent\n- Skip reviews (spec compliance OR code quality)\n- Proceed with unfixed issues\n- Dispatch multiple implementation subagents in parallel (conflicts)\n- Make subagent read plan file (provide full text instead)\n- Skip scene-setting context (subagent needs to understand where task fits)\n- Ignore subagent questions (answer before letting them proceed)\n- Accept \"close enough\" on spec compliance (spec reviewer found issues = not done)\n- Skip review loops (reviewer found issues = implementer fixes = review again)\n- Let implementer self-review replace actual review (both are needed)\n- **Start code quality review before spec compliance is ✅** (wrong order)\n- Move to next task while either review has open issues\n\n**If subagent asks questions:**\n- Answer clearly and completely\n- Provide additional context if needed\n- Don''t rush them into implementation\n\n**If reviewer finds issues:**\n- Implementer (same subagent) fixes them\n- Reviewer reviews again\n- Repeat until approved\n- Don''t skip the re-review\n\n**If subagent fails task:**\n- Dispatch fix subagent with specific instructions\n- Don''t try to fix manually (context pollution)\n\n## Integration\n\n**Required workflow skills:**\n- **superpowers:using-git-worktrees** - REQUIRED: Set up isolated workspace before starting\n- **superpowers:writing-plans** - Creates the plan this skill executes\n- **superpowers:requesting-code-review** - Code review template for reviewer subagents\n- **superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch** - Complete development after all tasks\n\n**Subagents should use:**\n- **superpowers:test-driven-development** - Subagents follow TDD for each task\n\n**Alternative workflow:**\n- **superpowers:executing-plans** - Use for parallel session instead of same-session execution\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:04:15.733Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理：子代理驱动开发","ja":"AIエージェント：サブエージェント駆動開発","ko":"AI 에이전트: 서브 에이전트 주도 개발","es":"Desarrollo impulsado por subagentes: Herramientas de AI A...","fr":"Développement piloté par sous-agent: Outils d''Agent IA","de":"Subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung: AI-Tools für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Subagentes","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Подагент-ориентированное развитие","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: التطوير الموجه بواسطة الوكلاء الف...","en":"subagent-driven-development"},"description":{"zh":"子代理驱动开发是一种使用独立任务的实现计划执行方法，通过两阶段审查确保高质量和快速迭代","ja":"サブエージェント駆動開発は、独立したタスクを持つ実装計画を実行する方法で、2段階のレビューを通じて高品質と迅速な反復を実現します","ko":"서브 에이전트 주도 개발은 독립적인 태스크를 사용하는 구현 계획을 실행하는 방법으로, 2단계의 검토를 통해 높은 품질과 빠른 반복을 실현합니다","es":"El desarrollo impulsado por subagentes es una técnica que utiliza subagentes para ejecutar planes de implementación con tareas independientes y revisiones de...","fr":"Le développement piloté par sous-agent est une technique qui utilise des sous-agents pour exécuter des plans de mise en œuvre avec des tâches indépendantes e...","de":"Die subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung ist eine Technik, die Subagenten zur Ausführung von Implementierungsplänen mit unabhängigen Aufgaben und zweistufigen Ü...","pt":"O desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes é uma abordagem que executa planos por meio da criação de subagentes frescos para cada tarefa, com revisão em duas ...","ru":"Подагент-ориентированное развитие - это подход, который выполняет планы путем создания свежих подагентов для каждой задачи, с двухэтапным обзором","ar":"التطوير الموجه بواسطة الوكلاء الفرعيين هو نهج يُنفّذ الخطط من خلال إنشاء وكلاء فرعيين mớiین لكل مهمة، مع استعراض على مرحلتين","en":"Use when executing implementation plans with independent tasks in the current session"},"definition":{"en":"Use when executing implementation plans with independent tasks in the current session"},"features":{"zh":["使用子代理执行独立任务","两阶段审查：规范合规审查和代码质量审查","提高代码质量和迭代速度","适用于具有独立任务的实现计划","支持快速反复开发"],"ja":["サブエージェントを使用して独立したタスクを実行","2段階のレビュー：仕様の準拠レビューとコードの品質レビュー","コードの品質と反復のスピードを向上","独立したタスクを持つ実装計画に適しています","迅速な反復開発をサポート"],"ko":["서브 에이전트를 사용하여 독립적인 태스크를 실행","2단계의 검토：규격 준수 검토와 코드 품질 검토","코드 품질과 반복 속도를 향상","독립적인 태스크를 가진 구현 계획에 적합","빠른 반복 개발을 지원"],"es":["Ejecución de planes de implementación con tareas independientes","Uso de subagentes para cada tarea","Revisión de dos etapas: cumplimiento de especificaciones y calidad del código","Desarrollo rápido y de alta calidad","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo existentes"],"fr":["Exécution de plans de mise en œuvre avec des tâches indépendantes","Utilisation de sous-agents pour chaque tâche","Revues en deux étapes : conformité aux spécifications et qualité du code","Développement rapide et de haute qualité","Intégration avec des outils de développement existants"],"de":["Ausführung von Implementierungsplänen mit unabhängigen Aufgaben","Verwendung von Subagenten für jede Aufgabe","Zweistufige Überprüfung: Einhaltung von Spezifikationen und Code-Qualität","Schnelle und hochwertige Entwicklung","Integration mit bestehenden Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Execução de planos com tarefas independentes","Criação de subagentes frescos para cada tarefa","Revisão em duas etapas: conformidade com especificações e qualidade do código","Melhoria da qualidade e velocidade de iteração","Integração com implementação de planos na sessão atual"],"ru":["Выполнение планов с независимыми задачами","Создание свежих подагентов для каждой задачи","Двухэтапный обзор: соответствие спецификациям и качество кода","Повышение качества и скорости итерации","Интеграция с реализацией планов в текущей сессии"],"ar":["تنفيذ الخطط مع المهام المستقلة","إنشاء وكلاء فرعيين جدیدین لكل مهمة","استعراض على مرحلتين: مطابقة للمواصفات و جودة الكود","تحسين الجودة و سرعة التكرار","التكامل مع تنفيذ الخطط في الجلسة الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","子代理驱动开发","软件开发方法","独立任务","两阶段审查","代码质量","迭代速度"],"ja":["AIエージェント","サブエージェント駆動開発","ソフトウェア開発方法","独立したタスク","2段階のレビュー","コードの品質","反復のスピード"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","서브 에이전트 주도 개발","소프트웨어 개발 방법","독립적인 태스크","2단계의 검토","코드 품질","반복 속도"],"es":["desarrollo impulsado por subagentes","herramientas de AI Agent","desarrollo de software","tareas independientes","revisiones de dos etapas","desarrollo rápido","alta calidad"],"fr":["développement piloté par sous-agent","outils d''Agent IA","développement de logiciels","tâches indépendantes","revues en deux étapes","développement rapide","haute qualité"],"de":["subagenten-getriebene Entwicklung","AI-Tools","Software-Entwicklung","unabhängige Aufgaben","zweistufige Überprüfung","schnelle Entwicklung","hochwertige Entwicklung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento dirigido por subagentes","ferramentas de ia","execução de planos","tarefas independentes","subagentes","revisão em duas etapas","qualidade do código","velocidade de iteração"],"ru":["подагент-ориентированное развитие","ии агенты","выполнение планов","независимые задачи","подагенты","двухэтапный обзор","качество кода","скорость итерации"],"ar":["تطوير موجه بواسطة الوكلاء الفرعيين","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنفيذ الخطط","مهام مستقلة","وكلاء فرعيين","استعراض على مرحلتين","جودة الكود","سرعة التكرار"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents requiring rapid task execution and high-quality output through independent subagent dispatching and two-stage review processes.","zh":"适用于需要快速任务执行和高质量输出的自主代理，通过独立的子代理调度和双阶段审查过程。","ja":"自己完結型エージェントが迅速なタスク実行と高品質の出力が必要な場合に適しています。独立したサブエージェントの派遣と二段階のレビュー処理を通じて実現します。","ko":"신속한 작업 실행과 독립적 子エージェント 派遣 및 이중 검토 프로세스를 통해 고품질 출력이 필요한 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos que requieren ejecución de tareas rápida y salida de alta calidad a través de la expedición de subagentes independientes y procesos de revisión de dos etapas.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Autonomes nécessitant une exécution de tâches rapide et une sortie de haute qualité grâce à l''expédition de sous-agents indépendants et des processus de révision en deux étapes.","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten, die eine schnelle Aufgabenausführung und eine hohe Ausgabequalität durch die Entsendung unabhängiger Subagenten und zweistufige Überprüfungsprozesse erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autônomos que requerem execução rápida de tarefas e saída de alta qualidade por meio de despacho de subagentes independentes e processos de revisão em duas etapas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов, требующих быстрой выполнения задач и высококачественного вывода через независимый подагентский диспетчер и двухэтапные процессы проверки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل tự trị يتطلب تنفيذ任务 سريعًا وإخراج عالي الجودة من خلال إرسال وكلاء فرعيين مستقلين وعمليات مراجعة على مرحلتين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute implementation plans efficiently by dispatching fresh subagents per task, leveraging spec compliance reviews and code quality assessments for optimal results, utilizing two-stage review protocols for enhanced quality control.","zh":"赋予代理执行实现计划的能力，通过为每个任务派遣新的子代理，利用规范合规性审查和代码质量评估以获得最佳结果，并利用双阶段审查协议增强质量控制。","ja":"実装計画を効率的に実行できるエージェントを実現します。各タスクに新しいサブエージェントを派遣し、仕様準拠レビューとコード品質評価を利用して最適な結果を得て、双段階レビューのプロトコルを使用して品質管理を強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 효율적으로 구현 계획을 실행할 수 있도록 합니다. 각 작업에 새로운 子エージェント를 배치하고, 사양 준수 리뷰 및 코드 품질 평가를 활용하여 최적의 결과를 얻고, 2단계 리뷰 프로토콜을 사용하여 품질 제어를 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar planes de implementación de manera eficiente mediante la expedición de subagentes frescos por tarea, aprovechando las revisiones de cumplimiento de especificaciones y las evaluaciones de calidad del código para obtener resultados óptimos, utilizando protocolos de revisión de dos etapas para un control de calidad mejorado.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des plans d''implémentation de manière efficace en expédiant des sous-agents frais par tâche, en exploitant les révisions de conformité aux spécifications et les évaluations de la qualité du code pour obtenir des résultats optimaux, en utilisant des protocoles de révision en deux étapes pour un contrôle de qualité amélioré.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Implementierungspläne effizient auszuführen, indem sie für jede Aufgabe frische Subagenten entsenden, wobei sie Überprüfungen der Spezifikationskonformität und Codequalitätsbewertungen für optimale Ergebnisse nutzen und zweistufige Überprüfungsprotokolle für eine verbesserte Qualitätskontrolle verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar planos de implementação de forma eficiente, despachando novos subagentes por tarefa, aproveitando revisões de conformidade de especificações e avaliações de qualidade de código para resultados ótimos, utilizando protocolos de revisão em duas etapas para controle de qualidade aprimorado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять планы реализации эффективно, диспетчеризируя свежих подагентов на каждую задачу, используя проверки соответствия спецификации и оценки качества кода для оптимальных результатов, используя двухэтапные протоколы проверки для повышения контроля качества.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ خطط التنفيذ بفعالية، من خلال إرسال وكلاء فرعيين جدد لكل مهمة، و利用 مراجعات مطابقة للمواصفات وتقييمات جودة الشفرة للحصول على نتائج مثالية، واستخدام بروتوكولات المراجعة على مرحلتين لتحسين ضبط الجودة."},"useCases":{"en":["Dispatching subagents for independent task execution","Implementing two-stage review processes for quality assurance","Enhancing development speed through parallel subagent tasking"],"zh":["为独立任务执行派遣子代理","实施双阶段审查过程以确保质量","通过并行子代理任务加速开发速度"],"ja":["独立したタスク実行のためのサブエージェントの派遣","品質保証のための二段階のレビュー処理の実施","並列サブエージェントのタスクを通じて開発速度の向上"],"ko":["독립적 작업 실행을 위한 子エージェント 派遣","품질 보증을 위한 2단계 검토 프로세스 구현","병렬 子エージェント 작업을 통한 개발 속도 향상"],"es":["Expedición de subagentes para la ejecución de tareas independientes","Implementación de procesos de revisión de dos etapas para la garantía de calidad"," Mejora de la velocidad de desarrollo a través de la ejecución de tareas de subagentes paralelos"],"fr":["Expedition de sous-agents pour l''exécution de tâches indépendantes","Mise en œuvre de processus de révision en deux étapes pour l''assurance de la qualité","Amélioration de la vitesse de développement grâce à la tâche parallèle des sous-agents"],"de":["Entsendung von Subagenten für die unabhängige Aufgabenausführung","Implementierung von zweistufigen Überprüfungsprozessen für die Qualitätsicherung","Verbesserung der Entwicklungszeit durch paralleles Arbeiten von Subagenten"],"pt":["Despachar subagentes para execução de tarefas independentes","Implementar processos de revisão em duas etapas para garantia de qualidade","Aumentar a velocidade de desenvolvimento por meio de tarefas de subagentes paralelas"],"ru":["Диспетчеризация подагентов для независимого выполнения задач","Реализация двухэтапных процессов проверки для обеспечения качества","Ускорение разработки за счет параллельного задания подагентов"],"ar":["إرسال وكلاء فرعيين لتنفيذ المهام المستقلة","تطبيق عمليات المراجعة على مرحلتين لتأمين الجودة","تعزيز سرعة التطوير من خلال مهام وكلاء فرعيين متوازية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ability to dispatch and manage subagents","Dependent on current session stability for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要能够派遣和管理子代理","依赖于当前会话的稳定性以获得最佳性能"],"ja":["サブエージェントを派遣および管理する能力が必要","最適なパフォーマンスを得るために現在のセッションの安定性に依存する"],"ko":["子エージェント를派遣 및 관리할 수 있는 능력이 필요","최적의 성능을 얻기 위해 현재 세션의 안정성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la capacidad de expedir y gestionar subagentes","Depende de la estabilidad de la sesión actual para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite la capacité d''expédier et de gérer des sous-agents","Dépend de la stabilité de la session actuelle pour des performances optimales"],"de":["Benötigt die Fähigkeit, Subagenten zu entsenden und zu verwalten","Hängt von der Stabilität der aktuellen Sitzung für optimale Leistung ab"],"pt":["Requer a capacidade de despachar e gerenciar subagentes","Depende da estabilidade da sessão atual para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Требует возможности диспетчеризации и управления подагентами","Зависит от стабильности текущей сессии для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب القدرة على إرسال وكلاء فرعيين وإدارتهم","يعتمد على استقرار الجلسة الحالية для الأداء الأمثل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"994b89a5d294eadd6a1611edb51377bac748d5f5fb7f4139d3c736b616b3a46a","repoEtag":"W/\"6ca4599aa6df63cc9397ee47e5073b776827a72e0cb91d7461282a78426487c4\"","qualityScore":95}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/backend-patterns', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'backend-patterns', 50960, 6308, 95, '2026-02-24T12:02:48Z', '2026-02-24T12:04:32.524Z', 'f4944cc2a64b48dd3da335f6b7c8e8774f059e8950df0ee391ab60e80d79a203', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/backend-patterns","name":"backend-patterns","description":{"zh":"后端开发模式，包括REST和GraphQL API设计、数据库优化和服务器端最佳实践","ja":"バックエンド開発パターン、RESTとGraphQL API設計、データベース最適化、サーバーサイドのベストプラクティス","ko":"백엔드 개발 패턴, REST와 GraphQL API 설계, 데이터베이스 최적화, 서버사이드의 베스트 프랙티스","es":"Patrones de backend para aplicaciones server-side escalables con Node.js, Express y Next.js","fr":"Modèles de backend pour des applications serveur évolutives avec Node.js, Express et Next.js","de":"Backend-Muster für skalierbare Server-Anwendungen mit Node.js, Express und Next.js","pt":"Padrões de desenvolvimento backend para aplicações escaláveis com Node.js, Express e Next.js","ru":"Шаблоны backend-разработки для масштабируемых приложений с Node.js, Express и Next.js","ar":"نماذج التطوير الخلفي لبرامج قابلة للتوسيع مع Node.js، Express و Next.js","en":"Backend architecture patterns, API design, database optimization, and server-side best practices for Node.js, Express, and Next.js API routes."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":50960,"forks":6308,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:48Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"backend-patterns","description":"Backend architecture patterns, API design, database optimization, and server-side best practices for Node.js, Express, and Next.js API routes.","bodyPreview":"# Backend Development Patterns\n\nBackend architecture patterns and best practices for scalable server-side applications.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Designing REST or GraphQL API endpoints\n- Implementing repository, service, or controller layers\n- Optimizing database queries (N+1, indexing, connection pooling)\n- Adding caching (Redis, in-memory, HTTP cache headers)\n- Setting up background jobs or async processing\n- Structuring error handling and validation for APIs\n- Building middleware (auth, loggin","body":"# Backend Development Patterns\n\nBackend architecture patterns and best practices for scalable server-side applications.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Designing REST or GraphQL API endpoints\n- Implementing repository, service, or controller layers\n- Optimizing database queries (N+1, indexing, connection pooling)\n- Adding caching (Redis, in-memory, HTTP cache headers)\n- Setting up background jobs or async processing\n- Structuring error handling and validation for APIs\n- Building middleware (auth, logging, rate limiting)\n\n## API Design Patterns\n\n### RESTful API Structure\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Resource-based URLs\nGET    /api/markets                 # List resources\nGET    /api/markets/:id             # Get single resource\nPOST   /api/markets                 # Create resource\nPUT    /api/markets/:id             # Replace resource\nPATCH  /api/markets/:id             # Update resource\nDELETE /api/markets/:id             # Delete resource\n\n// ✅ Query parameters for filtering, sorting, pagination\nGET /api/markets?status=active&sort=volume&limit=20&offset=0\n```\n\n### Repository Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// Abstract data access logic\ninterface MarketRepository {\n  findAll(filters?: MarketFilters): Promise<Market[]>\n  findById(id: string): Promise<Market | null>\n  create(data: CreateMarketDto): Promise<Market>\n  update(id: string, data: UpdateMarketDto): Promise<Market>\n  delete(id: string): Promise<void>\n}\n\nclass SupabaseMarketRepository implements MarketRepository {\n  async findAll(filters?: MarketFilters): Promise<Market[]> {\n    let query = supabase.from(''markets'').select(''*'')\n\n    if (filters?.status) {\n      query = query.eq(''status'', filters.status)\n    }\n\n    if (filters?.limit) {\n      query = query.limit(filters.limit)\n    }\n\n    const { data, error } = await query\n\n    if (error) throw new Error(error.message)\n    return data\n  }\n\n  // Other methods...\n}\n```\n\n### Service Layer Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// Business logic separated from data access\nclass MarketService {\n  constructor(private marketRepo: MarketRepository) {}\n\n  async searchMarkets(query: string, limit: number = 10): Promise<Market[]> {\n    // Business logic\n    const embedding = await generateEmbedding(query)\n    const results = await this.vectorSearch(embedding, limit)\n\n    // Fetch full data\n    const markets = await this.marketRepo.findByIds(results.map(r => r.id))\n\n    // Sort by similarity\n    return markets.sort((a, b) => {\n      const scoreA = results.find(r => r.id === a.id)?.score || 0\n      const scoreB = results.find(r => r.id === b.id)?.score || 0\n      return scoreA - scoreB\n    })\n  }\n\n  private async vectorSearch(embedding: number[], limit: number) {\n    // Vector search implementation\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Middleware Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// Request/response processing pipeline\nexport function withAuth(handler: NextApiHandler): NextApiHandler {\n  return async (req, res) => {\n    const token = req.headers.authorization?.replace(''Bearer '', '''')\n\n    if (!token) {\n      return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Unauthorized'' })\n    }\n\n    try {\n      const user = await verifyToken(token)\n      req.user = user\n      return handler(req, res)\n    } catch (error) {\n      return res.status(401).json({ error: ''Invalid token'' })\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\nexport default withAuth(async (req, res) => {\n  // Handler has access to req.user\n})\n```\n\n## Database Patterns\n\n### Query Optimization\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ GOOD: Select only needed columns\nconst { data } = await supabase\n  .from(''markets'')\n  .select(''id, name, status, volume'')\n  .eq(''status'', ''active'')\n  .order(''volume'', { ascending: false })\n  .limit(10)\n\n// ❌ BAD: Select everything\nconst { data } = await supabase\n  .from(''markets'')\n  .select(''*'')\n```\n\n### N+1 Query Prevention\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ BAD: N+1 query problem\nconst markets = await getMarkets()\nfor (const market of markets) {\n  market.creator = await getUser(market.creator_id)  // N queries\n}\n\n// ✅ GOOD: Batch fetch\nconst markets = await getMarkets()\nconst creatorIds = markets.map(m => m.creator_id)\nconst creators = await getUsers(creatorIds)  // 1 query\nconst creatorMap = new Map(creators.map(c => [c.id, c]))\n\nmarkets.forEach(market => {\n  market.creator = creatorMap.get(market.creator_id)\n})\n```\n\n### Transaction Pattern\n\n```typescript\nasync function createMarketWithPosition(\n  marketData: CreateMarketDto,\n  positionData: CreatePositionDto\n) {\n  // Use Supabase transaction\n  const { data, error } = await supabase.rpc(''create_market_with_position'', {\n    market_data: marketData,\n    position_data: positionData\n  })\n\n  if (error) throw new Error(''Transaction failed'')\n  return data\n}\n\n// SQL function in Supabase\nCREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION create_market_with_position(\n  market_data jsonb,\n  position_data jsonb\n)\nRETURNS jsonb\nLANGUAGE plpgsql\nAS $$\nBEGIN\n  -- Start transaction automatically\n  INSERT INTO markets VALUES (market_data);\n  INSERT INTO positions VALUES (position_data);\n  RETURN jsonb_build_object(''success'', true);\nEXCEPTION\n  WHEN OTHERS THEN\n    -- Rollback happens automatically\n    RETURN jsonb_build_object(''success'', false, ''error'', SQLERRM);\nEND;\n$$;\n```\n\n## Caching Strategies\n\n### Redis Caching Layer\n\n```typescript\nclass CachedMarketRepository implements MarketRepository {\n  constructor(\n    private baseRepo: MarketRepository,\n    private redis: RedisClient\n  ) {}\n\n  async findById(id: string): Promise<Market | null> {\n    // Check cache first\n    const cached = await this.redis.get(`market:${id}`)\n\n    if (cached) {\n      return JSON.parse(cached)\n    }\n\n    // Cache miss - fetch from database\n    const market = await this.baseRepo.findById(id)\n\n    if (market) {\n      // Cache for 5 minutes\n      await this.redis.setex(`market:${id}`, 300, JSON.stringify(market))\n    }\n\n    return market\n  }\n\n  async invalidateCache(id: string): Promise<void> {\n    await this.redis.del(`market:${id}`)\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Cache-Aside Pattern\n\n```typescript\nasync function getMarketWithCache(id: string): Promise<Market> {\n  const cacheKey = `market:${id}`\n\n  // Try cache\n  const cached = await redis.get(cacheKey)\n  if (cached) return JSON.parse(cached)\n\n  // Cache miss - fetch from DB\n  const market = await db.markets.findUnique({ where: { id } })\n\n  if (!market) throw new Error(''Market not found'')\n\n  // Update cache\n  await redis.setex(cacheKey, 300, JSON.stringify(market))\n\n  return market\n}\n```\n\n## Error Handling Patterns\n\n### Centralized Error Handler\n\n```typescript\nclass ApiError extends Error {\n  constructor(\n    public statusCode: number,\n    public message: string,\n    public isOperational = true\n  ) {\n    super(message)\n    Object.setPrototypeOf(this, ApiError.prototype)\n  }\n}\n\nexport function errorHandler(error: unknown, req: Request): Response {\n  if (error instanceof ApiError) {\n    return NextResponse.json({\n      success: false,\n      error: error.message\n    }, { status: error.statusCode })\n  }\n\n  if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n    return NextResponse.json({\n      success: false,\n      error: ''Validation failed'',\n      details: error.errors\n    }, { status: 400 })\n  }\n\n  // Log unexpected errors\n  console.error(''Unexpected error:'', error)\n\n  return NextResponse.json({\n    success: false,\n    error: ''Internal server error''\n  }, { status: 500 })\n}\n\n// Usage\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  try {\n    const data = await fetchData()\n    return NextResponse.json({ success: true, data })\n  } catch (error) {\n    return errorHandler(error, request)\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Retry with Exponential Backoff\n\n```typescript\nasync function fetchWithRetry<T>(\n  fn: () => Promise<T>,\n  maxRetries = 3\n): Promise<T> {\n  let lastError: Error\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < maxRetries; i++) {\n    try {\n      return await fn()\n    } catch (error) {\n      lastError = error as Error\n\n      if (i < maxRetries - 1) {\n        // Exponential backoff: 1s, 2s, 4s\n        const delay = Math.pow(2, i) * 1000\n        await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, delay))\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  throw lastError!\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst data = await fetchWithRetry(() => fetchFromAPI())\n```\n\n## Authentication & Authorization\n\n### JWT Token Validation\n\n```typescript\nimport jwt from ''jsonwebtoken''\n\ninterface JWTPayload {\n  userId: string\n  email: string\n  role: ''admin'' | ''user''\n}\n\nexport function verifyToken(token: string): JWTPayload {\n  try {\n    const payload = jwt.verify(token, process.env.JWT_SECRET!) as JWTPayload\n    return payload\n  } catch (error) {\n    throw new ApiError(401, ''Invalid token'')\n  }\n}\n\nexport async function requireAuth(request: Request) {\n  const token = request.headers.get(''authorization'')?.replace(''Bearer '', '''')\n\n  if (!token) {\n    throw new ApiError(401, ''Missing authorization token'')\n  }\n\n  return verifyToken(token)\n}\n\n// Usage in API route\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const user = await requireAuth(request)\n\n  const data = await getDataForUser(user.userId)\n\n  return NextResponse.json({ success: true, data })\n}\n```\n\n### Role-Based Access Control\n\n```typescript\ntype Permission = ''read'' | ''write'' | ''delete'' | ''admin''\n\ninterface User {\n  id: string\n  role: ''admin'' | ''moderator'' | ''user''\n}\n\nconst rolePermissions: Record<User[''role''], Permission[]> = {\n  admin: [''read'', ''write'', ''delete'', ''admin''],\n  moderator: [''read'', ''write'', ''delete''],\n  user: [''read'', ''write'']\n}\n\nexport function hasPermission(user: User, permission: Permission): boolean {\n  return rolePermissions[user.role].includes(permission)\n}\n\nexport function requirePermission(permission: Permission) {\n  return (handler: (request: Request, user: User) => Promise<Response>) => {\n    return async (request: Request) => {\n      const user = await requireAuth(request)\n\n      if (!hasPermission(user, permission)) {\n        throw new ApiError(403, ''Insufficient permissions'')\n      }\n\n      return handler(request, user)\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage - HOF wraps the handler\nexport const DELETE = requirePermission(''delete'')(\n  async (request: Request, user: User) => {\n    // Handler receives authenticated user with verified permission\n    return new Response(''Deleted'', { status: 200 })\n  }\n)\n```\n\n## Rate Limiting\n\n### Simple In-Memory Rate Limiter\n\n```typescript\nclass RateLimiter {\n  private requests = new Map<string, number[]>()\n\n  async checkLimit(\n    identifier: string,\n    maxRequests: number,\n    windowMs: number\n  ): Promise<boolean> {\n    const now = Date.now()\n    const requests = this.requests.get(identifier) || []\n\n    // Remove old requests outside window\n    const recentRequests = requests.filter(time => now - time < windowMs)\n\n    if (recentRequests.length >= maxRequests) {\n      return false  // Rate limit exceeded\n    }\n\n    // Add current request\n    recentRequests.push(now)\n    this.requests.set(identifier, recentRequests)\n\n    return true\n  }\n}\n\nconst limiter = new RateLimiter()\n\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const ip = request.headers.get(''x-forwarded-for'') || ''unknown''\n\n  const allowed = await limiter.checkLimit(ip, 100, 60000)  // 100 req/min\n\n  if (!allowed) {\n    return NextResponse.json({\n      error: ''Rate limit exceeded''\n    }, { status: 429 })\n  }\n\n  // Continue with request\n}\n```\n\n## Background Jobs & Queues\n\n### Simple Queue Pattern\n\n```typescript\nclass JobQueue<T> {\n  private queue: T[] = []\n  private processing = false\n\n  async add(job: T): Promise<void> {\n    this.queue.push(job)\n\n    if (!this.processing) {\n      this.process()\n    }\n  }\n\n  private async process(): Promise<void> {\n    this.processing = true\n\n    while (this.queue.length > 0) {\n      const job = this.queue.shift()!\n\n      try {\n        await this.execute(job)\n      } catch (error) {\n        console.error(''Job failed:'', error)\n      }\n    }\n\n    this.processing = false\n  }\n\n  private async execute(job: T): Promise<void> {\n    // Job execution logic\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage for indexing markets\ninterface IndexJob {\n  marketId: string\n}\n\nconst indexQueue = new JobQueue<IndexJob>()\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const { marketId } = await request.json()\n\n  // Add to queue instead of blocking\n  await indexQueue.add({ marketId })\n\n  return NextResponse.json({ success: true, message: ''Job queued'' })\n}\n```\n\n## Logging & Monitoring\n\n### Structured Logging\n\n```typescript\ninterface LogContext {\n  userId?: string\n  requestId?: string\n  method?: string\n  path?: string\n  [key: string]: unknown\n}\n\nclass Logger {\n  log(level: ''info'' | ''warn'' | ''error'', message: string, context?: LogContext) {\n    const entry = {\n      timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n      level,\n      message,\n      ...context\n    }\n\n    console.log(JSON.stringify(entry))\n  }\n\n  info(message: string, context?: LogContext) {\n    this.log(''info'', message, context)\n  }\n\n  warn(message: string, context?: LogContext) {\n    this.log(''warn'', message, context)\n  }\n\n  error(message: string, error: Error, context?: LogContext) {\n    this.log(''error'', message, {\n      ...context,\n      error: error.message,\n      stack: error.stack\n    })\n  }\n}\n\nconst logger = new Logger()\n\n// Usage\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const requestId = crypto.randomUUID()\n\n  logger.info(''Fetching markets'', {\n    requestId,\n    method: ''GET'',\n    path: ''/api/markets''\n  })\n\n  try {\n    const markets = await fetchMarkets()\n    return NextResponse.json({ success: true, data: markets })\n  } catch (error) {\n    logger.error(''Failed to fetch markets'', error as Error, { requestId })\n    return NextResponse.json({ error: ''Internal error'' }, { status: 500 })\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Remember**: Backend patterns enable scalable, maintainable server-side applications. Choose patterns that fit your complexity level.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:04:32.524Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理后端模式","ja":"AIエージェントのバックエンドパターン","ko":"AI 에이전트 백엔드 패턴","es":"Patrones de backend para AI Agentes con Node.js","fr":"Modèles de backend pour les Outils IA avec Node.js","de":"Backend-Muster für AI-Tools mit Node.js","pt":"Padrões de Desenvolvimento Backend com Ferramentas de IA","ru":"Шаблоны Backend-разработки с ИИ Агентами","ar":"نماذج التطوير الخلفي مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"backend-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"后端开发模式，包括REST和GraphQL API设计、数据库优化和服务器端最佳实践","ja":"バックエンド開発パターン、RESTとGraphQL API設計、データベース最適化、サーバーサイドのベストプラクティス","ko":"백엔드 개발 패턴, REST와 GraphQL API 설계, 데이터베이스 최적화, 서버사이드의 베스트 프랙티스","es":"Patrones de backend para aplicaciones server-side escalables con Node.js, Express y Next.js","fr":"Modèles de backend pour des applications serveur évolutives avec Node.js, Express et Next.js","de":"Backend-Muster für skalierbare Server-Anwendungen mit Node.js, Express und Next.js","pt":"Padrões de desenvolvimento backend para aplicações escaláveis com Node.js, Express e Next.js","ru":"Шаблоны backend-разработки для масштабируемых приложений с Node.js, Express и Next.js","ar":"نماذج التطوير الخلفي لبرامج قابلة للتوسيع مع Node.js، Express و Next.js","en":"Backend architecture patterns, API design, database optimization, and server-side best practices for Node.js, Express, and Next.js API routes."},"definition":{"en":"Backend architecture patterns, API design, database optimization, and server-side best practices for Node.js, Express, and Next.js API routes."},"features":{"zh":["REST和GraphQL API设计","数据库优化和性能调优","服务器端最佳实践和安全性","后端架构模式和设计原则","Node.js、Express和Next.js API路由支持"],"ja":["RESTとGraphQL API設計","データベース最適化とパフォーマンスチューニング","サーバーサイドのベストプラクティスとセキュリティ","バックエンドアーキテクチャパターンと設計原則","Node.js、Express、Next.js APIルートのサポート"],"ko":["REST와 GraphQL API 설계","데이터베이스 최적화와 성능 튜닝","서버사이드의 베스트 프랙티스와 보안","백엔드 아키텍처 패턴과 디자인 원칙","Node.js, Express, Next.js API 路由의 지원"],"es":["Diseño de API REST y GraphQL","Optimización de bases de datos","Implementación de capas de repositorio y servicio","Configuración de trabajos en segundo plano y procesamiento asíncrono","Estructuración de manejo de errores y validación para API"],"fr":["Conception d''API REST et GraphQL","Optimisation de bases de données","Mise en œuvre de couches de répository et de service","Configuration de tâches en arrière-plan et de traitement asynchrone","Structuration de la gestion des erreurs et de la validation pour les API"],"de":["Entwurf von REST- und GraphQL-APIs","Optimierung von Datenbanken","Implementierung von Repository- und Dienstschichten","Konfiguration von Hintergrundjobs und asynchroner Verarbeitung","Strukturierung der Fehlerbehandlung und Validierung für APIs"],"pt":["Padrões de arquitetura backend","Design de API REST e GraphQL","Otimização de banco de dados","Implementação de caching","Tratamento de erros e validação"],"ru":["Шаблоны backend-архитектуры","Дизайн API REST и GraphQL","Оптимизация базы данных","Реализация кэширования","Обработка ошибок и валидация"],"ar":["نماذج هندسة الخلفية","تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST و GraphQL","تحسين قاعدة البيانات","تنفيذ التخزين المؤقت","معالجة الأخطاء والتحقق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","后端开发模式","REST API","GraphQL API","数据库优化","服务器端最佳实践","Node.js","Express","Next.js"],"ja":["AIエージェント","バックエンド開発パターン","REST API","GraphQL API","データベース最適化","サーバーサイドのベストプラクティス","Node.js","Express","Next.js"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","백엔드 개발 패턴","REST API","GraphQL API","데이터베이스 최적화","서버사이드의 베스트 프랙티스","Node.js","Express","Next.js"],"es":["patrones de backend","AI Agentes","Node.js","Express","Next.js","diseño de API","optimización de bases de datos","desarrollo de servidor"],"fr":["modèles de backend","Outils IA","Node.js","Express","Next.js","conception d''API","optimisation de bases de données","développement de serveur"],"de":["Backend-Muster","AI-Tools","Node.js","Express","Next.js","API-Entwurf","Datenbankoptimierung","Server-Entwicklung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento backend","padrões de arquitetura","design de API","otimização de banco de dados","Node.js","Express","Next.js","ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["backend-разработка","шаблоны архитектуры","дизайн API","оптимизация базы данных","Node.js","Express","Next.js","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["تطوير الخلفية","نماذج هندسة","تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تحسين قاعدة البيانات","Node.js","Express","Next.js","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Node.js Agents needing scalable backend architecture patterns and optimized API design.","zh":"适用于需要可扩展的后端架构模式和优化的API设计的Node.js代理。","ja":"Node.jsエージェントがスケーラブルなバックエンドアーキテクチャパターンと最適化されたAPI設計を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"확장 가능한 백엔드 아키텍처 패턴과 최적화된 API設計이 필요한 Node.js 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Node.js que necesitan patrones de arquitectura de backend escalables y un diseño de API optimizado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Node.js qui nécessitent des modèles d''architecture de backend évolutifs et une conception d''API optimisée.","de":"Perfekt für Node.js-Agents, die skalierte Backend-Architekturmuster und optimierten API-Design benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Node.js que necessitam de padrões de arquitetura de backend escaláveis e design de API otimizado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Node.js, которым необходимы масштабируемые шаблоны архитектуры бэкенда и оптимизированный дизайн API.","ar":" مثالي لعميل Node.js الذي يحتاج إلى أنماط هندسة الخلفية القابلة للتحجيم وتصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المتقن."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design efficient REST and GraphQL API endpoints, implement repository and service layers, and optimize database queries using Node.js, Express, and Next.js, while leveraging techniques like caching with Redis and connection pooling.","zh":"赋予代理设计高效的REST和GraphQL API端点、实现存储库和服务层、使用Node.js、Express和Next.js优化数据库查询，同时利用像Redis缓存和连接池等技术。","ja":"エージェントにRESTとGraphQL APIエンドポイントを効率的に設計し、リポジトリとサービス層を実装し、Node.js、Express、Next.jsを使用してデータベースクエリを最適化することを可能にし、Redisによるキャッシングや接続プーリングなどのテクニックを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 효율적인 REST와 GraphQL API 끝점을 설계하고, 저장소 및 서비스 계층을 구현하며, Node.js, Express 및 Next.js를 사용하여 데이터베이스 쿼리를 최적화 할 수 있도록 하며, Redis 캐싱 및 커넥션 풀링 등의 기술을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar puntos de conexión de API REST y GraphQL eficientes, implementar capas de repositorio y servicio, y optimizar consultas de base de datos utilizando Node.js, Express y Next.js, mientras aprovecha técnicas como el caché con Redis y la agrupación de conexiones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des points de terminaison d''API REST et GraphQL efficaces, de mettre en œuvre des couches de référentiel et de service, et d''optimiser les requêtes de base de données en utilisant Node.js, Express et Next.js, tout en exploitant des techniques comme le cache avec Redis et le regroupement de connexions.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, effiziente REST- und GraphQL-API-Endpunkte zu entwerfen, Repository- und Service-Ebenen zu implementieren und Datenbankabfragen mit Node.js, Express und Next.js zu optimieren, während Techniken wie Caching mit Redis und Connection-Pooling genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar pontos de extremidade de API REST e GraphQL eficientes, implementar camadas de repositório e serviço e otimizar consultas de banco de dados usando Node.js, Express e Next.js, aproveitando técnicas como cache com Redis e pooling de conexões.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать эффективные конечные точки API REST и GraphQL, реализовывать слои репозитория и сервиса, а также оптимизировать запросы к базе данных с помощью Node.js, Express и Next.js, используя при этом техники, такие как кэширование с помощью Redis и пулинг соединений.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تصميم نقاط نهاية API REST وGraphQL الفعالة، وتنفيذ طبقات المستودع وخدمة، وتحسين استفسارات قاعدة البيانات باستخدام Node.js وExpress وNext.js، مع الاستفادة من تقنيات مثل ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت مع Redis وجمع الاتصالات."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing scalable API routes with Express and Next.js","Implementing repository and service layers for data access","Optimizing database queries using indexing and connection pooling"],"zh":["使用Express和Next.js设计可扩展的API路由","实现数据访问的存储库和服务层","使用索引和连接池优化数据库查询"],"ja":["ExpressとNext.jsを使用してスケーラブルなAPIルートを設計する","データアクセス用のリポジトリとサービス層を実装する","インデックスと接続プーリングを使用してデータベースクエリを最適化する"],"ko":["Express 및 Next.js를 사용하여 확장 가능한 API 路由를 설계한다","데이터 접근을 위한 저장소 및 서비스 계층을 구현한다","인덱싱 및 커넥션 풀링을 사용하여 데이터베이스 쿼리를 최적화한다"],"es":["Diseñar rutas de API escalables con Express y Next.js","Implementar capas de repositorio y servicio para el acceso a datos","Optimizar consultas de base de datos utilizando indexación y agrupación de conexiones"],"fr":["Concevoir des routes d''API évolutives avec Express et Next.js","Mettre en œuvre des couches de référentiel et de service pour l''accès aux données","Optimiser les requêtes de base de données en utilisant l''indexation et le regroupement de connexions"],"de":["Entwerfen von skalierbaren API-Routen mit Express und Next.js","Implementieren von Repository- und Service-Ebenen für den Datenzugriff","Optimieren von Datenbankabfragen unter Verwendung von Indexierung und Connection-Pooling"],"pt":["Projeto de rotas de API escaláveis com Express e Next.js","Implementação de camadas de repositório e serviço para acesso a dados","Otimização de consultas de banco de dados usando indexação e pooling de conexões"],"ru":["Проектирование масштабируемых маршрутов API с помощью Express и Next.js","Реализация слоев репозитория и сервиса для доступа к данным","Оптимизация запросов к базе данных с помощью индексации и пулинга соединений"],"ar":["تصميم مسارات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات القابلة للتحجيم مع Express وNext.js","تنفيذ طبقات المستودع وخدمة للوصول إلى البيانات","تحسين استفسارات قاعدة البيانات باستخدام الفهرسة وجمع الاتصالات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Limited to Express and Next.js frameworks","Database optimization techniques specific to Node.js and its ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Node.js环境","仅限于Express和Next.js框架","数据库优化技术仅适用于Node.js及其生态系统"],"ja":["Node.js環境が必要","ExpressとNext.jsフレームワークのみに対応","データベース最適化テクニックはNode.jsとそのエコシステムのみに特有"],"ko":["Node.js 환경이 필요하다","Express 및 Next.js 프레임워크만 해당한다","데이터베이스 최적화 기술은 Node.js 및 그 생태계에만 특정하다"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Node.js","Limitado a los frameworks Express y Next.js","Técnicas de optimización de base de datos específicas de Node.js y su ecosistema"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Limité aux frameworks Express et Next.js","Techniques d''optimisation de base de données spécifiques à Node.js et son écosystème"],"de":["Benötigt eine Node.js-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Frameworks Express und Next.js","Datenbank-Optimierungstechniken, die spezifisch für Node.js und dessen Ökosystem sind"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Node.js","Limitado aos frameworks Express e Next.js","Técnicas de otimização de banco de dados específicas do Node.js e seu ecossistema"],"ru":["Требует среды Node.js","Ограничен фреймворками Express и Next.js","Техники оптимизации базы данных, специфичные для Node.js и его экосистемы"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","محدود بالإطارات Express وNext.js","تقنيات تحسين قاعدة البيانات الخاصة bằng Node.js ونظامها البيئي"]},"version":3},"