g results to reduce processing costs","Auto-invalidating cached text extraction results when file content changes","Optimizing image analysis pipelines with efficient caching using SHA-256 hashes"],"zh":["Caching PDF parsing results to reduce processing costs","Auto-invalidating cached text extraction results when file content changes","Optimizing image analysis pipelines with efficient caching using SHA-256 hashes"],"ja":["Caching PDF parsing results to reduce processing costs","Auto-invalidating cached text extraction results when file content changes","Optimizing image analysis pipelines with efficient caching using SHA-256 hashes"],"ko":["Caching PDF parsing results to reduce processing costs","Auto-invalidating cached text extraction results when file content changes","Optimizing image analysis pipelines with efficient caching using SHA-256 hashes"],"es":["Caching PDF parsing results to reduce processing costs","Auto-invalidating cached text extraction results when file content changes","Optimizing image analysis pipelines with efficient caching using SHA-256 hashes"],"fr":["Caching PDF parsing results to reduce processing costs","Auto-invalidating cached text extraction results when file content changes","Optimizing image analysis pipelines with efficient caching using SHA-256 hashes"],"de":["Caching PDF parsing results to reduce processing costs","Auto-invalidating cached text extraction results when file content changes","Optimizing image analysis pipelines with efficient caching using SHA-256 hashes"],"pt":["Caching PDF parsing results to reduce processing costs","Auto-invalidating cached text extraction results when file content changes","Optimizing image analysis pipelines with efficient caching using SHA-256 hashes"],"ru":["Caching PDF parsing results to reduce processing costs","Auto-invalidating cached text extraction results when file content changes","Optimizing image analysis pipelines with efficient caching using SHA-256 hashes"],"ar":["Caching PDF parsing results to reduce processing costs","Auto-invalidating cached text extraction results when file content changes","Optimizing image analysis pipelines with efficient caching using SHA-256 hashes"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SHA-256 hash computation capabilities","Limited to file processing operations","Needs service layer separation for effective caching"],"zh":["Requires SHA-256 hash computation capabilities","Limited to file processing operations","Needs service layer separation for effective caching"],"ja":["Requires SHA-256 hash computation capabilities","Limited to file processing operations","Needs service layer separation for effective caching"],"ko":["Requires SHA-256 hash computation capabilities","Limited to file processing operations","Needs service layer separation for effective caching"],"es":["Requires SHA-256 hash computation capabilities","Limited to file processing operations","Needs service layer separation for effective caching"],"fr":["Requires SHA-256 hash computation capabilities","Limited to file processing operations","Needs service layer separation for effective caching"],"de":["Requires SHA-256 hash computation capabilities","Limited to file processing operations","Needs service layer separation for effective caching"],"pt":["Requires SHA-256 hash computation capabilities","Limited to file processing operations","Needs service layer separation for effective caching"],"ru":["Requires SHA-256 hash computation capabilities","Limited to file processing operations","Needs service layer separation for effective caching"],"ar":["Requires SHA-256 hash computation capabilities","Limited to file processing operations","Needs service layer separation for effective caching"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"59f125cfc078ef32a483c3d4a6685c1bfe3ebe20a9d16ec3df2d531534fb0145","repoEtag":"W/\"364f268e25511efbc6f9c2152da6805d934c8ccbaa49ea479a3da0f27c55af07\"","qualityScore":95}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/cost-aware-llm-pipeline', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'cost-aware-llm-pipeline', 50960, 6308, 95, '2026-02-24T12:02:48Z', '2026-02-24T12:04:35.888Z', '79fa629f4cd902c6ac27823860d6139622f81765601ddb8b04943e1331dadfeb', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/cost-aware-llm-pipeline","name":"cost-aware-llm-pipeline","description":{"zh":"成本优化模式，用于优化LLM API的成本而不牺牲质量","ja":"AIエージェントのコストを最適化するためのパターン","ko":"LLM API 비용을 최적화하는 패턴","es":"El pipeline de LLM de costo consciente combina enrutamiento de modelos, seguimiento de presupuesto, lógica de reintento y caché de solicitudes para optimizar costos","fr":"Le pipeline LLM à conscience de coût combine le routage de modèles, le suivi budgétaire, la logique de réessai et la mise en cache des requêtes pour optimiser les coûts","de":"Die kostenbewusste LLM-Pipeline kombiniert Modell-Routing, Budget-Tracking, Wiederholungslogik und Anfrage-Caching, um Kosten zu optimieren","pt":"O pipeline de LLM otimizado por custo combina roteamento de modelo, rastreamento de orçamento, lógica de reintento e cache de prompt para controlar custos de API de LLM","ru":"Пайплайн LLM с оптимизацией стоимости объединяет маршрутизацию модели, отслеживание бюджета, логику повторных попыток и кэширование подсказки для контроля затрат на API LLM","ar":"ترب#line LLM الموجهة للتكلفة يدمج маршруطة النموذج وتحديد الميزانية و منطق إعادة المحاولة وذاكرة التخزين المؤقت للتحفيز للسيطرة على تكاليف واجهة برمجة تطبيقات LLM","en":"Cost optimization patterns for LLM API usage — model routing by task complexity, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":50960,"forks":6308,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:48Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"cost-aware-llm-pipeline","description":"Cost optimization patterns for LLM API usage — model routing by task complexity, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching.","bodyPreview":"# Cost-Aware LLM Pipeline\n\nPatterns for controlling LLM API costs while maintaining quality. Combines model routing, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching into a composable pipeline.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building applications that call LLM APIs (Claude, GPT, etc.)\n- Processing batches of items with varying complexity\n- Need to stay within a budget for API spend\n- Optimizing cost without sacrificing quality on complex tasks\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Model Routing by Task Complexity","body":"# Cost-Aware LLM Pipeline\n\nPatterns for controlling LLM API costs while maintaining quality. Combines model routing, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching into a composable pipeline.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building applications that call LLM APIs (Claude, GPT, etc.)\n- Processing batches of items with varying complexity\n- Need to stay within a budget for API spend\n- Optimizing cost without sacrificing quality on complex tasks\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Model Routing by Task Complexity\n\nAutomatically select cheaper models for simple tasks, reserving expensive models for complex ones.\n\n```python\nMODEL_SONNET = \"claude-sonnet-4-6\"\nMODEL_HAIKU = \"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\"\n\n_SONNET_TEXT_THRESHOLD = 10_000  # chars\n_SONNET_ITEM_THRESHOLD = 30     # items\n\ndef select_model(\n    text_length: int,\n    item_count: int,\n    force_model: str | None = None,\n) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Select model based on task complexity.\"\"\"\n    if force_model is not None:\n        return force_model\n    if text_length >= _SONNET_TEXT_THRESHOLD or item_count >= _SONNET_ITEM_THRESHOLD:\n        return MODEL_SONNET  # Complex task\n    return MODEL_HAIKU  # Simple task (3-4x cheaper)\n```\n\n### 2. Immutable Cost Tracking\n\nTrack cumulative spend with frozen dataclasses. Each API call returns a new tracker — never mutates state.\n\n```python\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True, slots=True)\nclass CostRecord:\n    model: str\n    input_tokens: int\n    output_tokens: int\n    cost_usd: float\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True, slots=True)\nclass CostTracker:\n    budget_limit: float = 1.00\n    records: tuple[CostRecord, ...] = ()\n\n    def add(self, record: CostRecord) -> \"CostTracker\":\n        \"\"\"Return new tracker with added record (never mutates self).\"\"\"\n        return CostTracker(\n            budget_limit=self.budget_limit,\n            records=(*self.records, record),\n        )\n\n    @property\n    def total_cost(self) -> float:\n        return sum(r.cost_usd for r in self.records)\n\n    @property\n    def over_budget(self) -> bool:\n        return self.total_cost > self.budget_limit\n```\n\n### 3. Narrow Retry Logic\n\nRetry only on transient errors. Fail fast on authentication or bad request errors.\n\n```python\nfrom anthropic import (\n    APIConnectionError,\n    InternalServerError,\n    RateLimitError,\n)\n\n_RETRYABLE_ERRORS = (APIConnectionError, RateLimitError, InternalServerError)\n_MAX_RETRIES = 3\n\ndef call_with_retry(func, *, max_retries: int = _MAX_RETRIES):\n    \"\"\"Retry only on transient errors, fail fast on others.\"\"\"\n    for attempt in range(max_retries):\n        try:\n            return func()\n        except _RETRYABLE_ERRORS:\n            if attempt == max_retries - 1:\n                raise\n            time.sleep(2 ** attempt)  # Exponential backoff\n    # AuthenticationError, BadRequestError etc. → raise immediately\n```\n\n### 4. Prompt Caching\n\nCache long system prompts to avoid resending them on every request.\n\n```python\nmessages = [\n    {\n        \"role\": \"user\",\n        \"content\": [\n            {\n                \"type\": \"text\",\n                \"text\": system_prompt,\n                \"cache_control\": {\"type\": \"ephemeral\"},  # Cache this\n            },\n            {\n                \"type\": \"text\",\n                \"text\": user_input,  # Variable part\n            },\n        ],\n    }\n]\n```\n\n## Composition\n\nCombine all four techniques in a single pipeline function:\n\n```python\ndef process(text: str, config: Config, tracker: CostTracker) -> tuple[Result, CostTracker]:\n    # 1. Route model\n    model = select_model(len(text), estimated_items, config.force_model)\n\n    # 2. Check budget\n    if tracker.over_budget:\n        raise BudgetExceededError(tracker.total_cost, tracker.budget_limit)\n\n    # 3. Call with retry + caching\n    response = call_with_retry(lambda: client.messages.create(\n        model=model,\n        messages=build_cached_messages(system_prompt, text),\n    ))\n\n    # 4. Track cost (immutable)\n    record = CostRecord(model=model, input_tokens=..., output_tokens=..., cost_usd=...)\n    tracker = tracker.add(record)\n\n    return parse_result(response), tracker\n```\n\n## Pricing Reference (2025-2026)\n\n| Model | Input ($/1M tokens) | Output ($/1M tokens) | Relative Cost |\n|-------|---------------------|----------------------|---------------|\n| Haiku 4.5 | $0.80 | $4.00 | 1x |\n| Sonnet 4.6 | $3.00 | $15.00 | ~4x |\n| Opus 4.5 | $15.00 | $75.00 | ~19x |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Start with the cheapest model** and only route to expensive models when complexity thresholds are met\n- **Set explicit budget limits** before processing batches — fail early rather than overspend\n- **Log model selection decisions** so you can tune thresholds based on real data\n- **Use prompt caching** for system prompts over 1024 tokens — saves both cost and latency\n- **Never retry on authentication or validation errors** — only transient failures (network, rate limit, server error)\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- Using the most expensive model for all requests regardless of complexity\n- Retrying on all errors (wastes budget on permanent failures)\n- Mutating cost tracking state (makes debugging and auditing difficult)\n- Hardcoding model names throughout the codebase (use constants or config)\n- Ignoring prompt caching for repetitive system prompts\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Any application calling Claude, OpenAI, or similar LLM APIs\n- Batch processing pipelines where cost adds up quickly\n- Multi-model architectures that need intelligent routing\n- Production systems that need budget guardrails\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:04:35.888Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"智能AI代理成本优化","ja":"AIエージェントのコスト最適化","ko":"AI 에이전트 비용 최적화","es":"Técnicas de optimización de costos para Agentes de IA","fr":"Outil d''optimisation de coûts pour les Agents d''IA","de":"Kostenoptimierung für KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Pipeline de LLM Otimizado por Custo","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Pipeline LLM с Оптимизацией Стоимости","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: труб#line LLM الموجهة للتكلفة","en":"cost-aware-llm-pipeline"},"description":{"zh":"成本优化模式，用于优化LLM API的成本而不牺牲质量","ja":"AIエージェントのコストを最適化するためのパターン","ko":"LLM API 비용을 최적화하는 패턴","es":"El pipeline de LLM de costo consciente combina enrutamiento de modelos, seguimiento de presupuesto, lógica de reintento y caché de solicitudes para optimizar...","fr":"Le pipeline LLM à conscience de coût combine le routage de modèles, le suivi budgétaire, la logique de réessai et la mise en cache des requêtes pour optimise...","de":"Die kostenbewusste LLM-Pipeline kombiniert Modell-Routing, Budget-Tracking, Wiederholungslogik und Anfrage-Caching, um Kosten zu optimieren","pt":"O pipeline de LLM otimizado por custo combina roteamento de modelo, rastreamento de orçamento, lógica de reintento e cache de prompt para controlar custos de...","ru":"Пайплайн LLM с оптимизацией стоимости объединяет маршрутизацию модели, отслеживание бюджета, логику повторных попыток и кэширование подсказки для контроля за...","ar":"ترب#line LLM الموجهة للتكلفة يدمج маршруطة النموذج وتحديد الميزانية و منطق إعادة المحاولة وذاكرة التخزين المؤقت للتحفيز للسيطرة على تكاليف واجهة برمجة تطبيقا...","en":"Cost optimization patterns for LLM API usage — model routing by task complexity, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching."},"definition":{"en":"Cost optimization patterns for LLM API usage — model routing by task complexity, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching."},"features":{"zh":["模型路由","预算跟踪","重试逻辑","提示缓存"],"ja":["モデルルーティング","予算追跡","再試行ロジック","プロンプトキャッシング"],"ko":["모델 라우팅","예산 추적","재시도 로직","프롬프트 캐싱"],"es":["Enrutamiento de modelos por complejidad de tarea","Seguimiento de presupuesto para controlar costos","Lógica de reintento para manejar errores","Caché de solicitudes para reducir la carga de trabajo","Integración con APIs de LLM como Claude y GPT"],"fr":["Routage de modèles par complexité de tâche","Suivi budgétaire pour contrôler les coûts","Logique de réessai pour gérer les erreurs","Mise en cache des requêtes pour réduire la charge de travail","Intégration avec les API LLM comme Claude et GPT"],"de":["Modell-Routing nach Aufgabenkomplexität","Budget-Tracking zur Kostenkontrolle","Wiederholungslogik zur Fehlerbehandlung","Anfrage-Caching zur Arbeitslastreduzierung","Integration mit LLM-APIs wie Claude und GPT"],"pt":["Roteamento de modelo por complexidade de tarefa","Rastreamento de orçamento para controle de custos","Lógica de reintento para garantir a qualidade","Cache de prompt para otimizar o desempenho","Integração com APIs de LLM como Claude e GPT"],"ru":["Маршрутизация модели по сложности задачи","Отслеживание бюджета для контроля затрат","Логика повторных попыток для обеспечения качества","Кэширование подсказки для оптимизации производительности","Интеграция с API LLM, такими как Claude и GPT"],"ar":["مرشح маршروطة النموذج حسب تعقيد المهمة","تحديد الميزانية للسيطرة على التكاليف","منطق إعادة المحاولة لضمان الجودة","ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت للتحفيز لتحسين الأداء","التكامل مع واجهات برمجة تطبيقات LLM مثل Claude و GPT"]},"keywords":{"zh":["智能AI代理","LLM API","成本优化","模型路由","预算跟踪","重试逻辑","提示缓存"],"ja":["AIエージェント","LLM API","コスト最適化","モデルルーティング","予算追跡","再試行ロジック","プロンプトキャッシング"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","LLM API","비용 최적화","모델 라우팅","예산 추적","재시도 로직","프롬프트 캐싱"],"es":["Agentes de IA","Optimización de costos","LLM","APIs de LLM","Enrutamiento de modelos","Seguimiento de presupuesto","Desarrollo de aplicaciones","Técnicas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Agents d''IA","Optimisation de coûts","LLM","API LLM","Routage de modèles","Suivi budgétaire","Développement d''applications","Techniques de développement"],"de":["KI-Agents","Kostenoptimierung","LLM","LLM-APIs","Modell-Routing","Budget-Tracking","Anwendungsentwicklung","Entwicklungstechniken"],"pt":["Ferramentas de IA","Pipeline de LLM","Otimização de custo","API de LLM","Desenvolvimento de software","Tecnologia de IA","Otimização de desempenho","Controle de custos"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","Пайплайн LLM","Оптимизация стоимости","API LLM","Разработка программного обеспечения","Технология ИИ","Оптимизация производительности","Контроль затрат"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ترب#line LLM","تحسين التكلفة","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات LLM","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الأداء","مراقبة التكاليف"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing cost optimization for LLM API usage.","zh":"适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要优化LLM API的成本。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeのようなAIエージェントに適しています。LLM APIのコスト最適化が必要です。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. LLM API 사용 비용을 최적화해야 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan optimización de costos para el uso de la API de LLM.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin d''une optimisation de coûts pour l''utilisation de l''API LLM.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine Kostenoptimierung für die LLM-API-Nutzung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que precisam de otimização de custos para uso da API LLM.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым требуется оптимизация затрат на использование API LLM.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوسائط الذكية مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى تحسين التكلفة لاستخدام API LLM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize LLM API costs through model routing by task complexity, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching, ensuring quality while staying within budget using protocols like API cost tracking and libraries for task complexity analysis.","zh":"通过任务复杂性路由、预算跟踪、重试逻辑和提示缓存来优化LLM API成本，同时确保质量并保持在预算内，使用诸如API成本跟踪和任务复杂性分析库等协议。","ja":"タスクの複雑さに基づくルーティング、予算の追跡、再試行ロジック、プロンプトのキャッシュを通じて、LLM APIのコストを最適化し、同時に品質を確保し、予算内に留まることを可能にします。APIコスト追跡やタスクの複雑さ分析ライブラリなどのプロトコルを使用します。","ko":"작업 복잡도 라우팅, 예산 추적, 재시도 로직 및 프롬프트 캐싱을 통해 LLM API 비용을 최적화하고 품질을 유지하면서 동시에 예산 안에 머무르는 것을 가능하게 합니다. API 비용 추적 및 작업 복잡도 분석 라이브러리와 같은 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar los costos de la API de LLM a través de la routificación de modelos por complejidad de tarea, seguimiento de presupuesto, lógica de reintento y almacenamiento en caché de solicitudes, garantizando la calidad al mismo tiempo que se mantiene dentro del presupuesto utilizando protocolos como el seguimiento de costos de API y bibliotecas para el análisis de complejidad de tareas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les coûts de l''API LLM grâce à la routage de modèles par complexité de tâche, la traçabilité du budget, la logique de réessai et la mise en cache des invites, en garantissant la qualité tout en restant dans le budget en utilisant des protocoles tels que la traçabilité des coûts d''API et des bibliothèques pour l''analyse de complexité des tâches.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Kosten der LLM-API durch Modellrouten je nach Aufgabenkomplexität, Budgetverfolgung, Wiederholungslogik und Prompt-Caching zu optimieren, während die Qualität gewährleistet wird und innerhalb des Budgets bleibt, indem Protokolle wie API-Kostenverfolgung und Bibliotheken für die Analyse der Aufgabenkomplexität verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar os custos da API LLM por meio de roteamento de modelos por complexidade de tarefa, acompanhamento de orçamento, lógica de repetição e cache de prompts, garantindo a qualidade ao mesmo tempo em que permanece dentro do orçamento usando protocolos como acompanhamento de custos da API e bibliotecas para análise de complexidade de tarefas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать затраты на API LLM путем маршрутизации моделей по сложности задач, отслеживания бюджета, логике повторных попыток и кэширования запросов, обеспечивая качество при одновременном соблюдении бюджета с использованием протоколов, таких как отслеживание затрат на API, и библиотек для анализа сложности задач.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تحسين التكاليف الخاصة بهم لاستخدام API LLM من خلال توجيه النماذج حسب تعقيد المهمة وتتبع الميزانية وطريقة إعادة المحاولة وتخزين مؤقت للطلبات، مع ضمان الجودة في نفس الوقت مع الحفاظ على الميزانية باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تتبع تكاليف API ومكتبات لتحليل تعقيد المهام."},"useCases":{"en":["Routing complex tasks to appropriate LLM models","Implementing budget tracking for API spend optimization","Caching prompts to reduce redundant API calls"],"zh":["将复杂任务路由到适合的LLM模型","实现预算跟踪以优化API支出","缓存提示以减少冗余的API调用"],"ja":["複雑なタスクを適切なLLMモデルにルーティングする","APIの支出を最適化するための予算の追跡を実装する","プロンプトをキャッシュして冗長なAPI呼び出しを減らす"],"ko":["복잡한 작업을 적절한 LLM 모델로 라우팅하는 것","API 지출을 최적화하기 위한 예산 추적 구현","프롬프트를 캐싱하여 중복된 API 호출을 줄이는 것"],"es":["Enrutamiento de tareas complejas a modelos de LLM adecuados","Implementación de seguimiento de presupuesto para la optimización del gasto de API","Almacenamiento en caché de solicitudes para reducir llamadas de API redundantes"],"fr":["Acheminement de tâches complexes à des modèles LLM appropriés","Mise en œuvre de la traçabilité du budget pour l''optimisation des dépenses d''API","Mise en cache des invites pour réduire les appels d''API redondants"],"de":["Weiterleitung komplexer Aufgaben an geeignete LLM-Modelle","Implementierung von Budgetverfolgung für die Optimierung des API-Ausgaben","Caching von Prompts, um redundante API-Aufrufe zu reduzieren"],"pt":["Encaminhamento de tarefas complexas para modelos LLM apropriados","Implementação de acompanhamento de orçamento para otimização de gastos de API","Armazenamento em cache de prompts para reduzir chamadas de API redundantes"],"ru":["Маршрутизация сложных задач на соответствующие модели LLM","Реализация отслеживания бюджета для оптимизации расходов на API","Кэширование запросов для уменьшения избыточных вызовов API"],"ar":["توجيه المهام المعقدة إلى نماذج LLM المناسبة","تنفيذ تتبع الميزانية لتحسين التكاليف الخاصة ب API","تخزين مؤقت للطلبات لتقليل المكالمات الزائدة ل API"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LLM API access","May need custom implementation for specific LLM models like AutoGPT or LangChain"],"zh":["需要LLM API访问","可能需要为特定的LLM模型（如AutoGPT或LangChain）进行自定义实现"],"ja":["LLM APIへのアクセスが必要","特定のLLMモデル（AutoGPTやLangChainなど）のカスタム実装が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["LLM API 액세스가 필요합니다.","AutoGPT 또는 LangChain과 같은 특정 LLM 모델에 대한 사용자 지정 구현이 필요할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de LLM","Puede necesitar una implementación personalizada para modelos de LLM específicos como AutoGPT o LangChain"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API LLM","Peut nécessiter une mise en œuvre personnalisée pour des modèles LLM spécifiques comme AutoGPT ou LangChain"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die LLM-API","Kann eine benutzerdefinierte Implementierung für bestimmte LLM-Modelle wie AutoGPT oder LangChain benötigen"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API LLM","Pode precisar de implementação personalizada para modelos LLM específicos como AutoGPT ou LangChain"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API LLM","Может потребовать индивидуальной реализации для конкретных моделей LLM, таких как AutoGPT или LangChain"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى API LLM","يمكن أن يتطلب تنفيذًا مخصصًا لنماذج LLM محددة مثل AutoGPT أو LangChain"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"79fa629f4cd902c6ac27823860d6139622f81765601ddb8b04943e1331dadfeb","repoEtag":"W/\"364f268e25511efbc6f9c2152da6805d934c8ccbaa49ea479a3da0f27c55af07\"","qualityScore":95}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/springboot-security', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'springboot-security', 50960, 6308, 95, '2026-02-24T12:02:48Z', '2026-02-24T12:06:43.110Z', '9750d7505bc81a050538134d2af22cfdb67c46260cf015f8ad23c648ccca7b5f', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/springboot-security","name":"springboot-security","description":{"zh":"Spring Boot安全最佳实践，包括authn、authz、验证、CSRF、秘密、头部、速率限制和依赖安全","ja":"Spring Bootセキュリティベストプラクティス，包括認証、認可、検証、CSRF、シークレット、ヘッダー、レート制限、依存関係のセキュリティ","ko":"Spring Boot 보안 최고의 실践，包括 인증、인가、검증、CSRF、비밀、헤더、속도 제한 및 종속 보안","es":"Spring Boot Security es una colección de mejores prácticas para la autenticación, autorización y validación de datos en aplicaciones Java Spring Boot","fr":"Spring Boot Security est un ensemble de meilleures pratiques pour l''authentification, l''autorisation et la validation des données dans les applications Java Spring Boot","de":"Spring Boot Security ist eine Sammlung von bewährten Methoden für die Authentifizierung, Autorisierung und Datenvalidierung in Java-Spring-Boot-Anwendungen","pt":"O Spring Boot Security oferece recursos para autenticação, autorização e segurança em serviços Java","ru":"Spring Boot Security предоставляет функции для аутентификации, авторизации и безопасности в сервисах Java","ar":"يوفر سبرينغ بوت للأمان ميزات للمصادقة والتفويض والأمان في خدمات جافا","en":"Spring Security best practices for authn/authz, validation, CSRF, secrets, headers, rate limiting, and dependency security in Java Spring Boot services."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":50960,"forks":6308,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:48Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"springboot-security","description":"Spring Security best practices for authn/authz, validation, CSRF, secrets, headers, rate limiting, and dependency security in Java Spring Boot services.","bodyPreview":"# Spring Boot Security Review\n\nUse when adding auth, handling input, creating endpoints, or dealing with secrets.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Adding authentication (JWT, OAuth2, session-based)\n- Implementing authorization (@PreAuthorize, role-based access)\n- Validating user input (Bean Validation, custom validators)\n- Configuring CORS, CSRF, or security headers\n- Managing secrets (Vault, environment variables)\n- Adding rate limiting or brute-force protection\n- Scanning dependencies for CVEs\n\n## Auth","body":"# Spring Boot Security Review\n\nUse when adding auth, handling input, creating endpoints, or dealing with secrets.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Adding authentication (JWT, OAuth2, session-based)\n- Implementing authorization (@PreAuthorize, role-based access)\n- Validating user input (Bean Validation, custom validators)\n- Configuring CORS, CSRF, or security headers\n- Managing secrets (Vault, environment variables)\n- Adding rate limiting or brute-force protection\n- Scanning dependencies for CVEs\n\n## Authentication\n\n- Prefer stateless JWT or opaque tokens with revocation list\n- Use `httpOnly`, `Secure`, `SameSite=Strict` cookies for sessions\n- Validate tokens with `OncePerRequestFilter` or resource server\n\n```java\n@Component\npublic class JwtAuthFilter extends OncePerRequestFilter {\n  private final JwtService jwtService;\n\n  public JwtAuthFilter(JwtService jwtService) {\n    this.jwtService = jwtService;\n  }\n\n  @Override\n  protected void doFilterInternal(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response,\n      FilterChain chain) throws ServletException, IOException {\n    String header = request.getHeader(HttpHeaders.AUTHORIZATION);\n    if (header != null && header.startsWith(\"Bearer \")) {\n      String token = header.substring(7);\n      Authentication auth = jwtService.authenticate(token);\n      SecurityContextHolder.getContext().setAuthentication(auth);\n    }\n    chain.doFilter(request, response);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Authorization\n\n- Enable method security: `@EnableMethodSecurity`\n- Use `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(''ADMIN'')\")` or `@PreAuthorize(\"@authz.canEdit(#id)\")`\n- Deny by default; expose only required scopes\n\n```java\n@RestController\n@RequestMapping(\"/api/admin\")\npublic class AdminController {\n\n  @PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(''ADMIN'')\")\n  @GetMapping(\"/users\")\n  public List<UserDto> listUsers() {\n    return userService.findAll();\n  }\n\n  @PreAuthorize(\"@authz.isOwner(#id, authentication)\")\n  @DeleteMapping(\"/users/{id}\")\n  public ResponseEntity<Void> deleteUser(@PathVariable Long id) {\n    userService.delete(id);\n    return ResponseEntity.noContent().build();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Input Validation\n\n- Use Bean Validation with `@Valid` on controllers\n- Apply constraints on DTOs: `@NotBlank`, `@Email`, `@Size`, custom validators\n- Sanitize any HTML with a whitelist before rendering\n\n```java\n// BAD: No validation\n@PostMapping(\"/users\")\npublic User createUser(@RequestBody UserDto dto) {\n  return userService.create(dto);\n}\n\n// GOOD: Validated DTO\npublic record CreateUserDto(\n    @NotBlank @Size(max = 100) String name,\n    @NotBlank @Email String email,\n    @NotNull @Min(0) @Max(150) Integer age\n) {}\n\n@PostMapping(\"/users\")\npublic ResponseEntity<UserDto> createUser(@Valid @RequestBody CreateUserDto dto) {\n  return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.CREATED)\n      .body(userService.create(dto));\n}\n```\n\n## SQL Injection Prevention\n\n- Use Spring Data repositories or parameterized queries\n- For native queries, use `:param` bindings; never concatenate strings\n\n```java\n// BAD: String concatenation in native query\n@Query(value = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = ''\" + name + \"''\", nativeQuery = true)\n\n// GOOD: Parameterized native query\n@Query(value = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = :name\", nativeQuery = true)\nList<User> findByName(@Param(\"name\") String name);\n\n// GOOD: Spring Data derived query (auto-parameterized)\nList<User> findByEmailAndActiveTrue(String email);\n```\n\n## Password Encoding\n\n- Always hash passwords with BCrypt or Argon2 — never store plaintext\n- Use `PasswordEncoder` bean, not manual hashing\n\n```java\n@Bean\npublic PasswordEncoder passwordEncoder() {\n  return new BCryptPasswordEncoder(12); // cost factor 12\n}\n\n// In service\npublic User register(CreateUserDto dto) {\n  String hashedPassword = passwordEncoder.encode(dto.password());\n  return userRepository.save(new User(dto.email(), hashedPassword));\n}\n```\n\n## CSRF Protection\n\n- For browser session apps, keep CSRF enabled; include token in forms/headers\n- For pure APIs with Bearer tokens, disable CSRF and rely on stateless auth\n\n```java\nhttp\n  .csrf(csrf -> csrf.disable())\n  .sessionManagement(sm -> sm.sessionCreationPolicy(SessionCreationPolicy.STATELESS));\n```\n\n## Secrets Management\n\n- No secrets in source; load from env or vault\n- Keep `application.yml` free of credentials; use placeholders\n- Rotate tokens and DB credentials regularly\n\n```yaml\n# BAD: Hardcoded in application.yml\nspring:\n  datasource:\n    password: mySecretPassword123\n\n# GOOD: Environment variable placeholder\nspring:\n  datasource:\n    password: ${DB_PASSWORD}\n\n# GOOD: Spring Cloud Vault integration\nspring:\n  cloud:\n    vault:\n      uri: https://vault.example.com\n      token: ${VAULT_TOKEN}\n```\n\n## Security Headers\n\n```java\nhttp\n  .headers(headers -> headers\n    .contentSecurityPolicy(csp -> csp\n      .policyDirectives(\"default-src ''self''\"))\n    .frameOptions(HeadersConfigurer.FrameOptionsConfig::sameOrigin)\n    .xssProtection(Customizer.withDefaults())\n    .referrerPolicy(rp -> rp.policy(ReferrerPolicyHeaderWriter.ReferrerPolicy.NO_REFERRER)));\n```\n\n## CORS Configuration\n\n- Configure CORS at the security filter level, not per-controller\n- Restrict allowed origins — never use `*` in production\n\n```java\n@Bean\npublic CorsConfigurationSource corsConfigurationSource() {\n  CorsConfiguration config = new CorsConfiguration();\n  config.setAllowedOrigins(List.of(\"https://app.example.com\"));\n  config.setAllowedMethods(List.of(\"GET\", \"POST\", \"PUT\", \"DELETE\"));\n  config.setAllowedHeaders(List.of(\"Authorization\", \"Content-Type\"));\n  config.setAllowCredentials(true);\n  config.setMaxAge(3600L);\n\n  UrlBasedCorsConfigurationSource source = new UrlBasedCorsConfigurationSource();\n  source.registerCorsConfiguration(\"/api/**\", config);\n  return source;\n}\n\n// In SecurityFilterChain:\nhttp.cors(cors -> cors.configurationSource(corsConfigurationSource()));\n```\n\n## Rate Limiting\n\n- Apply Bucket4j or gateway-level limits on expensive endpoints\n- Log and alert on bursts; return 429 with retry hints\n\n```java\n// Using Bucket4j for per-endpoint rate limiting\n@Component\npublic class RateLimitFilter extends OncePerRequestFilter {\n  private final Map<String, Bucket> buckets = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();\n\n  private Bucket createBucket() {\n    return Bucket.builder()\n        .addLimit(Bandwidth.classic(100, Refill.intervally(100, Duration.ofMinutes(1))))\n        .build();\n  }\n\n  @Override\n  protected void doFilterInternal(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response,\n      FilterChain chain) throws ServletException, IOException {\n    String clientIp = request.getRemoteAddr();\n    Bucket bucket = buckets.computeIfAbsent(clientIp, k -> createBucket());\n\n    if (bucket.tryConsume(1)) {\n      chain.doFilter(request, response);\n    } else {\n      response.setStatus(HttpStatus.TOO_MANY_REQUESTS.value());\n      response.getWriter().write(\"{\\\"error\\\": \\\"Rate limit exceeded\\\"}\");\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Dependency Security\n\n- Run OWASP Dependency Check / Snyk in CI\n- Keep Spring Boot and Spring Security on supported versions\n- Fail builds on known CVEs\n\n## Logging and PII\n\n- Never log secrets, tokens, passwords, or full PAN data\n- Redact sensitive fields; use structured JSON logging\n\n## File Uploads\n\n- Validate size, content type, and extension\n- Store outside web root; scan if required\n\n## Checklist Before Release\n\n- [ ] Auth tokens validated and expired correctly\n- [ ] Authorization guards on every sensitive path\n- [ ] All inputs validated and sanitized\n- [ ] No string-concatenated SQL\n- [ ] CSRF posture correct for app type\n- [ ] Secrets externalized; none committed\n- [ ] Security headers configured\n- [ ] Rate limiting on APIs\n- [ ] Dependencies scanned and up to date\n- [ ] Logs free of sensitive data\n\n**Remember**: Deny by default, validate inputs, least privilege, and secure-by-configuration first.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:06:43.110Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理Spring Boot安全最佳实践","ja":"AIエージェントのためのSpring Bootセキュリティベストプラクティス","ko":"AI 에이전트를 위한 Spring Boot 보안 최고의 실践","es":"Herramientas de seguridad de Spring Boot para desarrollad...","fr":"Outils de sécurité Spring Boot pour les développeurs","de":"Spring Boot Sicherheitstools für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de Segurança Spring Boot com Agentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Spring Boot Security","ar":"أدوات الأمان سبرينغ بوت مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"springboot-security"},"description":{"zh":"Spring Boot安全最佳实践，包括authn、authz、验证、CSRF、秘密、头部、速率限制和依赖安全","ja":"Spring Bootセキュリティベストプラクティス，包括認証、認可、検証、CSRF、シークレット、ヘッダー、レート制限、依存関係のセキュリティ","ko":"Spring Boot 보안 최고의 실践，包括 인증、인가、검증、CSRF、비밀、헤더、속도 제한 및 종속 보안","es":"Spring Boot Security es una colección de mejores prácticas para la autenticación, autorización y validación de datos en aplicaciones Java Spring Boot","fr":"Spring Boot Security est un ensemble de meilleures pratiques pour l''authentification, l''autorisation et la validation des données dans les applications Java ...","de":"Spring Boot Security ist eine Sammlung von bewährten Methoden für die Authentifizierung, Autorisierung und Datenvalidierung in Java-Spring-Boot-Anwendungen","pt":"O Spring Boot Security oferece recursos para autenticação, autorização e segurança em serviços Java","ru":"Spring Boot Security предоставляет функции для аутентификации, авторизации и безопасности в сервисах Java","ar":"يوفر سبرينغ بوت للأمان ميزات للمصادقة والتفويض والأمان في خدمات جافا","en":"Spring Security best practices for authn/authz, validation, CSRF, secrets, headers, rate limiting, and dependency security in Java Spring Boot services."},"definition":{"en":"Spring Security best practices for authn/authz, validation, CSRF, secrets, headers, rate limiting, and dependency security in Java Spring Boot services."},"features":{"zh":["实现authn和authz","验证用户输入","配置CORS和CSRF","管理秘密和头部","添加速率限制和暴力破解保护","扫描依赖项的CVE"],"ja":["認証と認可の実現","ユーザー入力の検証","CORSとCSRFの設定","シークレットとヘッダーの管理","レート制限とブルートフォース保護の追加","依存関係のCVEのスキャン"],"ko":["인증과 인가의 구현","사용자 입력의 검증","CORS와 CSRF의 설정","비밀과 헤더의 관리","속도 제한과暴力破解 보호의 추가","종속関係의 CVE의 스キャн"],"es":["Autenticación y autorización con JWT, OAuth2 y sesiones","Validación de datos con Bean Validation y validadores personalizados","Configuración de CORS, CSRF y encabezados de seguridad","Gestión de secretos con Vault y variables de entorno","Limitación de velocidad y protección contra ataques de fuerza bruta","Análisis de dependencias para vulnerabilidades de seguridad"],"fr":["Authentification et autorisation avec JWT, OAuth2 et sessions","Validation des données avec Bean Validation et validateurs personnalisés","Configuration de CORS, CSRF et en-têtes de sécurité","Gestion des secrets avec Vault et variables d''environnement","Limitation de vitesse et protection contre les attaques de force brute","Analyse des dépendances pour les vulnérabilités de sécurité"],"de":["Authentifizierung und Autorisierung mit JWT, OAuth2 und Sitzungen","Datenvalidierung mit Bean Validation und benutzerdefinierten Validatoren","Konfiguration von CORS, CSRF und Sicherheitsheadern","Verwaltung von Geheimnissen mit Vault und Umgebungsvariablen","Rate Limiting und Schutz vor Brute-Force-Angriffen","Abhängigkeitsanalyse für Sicherheitslücken"],"pt":["Autenticação com JWT, OAuth2 e sessões","Autorização com @PreAuthorize e acesso baseado em papéis","Validação de entrada de usuário com Bean Validation","Configuração de CORS, CSRF e cabeçalhos de segurança","Gerenciamento de segredos com Vault e variáveis de ambiente","Adicionando limitação de taxa e proteção contra força bruta"],"ru":["Аутентификация с помощью JWT, OAuth2 и сессий","Авторизация с помощью @PreAuthorize и ролевого доступа","Валидация пользовательского ввода с помощью Bean Validation","Настройка CORS, CSRF и заголовков безопасности","Управление секретами с помощью Vault и переменных среды","Добавление ограничения скорости и защиты от брутфорса"],"ar":["المصادقة باستخدام JWT و OAuth2 و الدورات","التفويض باستخدام @PreAuthorize و الوصول المبني على الأدوار","التحقق من صحة مدخلات المستخدم باستخدام Bean Validation","تكوين CORS و CSRF و رؤوس الأمان","إدارة الأسرار باستخدام Vault و متغيرات البيئة","إضافة حماية من الإفراط في الطلب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Spring Boot安全","AI智能代理","authn","authz","验证","CSRF","秘密","头部","速率限制","依赖安全"],"ja":["Spring Bootセキュリティ","AIエージェント","認証","認可","検証","CSRF","シークレット","ヘッダー","レート制限","依存関係のセキュリティ"],"ko":["Spring Boot 보안","AI 에이전트","인증","인가","검증","CSRF","비밀","헤더","속도 제한","종속 보안"],"es":["seguridad de Spring Boot","autenticación y autorización","validación de datos","CORS y CSRF","gestión de secretos","limitación de velocidad","análisis de dependencias","herramientas de seguridad para desarrolladores","mejores prácticas de seguridad"],"fr":["sécurité Spring Boot","authentification et autorisation","validation des données","CORS et CSRF","gestion des secrets","limitation de vitesse","analyse des dépendances","outils de sécurité pour les développeurs","meilleures pratiques de sécurité"],"de":["Spring-Boot-Sicherheit","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Datenvalidierung","CORS und CSRF","Geheimnisverwaltung","Rate Limiting","Abhängigkeitsanalyse","Sicherheitstools für Entwickler","Sicherheitsbest-Practices"],"pt":["Spring Boot Security","Autenticação Java","Autorização Spring Boot","Segurança em Serviços Java","Agentes de IA para Segurança","Ferramentas de Desenvolvimento de Segurança","Melhores Práticas de Segurança Spring Boot"],"ru":["Spring Boot Security","Аутентификация Java","Авторизация Spring Boot","Безопасность в сервисах Java","ИИ Агенты для безопасности","Инструменты разработки безопасности","Лучшие практики безопасности Spring Boot"],"ar":["سبرينغ بوت للأمان","المصادقة جافا","التفويض سبرينغ بوت","أمان خدمات جافا","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي للأمان","أدوات تطوير الأمان","أفضل الممارسات للأمان سبرينغ بوت"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Java-based AI Agents requiring robust security configurations in Spring Boot services, particularly those leveraging OAuth2, JWT, and role-based access control","zh":"适用于需要在 Spring Boot 服务中配置强大的安全设置的基于 Java 的 AI代理，特别是那些利用 OAuth2、JWT 和基于角色的访问控制的代理","ja":"Spring Boot サービスでロバストなセキュリティ設定を必要とする Java ベースの AI エージェントに適しています。特に、OAuth2、JWT、ロールベースのアクセス制御を利用するもの","ko":"Spring Boot 서비스에서 강력한 보안 설정을 필요로 하는 자바 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 특히 OAuth2, JWT 및 역할 기반 액세스 제어를 활용하는 에이전트","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Java que requieren configuraciones de seguridad robustas en servicios de Spring Boot, particularmente aquellos que aprovechan OAuth2, JWT y control de acceso basado en roles","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Java nécessitant des configurations de sécurité robustes dans les services Spring Boot, en particulier ceux qui utilisent OAuth2, JWT et contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles","de":"Ideal für Java-basierte KI-Agents, die robuste Sicherheitskonfigurationen in Spring-Boot-Diensten erfordern, insbesondere solche, die OAuth2, JWT und rollenbasierte Zugriffskontrolle nutzen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Java que exigem configurações de segurança robustas em serviços Spring Boot, particularmente aqueles que utilizam OAuth2, JWT e controle de acesso baseado em funções","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, основанных на Java, требующих надежных конфигураций безопасности в сервисах Spring Boot, особенно тех, которые используют OAuth2, JWT и контроль доступа на основе ролей","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التمثيل الذكي القائمة على Java التي تتطلب تكوينات أمان قوية في خدمات Spring Boot، لا سيما تلك التي تستخدم OAuth2 و JWT ومراقبة الوصول القائم على الأدوار"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce stringent security measures including authentication, authorization, input validation, and dependency scanning, utilizing Spring Security features like @PreAuthorize and Bean Validation, while also managing secrets and configuring security headers for enhanced protection","zh":"赋予代理强制执行严格的安全措施的能力，包括身份验证、授权、输入验证和依赖项扫描，利用 Spring Security 的功能，如 @PreAuthorize 和 Bean Validation，同时也管理机密并配置安全头以增强保护","ja":"エージェントが厳格なセキュリティ対策を実施する能力を付与します。認証、認可、入力検証、依存関係のスキャンなどを実施し、@PreAuthorizeやBean ValidationなどのSpring Securityの機能を利用します。さらに、シークレットの管理やセキュリティヘッダーの設定も行い、保護を強化します","ko":"에이전트가 강력한 보안 조치를 시행할 수 있는 기능을 부여합니다. 인증, 인가, 입력 검증 및 종속성 스캔 등을 시행하며 @PreAuthorize 및 Bean Validation과 같은 Spring Security 기능을 활용합니다. 또한 기밀을 관리하고 보안 헤더를 구성하여 보호를 강화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar estrictas medidas de seguridad, incluyendo autenticación, autorización, validación de entrada y análisis de dependencias, utilizando características de Spring Security como @PreAuthorize y Bean Validation, y también gestionando secretos y configurando encabezados de seguridad para una mayor protección","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des mesures de sécurité strictes, notamment l''authentification, l''autorisation, la validation des entrées et l''analyse des dépendances, en utilisant des fonctionnalités de Spring Security telles que @PreAuthorize et Bean Validation, tout en gérant les secrets et en configurant les en-têtes de sécurité pour une protection renforcée","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, strenge Sicherheitsmaßnahmen durchzusetzen, einschließlich Authentifizierung, Autorisierung, Eingabevalidierung und Abhängigkeitsanalyse, unter Verwendung von Spring-Security-Features wie @PreAuthorize und Bean-Validierung, und verwaltet auch Geheimnisse und konfiguriert Sicherheitsheader für einen verbesserten Schutz","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem medidas de segurança rigorosas, incluindo autenticação, autorização, validação de entrada e digitalização de dependências, utilizando recursos do Spring Security como @PreAuthorize e Bean Validation, enquanto também gerencia segredos e configura cabeçalhos de segurança para proteção reforçada","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать строгие меры безопасности, включая аутентификацию, авторизацию, проверку ввода и сканирование зависимостей, используя функции Spring Security, такие как @PreAuthorize и Bean Validation, а также управляет секретами и настраивает заголовки безопасности для повышенной защиты","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من فرض إجراءات أمنية صارمة، بما في ذلك المصادقة والتفويض وتصديق المدخلات وفحص الاعتماديات، باستخدام ميزات Spring Security مثل @PreAuthorize و Bean Validation، بينما يقوم أيضًا بإدارة الأسرار وتكوين رؤوس الأمان للحماية المعززة"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing authentication and authorization mechanisms using JWT and OAuth2","Configuring CORS and CSRF protection for RESTful endpoints","Validating user input using Bean Validation and custom validators to prevent common web vulnerabilities","Managing secrets securely through Vault or environment variables","Scanning dependencies for known vulnerabilities and applying rate limiting to prevent brute-force attacks"],"zh":["使用 JWT 和 OAuth2 实现身份验证和授权机制","为 RESTful 端点配置 CORS 和 CSRF 保护","使用 Bean Validation 和自定义验证器验证用户输入以防止常见的 Web 脆弱性","通过 Vault 或环境变量安全地管理机密","扫描依赖项以查找已知的漏洞并应用速率限制以防止暴力攻击"],"ja":["JWTとOAuth2を使用した認証と認可メカニズムの実装","RESTfulエンドポイントのCORSとCSRF保護の構成","Bean Validationとカスタムバリデータを使用したユーザー入力の検証によるWebの一般的な脆弱性の防止","Vaultまたは環境変数を使用したシークレットの安全な管理","既知の脆弱性の検出と暴力攻撃の防止のための依存関係のスキャンとレート制限の適用"],"ko":["JWT 및 OAuth2를 사용한 인증 및 인가 메커니즘 구현","RESTful 엔드ポイント의 CORS 및 CSRF 보호 구성","Bean Validation 및 사용자 정의 검증기를 사용한 사용자 입력 검증을 통해 일반적인 웹 취약점 방지","Vault 또는 환경 변수를 사용한 기밀의 안전한 관리","알려진 취약점 검색 및 무차별 대입 공격 방지를 위한 종속성 스캔 및 속도 제한 적용"],"es":["Implementar mecanismos de autenticación y autorización utilizando JWT y OAuth2","Configurar la protección CORS y CSRF para puntos de conexión RESTful","Validar la entrada del usuario utilizando Bean Validation y validadores personalizados para prevenir vulnerabilidades web comunes","Gestionar secretos de manera segura a través de Vault o variables de entorno","Analizar dependencias en busca de vulnerabilidades conocidas y aplicar una limitación de velocidad para prevenir ataques de fuerza bruta"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des mécanismes d''authentification et d''autorisation en utilisant JWT et OAuth2","Configurer la protection CORS et CSRF pour les points de terminaison RESTful","Valider les entrées utilisateur en utilisant Bean Validation et des validateurs personnalisés pour prévenir les vulnérabilités Web courantes","Gérer les secrets de manière sécurisée via Vault ou des variables d''environnement","Analyser les dépendances pour détecter les vulnérabilités connues et appliquer une limitation de débit pour prévenir les attaques de force brute"],"de":["Implementierung von Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungsmechanismen unter Verwendung von JWT und OAuth2","Konfigurieren des CORS- und CSRF-Schutzes für RESTful-Endpunkte","Validierung der Benutzereingaben unter Verwendung von Bean-Validierung und benutzerdefinierten Validierern, um gängige Web-Schwachstellen zu verhindern","Sicheres Verwalten von Geheimnissen über Vault oder Umgebungsvariablen","Analyse der Abhängigkeiten auf bekannte Schwachstellen und Anwendung einer Rate Limitierung, um Brute-Force-Angriffe zu verhindern"],"pt":["Implementação de mecanismos de autenticação e autorização usando JWT e OAuth2","Configuração de proteção CORS e CSRF para pontos finais RESTful","Validação de entrada do usuário usando Bean Validation e validadores personalizados para prevenir vulnerabilidades comuns da web","Gerenciamento seguro de segredos por meio do Vault ou variáveis de ambiente","Digitalização de dependências para vulnerabilidades conhecidas e aplicação de limitação de taxa para prevenir ataques de força bruta"],"ru":["Реализация механизмов аутентификации и авторизации с использованием JWT и OAuth2","Настройка защиты CORS и CSRF для RESTful-точек","Проверка ввода пользователя с помощью Bean Validation и пользовательских валидаторов для предотвращения распространенных уязвимостей веб-приложений","Безопасное управление секретами с помощью Vault или переменных среды","Сканирование зависимостей на наличие известных уязвимостей и применение ограничения скорости для предотвращения атак методом перебора"],"ar":["تنفيذ آليات المصادقة والتفويض باستخدام JWT و OAuth2","تكوين حماية CORS و CSRF لنقاط النهاية RESTful","تحقق من مدخلات المستخدم باستخدام Bean Validation والمدققين المخصصين لمنع نقاط الضعف الشائعة في تطبيقات الويب","إدارة الأسرار بشكل آمن من خلال Vault أو متغيرات البيئة","فحص الاعتماديات للكشف عن نقاط الضعف المعروفة وتطبيق حد للمعدل لمنع الهجمات القائمة على القوة Bruteforce"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Java Spring Boot environment","Dependent on Spring Security framework","May require additional configuration for specific authentication protocols like OAuth2"],"zh":["需要 Java Spring Boot 环境","依赖于 Spring Security 框架","可能需要对特定的身份验证协议（如 OAuth2）进行额外的配置"],"ja":["Java Spring Boot 環境が必要","Spring Security フレームワークに依存する","特定の認証プロトコル（例：OAuth2）に対して追加の構成が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["Java Spring Boot 환경이 필요함","Spring Security 프레임워크에 의존함","특정 인증 프로토콜(예: OAuth2)에 대한 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere un entorno Java Spring Boot","Depende del marco de seguridad de Spring","Puede requerir una configuración adicional para protocolos de autenticación específicos como OAuth2"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Java Spring Boot","Dépend du framework de sécurité Spring","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour des protocoles d''authentification spécifiques tels que OAuth2"],"de":["Benötigt eine Java-Spring-Boot-Umgebung","Hängt vom Spring-Sicherheitsframework ab","Kann eine zusätzliche Konfiguration für spezifische Authentifizierungsprotokolle wie OAuth2 erfordern"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Java Spring Boot","Depende do framework Spring Security","Pode exigir configuração adicional para protocolos de autenticação específicos como OAuth2"],"ru":["Требует среды Java Spring Boot","Зависит от фреймворка Spring Security","Может требовать дополнительной настройки для конкретных протоколов аутентификации, таких как OAuth2"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Java Spring Boot","يعتمد على إطار Spring Security","قد يتطلب تكوينًا إضافيًا لبروتوكولات المصادقة المحددة مثل OAuth2"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9750d7505bc81a050538134d2af22cfdb67c46260cf015f8ad23c648ccca7b5f","repoEtag":"W/\"364f268e25511efbc6f9c2152da6805d934c8ccbaa49ea479a3da0f27c55af07\"","qualityScore":95}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/springboot-tdd', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'springboot-tdd', 50960, 6308, 95, '2026-02-24T12:02:48Z', '2026-02-24T12:06:43.576Z', 'f0696338cd733bc2a91ebdeea260d284634445d82af321cb009fa4a80d0c3ad7', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/springboot-tdd","name":"springboot-tdd","description":{"zh":"Spring Boot TDD开发流程，使用JUnit 5、Mockito、MockMvc、Testcontainers和JaCoCo实现高效的测试驱动开发","ja":"Spring Boot TDD開発プロセス、JUnit 5、Mockito、MockMvc、Testcontainers、JaCoCoを使用して効率的なテスト駆動開発を実現","ko":"스프링 부트 TDD 개발 프로세스, JUnit 5, Mockito, MockMvc, Testcontainers, JaCoCo를 사용하여 효율적인 테스트 주도 개발을 구현","es":"Desarrolla aplicaciones Spring Boot con pruebas unitarias y de integración utilizando JUnit 5, Mockito y JaCoCo","fr":"Développez des applications Spring Boot avec des tests unitaires et d''intégration utilisant JUnit 5, Mockito et JaCoCo","de":"Entwickeln Sie Spring-Boot-Anwendungen mit Einheitstests und Integrationstests unter Verwendung von JUnit 5, Mockito und JaCoCo","pt":"O springboot-tdd é uma habilidade de agente de IA que fornece orientação de TDD para serviços Spring Boot com cobertura de 80% ou mais","ru":"Springboot-tdd - это навык ИИ Агента, который предоставляет руководство по TDD для сервисов Spring Boot с покрытием 80% или более","ar":"سبرينج بوت-تي دي دي هو مهارة وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي التي توفر إرشادات التطوير الموجهة بالتحقق لتطبيقات سبرينج بوت مع تغطية 80% أو أكثر","en":"Test-driven development for Spring Boot using JUnit 5, Mockito, MockMvc, Testcontainers, and JaCoCo. Use when adding features, fixing bugs, or refactoring."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":50960,"forks":6308,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:48Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"springboot-tdd","description":"Test-driven development for Spring Boot using JUnit 5, Mockito, MockMvc, Testcontainers, and JaCoCo. Use when adding features, fixing bugs, or refactoring.","bodyPreview":"# Spring Boot TDD Workflow\n\nTDD guidance for Spring Boot services with 80%+ coverage (unit + integration).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- New features or endpoints\n- Bug fixes or refactors\n- Adding data access logic or security rules\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) Write tests first (they should fail)\n2) Implement minimal code to pass\n3) Refactor with tests green\n4) Enforce coverage (JaCoCo)\n\n## Unit Tests (JUnit 5 + Mockito)\n\n```java\n@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)\nclass MarketServiceTest {\n  @Mock MarketRepository r","body":"# Spring Boot TDD Workflow\n\nTDD guidance for Spring Boot services with 80%+ coverage (unit + integration).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- New features or endpoints\n- Bug fixes or refactors\n- Adding data access logic or security rules\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) Write tests first (they should fail)\n2) Implement minimal code to pass\n3) Refactor with tests green\n4) Enforce coverage (JaCoCo)\n\n## Unit Tests (JUnit 5 + Mockito)\n\n```java\n@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)\nclass MarketServiceTest {\n  @Mock MarketRepository repo;\n  @InjectMocks MarketService service;\n\n  @Test\n  void createsMarket() {\n    CreateMarketRequest req = new CreateMarketRequest(\"name\", \"desc\", Instant.now(), List.of(\"cat\"));\n    when(repo.save(any())).thenAnswer(inv -> inv.getArgument(0));\n\n    Market result = service.create(req);\n\n    assertThat(result.name()).isEqualTo(\"name\");\n    verify(repo).save(any());\n  }\n}\n```\n\nPatterns:\n- Arrange-Act-Assert\n- Avoid partial mocks; prefer explicit stubbing\n- Use `@ParameterizedTest` for variants\n\n## Web Layer Tests (MockMvc)\n\n```java\n@WebMvcTest(MarketController.class)\nclass MarketControllerTest {\n  @Autowired MockMvc mockMvc;\n  @MockBean MarketService marketService;\n\n  @Test\n  void returnsMarkets() throws Exception {\n    when(marketService.list(any())).thenReturn(Page.empty());\n\n    mockMvc.perform(get(\"/api/markets\"))\n        .andExpect(status().isOk())\n        .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.content\").isArray());\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Integration Tests (SpringBootTest)\n\n```java\n@SpringBootTest\n@AutoConfigureMockMvc\n@ActiveProfiles(\"test\")\nclass MarketIntegrationTest {\n  @Autowired MockMvc mockMvc;\n\n  @Test\n  void createsMarket() throws Exception {\n    mockMvc.perform(post(\"/api/markets\")\n        .contentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)\n        .content(\"\"\"\n          {\"name\":\"Test\",\"description\":\"Desc\",\"endDate\":\"2030-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"categories\":[\"general\"]}\n        \"\"\"))\n      .andExpect(status().isCreated());\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Persistence Tests (DataJpaTest)\n\n```java\n@DataJpaTest\n@AutoConfigureTestDatabase(replace = AutoConfigureTestDatabase.Replace.NONE)\n@Import(TestContainersConfig.class)\nclass MarketRepositoryTest {\n  @Autowired MarketRepository repo;\n\n  @Test\n  void savesAndFinds() {\n    MarketEntity entity = new MarketEntity();\n    entity.setName(\"Test\");\n    repo.save(entity);\n\n    Optional<MarketEntity> found = repo.findByName(\"Test\");\n    assertThat(found).isPresent();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Testcontainers\n\n- Use reusable containers for Postgres/Redis to mirror production\n- Wire via `@DynamicPropertySource` to inject JDBC URLs into Spring context\n\n## Coverage (JaCoCo)\n\nMaven snippet:\n```xml\n<plugin>\n  <groupId>org.jacoco</groupId>\n  <artifactId>jacoco-maven-plugin</artifactId>\n  <version>0.8.14</version>\n  <executions>\n    <execution>\n      <goals><goal>prepare-agent</goal></goals>\n    </execution>\n    <execution>\n      <id>report</id>\n      <phase>verify</phase>\n      <goals><goal>report</goal></goals>\n    </execution>\n  </executions>\n</plugin>\n```\n\n## Assertions\n\n- Prefer AssertJ (`assertThat`) for readability\n- For JSON responses, use `jsonPath`\n- For exceptions: `assertThatThrownBy(...)`\n\n## Test Data Builders\n\n```java\nclass MarketBuilder {\n  private String name = \"Test\";\n  MarketBuilder withName(String name) { this.name = name; return this; }\n  Market build() { return new Market(null, name, MarketStatus.ACTIVE); }\n}\n```\n\n## CI Commands\n\n- Maven: `mvn -T 4 test` or `mvn verify`\n- Gradle: `./gradlew test jacocoTestReport`\n\n**Remember**: Keep tests fast, isolated, and deterministic. Test behavior, not implementation details.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:06:43.576Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：Spring Boot TDD开发","ja":"AIエージェント：Spring Boot TDD開発","ko":"AI 에이전트: 스프링 부트 TDD 개발","es":"Herramientas de TDD para Spring Boot con Agentes de IA","fr":"Outils de TDD pour Spring Boot avec Agents d''IA","de":"TDD-Tools für Spring Boot mit KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de TDD para Spring Boot com Agentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты для TDD в Spring Boot","ar":"أدوات التطوير الموجهة بالتحقق لاسبرينج بوت مع وكلاء الذكا...","en":"springboot-tdd"},"description":{"zh":"Spring Boot TDD开发流程，使用JUnit 5、Mockito、MockMvc、Testcontainers和JaCoCo实现高效的测试驱动开发","ja":"Spring Boot TDD開発プロセス、JUnit 5、Mockito、MockMvc、Testcontainers、JaCoCoを使用して効率的なテスト駆動開発を実現","ko":"스프링 부트 TDD 개발 프로세스, JUnit 5, Mockito, MockMvc, Testcontainers, JaCoCo를 사용하여 효율적인 테스트 주도 개발을 구현","es":"Desarrolla aplicaciones Spring Boot con pruebas unitarias y de integración utilizando JUnit 5, Mockito y JaCoCo","fr":"Développez des applications Spring Boot avec des tests unitaires et d''intégration utilisant JUnit 5, Mockito et JaCoCo","de":"Entwickeln Sie Spring-Boot-Anwendungen mit Einheitstests und Integrationstests unter Verwendung von JUnit 5, Mockito und JaCoCo","pt":"O springboot-tdd é uma habilidade de agente de IA que fornece orientação de TDD para serviços Spring Boot com cobertura de 80% ou mais","ru":"Springboot-tdd - это навык ИИ Агента, который предоставляет руководство по TDD для сервисов Spring Boot с покрытием 80% или более","ar":"سبرينج بوت-تي دي دي هو مهارة وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي التي توفر إرشادات التطوير الموجهة بالتحقق لتطبيقات سبرينج بوت مع تغطية 80% أو أكثر","en":"Test-driven development for Spring Boot using JUnit 5, Mockito, MockMvc, Testcontainers, and JaCoCo. Use when adding features, fixing bugs, or refactoring."},"definition":{"en":"Test-driven development for Spring Boot using JUnit 5, Mockito, MockMvc, Testcontainers, and JaCoCo. Use when adding features, fixing bugs, or refactoring."},"features":{"zh":["使用JUnit 5和Mockito进行单元测试","使用MockMvc和Testcontainers进行集成测试","使用JaCoCo实现代码覆盖率分析","支持TDD开发流程","提高代码质量和开发效率"],"ja":["JUnit 5とMockitoを使用したユニットテスト","MockMvcとTestcontainersを使用した統合テスト","JaCoCoを使用したコードカバレッジ分析","TDD開発プロセスのサポート","コード品質と開発効率の向上"],"ko":["JUnit 5와 Mockito를 사용한 유닛 테스트","MockMvc와 Testcontainers를 사용한 통합 테스트","JaCoCo를 사용한 코드 커버리지 분석","TDD 개발 프로세스 지원","코드 품질과 개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Pruebas unitarias con JUnit 5","Pruebas de integración con MockMvc","Cobertura de código con JaCoCo","Uso de Mockito para pruebas unitarias","Soporte para Testcontainers"],"fr":["Tests unitaires avec JUnit 5","Tests d''intégration avec MockMvc","Couverture de code avec JaCoCo","Utilisation de Mockito pour les tests unitaires","Prise en charge de Testcontainers"],"de":["Einheitstests mit JUnit 5","Integrationstests mit MockMvc","Codeabdeckung mit JaCoCo","Verwendung von Mockito für Einheitstests","Unterstützung für Testcontainers"],"pt":["Orientação de TDD para serviços Spring Boot","Cobertura de 80% ou mais com testes unitários e de integração","Uso de JUnit 5, Mockito, MockMvc, Testcontainers e JaCoCo","Melhoria da produtividade com agentes de IA","Desenvolvimento de aplicações mais confiáveis e escaláveis"],"ru":["Руководство по TDD для сервисов Spring Boot","Покрытие 80% или более с помощью юнит-тестов и интеграционных тестов","Использование JUnit 5, Mockito, MockMvc, Testcontainers и JaCoCo","Повышение производительности с помощью ИИ Агенто