as","pruebas de integración"],"fr":["test Python","Agents IA","pytest","TDD","développement de logiciels","productivité","outils de développement","tests unitaires","tests d''intégration"],"de":["Python-Testing","KI-Agenten","pytest","TDD","Softwareentwicklung","Produktivität","Entwicklungstools","Einheitstests","Integrations-tests"],"pt":["teste python","pytest","tdd","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de software","agentes de ia","ferramentas de teste","cobertura de teste","produtividade"],"ru":["тестирование python","pytest","tdd","разработка программного обеспечения","качество программного обеспечения","ии агенты","инструменты тестирования","покрытие тестов","производительность"],"ar":["اختبار بايثون","بيست","tdd","تنمية البرمجيات","جودة البرمجيات","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الاختبار","تغطية الاختبار","الانتاجية"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Python Development Agents seeking to enhance code reliability with pytest and TDD methodologies.","zh":"适合于寻求使用pytest和TDD方法提高代码可靠性的Python开发代理。","ja":"pytestとTDDメソッドを使用してコードの信頼性を高めたいPython開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"pytest와 TDD 방법을 사용하여 코드의 신뢰성을 높이고자 하는 파이썬 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo de Python que buscan mejorar la confiabilidad del código con pytest y metodologías TDD.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Python qui cherchent à améliorer la fiabilité du code avec pytest et les méthodologies TDD.","de":"Ideal für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die die Zuverlässigkeit des Codes mit pytest und TDD-Methoden verbessern möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que buscam melhorar a confiabilidade do código com pytest e metodologias TDD.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки Python, стремящихся повысить надежность кода с помощью pytest и методологий TDD.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير بايثون الذين يسعون إلى تعزيز موثوقية الشفرة مع pytest و منهجيات TDD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement comprehensive testing strategies using pytest, fixtures, mocking, and parametrization, ensuring high test coverage and adherence to best practices like Test-Driven Development (TDD).","zh":"赋予代理实现全面的测试策略的能力，使用pytest、fixtures、mocking和parametrization，确保高测试覆盖率和遵循最佳实践，如测试驱动开发（TDD）。","ja":"pytest、fixtures、mocking、parametrizationを使用して包括的なテスト戦略を実装するエージェントの能力を付与し、高いテストカバレッジとベストプラクティスsuch as Test-Driven Development（TDD）への準拠を確保します。","ko":"pytest, fixtures, mocking 및 parametrization을 사용하여 포괄적인 테스트 전략을 구현할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여 높은 테스트 커버리지와 테스트 주도 개발(TDD) 등의 모범 사례를 준수합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar estrategias de prueba integrales utilizando pytest, fixtures, mocking y parametrización, garantizando una alta cobertura de pruebas y el cumplimiento de las mejores prácticas como el Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas (TDD).","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des stratégies de test complètes en utilisant pytest, des fixtures, du mocking et de la paramétrisation, garantissant une couverture de test élevée et le respect des meilleures pratiques comme le Développement Piloté par les Tests (TDD).","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Teststrategien mit pytest, Fixtures, Mocking und Parametrisierung umzusetzen, um eine hohe Testabdeckung und die Einhaltung von Best Practices wie Testgetriebenem Entwickeln (TDD) sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar estratégias de teste abrangentes usando pytest, fixtures, mocking e parametrização, garantindo uma alta cobertura de teste e aderência às melhores práticas como Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes (TDD).","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать комплексные стратегии тестирования с помощью pytest, fixtures, mocking и параметризации, обеспечивая высокое покрытие тестирования и соблюдение лучших практик, таких как Разработка, управляемая тестированием (TDD).","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تنفيذ استراتيجيات اختبار شاملة باستخدام pytest و fixtures و mocking و параметريات، مما يضمن تغطية اختبار عالية والالتزام بأفضل الممارسات مثل التطوير الموجه بالاختبار (TDD)."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing robust test suites for Python applications","Implementing TDD for new Python code","Reviewing and optimizing test coverage for existing projects"],"zh":["为Python应用程序设计强大的测试套件","为新Python代码实现TDD","查看和优化现有项目的测试覆盖率"],"ja":["Pythonアプリケーションのための堅牢なテストスイートを設計する","新しいPythonコードのためのTDDを実装する","既存のプロジェクトのテストカバレッジを確認して最適化する"],"ko":["파이썬 애플리케이션을 위한 강력한 테스트套件을 설계하는こと","새로운 파이썬 코드를 위한 TDD를 구현하는こと","기존 프로젝트의 테스트 커버리지 확인 및 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar suites de pruebas robustas para aplicaciones de Python","Implementar TDD para nuevo código de Python","Revisar y optimizar la cobertura de pruebas para proyectos existentes"],"fr":["Concevoir des suites de tests robustes pour les applications Python","Mettre en œuvre TDD pour le nouveau code Python","Réviser et optimiser la couverture de test pour les projets existants"],"de":["Robuste Test-Suiten für Python-Anwendungen entwerfen","TDD für neuen Python-Code implementieren","Testabdeckung für bestehende Projekte überprüfen und optimieren"],"pt":["Projeto de conjuntos de testes robustos para aplicações Python","Implementação de TDD para novo código Python","Revisão e otimização da cobertura de teste para projetos existentes"],"ru":["Проектирование надежных наборов тестов для приложений Python","Реализация TDD для нового кода Python","Проверка и оптимизация покрытия тестирования для существующих проектов"],"ar":["تصميم مجموعات اختبار قوية لتطبيقات بايثون","تنفيذ TDD لشفرة بايثون جديدة","مراجعة وتحسين تغطية الاختبار لمشاريع موجودة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pytest installation","Python knowledge necessary","TDD methodology understanding required"],"zh":["需要pytest安装","需要Python知识","需要TDD方法理解"],"ja":["pytestのインストールが必要","Pythonの知識が必要","TDDメソッドの理解が必要"],"ko":["pytest 설치가 필요합니다","파이썬 지식이 필요합니다","TDD 방법의 이해가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere instalación de pytest","Conocimiento de Python necesario","Se requiere comprensión de la metodología TDD"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de pytest","Connaissances de Python nécessaires","Compréhension de la méthodologie TDD requise"],"de":["Benötigt Installation von pytest","Python-Kenntnisse erforderlich","Verständnis der TDD-Methodik erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer instalação do pytest","Conhecimento de Python necessário","Entendimento da metodologia TDD necessário"],"ru":["Требуется установка pytest","Необходимо знание Python","Требуется понимание методологии TDD"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت pytest","مطلوب معرفة بايثون","مطلوب فهم منهجية TDD"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"98ce1865de021c57f416bb41c9630a9d0ee85c790e8d512d4a8c9f2ebc63b501","repoEtag":"W/\"364f268e25511efbc6f9c2152da6805d934c8ccbaa49ea479a3da0f27c55af07\"","qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/strategic-compact', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'strategic-compact', 50960, 6308, 80, '2026-02-24T12:02:48Z', '2026-02-24T12:06:44.596Z', 'bab8749c044636ae3de0f42e0cd79f681755c76a075907b6a2d19f46951935f0', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/strategic-compact","name":"strategic-compact","description":{"zh":"Strategic Compact 技能建议在合适的时机手动压缩上下文，以保持任务阶段的连续性","ja":"Strategic Compact スキルは、タスクの各段階でコンテキストを保持するために、適切なタイミングで手動でコンテキストを圧縮することを提案します","ko":"Strategic Compact 기능은 태스크의 각 단계에서 컨텍스트를 유지하기 위해 적절한 시점에 수동으로 컨텍스트를 압축하는 것을 제안합니다","es":"La compactación estratégica sugiere la compactación manual de contexto en intervalos lógicos para preservar el contexto a través de fases de tareas","fr":"La compactage stratégique suggère la compactage manuelle de contexte à des intervalles logiques pour préserver le contexte à travers les phases de tâches","de":"Die strategische Kompaktierung schlägt die manuelle Kompaktierung von Kontext in logischen Intervallen vor, um den Kontext über Aufgabenphasen hinweg zu erhalten","pt":"A habilidade de compactação estratégica sugere a compactação manual em intervalos lógicos para preservar o contexto","ru":"С стратегической компактацией вы можете сохранять контекст с помощью ручной компактации на логических интервалах","ar":"تتيح لك مهارة التكثيف الاستراتيجي الحفاظ على السياق من خلال التكثيف اليدوي في الفواصل المنطقية","en":"Suggests manual context compaction at logical intervals to preserve context through task phases rather than arbitrary auto-compaction."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":50960,"forks":6308,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:48Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"strategic-compact","description":"Suggests manual context compaction at logical intervals to preserve context through task phases rather than arbitrary auto-compaction.","bodyPreview":"# Strategic Compact Skill\n\nSuggests manual `/compact` at strategic points in your workflow rather than relying on arbitrary auto-compaction.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Running long sessions that approach context limits (200K+ tokens)\n- Working on multi-phase tasks (research → plan → implement → test)\n- Switching between unrelated tasks within the same session\n- After completing a major milestone and starting new work\n- When responses slow down or become less coherent (context pressure)\n\n## Why Stra","body":"# Strategic Compact Skill\n\nSuggests manual `/compact` at strategic points in your workflow rather than relying on arbitrary auto-compaction.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Running long sessions that approach context limits (200K+ tokens)\n- Working on multi-phase tasks (research → plan → implement → test)\n- Switching between unrelated tasks within the same session\n- After completing a major milestone and starting new work\n- When responses slow down or become less coherent (context pressure)\n\n## Why Strategic Compaction?\n\nAuto-compaction triggers at arbitrary points:\n- Often mid-task, losing important context\n- No awareness of logical task boundaries\n- Can interrupt complex multi-step operations\n\nStrategic compaction at logical boundaries:\n- **After exploration, before execution** — Compact research context, keep implementation plan\n- **After completing a milestone** — Fresh start for next phase\n- **Before major context shifts** — Clear exploration context before different task\n\n## How It Works\n\nThe `suggest-compact.js` script runs on PreToolUse (Edit/Write) and:\n\n1. **Tracks tool calls** — Counts tool invocations in session\n2. **Threshold detection** — Suggests at configurable threshold (default: 50 calls)\n3. **Periodic reminders** — Reminds every 25 calls after threshold\n\n## Hook Setup\n\nAdd to your `~/.claude/settings.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"hooks\": {\n    \"PreToolUse\": [\n      {\n        \"matcher\": \"Edit\",\n        \"hooks\": [{ \"type\": \"command\", \"command\": \"node ~/.claude/skills/strategic-compact/suggest-compact.js\" }]\n      },\n      {\n        \"matcher\": \"Write\",\n        \"hooks\": [{ \"type\": \"command\", \"command\": \"node ~/.claude/skills/strategic-compact/suggest-compact.js\" }]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\nEnvironment variables:\n- `COMPACT_THRESHOLD` — Tool calls before first suggestion (default: 50)\n\n## Compaction Decision Guide\n\nUse this table to decide when to compact:\n\n| Phase Transition | Compact? | Why |\n|-----------------|----------|-----|\n| Research → Planning | Yes | Research context is bulky; plan is the distilled output |\n| Planning → Implementation | Yes | Plan is in TodoWrite or a file; free up context for code |\n| Implementation → Testing | Maybe | Keep if tests reference recent code; compact if switching focus |\n| Debugging → Next feature | Yes | Debug traces pollute context for unrelated work |\n| Mid-implementation | No | Losing variable names, file paths, and partial state is costly |\n| After a failed approach | Yes | Clear the dead-end reasoning before trying a new approach |\n\n## What Survives Compaction\n\nUnderstanding what persists helps you compact with confidence:\n\n| Persists | Lost |\n|----------|------|\n| CLAUDE.md instructions | Intermediate reasoning and analysis |\n| TodoWrite task list | File contents you previously read |\n| Memory files (`~/.claude/memory/`) | Multi-step conversation context |\n| Git state (commits, branches) | Tool call history and counts |\n| Files on disk | Nuanced user preferences stated verbally |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Compact after planning** — Once plan is finalized in TodoWrite, compact to start fresh\n2. **Compact after debugging** — Clear error-resolution context before continuing\n3. **Don''t compact mid-implementation** — Preserve context for related changes\n4. **Read the suggestion** — The hook tells you *when*, you decide *if*\n5. **Write before compacting** — Save important context to files or memory before compacting\n6. **Use `/compact` with a summary** — Add a custom message: `/compact Focus on implementing auth middleware next`\n\n## Related\n\n- [The Longform Guide](https://x.com/affaanmustafa/status/2014040193557471352) — Token optimization section\n- Memory persistence hooks — For state that survives compaction\n- `continuous-learning` skill — Extracts patterns before session ends\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:06:44.596Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理 - Strategic Compact 技能","ja":"AIエージェント - Strategic Compact スキル","ko":"AI 에이전트 - Strategic Compact 기능","es":"Herramientas de Compactación Estratégica para Agentes de IA","fr":"Outils de Compactage Stratégique pour les Agents d''IA","de":"Strategische Kompaktierungstools für KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Habilite Compactação Estratégica","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Компактация на стратегических интервалах","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: التكثيف الاستراتيجي","en":"strategic-compact"},"description":{"zh":"Strategic Compact 技能建议在合适的时机手动压缩上下文，以保持任务阶段的连续性","ja":"Strategic Compact スキルは、タスクの各段階でコンテキストを保持するために、適切なタイミングで手動でコンテキストを圧縮することを提案します","ko":"Strategic Compact 기능은 태스크의 각 단계에서 컨텍스트를 유지하기 위해 적절한 시점에 수동으로 컨텍스트를 압축하는 것을 제안합니다","es":"La compactación estratégica sugiere la compactación manual de contexto en intervalos lógicos para preservar el contexto a través de fases de tareas","fr":"La compactage stratégique suggère la compactage manuelle de contexte à des intervalles logiques pour préserver le contexte à travers les phases de tâches","de":"Die strategische Kompaktierung schlägt die manuelle Kompaktierung von Kontext in logischen Intervallen vor, um den Kontext über Aufgabenphasen hinweg zu erha...","pt":"A habilidade de compactação estratégica sugere a compactação manual em intervalos lógicos para preservar o contexto","ru":"С стратегической компактацией вы можете сохранять контекст с помощью ручной компактации на логических интервалах","ar":"تتيح لك مهارة التكثيف الاستراتيجي الحفاظ على السياق من خلال التكثيف اليدوي في الفواصل المنطقية","en":"Suggests manual context compaction at logical intervals to preserve context through task phases rather than arbitrary auto-compaction."},"definition":{"en":"Suggests manual context compaction at logical intervals to preserve context through task phases rather than arbitrary auto-compaction."},"features":{"zh":["手动压缩上下文","保持任务阶段的连续性","提高工作效率","减少任意自动压缩的影响","适用于长时间的工作会话","适用于多阶段的任务"],"ja":["手動でコンテキストを圧縮","タスクの各段階でコンテキストを保持","作業の効率を上げる","任意の自動圧縮の影響を減らす","長時間の作業セッションに適している","多段階のタスクに適している"],"ko":["수동으로 컨텍스트를 압축","태스크의 각 단계에서 컨텍스트를 유지","작업 효율성을 높인다","任意의 자동 압축의 영향을 줄인다","장시간의 작업 세션에 적합","다단계의 태스크에 적합"],"es":["Compactación manual de contexto","Preservación del contexto a través de fases de tareas","Optimización de flujos de trabajo","Mejora de la productividad","Compatibilidad con agentes de IA como Claude"],"fr":["Compactage manuel de contexte","Préservation du contexte à travers les phases de tâches","Optimisation des flux de travail","Amélioration de la productivité","Compatibilité avec les agents d''IA tels que Claude"],"de":["Manuelle Kompaktierung von Kontext","Erhaltung des Kontexts über Aufgabenphasen hinweg","Optimierung von Arbeitsabläufen","Steigerung der Produktivität","Kompatibilität mit KI-Agents wie Claude"],"pt":["Compactação manual em intervalos lógicos","Preservação do contexto em fases de tarefas","Otimização do desempenho em sessões longas","Melhoria da coerência das respostas","Redução da pressão do contexto"],"ru":["Ручная компактация на логических интервалах","Сохранение контекста на этапах задач","Оптимизация производительности в длинных сессиях","Улучшение связности ответов","Снижение давления контекста"],"ar":["التكثيف اليدوي في الفواصل المنطقية","الحفاظ على السياق في مراحل المهام","تحسين الأداء في الجلسات الطويلة","تحسين الاتساق في الاستجابات","تقليل ضغط السياق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Strategic Compact","手动压缩上下文","任务阶段","工作效率","长时间的工作会话","多阶段的任务","AI工具","开发者工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Strategic Compact","手動でコンテキストを圧縮","タスクの各段階","作業の効率","長時間の作業セッション","多段階のタスク","AIツール","開発者ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Strategic Compact","수동으로 컨텍스트를 압축","태스크의 각 단계","작업 효율성","장시간의 작업 세션","다단계의 태스크","AI 도구","개발자 도구"],"es":["agentes de ia","herramientas de ia","compactación de contexto","productividad","flujos de trabajo","claude","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["agents d''ia","outils d''ia","compactage de contexte","productivité","flux de travail","claude","développement de logiciels"],"de":["ki-agents","ki-tools","kompaktierung von kontext","produktivität","arbeitsabläufe","claude","software-entwicklung"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvedores","compactação estratégica","otimização do contexto","desempenho","coerência das respostas"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","разработчики","стратегическая компактация","оптимизация контекста","производительность","связность ответов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مطورون","التكثيف الاستراتيجي","تحسين السياق","الأداء","اتساق الاستجابات"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Language Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain requiring efficient context management during lengthy conversations or multi-phase tasks.","zh":"适用于高级语言代理，如 AutoGPT 和 LangChain，这些代理需要在长时间对话或多阶段任务中高效管理上下文。","ja":"長時間の会話や多段階のタスクで効率的なコンテキスト管理が必要な AutoGPT や LangChain などの高度な言語エージェントに適しています。","ko":"길고 복잡한 대화나 여러 단계의 작업에서 효율적인 컨텍스트 관리가 필요한 AutoGPT와 LangChain 같은 고급 언어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje Avanzados como AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren una gestión eficiente del contexto durante conversaciones largas o tareas multifásicas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de langage avancés comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une gestion efficace du contexte lors de conversations longues ou de tâches multi-étapes.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte Sprachagenten wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine effiziente Kontextverwaltung während langer Gespräche oder mehrphasiger Aufgaben erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Linguagem Avançados como AutoGPT e LangChain que requerem gerenciamento de contexto eficiente durante conversas longas ou tarefas de múltiplas fases.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых языковых агентов, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих эффективного управления контекстом во время длительных разговоров или многофазных задач.","ar":"مثالي لعميل لغة متقدم مثل AutoGPT و LangChain الذي يتطلب إدارة سياق فعالة خلال محادثات طويلة أو مهام متعددة المراحل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manually compact context at logical intervals using the `/compact` command, preserving context through task phases and mitigating context pressure, especially in scenarios involving 200K+ tokens or when switching between unrelated tasks.","zh":"使代理能够在逻辑间隔使用 `/compact` 命令手动压缩上下文，从而在任务阶段中保持上下文并减轻上下文压力，特别是在涉及 200K+ 令牌或在无关任务之间切换的场景中。","ja":"エージェントが `/compact` コマンドを使用して論理的な間隔でコンテキストを手動で圧縮できるため、タスクの段階を通じてコンテキストを保持し、コンテキストの圧力を軽減することができ、特に 200K+ トークンを扱うシナリオや無関係なタスク間を切り替える際に役立ちます。","ko":"에이전트가 `/compact` 명령을 사용하여 논리적 간격으로 컨텍스트를 수동으로 압축할 수 있으므로 작업 단계에서 컨텍스트를 유지하고 컨텍스트 압력을 완화할 수 있으며, 특히 200K+ 토큰을 처리하는 시나리오 또는 관련이 없는 작업 사이를 전환할 때 유용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes compactar manualmente el contexto en intervalos lógicos utilizando el comando `/compact`, preservando el contexto a través de las fases de la tarea y mitigando la presión del contexto, especialmente en escenarios que involucran 200K+ tokens o cuando se cambia entre tareas no relacionadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de compacter manuellement le contexte à des intervalles logiques en utilisant la commande `/compact`, en préservant le contexte à travers les phases de la tâche et en atténuant la pression du contexte, notamment dans les scénarios impliquant 200K+ tokens ou lors du passage entre des tâches non liées.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, den Kontext manuell in logischen Intervallen mithilfe des Befehls `/compact` zu komprimieren, wodurch der Kontext während der Aufgabenphasen erhalten bleibt und der Kontextdruck gemindert wird, insbesondere in Szenarien mit 200K+ Tokens oder beim Wechseln zwischen nicht verwandten Aufgaben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a compactar manualmente o contexto em intervalos lógicos usando o comando `/compact`, preservando o contexto por meio de fases de tarefas e mitigando a pressão do contexto, especialmente em cenários que envolvem 200K+ tokens ou quando alternando entre tarefas não relacionadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью ручного компактирования контекста на логических интервалах с помощью команды `/compact`, сохраняя контекст на протяжении фаз задач и смягчая давление контекста, особенно в сценариях, включающих 200K+ токенов или при переключении между несвязанными задачами.","ar":"يتوفر على وكلاء لضغط السياق يدويًا في الفواصل المنطقية باستخدام أمر `/compact` ، للحفاظ على السياق خلال مراحل المهام وتقليل ضغط السياق ، خاصة في السيناريوهات التي تتضمن 200K+ رمز أو عند التبديل بين المهام غير المرتبطة."},"useCases":{"en":["Compacting context during long research sessions to maintain coherence","Optimizing context size when working on multi-phase projects to improve response speed","Manually clearing context after completing major milestones to start fresh","Reducing context pressure when dealing with complex, high-token tasks"],"zh":["在长时间的研究会话中压缩上下文以保持连贯性","在处理多阶段项目时优化上下文大小以提高响应速度","完成主要里程碑后手动清除上下文以重新开始","处理复杂、高令牌任务时减轻上下文压力"],"ja":["長時間のリサーチセッション中にコンテキストを圧縮して一貫性を維持する","マルチステージプロジェクトを処理する際にコンテキストサイズを最適化してレスポンス速度を向上させる","主要なマイルストーンを完了した後にコンテキストを手動でクリアして再開する","複雑で高トークンのタスクを処理する際にコンテキストの圧力を軽減する"],"ko":["긴 연구 세션 동안 컨텍스트를 압축하여 일관성을 유지한다","다단계 프로젝트 작업 시 컨텍스트 크기를 최적화하여 응답 속도를 개선한다","주요 마일스톤을 완료한 후 컨텍스트를 수동으로 지우고 다시 시작한다","복잡하고 높은 토큰 작업을 처리할 때 컨텍스트 압력을 줄인다"],"es":["Compactar el contexto durante largas sesiones de investigación para mantener la coherencia","Optimizar el tamaño del contexto al trabajar en proyectos multifásicos para mejorar la velocidad de respuesta","Borrar manualmente el contexto después de completar hitos importantes para empezar de nuevo","Reducir la presión del contexto al tratar con tareas complejas y de alta carga de tokens"],"fr":["Compacter le contexte lors de longues sessions de recherche pour maintenir la cohérence","Optimiser la taille du contexte lors du travail sur des projets multi-étapes pour améliorer la vitesse de réponse","Effacer manuellement le contexte après avoir terminé des étapes importantes pour recommencer","Réduire la pression du contexte lors de la gestion de tâches complexes et à forte charge de tokens"],"de":["Den Kontext während langer Forschungssitzungen komprimieren, um die Kohärenz zu erhalten","Die Kontextgröße optimieren, wenn man an mehrphasigen Projekten arbeitet, um die Antwortgeschwindigkeit zu verbessern","Den Kontext manuell löschen, nachdem man wichtige Meilensteine abgeschlossen hat, um von vorne zu beginnen","Den Kontextdruck reduzieren, wenn man mit komplexen, tokenintensiven Aufgaben umgeht"],"pt":["Compactar contexto durante longas sessões de pesquisa para manter a coerência","Otimizar o tamanho do contexto ao trabalhar em projetos de múltiplas fases para melhorar a velocidade de resposta","Limpar manualmente o contexto após concluir marcos importantes para começar de novo","Reduzir a pressão do contexto ao lidar com tarefas complexas e de alto token"],"ru":["Компактирование контекста во время длинных исследовательских сессий для поддержания связности","Оптимизация размера контекста при работе над многофазными проектами для улучшения скорости ответа","Ручное очистка контекста после завершения основных вех для начала сначала","Снижение давления контекста при работе с сложными и высокотокенными задачами"],"ar":["ضغط السياق خلال جلسات البحث الطويلة للحفاظ على الاتساق","تحسين حجم السياق عند العمل على مشاريع متعددة المراحل لتحسين سرعة الاستجابة","مسح السياق يدويًا بعد إكمال مراحل رئيسية لبدء من جديد","تقليل ضغط السياق عند التعامل مع مهام معقدة وعالية التoken"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires manual intervention to compact context","Most beneficial for agents handling long sessions or multi-phase tasks","Context limits (e.g., 200K+ tokens) may still pose challenges if not managed properly"],"zh":["需要手动干预来压缩上下文","最适合处理长时间会话或多阶段任务的代理","上下文限制（例如 200K+ 令牌）如果不正确管理，仍可能带来挑战"],"ja":["コンテキストを圧縮するために手動での介入が必要","長時間のセッションやマルチステージのタスクを処理するエージェントにとって最も有益","コンテキストの制限（例：200K+ トークン）が適切に管理されない場合、依然として課題をもたらす可能性がある"],"ko":["컨텍스트를 압축하기 위해 수동 개입이 필요하다","긴 시간의 세션 또는 다단계 작업을 처리하는 에이전트에게 가장 유익하다","컨텍스트 제한(예: 200K+ 토큰)이 올바르게 관리되지 않는 경우 여전히 도전을 초래할 수 있다"],"es":["Requiere intervención manual para compactar el contexto","Es más beneficioso para agentes que manejan sesiones largas o tareas multifásicas","Los límites de contexto (por ejemplo, 200K+ tokens) pueden seguir planteando desafíos si no se gestionan adecuadamente"],"fr":["Nécessite une intervention manuelle pour compacter le contexte","Est plus bénéfique pour les agents qui gèrent des sessions longues ou des tâches multi-étapes","Les limites de contexte (par exemple, 200K+ tokens) peuvent encore présenter des défis si elles ne sont pas gérées correctement"],"de":["Benötigt manuelle Eingriffe, um den Kontext zu komprimieren","Eignet sich am besten für Agenten, die lange Sitzungen oder mehrphasige Aufgaben verarbeiten","Kontextlimits (z. B. 200K+ Token) können weiterhin Herausforderungen darstellen, wenn sie nicht ordnungsgemäß gemanagt werden"],"pt":["Requer intervenção manual para compactar o contexto","Mais benéfico para agentes que lidam com sessões longas ou tarefas de múltiplas fases","Limites de contexto (por exemplo, 200K+ tokens) podem ainda representar desafios se não forem gerenciados adequadamente"],"ru":["Требует ручного вмешательства для компактирования контекста","Более полезен для агентов, обрабатывающих длинные сессии или многофазные задачи","Ограничения контекста (например, 200K+ токенов) могут по-прежнему представлять проблемы, если не управлять ими должным образом"],"ar":["يتطلب تدخلًا يدويًا لضغط السياق","أكثر فائدة لعميل يتعامل مع جلسات طويلة أو مهام متعددة المراحل","قيود السياق (على سبيل المثال ، 200K+ رمز) قد لا تزال تشكل تحديات إذا لم يتم إدارتها بشكل صحيح"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bab8749c044636ae3de0f42e0cd79f681755c76a075907b6a2d19f46951935f0","repoEtag":"W/\"364f268e25511efbc6f9c2152da6805d934c8ccbaa49ea479a3da0f27c55af07\"","qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('remotion-dev/skills/remotion', 'official', 'remotion-dev', 'skills', 'remotion-dev/skills', 'remotion-best-practices', 1731, 206, 80, '2026-02-24T11:38:12Z', '2026-02-24T12:10:04.861Z', 'af627225edda7420907d4f66bc07d9a111ee5e276bd3e45705bf118fb8e7cdbb', '{"id":"remotion-dev/skills/remotion","name":"remotion-best-practices","description":{"zh":"Remotion最佳实践为React视频创建提供了专业知识","ja":"RemotionベストプラクティスはReactビデオ作成のための専門知識を提供","ko":"Remotion最佳實踐은 React 비디오 생성을 위한 전문 지식을 제공","es":"Conoce las mejores prácticas para Remotion y crea videos de alta calidad en React con nuestros Agentes de IA","fr":"Découvrez les bonnes pratiques pour Remotion et créez des vidéos de haute qualité avec React et nos Outils d''IA","de":"Erfahren Sie die Best Practices für Remotion und erstellen Sie hochwertige Videos mit React und unseren KI-Tools","pt":"Melhores práticas para Remotion, uma ferramenta de criação de vídeos em React, com dicas para legendas, FFmpeg e visualização de áudio","ru":"Лучшие практики для Remotion, инструмента для создания видео в React, с советами по субтитрам, FFmpeg и визуализации аудио","ar":"أفضل الممارسات ل Remotion، أداة إنشاء فيديو في React، مع نصائح حول الترجمات، FFmpeg وتصوير الصوت","en":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React"},"owner":"remotion-dev","repo":"skills","repoPath":"remotion-dev/skills","stars":1731,"forks":206,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:38:12Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## Captions\n\nWhen dealing with captions or subtitles, load the [./rules/subtitles.md](./rules/subtitles.md) file for more information.\n\n## Using FFmpeg\n\nFor some video operations, such as trimming videos or detecting silence, FFmpeg should be used. Load the [./rules/ffmpeg.md](./rules/ffmpeg.md) file for more information.\n\n## Audio visualization\n\nWhen needing to visualize audio (","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## Captions\n\nWhen dealing with captions or subtitles, load the [./rules/subtitles.md](./rules/subtitles.md) file for more information.\n\n## Using FFmpeg\n\nFor some video operations, such as trimming videos or detecting silence, FFmpeg should be used. Load the [./rules/ffmpeg.md](./rules/ffmpeg.md) file for more information.\n\n## Audio visualization\n\nWhen needing to visualize audio (spectrum bars, waveforms, bass-reactive effects), load the [./rules/audio-visualization.md](./rules/audio-visualization.md) file for more information.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion (bar, pie, line, stock charts)\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/light-leaks.md](rules/light-leaks.md) - Light leak overlay effects using @remotion/light-leaks\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/transparent-videos.md](rules/transparent-videos.md) - Rendering out a video with transparency\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n- [rules/voiceover.md](rules/voiceover.md) - Adding AI-generated voiceover to Remotion compositions using ElevenLabs TTS\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:10:04.861Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Remotion 最佳实践 - AI 工具","ja":"Remotion ベストプラクティス - AI エージェント","ko":"Remotion最佳實踐 - AI 에이전트","es":"Mejores prácticas para Remotion con Agentes de IA","fr":"Bonnes pratiques pour Remotion avec des Outils d''IA","de":"Best Practices für Remotion mit KI-Tools","pt":"Melhores Práticas de Remotion - Ferramentas de IA para Ví...","ru":"Лучшие практики Remotion - ИИ Агенты для видео в React","ar":"أفضل الممارسات ل Remotion - أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للفيدي...","en":"remotion-best-practices"},"description":{"zh":"Remotion最佳实践为React视频创建提供了专业知识","ja":"RemotionベストプラクティスはReactビデオ作成のための専門知識を提供","ko":"Remotion最佳實踐은 React 비디오 생성을 위한 전문 지식을 제공","es":"Conoce las mejores prácticas para Remotion y crea videos de alta calidad en React con nuestros Agentes de IA","fr":"Découvrez les bonnes pratiques pour Remotion et créez des vidéos de haute qualité avec React et nos Outils d''IA","de":"Erfahren Sie die Best Practices für Remotion und erstellen Sie hochwertige Videos mit React und unseren KI-Tools","pt":"Melhores práticas para Remotion, uma ferramenta de criação de vídeos em React, com dicas para legendas, FFmpeg e visualização de áudio","ru":"Лучшие практики для Remotion, инструмента для создания видео в React, с советами по субтитрам, FFmpeg и визуализации аудио","ar":"أفضل الممارسات ل Remotion، أداة إنشاء فيديو في React، مع نصائح حول الترجمات، FFmpeg وتصوير الصوت","en":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React"},"definition":{"en":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React"},"features":{"zh":["使用Remotion进行React视频创建","字幕和字幕处理","使用FFmpeg进行视频操作","音频可视化","最佳实践和专业知识"],"ja":["Remotionを使用したReactビデオ作成","字幕とサブタイトルの処理","FFmpegを使用したビデオ操作","オーディオの可視化","ベストプラクティスと専門知識"],"ko":["Remotion을 사용하여 React 비디오 생성","자막과 자막 처리","FFmpeg를 사용하여 비디오操作","오디오 시각화","최선의 방법과 전문 지식"],"es":["Mejores prácticas para Remotion","Creación de videos en React","Uso de FFmpeg para operaciones de video","Visualización de audio","Uso de subtítulos y leyendas","Optimización de rendimiento"],"fr":["Bonnes pratiques pour Remotion","Création de vidéos avec React","Utilisation de FFmpeg pour les opérations vidéo","Visualisation de l''audio","Utilisation de sous-titres et de légendes","Optimisation des performances"],"de":["Best Practices für Remotion","Videocreation mit React","Verwendung von FFmpeg für Videobearbeitung","Audio-Visualisierung","Verwendung von Untertiteln und Legenden","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["Criação de vídeos em React","Legendas e subtítulos personalizados","Edição de vídeo com FFmpeg","Visualização de áudio","Integração com Ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["Создание видео в React","Пользовательские субтитры и титры","Редактирование видео с помощью FFmpeg","Визуализация аудио","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами"],"ar":["إنشاء فيديو في React","ترجمات وترجمة مخصصة","تحرير الفيديو مع FFmpeg","تصوير الصوت","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Remotion","React视频创建","AI工具","FFmpeg","音频可视化","字幕处理","最佳实践"],"ja":["Remotion","Reactビデオ作成","AIエージェント","FFmpeg","オーディオの可視化","字幕処理","ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Remotion","React 비디오 생성","AI 에이전트","FFmpeg","오디오 시각화","자막 처리","최선의 방법"],"es":["Remotion","React","Agentes de IA","Creación de videos","FFmpeg","Visualización de audio","Subtítulos y leyendas","Optimización de rendimiento"],"fr":["Remotion","React","Outils d''IA","Création de vidéos","FFmpeg","Visualisation de l''audio","Sous-titres et légendes","Optimisation des performances"],"de":["Remotion","React","KI-Tools","Videocreation","FFmpeg","Audio-Visualisierung","Untertitel und Legenden","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["Remotion","React","Vídeo","Legendas","FFmpeg","Visualização de áudio","Ferramentas de IA","Desenvolvimento web","Criação de conteúdo"],"ru":["Remotion","React","Видео","Субтитры","FFmpeg","Визуализация аудио","ИИ Агенты","Веб-разработка","Создание контента"],"ar":["Remotion","React","فيديو","ترجمات","FFmpeg","تصوير الصوت","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير الويب","إنشاء المحتوى"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Video Creation Agents needing domain-specific knowledge of Remotion and React","zh":"适合需要Remotion和React领域特定知识的视频创建代理","ja":"RemotionとReactのドメイン固有の知識を必要とするビデオ作成エージェントに適しています","ko":"Remotion과 React의 도메인 특정 지식을 필요로 하는 비디오 생성 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de creación de video que necesitan conocimientos específicos del dominio de Remotion y React","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de création de vidéo nécessitant des connaissances spécifiques au domaine de Remotion et React","de":"Perfekt für Video-Erstellungsagenten, die domänenbezogene Kenntnisse von Remotion und React benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Criação de Vídeo que necessitam de conhecimento específico do domínio de Remotion e React","ru":"Идеально для агентов по созданию видео, которым необходимы знания в области Remotion и React","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إنشاء الفيديو التي تحتاج إلى معرفة محددة في مجال Remotion و React"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-quality videos with best practices for captions, utilizing FFmpeg for video operations like trimming and silence detection, and visualizing audio in Remotion projects with React","zh":"赋予代理创建高质量视频的能力，遵循字幕、使用FFmpeg进行视频操作（如修剪和静默检测）以及在Remotion项目中使用React可视化音频的最佳实践","ja":"エージェントが高品質のビデオを作成できるようにし、字幕、FFmpegを使用したビデオ操作（トリミングやサイレンス検出など）およびRemotionプロジェクトでReactを使用したオーディオの視覚化についてのベストプラクティスに従う","ko":"에이전트가 높은 품질의 비디오를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 자막, FFmpeg를 사용한 비디오操作(예: 자르기 및 무음 감지) 및 Remotion 프로젝트에서 React를 사용한 오디오 시각화에 대한 모범 사례를 따름","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear videos de alta calidad con las mejores prácticas para subtítulos, utilizando FFmpeg para operaciones de video como recorte y detección de silencio, y visualizando audio en proyectos de Remotion con React","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des vidéos de haute qualité avec les meilleures pratiques pour les sous-titres, en utilisant FFmpeg pour les opérations de vidéo comme le découpage et la détection de silence, et en visualisant l''audio dans les projets Remotion avec React","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hochwertige Videos mit bewährten Methoden für Untertitel zu erstellen, indem FFmpeg für Videovorgänge wie Beschneiden und Stille-Erkennung verwendet wird und Audio in Remotion-Projekten mit React visualisiert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar vídeos de alta qualidade com as melhores práticas para legendas, utilizando FFmpeg para operações de vídeo como corte e detecção de silêncio, e visualizando áudio em projetos Remotion com React","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высококачественные видео с лучшими практиками для субтитров, используя FFmpeg для видеоопераций, таких как обрезка и обнаружение молчания, и визуализируя аудио в проектах Remotion с React","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء مقاطع فيديو عالية الجودة مع أفضل الممارسات للتعليقات، باستخدام FFmpeg لعملية الفيديو مثل القص والكشف عن الصمت، وتصوير الصوت في مشاريع Remotion مع React"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating video captioning with subtitles.md rules","Generating video thumbnails using FFmpeg","Debugging audio visualization issues in Remotion projects"],"zh":["使用subtitles.md规则自动化视频字幕","使用FFmpeg生成视频缩略图","调试Remotion项目中的音频可视化问题"],"ja":["subtitles.mdルールを使用したビデオ字幕の自動化","FFmpegを使用したビデオサムネイルの生成","Remotionプロジェクトのオーディオ視覚化の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["subtitles.md 규칙을 사용한 비디오 자막 자동화","FFmpeg를 사용한 비디오 썸네일 생성","Remotion 프로젝트의 오디오 시각화 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de subtítulos de video con reglas de subtitles.md","Generar miniaturas de video utilizando FFmpeg","Depurar problemas de visualización de audio en proyectos de Remotion"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de sous-titres de vidéo avec des règles de subtitles.md","Générer des miniatures de vidéo en utilisant FFmpeg","Déboguer les problèmes de visualisation de l''audio dans les projets Remotion"],"de":["Automatisieren der Videountertitelung mit Regeln von subtitles.md","Generieren von Videovorschaubildern mit FFmpeg","Beheben von Audio-Visualisierungsproblemen in Remotion-Projekten"],"pt":["Automatizar legendas de vídeo com regras subtitles.md","Gerar miniaturas de vídeo usando FFmpeg","Depurar problemas de visualização de áudio em projetos Remotion"],"ru":["Автоматизировать субтитры видео с правилами subtitles.md","Генерировать миниатюры видео с помощью FFmpeg","Отладить проблемы визуализации аудио в проектах Remotion"],"ar":["تحسين التعليقات التلقائية للمقاطع الفيديو مع قواعد subtitles.md","إنشاء مصغرات الفيديو باستخدام FFmpeg","تصحيح أخطاء ظهور الصوت في مشاريع Remotion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion and React setup","FFmpeg installation needed for advanced video operations"],"zh":["需要Remotion和React设置","高级视频操作需要FFmpeg安装"],"ja":["RemotionとReactの設定が必要","高度なビデオ操作にはFFmpegのインストールが必要"],"ko":["Remotion과 React 설정이 필요","고급 비디오 운영에는 FFmpeg 설치가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Remotion y React","Se necesita instalación de FFmpeg para operaciones de video avanzadas"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Remotion et React","L''installation de FFmpeg est nécessaire pour les opérations de vidéo avancées"],"de":["Benötigt Remotion- und React-Setup","FFmpeg-Installation erforderlich für erweiterte Videovorgänge"],"pt":["Requer configuração de Remotion e React","Instalação do FFmpeg necessária para operações de vídeo avançadas"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Remotion и React","Необходима установка FFmpeg для продвинутых видеоопераций"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Remotion و React","تثبيت FFmpeg ضروري لعملية الفيديو المتقدمة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"af627225edda7420907d4f66bc07d9a111ee5e276bd3e45705bf118fb8e7cdbb","repoEtag":"W/\"d1c09d27aa5e6a62c21f8836ebfdeb5ab14805038c3eb549a54b7035bc512f80\"","qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('stripe/ai/upgrade-stripe', 'official', 'stripe', 'ai', 'stripe/ai', 'upgrade-stripe', 1300, 206, 80, '2026-02-22T16:59:36Z', '2026-02-23T01:07:33.411Z', '32f409610b34809799eba26a6c2a162fda1375f3ae27c1de5d5ff27b7c8b769b', '{"id":"stripe/ai/upgrade-stripe","name":"upgrade-stripe","description":{"zh":"本指南介绍如何升级 Stripe API 版本、服务器端 SDK、Stripe.js 和移动 SDK","ja":"このガイドでは、Stripe API バージョン、サーバーサイド SDK、Stripe.js、モバイル SDK をアップグレードする方法について説明します","ko":"이 가이드에서는 스트라이프 API 버전, 서버 측 SDK, Stripe.js 및 모바일 SDK를 업그레이드하는 방법에 대해 설명합니다","es":"Actualiza Stripe API y SDK con upgrade-stripe, la guía oficial para desarrolladores","fr":"Mettez à jour Stripe API et SDK avec upgrade-stripe, le guide officiel pour les développeurs","de":"Aktualisieren Sie Stripe API und SDK mit upgrade-stripe, dem offiziellen Leitfaden für Entwickler","pt":"Guia para upgrade da API do Stripe e SDKs, incluindo versões do servidor, Stripe.js e SDKs móveis","ru":"Руководство по обновлению версий API Stripe и SDK, включая серверные версии, Stripe.js и мобильные SDK","ar":"دليل لترقية إصدارات واجهة برمجة تطبيقات سترايب و SDK ، بما في ذلك إصدارات الخادم و سترايب.js و SDK الموبايل","en":"Guide for upgrading Stripe API versions and SDKs"},"owner":"stripe","repo":"ai","repoPath":"stripe/ai","stars":1300,"forks":206,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T16:59:36Z","topics":["ai","llm","llm-agents","mcp","python","typescript","workflows"],"skillMd":{"name":"","description":"Guide for upgrading Stripe API versions and SDKs","bodyPreview":"The latest Stripe API version is 2026-01-28.clover - use this version when upgrading unless the user specifies a different target version.\n\n# Upgrading Stripe Versions\n\nThis guide covers upgrading Stripe API versions, server-side SDKs, Stripe.js, and mobile SDKs.\n\n## Understanding Stripe API Versioning\n\nStripe uses date-based API versions (e.g., `2026-01-28.clover`, `2025-08-27.basil`, `2024-12-18.acacia`). Your account''s API version determines request/response behavior.\n\n### Types of Changes\n\n*","body":"The latest Stripe API version is 2026-01-28.clover - use this version when upgrading unless the user specifies a different target version.\n\n# Upgrading Stripe Versions\n\nThis guide covers upgrading Stripe API versions, server-side SDKs, Stripe.js, and mobile SDKs.\n\n## Understanding Stripe API Versioning\n\nStripe uses date-based API versions (e.g., `2026-01-28.clover`, `2025-08-27.basil`, `2024-12-18.acacia`). Your account''s API version determines request/response behavior.\n\n### Types of Changes\n\n**Backward-Compatible Changes** (do not require code updates):\n- New API resources\n- New optional request parameters\n- New properties in existing responses\n- Changes to opaque string lengths (e.g., object IDs)\n- New webhook event types\n\n**Breaking Changes** (require code updates):\n- Field renames or removals\n- Behavioral modifications\n- Removed endpoints or parameters\n\nReview the [API Changelog](https://docs.stripe.com/changelog.md) for all changes between versions.\n\n## Server-Side SDK Versioning\n\nSee [SDK Version Management](https://docs.stripe.com/sdks/set-version.md) for details.\n\n### Dynamically-Typed Languages (Ruby, Python, PHP, Node.js)\n\nThese SDKs offer flexible version control:\n\n**Global Configuration:**\n```python\nimport stripe\nstripe.api_version = ''2026-01-28.clover''\n```\n\n```ruby\nStripe.api_version = ''2026-01-28.clover''\n```\n\n```javascript\nconst stripe = require(''stripe'')(''sk_test_xxx'', {\n  apiVersion: ''2026-01-28.clover''\n});\n```\n\n**Per-Request Override:**\n```python\nstripe.Customer.create(\n  email=\"customer@example.com\",\n  stripe_version=''2026-01-28.clover''\n)\n```\n\n### Strongly-Typed Languages (Java, Go, .NET)\n\nThese use a fixed API version matching the SDK release date. Do not set a different API version for strongly-typed languages because response objects might not match the strong types in the SDK. Instead, update the SDK to target a new API version.\n\n### Best Practice\n\nAlways specify the API version you''re integrating against in your code instead of relying on your account''s default API version:\n\n```javascript\n// Good: Explicit version\nconst stripe = require(''stripe'')(''sk_test_xxx'', {\n  apiVersion: ''2026-01-28.clover''\n});\n\n// Avoid: Relying on account default\nconst stripe = require(''stripe'')(''sk_test_xxx'');\n```\n\n## Stripe.js Versioning\n\nSee [Stripe.js Versioning](https://docs.stripe.com/sdks/stripejs-versioning.md) for details.\n\nStripe.js uses an evergreen model with major releases (Acacia, Basil, Clover) on a biannual basis.\n\n### Loading Versioned Stripe.js\n\n**Via Script Tag:**\n```html\n<script src=\"https://js.stripe.com/clover/stripe.js\"></script>\n```\n\n**Via npm:**\n```bash\nnpm install @stripe/stripe-js\n```\n\nMajor npm versions correspond to specific Stripe.js versions.\n\n### API Version Pairing\n\nEach Stripe.js version automatically pairs with its corresponding API version. For instance:\n- Clover Stripe.js uses `2026-01-28.clover` API\n- Acacia Stripe.js uses `2024-12-18.acacia` API\n\nYou cannot override this association.\n\n### Migrating from v3\n\n1. Identify your current API version in code\n2. Review the changelog for relevant changes\n3. Consider gradually updating your API version before switching Stripe.js versions\n4. Stripe continues supporting v3 indefinitely\n\n## Mobile SDK Versioning\n\nSee [Mobile SDK Versioning](https://docs.stripe.com/sdks/mobile-sdk-versioning.md) for details.\n\n### iOS and Android SDKs\n\nBoth platforms follow **semantic versioning** (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH):\n- **MAJOR**: Breaking API changes\n- **MINOR**: New functionality (backward-compatible)\n- **PATCH**: Bug fixes (backward-compatible)\n\nNew features and fixes release only on the latest major version. Upgrade regularly to access improvements.\n\n### React Native SDK\n\nUses a different model (0.x.y schema):\n- **Minor version changes** (x): Breaking changes AND new features\n- **Patch updates** (y): Critical bug fixes only\n\n### Backend Compatibility\n\nAll mobile SDKs work with any Stripe API version you use on your backend unless documentation specifies otherwise.\n\n## Upgrade Checklist\n\n1. Review the [API Changelog](https://docs.stripe.com/changelog.md) for changes between your current and target versions\n2. Check [Upgrades Guide](https://docs.stripe.com/upgrades.md) for migration guidance\n3. Update server-side SDK package version (e.g., `npm update stripe`, `pip install --upgrade stripe`)\n4. Update the `apiVersion` parameter in your Stripe client initialization\n5. Test your integration against the new API version using the `Stripe-Version` header\n6. Update webhook handlers to handle new event structures\n7. Update Stripe.js script tag or npm package version if needed\n8. Update mobile SDK versions in your package manager if needed\n9. Store Stripe object IDs in databases that accommodate up to 255 characters (case-sensitive collation)\n\n## Testing API Version Changes\n\nUse the `Stripe-Version` header to test your code against a new version without changing your default:\n\n```bash\ncurl https://api.stripe.com/v1/customers \\\n  -u sk_test_xxx: \\\n  -H \"Stripe-Version: 2026-01-28.clover\"\n```\n\nOr in code:\n\n```javascript\nconst stripe = require(''stripe'')(''sk_test_xxx'', {\n  apiVersion: ''2026-01-28.clover''  // Test with new version\n});\n```\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- Your webhook listener should handle unfamiliar event types gracefully\n- Test webhooks with the new version structure before upgrading\n- Breaking changes are tagged by affected product areas (Payments, Billing, Connect, etc.)\n- Multiple API versions coexist simultaneously, enabling staged adoption\n\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:07:33.411Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"升级 Stripe API 版本 - AI 工具","ja":"Stripe API バージョンアップグレード - AI エージェント","ko":"스트라이프 API 버전 업그레이드 - AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de AI: Actualiza Stripe con upgrade-stripe","fr":"Outils IA: Mettre à jour Stripe avec upgrade-stripe","de":"KI-Tools: Stripe aktualisieren mit upgrade-stripe","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Upgrade do Stripe","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Обновление Stripe","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: ترقية سترايب","en":"upgrade-stripe"},"description":{"zh":"本指南介绍如何升级 Stripe API 版本、服务器端 SDK、Stripe.js 和移动 SDK","ja":"このガイドでは、Stripe API バージョン、サーバーサイド SDK、Stripe.js、モバイル SDK をアップグレードする方法について説明します","ko":"이 가이드에서는 스트라이프 API 버전, 서버 측 SDK, Stripe.js 및 모바일 SDK를 업그레이드하는 방법에 대해 설명합니다","es":"Actualiza Stripe API y SDK con upgrade-stripe, la guía oficial para desarrolladores","fr":"Mettez à jour Stripe API et SDK avec upgrade-stripe, le guide officiel pour les développeurs","de":"Aktualisieren Sie Stripe API und SDK mit upgrade-stripe, dem offiziellen Leitfaden für Entwickler","pt":"Guia para upgrade da API do Stripe e SDKs, incluindo versões do servidor, Stripe.js e SDKs móveis","ru":"Руководство по обновлению версий API Stripe и SDK, включая серверные версии, Stripe.js и мобильные SDK","ar":"دليل لترقية إصدارات واجهة برمجة تطبيقات سترايب و SDK ، بما في ذلك إصدارات الخادم و سترايب.js و SDK الموبايل","en":"Guide for upgrading Stripe API versions and SDKs"},"definition":{"en":"Guide for upgrading Stripe API versions and SDKs"},"features":{"zh":["支持最新的 Stripe API 版本（2026-01-28.clover）","升级服务器端 SDK 和 Stripe.js","升级移动 SDK","了解 API 版本升级的步骤和最佳实践","使用 Python 和 TypeScript 进行升级"],"ja":["最新の Stripe API バージョン（2026-01-28.clover）をサポート","サーバーサイド SDK と Stripe.js をアップグレード","モバイル SDK をアップグレード","API バージョンアップグレードの手順とベストプラクティスを学ぶ","Python と TypeScript を使用したアップグレード"],"ko":["최신 스트라이프 API 버전(2026-01-28.clover) 지원","서버 측 SDK 및 Stripe.js 업그레이드","모바일 SDK 업그레이드","API 버전 업그레이드의 단계 및 모범 사례 학습","Python 및 TypeScript를 사용한 업그레이드"],"es":["Actualiza la versión de la API de Stripe","Compatibilidad con SDK de servidor y cliente","Soporte para Python y TypeScript","Guía paso a paso para la actualización","Información sobre los tipos de cambios en la API"],"fr":["Mettez à jour la version de l''API Stripe","Compatibilité avec les SDK serveur et client","Prise en charge de Python et TypeScript","Guide étape par étape pour la mise à jour","Informations sur les types de modifications de l''API"],"de":["Aktualisieren der Stripe-API-Version","Kompatibilität mit Server- und Client-SDKs","Unterstützung für Python und TypeScript","Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitung zur Aktualisierung","Informationen über die Arten von Änderungen in der API"],"pt":["Atualização da API do Stripe","Upgrade de SDKs do servidor","Atualização do Stripe.js","Upgrade de SDKs móveis","Compatibilidade com Python e TypeScript","Fluxos de trabalho personalizados"],"ru":["Обновление API Stripe","Обновление серверных SDK","Обновление Stripe.js","Обновление мобильных SDK","Совместимость с Python и TypeScript","Настраиваемые рабочие процессы"],"ar":["ترقية واجهة برمجة تطبيقات سترايب","ترقية SDK الخادم","ترقية سترايب.js","ترقية SDK الموبايل","التوافق مع بايثون وتايب سكريبت","سير عمل مخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["升级 Stripe API","Stripe API 版本升级","服务器端 SDK 升级","Stripe.js 升级","移动 SDK 升级","Python 升级","TypeScript 升级","AI 工具","AI 技术"],"ja":["Stripe API アップグレード","Stripe API バージョンアップグレード","サーバーサイド SDK アップグレード","Stripe.js アップグレード","モバイル SDK アップグレード","Python アップグレード","TypeScript アップグレード","AI エージェント","AI 技術"],"ko":["스트라이프 API 업그레이드","스트라이프 API 버전 업그레이드","서버 측 SDK 업그레이드","Stripe.js 업그레이드","모바일 SDK 업그레이드","Python 업그레이드","TypeScript 업그레이드","AI 에이전트","AI 기술"],"es":["upgrade-stripe","actualización de Stripe","API de Stripe","SDK de Stripe","desarrollo de software","herramientas de AI","Python","TypeScript"],"fr":["upgrade-stripe","mise à jour de Stripe","API Stripe","SDK Stripe","développement de logiciels","outils IA","Python","TypeScript"],"de":["upgrade-stripe","Aktualisierung von Stripe","Stripe-API","Stripe-SDK","Software-Entwicklung","KI-Tools","Python","TypeScript"],"pt":["upgrade do stripe","atualização da api do stripe","sdk do stripe","stripe.js","python","typescript","fluxos de trabalho","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["обновление stripe","обновление api stripe","sdk stripe","stripe.js","python","typescript","рабочие процессы","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["ترقية سترايب","تحديث واجهة برمجة تطبيقات سترايب","sdk سترايب","ستрайب.js","بايثون","تايب سكريبت","سير عمل","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Payment Processing Agents needing seamless Stripe API version upgrades and SDK management.","zh":"适合需要无缝升级 Stripe API 版本和 SDK 管理的支付处理代理。","ja":"Stripe API 版本の無縫なアップグレードと SDK 管理が必要な決済処理エージェントに適しています。","ko":"무료로 Stripe API 버전 업그레이드 및 SDK 관리가 필요한 결제 처리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de procesamiento de pagos que necesitan actualizaciones de versiones de Stripe API y administración de SDK sin problemas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de traitement de paiement ayant besoin de mises à jour de version d''API Stripe et de gestion de SDK sans interruption.","de":"Perfekt für Zahlungsabwicklungsagenten, die eine nahtlose Aktualisierung der Stripe-API-Versionen und eine SDK-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de processamento de pagamentos que necessitam de atualizações de versão de API do Stripe sem interrupções e gerenciamento de SDK.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обработки платежей, которым необходимы бесшовные обновления версий API Stripe и управление SDK.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تحديثات إصدار API Stripe دون انقطاع وإدارة SDK."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to upgrade Stripe API versions, server-side SDKs, Stripe.js, and mobile SDKs using date-based API versions like 2026-01-28.clover, ensuring compatibility and optimal request/response behavior.","zh":"赋予代理升级 Stripe API 版本、服务器端 SDK、Stripe.js 和移动 SDK 的能力，使用基于日期的 API 版本（如 2026-01-28.clover），确保兼容性和最佳的请求/响应行为。","ja":"エージェントは、Stripe API バージョン、サーバーサイドの SDK、Stripe.js、モバイル SDK をアップグレードする