":["Requires Wrangler installation (v4.x+)","Needs a recent compatibility date (within 30 days)","Preferably uses JSON config over TOML for newer features"],"zh":["需要Wrangler安装（v4.x+）","需要最近的兼容性日期（在30天内）","更倾向于使用JSON配置而不是TOML进行新功能"],"ja":["Wranglerのインストール（v4.x+）が必要","最近の互換性日付（30日以内）が必要","新しい機能ではTOMLよりもJSON構成を使用することをお勧めします"],"ko":["Wrangler 설치(v4.x+)가 필요합니다.","最近의 호환성 날짜(30일 이내)가 필요합니다.","새로운 기능에서는 TOML보다 JSON 구성 사용을 선호합니다."],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Wrangler (v4.x+)","Necesita una fecha de compatibilidad reciente (dentro de 30 días)","Prefiere la configuración JSON sobre TOML para funciones más nuevas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Wrangler (v4.x+)","A besoin d''une date de compatibilité récente (dans les 30 jours)","Préfère la configuration JSON à TOML pour les fonctionnalités plus récentes"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Wrangler (v4.x+)","Benötigt ein aktuelles Kompatibilitätsdatum (innerhalb von 30 Tagen)","Bevorzugt die JSON-Konfiguration gegenüber TOML für neuere Funktionen"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Wrangler (v4.x+)","Necessita de uma data de compatibilidade recente (dentro de 30 dias)","Preferencialmente usa JSON config em vez de TOML para recursos mais novos"],"ru":["Требует установки Wrangler (v4.x+)","Требует недавней даты совместимости (в течение 30 дней)","Предпочтительно использует конфигурацию JSON вместо TOML для новых функций"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Wrangler (v4.x+)","يحتاج إلى تاريخ توافق حديث (ضمن 30 يومًا)","يفضل استخدام JSON config بدلاً من TOML لميزات أحدث"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b1192e4c6701de164c48f44bb9cf6ccba92070ae2873c8beca00a6aadc64b750","repoEtag":"W/\"d80154fd9ed8586078af8bf4b067aaef85c0af6b0931f4dceda13fbdd08d77f7\"","qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('facebook/react/flags', 'official', 'facebook', 'react', 'facebook/react', 'flags', 243274, 50614, 80, '2026-02-22T23:26:11Z', '2026-02-23T01:08:22.769Z', '8dfb38a708aff4cc90f633d048d9f1c556c5d4a8f15107ad60f0d8cf252dc30e', '{"id":"facebook/react/flags","name":"flags","description":{"zh":"Flags功能用于检查功能标志状态、比较渠道和调试功能差异，支持多个选项和渠道","ja":"Flags機能は、機能フラグの状態を確認し、チャネルを比較し、機能の違いをデバッグするために使用されます","ko":"Flags 기능은 기능 플래그 상태를 확인하고 채널을 비교하고 기능의 차이를 디버깅하기 위해 사용됩니다","es":"Flags es una herramienta de IA que permite gestionar y depurar características en diferentes canales de lanzamiento","fr":"Flags est un outil IA qui permet de gérer et de déboguer les fonctionnalités sur différents canaux de lancement","de":"Flags ist ein KI-Tool, das die Verwaltung und Fehlersuche von Funktionen in verschiedenen Release-Kanälen ermöglicht","pt":"Use flags para verificar estados de recursos e comparar canais. Ferramenta de desenvolvimento para React e JavaScript","ru":"Используйте флаги для проверки состояний функций и сравнения каналов. Инструмент для разработчиков на React и JavaScript","ar":"استخدم الأعلام لتحقق من حالات الميزات ومقارنة القنوات. أداة تطوير لمطوري React و JavaScript","en":"Use when you need to check feature flag states, compare channels, or debug why a feature behaves differently across release channels."},"owner":"facebook","repo":"react","repoPath":"facebook/react","stars":243274,"forks":50614,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T23:26:11Z","topics":["declarative","frontend","javascript","library","react","ui"],"skillMd":{"name":"flags","description":"Use when you need to check feature flag states, compare channels, or debug why a feature behaves differently across release channels.","bodyPreview":"# Feature Flags\n\nArguments:\n- $ARGUMENTS: Optional flags\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| (none) | Show all flags across all channels |\n| `--diff <ch1> <ch2>` | Compare flags between channels |\n| `--cleanup` | Show flags grouped by cleanup status |\n| `--csv` | Output in CSV format |\n\n## Channels\n\n- `www`, `www-modern` - Meta internal\n- `canary`, `next`, `experimental` - OSS channels\n- `rn`, `rn-fb`, `rn-next` - React Native\n\n## Legend\n\n✅ enabled, ❌ disabled, 🧪 `__VARIANT","body":"# Feature Flags\n\nArguments:\n- $ARGUMENTS: Optional flags\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| (none) | Show all flags across all channels |\n| `--diff <ch1> <ch2>` | Compare flags between channels |\n| `--cleanup` | Show flags grouped by cleanup status |\n| `--csv` | Output in CSV format |\n\n## Channels\n\n- `www`, `www-modern` - Meta internal\n- `canary`, `next`, `experimental` - OSS channels\n- `rn`, `rn-fb`, `rn-next` - React Native\n\n## Legend\n\n✅ enabled, ❌ disabled, 🧪 `__VARIANT__`, 📊 profiling-only\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Run `yarn flags $ARGUMENTS`\n2. Explain the output to the user\n3. For --diff, highlight meaningful differences\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n- **Forgetting `__VARIANT__` flags** - These are tested both ways in www; check both variants\n- **Comparing wrong channels** - Use `--diff` to see exact differences\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:08:22.769Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理Flags功能","ja":"AIエージェントのFlags機能","ko":"AI 에이전트 Flags 기능","es":"Herramientas de IA: Flags para desarrollo frontend","fr":"Outils IA: Flags pour le développement frontend","de":"KI-Tools: Flags für Frontend-Entwicklung","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: flags para desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: флаги для разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: أعلام للمطورين","en":"flags"},"description":{"zh":"Flags功能用于检查功能标志状态、比较渠道和调试功能差异，支持多个选项和渠道","ja":"Flags機能は、機能フラグの状態を確認し、チャネルを比較し、機能の違いをデバッグするために使用されます","ko":"Flags 기능은 기능 플래그 상태를 확인하고 채널을 비교하고 기능의 차이를 디버깅하기 위해 사용됩니다","es":"Flags es una herramienta de IA que permite gestionar y depurar características en diferentes canales de lanzamiento","fr":"Flags est un outil IA qui permet de gérer et de déboguer les fonctionnalités sur différents canaux de lancement","de":"Flags ist ein KI-Tool, das die Verwaltung und Fehlersuche von Funktionen in verschiedenen Release-Kanälen ermöglicht","pt":"Use flags para verificar estados de recursos e comparar canais. Ferramenta de desenvolvimento para React e JavaScript","ru":"Используйте флаги для проверки состояний функций и сравнения каналов. Инструмент для разработчиков на React и JavaScript","ar":"استخدم الأعلام لتحقق من حالات الميزات ومقارنة القنوات. أداة تطوير لمطوري React و JavaScript","en":"Use when you need to check feature flag states, compare channels, or debug why a feature behaves differently across release channels."},"definition":{"en":"Use when you need to check feature flag states, compare channels, or debug why a feature behaves differently across release channels."},"features":{"zh":["检查功能标志状态","比较渠道","调试功能差异","支持多个选项","支持多个渠道"],"ja":["機能フラグの状態を確認","チャネルを比較","機能の違いをデバッグ","複数のオプションをサポート","複数のチャネルをサポート"],"ko":["기능 플래그 상태를 확인","채널을 비교","기능의 차이를 디버깅","복수의 옵션을 지원","복수의 채널을 지원"],"es":["Gestión de características en diferentes canales de lanzamiento","Comparación de flags entre canales","Depuración de diferencias entre canales","Salida en formato CSV","Integración con React y React Native"],"fr":["Gestion des fonctionnalités sur différents canaux de lancement","Comparaison des flags entre canaux","Débogage des différences entre canaux","Sortie au format CSV","Intégration avec React et React Native"],"de":["Verwaltung von Funktionen in verschiedenen Release-Kanälen","Vergleich von Flags zwischen Kanälen","Fehlersuche von Unterschieden zwischen Kanälen","Ausgabe im CSV-Format","Integration mit React und React Native"],"pt":["Verificar estados de recursos em diferentes canais","Comparar canais e depurar comportamentos de recursos","Suporte a React e JavaScript","Saída em formato CSV","Opções de limpeza e organização de flags"],"ru":["Проверка состояний функций в разных каналах","Сравнение каналов и отладка поведения функций","Поддержка React и JavaScript","Выходные данные в формате CSV","Варианты очистки и организации флагов"],"ar":["تحقق من حالات الميزات في قنوات مختلفة","مقارنة القنوات وتصحيح أخطاء سلوك الميزات","دعم React و JavaScript","إخراج البيانات في تنسيق CSV","خيارات تنظيف وتنظيم الأعلام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Flags功能","功能标志状态","渠道比较","功能差异调试","React","JavaScript","前端开发"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Flags機能","機能フラグの状態","チャネル比較","機能の違いデバッグ","React","JavaScript","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Flags 기능","기능 플래그 상태","채널 비교","기능의 차이 디버깅","React","JavaScript","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["herramientas de ia","desarrollo frontend","gestión de características","depuración de diferencias","react","react native","flags","canales de lanzamiento"],"fr":["outils ia","développement frontend","gestion des fonctionnalités","débogage des différences","react","react native","flags","canaux de lancement"],"de":["ki-tools","frontend-entwicklung","funktionsverwaltung","fehlersuche von unterschieden","react","react native","flags","release-kanäle"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","flags","desenvolvimento de software","react","javascript","canais de lançamento","depuração de código"],"ru":["ии агенты","флаги","разработка программного обеспечения","react","javascript","каналы выпуска","отладка кода"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أعلام","تطوير البرمجيات","react","javascript","قنوات الإصدار","تصحيح أخطاء الكود"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Debugging Agents needing to compare feature flag states across different release channels.","zh":"适合需要比较不同发布渠道的功能标志状态的调试代理。","ja":"デバッグ エージェントがさまざまなリリース チャネルの機能フラグ状態を比較する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"다양한 릴리스 채널의 기능 플래그 상태를 비교해야 하는 디버깅 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para depurar Agent que necesitan comparar estados de feature flags entre diferentes canales de release.","fr":"Idéal pour le débogage des Agents nécessitant de comparer les états des feature flags sur différents canaux de release.","de":"Perfekt für das Debugging von Agents, die Feature-Flag-Status über verschiedene Release-Kanäle vergleichen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para depurar Agents que precisam comparar estados de feature flags em diferentes canais de release.","ru":"Идеально подходит для отладки агентов, которым необходимо сравнивать состояния feature flags в различных каналах выпуска.","ar":"مثالي لتصحيح أخطاء الـ Agents التي تحتاج إلى مقارنة حالات الـ feature flags عبر قنوات الإصدار المختلفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compare flags between channels using the `--diff` option, output results in CSV format with `--csv`, and debug feature behaviors with cleanup status using `--cleanup`, all while interacting with various channels like `www`, `canary`, and `rn`.","zh":"赋予代理比较渠道之间的标志的能力，使用 `--diff` 选项，并使用 `--csv` 输出结果，以 `--cleanup` 调试功能行为，同时与各种渠道（如 `www`、`canary` 和 `rn`）交互。","ja":"`--diff` オプションを使用してチャネル間のフラグを比較し、`--csv` を使用して結果を CSV 形式で出力し、`--cleanup` を使用してクリーンアップ状態で機能の動作をデバッグし、`www`、`canary`、`rn` などのさまざまなチャネルとやり取りすることができます。","ko":"`--diff` 옵션을 사용하여 채널 간의 플래그를 비교하고, `--csv`를 사용하여 결과를 CSV 형식으로 출력하며, `--cleanup`을 사용하여 클린업 상태에서 기능 동작을 디버깅하며, `www`, `canary`, `rn` 등의 다양한 채널와 상호 작용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agents comparar flags entre canales usando la opción `--diff`, generar resultados en formato CSV con `--csv`, y depurar comportamientos de features con el estado de cleanup usando `--cleanup`, todo mientras interactúa con varios canales como `www`, `canary` y `rn`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de comparer les flags entre les canaux en utilisant l''option `--diff`, de produire les résultats au format CSV avec `--csv`, et de déboguer les comportements des features avec le statut de cleanup en utilisant `--cleanup`, le tout en interagissant avec divers canaux tels que `www`, `canary` et `rn`.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, Flags zwischen Kanälen mit der Option `--diff` zu vergleichen, Ergebnisse im CSV-Format mit `--csv` auszugeben und Feature-Verhalten mit Cleanup-Status mit `--cleanup` zu debuggen, alles während der Interaktion mit verschiedenen Kanälen wie `www`, `canary` und `rn`.","pt":"Permite que os agents comparem flags entre canais usando a opção `--diff`, emitam resultados em formato CSV com `--csv` e depurem comportamentos de features com status de limpeza usando `--cleanup`, tudo enquanto interagem com vários canais como `www`, `canary` e `rn`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам сравнивать флаги между каналами с помощью опции `--diff`, выводить результаты в формате CSV с помощью `--csv` и отлаживать поведение функций со статусом очистки с помощью `--cleanup`, все это при взаимодействии с различными каналами, такими как `www`, `canary` и `rn`.","ar":"يمكّن الـ Agents من مقارنة الـ flags بين القنوات باستخدام خيار `--diff`، وإخراج النتائج بتنسيق CSV باستخدام `--csv`، وتصحيح سلوكيات الـ features مع حالة التنظيف باستخدام `--cleanup`، كل ذلك أثناء التفاعل مع قنوات مختلفة مثل `www` و `canary` و `rn`."},"useCases":{"en":["Comparing feature flags between `www` and `canary` channels","Debugging feature behaviors with cleanup status","Outputting feature flag states in CSV format for analysis"],"zh":["比较 `www` 和 `canary` 渠道之间的功能标志","使用清理状态调试功能行为","以 CSV 格式输出功能标志状态以进行分析"],"ja":["`www` と `canary` チャネルの機能フラグを比較する","クリーンアップ状態で機能の動作をデバッグする","機能フラグ状態を CSV 形式で出力して分析する"],"ko":["`www`과 `canary` 채널 사이의 기능 플래그를 비교하는 것","클린업 상태에서 기능 동작을 디버깅하는 것","분석을 위해 기능 플래그 상태를 CSV 형식으로 출력하는 것"],"es":["Comparar feature flags entre los canales `www` y `canary`","Depurar comportamientos de features con el estado de cleanup","Generar estados de feature flags en formato CSV para su análisis"],"fr":["Comparaison des feature flags entre les canaux `www` et `canary`","Débogage des comportements des features avec le statut de cleanup","Production des états des feature flags au format CSV pour analyse"],"de":["Vergleichen von Feature-Flags zwischen den `www`- und `canary`-Kanälen","Debuggen von Feature-Verhalten mit Cleanup-Status","Ausgeben von Feature-Flag-Status im CSV-Format zur Analyse"],"pt":["Comparar feature flags entre os canais `www` e `canary`","Depurar comportamentos de features com status de limpeza","Emitir estados de feature flags em formato CSV para análise"],"ru":["Сравнение feature flags между каналами `www` и `canary`","Отладка поведения функций со статусом очистки","Вывод состояний feature flags в формате CSV для анализа"],"ar":["مقارنة الـ feature flags بين قنوات `www` و `canary`","تصحيح سلوكيات الـ features مع حالة التنظيف","إخراج حالات الـ feature flags بتنسيق CSV للتحليل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of specific channel names like `www-modern` and `rn-fb`","Limited to comparing and debugging feature flags"],"zh":["需要了解特定渠道名称（如 `www-modern` 和 `rn-fb`）","仅限比较和调试功能标志"],"ja":["特定のチャネル名（`www-modern` や `rn-fb` など）を知っている必要がある","機能フラグの比較とデバッグのみに限定される"],"ko":["특정 채널 이름(`www-modern` 및 `rn-fb` 등)을 알아야 하는 것","기능 플래그의 비교 및 디버깅만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de nombres de canales específicos como `www-modern` y `rn-fb`","Limitado a comparar y depurar feature flags"],"fr":["Nécessite la connaissance de noms de canaux spécifiques comme `www-modern` et `rn-fb`","Limité à la comparaison et au débogage des feature flags"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnis spezifischer Kanalnamen wie `www-modern` und `rn-fb`","Beschränkt auf das Vergleichen und Debuggen von Feature-Flags"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de nomes de canais específicos como `www-modern` e `rn-fb`","Limitado a comparar e depurar feature flags"],"ru":["Требует знания конкретных имен каналов, таких как `www-modern` и `rn-fb`","Ограничено сравнением и отладкой feature flags"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بأسماء قنوات محددة مثل `www-modern` و `rn-fb`","مقتصر على مقارنة وتصحيح أخطاء الـ feature flags"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8dfb38a708aff4cc90f633d048d9f1c556c5d4a8f15107ad60f0d8cf252dc30e","repoEtag":"W/\"760a59871b4a4077e06a22aacf6f520d97df70e5d97d558f7c60e2050ca096b9\"","qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('anthropics/skills/docx', 'official', 'anthropics', 'skills', 'anthropics/skills', 'docx', 74575, 7681, 75, '2026-02-24T12:03:15Z', '2026-02-24T12:03:42.542Z', '71cfc398ee05221f21fddc797ea5523a59278feb3447c681db92fa9130ad2da3', '{"id":"anthropics/skills/docx","name":"docx","description":{"zh":"Docx技能用于创建、读取、编辑和操作Word文档，支持触发器如Word文档、.docx文件、报告、备忘录等","ja":"Docxスキルは、Word文書を作成、読み取り、編集、操作するために使用され、Word文書、.docxファイル、報告書、メモ等のトリガーをサポート","ko":"Docx 스킬은 워드 문서를 생성, 읽기, 편집 및 조작하는 데 사용되며 워드 문서, .docx 파일, 보고서, 메모 등 트리거를 지원","es":"La habilidad de AI para documentos Word (.docx) permite crear, leer, editar y manipular archivos de Word con formato profesional.","fr":"La compétence en IA pour les documents Word (.docx) permet de créer, de lire, d''éditer et de manipuler des fichiers Word avec un format professionnel.","de":"Die KI-Fähigkeit für Word-Dokumente (.docx) ermöglicht das Erstellen, Lesen, Bearbeiten und Manipulieren von Word-Dateien im professionellen Format.","pt":"A skill docx é uma ferramenta de IA que permite criar, editar e manipular documentos Word. Ela é útil para produzir relatórios, memorandos e cartas com formatação avançada.","ru":"Навык docx - это инструмент ИИ, который позволяет создавать, редактировать и манипулировать документами Word. Он полезен для создания отчетов, заметок и писем с продвинутой форматировкой.","ar":"المهارة docx هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تمكن من إنشاء وحرر وتنسيق مستندات الوورد. إنها مفيدة لإنشاء تقارير ومراسلات ورسائل مع تنسيق متقدم.","en":"Use this skill whenever the user wants to create, read, edit, or manipulate Word documents (.docx files). Triggers include: any mention of \\Word doc\\, \\word document\\, \\.docx\\, or requests to produce professional documents with formatting like tables of contents, headings, page numbers, or letter..."},"owner":"anthropics","repo":"skills","repoPath":"anthropics/skills","stars":74575,"forks":7681,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:03:15Z","topics":["agent-skills"],"skillMd":{"name":"docx","description":"Use this skill whenever the user wants to create, read, edit, or manipulate Word documents (.docx files). Triggers include: any mention of \\Word doc\\, \\word document\\, \\.docx\\, or requests to produce professional documents with formatting like tables of contents, headings, page numbers, or letterheads. Also use when extracting or reorganizing content from .docx files, inserting or replacing images in documents, performing find-and-replace in Word files, working with tracked changes or comments, or converting content into a polished Word document. If the user asks for a \\report\\, \\memo\\, \\letter\\, \\template\\, or similar deliverable as a Word or .docx file, use this skill. Do NOT use for PDFs, spreadsheets, Google Docs, or general coding tasks unrelated to document generation.","bodyPreview":"# DOCX creation, editing, and analysis\n\n## Overview\n\nA .docx file is a ZIP archive containing XML files.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Approach |\n|------|----------|\n| Read/analyze content | `pandoc` or unpack for raw XML |\n| Create new document | Use `docx-js` - see Creating New Documents below |\n| Edit existing document | Unpack → edit XML → repack - see Editing Existing Documents below |\n\n### Converting .doc to .docx\n\nLegacy `.doc` files must be converted before editing:\n\n```bash\npython scrip","body":"# DOCX creation, editing, and analysis\n\n## Overview\n\nA .docx file is a ZIP archive containing XML files.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Approach |\n|------|----------|\n| Read/analyze content | `pandoc` or unpack for raw XML |\n| Create new document | Use `docx-js` - see Creating New Documents below |\n| Edit existing document | Unpack → edit XML → repack - see Editing Existing Documents below |\n\n### Converting .doc to .docx\n\nLegacy `.doc` files must be converted before editing:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/office/soffice.py --headless --convert-to docx document.doc\n```\n\n### Reading Content\n\n```bash\n# Text extraction with tracked changes\npandoc --track-changes=all document.docx -o output.md\n\n# Raw XML access\npython scripts/office/unpack.py document.docx unpacked/\n```\n\n### Converting to Images\n\n```bash\npython scripts/office/soffice.py --headless --convert-to pdf document.docx\npdftoppm -jpeg -r 150 document.pdf page\n```\n\n### Accepting Tracked Changes\n\nTo produce a clean document with all tracked changes accepted (requires LibreOffice):\n\n```bash\npython scripts/accept_changes.py input.docx output.docx\n```\n\n---\n\n## Creating New Documents\n\nGenerate .docx files with JavaScript, then validate. Install: `npm install -g docx`\n\n### Setup\n```javascript\nconst { Document, Packer, Paragraph, TextRun, Table, TableRow, TableCell, ImageRun,\n        Header, Footer, AlignmentType, PageOrientation, LevelFormat, ExternalHyperlink,\n        TableOfContents, HeadingLevel, BorderStyle, WidthType, ShadingType,\n        VerticalAlign, PageNumber, PageBreak } = require(''docx'');\n\nconst doc = new Document({ sections: [{ children: [/* content */] }] });\nPacker.toBuffer(doc).then(buffer => fs.writeFileSync(\"doc.docx\", buffer));\n```\n\n### Validation\nAfter creating the file, validate it. If validation fails, unpack, fix the XML, and repack.\n```bash\npython scripts/office/validate.py doc.docx\n```\n\n### Page Size\n\n```javascript\n// CRITICAL: docx-js defaults to A4, not US Letter\n// Always set page size explicitly for consistent results\nsections: [{\n  properties: {\n    page: {\n      size: {\n        width: 12240,   // 8.5 inches in DXA\n        height: 15840   // 11 inches in DXA\n      },\n      margin: { top: 1440, right: 1440, bottom: 1440, left: 1440 } // 1 inch margins\n    }\n  },\n  children: [/* content */]\n}]\n```\n\n**Common page sizes (DXA units, 1440 DXA = 1 inch):**\n\n| Paper | Width | Height | Content Width (1\" margins) |\n|-------|-------|--------|---------------------------|\n| US Letter | 12,240 | 15,840 | 9,360 |\n| A4 (default) | 11,906 | 16,838 | 9,026 |\n\n**Landscape orientation:** docx-js swaps width/height internally, so pass portrait dimensions and let it handle the swap:\n```javascript\nsize: {\n  width: 12240,   // Pass SHORT edge as width\n  height: 15840,  // Pass LONG edge as height\n  orientation: PageOrientation.LANDSCAPE  // docx-js swaps them in the XML\n},\n// Content width = 15840 - left margin - right margin (uses the long edge)\n```\n\n### Styles (Override Built-in Headings)\n\nUse Arial as the default font (universally supported). Keep titles black for readability.\n\n```javascript\nconst doc = new Document({\n  styles: {\n    default: { document: { run: { font: \"Arial\", size: 24 } } }, // 12pt default\n    paragraphStyles: [\n      // IMPORTANT: Use exact IDs to override built-in styles\n      { id: \"Heading1\", name: \"Heading 1\", basedOn: \"Normal\", next: \"Normal\", quickFormat: true,\n        run: { size: 32, bold: true, font: \"Arial\" },\n        paragraph: { spacing: { before: 240, after: 240 }, outlineLevel: 0 } }, // outlineLevel required for TOC\n      { id: \"Heading2\", name: \"Heading 2\", basedOn: \"Normal\", next: \"Normal\", quickFormat: true,\n        run: { size: 28, bold: true, font: \"Arial\" },\n        paragraph: { spacing: { before: 180, after: 180 }, outlineLevel: 1 } },\n    ]\n  },\n  sections: [{\n    children: [\n      new Paragraph({ heading: HeadingLevel.HEADING_1, children: [new TextRun(\"Title\")] }),\n    ]\n  }]\n});\n```\n\n### Lists (NEVER use unicode bullets)\n\n```javascript\n// ❌ WRONG - never manually insert bullet characters\nnew Paragraph({ children: [new TextRun(\"• Item\")] })  // BAD\nnew Paragraph({ children: [new TextRun(\"\\u2022 Item\")] })  // BAD\n\n// ✅ CORRECT - use numbering config with LevelFormat.BULLET\nconst doc = new Document({\n  numbering: {\n    config: [\n      { reference: \"bullets\",\n        levels: [{ level: 0, format: LevelFormat.BULLET, text: \"•\", alignment: AlignmentType.LEFT,\n          style: { paragraph: { indent: { left: 720, hanging: 360 } } } }] },\n      { reference: \"numbers\",\n        levels: [{ level: 0, format: LevelFormat.DECIMAL, text: \"%1.\", alignment: AlignmentType.LEFT,\n          style: { paragraph: { indent: { left: 720, hanging: 360 } } } }] },\n    ]\n  },\n  sections: [{\n    children: [\n      new Paragraph({ numbering: { reference: \"bullets\", level: 0 },\n        children: [new TextRun(\"Bullet item\")] }),\n      new Paragraph({ numbering: { reference: \"numbers\", level: 0 },\n        children: [new TextRun(\"Numbered item\")] }),\n    ]\n  }]\n});\n\n// ⚠️ Each reference creates INDEPENDENT numbering\n// Same reference = continues (1,2,3 then 4,5,6)\n// Different reference = restarts (1,2,3 then 1,2,3)\n```\n\n### Tables\n\n**CRITICAL: Tables need dual widths** - set both `columnWidths` on the table AND `width` on each cell. Without both, tables render incorrectly on some platforms.\n\n```javascript\n// CRITICAL: Always set table width for consistent rendering\n// CRITICAL: Use ShadingType.CLEAR (not SOLID) to prevent black backgrounds\nconst border = { style: BorderStyle.SINGLE, size: 1, color: \"CCCCCC\" };\nconst borders = { top: border, bottom: border, left: border, right: border };\n\nnew Table({\n  width: { size: 9360, type: WidthType.DXA }, // Always use DXA (percentages break in Google Docs)\n  columnWidths: [4680, 4680], // Must sum to table width (DXA: 1440 = 1 inch)\n  rows: [\n    new TableRow({\n      children: [\n        new TableCell({\n          borders,\n          width: { size: 4680, type: WidthType.DXA }, // Also set on each cell\n          shading: { fill: \"D5E8F0\", type: ShadingType.CLEAR }, // CLEAR not SOLID\n          margins: { top: 80, bottom: 80, left: 120, right: 120 }, // Cell padding (internal, not added to width)\n          children: [new Paragraph({ children: [new TextRun(\"Cell\")] })]\n        })\n      ]\n    })\n  ]\n})\n```\n\n**Table width calculation:**\n\nAlways use `WidthType.DXA` — `WidthType.PERCENTAGE` breaks in Google Docs.\n\n```javascript\n// Table width = sum of columnWidths = content width\n// US Letter with 1\" margins: 12240 - 2880 = 9360 DXA\nwidth: { size: 9360, type: WidthType.DXA },\ncolumnWidths: [7000, 2360]  // Must sum to table width\n```\n\n**Width rules:**\n- **Always use `WidthType.DXA`** — never `WidthType.PERCENTAGE` (incompatible with Google Docs)\n- Table width must equal the sum of `columnWidths`\n- Cell `width` must match corresponding `columnWidth`\n- Cell `margins` are internal padding - they reduce content area, not add to cell width\n- For full-width tables: use content width (page width minus left and right margins)\n\n### Images\n\n```javascript\n// CRITICAL: type parameter is REQUIRED\nnew Paragraph({\n  children: [new ImageRun({\n    type: \"png\", // Required: png, jpg, jpeg, gif, bmp, svg\n    data: fs.readFileSync(\"image.png\"),\n    transformation: { width: 200, height: 150 },\n    altText: { title: \"Title\", description: \"Desc\", name: \"Name\" } // All three required\n  })]\n})\n```\n\n### Page Breaks\n\n```javascript\n// CRITICAL: PageBreak must be inside a Paragraph\nnew Paragraph({ children: [new PageBreak()] })\n\n// Or use pageBreakBefore\nnew Paragraph({ pageBreakBefore: true, children: [new TextRun(\"New page\")] })\n```\n\n### Table of Contents\n\n```javascript\n// CRITICAL: Headings must use HeadingLevel ONLY - no custom styles\nnew TableOfContents(\"Table of Contents\", { hyperlink: true, headingStyleRange: \"1-3\" })\n```\n\n### Headers/Footers\n\n```javascript\nsections: [{\n  properties: {\n    page: { margin: { top: 1440, right: 1440, bottom: 1440, left: 1440 } } // 1440 = 1 inch\n  },\n  headers: {\n    default: new Header({ children: [new Paragraph({ children: [new TextRun(\"Header\")] })] })\n  },\n  footers: {\n    default: new Footer({ children: [new Paragraph({\n      children: [new TextRun(\"Page \"), new TextRun({ children: [PageNumber.CURRENT] })]\n    })] })\n  },\n  children: [/* content */]\n}]\n```\n\n### Critical Rules for docx-js\n\n- **Set page size explicitly** - docx-js defaults to A4; use US Letter (12240 x 15840 DXA) for US documents\n- **Landscape: pass portrait dimensions** - docx-js swaps width/height internally; pass short edge as `width`, long edge as `height`, and set `orientation: PageOrientation.LANDSCAPE`\n- **Never use `\\n`** - use separate Paragraph elements\n- **Never use unicode bullets** - use `LevelFormat.BULLET` with numbering config\n- **PageBreak must be in Paragraph** - standalone creates invalid XML\n- **ImageRun requires `type`** - always specify png/jpg/etc\n- **Always set table `width` with DXA** - never use `WidthType.PERCENTAGE` (breaks in Google Docs)\n- **Tables need dual widths** - `columnWidths` array AND cell `width`, both must match\n- **Table width = sum of columnWidths** - for DXA, ensure they add up exactly\n- **Always add cell margins** - use `margins: { top: 80, bottom: 80, left: 120, right: 120 }` for readable padding\n- **Use `ShadingType.CLEAR`** - never SOLID for table shading\n- **TOC requires HeadingLevel only** - no custom styles on heading paragraphs\n- **Override built-in styles** - use exact IDs: \"Heading1\", \"Heading2\", etc.\n- **Include `outlineLevel`** - required for TOC (0 for H1, 1 for H2, etc.)\n\n---\n\n## Editing Existing Documents\n\n**Follow all 3 steps in order.**\n\n### Step 1: Unpack\n```bash\npython scripts/office/unpack.py document.docx unpacked/\n```\nExtracts XML, pretty-prints, merges adjacent runs, and converts smart quotes to XML entities (`&#x201C;` etc.) so they survive editing. Use `--merge-runs false` to skip run merging.\n\n### Step 2: Edit XML\n\nEdit files in `unpacked/word/`. See XML Reference below for patterns.\n\n**Use \"Claude\" as the author** for tracked changes and comments, unless the user explicitly requests use of a different name.\n\n**Use the Edit tool directly for string replacement. Do not write Python scripts.** Scripts introduce unnecessary complexity. The Edit tool shows exactly what is being replaced.\n\n**CRITICAL: Use smart quotes for new content.** When adding text with apostrophes or quotes, use XML entities to produce smart quotes:\n```xml\n<!-- Use these entities for professional typography -->\n<w:t>Here&#x2019;s a quote: &#x201C;Hello&#x201D;</w:t>\n```\n| Entity | Character |\n|--------|-----------|\n| `&#x2018;` | ‘ (left single) |\n| `&#x2019;` | ’ (right single / apostrophe) |\n| `&#x201C;` | “ (left double) |\n| `&#x201D;` | ” (right double) |\n\n**Adding comments:** Use `comment.py` to handle boilerplate across multiple XML files (text must be pre-escaped XML):\n```bash\npython scripts/comment.py unpacked/ 0 \"Comment text with &amp; and &#x2019;\"\npython scripts/comment.py unpacked/ 1 \"Reply text\" --parent 0  # reply to comment 0\npython scripts/comment.py unpacked/ 0 \"Text\" --author \"Custom Author\"  # custom author name\n```\nThen add markers to document.xml (see Comments in XML Reference).\n\n### Step 3: Pack\n```bash\npython scripts/office/pack.py unpacked/ output.docx --original document.docx\n```\nValidates with auto-repair, condenses XML, and creates DOCX. Use `--validate false` to skip.\n\n**Auto-repair will fix:**\n- `durableId` >= 0x7FFFFFFF (regenerates valid ID)\n- Missing `xml:space=\"preserve\"` on `<w:t>` with whitespace\n\n**Auto-repair won''t fix:**\n- Malformed XML, invalid element nesting, missing relationships, schema violations\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Replace entire `<w:r>` elements**: When adding tracked changes, replace the whole `<w:r>...</w:r>` block with `<w:del>...<w:ins>...` as siblings. Don''t inject tracked change tags inside a run.\n- **Preserve `<w:rPr>` formatting**: Copy the original run''s `<w:rPr>` block into your tracked change runs to maintain bold, font size, etc.\n\n---\n\n## XML Reference\n\n### Schema Compliance\n\n- **Element order in `<w:pPr>`**: `<w:pStyle>`, `<w:numPr>`, `<w:spacing>`, `<w:ind>`, `<w:jc>`, `<w:rPr>` last\n- **Whitespace**: Add `xml:space=\"preserve\"` to `<w:t>` with leading/trailing spaces\n- **RSIDs**: Must be 8-digit hex (e.g., `00AB1234`)\n\n### Tracked Changes\n\n**Insertion:**\n```xml\n<w:ins w:id=\"1\" w:author=\"Claude\" w:date=\"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\">\n  <w:r><w:t>inserted text</w:t></w:r>\n</w:ins>\n```\n\n**Deletion:**\n```xml\n<w:del w:id=\"2\" w:author=\"Claude\" w:date=\"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\">\n  <w:r><w:delText>deleted text</w:delText></w:r>\n</w:del>\n```\n\n**Inside `<w:del>`**: Use `<w:delText>` instead of `<w:t>`, and `<w:delInstrText>` instead of `<w:instrText>`.\n\n**Minimal edits** - only mark what changes:\n```xml\n<!-- Change \"30 days\" to \"60 days\" -->\n<w:r><w:t>The term is </w:t></w:r>\n<w:del w:id=\"1\" w:author=\"Claude\" w:date=\"...\">\n  <w:r><w:delText>30</w:delText></w:r>\n</w:del>\n<w:ins w:id=\"2\" w:author=\"Claude\" w:date=\"...\">\n  <w:r><w:t>60</w:t></w:r>\n</w:ins>\n<w:r><w:t> days.</w:t></w:r>\n```\n\n**Deleting entire paragraphs/list items** - when removing ALL content from a paragraph, also mark the paragraph mark as deleted so it merges with the next paragraph. Add `<w:del/>` inside `<w:pPr><w:rPr>`:\n```xml\n<w:p>\n  <w:pPr>\n    <w:numPr>...</w:numPr>  <!-- list numbering if present -->\n    <w:rPr>\n      <w:del w:id=\"1\" w:author=\"Claude\" w:date=\"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\"/>\n    </w:rPr>\n  </w:pPr>\n  <w:del w:id=\"2\" w:author=\"Claude\" w:date=\"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\">\n    <w:r><w:delText>Entire paragraph content being deleted...</w:delText></w:r>\n  </w:del>\n</w:p>\n```\nWithout the `<w:del/>` in `<w:pPr><w:rPr>`, accepting changes leaves an empty paragraph/list item.\n\n**Rejecting another author''s insertion** - nest deletion inside their insertion:\n```xml\n<w:ins w:author=\"Jane\" w:id=\"5\">\n  <w:del w:author=\"Claude\" w:id=\"10\">\n    <w:r><w:delText>their inserted text</w:delText></w:r>\n  </w:del>\n</w:ins>\n```\n\n**Restoring another author''s deletion** - add insertion after (don''t modify their deletion):\n```xml\n<w:del w:author=\"Jane\" w:id=\"5\">\n  <w:r><w:delText>deleted text</w:delText></w:r>\n</w:del>\n<w:ins w:author=\"Claude\" w:id=\"10\">\n  <w:r><w:t>deleted text</w:t></w:r>\n</w:ins>\n```\n\n### Comments\n\nAfter running `comment.py` (see Step 2), add markers to document.xml. For replies, use `--parent` flag and nest markers inside the parent''s.\n\n**CRITICAL: `<w:commentRangeStart>` and `<w:commentRangeEnd>` are siblings of `<w:r>`, never inside `<w:r>`.**\n\n```xml\n<!-- Comment markers are direct children of w:p, never inside w:r -->\n<w:commentRangeStart w:id=\"0\"/>\n<w:del w:id=\"1\" w:author=\"Claude\" w:date=\"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\">\n  <w:r><w:delText>deleted</w:delText></w:r>\n</w:del>\n<w:r><w:t> more text</w:t></w:r>\n<w:commentRangeEnd w:id=\"0\"/>\n<w:r><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val=\"CommentReference\"/></w:rPr><w:commentReference w:id=\"0\"/></w:r>\n\n<!-- Comment 0 with reply 1 nested inside -->\n<w:commentRangeStart w:id=\"0\"/>\n  <w:commentRangeStart w:id=\"1\"/>\n  <w:r><w:t>text</w:t></w:r>\n  <w:commentRangeEnd w:id=\"1\"/>\n<w:commentRangeEnd w:id=\"0\"/>\n<w:r><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val=\"CommentReference\"/></w:rPr><w:commentReference w:id=\"0\"/></w:r>\n<w:r><w:rPr><w:rStyle w:val=\"CommentReference\"/></w:rPr><w:commentReference w:id=\"1\"/></w:r>\n```\n\n### Images\n\n1. Add image file to `word/media/`\n2. Add relationship to `word/_rels/document.xml.rels`:\n```xml\n<Relationship Id=\"rId5\" Type=\".../image\" Target=\"media/image1.png\"/>\n```\n3. Add content type to `[Content_Types].xml`:\n```xml\n<Default Extension=\"png\" ContentType=\"image/png\"/>\n```\n4. Reference in document.xml:\n```xml\n<w:drawing>\n  <wp:inline>\n    <wp:extent cx=\"914400\" cy=\"914400\"/>  <!-- EMUs: 914400 = 1 inch -->\n    <a:graphic>\n      <a:graphicData uri=\".../picture\">\n        <pic:pic>\n          <pic:blipFill><a:blip r:embed=\"rId5\"/></pic:blipFill>\n        </pic:pic>\n      </a:graphicData>\n    </a:graphic>\n  </wp:inline>\n</w:drawing>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- **pandoc**: Text extraction\n- **docx**: `npm install -g docx` (new documents)\n- **LibreOffice**: PDF conversion (auto-configured for sandboxed environments via `scripts/office/soffice.py`)\n- **Poppler**: `pdftoppm` for images\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:03:42.542Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能文档工具 - Docx","ja":"AIエージェント：ドキュメント作成 - Docx","ko":"AI 문서 생성 도구 - Docx","es":"Herramientas de AI para documentos Word (.docx)","fr":"Outils d''IA pour les documents Word (.docx)","de":"KI-Tools für Word-Dokumente (.docx)","pt":"Ferramentas de IA para Documentos Word - Skill docx","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Редактирования Документов Word - docx","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لملفات الوورد - مهارة docx","en":"docx"},"description":{"zh":"Docx技能用于创建、读取、编辑和操作Word文档，支持触发器如Word文档、.docx文件、报告、备忘录等","ja":"Docxスキルは、Word文書を作成、読み取り、編集、操作するために使用され、Word文書、.docxファイル、報告書、メモ等のトリガーをサポート","ko":"Docx 스킬은 워드 문서를 생성, 읽기, 편집 및 조작하는 데 사용되며 워드 문서, .docx 파일, 보고서, 메모 등 트리거를 지원","es":"La habilidad de AI para documentos Word (.docx) permite crear, leer, editar y manipular archivos de Word con formato profesional.","fr":"La compétence en IA pour les documents Word (.docx) permet de créer, de lire, d''éditer et de manipuler des fichiers Word avec un format professionnel.","de":"Die KI-Fähigkeit für Word-Dokumente (.docx) ermöglicht das Erstellen, Lesen, Bearbeiten und Manipulieren von Word-Dateien im professionellen Format.","pt":"A skill docx é uma ferramenta de IA que permite criar, editar e manipular documentos Word. Ela é útil para produzir relatórios, memorandos e cartas com forma...","ru":"Навык docx - это инструмент ИИ, который позволяет создавать, редактировать и манипулировать документами Word. Он полезен для создания отчетов, заметок и писе...","ar":"المهارة docx هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تمكن من إنشاء وحرر وتنسيق مستندات الوورد. إنها مفيدة لإنشاء تقارير ومراسلات ورسائل مع تنسيق متقدم.","en":"Use this skill whenever the user wants to create, read, edit, or manipulate Word documents (.docx files). Triggers include: any mention of \\Word doc\\, \\word ..."},"definition":{"en":"Use this skill whenever the user wants to create, read, edit, or manipulate Word documents (.docx files). Triggers include: any mention of \\Word doc\\, \\word document\\, \\.docx\\, or requests to produce professional documents with formatting like tables of contents, headings, page numbers, or letterheads. Also use when extracting or reorganizing content from .docx files, inserting or replacing images in documents, performing find-and-replace in Word files, working with tracked changes or comments, or converting content into a polished Word document. If the user asks for a \\report\\, \\memo\\, \\letter\\, \\template\\, or similar deliverable as a Word or .docx file, use this skill. Do NOT use for PDFs, spreadsheets, Google Docs, or general coding tasks unrelated to document generation."},"features":{"zh":["创建和编辑Word文档","支持触发器如Word文档、.docx文件、报告、备忘录等","自动化生成专业文档","支持文档格式如表格、标题、页码等","支持图像插入和替换"],"ja":["Word文書の作成と編集","Word文書、.docxファイル、報告書、メモ等のトリガーをサポート","专业文書の自動化生成","文書形式如表、題名、ページ番号等をサポート","画像の挿入と置換をサポート"],"ko":["워드 문서 생성 및 편집","워드 문서, .docx 파일, 보고서, 메모 등 트리거 지원","전문 문서 자동화 생성","문서 형식如 표, 제목, 페이지 번호 등 지원","이미지 삽입 및 대체 지원"],"es":["Creación de documentos Word","Edición y manipulación de archivos .docx","Inserción y reemplazo de imágenes","Búsqueda y reemplazo de texto","Trabajo con cambios y comentarios","Conversión de contenido en documentos Word"],"fr":["Création de documents Word","Édition et manipulation de fichiers .docx","Insertion et remplacement d''images","Recherche et remplacement de texte","Travail avec les modifications et les commentaires","Conversion de contenu en documents Word"],"de":["Erstellung von Word-Dokumenten","Bearbeitung und Manipulation von .docx-Dateien","Einfügen und Ersetzen von Bildern","Suchen und Ersetzen von Text","Arbeiten mit Änderungen und Kommentaren","Konvertierung von Inhalten in Word-Dokumente"],"pt":["Criação de documentos Word","Edição e manipulação de arquivos .docx","Inserção e substituição de imagens","Formatação avançada com tabelas de conteúdo e cabeçalhos","Extração e reorganização de conteúdo"],"ru":["Создание документов Word","Редактирование и манипулирование файлами .docx","Вставка и замена изображений","Продвинутая форматировка с таблицами содержания и заголовками","Извлечение и реорганизация контента"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات الوورد","تحرير وتنسيق ملفات .docx","إدراج واستبدال الصور","تنسيق متقدم مع جداول المحتوى والعناوين","استخراج واعادة تنظيم المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能文档工具","Docx技能","Word文档创建","Word文档编辑","专业文档自动化生成","文档格式支持"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Docxスキル","Word文書作成","Word文書編集","专业文書自動化生成","文書形式サポート"],"ko":["AI 문서 생성 도구","Docx 스킬","워드 문서 생성","워드 문서 편집","전문 문서 자동화 생성","문서 형식 지원"],"es":["herramientas de AI para Word","documentos Word","archivos .docx","creación de documentos","edición de documentos","manipulación de archivos","inserción de imágenes","búsqueda y reemplazo","trabajo con cambios","conversión de contenido"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour Word","documents Word","fichiers .docx","création de documents","édition de documents","manipulation de fichiers","insertion d''images","recherche et remplacement","travail avec les modifications","conversion de contenu"],"de":["KI-Tools für Word","Word-Dokumente","Dateien .docx","Erstellung von Dokumenten","Bearbeitung von Dokumenten","Manipulation von Dateien","Einfügen von Bildern","Suchen und Ersetzen","Arbeiten mit Änderungen","Konvertierung von Inhalten"],"pt":["skill docx","ferramentas de IA para documentos Word","manipulação de arquivos .docx","criação de relatórios","edição de documentos Word","formatação avançada"],"ru":["навык docx","инструменты ИИ для документов Word","манипулирование файлами .docx","создание отчетов","редактирование документов Word","продвинутая форматировка"],"ar":["مهارة docx","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لمستندات الوورد","تنسيق ملفات .docx","إنشاء تقارير","تحرير مستندات الوورد","تنسيق متقدم"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Automation Agents needing to create, edit, and analyze structured Word documents programmatically.","zh":"Perfect for Document Automation Agents needing to create, edit, and analyze structured Word documents programmatically.","ja":"Perfect for Document Automation Agents needing to create, edit, and analyze structured Word documents programmatically.","ko":"Perfect for Document Automation Agents needing to create, edit, and analyze structured Word documents programmatically.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de documentos que necesitan crear, editar y analizar documentos de Word estructurados de forma programática.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de documents ayant besoin de créer, modifier et analyser des documents Word structurés de manière programmatique.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentautomatisierungsagenten, die strukturierte Word-Dokumente programmgesteuert erstellen, bearbeiten und analysieren müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Documentos que necessitam criar, editar e analisar documentos estruturados do Word programaticamente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов автоматизации документов, которым требуется программно создавать, редактировать и анализировать структурированные документы Word.","ar":"مثالي لعملاء أتمتة المستندات الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مستندات Word منظمة وتحريرها وتحليلها برمجيًا."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct manipulation of .docx files as ZIP archives containing XML, allowing agents to perform complex document operations like creating tables of contents, managing tracked changes, inserting images, and restructuring content. Provides capabilities for both high-level document generation with docx-js and low-level XML editing for precise control.","zh":"Enables direct manipulation of .docx files as ZIP archives containing XML, allowing agents to perform complex document operations like creating tables of contents, managing tracked changes, inserting images, and restructuring content. Provides capabilities for both high-level document generation with docx-js and low-level XML editing for precise control.","ja":"Enables direct manipulation of .docx files as ZIP archives containing XML, allowing agents to perform complex document operations like creating tables of contents, managing tracked changes, inserting images, and restructuring content. Provides capabilities for both high-level document generation with docx-js and low-level XML editing for precise control.","ko":"Enables direct manipulation of .docx files as ZIP archives containing XML, allowing agents to perform complex document operations like creating tables of contents, managing tracked changes, inserting images, and restructuring content. Provides capabilities for both high-level document generation with docx-js and low-level XML editing for precise control.","es":"Permite la manipulación directa de archivos .docx como archivos ZIP que contienen XML, lo que permite a los agentes realizar operaciones de documento complejas como la creación de tablas de contenido, la gestión de cambios realizados, la inserción de imágenes y la reestructuración de contenido. Proporciona capacidades tanto para la generación de documentos de alto nivel con docx-js como para la edición de XML de bajo nivel para un control preciso.","fr":"Permet la manipulation directe de fichiers .docx comme des archives ZIP contenant du XML, ce qui permet aux agents d''effectuer des opérations de document complexes comme la création de tables des matières, la gestion des modifications suivies, l''insertion d''images et la réorganisation de contenu. Fournit des capacités pour la génération de documents de haut niveau avec docx-js et l''édition XML de bas niveau pour un contrôle précis.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Manipulation von .docx-Dateien als ZIP-Archiven, die XML enthalten, sodass Agenten komplexe Dokumentoperationen wie die Erstellung von Inhaltsverzeichnissen, die Verwaltung von Nachverfolgung von Änderungen, das Einfügen von Bildern und die Neustrukturierung von Inhalten durchführen können. Bietet Fähigkeiten für die Erstellung von Dokumenten auf hohem Niveau mit docx-js und die XML-Bearbeitung auf niedrigem Niveau für präzise Kontrolle.","pt":"Permite a manipulação direta de arquivos .docx como arquivos ZIP contendo XML, permitindo que os agentes realizem operações complexas de documento, como criar sumários, gerenciar alterações controladas, inserir imagens e reestruturar conteúdo. Fornece capacidades para geração de documentos de alto nível com docx-js e edição de XML de baixo nível para controle preciso.","ru":"Позволяет напрямую управлять файлами .docx как ZIP-архивами, содержащими XML, что дает агентам возможность выполнять сложные операции с документами, такие как создание оглавлений, управление отслеживаемыми изменениями, вставка изображений и реструктуризация содержимого. Обеспечивает возможности как для генерации документов высокого уровня с docx-js, так и для низкоуровневого редактирования XML для точного контроля.","ar":"يتيح التلاعب المباشر بملفات .docx كأرشيفات ZIP تحتوي على XML، مما يسمح للعملاء بتنفيذ عمليات مستند معقدة مثل إنشاء جداول المحتويات، وإدارة التغييرات المتعقبة، وإدراج الصور، وإعادة هيكلة المحتوى. يوفر إمكانيات لكل من إنشاء المستندات عالية المستوى باستخدام docx-js وتحرير XML منخفض المستوى للتحكم الدقيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating professional reports with formatted headings and page numbers","Extracting or reorganizing content from existing .docx files","Performing find-and-replace operations across Word documents","Converting legacy .doc files to modern .docx format"],"zh":["Generating professional reports with formatted headings and page numbers","Extracting or reorganizing content from existing .docx files","Performing find-and-replace operations across Word documents","Converting legacy .doc files to modern .docx format"],"ja":["Generating professional reports with formatted headings and page numbers","Extracting or reorganizing content from existing .docx files","Performing find-and-replace operations across Word documents","Converting legacy .doc files to modern .docx format"],"ko":["Generating professional reports with formatted headings and page numbers","Extracting or reorganizing content from existing .docx files","Performing find-and-replace operations across Word documents","Converting legacy .doc files to modern .docx format"],"es":["Generar informes profesionales con encabezados y números de página con formato","Extraer o reorganizar contenido de archivos .docx existentes","Realizar operaciones de búsqueda y reemplazo en documentos de Word","Convertir archivos .doc heredados al formato .docx moderno"],"fr":["Générer des rapports professionnels avec des en-têtes et des numéros de page formatés","Extraire ou réorganiser le contenu de fichiers .docx existants","Effectuer des opérations de recherche et de remplacement dans des documents Word","Convertir des fichiers .doc hérités au format .docx moderne"],"de":["Erstellen von professionellen Berichten mit formatierten Überschriften und Seitenzahlen","Extrahieren oder Neuorganisieren von Inhalten aus bestehenden .docx-Dateien","Durchführen von Such- und Ersetzungsoperationen in Word-Dokumenten","Umwandeln von veralteten .doc-Dateien in das moderne .docx-Format"],"pt":["Geração de relatórios profissionais com cabeçalhos formatados e números de página","Extrair ou reorganizar conteúdo de arquivos .docx existentes","Executar operações de localizar e substituir em documentos do Word","Converter arquivos legados .doc para o formato moderno .docx"],"ru":["Генерация профессиональных отчетов с форматированными заголовками и номерами страниц","Извлечение или реорганизация содержимого из существующих файлов .docx","Выполнение операций поиска и замены в документах Word","Преобразование устаревших файлов .doc в современный формат .docx"],"ar":["إنشاء تقارير احترافية بعناوين منسقة وأرقام صفحات","استخراج المحتوى من ملفات .docx الحالية أو إعادة تنظيمه","إجراء عمليات البحث والاستبدال عبر مستندات Word","تحويل ملفات .doc القديمة إلى تنسيق .docx الحديث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires conversion of legacy .doc files before editing","No native support for PDFs or Google Docs formats","Involves working with raw XML structure for advanced edits"],"zh":["Requires conversion of legacy .doc files before editing","No native support for PDFs or Google Docs formats","Involves working with raw XML structure for advanced edits"],"ja":["Requires conversion of legacy .doc files before editing","No native support for PDFs or Google Docs formats","Involves working with raw XML structure for advanced edits"],"ko":["Requires conversion of legacy .doc files before editing","No native support for PDFs or Google Docs formats","Involves working with raw XML structure for advanced edits"],"es":["Requiere la conversión de archivos .doc heredados antes de editar","No hay soporte nativo para formatos PDF o Google Docs","Implica trabajar con la estructura XML sin procesar para ediciones avanzadas"],"fr":["Nécessite la conversion de fichiers .doc hérités avant de les modifier","Aucun support natif pour les formats PDF ou Google Docs","Implique de travailler avec la structure XML brute pour des éditions avancées"],"de":["Erfordert die Umwandlung von veralteten .doc-Dateien vor der Bearbeitung","Keine native Unterstützung für PDF- oder Google-Docs-Formate","Beinhaltet die Arbeit mit der rohen XML-Struktur für erweiterte Bearbeitungen"],"pt":["Requer conversão de arquivos legados .doc antes da edição","Sem suporte nativo para formatos PDFs ou Google Docs","Envolve trabalhar com a estrutura bruta de XML para edições avançadas"],"ru":["Требует преобразования устаревших файлов .doc перед редактированием","Отсутствует native поддержка форматов PDF или Google Docs","Предполагает работу с raw структурой XML для расширенных правок"],"ar":["يتطلب تحويل ملفات .doc القديمة قبل التحرير","لا يوجد دعم أصلي لتنسيقات PDFs أو Google Docs","يتضمن العمل مع بنية XML الأولية للتعديلات المتقدمة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"71cfc398ee05221f21fddc797ea5523a59278feb3447c681db92fa9130ad2da3","repoEtag":"W/\"8b029149fa94da008a6c4f1a43152b0b329b2e734b696109a05864aae22c5410\"","qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('anthropics/skills/pdf', 'official', 'anthropics', 'skills', 'anthropics/skills', 'pdf', 74575, 7681, 75, '2026-02-24T12:03:15Z', '2026-02-24T12:03:44.034Z', '9f78b8359fbd4943ad260a7a1e436e5a96503406d6c34e99f69223d647d85b9c', '{"id":"anthropics/skills/pdf","name":"pdf","description":{"zh":"本指南介绍使用Python库和命令行工具进行PDF处理的基本操作","ja":"このガイドでは、Pythonライブラリとコマンドラインツールを使用してPDFを処理する基本的な操作について説明します","ko":"이 가이드는 Python 라이브러리와 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 PDF를 처리하는 기본적인 작업에 대해 설명합니다","es":"Guía para procesar PDF con Python y herramientas de línea de comandos","fr":"Guide pour traiter les PDF avec Python et des outils de ligne de commande","de":"Anleitung zum Verarbeiten von PDF mit Python und Kommandozeilen-Tools","pt":"Guia de processamento de PDF para desenvolvedores, com exemplos em Python","ru":"Руководство по работе с PDF для разработчиков, с примерами на Python","ar":"دليل معالجة PDF للمطورين، مع أمثلة بلغة Python","en":"Use this skill whenever the user wants to do anything with PDF files. This includes reading or extracting text/tables from PDFs, combining or merging multiple PDFs into one, splitting PDFs apart, rotating pages, adding watermarks, creating new PDFs, filling PDF forms, encrypting/decrypting PDFs, ..."},"owner":"anthropics","repo":"skills","repoPath":"anthropics/skills","stars":74575,"forks":7681,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:03:15Z","topics":["agent-skills"],"skillMd":{"name":"pdf","description":"Use this skill whenever the user wants to do anything with PDF files. This includes reading or extracting text/tables from PDFs, combining or merging multiple PDFs into one, splitting PDFs apart, rotating pages, adding watermarks, creating new PDFs, filling PDF forms, encrypting/decrypting PDFs, extracting images, and OCR on scanned PDFs to make them searchable. If the user mentions a .pdf file or asks to produce one, use this skill.","bodyPreview":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see REFERENCE.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read FORMS.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.","body":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see REFERENCE.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read FORMS.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    text += page.extract_text()\n```\n\n## Python Libraries\n\n### pypdf - Basic Operations\n\n#### Merge PDFs\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfWriter, PdfReader\n\nwriter = PdfWriter()\nfor pdf_file in [\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\", \"doc3.pdf\"]:\n    reader = PdfReader(pdf_file)\n    for page in reader.pages:\n        writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"merged.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Split PDF\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nfor i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n    writer = PdfWriter()\n    writer.add_page(page)\n    with open(f\"page_{i+1}.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n        writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Extract Metadata\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nmeta = reader.metadata\nprint(f\"Title: {meta.title}\")\nprint(f\"Author: {meta.author}\")\nprint(f\"Subject: {meta.subject}\")\nprint(f\"Creator: {meta.creator}\")\n```\n\n#### Rotate Pages\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\npage = reader.pages[0]\npage.rotate(90)  # Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nwriter.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"rotated.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### pdfplumber - Text and Table Extraction\n\n#### Extract Text with Layout\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        text = page.extract_text()\n        print(text)\n```\n\n#### Extract Tables\n```python\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for i, page in enumerate(pdf.pages):\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for j, table in enumerate(tables):\n            print(f\"Table {j+1} on page {i+1}:\")\n            for row in table:\n                print(row)\n```\n\n#### Advanced Table Extraction\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    all_tables = []\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for table in tables:\n            if table:  # Check if table is not empty\n                df = pd.DataFrame(table[1:], columns=table[0])\n                all_tables.append(df)\n\n# Combine all tables\nif all_tables:\n    combined_df = pd.concat(all_tables, ignore_index=True)\n    combined_df.to_excel(\"extracted_tables.xlsx\", index=False)\n```\n\n### reportlab - Create PDFs\n\n#### Basic PDF Creation\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\nc = canvas.Canvas(\"hello.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nwidth, height = letter\n\n# Add text\nc.drawString(100, height - 100, \"Hello World!\")\nc.drawString(100, height - 120, \"This is a PDF created with reportlab\")\n\n# Add a line\nc.line(100, height - 140, 400, height - 140)\n\n# Save\nc.save()\n```\n\n#### Create PDF with Multiple Pages\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.platypus import SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, PageBreak\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\"report.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\nstory = []\n\n# Add content\ntitle = Paragraph(\"Report Title\", styles[''Title''])\nstory.append(title)\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\nbody = Paragraph(\"This is the body of the report. \" * 20, styles[''Normal''])\nstory.append(body)\nstory.append(PageBreak())\n\n# Page 2\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Page 2\", styles[''Heading1'']))\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Content for page 2\", styles[''Normal'']))\n\n# Build PDF\ndoc.build(story)\n```\n\n#### Subscripts and Superscripts\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Never use Unicode subscript/superscript characters (₀₁₂₃₄₅₆₇₈₉, ⁰¹²³⁴⁵⁶⁷⁸⁹) in ReportLab PDFs. The built-in fonts do not include these glyphs, causing them to render as solid black boxes.\n\nInstead, use ReportLab''s XML markup tags in Paragraph objects:\n```python\nfrom reportlab.platypus import Paragraph\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\n\n# Subscripts: use <sub> tag\nchemical = Paragraph(\"H<sub>2</sub>O\", styles[''Normal''])\n\n# Superscripts: use <super> tag\nsquared = Paragraph(\"x<super>2</super> + y<super>2</super>\", styles[''Normal''])\n```\n\nFor canvas-drawn text (not Paragraph objects), manually adjust font the size and position rather than using Unicode subscripts/superscripts.\n\n## Command-Line Tools\n\n### pdftotext (poppler-utils)\n```bash\n# Extract text\npdftotext input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract text preserving layout\npdftotext -layout input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract specific pages\npdftotext -f 1 -l 5 input.pdf output.txt  # Pages 1-5\n```\n\n### qpdf\n```bash\n# Merge PDFs\nqpdf --empty --pages file1.pdf file2.pdf -- merged.pdf\n\n# Split pages\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 1-5 -- pages1-5.pdf\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 6-10 -- pages6-10.pdf\n\n# Rotate pages\nqpdf input.pdf output.pdf --rotate=+90:1  # Rotate page 1 by 90 degrees\n\n# Remove password\nqpdf --password=mypassword --decrypt encrypted.pdf decrypted.pdf\n```\n\n### pdftk (if available)\n```bash\n# Merge\npdftk file1.pdf file2.pdf cat output merged.pdf\n\n# Split\npdftk input.pdf burst\n\n# Rotate\npdftk input.pdf rotate 1east output rotated.pdf\n```\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Extract Text from Scanned PDFs\n```python\n# Requires: pip install pytesseract pdf2image\nimport pytesseract\nfrom pdf2image import convert_from_path\n\n# Convert PDF to images\nimages = convert_from_path(''scanned.pdf'')\n\n# OCR each page\ntext = \"\"\nfor i, image in enumerate(images):\n    text += f\"Page {i+1}:\\n\"\n    text += pytesseract.image_to_string(image)\n    text += \"\\n\\n\"\n\nprint(text)\n```\n\n### Add Watermark\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Create watermark (or load existing)\nwatermark = PdfReader(\"watermark.pdf\").pages[0]\n\n# Apply to all pages\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    page.merge_page(watermark)\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"watermarked.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### Extract Images\n```bash\n# Using pdfimages (poppler-utils)\npdfimages -j input.pdf output_prefix\n\n# This extracts all images as output_prefix-000.jpg, output_prefix-001.jpg, etc.\n```\n\n### Password Protection\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\n# Add password\nwriter.encrypt(\"userpassword\", \"ownerpassword\")\n\nwith open(\"encrypted.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Best Tool | Command/Code |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| Merge PDFs | pypdf | `writer.add_page(page)` |\n| Split PDFs | pypdf | One page per file |\n| Extract text | pdfplumber | `page.extract_text()` |\n| Extract tables | pdfplumber | `page.extract_tables()` |\n| Create PDFs | reportlab | Canvas or Platypus |\n| Command line merge | qpdf | `qpdf --empty --pages ...` |\n| OCR scanned PDFs | pytesseract | Convert to image first |\n| Fill PDF forms | pdf-lib or pypdf (see FORMS.md) | See FORMS.md |\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- For advanced pypdfium2 usage, see REFERENCE.md\n- For JavaScript libraries (pdf-lib), see REFERENCE.md\n- If you need to fill out a PDF form, follow the instructions in FORMS.md\n- For troubleshooting guides, see REFERENCE.md\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:03:44.034Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理PDF处理","ja":"AIエージェントのPDF処理","ko":"AI 에이전트 PDF 처리","es":"Herramientas AI para Procesamiento de PDF","fr":"Outils AI pour le Traitement de PDF","de":"KI-Tools für PDF-Verarbeitung","pt":"Ferramentas de IA para Processamento de PDF","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Работы с PDF","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لمعالجة PDF","en":"pdf"},"description":{"zh":"本指南介绍使用Python库和命令行工具进行PDF处理的基本操作","ja":"このガイドでは、Pythonライブラリとコマンドラインツールを使用してPDFを処理する基本的な操作について説明します","ko":"이 가이드는 Python 라이브러리와 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 PDF를 처리하는 기본적인 작업에 대해 설명합니다","es":"Guía para procesar PDF con Python y herramientas de línea de comandos","fr":"Guide pour traiter les PDF avec Python et des outils de ligne de commande","de":"Anleitung zum Verarbeiten von PDF mit Python und Kommandozeilen-Tools","pt":"Guia de processamento de PDF para desenvolvedores, com exemplos em Python","ru":"Руководство по работе с PDF для разработчиков, с примерами на Python","ar":"دليل معالجة PDF للمطورين، مع أمثلة بلغة Python","en":"Use this skill whenever the user wants to do anything with PDF files. This includes reading or extracting text/tables from PDFs, combining or merging multipl..."},"definition":{"en":"Use this skill whenever the user wants to do anything with PDF files. This includes reading or extracting text/tables from PDFs, combining or merging multiple PDFs into one, splitting PDFs apart, rotating pages, adding watermarks, creating new PDFs, filling PDF forms, encrypting/decrypting PDFs, extracting images, and OCR on scanned PDFs to make them searchable. If the user mentions a .pdf file or asks to produce one, use this skill."},"features":{"zh":["读取PDF文件","合并和拆分PDF文件","加密和解密PDF文件","提取PDF中的文本和图像","使用OCR技术使扫描的PDF文件可搜索"],"ja":["PDFファイルの読み取り","PDFファイルの結合と分割","PDFファイルの暗号化と復号化","PDF内のテキストと画像の抽出","OCR技術を使用してスキャナのPDFファイルを検索可能にする"],"ko":["PDF 파일 읽기","PDF 파일 결합 및 분할","PDF 파일 암호화 및 복호화","PDF中的 텍스트 및 이미지 추출","OCR 기술을 사용하여 스캔된 PDF 파일을 검색 가능하게 함"],"es":["Lectura y extracción de texto y tablas de PDF","Combinación y división de PDF","Rotación de páginas y agregado de marcas de agua","Creación de nuevos PDF y llenado de formularios","Cifrado y descifrado de PDF","Reconocimiento óptico de caracteres (OCR) en PDF escaneados"],"fr":["Lecture et extraction de texte et de tableaux de PDF","Combinaison et division de PDF","Rotation de pages et ajout de filigranes","Création de nouveaux PDF et remplissage de formulaires","Chiffrement et déchiffrement de PDF","Reconnaissance optique de caractères (OCR) dans les PDF scannés"],"de":["Lesen und Extrahieren von Text und Tabellen aus PDF","Kombinieren und Teilen von PDF","Seiten drehen und Wasserzeichen hinzufügen","Erstellen neuer PDF und Ausfüllen von Formularen","Verschlüsseln und Entschlüsseln von PDF","Optische Zeichenerkennung (OCR) in gescannten PDF"],"pt":["Leitura e extração de texto de arquivos PDF","Combinação e divisão de arquivos PDF","Adição de filigranas e criptografia de arquivos PDF","Criação de novos arquivos PDF","Preenchimento de formulários PDF"],"ru":["Чтение и извлечение текста из файлов PDF","Объединение и разделение файлов PDF","Добавление водяных знаков и шифрования файлов PDF","Создание новых файлов PDF","Заполнение форм PDF"],"ar":["قراءة و استخراج النص من ملفات PDF","دمج و تقسيم ملفات PDF","إضافة ختم مائي و تشفير ملفات PDF","إنشاء ملفات PDF جديدة","ملء استمارات PDF"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","PDF处理","Python库","命令行工具","PDF读取","PDF合并","PDF加密"],"ja":["AIエージェント","PDF処理","Pythonライブラリ","コマンドラインツール","PDF読み取り","PDF結合","PDF暗号化"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","PDF 처리","Python 라이브러리","명령줄 도구","PDF 읽기","PDF 결합","PDF 암호화"],"es":["procesamiento de pdf","herramientas ai para pdf","bibliotecas python para pdf","tratamiento de archivos pdf","automatización de tareas de pdf","reconocimiento óptico de caracteres en pdf"],"fr":["traitement de pdf","outils ai pour pdf","bibliothèques python pour pdf","traitement de fichiers pdf","automatisation de tâches de pdf","reconnaissance optique de caractères dans les pdf"],"de":["pdf-verarbeitung","ki-tools für pdf","python-bibliotheken für pdf","verarbeitung von pdf-dateien","automatisierung von pdf-aufgaben","optische zeichenerkennung in pdf"],"pt":["processamento de PDF","ferramentas de IA","bibliotecas Python","manipulação de arquivos PDF","extração de texto","combinação de arquivos","criptografia de arquivos"],"ru":["работа с PDF","ИИ Агенты","библиотеки Python","манипуляция файлами PDF","извлечение текста","объединение файлов","шифрование файлов"],"ar":["معالجة PDF","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مكتبات Python","تعديل ملفات PDF","استخراج النص","دمج الملفات","تشفير الملفات"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities using Python libraries like pypdf.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Python库（如pypdf）进行高级PDF处理的文档分析代理。","ja":"Pythonライブラリ（pypdfなど）を使用した高度なPDF処理機能を必要とするドキュメント分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Python 라이브러리(pypdf 등)를 사용하여 고급 PDF 처리 기능을 필요로 하는 문서 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de PDF avanzadas utilizando bibliotecas de Python como pypdf.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents nécessitant des capacités de traitement de PDF avancées en utilisant des bibliothèques Python comme pypdf.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte PDF-Verarbeitungsfähigkeiten mit Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de PDF usando bibliotecas Python como pypdf.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Анализа Документов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности обработки PDF с помощью библиотек Python, таких как pypdf.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل المستندات التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لمعالجة ملفات PDF باستخدام مكتبات Python مثل pypdf."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract text and tables from PDFs, merge or split PDF files, and perform OCR on scanned documents using command-line tools and JavaScript libraries, while also enabling encryption, decryption, and form filling with precise control over PDF operations.","zh":"赋予代理从PDF中提取文本和表格、合并或拆分PDF文件以及使用命令行工具和JavaScript库对扫描文档进行OCR，同时也能够对PDF操作进行加密、解密和表单填充，并且具有精确的控制。","ja":"エージェントがPDFからテキストとテーブルを抽出する、PDFファイルをマージまたは分割する、コマンドラインツールとJavaScriptライブラリを使用してスキャンドキュメントに対してOCRを実行することを可能にし、同時にPDF操作に対する暗号化、復号化、フォームの入力を正確に制御する。","ko":"에이전트가 PDF에서 텍스트와 표를 추출하고, PDF 파일을 병합 또는 분할하고, 명령줄 도구와 JavaScript 라이브러리를 사용하여 스캔된 문서에 대해 OCR을 수행할 수 있도록 하며,同時에 PDF 작업에 대한 암호화, 복호화, 양식填充 등을 정밀하게 제어할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer texto y tablas de los PDF, combinar o dividir archivos PDF y realizar OCR en documentos escaneados utilizando herramientas de línea de comandos y bibliotecas de JavaScript, al mismo tiempo que permite el cifrado, descifrado y llenado de formularios con un control preciso sobre las operaciones de PDF.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire du texte et des tableaux à partir de PDF, de fusionner ou de diviser des fichiers PDF et d''effectuer une reconnaissance optique des caractères (OCR) sur des documents scannés en utilisant des outils en ligne de commande et des bibliothèques JavaScript, tout en permettant le chiffrement, le déchiffrement et le remplissage de formulaires avec un contrôle précis sur les opérations de PDF.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Text und Tabellen aus PDFs zu extrahieren, PDF-Dateien zu kombinieren oder aufzuteilen und OCR auf gescannte Dokumente mit Kommandozeilenwerkzeugen und JavaScript-Bibliotheken durchzuführen, während auch die Verschlüsselung, Entschlüsselung und Formulareingabe mit genauer Kontrolle über die PDF-Operationen ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes extraiam texto e tabelas de PDFs, mesclam ou dividam arquivos PDF e realizem OCR em documentos digitalizados usando ferramentas de linha de comando e bibliotecas JavaScript, além de permitir criptografia, descriptografia e preenchimento de formulários com controle preciso sobre operações de PDF.","ru":"Позволяет агентам извлекать текст и таблицы из PDF, объединять или разделять файлы PDF, а также выполнять OCR над отсканированными документами с помощью инструментов командной строки и библиотек JavaScript, при этом обеспечивая шифрование, дешифрование и заполнение форм с точным контролем над операциями с PDF.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من استخراج النص والجداول من ملفات PDF ودمجها أو تقسيمها وتشغيل OCR على المستندات الممسوحة ضوئيًا باستخدام أدوات سطر الأوامر ومكتبات JavaScript، بالإضافة إلى تمكين التشفير وفك التشفير وتعبئة النماذج مع التحكم الدقيق على عمليات PDF."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting text from scanned PDFs using OCR","Merging multiple PDFs into a single document","Encrypting PDF files for secure sharing"],"zh":["使用OCR从扫描的PDF中提取文本","将多个PDF合并成一个文档","对PDF文件进行加密以便安全共享"],"ja":["OCRを使用してスキャンドキュメントからテキストを抽出する","複数のPDFを1つのドキュメントにマージする","PDFファイルを暗号化して安全に共有する"],"ko":["OCR을 사용하여 스캔된 PDF에서 텍스트를 추출하는 것","여러 개의 PDF를 하나의 문서로 병합하는 것","PDF 파일을 암호화하여 보안 공유를 하는 것"],"es":["Extraer texto de PDFs escaneados utilizando OCR","Combinar varios PDFs en un solo documento","Cifrar archivos PDF para compartir de forma segura"],"fr":["Extraire du texte à partir de PDF scannés en utilisant la reconnaissance optique des caractères (OCR)","Fusionner plusieurs PDF en un seul document","Chiffrer des fichiers PDF pour un partage sécurisé"],"de":["Text aus gescannten PDFs mithilfe von OCR extrahieren","Mehrere PDFs zu einem einzigen Dokument kombinieren","PDF-Dateien für sicheres Teilen verschlüsseln"],"pt":["Extrair texto de PDFs digitalizados usando OCR","Mesclar vários PDFs em um único documento","Criptografar arquivos PDF para compartilhamento seguro"],"ru":["Извлечение текста из отсканированных PDF с помощью OCR","Объединение нескольких PDF в один документ","Шифрование файлов PDF для безопасного обмена"],"ar":["استخراج النص من ملفات PDF الممسوحة ضوئيًا باستخدام OCR","دمج ملفات PDF متعددة في مستند واحد","تشفير ملفات PDF لمشاركتها بأمان"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment with pypdf library","JavaScript libraries needed for advanced features"],"zh":["需要Python环境和pypdf库","需要JavaScript库来支持高级功能"],"ja":["Python環境とpypdfライブラリが必要","高度な機能をサポートするためにJavaScriptライブラリが必要"],"ko":["Python 환경과 pypdf 라이브러리가 필요","고급 기능을 지원하기 위해 JavaScript 라이브러리가 필요"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python con biblioteca pypdf","Se necesitan bibliotecas de JavaScript para funciones avanzadas"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python avec la bibliothèque pypdf","Des bibliothèques JavaScript sont nécessaires pour les fonctionnalités avancées"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung mit pypdf-Bibliothek","JavaScript-Bibliotheken werden für erweiterte Funktionen benötigt"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python com biblioteca pypdf","Bibliotecas JavaScript necessárias para recursos avançados"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python с библиотекой pypdf","Необходимы библиотеки JavaScript для продвинутых функций"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python مع مكتبة pypdf","مكتبات JavaScript مطلوبة للميزات المتقدمة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9f78b8359fbd4943ad260a7a1e436e5a96503406d6c34e99f69223d647d85b9c","repoEtag":"W/\"8b029149fa94da008a6c4f1a43152b0b329b2e734b696109a05864aae22c5410\"","qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('obra/superpowers/writing-plans', 'official', 'obra', 'superpowers', 'obra/superpowers', 'writing-plans', 59922, 4566, 75, '2026-02-24T12:02:25Z', '2026-02-24T12:04:17.817Z', '8a9198d4d9efbcad6e019b17c422c182113062c864b6154ec2a3ba2ed0b6b9d0', '{"id":"obra/superpowers/writing-plans","name":"writing-plans","description":{"zh":"编写计划是开发前的重要步骤，使用AI智能工具可以提高效率","ja":"開発前に詳細な計画書を作成することが重要です。AIエージェントを使用して計画書を作成しましょう","ko":"개발 전 계획 수립은 중요합니다. AI 에이전트를 사용하여 구체적인 계획을 수립하세요","es":"La escritura de planes es una habilidad de agente de AI que ayuda a los desarrolladores a crear planes de implementación detallados para tareas complejas","fr":"L''écriture de plans est une compétence d''agent d''IA qui aide les développeurs à créer des plans d''implémentation détaillés pour les tâches complexes","de":"Das Schreiben von Plänen ist eine Fähigkeit von KI-Agents, die Entwicklern hilft, detaillierte Implementierungspläne für komplexe Aufgaben zu erstellen","pt":"O skill de escrita de planos ajuda a criar planos de implementação detalhados para tarefas complexas","ru":"Навык создания планов помогает разработчикам создавать подробные планы реализации сложных задач","ar":"مهارة كتابة خطط التنفيذ تساعد على إنشاء خطط تفصيلية لعمليات متعددة المراحل","en":"Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code"},"owner":"obra","repo":"superpowers","repoPath":"obra/superpowers","stars":59922,"forks":4566,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:25Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"writing-plans","description":"Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code","bodyPreview":"# Writing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite comprehensive implementation plans assuming the engineer has zero context for our codebase and questionable taste. Document everything they need to know: which files to touch for each task, code, testing, docs they might need to check, how to test it. Give them the whole plan as bite-sized tasks. DRY. YAGNI. TDD. Frequent commits.\n\nAssume they are a skilled developer, but know almost nothing about our toolset or problem domain. Assume they don''t know good test","body":"# Writing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nWrite comprehensive implementation plans assuming the engineer has zero context for our codebase and questionable taste. Document everything they need to know: which files to touch for each task, code, testing, docs they might need to check, how to test it. Give them the whole plan as bite-sized tasks. DRY. YAGNI. TDD. Frequent commits.\n\nAssume they are a skilled developer, but know almost nothing about our toolset or problem domain. Assume they don''t know good test design very well.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the writing-plans skill to create the implementation plan.\"\n\n**Context:** This should be run in a dedicated worktree (created by brainstorming skill).\n\n**Save plans to:** `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<feature-name>.md`\n\n## Bite-Sized Task Granularity\n\n**Each step is one action (2-5 minutes):**\n- \"Write the failing test\" - step\n- \"Run it to make sure it fails\" - step\n- \"Implement the minimal code to make the test pass\" - step\n- \"Run the tests and make sure they pass\" - step\n- \"Commit\" - step\n\n## Plan Document Header\n\n**Every plan MUST start with this header:**\n\n```markdown\n# [Feature Name] Implementation Plan\n\n> **For Claude:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task.\n\n**Goal:** [One sentence describing what this builds]\n\n**Architecture:** [2-3 sentences about approach]\n\n**Tech Stack:** [Key technologies/libraries]\n\n---\n```\n\n## Task Structure\n\n````markdown\n### Task N: [Component Name]\n\n**Files:**\n- Create: `exact/path/to/file.py`\n- Modify: `exact/path/to/existing.py:123-145`\n- Test: `tests/exact/path/to/test.py`\n\n**Step 1: Write the failing test**\n\n```python\ndef test_specific_behavior():\n    result = function(input)\n    assert result == expected\n```\n\n**Step 2: Run test to verify it fails**\n\nRun: `pytest tests/path/test.py::test_name -v`\nExpected: FAIL with \"function not defined\"\n\n**Step 3: Write minimal implementation**\n\n```python\ndef function(input):\n    return expected\n```\n\n**Step 4: Run test to verify it passes**\n\nRun: `pytest tests/path/test.py::test_name -v`\nExpected: PASS\n\n**Step 5: Commit**\n\n```bash\ngit add tests/path/test.py src/path/file.py\ngit commit -m \"feat: add specific feature\"\n```\n````\n\n## Remember\n- Exact file paths always\n- Complete code in plan (not \"add validation\")\n- Exact commands with expected output\n- Reference relevant skills with @ syntax\n- DRY, YAGNI, TDD, frequent commits\n\n## Execution Handoff\n\nAfter saving the plan, offer execution choice:\n\n**\"Plan complete and saved to `docs/plans/<filename>.md`. Two execution options:**\n\n**1. Subagent-Driven (this session)** - I dispatch fresh subagent per task, review between tasks, fast iteration\n\n**2. Parallel Session (separate)** - Open new session with executing-plans, batch execution with checkpoints\n\n**Which approach?\"**\n\n**If Subagent-Driven chosen:**\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development\n- Stay in this session\n- Fresh subagent per task + code review\n\n**If Parallel Session chosen:**\n- Guide them to open new session in worktree\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** New session uses superpowers:executing-plans\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:04:17.817Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：编写计划","ja":"AIエージェント：詳細な計画書の作成","ko":"AI 에이전트: 구체적인 계획 수립","es":"Herramientas de AI: Planificación de escritura para desar...","fr":"Outils d''IA: Écriture de plans pour les développeurs","de":"KI-Tools: Schreiben von Plänen für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Planejamento de Implementação","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Создание Планов Реализации","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: كتابة خطط التنفيذ","en":"writing-plans"},"description":{"zh":"编写计划是开发前的重要步骤，使用AI智能工具可以提高效率","ja":"開発前に詳細な計画書を作成することが重要です。AIエージェントを使用して計画書を作成しましょう","ko":"개발 전 계획 수립은 중요합니다. AI 에이전트를 사용하여 구체적인 계획을 수립하세요","es":"La escritura de planes es una habilidad de agente de AI que ayuda a los desarrolladores a crear planes de implementación detallados para tareas complejas","fr":"L''écriture de plans est une compétence d''agent d''IA qui aide les développeurs à créer des plans d''implémentation détaillés pour les tâches complexes","de":"Das Schreiben von Plänen ist eine Fähigkeit von KI-Agents, die Entwicklern hilft, detaillierte Implementierungspläne für komplexe Aufgaben zu erstellen","pt":"O skill de escrita de planos ajuda a criar planos de implementação detalhados para tarefas complexas","ru":"Навык создания планов помогает разработчикам создавать подробные планы реализации сложных задач","ar":"مهارة كتابة خطط التنفيذ تساعد على إنشاء خطط تفصيلية لعمليات متعددة المراحل","en":"Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code"},"definition":{"en":"Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code"},"features":{"zh":["根据需求创建详细的开发计划","提供开发步骤和代码参考","确保开发过程中的测试和文档","支持频繁提交和代码审查","遵循DRY和YAGNI原则"],"ja":["要件に基づいて詳細な開発計画を作成","開発手順とコード例を提供","開発プロセスにおけるテストとドキュメントを保証","頻繁なコミットとコードレビューをサポート","DRYとYAGNI原則に従う"],"ko":["요구사항에 따라 구체적인 개발 계획을 수립","개발 단계와 코드 참조 제공","개발 과정中的 테스트와 문서를 보장","頻繁한 커밋과 코드 리뷰를 지원","DRY와 YAGNI 원칙을 따름"],"es":["Creación de planes de implementación detallados","Asunción de cero conocimiento del código base","Documentación de todos los pasos necesarios","Uso de principios de DRY, YAGNI y TDD","Commit frecuentes"],"fr":["Création de plans d''implémentation détaillés","Hypothèse de zéro connaissance du code base","Documentation de toutes les étapes nécessaires","Utilisation des principes de DRY, YAGNI et TDD","Commit fréquents"],"de":["Erstellung detaillierter Implementierungspläne","Annahme von null Kenntnissen des Code-Basisses","Dokumentation aller erforderlichen Schritte","Verwendung der Prinzipien von DRY, YAGNI und TDD","Häufige Commits"],"pt":["Criação de planos de implementação detalhados","Documentação de todos os passos necessários","Utilização de princípios de DRY e YAGNI","Desenvolvimento orientado a testes (TDD)","Commits frequentes para controle de versão"],"ru":["Создание подробных планов реализации","Документирование всех необходимых шагов","Применение принципов DRY и YAGNI","Разработка, ориентированная на тестирование (TDD)","Частые коммиты для контроля версий"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط تفصيلية لعمليات التنفيذ","توثيق جميع الخطوات اللازمة","استخدام مبادئ DRY و YAGNI","التطوير الموجه للاختبارات (TDD)","التعهدات المتكررة للتحكم في الإصدارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","开发计划","详细计划","开发效率","错误减少","代码审查","频繁提交"],"ja":["AIエージェント","開発計画","詳細な計画","開発効率","エラーレDUCTION","コードレビュー","頻繁なコミット"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","개발 계획","구체적인 계획","개발 효율성","오류 감소","코드 리뷰","頻繁한 커밋"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","planificación de escritura","desarrollo de software","implementación de tareas","principios de DRY","principios de YAGNI","principios de TDD","commit frecuentes","desarrollo de software ágil"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","écriture de plans","développement de logiciels","implémentation de tâches","principes de DRY","principes de YAGNI","principes de TDD","commit fréquents","développement de logiciels agiles"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","Schreiben von Plänen","Software-Entwicklung","Implementierung von Aufgaben","Prinzipien von DRY","Prinzipien von YAGNI","Prinzipien von TDD","häufige Commits","agile Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","planejamento de implementação","desenvolvimento de software","testes automatizados","controle de versão","DRY","YAGNI","TDD"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","создание планов реализации","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизированное тестирование","контроль версий","DRY","YAGNI","TDD"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","كتابة خطط التنفيذ","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات آلية","التحكم في الإصدارات","DRY","YAGNI","TDD"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Analysis Agents requiring structured implementation planning with DRY, YAGNI, and TDD principles.","zh":"适用于需要结构化实施规划的代码分析代理，具有DRY、YAGNI和TDD原则。","ja":"構造化された実装計画が必要なコード分析エージェントに適しています。DRY、YAGNI、TDDの原則を必要とします。","ko":"구조화된 구현 계획이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다. DRY, YAGNI, TDD 원칙을 필요로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de código que requieren una planificación de implementación estructurada con principios DRY, YAGNI y TDD.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant une planification d''implémentation structurée avec les principes DRY, YAGNI et TDD.","de":"Ideal für Code-Analyse-Agenten, die eine strukturierte Implementierungsplanung mit DRY-, YAGNI- und TDD-Prinzipien erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Código que exigem planejamento de implementação estruturado com princípios DRY, YAGNI e TDD.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Кодов, требующих структурированного планирования реализации с принципами DRY, YAGNI и TDD.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يتطلب تخطيط تنفيذ منظم مع مبادئ DRY و YAGNI و TDD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive, bite-sized implementation plans, incorporating frequent commits, testing, and documentation, assuming zero context for the codebase and utilizing best practices like DRY and YAGNI.","zh":"赋予代理创建全面、分段的实施计划的能力，包括频繁的提交、测试和文档，假设代码库没有任何上下文，并利用最佳实践，如DRY和YAGNI。","ja":"エージェントに、コードベースのゼロコンテキストを前提とし、DRYやYAGNIなどのベストプラクティスを利用して、頻繁なコミット、テスト、文書化を含む、包括的でバイトサイズの実装計画を作成する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트에 코드베이스에 대한 제로 컨텍스트를 가정하고 DRY 및 YAGNI와 같은 베스트 프랙티스를 활용하여 빈번한 커밋, 테스트 및 문서화를 포함한 포괄적이고 바이트 크기의 구현 계획을 생성할 수 있는 기능을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear planes de implementación integrales y divididos en partes, incorporando commits frecuentes, pruebas y documentación, asumiendo cero contexto para el código base y utilizando las mejores prácticas como DRY y YAGNI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des plans d''implémentation complets et divisés en parties, incorporant des validations fréquentes, des tests et une documentation, en supposant un contexte nul pour la base de code et en utilisant les meilleures pratiques comme DRY et YAGNI.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende, portionierte Implementierungspläne zu erstellen, die häufige Commits, Tests und Dokumentation umfassen, unter der Annahme, dass der Codebase kein Kontext bekannt ist und unter Verwendung von Best Practices wie DRY und YAGNI.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem planos de implementação abrangentes e divididos em partes, incorporando commits frequentes, testes e documentação, supondo zero contexto para o repositório de código e utilizando boas práticas como DRY e YAGNI.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать комплексные, разделенные на части планы реализации, включающие частые коммиты, тестирование и документацию, предполагая нулевой контекст для кодовой базы и используя лучшие практики, такие как DRY и YAGNI.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء خطط تنفيذ شاملة ومقسمة إلى قطع، متضمنة الإلتزامات المتكررة والاختبار والتوثيق، افتراضًا عدم وجود سياق للكود والاستفادة من أفضل الممارسات مثل DRY و YAGNI."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating step-by-step task plans for complex projects","Documenting code implementation for new team members","Creating testing plans for multi-step tasks"],"zh":["为复杂项目生成步骤式任务计划","为新团队成员记录代码实现","为多步骤任务创建测试计划"],"ja":["複雑なプロジェクトのためのステップバイステップのタスクプランの生成","新しいチームメンバーのためのコード実装の文書化","マルチステップタスクのためのテストプランの作成"],"ko":["복잡한 프로젝트를 위한 단계별 작업 계획 생성","새 팀 구성원의 코드 구현 문서화","다단계 작업을 위한 테스트 계획 생성"],"es":["Generación de planes de tareas paso a paso para proyectos complejos","Documentación de la implementación de código para nuevos miembros del equipo","Creación de planes de prueba para tareas de varios pasos"],"fr":["Génération de plans de tâches étape par étape pour des projets complexes","Documentation de la mise en œuvre du code pour les nouveaux membres de l''équipe","Création de plans de test pour des tâches multi-étapes"],"de":["Erstellung von Schritt-für-Schritt-Aufgabenplänen für komplexe Projekte","Dokumentation der Codeimplementierung für neue Teammitglieder","Erstellung von Testplänen für mehrschrittige Aufgaben"],"pt":["Geração de planos de tarefas passo a passo para projetos complexos","Documentação da implementação do código para novos membros da equipe","Criação de planos de teste para tarefas multi-etapas"],"ru":["Генерация пошаговых планов задач для сложных проектов","Документирование реализации кода для новых членов команды","Создание планов тестирования для задач с несколькими шагами"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط العمل خطوة بخطوة للمشاريع المعقدة","توثيق تنفيذ الشفرة لأعضاء الفريق الجدد","إنشاء خطط الاختبار للمهام متعددة الخطوات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Assumes skilled developer with limited domain knowledge","Requires thorough understanding of codebase and problem domain"],"zh":["假设开发者具有有限的领域知识","需要对代码库和问题领域有彻底的理解"],"ja":["開発者に限定されたドメイン知識があることを前提とする","コードベースと問題ドメインに対する徹底的な理解が必要"],"ko":["개발자가 제한된 도메인 지식을 갖고 있다고 가정","코드베이스와 문제 도메인에 대한 철저한 이해가 필요"],"es":["Supone un desarrollador capacitado con conocimientos de dominio limitados","Requiere una comprensión exhaustiva del código base y del dominio del problema"],"fr":["Suppose un développeur qualifié avec des connaissances de domaine limitées","Nécessite une compréhension approfondie de la base de code et du domaine du problème"],"de":["Geht von einem qualifizierten Entwickler mit begrenzten Domänenkenntnissen aus","Benötigt ein gründliches Verständnis des Codebase und des Problem-domäne"],"pt":["Pressupõe desenvolvedor habilidoso com conhecimento limitado de domínio","Exige compreensão aprofundada da base de código e do domínio do problema"],"ru":["Предполагает опытного разработчика с ограниченными знаниями предметной области","Требует глубокого понимания кодовой базы и предметной области"],"ar":["يفترض مطورًا ماهرًا مع معرفة محدودة بالمجال","يتطلب فهمًا عميقًا لقاعدة الكود ومجال المشكلة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8a9198d4d9efbcad6e019b17c422c182113062c864b6154ec2a3ba2ed0b6b9d0","repoEtag":"W/\"6ca4599aa6df63cc9397ee47e5073b776827a72e0cb91d7461282a78426487c4\"","qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/eval-harness', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'eval-harness', 50960, 6308, 75, '2026-02-24T12:02:48Z', '2026-02-24T12:04:41.975Z', '1fa9d38a64823e13c02b29df9e3598774218edb14dbbcbcb528e70874439554c', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/eval-harness","name":"eval-harness","description":{"zh":"Eval Harness Skill是一种用于Claude Code会话的正式评估框架，实现评估驱动开发（EDD）原则，用于评估AI智能体的性能","ja":"Eval Harness Skillは、Claude Codeセッション用の正式な評価フレームワークで、評価駆動開発（EDD）原則を実装します","ko":"Eval Harness Skill은 클라우드 코드 세션을 위한 공식 평가 프레임워크로 평가 주도 개발(EDD) 원칙을 구현하여 AI 에이전트의 성능을 평가합니다","es":"Eval Harness es un marco de evaluación formal para sesiones de Claude Code, que implementa principios de desarrollo guiado por evaluación","fr":"Eval Harness est un cadre d''évaluation formel pour les sessions Claude Code, mettant en œuvre les principes de développement guidé par l''évaluation","de":"Eval Harness ist ein formales Bewertungsframework für Claude Code-Sitzungen, das die Prinzipien der evaluierten Entwicklung umsetzt","pt":"O eval-harness é uma estrutura de avaliação formal para sessões de Claude Code, implementando princípios de desenvolvimento orientado a avaliação","ru":"ИИ Агенты: eval-harness - формальная оценка для сессий Claude Code, реализующая принципы разработки, управляемой оценкой","ar":"أداة تقييم الوكلاء الذكية هي إطار تقييم رسمي لجلسات Claude Code، يطبق مبادئ التطوير الموجه للتقييم","en":"Formal evaluation framework for Claude Code sessions implementing eval-driven development (EDD) principles"},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":50960,"forks":6308,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:48Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"eval-harness","description":"Formal evaluation framework for Claude Code sessions implementing eval-driven development (EDD) principles","bodyPreview":"# Eval Harness Skill\n\nA formal evaluation framework for Claude Code sessions, implementing eval-driven development (EDD) principles.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Setting up eval-driven development (EDD) for AI-assisted workflows\n- Defining pass/fail criteria for Claude Code task completion\n- Measuring agent reliability with pass@k metrics\n- Creating regression test suites for prompt or agent changes\n- Benchmarking agent performance across model versions\n\n## Philosophy\n\nEval-Driven Development treats","body":"# Eval Harness Skill\n\nA formal evaluation framework for Claude Code sessions, implementing eval-driven development (EDD) principles.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Setting up eval-driven development (EDD) for AI-assisted workflows\n- Defining pass/fail criteria for Claude Code task completion\n- Measuring agent reliability with pass@k metrics\n- Creating regression test suites for prompt or agent changes\n- Benchmarking agent performance across model versions\n\n## Philosophy\n\nEval-Driven Development treats evals as the \"unit tests of AI development\":\n- Define expected behavior BEFORE implementation\n- Run evals continuously during development\n- Track regressions with each change\n- Use pass@k metrics for reliability measurement\n\n## Eval Types\n\n### Capability Evals\nTest if Claude can do something it couldn''t before:\n```markdown\n[CAPABILITY EVAL: feature-name]\nTask: Description of what Claude should accomplish\nSuccess Criteria:\n  - [ ] Criterion 1\n  - [ ] Criterion 2\n  - [ ] Criterion 3\nExpected Output: Description of expected result\n```\n\n### Regression Evals\nEnsure changes don''t break existing functionality:\n```markdown\n[REGRESSION EVAL: feature-name]\nBaseline: SHA or checkpoint name\nTests:\n  - existing-test-1: PASS/FAIL\n  - existing-test-2: PASS/FAIL\n  - existing-test-3: PASS/FAIL\nResult: X/Y passed (previously Y/Y)\n```\n\n## Grader Types\n\n### 1. Code-Based Grader\nDeterministic checks using code:\n```bash\n# Check if file contains expected pattern\ngrep -q \"export function handleAuth\" src/auth.ts && echo \"PASS\" || echo \"FAIL\"\n\n# Check if tests pass\nnpm test -- --testPathPattern=\"auth\" && echo \"PASS\" || echo \"FAIL\"\n\n# Check if build succeeds\nnpm run build && echo \"PASS\" || echo \"FAIL\"\n```\n\n### 2. Model-Based Grader\nUse Claude to evaluate open-ended outputs:\n```markdown\n[MODEL GRADER PROMPT]\nEvaluate the following code change:\n1. Does it solve the stated problem?\n2. Is it well-structured?\n3. Are edge cases handled?\n4. Is error handling appropriate?\n\nScore: 1-5 (1=poor, 5=excellent)\nReasoning: [explanation]\n```\n\n### 3. Human Grader\nFlag for manual review:\n```markdown\n[HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED]\nChange: Description of what changed\nReason: Why human review is needed\nRisk Level: LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH\n```\n\n## Metrics\n\n### pass@k\n\"At least one success in k attempts\"\n- pass@1: First attempt success rate\n- pass@3: Success within 3 attempts\n- Typical target: pass@3 > 90%\n\n### pass^k\n\"All k trials succeed\"\n- Higher bar for reliability\n- pass^3: 3 consecutive successes\n- Use for critical paths\n\n## Eval Workflow\n\n### 1. Define (Before Coding)\n```markdown\n## EVAL DEFINITION: feature-xyz\n\n### Capability Evals\n1. Can create new user account\n2. Can validate email format\n3. Can hash password securely\n\n### Regression Evals\n1. Existing login still works\n2. Session management unchanged\n3. Logout flow intact\n\n### Success Metrics\n- pass@3 > 90% for capability evals\n- pass^3 = 100% for regression evals\n```\n\n### 2. Implement\nWrite code to pass the defined evals.\n\n### 3. Evaluate\n```bash\n# Run capability evals\n[Run each capability eval, record PASS/FAIL]\n\n# Run regression evals\nnpm test -- --testPathPattern=\"existing\"\n\n# Generate report\n```\n\n### 4. Report\n```markdown\nEVAL REPORT: feature-xyz\n========================\n\nCapability Evals:\n  create-user:     PASS (pass@1)\n  validate-email:  PASS (pass@2)\n  hash-password:   PASS (pass@1)\n  Overall:         3/3 passed\n\nRegression Evals:\n  login-flow:      PASS\n  session-mgmt:    PASS\n  logout-flow:     PASS\n  Overall:         3/3 passed\n\nMetrics:\n  pass@1: 67% (2/3)\n  pass@3: 100% (3/3)\n\nStatus: READY FOR REVIEW\n```\n\n## Integration Patterns\n\n### Pre-Implementation\n```\n/eval define feature-name\n```\nCreates eval definition file at `.claude/evals/feature-name.md`\n\n### During Implementation\n```\n/eval check feature-name\n```\nRuns current evals and reports status\n\n### Post-Implementation\n```\n/eval report feature-name\n```\nGenerates full eval report\n\n## Eval Storage\n\nStore evals in project:\n```\n.claude/\n  evals/\n    feature-xyz.md      # Eval definition\n    feature-xyz.log     # Eval run history\n    baseline.json       # Regression baselines\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Define evals BEFORE coding** - Forces clear thinking about success criteria\n2. **Run evals frequently** - Catch regressions early\n3. **Track pass@k over time** - Monitor reliability trends\n4. **Use code graders when possible** - Deterministic > probabilistic\n5. **Human review for security** - Never fully automate security checks\n6. **Keep evals fast** - Slow evals don''t get run\n7. **Version evals with code** - Evals are first-class artifacts\n\n## Example: Adding Authentication\n\n```markdown\n## EVAL: add-authentication\n\n### Phase 1: Define (10 min)\nCapability Evals:\n- [ ] User can register with email/password\n- [ ] User can login with valid credentials\n- [ ] Invalid credentials rejected with proper error\n- [ ] Sessions persist across page reloads\n- [ ] Logout clears session\n\nRegression Evals:\n- [ ] Public routes still accessible\n- [ ] API responses unchanged\n- [ ] Database schema compatible\n\n### Phase 2: Implement (varies)\n[Write code]\n\n### Phase 3: Evaluate\nRun: /eval check add-authentication\n\n### Phase 4: Report\nEVAL REPORT: add-authentication\n==============================\nCapability: 5/5 passed (pass@3: 100%)\nRegression: 3/3 passed (pass^3: 100%)\nStatus: SHIP IT\n```\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:04:41.975Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能评估框架 - Eval Harness Skill","ja":"AIエージェントの評価フレームワーク - Eval Harness Skill","ko":"AI 에이전트 평가 프레임워크 - Eval Harness Skill","es":"Eval Harness: Marco de Evaluación para Agentes de IA","fr":"Eval Harness: Cadre d''Évaluation pour Outils d''IA","de":"Eval Harness: Bewertungsframework für KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramenta de Avaliação para Agentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Формальная Оценка для Claude Code","ar":"أداة تقييم الوكلاء الذكية","en":"eval-harness"},"description":{"zh":"Eval Harness Skill是一种用于Claude Code会话的正式评估框架，实现评估驱动开发（EDD）原则，用于评估AI智能体的性能","ja":"Eval Harness Skillは、Claude Codeセッション用の正式な評価フレームワークで、評価駆動開発（EDD）原則を実装します","ko":"Eval Harness Skill은 클라우드 코드 세션을 위한 공식 평가 프레임워크로 평가 주도 개발(EDD) 원칙을 구현하여 AI 에이전트의 성능을 평가합니다","es":"Eval Harness es un marco de evaluación formal para sesiones de Claude Code, que implementa principios de desarrollo guiado por evaluación","fr":"Eval Harness est un cadre d''évaluation formel pour les sessions Claude Code, mettant en œuvre les principes de développement guidé par l''évaluation","de":"Eval Harness ist ein formales Bewertungsframework für Claude Code-Sitzungen, das die Prinzipien der evaluierten Entwicklung umsetzt","pt":"O eval-harness é uma estrutura de avaliação formal para sessões de Claude Code, implementando princípios de desenvolvimento orientado a avaliação","ru":"ИИ Агенты: eval-harness - формальная оценка для сессий Claude Code, реализующая принципы разработки, управляемой оценкой","ar":"أداة تقييم الوكلاء الذكية هي إطار تقييم رسمي لجلسات Claude Code، يطبق مبادئ التطوير الموجه للتقييم","en":"Formal evaluation framework for Claude Code sessions implementing eval-driven development (EDD) principles"},"definition":{"en":"Formal evaluation framework for Claude Code sessions implementing eval-driven development (EDD) principles"},"features":{"zh":["评估驱动开发（EDD）原则","用于Claude Code会话的正式评估框架","AI智能体性能评估","支持评估驱动开发工作流","定义任务完成的通过/失败标准"],"ja":["評価駆動開発（EDD）原則","Claude Codeセッション用の正式な評価フレームワーク","AIエージェントの性能評価","評価駆動開発ワークフローのサポート","タスク完了の通過/失敗基準の定義"],"ko":["평가 주도 개발(EDD) 원칙","클라우드 코드 세션을 위한 공식 평가 프레임워크","AI 에이전트의 성능 평가","평가 주도 개발 워크플로우 지원","작업 완료의 통과/실패 기준 정의"],"es":["Marco de evaluación formal para sesiones de Claude Code","Implementación de principios de desarrollo guiado por evaluación","Definición de criterios de aprobación/rechazo para la finalización de tareas","Medición de la confiabilidad del agente con métricas pass@k","Creación de suites de pruebas de regresión para cambios en la solicitud o el agente","Benchmarcking del rendimiento del agente en diferentes versiones del modelo"],"fr":["Cadre d''évaluation formel pour les sessions Claude Code","Mise en œuvre des principes de développement guidé par l''évaluation","Définition des critères de validation/invalidation pour l''achèvement des tâches","Mesure de la fiabilité de l''agent avec des métriques pass@k","Création de suites de tests de régression pour les modifications de la requête ou de l''agent","Benchmarcking des performances de l''agent sur différentes versions du modèle"],"de":["Formales Bewertungsframework für Claude Code-Sitzungen","Umsetzung der Prinzipien der evaluierten Entwicklung","Definition von Bestehens-/Nichtbestehenskriterien für die Aufgabenerfüllung","Messung der Zuverlässigkeit des Agents mit pass@k-Metriken","Erstellung von Regressions-Test-Suiten für Änderungen an der Anfrage oder dem Agent","Benchmarcking der Leistung des Agents in verschiedenen Modellversionen"],"pt":["Avaliação formal para sessões de Claude Code","Implementação de princípios de desenvolvimento orientado a avaliação","Definição de critérios de aprovação/reprovação para tarefas de Claude Code","Medição da confiabilidade do agente com métricas pass@k","Criação de conjuntos de testes de regressão para alterações de prompts ou agentes"],"ru":["Формальная оценка для сессий Claude Code","Реализация принципов разработки, управляемой оценкой","Определение критериев сдачи/незачета для задач Claude Code","Измерение надежности агента с метриками pass@k","Создание наборов тестов регрессии для изменений промптов или агентов"],"ar":["التقييم الشامل لجلسات Claude Code","تنفيذ مبادئ التطوير الموجه للتقييم","تحديد معايير النجاح/الفشل للأعمال في جلسات Claude Code","قياس موثوقية الوكيل بمتغيرات النجاح","إنشاء مجموعات اختبار الانحدار لتحديثات الوكلاء أو الإشارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能评估","评估驱动开发","Claude Code","AI智能体","性能评估","评估框架","智能开发工具"],"ja":["AIエージェントの評価","評価駆動開発","Claude Code","AIエージェント","性能評価","評価フレームワーク","スマート開発ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 평가","평가 주도 개발","클라우드 코드","AI 에이전트","성능 평가","평가 프레임워크","스마트 개발 도구"],"es":["Agentes de IA","Herramientas de IA","Desarrollo guiado por evaluación","Eval Harness","Claude Code","Pruebas de regresión","Benchmarcking de rendimiento"],"fr":["Outils d''IA","Agents d''IA","Développement guidé par l''évaluation","Eval Harness","Claude Code","Tests de régression","Benchmarcking des performances"],"de":["KI-Agents","KI-Tools","Evaluierte Entwicklung","Eval Harness","Claude Code","Regressions-Tests","Benchmarcking der Leistung"],"pt":["agentes de ia","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","avaliação formal","desenvolvimento orientado a avaliação","claude code","eval-harness"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","инструменты разработки","формальная оценка","разработка, управляемая оценкой","claude code","eval-harness"],"ar":["وكلاء ذكية","أدوات تطوير","تقييم شامل","تطوير موجه للتقييم","كلود كود","أداة تقييم الوكلاء الذكية"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain requiring a structured approach to eval-driven development and reliability metrics","zh":"适用于 Claude Code、AutoGPT 和 LangChain 等 AI Agent，需要结构化方法进行评估驱动开发和可靠性指标","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChain などの AI エージェントに適しています。これらは評価駆動開発と信頼性メトリクスに構造化アプローチを必要とします","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain 등과 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 구조화된 접근 방식을 통해 평가 주도 개발 및 신뢰성 메트릭이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren un enfoque estructurado para el desarrollo dirigido por evaluación y métricas de confiabilidad","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une approche structurée pour le développement piloté par l''évaluation et les mesures de fiabilité","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die einen strukturierten Ansatz für die evaluierte Entwicklung und Zuverlässigkeitsmetriken erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que exigem uma abordagem estruturada para o desenvolvimento orientado por avaliação e métricas de confiabilidade","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих структурированного подхода к разработке, основанной на оценке, и метрикам надежности","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى نهج منظم لتطوير تقييم محرك وقياس موثوقية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement eval-driven development principles, defining pass/fail criteria and measuring reliability with pass@k metrics, while creating regression test suites for prompt or agent changes and benchmarking performance across model versions using eval-harness","zh":"赋予代理实现评估驱动开发原则的能力，定义通过/失败标准，并使用通过@k 指标衡量可靠性，同时为提示或代理更改创建回归测试套件，并使用 eval-harness 在模型版本之间基准性能","ja":"評価駆動開発の原則をエージェントに実装する能力を与え、パス/失敗の基準を定義し、パス@k メトリクスを使用して信頼性を測定し、while プロンプトまたはエージェントの変更のための回帰テスト スイートを作成し、eval-harness を使用してモデル バージョン間のパフォーマンスをベンチマークします","ko":"에이전트가 평가 주도 개발 원칙을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 통과/실패 기준을 정의하고, 통과@k 지표를 사용하여 신뢰성을 측정하며, 프롬프트 또는 에이전트 변경에 대한 회귀 테스트 스위트를 생성하고, eval-harness를 사용하여 모델 버전 간의 성능을 벤치마크합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar principios de desarrollo dirigido por evaluación, definiendo criterios de aprobado/reprobado y midiendo la confiabilidad con métricas pass@k, mientras crea conjuntos de pruebas de regresión para cambios de prompt o de agente y benchmarking del rendimiento en varias versiones del modelo utilizando eval-harness","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des principes de développement piloté par l''évaluation, en définissant des critères de réussite/échec et en mesurant la fiabilité avec des métriques pass@k, tout en créant des suites de tests de régression pour les modifications de prompt ou d''agent et en benchmarkant les performances sur différentes versions de modèle en utilisant eval-harness","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, evaluierte Entwicklungsprinzipien umzusetzen, indem sie Bestehen/Nichtbestehen-Kriterien definieren und die Zuverlässigkeit mit pass@k-Metriken messen, während sie Regressions-Test-Suiten für Prompt- oder Agentenänderungen erstellen und die Leistung über verschiedene Modellversionen hinweg mit eval-harness benchmarken","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar princípios de desenvolvimento orientado por avaliação, definindo critérios de aprovação/reprovação e medindo a confiabilidade com métricas pass@k, enquanto cria conjuntos de testes de regressão para alterações de prompt ou de agente e benchmark de desempenho em diferentes versões do modelo usando eval-harness","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать принципы разработки, основанной на оценке, определяя критерии сдачи/незачета и измеряя надежность с помощью метрик pass@k, а также создавать наборы регрессионных тестов для изменений подсказки или агента и оценку производительности по разным версиям модели с использованием eval-harness","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ مبادئ التطوير القائم على التقييم، ووضع معايير النجاح والفشل وقياس الموثوقية باستخدام مقاييس pass@k، في حين إنشاء مجموعات اختبار انحدار لتحديثات البرومت أو الوكيل وتحديد معايير الأداء عبر إصدارات النموذج المختلفة باستخدام eval-harness"},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up eval-driven development for AI-assisted workflows","Defining pass/fail criteria for task completion","Measuring agent reliability with pass@k metrics"],"zh":["为 AI 辅助工作流设置评估驱动开发","为任务完成定义通过/失败标准","使用通过@k 指标测量代理可靠性"],"ja":["AI支援ワークフローに評価駆動開発を設定する","タスク完了の通過/失敗基準を定義する","パス@k メトリクスを使用してエージェントの信頼性を測定する"],"ko":["AI 지원 워크플로우에 평가 주도 개발을 설정하는 것","작업 완료를 위한 통과/실패 기준을 정의하는 것","통과@k 지표를 사용하여 에이전트의 신뢰성을 측정하는 것"],"es":["Configuración del desarrollo dirigido por evaluación para flujos de trabajo asistidos por IA","Definición de criterios de aprobado/reprobado para la finalización de tareas","Medición de la confiabilidad del agente con métricas pass@k"],"fr":["Configuration du développement piloté par l''évaluation pour les flux de travail assistés par l''IA","Définition des critères de réussite/échec pour l''achèvement des tâches","Mesure de la fiabilité de l''agent avec des métriques pass@k"],"de":["Einrichtung der evaluierten Entwicklung für von KI unterstützte Arbeitsabläufe","Definition von Bestehen/Nichtbestehen-Kriterien für die Aufgabenabschluss","Messung der Zuverlässigkeit des Agents mit pass@k-Metriken"],"pt":["Configuração do desenvolvimento orientado por avaliação para fluxos de trabalho assistidos por IA","Definição de critérios de aprovação/reprovação para conclusão de tarefas","Medição da confiabilidade do agente com métricas pass@k"],"ru":["Настройка разработки, основанной на оценке, для рабочих процессов с поддержкой ИИ","Определение критериев сдачи/незачета для завершения задач","Измерение надежности агента с помощью метрик pass@k"],"ar":["تكوين التطوير القائم على التقييم لتدفقات العمل المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","تحديد معايير النجاح والفشل لإكمال المهام","قياس موثوقية الوكيل بمقاييس pass@k"]},"limitations":{"en":["Specific to Claude Code sessions","Requires implementation of eval-driven development principles"],"zh":["特定于 Claude Code 会话","需要实现评估驱动开发原则"],"ja":["Claude Code セッションに特有のもの","評価駆動開発の原則を実装する必要がある"],"ko":["Claude Code 세션에 특정된 것","평가 주도 개발 원칙을 구현해야 하는 것"],"es":["Específico para sesiones de Claude Code","Requiere la implementación de principios de desarrollo dirigido por evaluación"],"fr":["Spécifique aux sessions de Claude Code","Nécessite la mise en œuvre de principes de développement piloté par l''évaluation"],"de":["Spezifisch für Claude Code-Sitzungen","Erfordert die Umsetzung von evaluierten Entwicklungsprinzipien"],"pt":["Específico para sessões do Claude Code","Exige implementação de princípios de desenvolvimento orientado por avaliação"],"ru":["Спецефичен для сессий Claude Code","Требует реализации принципов разработки, основанной на оценке"],"ar":["محدد للجلسات الخاصة ببرنامج Claude Code","يتطلب تنفيذ مبادئ التطوير القائم على التقييم"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1fa9d38a64823e13c02b29df9e3598774218edb14dbbcbcb528e70874439554c","repoEtag":"W/\"364f268e25511efbc6f9c2152da6805d934c8ccbaa49ea479a3da0f27c55af07\"","qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/postgres-patterns', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'postgres-patterns', 50960, 6308, 75, '2026-02-24T12:02:48Z', '2026-02-24T12:04:49.878Z', 'f38ed542ddcc0adbab49a960badcf015d0153f9ebe3d38f73ff0972756bc205f', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/postgres-patterns","name":"postgres-patterns","description":{"zh":"Postgres 模式 AI 工具提供 PostgreSQL 最佳实践，用于查询优化、schema 设计、索引和安全性","ja":"Postgres パターン AI エージェントは、PostgreSQL のベストプラクティスを提供し、クエリ最適化、スキーマ設計、インデックス、セキュリティに対応","ko":"Postgres 패턴 AI 에이전트는 PostgreSQL 최적화된 패턴을 제공하며 쿼리 최적화, 스키마 설계, 인덱싱 및 보안에 도움을 줍니다","es":"Patrones de PostgreSQL para la optimización de consultas, diseño de esquemas y seguridad, basados en las mejores prácticas de Supabase para Agentes de IA","fr":"Modèles PostgreSQL pour l''optimisation des requêtes, la conception de schémas et la sécurité, basés sur les meilleures pratiques de Supabase pour les Agents IA","de":"PostgreSQL-Muster für die Optimierung von Abfragen, Schema-Design und Sicherheit, basierend auf den Best-Practices von Supabase für KI-Agents","pt":"O ''postgres-patterns'' é um agente que fornece padrões de PostgreSQL para otimização de consultas, design de esquemas e segurança, baseado nas melhores práticas do Supabase","ru":"Постгрес Паттерны - это ИИ Агент, который предоставляет рекомендации по оптимизации баз данных Постгрес, включая проектирование схем и безопасность на основе рекомендаций Supabase","ar":"نماذج قواعد البيانات پستجرس هو وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي يقدم نماذج لتحسين قواعد البيانات پستجرس، بما في ذلك تصميم مخططات البيانات والأمان على أساس أفضل الممارسات من Supabase","en":"PostgreSQL database patterns for query optimization, schema design, indexing, and security. Based on Supabase best practices."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":50960,"forks":6308,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:48Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"postgres-patterns","description":"PostgreSQL database patterns for query optimization, schema design, indexing, and security. Based on Supabase best practices.","bodyPreview":"# PostgreSQL Patterns\n\nQuick reference for PostgreSQL best practices. For detailed guidance, use the `database-reviewer` agent.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Writing SQL queries or migrations\n- Designing database schemas\n- Troubleshooting slow queries\n- Implementing Row Level Security\n- Setting up connection pooling\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Index Cheat Sheet\n\n| Query Pattern | Index Type | Example |\n|--------------|------------|---------|\n| `WHERE col = value` | B-tree (default) | `CREATE INDEX idx ON","body":"# PostgreSQL Patterns\n\nQuick reference for PostgreSQL best practices. For detailed guidance, use the `database-reviewer` agent.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Writing SQL queries or migrations\n- Designing database schemas\n- Troubleshooting slow queries\n- Implementing Row Level Security\n- Setting up connection pooling\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Index Cheat Sheet\n\n| Query Pattern | Index Type | Example |\n|--------------|------------|---------|\n| `WHERE col = value` | B-tree (default) | `CREATE INDEX idx ON t (col)` |\n| `WHERE col > value` | B-tree | `CREATE INDEX idx ON t (col)` |\n| `WHERE a = x AND b > y` | Composite | `CREATE INDEX idx ON t (a, b)` |\n| `WHERE jsonb @> ''{}''` | GIN | `CREATE INDEX idx ON t USING gin (col)` |\n| `WHERE tsv @@ query` | GIN | `CREATE INDEX idx ON t USING gin (col)` |\n| Time-series ranges | BRIN | `CREATE INDEX idx ON t USING brin (col)` |\n\n### Data Type Quick Reference\n\n| Use Case | Correct Type | Avoid |\n|----------|-------------|-------|\n| IDs | `bigint` | `int`, random UUID |\n| Strings | `text` | `varchar(255)` |\n| Timestamps | `timestamptz` | `timestamp` |\n| Money | `numeric(10,2)` | `float` |\n| Flags | `boolean` | `varchar`, `int` |\n\n### Common Patterns\n\n**Composite Index Order:**\n```sql\n-- Equality columns first, then range columns\nCREATE INDEX idx ON orders (status, created_at);\n-- Works for: WHERE status = ''pending'' AND created_at > ''2024-01-01''\n```\n\n**Covering Index:**\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx ON users (email) INCLUDE (name, created_at);\n-- Avoids table lookup for SELECT email, name, created_at\n```\n\n**Partial Index:**\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX idx ON users (email) WHERE deleted_at IS NULL;\n-- Smaller index, only includes active users\n```\n\n**RLS Policy (Optimized):**\n```sql\nCREATE POLICY policy ON orders\n  USING ((SELECT auth.uid()) = user_id);  -- Wrap in SELECT!\n```\n\n**UPSERT:**\n```sql\nINSERT INTO settings (user_id, key, value)\nVALUES (123, ''theme'', ''dark'')\nON CONFLICT (user_id, key)\nDO UPDATE SET value = EXCLUDED.value;\n```\n\n**Cursor Pagination:**\n```sql\nSELECT * FROM products WHERE id > $last_id ORDER BY id LIMIT 20;\n-- O(1) vs OFFSET which is O(n)\n```\n\n**Queue Processing:**\n```sql\nUPDATE jobs SET status = ''processing''\nWHERE id = (\n  SELECT id FROM jobs WHERE status = ''pending''\n  ORDER BY created_at LIMIT 1\n  FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED\n) RETURNING *;\n```\n\n### Anti-Pattern Detection\n\n```sql\n-- Find unindexed foreign keys\nSELECT conrelid::regclass, a.attname\nFROM pg_constraint c\nJOIN pg_attribute a ON a.attrelid = c.conrelid AND a.attnum = ANY(c.conkey)\nWHERE c.contype = ''f''\n  AND NOT EXISTS (\n    SELECT 1 FROM pg_index i\n    WHERE i.indrelid = c.conrelid AND a.attnum = ANY(i.indkey)\n  );\n\n-- Find slow queries\nSELECT query, mean_exec_time, calls\nFROM pg_stat_statements\nWHERE mean_exec_time > 100\nORDER BY mean_exec_time DESC;\n\n-- Check table bloat\nSELECT relname, n_dead_tup, last_vacuum\nFROM pg_stat_user_tables\nWHERE n_dead_tup > 1000\nORDER BY n_dead_tup DESC;\n```\n\n### Configuration Template\n\n```sql\n-- Connection limits (adjust for RAM)\nALTER SYSTEM SET max_connections = 100;\nALTER SYSTEM SET work_mem = ''8MB'';\n\n-- Timeouts\nALTER SYSTEM SET idle_in_transaction_session_timeout = ''30s'';\nALTER SYSTEM SET statement_timeout = ''30s'';\n\n-- Monitoring\nCREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS pg_stat_statements;\n\n-- Security defaults\nREVOKE ALL ON SCHEMA public FROM public;\n\nSELECT pg_reload_conf();\n```\n\n## Related\n\n- Agent: `database-reviewer` - Full database review workflow\n- Skill: `clickhouse-io` - ClickHouse analytics patterns\n- Skill: `backend-patterns` - API and backend patterns\n\n---\n\n*Based on [Supabase Agent Skills](https://github.com/supabase/agent-skills) (MIT License)*\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:04:49.878Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Postgres 模式 AI 工具","ja":"Postgres パターン AI エージェント","ko":"Postgres 패턴 AI 에이전트","es":"Patrones de PostgreSQL para Agentes de IA","fr":"Modèles PostgreSQL pour les Agents IA","de":"PostgreSQL-Muster für KI-Agents","pt":"Padrões de PostgreSQL para Otimização de Consultas","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Постгрес Паттерны для Оптимизации Баз Данных","ar":"نماذج قواعد البيانات پستجرس للتحسين","en":"postgres-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"Postgres 模式 AI 工具提供 PostgreSQL 最佳实践，用于查询优化、schema 设计、索引和安全性","ja":"Postgres パターン AI エージェントは、PostgreSQL のベストプラクティスを提供し、クエリ最適化、スキーマ設計、インデックス、セキュリティに対応","ko":"Postgres 패턴 AI 에이전트는 PostgreSQL 최적화된 패턴을 제공하며 쿼리 최적화, 스키마 설계, 인덱싱 및 보안에 도움을 줍니다","es":"Patrones de PostgreSQL para la optimización de consultas, diseño de esquemas y seguridad, basados en las mejores prácticas de Supabase para Agentes de IA","fr":"Modèles PostgreSQL pour l''optimisation des requêtes, la conception de schémas et la sécurité, basés sur les meilleures pratiques de Supabase pour les Agents IA","de":"PostgreSQL-Muster für die Optimierung von Abfragen, Schema-Design und Sicherheit, basierend auf den Best-Practices von Supabase für KI-Agents","pt":"O ''postgres-patterns'' é um agente que fornece padrões de PostgreSQL para otimização de consultas, design de esquemas e segurança, baseado nas melhores prátic...","ru":"Постгрес Паттерны - это ИИ Агент, который предоставляет рекомендации по оптимизации баз данных Постгрес, включая проектирование схем и безопасность на основе...","ar":"نماذج قواعد البيانات پستجرس هو وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي يقدم نماذج لتحسين قواعد البيانات پستجرس، بما في ذلك تصميم مخططات البيانات والأمان على أساس أفضل الممارسات من...","en":"PostgreSQL database patterns for query optimization, schema design, indexing, and security. Based on Supabase best practices."},"definition":{"en":"PostgreSQL database patterns for query optimization, schema design, indexing, and security. Based on Supabase best practices."},"features":{"zh":["查询优化模式","schema 设计模式","索引模式","安全性模式","基于 Supabase 最佳实践"],"ja":["クエリ最適化パターン","スキーマ設計パターン","インデックスパターン","セキュリティパターン","Supabase ベストプラクティスに基づく"],"ko":["쿼리 최적화 패턴","스키마 설계 패턴","인덱싱 패턴","보안 패턴","Supabase 최적화된 패턴을 기반으로"],"es":["Optimización de consultas SQL","Diseño de esquemas de base de datos","Configuración de índices","Implementación de seguridad de nivel de fila","Configuración de agrupación de conexiones"],"fr":["Optimisation des requêtes SQL","Conception de schémas de base de données","Configuration des index","Mise en œuvre de la sécurité au niveau des lignes","Configuration du regroupement de connexions"],"de":["Optimierung von SQL-Abfragen","Schema-Design für Datenbanken","Konfiguration von Indizes","Implementierung von Zeilensicherheit","Konfiguration von Verbindungspooling"],"pt":["Otimização de consultas SQL","Projeto de esquemas de banco de dados","Implementação de segurança de nível de linha","Configuração de pooling de conexões","Melhores práticas do Supabase"],"ru":["Оптимизация запросов SQL","Проектирование схем баз данных","Реализация безопасности уровня строки","Настройка пула соединений","Рекомендации Supabase"],"ar":["تحسين الاستفسارات SQL","تصميم مخططات قواعد البيانات","تنفيذ أمان مستوى السطر","تكوين مجموعة الاتصال","أفضل الممارسات من Supabase"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Postgres 模式","AI 工具","PostgreSQL","查询优化","schema 设计","索引","安全性","Supabase","数据库性能"],"ja":["Postgres パターン","AI エージェント","PostgreSQL","クエリ最適化","スキーマ設計","インデックス","セキュリティ","Supabase","データベースパフォーマンス"],"ko":["Postgres 패턴","AI 에이전트","PostgreSQL","쿼리 최적화","스키마 설계","인덱싱","보안","Supabase","데이터베이스 성능"],"es":["Agentes de IA","Herramientas de desarrollo","Optimización de consultas SQL","Diseño de esquemas de base de datos","Seguridad de nivel de fila","Supabase","PostgreSQL"],"fr":["Agents IA","Outils de développement","Optimisation des requêtes SQL","Conception de schémas de base de données","Sécurité au niveau des lignes","Supabase","PostgreSQL"],"de":["KI-Agents","Entwicklungstools","Optimierung von SQL-Abfragen","Schema-Design für Datenbanken","Zeilensicherheit","Supabase","PostgreSQL"],"pt":["padrões de PostgreSQL","otimização de consultas","projeto de esquemas","segurança de nível de linha","pooling de conexões","Supabase","banco de dados","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Постгрес Паттерны","Оптимизация баз данных","Проектирование схем","Безопасность уровня строки","Пул соединений","Supabase","База данных","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["نماذج قواعد البيانات پستجرس","تحسين قواعد البيانات","تصميم مخططات البيانات","أمان مستوى السطر","مجموعة الاتصال","Supabase","قاعدة البيانات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Database Analysis Agents needing advanced PostgreSQL query optimization and schema design capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级PostgreSQL查询优化和schema设计能力的数据库分析代理。","ja":"高度なPostgreSQLのクエリ最適化およびスキーマ設計能力が必要なデータベース分析エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 PostgreSQL 쿼리 최적화 및 스키마 설계 기능이 필요한 데이터베이스 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Bases de Datos que necesitan una optimización avanzada de consultas PostgreSQL y capacidades de diseño de esquema.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Bases de Données nécessitant une optimisation avancée des requêtes PostgreSQL et des capacités de conception de schéma.","de":"Perfekt für Datenbankanalyse-Agents, die eine erweiterte PostgreSQL-Abfrageoptimierung und Schema-Designfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Banco de Dados que necessitam de otimização avançada de consultas PostgreSQL e capacidades de design de esquema.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа баз данных, которым требуются продвинутые возможности оптимизации запросов PostgreSQL и проектирования схем.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل قاعدة البيانات التي تحتاج إلى تحسين متقدم لاستعلامات PostgreSQL وقدرات تصميم مخطط"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement efficient indexing strategies using B-tree indexes, optimize queries with Row Level Security, and design scalable database schemas based on Supabase best practices, leveraging connection pooling for enhanced performance.","zh":"赋予代理实现使用B-tree索引的高效索引策略，使用行级安全性优化查询，并基于Supabase最佳实践设计可扩展的数据库模式，利用连接池实现增强的性能。","ja":"B-tree索引を使用した効率的なインデックス戦略の実装、行レベルセキュリティを使用したクエリの最適化、Supabaseのベストプラクティスに基づいたスケーラブルなデータベーススキーマの設計、および接続プールを使用したパフォーマンスの向上をエージェントに実現します。","ko":"B-tree 인덱스를 사용한 효율적인 인덱싱 전략 구현, 행 수준 보안을 사용한 쿼리 최적화, Supabase의 최선의 방법에 따라 확장 가능한 데이터베이스 스키마를 설계하고, 연결 풀링을 사용하여 성능을 향상시키는 에이전트를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar estrategias de indexación eficientes utilizando índices B-tree, optimizar consultas con Seguridad de Nivel de Fila y diseñar esquemas de base de datos escalables basados en las mejores prácticas de Supabase, aprovechando la agrupación de conexiones para un rendimiento mejorado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des stratégies d''indexation efficaces en utilisant des index B-tree, d''optimiser les requêtes avec la Sécurité au Niveau des Lignes et de concevoir des schémas de base de données évolutifs basés sur les meilleures pratiques de Supabase, en exploitant le regroupement de connexions pour améliorer les performances.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, effiziente Indexierungsstrategien unter Verwendung von B-Baum-Indizes zu implementieren, Abfragen mit ZeilenEbene-Sicherheit zu optimieren und skalierbare Datenbank-Schemata auf Basis der Supabase-Best-Practices zu entwerfen, die Verbindungspooling für verbesserte Leistung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita agentes a implementar estratégias de indexação eficientes usando índices B-tree, otimizar consultas com Segurança de Nível de Linha e projetar esquemas de banco de dados escaláveis com base nas melhores práticas do Supabase, aproveitando o pooling de conexões para desempenho aprimorado.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать эффективные стратегии индексирования с использованием индексов B-tree, оптимизировать запросы с помощью Безопасности на уровне строк и разрабатывать масштабируемые схемы баз данных на основе最佳 практик Supabase, используя пулинг подключений для повышения производительности.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تنفيذ استراتيجيات فهرسة فعالة باستخدام فهرس الشجرة B، وتحسين الاستعلامات مع أمان مستوى الصف، وتصميم مخططات قاعدة البيانات القابلة للتطوير بناءً على أفضل الممارسات لـ Supabase، واستخدام 集합 الاتصال لتحسين الأداء"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing SQL queries for better performance","Designing secure database schemas with Row Level Security","Troubleshooting slow queries using indexing strategies"],"zh":["优化SQL查询以获得更好的性能","使用行级安全性设计安全的数据库模式","使用索引策略排查慢速查询"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの向上のためにSQLクエリを最適化する","行レベルセキュリティを使用してセキュアなデータベーススキーマを設計する","インデックス戦略を使用して遅いクエリをトラブルシューティングする"],"ko":["성능 개선을 위해 SQL 쿼리 최적화","행 수준 보안을 사용하여 보안 데이터베이스 스키마設計","인덱싱 전략을 사용하여 느린 쿼리 문제 해결"],"es":["Optimizar consultas SQL para un mejor rendimiento","Diseñar esquemas de base de datos seguros con Seguridad de Nivel de Fila","Solucionar problemas de consultas lentas utilizando estrategias de indexación"],"fr":["Optimiser les requêtes SQL pour de meilleures performances","Concevoir des schémas de base de données sécurisés avec la Sécurité au Niveau des Lignes","Résoudre les problèmes de requêtes lentes en utilisant des stratégies d''indexation"],"de":["SQL-Abfragen für bessere Leistung optimieren","Sichere Datenbank-Schemata mit ZeilenEbene-Sicherheit entwerfen","Probleme mit langsamen Abfragen unter Verwendung von Indexierungsstrategien lösen"],"pt":["Otimizando consultas SQL para melhor desempenho","Projetando esquemas de banco de dados seguros com Segurança de Nível de Linha","Solucionando problemas de consultas lentas usando estratégias de indexação"],"ru":["Оптимизация запросов SQL для лучшей производительности","Проектирование безопасных схем баз данных с Безопасностью на уровне строк","Поиск и решение проблем с медленными запросами с помощью стратегий индексирования"],"ar":["تحسين استعلامات SQL من أجل أداء أفضل","تصميم مخططات قاعدة البيانات الآمنة مع أمان مستوى الصف","معالجة مشاكل الاستعلامات البطيئة باستخدام استراتيجيات الفهرسة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PostgreSQL database access","Based on Supabase best practices, may not be compatible with all PostgreSQL implementations"],"zh":["需要PostgreSQL数据库访问","基于Supabase最佳实践，可能与所有PostgreSQL实现不兼容"],"ja":["PostgreSQLデータベースへのアクセスが必要","Supabaseのベストプラクティスに基づいているため、すべてのPostgreSQL実装と互換性がない場合がある"],"ko":["PostgreSQL 데이터베이스 액세스가 필요","Supabase의 최선의 방법을 기반으로 하므로 모든 PostgreSQL 구현과 호환되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de datos PostgreSQL","Basado en las mejores prácticas de Supabase, puede que no sea compatible con todas las implementaciones de PostgreSQL"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de données PostgreSQL","Basé sur les meilleures pratiques de Supabase, il peut ne pas être compatible avec toutes les implémentations de PostgreSQL"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die PostgreSQL-Datenbank","Basierend auf den Supabase-Best-Practices, ist es möglicherweise nicht kompatibel mit allen PostgreSQL-Implementierungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao banco de dados PostgreSQL","Baseado nas melhores práticas do Supabase, pode não ser compatível com todas as implementações do PostgreSQL"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к базе данных PostgreSQL","Основан на最佳 практиках Supabase, может быть несовместим со всеми реализациями PostgreSQL"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة البيانات PostgreSQL","استنادًا إلى أفضل الممارسات لـ Supabase، قد لا يكون متوافقًا مع جميع تنفيذات PostgreSQL"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f38ed542ddcc0adbab49a960badcf015d0153f9ebe3d38f73ff0972756bc205f","repoEtag":"W/\"364f268e25511efbc6f9c2152da6805d934c8ccbaa49ea479a3da0f27c55af07\"","qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('getsentry/skills/code-review', 'official', 'getsentry', 'skills', 'getsentry/skills', 'code-review', 302, 7, 75, '2026-02-24T10:49:39Z', '2026-02-24T12:13:31.127Z', 'ec5fc8855cb4648b4f2c79b608f8c8824a2da6a683330524c4d6283e4a3954c4', '{"id":"getsentry/skills/code-review","name":"code-review","description":{"zh":"Sentry 代码审查指南提供代码质量和安全性检查清单，确保代码符合 Sentry 工程实践","ja":"Sentry コードレビュー ガイドでは、コードの品質とセキュリティを確認するチェックリストを提供します","ko":"Sentry 코드 리뷰 가이드는 코드 품질 및 보안을 확인하는 체크리스트를 제공하여 Sentry 엔지니어링 실践에 따라 코드를 검토합니다","es":"La revisión de código de Sentry sigue las mejores prácticas de ingeniería para garantizar la calidad y seguridad del código. Cubre seguridad, rendimiento, pruebas y revisión de diseño.","fr":"La révision de code Sentry suit les meilleures pratiques d''ingénierie pour garantir la qualité et la sécurité du code. Couvre la sécurité, les performances, les tests et la révision de la conception.","de":"Die Code-Review von Sentry folgt den besten Praktiken des Engineerings, um die Qualität und Sicherheit des Codes zu gewährleisten. Umfasst Sicherheit, Leistung, Tests und Design-Review.","pt":"A revisão de código Sentry é um processo que segue as práticas de engenharia da Sentry para garantir a qualidade e a segurança do código.","ru":"Проверка кода Sentry - это процесс, следующий практикам инженерии Sentry для обеспечения качества и безопасности кода.","ar":"استعراض رمز Sentry هو عملية تتبع ممارسات هندسة Sentry لضمان جودة وأمان الرمز","en":"Perform code reviews following Sentry engineering practices. Use when reviewing pull requests, examining code changes, or providing feedback on code quality. Covers security, performance, testing, and design review."},"owner":"getsentry","repo":"skills","repoPath":"getsentry/skills","stars":302,"forks":7,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T10:49:39Z","topics":["tag-production"],"skillMd":{"name":"code-review","description":"Perform code reviews following Sentry engineering practices. Use when reviewing pull requests, examining code changes, or providing feedback on code quality. Covers security, performance, testing, and design review.","bodyPreview":"# Sentry Code Review\n\nFollow these guidelines when reviewing code for Sentry projects.\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n### Identifying Problems\n\nLook for these issues in code changes:\n\n- **Runtime errors**: Potential exceptions, null pointer issues, out-of-bounds access\n- **Performance**: Unbounded O(n²) operations, N+1 queries, unnecessary allocations\n- **Side effects**: Unintended behavioral changes affecting other components\n- **Backwards compatibility**: Breaking API changes without migration path\n- *","body":"# Sentry Code Review\n\nFollow these guidelines when reviewing code for Sentry projects.\n\n## Review Checklist\n\n### Identifying Problems\n\nLook for these issues in code changes:\n\n- **Runtime errors**: Potential exceptions, null pointer issues, out-of-bounds access\n- **Performance**: Unbounded O(n²) operations, N+1 queries, unnecessary allocations\n- **Side effects**: Unintended behavioral changes affecting other components\n- **Backwards compatibility**: Breaking API changes without migration path\n- **ORM queries**: Complex Django ORM with unexpected query performance\n- **Security vulnerabilities**: Injection, XSS, access control gaps, secrets exposure\n\n### Design Assessment\n\n- Do component interactions make logical sense?\n- Does the change align with existing project architecture?\n- Are there conflicts with current requirements or goals?\n\n### Test Coverage\n\nEvery PR should have appropriate test coverage:\n\n- Functional tests for business logic\n- Integration tests for component interactions\n- End-to-end tests for critical user paths\n\nVerify tests cover actual requirements and edge cases. Avoid excessive branching or looping in test code.\n\n### Long-Term Impact\n\nFlag for senior engineer review when changes involve:\n\n- Database schema modifications\n- API contract changes\n- New framework or library adoption\n- Performance-critical code paths\n- Security-sensitive functionality\n\n## Feedback Guidelines\n\n### Tone\n\n- Be polite and empathetic\n- Provide actionable suggestions, not vague criticism\n- Phrase as questions when uncertain: \"Have you considered...?\"\n\n### Approval\n\n- Approve when only minor issues remain\n- Don''t block PRs for stylistic preferences\n- Remember: the goal is risk reduction, not perfect code\n\n## Common Patterns to Flag\n\n### Python/Django\n\n```python\n# Bad: N+1 query\nfor user in users:\n    print(user.profile.name)  # Separate query per user\n\n# Good: Prefetch related\nusers = User.objects.prefetch_related(''profile'')\n```\n\n### TypeScript/React\n\n```typescript\n// Bad: Missing dependency in useEffect\nuseEffect(() => {\n  fetchData(userId);\n}, []);  // userId not in deps\n\n// Good: Include all dependencies\nuseEffect(() => {\n  fetchData(userId);\n}, [userId]);\n```\n\n### Security\n\n```python\n# Bad: SQL injection risk\ncursor.execute(f\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = {user_id}\")\n\n# Good: Parameterized query\ncursor.execute(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = %s\", [user_id])\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [Sentry Code Review Guidelines](https://develop.sentry.dev/engineering-practices/code-review/)\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:13:31.127Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Sentry 代码审查指南","ja":"Sentry コードレビュー ガイド","ko":"Sentry 코드 리뷰 가이드","es":"Revisión de Código de Sentry","fr":"Révision de Code Sentry","de":"Sentry Code-Review","pt":"Revisão de Código Sentry","ru":"Проверка Код Sentry","ar":"استعراض رمز Sentry","en":"code-review"},"description":{"zh":"Sentry 代码审查指南提供代码质量和安全性检查清单，确保代码符合 Sentry 工程实践","ja":"Sentry コードレビュー ガイドでは、コードの品質とセキュリティを確認するチェックリストを提供します","ko":"Sentry 코드 리뷰 가이드는 코드 품질 및 보안을 확인하는 체크리스트를 제공하여 Sentry 엔지니어링 실践에 따라 코드를 검토합니다","es":"La revisión de código de Sentry sigue las mejores prácticas de ingeniería para garantizar la calidad y seguridad del código. Cubre seguridad, rendimiento, pr...","fr":"La révision de code Sentry suit les meilleures pratiques d''ingénierie pour garantir la qualité et la sécurité du code. Couvre la sécurité, les performances, ...","de":"Die Code-Review von Sentry folgt den besten Praktiken des Engineerings, um die Qualität und Sicherheit des Codes zu gewährleisten. Umfasst Sicherheit, Leistu...","pt":"A revisão de código Sentry é um processo que segue as práticas de engenharia da Sentry para garantir a qualidade e a segurança do código.","ru":"Проверка кода Sentry - это процесс, следующий практикам инженерии Sentry для обеспечения качества и безопасности кода.","ar":"استعراض رمز Sentry هو عملية تتبع ممارسات هندسة Sentry لضمان جودة وأمان الرمز","en":"Perform code reviews following Sentry engineering practices. Use when reviewing pull requests, examining code changes, or providing feedback on code quality...."},"definition":{"en":"Perform code reviews following Sentry engineering practices. Use when reviewing pull requests, examining code changes, or providing feedback on code quality. Covers security, performance, testing, and design review."},"features":{"zh":["代码安全性检查","性能优化","测试和设计评审","后向兼容性检查"],"ja":["コードのセキュリティ チェック","パフォーマンスの最適化","テストとデザインのレビュー","後方互換性のチェック"],"ko":["코드 보안성 확인","성능 최적화","테스트 및 설계 리뷰","후방 호환성 확인"],"es":["Revisión de seguridad","Análisis de rendimiento","Detección de efectos secundarios","Verificación de compatibilidad hacia atrás","Revisión de diseño"],"fr":["Révision de sécurité","Analyse de performances","Détection d''effets secondaires","Vérification de la compatibilité ascendante","Révision de conception"],"de":["Sicherheitsprüfung","Leistungsanalyse","Erkennung von Nebenwirkungen","Überprüfung der Abwärtskompatibilität","Design-Review"],"pt":["Identificação de erros de runtime","Análise de desempenho","Verificação de efeitos colaterais","Verificação de compatibilidade para trás"],"ru":["Определение ошибок времени выполнения","Анализ производительности","Проверка побочных эффектов","Проверка обратной совместимости"],"ar":["تحديد أخطاء وقت التشغيل","تحليل الأداء","فحص الآثار الجانبية","فحص التوافق العكسي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","Sentry","代码质量","代码安全性","性能优化","测试和设计"],"ja":["コードレビュー","Sentry","コード品質","コードセキュリティ","パフォーマンス最適化","テストとデザイン"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","Sentry","코드 품질","코드 보안성","성능 최적화","테스트 및 설계"],"es":["revisión de código","mejores prácticas de ingeniería","seguridad del código","rendimiento del código","pruebas de código","diseño de código"],"fr":["révision de code","meilleures pratiques d''ingénierie","sécurité du code","performances du code","tests de code","conception de code"],"de":["Code-Review","beste Praktiken des Engineerings","Sicherheit des Codes","Leistung des Codes","Code-Tests","Code-Design"],"pt":["revisão de código","segurança de código","desempenho de código","design de código","práticas de engenharia","Sentry"],"ru":["проверка кода","безопасность кода","производительность кода","дизайн кода","практики инженерии","Sentry"],"ar":["استعراض الرمز","أمان الرمز","أداء الرمز","تصميم الرمز","ممارسات الهندسة","Sentry"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Analysis Agents requiring rigorous Sentry engineering practices for reviewing pull requests and examining code changes.","zh":"适用于需要严格遵守Sentry工程实践的代码分析代理，用于审查拉取请求和检查代码更改。","ja":"Sentryエンジニアリングの厳格な実践を必要とするコード分析エージェントに最適です。プルリクエストのレビューとコード変更の検査に使用されます。","ko":"코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다. Sentry 엔지니어링 관행을 엄격히 준수하여 풀 리퀘스트를 검토하고 코드 변경을 검사하는 데 사용됩니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de código que requieren prácticas de ingeniería de Sentry rigurosas para revisar solicitudes de extracción y examinar cambios de código.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant des pratiques d''ingénierie Sentry rigoureuses pour examiner les demandes d''extraction et examiner les modifications de code.","de":"Ideal für Code-Analyse-Agents, die strenge Sentry-Technikpraktiken für die Überprüfung von Pull-Requests und die Untersuchung von Code-Änderungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Código que exigem práticas rigorosas de engenharia Sentry para revisar solicitações de pull e examinar alterações de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, требующих строгих инженерных практик Sentry для рассмотрения запросов на включение и изучения изменений кода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يتطلب ممارسات هندسية صارمة من Sentry لمراجعة طلبات السحب وفحص تغييرات الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify runtime errors, performance issues, and security vulnerabilities using a comprehensive review checklist, ensuring backwards compatibility and adherence to best practices for testing and design review, all while following Sentry guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理识别运行时错误、性能问题和安全漏洞的能力，使用综合审查清单，确保向后兼容性和遵守测试和设计审查的最佳实践，同时遵循Sentry指南。","ja":"エージェントがランタイムエラー、パフォーマンスの問題、セキュリティ脆弱性を特定することができるようにし、包括的なレビュー チェックリストを使用して、後方互換性とテストおよび設計レビューのベストプラクティスへの準拠を確保し、Sentryのガイドラインに従います。","ko":"에이전트가 런타임 오류, 성능 문제 및 보안 취약성을 식별할 수 있도록 하며, 종합적인 검토 체크리스트를 사용하여 후방 호환성 및 테스트 및 설계 검토의 모범 사례를 준수하고, 센트리 지침을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para identificar errores de tiempo de ejecución, problemas de rendimiento y vulnerabilidades de seguridad utilizando una lista de verificación de revisión exhaustiva, garantizando la compatibilidad hacia atrás y el cumplimiento de las mejores prácticas para pruebas y revisión de diseño, todo siguiendo las pautas de Sentry.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les erreurs d''exécution, les problèmes de performances et les vulnérabilités de sécurité en utilisant une liste de vérification de révision complète, en garantissant la compatibilité ascendante et le respect des meilleures pratiques pour les tests et la révision de conception, le tout en suivant les directives de Sentry.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Laufzeitfehler, Leistungsprobleme und Sicherheitslücken unter Verwendung einer umfassenden Überprüfungs-Checkliste zu identifizieren, um die Abwärtskompatibilität und die Einhaltung der besten Praktiken für Tests und Designprüfung sicherzustellen, und dabei den Sentry-Richtlinien zu folgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar erros de tempo de execução, problemas de desempenho e vulnerabilidades de segurança usando uma lista de verificação abrangente, garantindo compatibilidade com versões anteriores e adesão às melhores práticas para teste e revisão de design, tudo seguindo as diretrizes da Sentry.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять ошибки времени выполнения, проблемы с производительностью и уязвимости безопасности с помощью всестороннего контрольного списка, обеспечивая совместимость с предыдущими версиями и соблюдение лучших практик для тестирования и рассмотрения конструкции, все это при соблюдении руководящих принципов Sentry.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تحديد أخطاء وقت التشغيل ومشاكل الأداء والثغرات الأمنية باستخدام قائمة مراجعة شاملة، مما يضمن التوافق مع الإصدارات السابقة والامتثال لأفضل الممارسات لاختبار ومراجعة التصميم، وكل ذلك اتباعًا لإرشادات Sentry."},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing pull requests for potential exceptions and null pointer issues","Examining code changes for performance optimization opportunities","Providing feedback on code quality and security"],"zh":["审查拉取请求以查找潜在的异常和空指针问题","检查代码更改以查找性能优化机会","提供有关代码质量和安全性的反馈"],"ja":["潜在の例外とヌルポインタの問題を探すためにプルリクエストをレビューする","パフォーマンス最適化の機会を探すためにコードの変更を調べる","コードの品質とセキュリティに関するフィードバックを提供する"],"ko":["潜在的な 예외 및 널 포인터 문제를 tìm kiếm하기 위해 풀 리퀘스트를 검토","성능 최적화를 위한 기회를 찾기 위해 코드 변경을 조사","코드 품질 및 보안에 대한 피드백 제공"],"es":["Revisar solicitudes de extracción para posibles excepciones y problemas de punteros nulos","Examinar cambios de código para oportunidades de optimización del rendimiento","Proporcionar comentarios sobre la calidad y seguridad del código"],"fr":["Examiner les demandes d''extraction pour les exceptions et les problèmes de pointeurs nuls potentiels","Examiner les modifications de code pour les opportunités d''optimisation des performances","Fournir des commentaires sur la qualité et la sécurité du code"],"de":["Überprüfen von Pull-Requests auf potenzielle Ausnahmen und Nullzeigerprobleme","Untersuchen von Code-Änderungen auf Chancen zur Leistungsoptimierung","Bereitstellen von Feedback zur Code-Qualität und -Sicherheit"],"pt":["Revisar solicitações de pull para possíveis exceções e problemas de ponteiro nulo","Examinar alterações de código para oportunidades de otimização de desempenho","Fornecer feedback sobre a qualidade e segurança do código"],"ru":["Просмотр запросов на включение на возможные исключения и проблемы с пустыми указателями","Изучение изменений кода для возможностей оптимизации производительности","Предоставление обратной связи о качестве и безопасности кода"],"ar":["مراجعة طلبات السحب للاستثناءات المحتملة ومشاكل المؤشرات الفارغة","فحص تغييرات الشفرة لفرص تحسين الأداء","توفير ملاحظات حول جودة وأمان الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Sentry engineering practices","Limited to code review use cases","May require additional setup for integration with existing development workflows"],"zh":["需要了解Sentry工程实践","仅限代码审查用例","可能需要额外的设置来与现有的开发工作流集成"],"ja":["Sentryエンジニアリングの実践を理解する必要がある","コードレビューのユースケースに限定される","既存の開発ワークフローとの統合には追加の設定が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["센트리 엔지니어링 관행을 이해해야 함","코드 리뷰 유즈케이스에만 국한됨","既存의 개발 워크플로와의 통합에는 추가 설정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de las prácticas de ingeniería de Sentry","Limitado a casos de uso de revisión de código","Puede requerir configuración adicional para la integración con flujos de trabajo de desarrollo existentes"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en pratiques d''ingénierie Sentry","Limité aux cas d''utilisation de révision de code","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour l''intégration avec les flux de travail de développement existants"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Sentry-Technikpraktiken","Begrenzt auf Code-Review-Anwendungsfälle","Kann eine zusätzliche Einrichtung für die Integration in bestehende Entwicklungsworkflows erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de práticas de engenharia Sentry","Limitado a casos de uso de revisão de código","Pode exigir configuração adicional para integração com fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento existentes"],"ru":["Требует знания инженерных практик Sentry","Ограничен случаями использования рассмотрения кода","Может требовать дополнительной настройки для интеграции с существующими рабочими процессами разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بممارسات هندسية Sentry","محدود حالات استخدام مراجعة الشفرة","يمكن أن يتطلب إعدادًا إضافيًا لتكامل مع سير عمل التطوير الحالية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ec5fc8855cb4648b4f2c79b608f8c8824a2da6a683330524c4d6283e4a3954c4","repoEtag":"W/\"2a524a36d10d78094c72f484233406f0cd4722cd88b5444674b33d0b91d29676\"","qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('getsentry/skills/django-access-review', 'official', 'getsentry', 'skills', 'getsentry/skills', 'django-access-review', 302, 7, 75, '2026-02-24T10:49:39Z', '2026-02-24T12:14:44.309Z', '75a58e3cf7bd7f3b65402c36424623e3f43ea1e8905b07494eaaae0d97a85dd9', '{"id":"getsentry/skills/django-access-review","name":"django-access-review","description":{"zh":"Django访问控制和IDOR安全审查AI工具，用于保护Python应用程序","ja":"Djangoアクセス制御とIDORセキュリティレビューAIエージェントによるPythonアプリケーションの保護","ko":"장고 액세스 리뷰 및 IDOR 보안 검토 AI 에이전트를 통한 Python 애플리케이션 보호","es":"La revisión de acceso Django es una herramienta de AI que ayuda a revisar y mejorar la seguridad de acceso y control de IDOR en aplicaciones Django","fr":"La révision d''accès Django est un outil d''IA qui aide à réviser et améliorer la sécurité d''accès et de contrôle IDOR dans les applications Django","de":"Die Django-Zugriffsprüfung ist ein KI-Tool, das hilft, die Sicherheit von Zugriff und IDOR-Kontrolle in Django-Anwendungen zu überprüfen und zu verbessern","pt":"A revisão de acesso Django é uma ferramenta de IA que ajuda a garantir a segurança do seu aplicativo, prevenindo IDOR e vulnerabilidades de acesso.","ru":"Обзор доступа Django - это инструмент ИИ, который помогает обеспечить безопасность вашего приложения, предотвращая IDOR и уязвимости доступа.","ar":"مراجعة الوصول Django هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد على ضمان أمان تطبيقك، ومنع IDOR وثغرات الوصول.","en":"Django access control and IDOR security review. Use when reviewing Django views, DRF viewsets, ORM queries, or any Python/Django code handling user authorization. Trigger keywords: IDOR, access control, authorization, Django permissions, object permissions, tenant isolation, broken access."},"owner":"getsentry","repo":"skills","repoPath":"getsentry/skills","stars":302,"forks":7,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T10:49:39Z","topics":["tag-production"],"skillMd":{"name":"django-access-review","description":"Django access control and IDOR security review. Use when reviewing Django views, DRF viewsets, ORM queries, or any Python/Django code handling user authorization. Trigger keywords: IDOR, access control, authorization, Django permissions, object permissions, tenant isolation, broken access.","bodyPreview":"<!--\nReference material based on OWASP Cheat Sheet Series (CC BY-SA 4.0)\nhttps://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/\n-->\n\n# Django Access Control & IDOR Review\n\nFind access control vulnerabilities by investigating how the codebase answers one question:\n\n**Can User A access, modify, or delete User B''s data?**\n\n## Philosophy: Investigation Over Pattern Matching\n\nDo NOT scan for predefined vulnerable patterns. Instead:\n\n1. **Understand** how authorization works in THIS codebase\n2. **Ask questions** about s","body":"<!--\nReference material based on OWASP Cheat Sheet Series (CC BY-SA 4.0)\nhttps://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/\n-->\n\n# Django Access Control & IDOR Review\n\nFind access control vulnerabilities by investigating how the codebase answers one question:\n\n**Can User A access, modify, or delete User B''s data?**\n\n## Philosophy: Investigation Over Pattern Matching\n\nDo NOT scan for predefined vulnerable patterns. Instead:\n\n1. **Understand** how authorization works in THIS codebase\n2. **Ask questions** about specific data flows\n3. **Trace code** to find where (or if) access checks happen\n4. **Report** only what you''ve confirmed through investigation\n\nEvery codebase implements authorization differently. Your job is to understand this specific implementation, then find gaps.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1: Understand the Authorization Model\n\nBefore looking for bugs, answer these questions about the codebase:\n\n### How is authorization enforced?\n\nResearch the codebase to find:\n\n```\n□ Where are permission checks implemented?\n  - Decorators? (@login_required, @permission_required, custom?)\n  - Middleware? (TenantMiddleware, AuthorizationMiddleware?)\n  - Base classes? (BaseAPIView, TenantScopedViewSet?)\n  - Permission classes? (DRF permission_classes?)\n  - Custom mixins? (OwnershipMixin, TenantMixin?)\n\n□ How are queries scoped?\n  - Custom managers? (TenantManager, UserScopedManager?)\n  - get_queryset() overrides?\n  - Middleware that sets query context?\n\n□ What''s the ownership model?\n  - Single user ownership? (document.owner_id)\n  - Organization/tenant ownership? (document.organization_id)\n  - Hierarchical? (org -> team -> user -> resource)\n  - Role-based within context? (org admin vs member)\n```\n\n### Investigation commands\n\n```bash\n# Find how auth is typically done\ngrep -rn \"permission_classes\\|@login_required\\|@permission_required\" --include=\"*.py\" | head -20\n\n# Find base classes that views inherit from\ngrep -rn \"class Base.*View\\|class.*Mixin.*:\" --include=\"*.py\" | head -20\n\n# Find custom managers\ngrep -rn \"class.*Manager\\|def get_queryset\" --include=\"*.py\" | head -20\n\n# Find ownership fields on models\ngrep -rn \"owner\\|user_id\\|organization\\|tenant\" --include=\"models.py\" | head -30\n```\n\n**Do not proceed until you understand the authorization model.**\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Map the Attack Surface\n\nIdentify endpoints that handle user-specific data:\n\n### What resources exist?\n\n```\n□ What models contain user data?\n□ Which have ownership fields (owner_id, user_id, organization_id)?\n□ Which are accessed via ID in URLs or request bodies?\n```\n\n### What operations are exposed?\n\nFor each resource, map:\n- List endpoints - what data is returned?\n- Detail/retrieve endpoints - how is the object fetched?\n- Create endpoints - who sets the owner?\n- Update endpoints - can users modify others'' data?\n- Delete endpoints - can users delete others'' data?\n- Custom actions - what do they access?\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: Ask Questions and Investigate\n\nFor each endpoint that handles user data, ask:\n\n### The Core Question\n\n**\"If I''m User A and I know the ID of User B''s resource, can I access it?\"**\n\nTrace the code to answer this:\n\n```\n1. Where does the resource ID enter the system?\n   - URL path: /api/documents/{id}/\n   - Query param: ?document_id=123\n   - Request body: {\"document_id\": 123}\n\n2. Where is that ID used to fetch data?\n   - Find the ORM query or database call\n\n3. Between (1) and (2), what checks exist?\n   - Is the query scoped to current user?\n   - Is there an explicit ownership check?\n   - Is there a permission check on the object?\n   - Does a base class or mixin enforce access?\n\n4. If you can''t find a check, is there one you missed?\n   - Check parent classes\n   - Check middleware\n   - Check managers\n   - Check decorators at URL level\n```\n\n### Follow-Up Questions\n\n```\n□ For list endpoints: Does the query filter to user''s data, or return everything?\n\n□ For create endpoints: Who sets the owner - the server or the request?\n\n□ For bulk operations: Are they scoped to user''s data?\n\n□ For related resources: If I can access a document, can I access its comments?\n  What if the document belongs to someone else?\n\n□ For tenant/org resources: Can User in Org A access Org B''s data by changing\n  the org_id in the URL?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Phase 4: Trace Specific Flows\n\nPick a concrete endpoint and trace it completely.\n\n### Example Investigation\n\n```\nEndpoint: GET /api/documents/{pk}/\n\n1. Find the view handling this URL\n   → DocumentViewSet.retrieve() in api/views.py\n\n2. Check what DocumentViewSet inherits from\n   → class DocumentViewSet(viewsets.ModelViewSet)\n   → No custom base class with authorization\n\n3. Check permission_classes\n   → permission_classes = [IsAuthenticated]\n   → Only checks login, not ownership\n\n4. Check get_queryset()\n   → def get_queryset(self):\n   →     return Document.objects.all()\n   → Returns ALL documents!\n\n5. Check for has_object_permission()\n   → Not implemented\n\n6. Check retrieve() method\n   → Uses default, which calls get_object()\n   → get_object() uses get_queryset(), which returns all\n\n7. Conclusion: IDOR - Any authenticated user can access any document\n```\n\n### What to look for when tracing\n\n```\nPotential gap indicators (investigate further, don''t auto-flag):\n- get_queryset() returns .all() or filters without user\n- Direct Model.objects.get(pk=pk) without ownership in query\n- ID comes from request body for sensitive operations\n- Permission class checks auth but not ownership\n- No has_object_permission() and queryset isn''t scoped\n\nLikely safe patterns (but verify the implementation):\n- get_queryset() filters by request.user or user''s org\n- Custom permission class with has_object_permission()\n- Base class that enforces scoping\n- Manager that auto-filters\n```\n\n---\n\n## Phase 5: Report Findings\n\nOnly report issues you''ve confirmed through investigation.\n\n### Confidence Levels\n\n| Level | Meaning | Action |\n|-------|---------|--------|\n| **HIGH** | Traced the flow, confirmed no check exists | Report with evidence |\n| **MEDIUM** | Check may exist but couldn''t confirm | Note for manual verification |\n| **LOW** | Theoretical, likely mitigated | Do not report |\n\n### Suggested Fixes Must Enforce, Not Document\n\n**Bad fix**: Adding a comment saying \"caller must validate permissions\"\n**Good fix**: Adding code that actually validates permissions\n\nA comment or docstring does not enforce authorization. Your suggested fix must include actual code that:\n- Validates the user has permission before proceeding\n- Raises an exception or returns an error if unauthorized\n- Makes unauthorized access impossible, not just discouraged\n\nExample of a BAD fix suggestion:\n```python\ndef get_resource(resource_id):\n    # IMPORTANT: Caller must ensure user has access to this resource\n    return Resource.objects.get(pk=resource_id)\n```\n\nExample of a GOOD fix suggestion:\n```python\ndef get_resource(resource_id, user):\n    resource = Resource.objects.get(pk=resource_id)\n    if resource.owner_id != user.id:\n        raise PermissionDenied(\"Access denied\")\n    return resource\n```\n\nIf you can''t determine the right enforcement mechanism, say so - but never suggest documentation as the fix.\n\n### Report Format\n\n```markdown\n## Access Control Review: [Component]\n\n### Authorization Model\n[Brief description of how this codebase handles authorization]\n\n### Findings\n\n#### [IDOR-001] [Title] (Severity: High/Medium)\n- **Location**: `path/to/file.py:123`\n- **Confidence**: High - confirmed through code tracing\n- **The Question**: Can User A access User B''s documents?\n- **Investigation**:\n  1. Traced GET /api/documents/{pk}/ to DocumentViewSet\n  2. Checked get_queryset() - returns Document.objects.all()\n  3. Checked permission_classes - only IsAuthenticated\n  4. Checked for has_object_permission() - not implemented\n  5. Verified no relevant middleware or base class checks\n- **Evidence**: [Code snippet showing the gap]\n- **Impact**: Any authenticated user can read any document by ID\n- **Suggested Fix**: [Code that enforces authorization - NOT a comment]\n\n### Needs Manual Verification\n[Issues where authorization exists but couldn''t confirm effectiveness]\n\n### Areas Not Reviewed\n[Endpoints or flows not covered in this review]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Django Authorization Patterns\n\nThese are patterns you might find - not a checklist to match against.\n\n### Query Scoping\n```python\n# Scoped to user\nDocument.objects.filter(owner=request.user)\n\n# Scoped to organization\nDocument.objects.filter(organization=request.user.organization)\n\n# Using a custom manager\nDocument.objects.for_user(request.user)  # Investigate what this does\n```\n\n### Permission Enforcement\n```python\n# DRF permission classes\npermission_classes = [IsAuthenticated, IsOwner]\n\n# Custom has_object_permission\ndef has_object_permission(self, request, view, obj):\n    return obj.owner == request.user\n\n# Django decorators\n@permission_required(''app.view_document'')\n\n# Manual checks\nif document.owner != request.user:\n    raise PermissionDenied()\n```\n\n### Ownership Assignment\n```python\n# Server-side (safe)\ndef perform_create(self, serializer):\n    serializer.save(owner=self.request.user)\n\n# From request (investigate)\nserializer.save(**request.data)  # Does request.data include owner?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Investigation Checklist\n\nUse this to guide your review, not as a pass/fail checklist:\n\n```\n□ I understand how authorization is typically implemented in this codebase\n□ I''ve identified the ownership model (user, org, tenant, etc.)\n□ I''ve mapped the key endpoints that handle user data\n□ For each sensitive endpoint, I''ve traced the flow and asked:\n  - Where does the ID come from?\n  - Where is data fetched?\n  - What checks exist between input and data access?\n□ I''ve verified my findings by checking parent classes and middleware\n□ I''ve only reported issues I''ve confirmed through investigation\n```\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:14:44.309Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Django访问控制审查AIエージェント","ja":"Djangoアクセス制御レビューアイエージェント","ko":"장고 액세스 리뷰 AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de AI para revisión de acceso Django","fr":"Outils d''IA pour la révision d''accès Django","de":"KI-Tools für Django-Zugriffsprüfung","pt":"Ferramentas de IA para Revisão de Acesso Django","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Обзора Доступа Django","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لمراجعة الوصول Django","en":"django-access-review"},"description":{"zh":"Django访问控制和IDOR安全审查AI工具，用于保护Python应用程序","ja":"Djangoアクセス制御とIDORセキュリティレビューAIエージェントによるPythonアプリケーションの保護","ko":"장고 액세스 리뷰 및 IDOR 보안 검토 AI 에이전트를 통한 Python 애플리케이션 보호","es":"La revisión de acceso Django es una herramienta de AI que ayuda a revisar y mejorar la seguridad de acceso y control de IDOR en aplicaciones Django","fr":"La révision d''accès Django est un outil d''IA qui aide à réviser et améliorer la sécurité d''accès et de contrôle IDOR dans les applications Django","de":"Die Django-Zugriffsprüfung ist ein KI-Tool, das hilft, die Sicherheit von Zugriff und IDOR-Kontrolle in Django-Anwendungen zu überprüfen und zu verbessern","pt":"A revisão de acesso Django é uma ferramenta de IA que ajuda a garantir a segurança do seu aplicativo, prevenindo IDOR e vulnerabilidades de acesso.","ru":"Обзор доступа Django - это инструмент ИИ, который помогает обеспечить безопасность вашего приложения, предотвращая IDOR и уязвимости доступа.","ar":"مراجعة الوصول Django هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد على ضمان أمان تطبيقك، ومنع IDOR وثغرات الوصول.","en":"Django access control and IDOR security review. Use when reviewing Django views, DRF viewsets, ORM queries, or any Python/Django code handling user authoriza..."},"definition":{"en":"Django access control and IDOR security review. Use when reviewing Django views, DRF viewsets, ORM queries, or any Python/Django code handling user authorization. Trigger keywords: IDOR, access control, authorization, Django permissions, object permissions, tenant isolation, broken access."},"features":{"zh":["Django访问控制审查","IDOR安全审查","Python应用程序保护","访问控制和授权","对象权限和租户隔离","broken access控制"],"ja":["Djangoアクセス制御レビュー","IDORセキュリティレビュー","Pythonアプリケーションの保護","アクセス制御と認可","オブジェクトパーミッションとテナント分離","broken access制御"],"ko":["장고 액세스 리뷰","IDOR 보안 검토","Python 애플리케이션 보호","액세스 리뷰 및 인증","객체 권한 및 테넌트 분리","broken access 제어"],"es":["Revisión de control de acceso en vistas Django","Análisis de IDOR en conjuntos de vistas de Django Rest Framework","Revisión de consultas ORM para garantizar la seguridad de acceso","Soporte para autorización de usuarios y permisos de objetos","Aislamiento de inquilinos para garantizar la seguridad de acceso","Detección de acceso roto y vulnerabilidades de seguridad"],"fr":["Révision du contrôle d''accès dans les vues Django","Analyse d''IDOR dans les ensembles de vues de Django Rest Framework","Révision des requêtes ORM pour garantir la sécurité d''accès","Prise en charge de l''autorisation des utilisateurs et des permissions d''objets","Isolement des locataires pour garantir la sécurité d''accès","Détection d''accès cassé et de vulnérabilités de sécurité"],"de":["Überprüfung der Zugriffskontrolle in Django-Views","Analyse von IDOR in Django-Rest-Framework-Viewsets","Überprüfung von ORM-Abfragen zur Gewährleistung der Zugriffssicherheit","Unterstützung für Benutzerauthentifizierung und Objektberechtigungen","Mandantenisolierung zur Gewährleistung der Zugriffssicherheit","Erkennung von fehlerhaftem Zugriff und Sicherheitslücken"],"pt":["Análise de vistas Django","Revisão de conjuntos de exibição do Django Rest Framework","Análise de consultas ORM","Prevenção de IDOR","Controle de acesso e autorização","Isolamento de inquilinos"],"ru":["Анализ представлений Django","Обзор наборов представления Django Rest Framework","Анализ запросов ORM","Предотвращение IDOR","Контроль доступа и авторизация","Изоляция арендаторов"],"ar":["تحليل معرض Django","مراجعة مجموعات العرض من إطار Django.Rest","تحليل استفسارات ORM","منع IDOR","مراقبة الوصول والتصريح","عزل المستأجرين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Django访问控制","IDOR安全","Python应用程序保护","访问控制和授权","对象权限","租户隔离","broken access控制","AI工具","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Djangoアクセス制御","IDORセキュリティ","Pythonアプリケーションの保護","アクセス制御と認可","オブジェクトパーミッション","テナント分離","broken access制御","AIエージェント","AIツール"],"ko":["장고 액세스 리뷰","IDOR 보안","Python 애플리케이션 보호","액세스 리뷰 및 인증","객체 권한","테넌트 분리","broken access 제어","AI 에이전트","AI 도구"],"es":["Herramientas de AI para Django","Revisión de acceso Django","Control de IDOR","Seguridad de acceso en Django","Autorización de usuarios en Django","Permisos de objetos en Django","Aislamiento de inquilinos en Django","Detección de acceso roto en Django"],"fr":["Outils d''IA pour Django","Révision d''accès Django","Contrôle IDOR","Sécurité d''accès dans Django","Autorisation des utilisateurs dans Django","Permissions d''objets dans Django","Isolement des locataires dans Django","Détection d''accès cassé dans Django"],"de":["KI-Tools für Django","Django-Zugriffsprüfung","IDOR-Kontrolle","Zugriffssicherheit in Django","Benutzerauthentifizierung in Django","Objektberechtigungen in Django","Mandantenisolierung in Django","Erkennung von fehlerhaftem Zugriff in Django"],"pt":["revisão de acesso django","idor","controle de acesso","autorização","permissões django","permissões de objeto","isolamento de inquilinos","segurança django","desenvolvimento de aplicativos django"],"ru":["обзор доступа django","idor","контроль доступа","авторизация","разрешения django","разрешения объекта","изоляция арендаторов","безопасность django","разработка приложений django"],"ar":["مراجعة الوصول django","idor","مراقبة الوصول","التصريح","صلاحيات django","صلاحيات الكائن","عزل المستأجرين","أمان django","تطوير تطبيقات django"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Security Agents needing advanced Django access control and IDOR vulnerability analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Django 访问控制和 IDOR 漏洞分析功能的 Python 安全代理。","ja":"高度な Django アクセス制御と IDOR 脆弱性分析機能を必要とする Python セキュリティエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Django 액세스 제어 및 IDOR 취약점 분석 기능이 필요한 Python 보안 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de seguridad de Python que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de control de acceso en Django y análisis de vulnerabilidades IDOR.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de sécurité Python ayant besoin de capacités avancées de contrôle d''accès Django et d''analyse des vulnérabilités IDOR.","de":"Ideal für Python-Sicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte Django-Zugriffskontrollen und IDOR-Schwachstellenanalysen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Segurança Python que necessitam de acesso avançado ao controle de acesso do Django e capacidades de análise de vulnerabilidades de IDOR.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов безопасности Python, которым необходим расширенный доступ к контролю доступа Django и возможности анализа уязвимостей IDOR.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمنيين بايثون الذين يحتاجون إلى الحصول على سيطرة متقدمة على الدخول إلى Django وتحليل نقاط الضعف في IDOR."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to investigate Django views, DRF viewsets, and ORM queries for access control vulnerabilities, leveraging trigger keywords like IDOR, authorization, and Django permissions to ensure secure user data handling, all while adhering to OWASP guidelines.","zh":"使代理能够调查 Django views、DRF viewsets 和 ORM queries 中的访问控制漏洞，利用 IDOR、authorization 和 Django permissions 等触发关键词确保安全的用户数据处理，同时遵循 OWASP 指南。","ja":"IDOR、authorization、Django permissions などのトリガーキーワードを活用して、安全なユーザーデータ処理を確保し、OWASP ガイドラインに準拠しながら、Django views、DRF viewsets、ORM queries のアクセス制御脆弱性を調査する機能をエージェントに提供します。","ko":"IDOR, authorization, Django permissions와 같은 트리거 키워드를 활용하여 안전한 사용자 데이터 처리를 보장하고 OWASP 지침을 준수하면서 Django views, DRF viewsets, ORM queries의 액세스 제어 취약점을 조사할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes investigar Django views, DRF viewsets y consultas ORM en busca de vulnerabilidades de control de acceso, aprovechando palabras clave desencadenantes como IDOR, authorization y Django permissions para garantizar un manejo seguro de los datos del usuario, todo ello cumpliendo con las directrices de OWASP.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étudier les vues Django, les viewsets DRF et les requêtes ORM pour détecter les vulnérabilités de contrôle d''accès, en utilisant des mots-clés déclencheurs tels que IDOR, authorization et Django permissions pour assurer une gestion sécurisée des données utilisateur, le tout dans le respect des directives OWASP.","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten, Django-Views, DRF-Viewsets und ORM-Abfragen auf Zugriffskontrollschwachstellen zu untersuchen, unter Verwendung von Trigger-Keywords wie IDOR, authorization und Django permissions, um eine sichere Benutzerdatenverarbeitung zu gewährleisten, alles unter Einhaltung der OWASP-Richtlinien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a investigar visualizações do Django, conjuntos de visualizações do DRF e consultas do ORM para vulnerabilidades de controle de acesso, utilizando palavras-chave desencadeadoras como IDOR, autorização e permissões do Django para garantir o tratamento seguro de dados do usuário, tudo isso seguindo as diretrizes do OWASP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью расследовать представления Django, наборы представлений DRF и запросы ORM для уязвимостей контроля доступа, используя триггерные ключевые слова, такие как IDOR, авторизация и разрешения Django, для обеспечения безопасной обработки пользовательских данных, при этом соблюдая рекомендации OWASP.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من التحقيق في.Views من Django و DRF viewsets والاستفسارات ORM حول نقاط الضعف في سيطرة الدخول ، باستخدام كلمات مفتاحية مثل IDOR والتصريح وتصريحات Django لضمان معالجة بيانات المستخدم بشكل آمن ، مع اتباع إرشادات OWASP."},"useCases":{"en":["Identifying IDOR vulnerabilities in Django applications","Reviewing access control mechanisms in Python codebases","Analyzing object permissions and tenant isolation in Django projects"],"zh":["识别 Django 应用程序中的 IDOR 漏洞","审查 Python 代码库中的访问控制机制","分析 Django 项目中的对象权限和租户隔离"],"ja":["Django アプリケーションにおける IDOR 脆弱性の特定","Python コードベースにおけるアクセス制御メカニズムのレビュー","Django プロジェクトにおけるオブジェクト権限とテナント分離の分析"],"ko":["Django 애플리케이션에서 IDOR 취약점 식별","Python 코드베이스의 액세스 제어 메커니즘 검토","Django 프로젝트의 객체 권한 및 테넌트 격리 분석"],"es":["Identificación de vulnerabilidades IDOR en aplicaciones Django","Revisión de mecanismos de control de acceso en bases de código Python","Análisis de permisos de objetos y aislamiento de inquilinos en proyectos Django"],"fr":["Identification des vulnérabilités IDOR dans les applications Django","Examen des mécanismes de contrôle d''accès dans les bases de code Python","Analyse des permissions sur les objets et de l''isolation des tenants dans les projets Django"],"de":["Identifizierung von IDOR-Schwachstellen in Django-Anwendungen","Überprüfung von Zugriffskontrollmechanismen in Python-Codebasen","Analyse von Objektberechtigungen und Tenant-Isolation in Django-Projekten"],"pt":["Identificar vulnerabilidades de IDOR em aplicações Django","Revisar mecanismos de controle de acesso em bases de código Python","Analizar permissões de objetos e isolamento de locatários em projetos Django"],"ru":["Определение уязвимостей IDOR в приложениях Django","Проверка механизмов контроля доступа в кодовых базах Python","Анализ разрешений объектов и изоляции арендаторов в проектах Django"],"ar":["تحديد نقاط الضعف في IDOR في تطبيقات Django","استعراض آليات التحكم في الوصول إلى قواعد الشفرة Python","تحليل صلاحيات الكائنات وعزل المستأجرين في مشاريع Django"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Django framework and Python","Focused on Django access control and IDOR security review, not general security auditing"],"zh":["需要具备 Django framework 和 Python 的知识","专注于 Django 访问控制和 IDOR 安全审查，而非通用安全审计"],"ja":["Django framework と Python の知識が必要","一般的なセキュリティ監査ではなく、Django アクセス制御と IDOR セキュリティレビューに焦点を当てている"],"ko":["Django framework 및 Python에 대한 지식 필요","일반적인 보안 감사가 아닌 Django 액세스 제어 및 IDOR 보안 검토에 중점을 둠"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del framework Django y Python","Se centra en la revisión de seguridad de control de acceso e IDOR de Django, no en auditorías de seguridad generales"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du framework Django et de Python","Se concentre sur l''examen de la sécurité du contrôle d''accès et des IDOR dans Django, et non sur l''audit de sécurité général"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse des Django-Frameworks und Python","Konzentriert sich auf die Überprüfung der Zugriffskontrolle und IDOR-Sicherheit in Django, nicht auf allgemeine Sicherheitsaudits"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do framework Django e Python","Focado no controle de acesso do Django e revisão de segurança do IDOR, e não na auditoria de segurança geral"],"ru":["Требует знания фреймворка Django и Python","Сосредоточен на контроле доступа Django и проверке безопасности IDOR, а не на общей проверке безопасности"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة إطار Django و Python","يركز على التحكم في الوصول إلى Django ومراجعة أمان IDOR ، وليس مراجعة الأمان العامة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"75a58e3cf7bd7f3b65402c36424623e3f43ea1e8905b07494eaaae0d97a85dd9","repoEtag":"W/\"2a524a36d10d78094c72f484233406f0cd4722cd88b5444674b33d0b91d29676\"","qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('getsentry/skills/iterate-pr', 'official', 'getsentry', 'skills', 'getsentry/skills', 'iterate-pr', 302, 7, 75, '2026-02-24T10:49:39Z', '2026-02-24T12:15:30.014Z', 'd71b1e9711896b92581426337ea137e8c4bac7394997ac48ded12f7d97fe8139', '{"id":"getsentry/skills/iterate-pr","name":"iterate-pr","description":{"zh":"iterate-pr是一种自动化CI检查和代码审查的工具，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"iterate-prはCIチェックとコードレビューを自動化するツールで、開発者の効率を向上させます","ko":"iterate-pr는 CI 검사 및 코드 리뷰를 자동화하는 도구로 개발자의 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Iterate-pr es una habilidad que automatiza el ciclo de retroalimentación y corrección en su repositorio de GitHub hasta que todas las comprobaciones de CI pasen.","fr":"Iterate-pr est une compétence qui automatise le cycle de rétroaction et de correction dans votre référentiel GitHub jusqu''à ce que toutes les vérifications de CI réussissent.","de":"Iterate-pr ist eine Fähigkeit, die den Feedback- und Korrekturzyklus in Ihrem GitHub-Repository automatisiert, bis alle CI-Überprüfungen erfolgreich sind.","pt":"O skill iterate-pr automatiza o ciclo de feedback e correção em seus PRs, permitindo que você itere até que todos os checks de CI passem e o feedback de revisão seja abordado.","ru":"Умение iterate-pr автоматизирует цикл обратной связи и исправления в ваших PR, позволяя вам итерировать до тех пор, пока все проверки CI не пройдут и обратная связь по ревью не будет устранена.","ar":"المهارة iterate-pr تلقيم دورة التغذية الراجعة والتصحيح في طلبات السحب الخاصة بك، مما يسمح لك بتكرار حتى تمر جميع فحوصات CI و يتم تلبية ملاحظات المراجعة","en":"Iterate on a PR until CI passes. Use when you need to fix CI failures, address review feedback, or continuously push fixes until all checks are green. Automates the feedback-fix-push-wait cycle."},"owner":"getsentry","repo":"skills","repoPath":"getsentry/skills","stars":302,"forks":7,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T10:49:39Z","topics":["tag-production"],"skillMd":{"name":"iterate-pr","description":"Iterate on a PR until CI passes. Use when you need to fix CI failures, address review feedback, or continuously push fixes until all checks are green. Automates the feedback-fix-push-wait cycle.","bodyPreview":"# Iterate on PR Until CI Passes\n\nContinuously iterate on the current branch until all CI checks pass and review feedback is addressed.\n\n**Requires**: GitHub CLI (`gh`) authenticated.\n\n**Important**: All scripts must be run from the repository root directory (where `.git` is located), not from the skill directory. Use the full path to the script via `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}`.\n\n## Bundled Scripts\n\n### `scripts/fetch_pr_checks.py`\n\nFetches CI check status and extracts failure snippets from logs.\n\n```b","body":"# Iterate on PR Until CI Passes\n\nContinuously iterate on the current branch until all CI checks pass and review feedback is addressed.\n\n**Requires**: GitHub CLI (`gh`) authenticated.\n\n**Important**: All scripts must be run from the repository root directory (where `.git` is located), not from the skill directory. Use the full path to the script via `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}`.\n\n## Bundled Scripts\n\n### `scripts/fetch_pr_checks.py`\n\nFetches CI check status and extracts failure snippets from logs.\n\n```bash\nuv run ${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}/scripts/fetch_pr_checks.py [--pr NUMBER]\n```\n\nReturns JSON:\n```json\n{\n  \"pr\": {\"number\": 123, \"branch\": \"feat/foo\"},\n  \"summary\": {\"total\": 5, \"passed\": 3, \"failed\": 2, \"pending\": 0},\n  \"checks\": [\n    {\"name\": \"tests\", \"status\": \"fail\", \"log_snippet\": \"...\", \"run_id\": 123},\n    {\"name\": \"lint\", \"status\": \"pass\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### `scripts/fetch_pr_feedback.py`\n\nFetches and categorizes PR review feedback using the [LOGAF scale](https://develop.sentry.dev/engineering-practices/code-review/#logaf-scale).\n\n```bash\nuv run ${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}/scripts/fetch_pr_feedback.py [--pr NUMBER]\n```\n\nReturns JSON with feedback categorized as:\n- `high` - Must address before merge (`h:`, blocker, changes requested)\n- `medium` - Should address (`m:`, standard feedback)\n- `low` - Optional (`l:`, nit, style, suggestion)\n- `bot` - Informational automated comments (Codecov, Dependabot, etc.)\n- `resolved` - Already resolved threads\n\nReview bot feedback (from Sentry, Warden, Cursor, Bugbot, CodeQL, etc.) appears in `high`/`medium`/`low` with `review_bot: true` — it is NOT placed in the `bot` bucket.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Identify PR\n\n```bash\ngh pr view --json number,url,headRefName\n```\n\nStop if no PR exists for the current branch.\n\n### 2. Gather Review Feedback\n\nRun `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}/scripts/fetch_pr_feedback.py` to get categorized feedback already posted on the PR.\n\n### 3. Handle Feedback by LOGAF Priority\n\n**Auto-fix (no prompt):**\n- `high` - must address (blockers, security, changes requested)\n- `medium` - should address (standard feedback)\n\nThis includes review bot feedback (items with `review_bot: true`). Treat it the same as human feedback:\n- Real issue found → fix it\n- False positive → skip, but explain why in a brief comment\n- Never silently ignore review bot feedback — always verify the finding\n\n**Prompt user for selection:**\n- `low` - present numbered list and ask which to address:\n\n```\nFound 3 low-priority suggestions:\n1. [l] \"Consider renaming this variable\" - @reviewer in api.py:42\n2. [nit] \"Could use a list comprehension\" - @reviewer in utils.py:18\n3. [style] \"Add a docstring\" - @reviewer in models.py:55\n\nWhich would you like to address? (e.g., \"1,3\" or \"all\" or \"none\")\n```\n\n**Skip silently:**\n- `resolved` threads\n- `bot` comments (informational only — Codecov, Dependabot, etc.)\n\n### 4. Check CI Status\n\nRun `${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}/scripts/fetch_pr_checks.py` to get structured failure data.\n\n**Wait if pending:** If review bot checks (sentry, warden, cursor, bugbot, seer, codeql) are still running, wait before proceeding—they post actionable feedback that must be evaluated. Informational bots (codecov) are not worth waiting for.\n\n### 5. Fix CI Failures\n\nFor each failure in the script output:\n1. Read the `log_snippet` to understand the failure\n2. Read the relevant code before making changes\n3. Fix the issue with minimal, targeted changes\n\nDo NOT assume what failed based on check name alone—always read the logs.\n\n### 6. Commit and Push\n\n```bash\ngit add <files>\ngit commit -m \"fix: <descriptive message>\"\ngit push\n```\n\n### 7. Wait for CI\n\n```bash\ngh pr checks --watch --interval 30\n```\n\n### 8. Re-check Feedback After CI\n\nReview bots often post feedback seconds after CI checks complete. Wait briefly, then check again:\n\n```bash\nsleep 10\nuv run ${CLAUDE_SKILL_ROOT}/scripts/fetch_pr_feedback.py\n```\n\nAddress any new high/medium feedback the same way as step 3. If new feedback requires code changes, return to step 6 to commit and push.\n\n### 9. Repeat\n\nReturn to step 2 if CI failed or new feedback appeared in step 8.\n\n## Exit Conditions\n\n**Success:** All checks pass, post-CI feedback re-check is clean (no new unaddressed high/medium feedback including review bot findings), user has decided on low-priority items.\n\n**Ask for help:** Same failure after 3 attempts, feedback needs clarification, infrastructure issues.\n\n**Stop:** No PR exists, branch needs rebase.\n\n## Fallback\n\nIf scripts fail, use `gh` CLI directly:\n- `gh pr checks name,state,bucket,link`\n- `gh run view <run-id> --log-failed`\n- `gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/{number}/comments`\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:15:30.014Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"iterate-pr自动化CI检查和代码审查","ja":"iterate-pr: CIチェックとコードレビューの自動化","ko":"iterate-pr: CI 검사 및 코드 리뷰 자동화","es":"Iterar en PR hasta que pase la CI","fr":"Itérer sur PR jusqu''à ce que la CI réussisse","de":"PR iterieren bis CI erfolgreich ist","pt":"Iterate PR: Automatize Ciclo de Feedback","ru":"Итерируйте PR: Автоматизируйте Цикл Обратной Связи","ar":"تكرار PR: أتمتة دورة التغذية الراجعة","en":"iterate-pr"},"description":{"zh":"iterate-pr是一种自动化CI检查和代码审查的工具，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"iterate-prはCIチェックとコードレビューを自動化するツールで、開発者の効率を向上させます","ko":"iterate-pr는 CI 검사 및 코드 리뷰를 자동화하는 도구로 개발자의 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Iterate-pr es una habilidad que automatiza el ciclo de retroalimentación y corrección en su repositorio de GitHub hasta que todas las comprobaciones de CI pa...","fr":"Iterate-pr est une compétence qui automatise le cycle de rétroaction et de correction dans votre référentiel GitHub jusqu''à ce que toutes les vérifications d...","de":"Iterate-pr ist eine Fähigkeit, die den Feedback- und Korrekturzyklus in Ihrem GitHub-Repository automatisiert, bis alle CI-Überprüfungen erfolgreich sind.","pt":"O skill iterate-pr automatiza o ciclo de feedback e correção em seus PRs, permitindo que você itere até que todos os checks de CI passem e o feedback de revi...","ru":"Умение iterate-pr автоматизирует цикл обратной связи и исправления в ваших PR, позволяя вам итерировать до тех пор, пока все проверки CI не пройдут и обратна...","ar":"المهارة iterate-pr تلقيم دورة التغذية الراجعة والتصحيح في طلبات السحب الخاصة بك، مما يسمح لك بتكرار حتى تمر جميع فحوصات CI و يتم تلبية ملاحظات المراجعة","en":"Iterate on a PR until CI passes. Use when you need to fix CI failures, address review feedback, or continuously push fixes until all checks are green. Automa..."},"definition":{"en":"Iterate on a PR until CI passes. Use when you need to fix CI failures, address review feedback, or continuously push fixes until all checks are green. Automates the feedback-fix-push-wait cycle."},"features":{"zh":["自动化CI检查","代码审查","持续迭代PR","提高开发效率","支持GitHub CLI"],"ja":["CIチェックの自動化","コードレビュー","PRの繰り返し実行","開発効率の向上","GitHub CLIのサポート"],"ko":["CI 검사 자동화","코드 리뷰","PR 반복 실행","개발 효율성 향상","GitHub CLI 지원"],"es":["Automatiza el ciclo de retroalimentación y corrección","Itera en la rama actual hasta que todas las comprobaciones de CI pasen","Requiere GitHub CLI autenticado","Incluye script para extraer fragmentos de errores de los registros de CI"],"fr":["Automatisez le cycle de rétroaction et de correction","Itère sur la branche actuelle jusqu''à ce que toutes les vérifications de CI réussissent","Nécessite GitHub CLI authentifié","Inclut un script pour extraire les extraits d''erreur des journaux de CI"],"de":["Automatisiert den Feedback- und Korrekturzyklus","Iteriert in der aktuellen Zweig bis alle CI-Überprüfungen erfolgreich sind","Benötigt authentifizierten GitHub-CLI","Enthält Skript zum Extrahieren von Fehlerausschnitten aus CI-Protokollen"],"pt":["Automatiza o ciclo de feedback e correção em PRs","Permite iteração até que todos os checks de CI passem","Aborda feedback de revisão","Requer autenticação do GitHub CLI","Executa scripts a partir do diretório raiz do repositório"],"ru":["Автоматизирует цикл обратной связи и исправления в PR","Позволяет итерировать до тех пор, пока все проверки CI не пройдут","Устраняет обратную связь по ревью","Требует аутентификации GitHub CLI","Выполняет скрипты из корневого каталога репозитория"],"ar":["تلقيم دورة التغذية الراجعة والتصحيح في طلبات السحب","يسمح بتكرار حتى تمر جميع فحوصات CI","تلبية ملاحظات المراجعة","يتطلب مصادقة واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub","ينفذ البرامج النصية من 目录 الجذر للمستودع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["iterate-pr","自动化CI检查","代码审查","持续集成","持续部署","GitHub CLI","开发效率"],"ja":["iterate-pr","CIチェックの自動化","コードレビュー","継続的インテグレーション","継続的デプロイ","GitHub CLI","開発効率"],"ko":["iterate-pr","CI 검사 자동화","코드 리뷰","지속적인 통합","지속적인 배포","GitHub CLI","개발 효율성"],"es":["integración continua","GitHub","automatización","desarrollo de software","pruebas de CI","retroalimentación","corrección"],"fr":["intégration continue","GitHub","automatisation","développement de logiciels","tests de CI","rétroaction","correction"],"de":["kontinuierliche Integration","GitHub","Automatisierung","Softwareentwicklung","CI-Tests","Feedback","Korrektur"],"pt":["iterate-pr","automatizar pr","ciclo de feedback","checks de ci","feedback de revisão","github cli","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["iterate-pr","автоматизировать пр","цикл обратной связи","проверки ci","обратная связь по ревью","github cli","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تكرار pr","تلقيم طلب السحب","دورة التغذية الراجعة","فحوصات ci","ملاحظات المراجعة","واجهة سطر أوامر github","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for GitHub-integrated Agents needing automated CI/CD pipeline management and review feedback addressing.","zh":"适用于需要自动化CI/CD流水线管理和审查反馈的GitHub集成Agent。","ja":"GitHub統合エージェントが自動化されたCI/CDパイプライン管理とレビュー反馈への対応を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"자동화된 CI/CD 파이프라인 관리 및 리뷰 피드백 처리가 필요한 GitHub 통합 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes integrados con GitHub que necesitan una gestión automatizada de la tubería de CI/CD y comentarios de revisión de direcciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents intégrés à GitHub nécessitant une gestion automatique de la pipeline CI/CD et des commentaires de révision d''adresses.","de":"Perfekt für GitHub-integrierte Agenten, die eine automatisierte CI/CD-Pipeline-Verwaltung und Review-Feedback-Adressierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes integrados ao GitHub que necessitam de gerenciamento automatizado de pipeline CI/CD e feedback de revisão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, интегрированных с GitHub, которым требуется автоматизированное управление конвейером CI/CD и обратная связь по рассмотрению.","ar":"مثالي لعميل GitHub المتكامل الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة تلقائية لpipeline CI/CD وتغذية مرتدة لمراجعة العنوان."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate the feedback-fix-push-wait cycle using GitHub CLI, streamlining the process of addressing review feedback and fixing CI failures with Python scripts like `fetch_pr_checks.py`.","zh":"赋予代理人使用GitHub CLI自动化反馈-修复-推送-等待循环的能力，简化了使用Python脚本（如`fetch_pr_checks.py`）处理审查反馈和修复CI失败的过程。","ja":"GitHub CLIを使用してフィードバック-修正-プッシュ-待機サイクルを自動化するエージェントを可能にし、Pythonスクリプト（例：`fetch_pr_checks.py`）を使用してレビューのフィードバックに対応し、CIの失敗を修正するプロセスを簡素化します。","ko":"GitHub CLI를 사용하여 피드백-수정-푸시-대기 사이클을 자동화할 수 있는 에이전트를赋予하고, Python 스크립트(예: `fetch_pr_checks.py`)를 사용하여 리뷰 피드백에 응답하고 CI 실패를 수정하는 프로세스를 간소화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar el ciclo de comentarios-corrección-impulsión-espera utilizando GitHub CLI, simplificando el proceso de abordar comentarios de revisión y corregir errores de CI con scripts de Python como `fetch_pr_checks.py`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser le cycle de commentaires-correction-poussée-attente en utilisant GitHub CLI, simplifiant le processus d''aborder les commentaires de révision et de corriger les échecs de CI avec des scripts Python comme `fetch_pr_checks.py`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den Feedback-Fix-Push-Warte-Zyklus mithilfe von GitHub CLI zu automatisieren, wodurch der Prozess der Bearbeitung von Review-Feedback und der Behebung von CI-Fehlern mit Python-Skripten wie `fetch_pr_checks.py` vereinfacht wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes automatem o ciclo de feedback-correção-envio-aguardo usando o GitHub CLI, simplificando o processo de abordar feedback de revisão e corrigir falhas de CI com scripts Python, como `fetch_pr_checks.py`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать цикл обратной связи-исправления-отправки-ожидания с помощью GitHub CLI, упрощая процесс рассмотрения обратной связи по рассмотрению и исправления сбоев CI с помощью скриптов Python, таких как `fetch_pr_checks.py`.","ar":"يمكن للعميل توفير توليد تلقائي لدورة تغذية مرتدة-تصحيح-إرسال-انتظار باستخدام واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub، مبسطًا عملية معالجة تغذية مرتدة لمراجعة العنوان وتصحيح فشل CI باستخدام سكريبتات بايثون مثل `fetch_pr_checks.py`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating CI/CD pipeline management","Addressing review feedback on GitHub pull requests","Continuously pushing fixes until all CI checks pass"],"zh":["自动化CI/CD流水线管理","在GitHub拉取请求上解决审查反馈","持续推送修复直到所有CI检查通过"],"ja":["CI/CDパイプライン管理の自動化","GitHubのプルリクエストでのレビュー反馈への対応","すべてのCIチェックが通過するまで修正を続けてプッシュ"],"ko":["CI/CD 파이프라인 관리 자동화","GitHub 풀 리퀘스트에서 리뷰 피드백에 대한 대응","모든 CI 체크가 통과할 때까지 수정을 계속하여 푸시"],"es":["Automatización de la gestión de la tubería de CI/CD","Dirección de comentarios de revisión en solicitudes de extracción de GitHub","Impulsión continua de correcciones hasta que todas las comprobaciones de CI pasen"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion de la pipeline CI/CD","Adresse des commentaires de révision sur les demandes d''extraction de GitHub","Poussée continue des corrections jusqu''à ce que toutes les vérifications de CI passent"],"de":["Automatisierung der CI/CD-Pipeline-Verwaltung","Adressierung von Review-Feedback in GitHub-Pull-Anfragen","Kontinuierliches Pushen von Korrekturen, bis alle CI-Prüfungen bestanden sind"],"pt":["Automatizar gerenciamento de pipeline CI/CD","Abordar feedback de revisão em solicitações de pull do GitHub","Empurrar continuamente correções até que todos os testes de CI passem"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление конвейером CI/CD","Обрабатывать обратную связь по рассмотрению в запросах на извлечение GitHub","Непрерывно отправлять исправления, пока все проверки CI не пройдут"],"ar":["توفير آلي لإدارة pipeline CI/CD","معالجة تغذية مرتدة لمراجعة العنوان في طلبات السحب على GitHub","دفع مستمر لإصلاحات حتى يمر جميع فحوصات CI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI (`gh`) authentication","Must be run from the repository root directory","Python environment required for script execution"],"zh":["需要GitHub CLI（`gh`）身份验证","必须从存储库根目录运行","需要Python环境来执行脚本"],"ja":["GitHub CLI（`gh`）の認証が必要","リポジトリのルートディレクトリから実行する必要がある","スクリプトの実行にはPython環境が必要"],"ko":["GitHub CLI(`gh`) 인증이 필요합니다.","리포지토리 루트 디렉토리에서 실행해야 합니다.","스크립트 실행을 위해 Python 환경이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere autenticación de GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Debe ejecutarse desde el directorio raíz del repositorio","Se requiere un entorno de Python para la ejecución de scripts"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Doit être exécuté à partir du répertoire racine du référentiel","Un environnement Python est requis pour l''exécution des scripts"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub CLI (`gh`)-Authentifizierung","Muss vom Repository-Stammdirectory aus ausgeführt werden","Ein Python-Umgebung ist für die Skriptausführung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer autenticação do GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Deve ser executado a partir do diretório raiz do repositório","Ambiente Python necessário para execução de script"],"ru":["Требуется аутентификация GitHub CLI (`gh`)","Должно быть запущено из корневого каталога репозитория","Требуется среда Python для выполнения скрипта"],"ar":["يتطلب مصادقة واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub (`gh`)","يجب تشغيله من دليل الجذر للمستودع","مطلوب بيئة بايثون لتنفيذ السكريبت"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d71b1e9711896b92581426337ea137e8c4bac7394997ac48ded12f7d97fe8139","repoEtag":"W/\"2a524a36d10d78094c72f484233406f0cd4722cd88b5444674b33d0b91d29676\"","qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('expo/skills/expo-dev-client', 'official', 'expo', 'skills', 'expo/skills', 'expo-dev-client', 1131, 45, 75, '2026-02-23T00:15:14Z', '2026-02-23T01:07:32.859Z', 'aa79e42e9cd96ea92d4e691fb8222145055dec1b868b7defce224a41d8878a5f', '{"id":"expo/skills/expo-dev-client","name":"expo-dev-client","description":{"zh":"expo-dev-client用于创建Expo开发客户端，用于测试本地 Expo 模块和第三方本地模块","ja":"Expo開発クライアントを作成して、ローカルExpoモジュールとサードパーティのネイティブモジュールをテストする","ko":"Expo 개발 클라이언트를 생성하여 로컬 Expo 모듈 및 제3자 네이티브 모듈을 테스트합니다","es":"El expo-dev-client es una herramienta de desarrollo que permite crear y distribuir clientes de desarrollo de Expo para probar cambios de código nativo en dispositivos físicos","fr":"L''outil expo-dev-client est un outil de développement qui permet de créer et de distribuer des clients de développement Expo pour tester les modifications de code natif sur des appareils physiques","de":"Das expo-dev-client ist ein Entwicklungstool, mit dem Entwicklungsclients für Expo erstellt und verteilt werden können, um Änderungen des nativen Codes auf physischen Geräten zu testen","pt":"O Expo Dev Client é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento que permite criar e distribuir clientes de desenvolvimento Expo para testar alterações de código nativo em dispositivos físicos","ru":"Expo Dev Client — это инструмент разработки, который позволяет создавать и распространять клиенты разработки Expo для тестирования изменений родного кода на физических устройствах","ar":"إكسبو ديف كلينت هو أداة تطوير تسمح بإنشاء وتوزيع عملاء التطوير إكسبو لاختبار التغييرات على الكود الأصلي على الأجهزة الفعلية","en":"Build and distribute Expo development clients locally or via TestFlight"},"owner":"expo","repo":"skills","repoPath":"expo/skills","stars":1131,"forks":45,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T00:15:14Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"expo-dev-client","description":"Build and distribute Expo development clients locally or via TestFlight","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"Use EAS Build to create development clients for testing native code changes on physical devices. Use this for creating custom Expo Go clients for testing branches of your app.\n\n## Important: When Development Clients Are Needed\n\n**Only create development clients when your app requires custom native code.** Most apps work fine in Expo Go.\n\nYou need a dev client ONLY when using:\n- Local Expo modules (custom native code)\n- Apple targets (widgets, app clips, extensions)\n- Third-party native modules n","body":"Use EAS Build to create development clients for testing native code changes on physical devices. Use this for creating custom Expo Go clients for testing branches of your app.\n\n## Important: When Development Clients Are Needed\n\n**Only create development clients when your app requires custom native code.** Most apps work fine in Expo Go.\n\nYou need a dev client ONLY when using:\n- Local Expo modules (custom native code)\n- Apple targets (widgets, app clips, extensions)\n- Third-party native modules not in Expo Go\n\n**Try Expo Go first** with `npx expo start`. If everything works, you don''t need a dev client.\n\n## EAS Configuration\n\nEnsure `eas.json` has a development profile:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"cli\": {\n    \"version\": \">= 16.0.1\",\n    \"appVersionSource\": \"remote\"\n  },\n  \"build\": {\n    \"production\": {\n      \"autoIncrement\": true\n    },\n    \"development\": {\n      \"autoIncrement\": true,\n      \"developmentClient\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"submit\": {\n    \"production\": {},\n    \"development\": {}\n  }\n}\n```\n\nKey settings:\n- `developmentClient: true` - Bundles expo-dev-client for development builds\n- `autoIncrement: true` - Automatically increments build numbers\n- `appVersionSource: \"remote\"` - Uses EAS as the source of truth for version numbers\n\n## Building for TestFlight\n\nBuild iOS dev client and submit to TestFlight in one command:\n\n```bash\neas build -p ios --profile development --submit\n```\n\nThis will:\n1. Build the development client in the cloud\n2. Automatically submit to App Store Connect\n3. Send you an email when the build is ready in TestFlight\n\nAfter receiving the TestFlight email:\n1. Download the build from TestFlight on your device\n2. Launch the app to see the expo-dev-client UI\n3. Connect to your local Metro bundler or scan a QR code\n\n## Building Locally\n\nBuild a development client on your machine:\n\n```bash\n# iOS (requires Xcode)\neas build -p ios --profile development --local\n\n# Android\neas build -p android --profile development --local\n```\n\nLocal builds output:\n- iOS: `.ipa` file\n- Android: `.apk` or `.aab` file\n\n## Installing Local Builds\n\nInstall iOS build on simulator:\n\n```bash\n# Find the .app in the .tar.gz output\ntar -xzf build-*.tar.gz\nxcrun simctl install booted ./path/to/App.app\n```\n\nInstall iOS build on device (requires signing):\n\n```bash\n# Use Xcode Devices window or ideviceinstaller\nideviceinstaller -i build.ipa\n```\n\nInstall Android build:\n\n```bash\nadb install build.apk\n```\n\n## Building for Specific Platform\n\n```bash\n# iOS only\neas build -p ios --profile development\n\n# Android only\neas build -p android --profile development\n\n# Both platforms\neas build --profile development\n```\n\n## Checking Build Status\n\n```bash\n# List recent builds\neas build:list\n\n# View build details\neas build:view\n```\n\n## Using the Dev Client\n\nOnce installed, the dev client provides:\n- **Development server connection** - Enter your Metro bundler URL or scan QR\n- **Build information** - View native build details\n- **Launcher UI** - Switch between development servers\n\nConnect to local development:\n\n```bash\n# Start Metro bundler\nnpx expo start --dev-client\n\n# Scan QR code with dev client or enter URL manually\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Build fails with signing errors:**\n```bash\neas credentials\n```\n\n**Clear build cache:**\n```bash\neas build -p ios --profile development --clear-cache\n```\n\n**Check EAS CLI version:**\n```bash\neas --version\neas update\n```\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:07:32.859Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：expo-dev-client","ja":"AIエージェント：expo-dev-client","ko":"AI 에이전트: expo-dev-client","es":"Herramientas de AI: expo-dev-client para desarrollo de ap...","fr":"Outils d''IA: expo-dev-client pour le développement d''appl...","de":"KI-Tools: expo-dev-client für die Entwicklung von Anwendu...","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Expo Dev Client para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Expo Dev Client для Разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: إكسبو ديف كلينت لل مطورين","en":"expo-dev-client"},"description":{"zh":"expo-dev-client用于创建Expo开发客户端，用于测试本地 Expo 模块和第三方本地模块","ja":"Expo開発クライアントを作成して、ローカルExpoモジュールとサードパーティのネイティブモジュールをテストする","ko":"Expo 개발 클라이언트를 생성하여 로컬 Expo 모듈 및 제3자 네이티브 모듈을 테스트합니다","es":"El expo-dev-client es una herramienta de desarrollo que permite crear y distribuir clientes de desarrollo de Expo para probar cambios de código nativo en dis...","fr":"L''outil expo-dev-client est un outil de développement qui permet de créer et de distribuer des clients de développement Expo pour tester les modifications de...","de":"Das expo-dev-client ist ein Entwicklungstool, mit dem Entwicklungsclients für Expo erstellt und verteilt werden können, um Änderungen des nativen Codes auf p...","pt":"O Expo Dev Client é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento que permite criar e distribuir clientes de desenvolvimento Expo para testar alterações de código nativo...","ru":"Expo Dev Client — это инструмент разработки, который позволяет создавать и распространять клиенты разработки Expo для тестирования изменений родного кода на ...","ar":"إكسبو ديف كلينت هو أداة تطوير تسمح بإنشاء وتوزيع عملاء التطوير إكسبو لاختبار التغييرات على الكود الأصلي على الأجهزة الفعلية","en":"Build and distribute Expo development clients locally or via TestFlight"},"definition":{"en":"Build and distribute Expo development clients locally or via TestFlight"},"features":{"zh":["支持本地Expo模块","支持第三方本地模块","支持Apple目标（小部件、应用程序片段、扩展）","使用EAS Build创建开发客户端","支持TestFlight测试"],"ja":["ローカルExpoモジュールをサポート","サードパーティのネイティブモジュールをサポート","Appleターゲット（ウィジェット、アプリクリップ、拡張）をサポート","EAS Buildを使用して開発クライアントを作成","TestFlightテストをサポート"],"ko":["로컬 Expo 모듈 지원","제3자 네이티브 모듈 지원","Apple 대상 지원（위젯, 앱 클립, 확장）","EAS Build를 사용하여 개발 클라이언트 생성","TestFlight 테스트 지원"],"es":["Crea clientes de desarrollo de Expo para probar cambios de código nativo","Distribuye clientes de desarrollo a través de TestFlight","Permite probar código nativo personalizado en dispositivos físicos","Soporta módulos de Expo personalizados","Soporta objetivos de Apple como widgets y extensiones","Soporta módulos nativos de terceros"],"fr":["Crée des clients de développement Expo pour tester les modifications de code natif","Distribue des clients de développement via TestFlight","Permet de tester du code natif personnalisé sur des appareils physiques","Prend en charge les modules Expo personnalisés","Prend en charge les cibles Apple telles que les widgets et les extensions","Prend en charge les modules natifs tiers"],"de":["Erstellt Entwicklungsclients für Expo zum Testen von Änderungen des nativen Codes","Verteilt Entwicklungsclients über TestFlight","Ermöglicht das Testen von benutzerdefiniertem nativem Code auf physischen Geräten","Unterstützt benutzerdefinierte Expo-Module","Unterstützt Apple-Ziele wie Widgets und Erweiterungen","Unterstützt native Module von Drittanbietern"],"pt":["Criação de clientes de desenvolvimento Expo personalizados","Distribuição de clientes de desenvolvimento via TestFlight","Teste de alterações de código nativo em dispositivos físicos","Suporte a módulos nativos personalizados","Integração com o EAS Build"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских клиентов разработки Expo","Распространение клиентов разработки через TestFlight","Тестирование изменений родного кода на физических устройствах","Поддержка пользовательских родных модулей","Интеграция с EAS Build"],"ar":["إنشاء عملاء التطوير إكسبو المخصصة","توزيع عملاء التطوير عبر تيست فلايت","اختبار التغييرات على الكود الأصلي على الأجهزة الفعلية","دعم المكونات الأصلية المخصصة","التكامل مع إيه إيه إس بيلد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","Expo开发客户端","本地Expo模块","第三方本地模块","Apple目标","EAS Build","TestFlight"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Expo開発クライアント","ローカルExpoモジュール","サードパーティのネイティブモジュール","Appleターゲット","EAS Build","TestFlight"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Expo 개발 클라이언트","로컬 Expo 모듈","제3자 네이티브 모듈","Apple 대상","EAS Build","TestFlight"],"es":["expo-dev-client","desarrollo de aplicaciones","herramientas de AI","clientes de desarrollo","código nativo","TestFlight","módulos de Expo","objetivos de Apple"],"fr":["expo-dev-client","développement d''applications","outils d''IA","clients de développement","code natif","TestFlight","modules Expo","cibles Apple"],"de":["expo-dev-client","Anwendungsentwicklung","KI-Tools","Entwicklungsclients","nativer Code","TestFlight","Expo-Module","Apple-Ziele"],"pt":["Expo Dev Client","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","Teste de código nativo","Distribuição de aplicativos","EAS Build","TestFlight","Módulos nativos personalizados"],"ru":["Expo Dev Client","Разработка мобильных приложений","Тестирование родного кода","Распространение приложений","EAS Build","TestFlight","Пользовательские родные модули"],"ar":["إكسبو ديف كلينت","تطوير تطبيقات الجوال","اختبار الكود الأصلي","توزيع التطبيقات","إيه إيه إس بيلد","تيست فلايت","المكونات الأصلية المخصصة"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Development Agents needing to test native code changes on physical devices with Expo","zh":"非常适合需要在物理设备上使用 Expo 测试本机代码更改的移动应用开发代理","ja":"Expo を使用して物理デバイス上でネイティブ コードの変更をテストする必要があるモバイル アプリ開発エージェントに最適","ko":"Expo를 사용하여 물리적 디바이스에서 네이티브 코드 변경을 테스트해야 하는 모바일 앱 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo de Aplicaciones Móviles que necesitan probar cambios de código nativo en dispositivos físicos con Expo","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement d''Applications Mobiles ayant besoin de tester les modifications de code natif sur des appareils physiques avec Expo","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App Development Agents, die native Codeänderungen auf physischen Geräten mit Expo testen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Aplicativos Móveis que precisam testar alterações de código nativo em dispositivos físicos com Expo","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки мобильных приложений, которым необходимо тестировать изменения родного кода на физических устройствах с Expo","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير تطبيقات الجوال الذين بحاجة إلى اختبار التغييرات في الكود الأصلي على الأجهزة الفعلية مع Expo"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create custom Expo Go clients for testing branches of their app using EAS Build, supporting local Expo modules, Apple targets, and third-party native modules","zh":"赋予代理创建自定义 Expo Go 客户端的能力，以使用 EAS Build 测试应用的分支，支持本地 Expo 模块、Apple 目标和第三方本机模块","ja":"EAS Build を使用してアプリのブランチをテストするためのカスタム Expo Go クライアントを作成する機能をエージェントに提供し、ローカル Expo モジュール、Apple ターゲット、およびサードパーティのネイティブ モジュールをサポート","ko":"EAS Build를 사용하여 앱의 브랜치를 테스트하기 위한 사용자 지정 Expo Go 클라이언트를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하며, 로컬 Expo 모듈, Apple 대상 및 제3자 네이티브 모듈을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear clientes personalizados de Expo Go para probar ramas de su aplicación utilizando EAS Build, con soporte para módulos locales de Expo, objetivos de Apple y módulos nativos de terceros","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des clients Expo Go personnalisés pour tester les branches de leur application à l''aide d''EAS Build, en prenant en charge les modules locaux Expo, les cibles Apple et les modules natifs tiers","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, benutzerdefinierte Expo Go-Clients für das Testen von App-Zweigen mit EAS Build zu erstellen, mit Unterstützung für lokale Expo-Module, Apple-Ziele und native Drittanbieter-Module","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar clientes personalizados do Expo G