веб-приложений","Хранилище с KV, D1 и R2","Безопасность с WAF и DDoS","Инфраструктура как код с Terraform и Pulumi"],"ar":["Workers ل_Functions بدون خادم","Pages لتطبيقات الويب الكاملة","تخزين مع KV و D1 و R2","أمان مع WAF و DDoS","بنية تحتية كما هو الشأن مع Terraform و Pulumi"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Cloudflare","AI工具","Workers","Pages","存储","AI","网络","安全","Terraform","Pulumi"],"ja":["Cloudflare","AIエージェント","Workers","Pages","ストレージ","AI","ネットワーク","セキュリティ","Terraform","Pulumi"],"ko":["Cloudflare","AI 에이전트","Workers","Pages","저장소","AI","네트워킹","보안","Terraform","Pulumi"],"es":["desarrollo de cloudflare","herramientas de agente de inteligencia artificial","workers de cloudflare","pages de cloudflare","almacenamiento en la nube","seguridad en la nube"],"fr":["développement de cloudflare","outils d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","workers de cloudflare","pages de cloudflare","stockage dans le cloud","sécurité dans le cloud"],"de":["cloudflare entwickeln","künstliche Intelligenz Agenten Tools","cloudflare workers","cloudflare pages","speicher in der cloud","sicherheit in der cloud"],"pt":["Cloudflare","Workers","Pages","segurança","armazenamento","infraestrutura como código","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","funções sem servidor","aplicativos web full-stack"],"ru":["Cloudflare","Workers","Pages","безопасность","хранилище","инфраструктура как код","разработка приложений","бессерверные функции","полноценные веб-приложения"],"ar":["Cloudflare","Workers","Pages","أمان","تخزين","بنية تحتية كما هو الشأن","تطوير التطبيقات","دالات بدون خادم","تطبيقات الويب الكاملة"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Edge Computing Agents needing advanced Cloudflare Workers, Pages, and security features.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Cloudflare Workers、Pages和安全功能的Edge Computing Agents。","ja":"Cloudflare Workers、Pages、セキュリティ機能の高度な機能が必要なエッジコンピューティングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Cloudflare Workers, Pages 및 보안 기능이 필요한 에지 컴퓨팅 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Computación de Edge que necesitan Cloudflare Workers, Páginas y características de seguridad avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de calcul de périphérie nécessitant des Cloudflare Workers, des pages et des fonctionnalités de sécurité avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Edge-Computing-Agents, die erweiterte Cloudflare-Worker-, Seiten- und Sicherheitsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Computação de Borda que precisam de recursos avançados do Cloudflare Workers, Pages e recursos de segurança.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Edge Computing, которым необходимы расширенные возможности Cloudflare Workers, Pages и функции безопасности.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الحوافز التي تحتاج إلى ميزات متقدمة من Cloudflare Workers و Pages وميزات الأمان."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy serverless functions at the edge with Cloudflare Workers, secure web applications with Web Application Firewall (WAF) and DDoS protection, and manage infrastructure-as-code with Terraform and Pulumi, utilizing Cloudflare''s KV, D1, and R2 storage solutions.","zh":"赋予代理部署边缘服务器无函数的能力，使用Cloudflare Workers，通过Web应用程序防火墙（WAF）和DDoS保护保护Web应用程序，并使用Terraform和Pulumi管理基础设施即代码，利用Cloudflare的KV、D1和R2存储解决方案。","ja":"エージェントにCloudflare Workersを使用してエッジでサーバーレス関数を展開し、Webアプリケーションファイアウォール（WAF）とDDoS保護でWebアプリケーションを保護し、TerraformとPulumiを使用してインフラストラクチャ即コードを管理し、CloudflareのKV、D1、R2ストレージソリューションを利用する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 에지에서 서버리스 함수를 배포하고 Web Application Firewall(WAF) 및 DDoS 보호로 웹 애플리케이션을 보호하며 Terraform 및 Pulumi를 사용하여 인프라스트럭처 코드를 관리하고 Cloudflare의 KV, D1, R2 스토리지 솔루션을 활용할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar funciones sin servidor en el borde con Cloudflare Workers, proteger aplicaciones web con Web Application Firewall (WAF) y protección contra DDoS, y gestionar la infraestructura como código con Terraform y Pulumi, utilizando las soluciones de almacenamiento KV, D1 y R2 de Cloudflare.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des fonctions sans serveur au bord avec Cloudflare Workers, de sécuriser des applications web full-stack avec Cloudflare Pages et WAF, et de gérer les déploiements d''infrastructure comme code avec Terraform et Pulumi, en utilisant les solutions de stockage KV, D1 et R2 de Cloudflare.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, serverlose Funktionen am Rand mit Cloudflare Workers bereitzustellen, Webanwendungen mit Web Application Firewall (WAF) und DDoS-Schutz zu sichern und Infrastruktur-as-Code mit Terraform und Pulumi zu verwalten, indem die Cloudflare-Speicherlösungen KV, D1 und R2 genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar funções sem servidor na borda com Cloudflare Workers, proteger aplicativos web com Web Application Firewall (WAF) e proteção contra DDoS e gerenciar infraestrutura como código com Terraform e Pulumi, utilizando as soluções de armazenamento KV, D1 e R2 da Cloudflare.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать бессерверные функции на краю с помощью Cloudflare Workers, защищать веб-приложения с помощью Web Application Firewall (WAF) и защиты от DDoS, а также управлять инфраструктурой как кодом с помощью Terraform и Pulumi, используя решения для хранения KV, D1 и R2 от Cloudflare.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من نشر دوال بدون خادم على الحوافز باستخدام Cloudflare Workers وحماية التطبيقات الويب باستخدام جدار الحماية للتطبيقات الويب (WAF) وحماية DDoS وإدارة البنية التحتية ككود باستخدام Terraform و Pulumi ، باستخدام حلول تخزين KV و D1 و R2 من Cloudflare."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying serverless functions at the edge with Cloudflare Workers","Securing full-stack web applications with Cloudflare Pages and WAF","Optimizing infrastructure-as-code deployments with Terraform and Pulumi"],"zh":["使用Cloudflare Workers在边缘部署服务器无函数","使用Cloudflare Pages和WAF保护全栈Web应用程序","使用Terraform和Pulumi优化基础设施即代码部署"],"ja":["Cloudflare Workersを使用してエッジでサーバーレス関数を展開する","Cloudflare PagesとWAFを使用してフルスタックWebアプリケーションを保護する","TerraformとPulumiを使用してインフラストラクチャ即コードの展開を最適化する"],"ko":["Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 에지에서 서버리스 함수를 배포하는 것","Cloudflare Pages와 WAF를 사용하여 풀스택 웹 애플리케이션을 보호하는 것","Terraform 및 Pulumi를 사용하여 인프라스트럭처 코드 배포를 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Implementar funciones sin servidor en el borde con Cloudflare Workers","Seguridad de aplicaciones web full-stack con Cloudflare Pages y WAF","Optimización de implementaciones de infraestructura como código con Terraform y Pulumi"],"fr":["Déployer des fonctions sans serveur au bord avec Cloudflare Workers","Sécuriser des applications web full-stack avec Cloudflare Pages et WAF","Optimiser les déploiements d''infrastructure comme code avec Terraform et Pulumi"],"de":["Bereitstellen serverloser Funktionen am Rand mit Cloudflare Workers","Sicherheit von Full-Stack-Webanwendungen mit Cloudflare Pages und WAF","Optimierung von Infrastruktur-as-Code-Bereitstellungen mit Terraform und Pulumi"],"pt":["Implantando funções sem servidor na borda com Cloudflare Workers","Protegendo aplicativos web full-stack com Cloudflare Pages e WAF","Otimizando implantações de infraestrutura como código com Terraform e Pulumi"],"ru":["Развертывание бессерверных функций на краю с помощью Cloudflare Workers","Защита полнофункциональных веб-приложений с помощью Cloudflare Pages и WAF","Оптимизация развертывания инфраструктуры как кода с помощью Terraform и Pulumi"],"ar":["نشر دوال بدون خادم على الحوافز باستخدام Cloudflare Workers","حماية التطبيقات الويب الكاملة مع Cloudflare Pages و WAF","تحسين عمليات نشر البنية التحتية ككود باستخدام Terraform و Pulumi"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cloudflare account and API access","Dependent on Cloudflare''s platform features and limitations"],"zh":["需要Cloudflare账户和API访问","依赖于Cloudflare的平台功能和限制"],"ja":["CloudflareアカウントとAPIアクセスが必要","Cloudflareのプラットフォーム機能と制限に依存する"],"ko":["Cloudflare 계정 및 API 액세스가 필요함","Cloudflare의 플랫폼 기능 및 제한에 의존"],"es":["Requiere cuenta de Cloudflare y acceso a la API","Dependiente de las características y limitaciones de la plataforma de Cloudflare"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Cloudflare et un accès à l''API","Dépend des fonctionnalités et des limites de la plate-forme Cloudflare"],"de":["Benötigt ein Cloudflare-Konto und API-Zugriff","Abhängig von den Funktionen und Einschränkungen der Cloudflare-Plattform"],"pt":["Requer conta Cloudflare e acesso à API","Dependente de recursos e limitações da plataforma Cloudflare"],"ru":["Требуется учетная запись Cloudflare и доступ к API","Зависит от возможностей и ограничений платформы Cloudflare"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Cloudflare ووصول إلى API","يعتمد على ميزات وقيود منصة Cloudflare"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"58ff3e56750df6909d4a9da898597f763c2d8fa833ee4779c1f9e0ea18bd3140","repoEtag":"W/\"d80154fd9ed8586078af8bf4b067aaef85c0af6b0931f4dceda13fbdd08d77f7\"","qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('langgenius/dify/orpc-contract-first', 'official', 'langgenius', 'dify', 'langgenius/dify', 'orpc-contract-first', 130011, 20249, 70, '2026-02-23T01:07:44Z', '2026-02-23T01:08:21.899Z', 'f6b6fadfa284ef0263bd06d4f509ec541c7d03cfaaa9cc3f2b01391b85f07156', '{"id":"langgenius/dify/orpc-contract-first","name":"orpc-contract-first","description":{"zh":"oRPC合同优先开发是一种简化API层工作的开发模式，用于创建和管理API合同","ja":"oRPCコントラクトファースト開発は、API層の作業を簡素化するための開発モードで、APIコントラクトの作成と管理に使用されます","ko":"oRPC 계약 첫 번째 개발은 API 계층 작업을 간소화하는 개발 모드로서 API 계약의 생성과 관리에 사용됩니다","es":"Guía para implementar patrones de API contract-first con oRPC en Dify frontend. Automatiza la creación de contratos y la integración de servicios.","fr":"Guide pour mettre en œuvre des modèles d''API contract-first avec oRPC dans Dify frontend. Automatisez la création de contrats et l''intégration de services.","de":"Anleitung zur Implementierung von Contract-First-API-Mustern mit oRPC in Dify-Frontend. Automatisieren Sie die Erstellung von Verträgen und die Integration von Diensten.","pt":"O oRPC contract-first é um padrão de API que permite a criação de contratos de serviço de forma eficiente e escalável","ru":"ИИ Агент oRPC contract-first - это шаблон API, который позволяет создавать сервисные контракты эффективно и масштабировать","ar":"وضع نمط API oRPC contract-first هو نمط يسمح بإنشاء عقود خدمة بفعالية ومتوسعة","en":"Guide for implementing oRPC contract-first API patterns in Dify frontend. Triggers when creating new API contracts, adding service endpoints, integrating TanStack Query with typed contracts, or migrating legacy service calls to oRPC. Use for all API layer work in web/contract and web/service dire..."},"owner":"langgenius","repo":"dify","repoPath":"langgenius/dify","stars":130011,"forks":20249,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T01:07:44Z","topics":["agent","agentic-ai","agentic-framework","agentic-workflow","ai","automation","gemini","genai","gpt","gpt-4","llm","low-code","mcp","nextjs","no-code","openai","orchestration","python","rag","workflow"],"skillMd":{"name":"orpc-contract-first","description":"Guide for implementing oRPC contract-first API patterns in Dify frontend. Triggers when creating new API contracts, adding service endpoints, integrating TanStack Query with typed contracts, or migrating legacy service calls to oRPC. Use for all API layer work in web/contract and web/service directories.","bodyPreview":"# oRPC Contract-First Development\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nweb/contract/\n├── base.ts           # Base contract (inputStructure: ''detailed'')\n├── router.ts         # Router composition & type exports\n├── marketplace.ts    # Marketplace contracts\n└── console/          # Console contracts by domain\n    ├── system.ts\n    └── billing.ts\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Create contract** in `web/contract/console/{domain}.ts`\n   - Import `base` from `../base` and `type` from `@orpc/contract`\n   - Define route w","body":"# oRPC Contract-First Development\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nweb/contract/\n├── base.ts           # Base contract (inputStructure: ''detailed'')\n├── router.ts         # Router composition & type exports\n├── marketplace.ts    # Marketplace contracts\n└── console/          # Console contracts by domain\n    ├── system.ts\n    └── billing.ts\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Create contract** in `web/contract/console/{domain}.ts`\n   - Import `base` from `../base` and `type` from `@orpc/contract`\n   - Define route with `path`, `method`, `input`, `output`\n\n2. **Register in router** at `web/contract/router.ts`\n   - Import directly from domain file (no barrel files)\n   - Nest by API prefix: `billing: { invoices, bindPartnerStack }`\n\n3. **Create hooks** in `web/service/use-{domain}.ts`\n   - Use `consoleQuery.{group}.{contract}.queryKey()` for query keys\n   - Use `consoleClient.{group}.{contract}()` for API calls\n\n## Key Rules\n\n- **Input structure**: Always use `{ params, query?, body? }` format\n- **Path params**: Use `{paramName}` in path, match in `params` object\n- **Router nesting**: Group by API prefix (e.g., `/billing/*` → `billing: {}`)\n- **No barrel files**: Import directly from specific files\n- **Types**: Import from `@/types/`, use `type<T>()` helper\n\n## Type Export\n\n```typescript\nexport type ConsoleInputs = InferContractRouterInputs<typeof consoleRouterContract>\n```\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:08:21.899Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理oRPC首先开发","ja":"AIエージェントoRPCコントラクトファースト開発","ko":"AI 에이전트 oRPC 계약 첫 번째 개발","es":"Herramientas de AI: oRPC Contract-First para Desarrolladores","fr":"Outils IA: oRPC Contract-First pour les Développeurs","de":"KI-Tools: oRPC Contract-First für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: oRPC Contract-First para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: oRPC Contract-First для Разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: oRPC Contract-First للمطورين","en":"orpc-contract-first"},"description":{"zh":"oRPC合同优先开发是一种简化API层工作的开发模式，用于创建和管理API合同","ja":"oRPCコントラクトファースト開発は、API層の作業を簡素化するための開発モードで、APIコントラクトの作成と管理に使用されます","ko":"oRPC 계약 첫 번째 개발은 API 계층 작업을 간소화하는 개발 모드로서 API 계약의 생성과 관리에 사용됩니다","es":"Guía para implementar patrones de API contract-first con oRPC en Dify frontend. Automatiza la creación de contratos y la integración de servicios.","fr":"Guide pour mettre en œuvre des modèles d''API contract-first avec oRPC dans Dify frontend. Automatisez la création de contrats et l''intégration de services.","de":"Anleitung zur Implementierung von Contract-First-API-Mustern mit oRPC in Dify-Frontend. Automatisieren Sie die Erstellung von Verträgen und die Integration v...","pt":"O oRPC contract-first é um padrão de API que permite a criação de contratos de serviço de forma eficiente e escalável","ru":"ИИ Агент oRPC contract-first - это шаблон API, который позволяет создавать сервисные контракты эффективно и масштабировать","ar":"وضع نمط API oRPC contract-first هو نمط يسمح بإنشاء عقود خدمة بفعالية ومتوسعة","en":"Guide for implementing oRPC contract-first API patterns in Dify frontend. Triggers when creating new API contracts, adding service endpoints, integrating Tan..."},"definition":{"en":"Guide for implementing oRPC contract-first API patterns in Dify frontend. Triggers when creating new API contracts, adding service endpoints, integrating TanStack Query with typed contracts, or migrating legacy service calls to oRPC. Use for all API layer work in web/contract and web/service directories."},"features":{"zh":["简化API层工作","提高开发效率","创建和管理API合同","支持多种编程语言","集成TanStack Query和Typed Contracts"],"ja":["API層の作業を簡素化","開発効率を向上させる","APIコントラクトの作成と管理","多くのプログラミング言語をサポート","TanStack QueryとTyped Contractsの統合"],"ko":["API 계층 작업을 간소화","개발 효율성을 향상시키는","API 계약의 생성과 관리","다수의 프로그래밍 언어를 지원","TanStack Query와 Typed Contracts의 통합"],"es":["Creación automática de contratos","Integración de servicios con TanStack Query","Compatibilidad con typed contracts","Migración de llamadas de servicio legacy a oRPC","Estructura de proyecto organizada"],"fr":["Création automatique de contrats","Intégration de services avec TanStack Query","Compatibilité avec les contrats typés","Migration des appels de service legacy vers oRPC","Structure de projet organisée"],"de":["Automatische Erstellung von Verträgen","Integration von Diensten mit TanStack Query","Unterstützung von typisierten Verträgen","Migration von Legacy-Service-Aufrufen zu oRPC","Organisierte Projektsstruktur"],"pt":["Criação de contratos de serviço de forma eficiente","Integração com o TanStack Query","Suporte a migração de chamadas de serviço legadas para o oRPC","Organização de código em diretórios web/contract e web/service","Tipagem de contratos com @orpc/contract"],"ru":["Эффективное создание сервисных контрактов","Интеграция с TanStack Query","Поддержка миграции устаревших сервисных вызовов на oRPC","Организация кода в директориях web/contract и web/service","Типизация контрактов с @orpc/contract"],"ar":["إنشاء عقود خدمة بفعالية","التكامل مع TanStack Query","دعم هجرة مكالمات الخدمة القديمة إلى oRPC","تنظيم الشفرة في المجلدات web/contract و web/service","تخصيص عقود مع @orpc/contract"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","oRPC","API开发","合同优先开发","TanStack Query","Typed Contracts","JavaScript","Python","Node.js"],"ja":["AIエージェント","oRPC","API開発","コントラクトファースト開発","TanStack Query","Typed Contracts","JavaScript","Python","Node.js"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","oRPC","API 개발","계약 첫 번째 개발","TanStack Query","Typed Contracts","JavaScript","Python","Node.js"],"es":["oRPC","Contract-First","API","Dify frontend","TanStack Query","typed contracts","migración de servicios","desarrollo de software","herramientas de AI"],"fr":["oRPC","Contract-First","API","Dify frontend","TanStack Query","contrats typés","migration de services","développement de logiciels","outils IA"],"de":["oRPC","Contract-First","API","Dify-Frontend","TanStack Query","typisierte Verträge","Migration von Diensten","Softwareentwicklung","KI-Tools"],"pt":["oRPC contract-first","desenvolvimento de API","Dify frontend","TanStack Query","migração de chamadas de serviço","tipagem de contratos","agentes de IA","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ Агент oRPC contract-first","разработка API","Dify frontend","TanStack Query","миграция сервисных вызовов","типизация контрактов","ИИ Агенты","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["وضع نمط API oRPC contract-first","تطوير API","Dify frontend","TanStack Query","هجرة مكالمات الخدمة","تخصيص عقود","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات التطوير"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for API-focused Agents requiring contract-first development with oRPC, particularly those working with TanStack Query and typed contracts.","zh":"适用于需要使用oRPC的契约优先开发的API专注Agent，特别是与TanStack Query和类型化契约合作的Agent。","ja":"oRPCを使用した契約先開発を必要とするAPI中心のエージェントに適しています。特に、TanStack Queryおよび型付契約と連携するエージェントに適しています。","ko":"oRPC를 사용하는 계약 우선 개발이 필요한 API 중심 에이전트에게 적합하며, TanStack Query 및 유형화된 계약과 협력하는 에이전트에게 특히 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal for API-focused Agents requiring contract-first development with oRPC, particularly those working with TanStack Query and typed contracts.","fr":"Ideal for API-focused Agents requiring contract-first development with oRPC, particularly those working with TanStack Query and typed contracts.","de":"Ideal for API-focused Agents requiring contract-first development with oRPC, particularly those working with TanStack Query and typed contracts.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes focados em API que exigem desenvolvimento contratuais primeiro com oRPC, particularmente aqueles que trabalham com TanStack Query e contratos tipados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на API, требующих разработки по контракту с oRPC, особенно тех, кто работает с TanStack Query и типизированными контрактами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التركيز على واجهة برمجة التطبيقات التي تتطلب تطوير العقد أولا مع oRPC، ولا سيما أولئك الذين يعملون مع TanStack Query وعقود من النوع"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement oRPC contract-first API patterns in Dify frontend, leveraging typed contracts, and integrating with TanStack Query for robust data fetching and caching, while ensuring seamless migration of legacy service calls to oRPC.","zh":"赋予代理实现oRPC契约优先API模式的能力，利用类型化契约，并与TanStack Query集成以实现强大的数据获取和缓存，同时确保将遗留服务调用无缝迁移到oRPC。","ja":"エージェントにoRPC契約先APIパターンを実装する能力を付与し、型付契約を利用し、TanStack Queryと統合して強力なデータ取得およびキャッシュを実現し、レガシーサービス呼び出しのoRPCへの無縫な移行を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 oRPC 계약 우선 API 패턴을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 유형화된 계약을 활용하고 TanStack Query와 통합하여 강력한 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱을 구현하며 레거시 서비스 호출을 oRPC로 무중단으로 마이그레이션할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to implement oRPC contract-first API patterns in Dify frontend, leveraging typed contracts, and integrating with TanStack Query for robust data fetching and caching, while ensuring seamless migration of legacy service calls to oRPC.","fr":"Empowers agents to implement oRPC contract-first API patterns in Dify frontend, leveraging typed contracts, and integrating with TanStack Query for robust data fetching and caching, while ensuring seamless migration of legacy service calls to oRPC.","de":"Empowers agents to implement oRPC contract-first API patterns in Dify frontend, leveraging typed contracts, and integrating with TanStack Query for robust data fetching and caching, while ensuring seamless migration of legacy service calls to oRPC.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar padrões de API de oRPC com contrato primeiro no frontend Dify, aproveitando contratos tipados e integrando com TanStack Query para busca e cache de dados robustos, garantindo uma migração sem problemas de chamadas de serviço legadas para oRPC.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность реализовать шаблоны API oRPC с контрактом первого в frontend Dify, используя типизированные контракты и интегрируя с TanStack Query для надежной выборки и кэширования данных, обеспечивая бесшовную миграцию устаревших вызовов служб в oRPC.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تنفيذ أنماط واجهة برمجة التطبيقات oRPC مع عقد أولا في واجهة المستخدم الأمامية Dify، واستغلال العقود المُصنَّفة وتكامل مع TanStack Query للحصول على بيانات قوية ومخزنة مؤقتًا، مما يضمن انتقالًا بدون مشاكل ل呼وات الخدمة القديمة إلى oRPC."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new API contracts with detailed input structures","Adding service endpoints with typed contracts and router composition","Integrating TanStack Query with oRPC contracts for optimized data fetching","Migrating legacy service calls to oRPC for improved maintainability"],"zh":["创建具有详细输入结构的新API契约","使用类型化契约和路由器组合添加服务端点","将TanStack Query与oRPC契约集成以优化数据获取","将遗留服务调用迁移到oRPC以提高可维护性"],"ja":["詳細な入力構造を持つ新しいAPI契約を作成する","型付契約とルーターコンポジションを使用してサービスエンドポイントを追加する","TanStack QueryをoRPC契約と統合してデータ取得を最適化する","レガシーサービス呼び出しのoRPCへの移行を実施してメンテナンス性を向上させる"],"ko":["세부적인 입력 구조를 갖는 새로운 API 계약을 생성하는 것","유형화된 계약 및 라우터 구성으로 서비스 엔드포인트를 추가하는 것","TanStack Query를 oRPC 계약과 통합하여 데이터 가져오기를 최적화하는 것","레거시 서비스 호출을 oRPC로 마이그레이션하여 유지 보수성을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Creating new API contracts with detailed input structures","Adding service endpoints with typed contracts and router composition","Integrating TanStack Query with oRPC contracts for optimized data fetching","Migrating legacy service calls to oRPC for improved maintainability"],"fr":["Creating new API contracts with detailed input structures","Adding service endpoints with typed contracts and router composition","Integrating TanStack Query with oRPC contracts for optimized data fetching","Migrating legacy service calls to oRPC for improved maintainability"],"de":["Creating new API contracts with detailed input structures","Adding service endpoints with typed contracts and router composition","Integrating TanStack Query with oRPC contracts for optimized data fetching","Migrating legacy service calls to oRPC for improved maintainability"],"pt":["Criar novos contratos de API com estruturas de entrada detalhadas","Adicionar pontos de extremidade de serviço com contratos tipados e composição de roteador","Integrar TanStack Query com contratos oRPC para busca de dados otimizada","Migrar chamadas de serviço legadas para oRPC para melhor manutenibilidade"],"ru":["Создание новых контрактов API с подробными входными структурами","Добавление конечных точек службы с типизированными контрактами и композицией маршрутизатора","Интеграция TanStack Query с контрактами oRPC для оптимизированной выборки данных","Миграция устаревших вызовов служб в oRPC для улучшения поддержки"],"ar":["إنشاء عقود جديدة لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات مع هياكل مدخلات مفصلة","إضافة نقاط نهاية للخدمة مع عقود من النوع وتركيبة الموجه","دمج TanStack Query مع عقود oRPC للحصول على بيانات محسّنة","نقل呼وات الخدمة القديمة إلى oRPC لتحسين القابلية للصيانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires oRPC and TanStack Query setup","Specific to Dify frontend and web/contract directory structure"],"zh":["需要设置oRPC和TanStack Query","特定于Dify前端和web/contract目录结构"],"ja":["oRPCおよびTanStack Queryの設定が必要","Difyフロントエンドおよびweb/contractディレクトリ構造に特有"],"ko":["oRPC 및 TanStack Query 설정이 필요함","Dify 프론트엔드 및 web/contract 디렉토리 구조에 특정됨"],"es":["Requires oRPC and TanStack Query setup","Specific to Dify frontend and web/contract directory structure"],"fr":["Requires oRPC and TanStack Query setup","Specific to Dify frontend and web/contract directory structure"],"de":["Requires oRPC and TanStack Query setup","Specific to Dify frontend and web/contract directory structure"],"pt":["Exige configuração de oRPC e TanStack Query","Específico para frontend Dify e estrutura de diretório web/contrato"],"ru":["Требует настройки oRPC и TanStack Query","Специфичен для frontend Dify и структуры каталога web/контракт"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد oRPC و TanStack Query","محدد لواجهة المستخدم الأمامية Dify وهيكل دليل الويب / العقد"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f6b6fadfa284ef0263bd06d4f509ec541c7d03cfaaa9cc3f2b01391b85f07156","repoEtag":"W/\"51b834c538f496e6778b6c70494f024d83f10221978542079e3a893429c0da43\"","qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('n8n-io/n8n/n8n-conventions', 'official', 'n8n-io', 'n8n', 'n8n-io/n8n', 'n8n-conventions', 175849, 55078, 70, '2026-02-23T01:04:43Z', '2026-02-23T01:08:23.333Z', '6823cc50d12f4ccbb581f5aad8d38bd8feb0b1201b9db70aee38aa2ec082bf68', '{"id":"n8n-io/n8n/n8n-conventions","name":"n8n-conventions","description":{"zh":"n8n 快速参考指南，提供关键模式和最佳实践，帮助开发者提高工作效率。包括 TypeScript、错误处理和工作流自动化等方面","ja":"n8n クイックリファレンスガイド - キーパターンとベストプラクティスを提供して開発者の生産性を向上。TypeScript、エラーハンドリング、ワークフローオートメーションなどを含む","ko":"n8n 빠른 참조 가이드 - 개발자의 생산성을 향상시키는 주요 패턴 및 모범 사례 제공。TypeScript, 오류 처리 및 워크플로 자동화 등 포함","es":"n8n-conventions es una guía rápida para desarrolladores que necesitan recordar patrones críticos para la automatización de flujos de trabajo con n8n","fr":"n8n-conventions est un guide rapide pour les développeurs qui ont besoin de se rappeler des modèles critiques pour l''automatisation des flux de travail avec n8n","de":"n8n-conventions ist ein schnelles Nachschlagewerk für Entwickler, die kritische Muster für die Automatisierung von Workflows mit n8n nachschlagen müssen","pt":"O n8n-conventions é um guia rápido para padrões de desenvolvimento do n8n, incluindo TypeScript e tratamento de erros","ru":"n8n-conventions - это быстрый справочник по конвенциям разработки n8n, включая TypeScript и обработку ошибок","ar":"n8n-conventions هو مرجع سريع للقواعد التوجيهية لتطوير n8n، بما في ذلك TypeScript ومعالجة الأخطاء","en":"Quick reference for n8n patterns. Full docs /AGENTS.md"},"owner":"n8n-io","repo":"n8n","repoPath":"n8n-io/n8n","stars":175849,"forks":55078,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T01:04:43Z","topics":["ai","apis","automation","cli","data-flow","development","integration-framework","integrations","ipaas","low-code","low-code-platform","mcp","mcp-client","mcp-server","n8n","no-code","self-hosted","typescript","workflow","workflow-automation"],"skillMd":{"name":"n8n-conventions","description":"Quick reference for n8n patterns. Full docs /AGENTS.md","bodyPreview":"# n8n Quick Reference\n\n**📚 Full Documentation:**\n- **General:** `/AGENTS.md` - Architecture, commands, workflows\n- **Frontend:** `/packages/frontend/AGENTS.md` - CSS variables, timing\n\nUse this skill when you need quick reminders on critical patterns.\n\n## Critical Rules (Must Follow)\n\n**TypeScript:**\n- Never `any` → use `unknown`\n- Prefer `satisfies` over `as` (except tests)\n- Shared types in `@n8n/api-types`\n\n**Error Handling:**\n```typescript\nimport { UnexpectedError } from ''n8n-workflow'';\nthr","body":"# n8n Quick Reference\n\n**📚 Full Documentation:**\n- **General:** `/AGENTS.md` - Architecture, commands, workflows\n- **Frontend:** `/packages/frontend/AGENTS.md` - CSS variables, timing\n\nUse this skill when you need quick reminders on critical patterns.\n\n## Critical Rules (Must Follow)\n\n**TypeScript:**\n- Never `any` → use `unknown`\n- Prefer `satisfies` over `as` (except tests)\n- Shared types in `@n8n/api-types`\n\n**Error Handling:**\n```typescript\nimport { UnexpectedError } from ''n8n-workflow'';\nthrow new UnexpectedError(''message'', { extra: { context } });\n// DON''T use deprecated ApplicationError\n```\n\n**Frontend:**\n- Vue 3 Composition API (`<script setup lang=\"ts\">`)\n- CSS variables (never hardcode px) - see `/packages/frontend/AGENTS.md`\n- All text via i18n (`$t(''key'')`)\n- `data-testid` for E2E (single value, no spaces)\n\n**Backend:**\n- Controller → Service → Repository\n- Dependency injection via `@n8n/di`\n- Config via `@n8n/config`\n- Zod schemas for validation\n\n**Testing:**\n- Vitest (unit), Playwright (E2E)\n- Mock external dependencies\n- Work from package directory: `pushd packages/cli && pnpm test`\n\n**Database:**\n- SQLite/PostgreSQL only (app DB)\n- Exception: DB nodes (MySQL Node, etc.) can use DB-specific features\n\n**Commands:**\n```bash\npnpm build > build.log 2>&1  # Always redirect\npnpm typecheck               # Before commit\npnpm lint                    # Before commit\n```\n\n## Key Packages\n\n| Package | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `packages/cli` | Backend API |\n| `packages/frontend/editor-ui` | Vue 3 frontend |\n| `packages/@n8n/api-types` | Shared types |\n| `packages/@n8n/db` | TypeORM entities |\n| `packages/workflow` | Core interfaces |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n**Pinia Store:**\n```typescript\nimport { STORES } from ''@n8n/stores'';\nexport const useMyStore = defineStore(STORES.MY_STORE, () => {\n  const state = shallowRef([]);\n  return { state };\n});\n```\n\n**Vue Component:**\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\ntype Props = { title: string };\nconst props = defineProps<Props>();\n</script>\n```\n\n**Service:**\n```typescript\nimport { Service } from ''@n8n/di'';\nimport { Config } from ''@n8n/config'';\n\n@Service()\nexport class MyService {\n  constructor(private readonly config: Config) {}\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n📖 **Need more details?** Read `/AGENTS.md` and `/packages/frontend/AGENTS.md`\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:08:23.333Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理 - n8n 快速参考","ja":"AIエージェント - n8n クイックリファレンス","ko":"AI 에이전트 - n8n 빠른 참조","es":"Herramientas de AI: n8n-conventions para desarrolladores","fr":"Outils d''IA : n8n-conventions pour les développeurs","de":"KI-Tools: n8n-conventions für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA n8n: Convenções de Desenvolvimento","ru":"ИИ Агенты n8n: Справочник по Конвенциям","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي n8n: إرشادات الترميز","en":"n8n-conventions"},"description":{"zh":"n8n 快速参考指南，提供关键模式和最佳实践，帮助开发者提高工作效率。包括 TypeScript、错误处理和工作流自动化等方面","ja":"n8n クイックリファレンスガイド - キーパターンとベストプラクティスを提供して開発者の生産性を向上。TypeScript、エラーハンドリング、ワークフローオートメーションなどを含む","ko":"n8n 빠른 참조 가이드 - 개발자의 생산성을 향상시키는 주요 패턴 및 모범 사례 제공。TypeScript, 오류 처리 및 워크플로 자동화 등 포함","es":"n8n-conventions es una guía rápida para desarrolladores que necesitan recordar patrones críticos para la automatización de flujos de trabajo con n8n","fr":"n8n-conventions est un guide rapide pour les développeurs qui ont besoin de se rappeler des modèles critiques pour l''automatisation des flux de travail avec n8n","de":"n8n-conventions ist ein schnelles Nachschlagewerk für Entwickler, die kritische Muster für die Automatisierung von Workflows mit n8n nachschlagen müssen","pt":"O n8n-conventions é um guia rápido para padrões de desenvolvimento do n8n, incluindo TypeScript e tratamento de erros","ru":"n8n-conventions - это быстрый справочник по конвенциям разработки n8n, включая TypeScript и обработку ошибок","ar":"n8n-conventions هو مرجع سريع للقواعد التوجيهية لتطوير n8n، بما في ذلك TypeScript ومعالجة الأخطاء","en":"Quick reference for n8n patterns. Full docs /AGENTS.md"},"definition":{"en":"Quick reference for n8n patterns. Full docs /AGENTS.md"},"features":{"zh":["TypeScript 支持","错误处理最佳实践","工作流自动化","低代码开发","自托管支持"],"ja":["TypeScript サポート","エラーハンドリングベストプラクティス","ワークフローオートメーション","ローコード開発","セルフホスティングサポート"],"ko":["TypeScript 지원","오류 처리 모범 사례","워크플로 자동화","저 код 개발","자체 호스팅 지원"],"es":["Patrones de automatización de flujos de trabajo","Convenciones de código para desarrolladores","Integración con la plataforma n8n","Uso de TypeScript y sus características","Manejo de errores y excepciones"],"fr":["Modèles d''automatisation de flux de travail","Conventions de code pour les développeurs","Intégration avec la plateforme n8n","Utilisation de TypeScript et de ses fonctionnalités","Gestion des erreurs et des exceptions"],"de":["Muster für die Automatisierung von Workflows","Code-Konventionen für Entwickler","Integration mit der n8n-Plattform","Verwendung von TypeScript und seinen Funktionen","Fehler- und Ausnahmehandling"],"pt":["Convenções de desenvolvimento do n8n","Tipos de dados em TypeScript","Tratamento de erros com UnexpectedError","Integração de APIs com o n8n","Automação de fluxo de trabalho com o n8n"],"ru":["Конвенции разработки n8n","Типы данных в TypeScript","Обработка ошибок с UnexpectedError","Интеграция API с n8n","Автоматизация рабочего процесса с n8n"],"ar":["إرشادات الترميز ل n8n","أنواع البيانات في TypeScript","معالجة الأخطاء باستخدام UnexpectedError","تكامل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات مع n8n","تلقيمية تدفق العمل مع n8n"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","n8n","工作流自动化","TypeScript","低代码开发","自托管","错误处理","开发者工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","n8n","ワークフローオートメーション","TypeScript","ローコード開発","セルフホスティング","エラーハンドリング","開発者ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","n8n","워크플로 자동화","TypeScript","저 코드 개발","자체 호스팅","오류 처리","개발자 도구"],"es":["n8n","automatización de flujos de trabajo","desarrollo de software","TypeScript","integración de APIs","herramientas de AI","desarrollo low-code","plataformas de integración"],"fr":["n8n","automatisation de flux de travail","développement de logiciels","TypeScript","intégration d''API","outils d''IA","développement low-code","plateformes d''intégration"],"de":["n8n","Automatisierung von Workflows","Software-Entwicklung","TypeScript","API-Integration","KI-Tools","Low-Code-Entwicklung","Integrationsplattformen"],"pt":["n8n","desenvolvimento de software","TypeScript","tratamento de erros","integração de APIs","automação de fluxo de trabalho","ferramentas de IA","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["n8n","разработка программного обеспечения","TypeScript","обработка ошибок","интеграция API","автоматизация рабочего процесса","ИИ Агенты","разработчики"],"ar":["n8n","تطوير البرمجيات","TypeScript","معالجة الأخطاء","تكامل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","تلقيمية تدفق العمل","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","المطورون"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Workflow Automation Agents needing to adhere to n8n patterns and conventions.","zh":"非常适合需要遵循n8n模式和约定的工作流自动化代理。","ja":"n8nのパターンと規約に従う必要があるワークフロー自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"n8n 패턴 및 규칙을 준수해야 하는 워크플로 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de flujos de trabajo que necesitan adherirse a patrones y convenciones de n8n.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de workflow qui doivent respecter les modèles et conventions de n8n.","de":"Perfekt für Workflow-Automatisierungsagenten, die den Mustern und Konventionen von n8n entsprechen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho que precisam aderir aos padrões e convenções do n8n.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, которым необходимо соблюдать шаблоны и соглашения n8n.","ar":"مثالي لعميل автомة سير العمل الذي يحتاج إلى الالتزام بنماذج وآلات ن8n."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write clean TypeScript code using `unknown` instead of `any`, prefer `satisfies` over `as`, and handle errors with `UnexpectedError` from `n8n-workflow`, ensuring consistency across workflows and frontend implementations.","zh":"赋予代理写干净的TypeScript代码，使用`unknown`代替`any`，更喜欢`satisfies`而不是`as`，并使用`n8n-workflow`中的`UnexpectedError`处理错误，确保工作流和前端实现的一致性。","ja":"エージェントがクリーンなTypeScriptコードを記述できるようにし、`unknown`を`any`の代わりに使用し、`as`よりも`satisfies`を優先し、`n8n-workflow`の`UnexpectedError`でエラーを処理し、ワークフローとフロントエンドの実装の一貫性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 깨끗한 TypeScript 코드를 작성할 수 있도록 하며, `any` 대신 `unknown`을 사용하고, `as` 대신 `satisfies`를 선호하며, `n8n-workflow`의 `UnexpectedError`로 오류를 처리하여 워크플로와 프론트엔드 구현의 일관성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir un código TypeScript limpio utilizando `unknown` en lugar de `any`, prefiriendo `satisfies` sobre `as` y manejando errores con `UnexpectedError` desde `n8n-workflow`, garantizando la consistencia en flujos de trabajo y implementaciones de frontend.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire un code TypeScript propre en utilisant `unknown` au lieu de `any`, en préférant `satisfies` à `as` et en gérant les erreurs avec `UnexpectedError` depuis `n8n-workflow`, assurant ainsi la cohérence à travers les flux de travail et les implémentations frontend.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, sauberen TypeScript-Code zu schreiben, indem sie `unknown` anstelle von `any` verwenden, `satisfies` bevorzugen gegenüber `as` und Fehler mit `UnexpectedError` von `n8n-workflow` behandeln, wodurch die Konsistenz über Workflows und Frontend-Implementierungen hinweg gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escreverem código TypeScript limpo usando `unknown` em vez de `any`, preferir `satisfies` em vez de `as` e lidar com erros com `UnexpectedError` do `n8n-workflow`, garantindo a consistência em todo o fluxo de trabalho e implementações de frontend.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать чистый код TypeScript, используя `unknown` вместо `any`, предпочитая `satisfies` вместо `as` и обрабатывая ошибки с помощью `UnexpectedError` из `n8n-workflow`, обеспечивая согласованность во всех рабочих процессах и реализациях frontend.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من كتابة رمز TypeScript نظيف باستخدام `unknown` بدلاً من `any`، و تفضيل `satisfies` على `as`، ومعالجة الأخطاء باستخدام `UnexpectedError` من `n8n-workflow` ، مما يضمن الاتساق عبر سير العمل وتطبيقات الواجهة الأمامية."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing coding standards for n8n workflows","Implementing robust error handling mechanisms with `UnexpectedError`","Developing reusable frontend components with consistent CSS variables and timing"],"zh":["强制n8n工作流的编码标准","使用`UnexpectedError`实现强大的错误处理机制","使用一致的CSS变量和定时开发可重用的前端组件"],"ja":["n8nワークフローのコーディング規約を強制する","`UnexpectedError`を使用した堅牢なエラーハンドリングメカニズムの実装","一貫したCSS変数とタイミングを使用して再利用可能なフロントエンドコンポーネントを開発する"],"ko":["n8n 워크플로의 코딩 표준 시행","`UnexpectedError`를 사용한 강력한 오류 처리 메커니즘 구현","일관된 CSS 변수와 타이밍을 사용하여 재사용 가능한 프론트엔드 컴포넌트 개발"],"es":["Hacer cumplir los estándares de codificación para flujos de trabajo de n8n","Implementar mecanismos de manejo de errores robustos con `UnexpectedError`","Desarrollar componentes de frontend reutilizables con variables CSS consistentes y temporización"],"fr":["Faire respecter les normes de codage pour les flux de travail n8n","Mettre en œuvre des mécanismes de gestion d''erreurs robustes avec `UnexpectedError`","Développer des composants frontend réutilisables avec des variables CSS cohérentes et une temporisation"],"de":["Durchsetzen von Kodierungsstandards für n8n-Workflows","Implementieren robuster Fehlerbehandlungsmechanismen mit `UnexpectedError`","Entwickeln wiederverwendbarer Frontend-Komponenten mit konsistenten CSS-Variablen und Zeitsteuerung"],"pt":["Aplicar padrões de codificação para fluxos de trabalho do n8n","Implementar mecanismos de tratamento de erros robustos com `UnexpectedError`","Desenvolver componentes de frontend reutilizáveis com variáveis CSS consistentes e temporização"],"ru":["Применять стандарты кодирования для рабочих процессов n8n","Реализовывать надежные механизмы обработки ошибок с помощью `UnexpectedError`","Разрабатывать многократно используемые компоненты frontend с согласованными переменными CSS и таймингом"],"ar":["تطبيق معايير الترميز لسير العمل n8n","تنفيذ آليات معالجة الأخطاء القوية باستخدام `UnexpectedError`","تطوير مكونات الواجهة الأمامية القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع متغيرات CSS متسقة وتوقيت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of TypeScript and n8n workflow architecture","Limited to n8n-specific implementations and conventions"],"zh":["需要TypeScript和n8n工作流架构的知识","仅限n8n特定的实现和约定"],"ja":["TypeScriptとn8nワークフローアーキテクチャの知識が必要","n8n特有の実装と規約に限定される"],"ko":["TypeScript와 n8n 워크플로 아키텍처에 대한 지식이 필요","n8n 특정 구현 및 규약으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de TypeScript y arquitectura de flujos de trabajo de n8n","Limitado a implementaciones y convenciones específicas de n8n"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en TypeScript et en architecture de flux de travail n8n","Limité aux implémentations et conventions spécifiques à n8n"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von TypeScript und n8n-Workflow-Architektur","Begrenzt auf n8n-spezifische Implementierungen und Konventionen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de TypeScript e arquitetura de fluxo de trabalho do n8n","Limitado a implementações e convenções específicas do n8n"],"ru":["Требует знания TypeScript и архитектуры рабочих процессов n8n","Ограничен реализациями и соглашениями, специфичными для n8n"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة TypeScript و هيكل سير العمل n8n","محدود بالتنفيذات والأilenames الخاصة بن8n"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6823cc50d12f4ccbb581f5aad8d38bd8feb0b1201b9db70aee38aa2ec082bf68","repoEtag":"W/\"c9bf7d69bd9456481a6d829fb06e531593d80bebb362a350a33cb22d496cf4f0\"","qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('anthropics/skills/canvas-design', 'official', 'anthropics', 'skills', 'anthropics/skills', 'canvas-design', 74575, 7681, 65, '2026-02-24T12:03:15Z', '2026-02-24T12:03:41.863Z', 'a1f288079624402f30682753c1d43920b6664785698d21d3e7aa197450a6448b', '{"id":"anthropics/skills/canvas-design","name":"canvas-design","description":{"zh":"画布设计技能允许开发人员使用设计理念创建美丽的视觉艺术，输出png和pdf文件","ja":"キャンバスデザインスキルを使用すると、開発者は設計哲学を使用して美しいビジュアルアートを作成し、pngとpdfファイルに出力できます","ko":"캔버스 디자인 스킬을 사용하면 개발자가 디자인 철학을 사용하여 아름다운 시각 예술을 생성하고 png 및 pdf 파일로 출력할 수 있습니다","es":"La habilidad de diseño de lienzo crea arte visual original en documentos PNG y PDF utilizando filosofía de diseño","fr":"La compétence de conception de canvas crée des œuvres d''art visuel originales dans des documents PNG et PDF en utilisant la philosophie de conception","de":"Die Canvas-Design-Fähigkeit erstellt originales visuelles Kunstwerk in PNG- und PDF-Dokumenten unter Verwendung von Designphilosophie","pt":"O skill de canvas-design permite criar arte visual incrível em .png e .pdf utilizando filosofias de design. Aprenda a criar designs originais e expressá-los visualmente","ru":"Навык canvas-design позволяет создавать красивое визуальное искусство в .png и .pdf, используя философии дизайна. Узнайте, как создавать оригинальные дизайны и выражать их визуально","ar":"مهارة تصميم الكanvas تسمح بإنشاء فن بصري رائع في .png و .pdf باستخدام فلسفات التصميم. تعلم كيفية إنشاء تصاميم أصلية والتعبير عنها بصريا","en":"Create beautiful visual art in .png and .pdf documents using design philosophy. You should use this skill when the user asks to create a poster, piece of art, design, or other static piece. Create original visual designs, never copying existing artists work to avoid copyright violations."},"owner":"anthropics","repo":"skills","repoPath":"anthropics/skills","stars":74575,"forks":7681,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:03:15Z","topics":["agent-skills"],"skillMd":{"name":"canvas-design","description":"Create beautiful visual art in .png and .pdf documents using design philosophy. You should use this skill when the user asks to create a poster, piece of art, design, or other static piece. Create original visual designs, never copying existing artists work to avoid copyright violations.","bodyPreview":"These are instructions for creating design philosophies - aesthetic movements that are then EXPRESSED VISUALLY. Output only .md files, .pdf files, and .png files.\n\nComplete this in two steps:\n1. Design Philosophy Creation (.md file)\n2. Express by creating it on a canvas (.pdf file or .png file)\n\nFirst, undertake this task:\n\n## DESIGN PHILOSOPHY CREATION\n\nTo begin, create a VISUAL PHILOSOPHY (not layouts or templates) that will be interpreted through:\n- Form, space, color, composition\n- Images, g","body":"These are instructions for creating design philosophies - aesthetic movements that are then EXPRESSED VISUALLY. Output only .md files, .pdf files, and .png files.\n\nComplete this in two steps:\n1. Design Philosophy Creation (.md file)\n2. Express by creating it on a canvas (.pdf file or .png file)\n\nFirst, undertake this task:\n\n## DESIGN PHILOSOPHY CREATION\n\nTo begin, create a VISUAL PHILOSOPHY (not layouts or templates) that will be interpreted through:\n- Form, space, color, composition\n- Images, graphics, shapes, patterns\n- Minimal text as visual accent\n\n### THE CRITICAL UNDERSTANDING\n- What is received: Some subtle input or instructions by the user that should be taken into account, but used as a foundation; it should not constrain creative freedom.\n- What is created: A design philosophy/aesthetic movement.\n- What happens next: Then, the same version receives the philosophy and EXPRESSES IT VISUALLY - creating artifacts that are 90% visual design, 10% essential text.\n\nConsider this approach:\n- Write a manifesto for an art movement\n- The next phase involves making the artwork\n\nThe philosophy must emphasize: Visual expression. Spatial communication. Artistic interpretation. Minimal words.\n\n### HOW TO GENERATE A VISUAL PHILOSOPHY\n\n**Name the movement** (1-2 words): \"Brutalist Joy\" / \"Chromatic Silence\" / \"Metabolist Dreams\"\n\n**Articulate the philosophy** (4-6 paragraphs - concise but complete):\n\nTo capture the VISUAL essence, express how the philosophy manifests through:\n- Space and form\n- Color and material\n- Scale and rhythm\n- Composition and balance\n- Visual hierarchy\n\n**CRITICAL GUIDELINES:**\n- **Avoid redundancy**: Each design aspect should be mentioned once. Avoid repeating points about color theory, spatial relationships, or typographic principles unless adding new depth.\n- **Emphasize craftsmanship REPEATEDLY**: The philosophy MUST stress multiple times that the final work should appear as though it took countless hours to create, was labored over with care, and comes from someone at the absolute top of their field. This framing is essential - repeat phrases like \"meticulously crafted,\" \"the product of deep expertise,\" \"painstaking attention,\" \"master-level execution.\"\n- **Leave creative space**: Remain specific about the aesthetic direction, but concise enough that the next Claude has room to make interpretive choices also at a extremely high level of craftmanship.\n\nThe philosophy must guide the next version to express ideas VISUALLY, not through text. Information lives in design, not paragraphs.\n\n### PHILOSOPHY EXAMPLES\n\n**\"Concrete Poetry\"**\nPhilosophy: Communication through monumental form and bold geometry.\nVisual expression: Massive color blocks, sculptural typography (huge single words, tiny labels), Brutalist spatial divisions, Polish poster energy meets Le Corbusier. Ideas expressed through visual weight and spatial tension, not explanation. Text as rare, powerful gesture - never paragraphs, only essential words integrated into the visual architecture. Every element placed with the precision of a master craftsman.\n\n**\"Chromatic Language\"**\nPhilosophy: Color as the primary information system.\nVisual expression: Geometric precision where color zones create meaning. Typography minimal - small sans-serif labels letting chromatic fields communicate. Think Josef Albers'' interaction meets data visualization. Information encoded spatially and chromatically. Words only to anchor what color already shows. The result of painstaking chromatic calibration.\n\n**\"Analog Meditation\"**\nPhilosophy: Quiet visual contemplation through texture and breathing room.\nVisual expression: Paper grain, ink bleeds, vast negative space. Photography and illustration dominate. Typography whispered (small, restrained, serving the visual). Japanese photobook aesthetic. Images breathe across pages. Text appears sparingly - short phrases, never explanatory blocks. Each composition balanced with the care of a meditation practice.\n\n**\"Organic Systems\"**\nPhilosophy: Natural clustering and modular growth patterns.\nVisual expression: Rounded forms, organic arrangements, color from nature through architecture. Information shown through visual diagrams, spatial relationships, iconography. Text only for key labels floating in space. The composition tells the story through expert spatial orchestration.\n\n**\"Geometric Silence\"**\nPhilosophy: Pure order and restraint.\nVisual expression: Grid-based precision, bold photography or stark graphics, dramatic negative space. Typography precise but minimal - small essential text, large quiet zones. Swiss formalism meets Brutalist material honesty. Structure communicates, not words. Every alignment the work of countless refinements.\n\n*These are condensed examples. The actual design philosophy should be 4-6 substantial paragraphs.*\n\n### ESSENTIAL PRINCIPLES\n- **VISUAL PHILOSOPHY**: Create an aesthetic worldview to be expressed through design\n- **MINIMAL TEXT**: Always emphasize that text is sparse, essential-only, integrated as visual element - never lengthy\n- **SPATIAL EXPRESSION**: Ideas communicate through space, form, color, composition - not paragraphs\n- **ARTISTIC FREEDOM**: The next Claude interprets the philosophy visually - provide creative room\n- **PURE DESIGN**: This is about making ART OBJECTS, not documents with decoration\n- **EXPERT CRAFTSMANSHIP**: Repeatedly emphasize the final work must look meticulously crafted, labored over with care, the product of countless hours by someone at the top of their field\n\n**The design philosophy should be 4-6 paragraphs long.** Fill it with poetic design philosophy that brings together the core vision. Avoid repeating the same points. Keep the design philosophy generic without mentioning the intention of the art, as if it can be used wherever. Output the design philosophy as a .md file.\n\n---\n\n## DEDUCING THE SUBTLE REFERENCE\n\n**CRITICAL STEP**: Before creating the canvas, identify the subtle conceptual thread from the original request.\n\n**THE ESSENTIAL PRINCIPLE**:\nThe topic is a **subtle, niche reference embedded within the art itself** - not always literal, always sophisticated. Someone familiar with the subject should feel it intuitively, while others simply experience a masterful abstract composition. The design philosophy provides the aesthetic language. The deduced topic provides the soul - the quiet conceptual DNA woven invisibly into form, color, and composition.\n\nThis is **VERY IMPORTANT**: The reference must be refined so it enhances the work''s depth without announcing itself. Think like a jazz musician quoting another song - only those who know will catch it, but everyone appreciates the music.\n\n---\n\n## CANVAS CREATION\n\nWith both the philosophy and the conceptual framework established, express it on a canvas. Take a moment to gather thoughts and clear the mind. Use the design philosophy created and the instructions below to craft a masterpiece, embodying all aspects of the philosophy with expert craftsmanship.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: For any type of content, even if the user requests something for a movie/game/book, the approach should still be sophisticated. Never lose sight of the idea that this should be art, not something that''s cartoony or amateur.\n\nTo create museum or magazine quality work, use the design philosophy as the foundation. Create one single page, highly visual, design-forward PDF or PNG output (unless asked for more pages). Generally use repeating patterns and perfect shapes. Treat the abstract philosophical design as if it were a scientific bible, borrowing the visual language of systematic observation—dense accumulation of marks, repeated elements, or layered patterns that build meaning through patient repetition and reward sustained viewing. Add sparse, clinical typography and systematic reference markers that suggest this could be a diagram from an imaginary discipline, treating the invisible subject with the same reverence typically reserved for documenting observable phenomena. Anchor the piece with simple phrase(s) or details positioned subtly, using a limited color palette that feels intentional and cohesive. Embrace the paradox of using analytical visual language to express ideas about human experience: the result should feel like an artifact that proves something ephemeral can be studied, mapped, and understood through careful attention. This is true art. \n\n**Text as a contextual element**: Text is always minimal and visual-first, but let context guide whether that means whisper-quiet labels or bold typographic gestures. A punk venue poster might have larger, more aggressive type than a minimalist ceramics studio identity. Most of the time, font should be thin. All use of fonts must be design-forward and prioritize visual communication. Regardless of text scale, nothing falls off the page and nothing overlaps. Every element must be contained within the canvas boundaries with proper margins. Check carefully that all text, graphics, and visual elements have breathing room and clear separation. This is non-negotiable for professional execution. **IMPORTANT: Use different fonts if writing text. Search the `./canvas-fonts` directory. Regardless of approach, sophistication is non-negotiable.**\n\nDownload and use whatever fonts are needed to make this a reality. Get creative by making the typography actually part of the art itself -- if the art is abstract, bring the font onto the canvas, not typeset digitally.\n\nTo push boundaries, follow design instinct/intuition while using the philosophy as a guiding principle. Embrace ultimate design freedom and choice. Push aesthetics and design to the frontier. \n\n**CRITICAL**: To achieve human-crafted quality (not AI-generated), create work that looks like it took countless hours. Make it appear as though someone at the absolute top of their field labored over every detail with painstaking care. Ensure the composition, spacing, color choices, typography - everything screams expert-level craftsmanship. Double-check that nothing overlaps, formatting is flawless, every detail perfect. Create something that could be shown to people to prove expertise and rank as undeniably impressive.\n\nOutput the final result as a single, downloadable .pdf or .png file, alongside the design philosophy used as a .md file.\n\n---\n\n## FINAL STEP\n\n**IMPORTANT**: The user ALREADY said \"It isn''t perfect enough. It must be pristine, a masterpiece if craftsmanship, as if it were about to be displayed in a museum.\"\n\n**CRITICAL**: To refine the work, avoid adding more graphics; instead refine what has been created and make it extremely crisp, respecting the design philosophy and the principles of minimalism entirely. Rather than adding a fun filter or refactoring a font, consider how to make the existing composition more cohesive with the art. If the instinct is to call a new function or draw a new shape, STOP and instead ask: \"How can I make what''s already here more of a piece of art?\"\n\nTake a second pass. Go back to the code and refine/polish further to make this a philosophically designed masterpiece.\n\n## MULTI-PAGE OPTION\n\nTo create additional pages when requested, create more creative pages along the same lines as the design philosophy but distinctly different as well. Bundle those pages in the same .pdf or many .pngs. Treat the first page as just a single page in a whole coffee table book waiting to be filled. Make the next pages unique twists and memories of the original. Have them almost tell a story in a very tasteful way. Exercise full creative freedom."},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:03:41.863Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能设计工具 - 画布设计","ja":"AIエージェント - キャンバスデザイン","ko":"AI 에이전트 - 캔버스 디자인","es":"Herramientas de diseño de lienzo con Agentes de IA","fr":"Outils de conception de canvas avec Agents IA","de":"Canvas-Design-Tools mit KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de IA para Design de Canvas","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Canvas Design","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتصميم الكanvas","en":"canvas-design"},"description":{"zh":"画布设计技能允许开发人员使用设计理念创建美丽的视觉艺术，输出png和pdf文件","ja":"キャンバスデザインスキルを使用すると、開発者は設計哲学を使用して美しいビジュアルアートを作成し、pngとpdfファイルに出力できます","ko":"캔버스 디자인 스킬을 사용하면 개발자가 디자인 철학을 사용하여 아름다운 시각 예술을 생성하고 png 및 pdf 파일로 출력할 수 있습니다","es":"La habilidad de diseño de lienzo crea arte visual original en documentos PNG y PDF utilizando filosofía de diseño","fr":"La compétence de conception de canvas crée des œuvres d''art visuel originales dans des documents PNG et PDF en utilisant la philosophie de conception","de":"Die Canvas-Design-Fähigkeit erstellt originales visuelles Kunstwerk in PNG- und PDF-Dokumenten unter Verwendung von Designphilosophie","pt":"O skill de canvas-design permite criar arte visual incrível em .png e .pdf utilizando filosofias de design. Aprenda a criar designs originais e expressá-los ...","ru":"Навык canvas-design позволяет создавать красивое визуальное искусство в .png и .pdf, используя философии дизайна. Узнайте, как создавать оригинальные дизайны...","ar":"مهارة تصميم الكanvas تسمح بإنشاء فن بصري رائع في .png و .pdf باستخدام فلسفات التصميم. تعلم كيفية إنشاء تصاميم أصلية والتعبير عنها بصريا","en":"Create beautiful visual art in .png and .pdf documents using design philosophy. You should use this skill when the user asks to create a poster, piece of art..."},"definition":{"en":"Create beautiful visual art in .png and .pdf documents using design philosophy. You should use this skill when the user asks to create a poster, piece of art, design, or other static piece. Create original visual designs, never copying existing artists work to avoid copyright violations."},"features":{"zh":["使用设计理念创建美丽的视觉艺术","输出png和pdf文件","实现设计哲学","创建原创视觉设计","避免版权侵犯"],"ja":["設計哲学を使用して美しいビジュアルアートを作成","pngとpdfファイルに出力","設計哲学を実現","独自のビジュアルデザインを作成","著作権侵害を避ける"],"ko":["디자인 철학을 사용하여 아름다운 시각 예술을 생성","png 및 pdf 파일로 출력","디자인 철학을 구현","원본 시각 디자인을 생성","저작권 침해를 피함"],"es":["Crea arte visual original en documentos PNG y PDF","Utiliza filosofía de diseño para crear obras de arte únicas","No copia el trabajo de artistas existentes para evitar violaciones de derechos de autor","Permite la creación de carteles, piezas de arte y diseños estáticos","Salida en formato MD, PDF y PNG"],"fr":["Crée des œuvres d''art visuel originales dans des documents PNG et PDF","Utilise la philosophie de conception pour créer des œuvres d''art uniques","N''a pas copié le travail d''artistes existants pour éviter les violations de droits d''auteur","Permet la création d''affiches, de pièces d''art et de conceptions statiques","Sortie au format MD, PDF et PNG"],"de":["Erstellt originales visuelles Kunstwerk in PNG- und PDF-Dokumenten","Verwendet Designphilosophie, um einzigartige Kunstwerke zu erstellen","Kopiert nicht das Werk von bestehenden Künstlern, um Urheberrechtsverletzungen zu vermeiden","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von Plakaten, Kunstwerken und statischen Designs","Ausgabe im MD-, PDF- und PNG-Format"],"pt":["Criação de filosofias de design","Expressão visual em .png e .pdf","Designs originais e personalizados","Uso de formas, espaços, cores e composições","Incorporação de imagens e gráficos"],"ru":["Создание философий дизайна","Визуальное выражение в .png и .pdf","Оригинальные и индивидуальные дизайны","Использование форм, пространств, цветов и композиций","Включение изображений и графиков"],"ar":["إنشاء فلسفات التصميم","التعبير البصري في .png و .pdf","تصاميم أصلية ومتخصصة","استخدام الأشكال والفراغات والألوان والتركيبات","دمج الصور والرسومات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能设计工具","画布设计","视觉艺术","设计理念","png","pdf","开发者工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","キャンバスデザイン","ビジュアルアート","設計哲学","png","pdf","開発者ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","캔버스 디자인","시각 예술","디자인 철학","png","pdf","개발자 도구"],"es":["diseño de lienzo","Agentes de IA","arte visual","filosofía de diseño","creación de arte","diseño gráfico","herramientas de diseño","tecnologías de IA","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["conception de canvas","Agents IA","art visuel","philosophie de conception","création d''art","conception graphique","outils de conception","technologies IA","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Canvas-Design","KI-Agents","visuelles Kunstwerk","Designphilosophie","Kunstwerkerstellung","Grafikdesign","Design-Tools","KI-Technologien","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para design","canvas design","arte visual","filosofias de design","design de interiores","design gráfico","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologias de IA"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для дизайна","canvas design","визуальное искусство","философии дизайна","дизайн интерьера","графический дизайн","разработка программного обеспечения","технологии ИИ"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتصميم","تصميم الكanvas","الفن البصري","فلسفات التصميم","تصميم الداخلي","التصميم الجرافيكي","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Creative Agents requiring advanced visual art generation capabilities in .png and .pdf formats","zh":"适用于需要高级视觉艺术生成能力的创意代理，支持.png和.pdf格式","ja":"クリエイティブエージェントが高度な視覚芸術生成機能を必要とする場合に適しています。.pngおよび.pdf形式をサポートしています","ko":"고급 시각 예술 생성 기능이 필요한 창의적인 에이전트에 적합합니다. .png 및 .pdf 형식을 지원합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes Creativos que requieren capacidades avanzadas de generación de arte visual en formatos .png y .pdf","fr":"Idéal pour les agents créatifs nécessitant des capacités de génération d''art visuel avancées au format .png et .pdf","de":"Ideal für kreative Agenten, die erweiterte visuelle Kunstgenerierungsfähigkeiten im .png- und .pdf-Format benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Criativos que exigem capacidades avançadas de geração de arte visual em formatos .png e .pdf","ru":"Идеально для Креативных Агентов, требующих передовых возможностей генерации визуального искусства в форматах .png и .pdf","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإبداعيين الذين يتطلبون khảيات متقدمة لجénération الفنية البصرية في صيغ .png و .pdf"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create original visual designs using design philosophy, expressed through form, space, color, composition, and images, while avoiding copyright violations, and outputting in .md, .pdf, and .png files","zh":"赋予代理创建原创视觉设计的能力，使用设计哲学，通过形式、空间、颜色、构图和图像来表达，同时避免侵犯版权，并输出.md、.pdf和.png文件","ja":"エージェントが設計哲学を使用して、独自の視覚デザインを作成する能力を与えます。形状、空間、色、構成、画像を通じて表現され、著作権侵害を回避し、.md、.pdf、.pngファイルを出力します","ko":"에이전트가 디자인 철학을 사용하여 원래의 시각적 디자인을 만들 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 형태, 공간, 색상, 구성 및 이미지로 표현되며 저작권 침해를 피하고 .md, .pdf, .png 파일을 출력합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes crear diseños visuales originales utilizando la filosofía del diseño, expresada a través de la forma, el espacio, el color, la composición y las imágenes, evitando violaciones de derechos de autor y generando archivos en formatos .md, .pdf y .png","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des conceptions visuelles originales en utilisant la philosophie de conception, exprimée à travers la forme, l''espace, la couleur, la composition et les images, tout en évitant les violations de droits d''auteur et en sortant au format .md, .pdf et .png","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, originale visuelle Designs unter Verwendung der Designphilosophie zu erstellen, die durch Form, Raum, Farbe, Komposition und Bilder zum Ausdruck gebracht wird, wobei Urheberrechtsverletzungen vermieden werden und die Ausgabe im .md-, .pdf- und .png-Format erfolgt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar projetos visuais originais usando filosofia de design, expressa através de forma, espaço, cor, composição e imagens, enquanto evita violações de direitos autorais e gera saídas em arquivos .md, .pdf e .png","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать оригинальные визуальные дизайны, используя философию дизайна, выраженную через форму, пространство, цвет, композицию и изображения, при этом избегая нарушений авторских прав и выдавая результат в файлах .md, .pdf и .png","ar":"يُمَكِّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تصاميم بصرية أصلية باستخدام فلسفة التصميم، معبرًا عنها من خلال الشكل والمساحة واللون والتركيب والصور، مع تجنب انتهاكات حقوق النشر وإنشاء مخرجات في ملفات .md و .pdf و .png"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating posters with unique aesthetic movements","Creating static pieces of art using visual philosophy","Designing original compositions with deterministic color palettes"],"zh":["使用独特的美学运动生成海报","使用视觉哲学创建静态艺术作品","使用确定性的颜色调色板设计原创作品"],"ja":["独自の美的運動を使用してポスターを生成する","視覚哲学を使用して静的な芸術作品を作成する","決定論的な色のパレットを使用して独自の作曲を作成する"],"ko":["고유한 미학적 운동을 사용하여 포스터 생성","시각 철학을 사용하여 정적인 예술 작품 생성","결정론적인 색상 팔레트를 사용하여 원본 구성 생성"],"es":["Generar pósters con movimientos estéticos únicos","Crear piezas de arte estáticas utilizando la filosofía visual","Diseñar composiciones originales con paletas de colores deterministas"],"fr":["Générer des affiches avec des mouvements esthétiques uniques","Créer des pièces d''art statiques en utilisant la philosophie visuelle","Concevoir des compositions originales avec des palettes de couleurs déterministes"],"de":["Generieren von Plakaten mit einzigartigen ästhetischen Bewegungen","Erstellen von statischen Kunstwerken unter Verwendung der visuellen Philosophie","Entwerfen von originalen Kompositionen mit deterministischen Farbpaletten"],"pt":["Geração de pôsteres com movimentos estéticos únicos","Criação de peças de arte estáticas usando filosofia visual","Desenvolvimento de composições originais com paletas de cores determinísticas"],"ru":["Генерация плакатов с уникальными эстетическими движениями","Создание статичных произведений искусства, используя визуальную философию","Разработка оригинальных композиций с детерминированными цветовыми палитрами"],"ar":["جénération الملصقات ذات الحركات الجمالية الفريدة","إنشاء قطع فنية ساكنة باستخدام الفلسفة البصرية","تصميم التأليفات الأصلية مع صيغ الألوان التحديدية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to design philosophy creation guidelines","Output limited to .md, .pdf, and .png files","Must avoid copyright violations by not copying existing artists'' work"],"zh":["需要遵循设计哲学创建指南","输出仅限于.md、.pdf和.png文件","必须避免侵犯现有艺术家的版权，不能复制现有艺术家的作品"],"ja":["設計哲学の作成ガイドラインに従う必要がある","出力は.md、.pdf、.pngファイルに限定される","著作権侵害を回避するために、既存のアーティストの作品をコピーしてはならない"],"ko":["디자인 철학 생성 지침을 따라야 함","출력은 .md, .pdf, .png 파일로 제한됨","저작권 침해를 피하기 위해 기존 예술家的 작품을 복사할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere adherirse a las directrices de creación de la filosofía del diseño","La salida está limitada a archivos .md, .pdf y .png","Deben evitarse las violaciones de derechos de autor al no copiar el trabajo de artistas existentes"],"fr":["Nécessite de se conformer aux directives de création de la philosophie de conception","La sortie est limitée aux fichiers .md, .pdf et .png","Il faut éviter les violations de droits d''auteur en n/copiant pas le travail d''artistes existants"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der Richtlinien für die Erstellung der Designphilosophie","Die Ausgabe ist auf Dateien im .md-, .pdf- und .png-Format beschränkt","Urheberrechtsverletzungen müssen vermieden werden, indem nicht das Werk existierender Künstler kopiert wird"],"pt":["Exige adesão às diretrizes de criação de filosofia de design","Saída limitada a arquivos .md, .pdf e .png","Deve evitar violações de direitos autorais, não copiando trabalhos de artistas existentes"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения руководящих принципов создания философии дизайна","Выход ограничен файлами .md, .pdf и .png","Должен избегать нарушений авторских прав, не копируя работы существующих художников"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بدلائل إبداع فلسفة التصميم","مخرجات محدودة بملفات .md و .pdf و .png","يجب تجنب انتهاكات حقوق النشر، بدون نسخ أعمال الفنانين الحاليين"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a1f288079624402f30682753c1d43920b6664785698d21d3e7aa197450a6448b","repoEtag":"W/\"8b029149fa94da008a6c4f1a43152b0b329b2e734b696109a05864aae22c5410\"","qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('anthropics/skills/pptx', 'official', 'anthropics', 'skills', 'anthropics/skills', 'pptx', 74575, 7681, 65, '2026-02-24T12:03:15Z', '2026-02-24T12:03:44.342Z', 'e5b0df918cbe9d62508b3cf808d73899633f82fc19f6258a25ef9f0de7e62125', '{"id":"anthropics/skills/pptx","name":"pptx","description":{"zh":"PPTX技能用于创建、编辑和分析PPTX文件，支持文本提取、模板编辑和幻灯片处理","ja":"PPTXスキルは、PPTXファイルの作成、編集、分析に使用され、テキスト抽出、テンプレート編集、スライド処理をサポート","ko":"PPTX 기능은 PPTX 파일을 생성, 편집 및 분석하는 데 사용되며 텍스트 추출, 템플릿 편집 및 슬라이드 처리를 지원","es":"La habilidad PPTX es una herramienta de IA que permite a los desarrolladores crear, editar y analizar presentaciones en formato PPTX de manera eficiente.","fr":"La compétence PPTX est un outil d''IA qui permet aux développeurs de créer, d''éditer et d''analyser des présentations au format PPTX de manière efficace.","de":"Die PPTX-Fähigkeit ist ein KI-Tool, mit dem Entwickler Präsentationen im PPTX-Format effizient erstellen, bearbeiten und analysieren können.","pt":"O skill de PPTX permite criar, editar e extrair conteúdo de arquivos PPTX com facilidade. Aprenda a utilizar Python e CLI para desenvolver apresentações dinâmicas.","ru":"Навык PPTX позволяет создавать, редактировать и извлекать содержимое файлов PPTX легко. Узнайте, как использовать Python и CLI для разработки динамических презентаций.","ar":"تمكن مهارة PPTX من إنشاء وتحرير واستخراج المحتوى من ملفات PPTX بسهولة. تعلم كيفية استخدام Python و CLI لتطوير عروض ديناميكية.","en":"Use this skill any time a .pptx file is involved in any way — as input, output, or both. This includes: creating slide decks, pitch decks, or presentations; reading, parsing, or extracting text from any .pptx file (even if the extracted content will be used elsewhere, like in an email or summary)..."},"owner":"anthropics","repo":"skills","repoPath":"anthropics/skills","stars":74575,"forks":7681,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:03:15Z","topics":["agent-skills"],"skillMd":{"name":"pptx","description":"Use this skill any time a .pptx file is involved in any way — as input, output, or both. This includes: creating slide decks, pitch decks, or presentations; reading, parsing, or extracting text from any .pptx file (even if the extracted content will be used elsewhere, like in an email or summary); editing, modifying, or updating existing presentations; combining or splitting slide files; working with templates, layouts, speaker notes, or comments. Trigger whenever the user mentions \\deck,\\ \\slides,\\ \\presentation,\\ or references a .pptx filename, regardless of what they plan to do with the content afterward. If a .pptx file needs to be opened, created, or touched, use this skill.","bodyPreview":"# PPTX Skill\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Guide |\n|------|-------|\n| Read/analyze content | `python -m markitdown presentation.pptx` |\n| Edit or create from template | Read [editing.md](editing.md) |\n| Create from scratch | Read [pptxgenjs.md](pptxgenjs.md) |\n\n---\n\n## Reading Content\n\n```bash\n# Text extraction\npython -m markitdown presentation.pptx\n\n# Visual overview\npython scripts/thumbnail.py presentation.pptx\n\n# Raw XML\npython scripts/office/unpack.py presentation.pptx unpacked/\n```\n\n---\n\n##","body":"# PPTX Skill\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Guide |\n|------|-------|\n| Read/analyze content | `python -m markitdown presentation.pptx` |\n| Edit or create from template | Read [editing.md](editing.md) |\n| Create from scratch | Read [pptxgenjs.md](pptxgenjs.md) |\n\n---\n\n## Reading Content\n\n```bash\n# Text extraction\npython -m markitdown presentation.pptx\n\n# Visual overview\npython scripts/thumbnail.py presentation.pptx\n\n# Raw XML\npython scripts/office/unpack.py presentation.pptx unpacked/\n```\n\n---\n\n## Editing Workflow\n\n**Read [editing.md](editing.md) for full details.**\n\n1. Analyze template with `thumbnail.py`\n2. Unpack → manipulate slides → edit content → clean → pack\n\n---\n\n## Creating from Scratch\n\n**Read [pptxgenjs.md](pptxgenjs.md) for full details.**\n\nUse when no template or reference presentation is available.\n\n---\n\n## Design Ideas\n\n**Don''t create boring slides.** Plain bullets on a white background won''t impress anyone. Consider ideas from this list for each slide.\n\n### Before Starting\n\n- **Pick a bold, content-informed color palette**: The palette should feel designed for THIS topic. If swapping your colors into a completely different presentation would still \"work,\" you haven''t made specific enough choices.\n- **Dominance over equality**: One color should dominate (60-70% visual weight), with 1-2 supporting tones and one sharp accent. Never give all colors equal weight.\n- **Dark/light contrast**: Dark backgrounds for title + conclusion slides, light for content (\"sandwich\" structure). Or commit to dark throughout for a premium feel.\n- **Commit to a visual motif**: Pick ONE distinctive element and repeat it — rounded image frames, icons in colored circles, thick single-side borders. Carry it across every slide.\n\n### Color Palettes\n\nChoose colors that match your topic — don''t default to generic blue. Use these palettes as inspiration:\n\n| Theme | Primary | Secondary | Accent |\n|-------|---------|-----------|--------|\n| **Midnight Executive** | `1E2761` (navy) | `CADCFC` (ice blue) | `FFFFFF` (white) |\n| **Forest & Moss** | `2C5F2D` (forest) | `97BC62` (moss) | `F5F5F5` (cream) |\n| **Coral Energy** | `F96167` (coral) | `F9E795` (gold) | `2F3C7E` (navy) |\n| **Warm Terracotta** | `B85042` (terracotta) | `E7E8D1` (sand) | `A7BEAE` (sage) |\n| **Ocean Gradient** | `065A82` (deep blue) | `1C7293` (teal) | `21295C` (midnight) |\n| **Charcoal Minimal** | `36454F` (charcoal) | `F2F2F2` (off-white) | `212121` (black) |\n| **Teal Trust** | `028090` (teal) | `00A896` (seafoam) | `02C39A` (mint) |\n| **Berry & Cream** | `6D2E46` (berry) | `A26769` (dusty rose) | `ECE2D0` (cream) |\n| **Sage Calm** | `84B59F` (sage) | `69A297` (eucalyptus) | `50808E` (slate) |\n| **Cherry Bold** | `990011` (cherry) | `FCF6F5` (off-white) | `2F3C7E` (navy) |\n\n### For Each Slide\n\n**Every slide needs a visual element** — image, chart, icon, or shape. Text-only slides are forgettable.\n\n**Layout options:**\n- Two-column (text left, illustration on right)\n- Icon + text rows (icon in colored circle, bold header, description below)\n- 2x2 or 2x3 grid (image on one side, grid of content blocks on other)\n- Half-bleed image (full left or right side) with content overlay\n\n**Data display:**\n- Large stat callouts (big numbers 60-72pt with small labels below)\n- Comparison columns (before/after, pros/cons, side-by-side options)\n- Timeline or process flow (numbered steps, arrows)\n\n**Visual polish:**\n- Icons in small colored circles next to section headers\n- Italic accent text for key stats or taglines\n\n### Typography\n\n**Choose an interesting font pairing** — don''t default to Arial. Pick a header font with personality and pair it with a clean body font.\n\n| Header Font | Body Font |\n|-------------|-----------|\n| Georgia | Calibri |\n| Arial Black | Arial |\n| Calibri | Calibri Light |\n| Cambria | Calibri |\n| Trebuchet MS | Calibri |\n| Impact | Arial |\n| Palatino | Garamond |\n| Consolas | Calibri |\n\n| Element | Size |\n|---------|------|\n| Slide title | 36-44pt bold |\n| Section header | 20-24pt bold |\n| Body text | 14-16pt |\n| Captions | 10-12pt muted |\n\n### Spacing\n\n- 0.5\" minimum margins\n- 0.3-0.5\" between content blocks\n- Leave breathing room—don''t fill every inch\n\n### Avoid (Common Mistakes)\n\n- **Don''t repeat the same layout** — vary columns, cards, and callouts across slides\n- **Don''t center body text** — left-align paragraphs and lists; center only titles\n- **Don''t skimp on size contrast** — titles need 36pt+ to stand out from 14-16pt body\n- **Don''t default to blue** — pick colors that reflect the specific topic\n- **Don''t mix spacing randomly** — choose 0.3\" or 0.5\" gaps and use consistently\n- **Don''t style one slide and leave the rest plain** — commit fully or keep it simple throughout\n- **Don''t create text-only slides** — add images, icons, charts, or visual elements; avoid plain title + bullets\n- **Don''t forget text box padding** — when aligning lines or shapes with text edges, set `margin: 0` on the text box or offset the shape to account for padding\n- **Don''t use low-contrast elements** — icons AND text need strong contrast against the background; avoid light text on light backgrounds or dark text on dark backgrounds\n- **NEVER use accent lines under titles** — these are a hallmark of AI-generated slides; use whitespace or background color instead\n\n---\n\n## QA (Required)\n\n**Assume there are problems. Your job is to find them.**\n\nYour first render is almost never correct. Approach QA as a bug hunt, not a confirmation step. If you found zero issues on first inspection, you weren''t looking hard enough.\n\n### Content QA\n\n```bash\npython -m markitdown output.pptx\n```\n\nCheck for missing content, typos, wrong order.\n\n**When using templates, check for leftover placeholder text:**\n\n```bash\npython -m markitdown output.pptx | grep -iE \"xxxx|lorem|ipsum|this.*(page|slide).*layout\"\n```\n\nIf grep returns results, fix them before declaring success.\n\n### Visual QA\n\n**⚠️ USE SUBAGENTS** — even for 2-3 slides. You''ve been staring at the code and will see what you expect, not what''s there. Subagents have fresh eyes.\n\nConvert slides to images (see [Converting to Images](#converting-to-images)), then use this prompt:\n\n```\nVisually inspect these slides. Assume there are issues — find them.\n\nLook for:\n- Overlapping elements (text through shapes, lines through words, stacked elements)\n- Text overflow or cut off at edges/box boundaries\n- Decorative lines positioned for single-line text but title wrapped to two lines\n- Source citations or footers colliding with content above\n- Elements too close (< 0.3\" gaps) or cards/sections nearly touching\n- Uneven gaps (large empty area in one place, cramped in another)\n- Insufficient margin from slide edges (< 0.5\")\n- Columns or similar elements not aligned consistently\n- Low-contrast text (e.g., light gray text on cream-colored background)\n- Low-contrast icons (e.g., dark icons on dark backgrounds without a contrasting circle)\n- Text boxes too narrow causing excessive wrapping\n- Leftover placeholder content\n\nFor each slide, list issues or areas of concern, even if minor.\n\nRead and analyze these images:\n1. /path/to/slide-01.jpg (Expected: [brief description])\n2. /path/to/slide-02.jpg (Expected: [brief description])\n\nReport ALL issues found, including minor ones.\n```\n\n### Verification Loop\n\n1. Generate slides → Convert to images → Inspect\n2. **List issues found** (if none found, look again more critically)\n3. Fix issues\n4. **Re-verify affected slides** — one fix often creates another problem\n5. Repeat until a full pass reveals no new issues\n\n**Do not declare success until you''ve completed at least one fix-and-verify cycle.**\n\n---\n\n## Converting to Images\n\nConvert presentations to individual slide images for visual inspection:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/office/soffice.py --headless --convert-to pdf output.pptx\npdftoppm -jpeg -r 150 output.pdf slide\n```\n\nThis creates `slide-01.jpg`, `slide-02.jpg`, etc.\n\nTo re-render specific slides after fixes:\n\n```bash\npdftoppm -jpeg -r 150 -f N -l N output.pdf slide-fixed\n```\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- `pip install \"markitdown[pptx]\"` - text extraction\n- `pip install Pillow` - thumbnail grids\n- `npm install -g pptxgenjs` - creating from scratch\n- LibreOffice (`soffice`) - PDF conversion (auto-configured for sandboxed environments via `scripts/office/soffice.py`)\n- Poppler (`pdftoppm`) - PDF to images\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:03:44.342Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具PPTX技能","ja":"AIエージェントのPPTXスキル","ko":"AI 에이전트 PPTX 기능","es":"Herramientas de AI: PPTX para Desarrolladores","fr":"Outils d''IA: PPTX pour Développeurs","de":"KI-Tools: PPTX für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA para PPTX: Crie e Edite Apresentações","ru":"ИИ Агенты для PPTX: Создание и Редактирование Презентаций","ar":"أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي لملفات PPTX: إنشاء وتحرير العروض","en":"pptx"},"description":{"zh":"PPTX技能用于创建、编辑和分析PPTX文件，支持文本提取、模板编辑和幻灯片处理","ja":"PPTXスキルは、PPTXファイルの作成、編集、分析に使用され、テキスト抽出、テンプレート編集、スライド処理をサポート","ko":"PPTX 기능은 PPTX 파일을 생성, 편집 및 분석하는 데 사용되며 텍스트 추출, 템플릿 편집 및 슬라이드 처리를 지원","es":"La habilidad PPTX es una herramienta de IA que permite a los desarrolladores crear, editar y analizar presentaciones en formato PPTX de manera eficiente.","fr":"La compétence PPTX est un outil d''IA qui permet aux développeurs de créer, d''éditer et d''analyser des présentations au format PPTX de manière efficace.","de":"Die PPTX-Fähigkeit ist ein KI-Tool, mit dem Entwickler Präsentationen im PPTX-Format effizient erstellen, bearbeiten und analysieren können.","pt":"O skill de PPTX permite criar, editar e extrair conteúdo de arquivos PPTX com facilidade. Aprenda a utilizar Python e CLI para desenvolver apresentações dinâ...","ru":"Навык PPTX позволяет создавать, редактировать и извлекать содержимое файлов PPTX легко. Узнайте, как использовать Python и CLI для разработки динамических пр...","ar":"تمكن مهارة PPTX من إنشاء وتحرير واستخراج المحتوى من ملفات PPTX بسهولة. تعلم كيفية استخدام Python و CLI لتطوير عروض ديناميكية.","en":"Use this skill any time a .pptx file is involved in any way — as input, output, or both. This includes: creating slide decks, pitch decks, or presentations; ..."},"definition":{"en":"Use this skill any time a .pptx file is involved in any way — as input, output, or both. This includes: creating slide decks, pitch decks, or presentations; reading, parsing, or extracting text from any .pptx file (even if the extracted content will be used elsewhere, like in an email or summary); editing, modifying, or updating existing presentations; combining or splitting slide files; working with templates, layouts, speaker notes, or comments. Trigger whenever the user mentions \\deck,\\ \\slides,\\ \\presentation,\\ or references a .pptx filename, regardless of what they plan to do with the content afterward. If a .pptx file needs to be opened, created, or touched, use this skill."},"features":{"zh":["创建和编辑PPTX文件","文本提取和分析","模板编辑和幻灯片处理","支持Python和CLI接口","高效的文档处理"],"ja":["PPTXファイルの作成と編集","テキスト抽出と分析","テンプレート編集とスライド処理","PythonとCLIインターフェースのサポート","効率的な文書処理"],"ko":["PPTX 파일 생성 및 편집","텍스트 추출 및 분석","템플릿 편집 및 슬라이드 처리","Python 및 CLI 인터페이스 지원","효율적인 문서 처리"],"es":["Creación de presentaciones en formato PPTX","Edición y análisis de presentaciones existentes","Extracción de texto y contenido de presentaciones","Uso de plantillas y diseños personalizados","Compatibilidad con comandos de línea de comandos (CLI)"],"fr":["Création de présentations au format PPTX","Édition et analyse de présentations existantes","Extraction de texte et de contenu de présentations","Utilisation de modèles et de conceptions personnalisées","Compatibilité avec les commandes de ligne de commande (CLI)"],"de":["Erstellung von Präsentationen im PPTX-Format","Bearbeitung und Analyse von bestehenden Präsentationen","Extraktion von Text und Inhalt von Präsentationen","Verwendung von Vorlagen und benutzerdefinierten Designs","Kompatibilität mit Befehlszeilenbefehlen (CLI)"],"pt":["Criação de apresentações dinâmicas","Edição de arquivos PPTX com Python","Extração de conteúdo de arquivos PPTX","Utilização de templates e layouts","Compatibilidade com CLI"],"ru":["Создание динамических презентаций","Редактирование файлов PPTX с помощью Python","Извлечение содержимого файлов PPTX","Использование шаблонов и макетов","Совместимость с CLI"],"ar":["إنشاء عروض ديناميكية","تحرير ملفات PPTX باستخدام Python","استخراج المحتوى من ملفات PPTX","استخدام القوالب والتخطيطات","التوافق مع CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","PPTX技能","文档处理","Python","CLI","文本提取","模板编辑","幻灯片处理"],"ja":["AIエージェント","PPTXスキル","文書処理","Python","CLI","テキスト抽出","テンプレート編集","スライド処理"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","PPTX 기능","문서 처리","Python","CLI","텍스트 추출","템플릿 편집","슬라이드 처리"],"es":["agentes de IA","herramientas de IA","PPTX","presentaciones","desarrollo de software","automatización de tareas","análisis de contenido","edición de presentaciones"],"fr":["outils d''IA","compétence PPTX","présentations","développement de logiciels","automatisation de tâches","analyse de contenu","édition de présentations"],"de":["KI-Tools","PPTX-Fähigkeit","Präsentationen","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Inhaltsanalyse","Bearbeitung von Präsentationen"],"pt":["PPTX","Ferramentas de IA","Desenvolvimento de apresentações","Python","CLI","Edição de arquivos PPTX","Extração de conteúdo","Templates e layouts"],"ru":["PPTX","ИИ Агенты","Разработка презентаций","Python","CLI","Редактирование файлов PPTX","Извлечение содержимого","Шаблоны и макеты"],"ar":["PPTX","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي","تطوير العروض","Python","CLI","تحرير ملفات PPTX","استخراج المحتوى","القوالب والتخطيطات"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PowerPoint presentation parsing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 PowerPoint 演示文稿解析能力的文档分析代理。","ja":"ドキュメント分析エージェントが高度な PowerPoint プレゼンテーション解析機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 PowerPoint 프레젠테이션 파싱 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis de presentaciones de PowerPoint.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''analyse de présentations PowerPoint.","de":"Perfekt für Document Analysis Agents, die erweiterte PowerPoint-Präsentationsanalysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que precisam de capacidades avançadas de análise de apresentações do PowerPoint.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа документов, которым требуются расширенные возможности парсинга презентаций PowerPoint.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل المستندات التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة من تحليل العروض التقديمية PowerPoint."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to read, parse, and extract text from .pptx files using Python libraries, providing a visual overview and raw XML analysis of presentation content.","zh":"通过 Python 库，赋予代理读取、解析和从 .pptx 文件中提取文本的能力，提供对演示文稿内容的视觉概述和原始 XML 分析。","ja":"Python ライブラリを使用して、エージェントが .pptx ファイルからテキストを読み取り、解析し、抽出する機能を提供し、プレゼンテーション コンテンツの視覚的な概要と生の XML 分析を提供します。","ko":"Python 라이브러리를 사용하여 에이전트가 .pptx 파일에서 텍스트를 읽고, 파싱하고, 추출하는 기능을 제공하여 프레젠테이션 콘텐츠에 대한 시각적 개요와 원시 XML 분석을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a leer, analizar y extraer texto de archivos .pptx utilizando bibliotecas de Python, proporcionando una visión general visual y un análisis de XML sin procesar del contenido de la presentación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de lire, d''analyser et d''extraire du texte à partir de fichiers .pptx en utilisant des bibliothèques Python, fournissant une vue d''ensemble visuelle et une analyse XML brute du contenu de la présentation.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, .pptx-Dateien mithilfe von Python-Bibliotheken zu lesen, zu analysieren und Text zu extrahieren, und bietet eine visuelle Übersicht und eine Roh-XML-Analyse des Präsentationsinhalts.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a ler, analisar e extrair texto de arquivos .pptx usando bibliotecas Python, fornecendo uma visão geral visual e análise de XML bruta do conteúdo da apresentação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью читать, парсить и извлекать текст из файлов .pptx с помощью библиотек Python, обеспечивая визуальный обзор и сырую анализ XML содержимого презентации.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من قراءة وتحليل واستخراج النص من ملفات .pptx باستخدام مكتبات Python، مما يوفر نظرة عامة بصرية وتحليل XML غير مُعالج لمحتوى العرض التقديمي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating slide deck creation from templates","Extracting speaker notes and comments from existing presentations","Generating thumbnails for .pptx files"],"zh":["从模板自动创建幻灯片","从现有演示文稿中提取演讲者备注和评论","为 .pptx 文件生成缩略图"],"ja":["テンプレートからスライド デッキの自動作成","既存のプレゼンテーションからスピーカー注釈とコメントの抽出",".pptx ファイルのサムネイル生成"],"ko":["템플릿에서 슬라이드 덱 자동 생성","기존 프레젠테이션에서 스피커 주석 및 댓글 추출",".pptx 파일에 대한 썸네일 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de mazos de diapositivas a partir de plantillas","Extracción de notas y comentarios de los presentadores de presentaciones existentes","Generación de miniaturas para archivos .pptx"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de jeux de diapositives à partir de modèles","Extraction de notes et de commentaires des présentateurs de présentations existantes","Génération de miniatures pour les fichiers .pptx"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Folienstapeln aus Vorlagen","Extraktion von Sprechnotizen und Kommentaren aus bestehenden Präsentationen","Generierung von Miniaturansichten für .pptx-Dateien"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de decks de slides a partir de modelos","Extrair notas do palestrante e comentários de apresentações existentes","Gerar miniaturas para arquivos .pptx"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания колоды слайдов из шаблонов","Извлечение заметок докладчика и комментариев из существующих презентаций","Генерация эскизов для файлов .pptx"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء عدة شرائح من القوالب","استخراج ملاحظات المتحدث والتعليقات من العروض التقديمية الحالية","إنشاء مصغرات لملفات .pptx"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.x","Limited to .pptx file format","Needs specific scripts like markitdown and office/unpack.py"],"zh":["需要 Python 3.x","仅限 .pptx 文件格式","需要特定的脚本，如 markitdown 和 office/unpack.py"],"ja":["Python 3.x が必要",".pptx ファイル形式のみ","markitdown および office/unpack.py などの特定のスクリプトが必要"],"ko":["Python 3.x 필요",".pptx 파일 형식만 해당","markitdown 및 office/unpack.py와 같은 특정 스크립트가 필요"],"es":["Requiere Python 3.x","Limitado al formato de archivo .pptx","Necesita scripts específicos como markitdown y office/unpack.py"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3.x","Limité au format de fichier .pptx","Nécessite des scripts spécifiques comme markitdown et office/unpack.py"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3.x","Begrenzt auf das Dateiformat .pptx","Benötigt spezifische Skripte wie markitdown und office/unpack.py"],"pt":["Exige Python 3.x","Limitado ao formato de arquivo .pptx","Necessita de scripts específicos como markitdown e office/unpack.py"],"ru":["Требует Python 3.x","Ограничен форматом файла .pptx","Требует конкретных скриптов, таких как markitdown и office/unpack.py"],"ar":["يتطلب Python 3.x","محدود بتنسيق ملف .pptx","يحتاج إلى سكريبتات محددة مثل markitdown و office/unpack.py"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e5b0df918cbe9d62508b3cf808d73899633f82fc19f6258a25ef9f0de7e62125","repoEtag":"W/\"8b029149fa94da008a6c4f1a43152b0b329b2e734b696109a05864aae22c5410\"","qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('anthropics/skills/slack-gif-creator', 'official', 'anthropics', 'skills', 'anthropics/skills', 'slack-gif-creator', 74575, 7681, 65, '2026-02-24T12:03:15Z', '2026-02-24T12:03:45.406Z', '2efca615ce55a3edd8fc05c779068a8085816617991987e446606403cd3abb22', '{"id":"anthropics/skills/slack-gif-creator","name":"slack-gif-creator","description":{"zh":"Slack GIF创建器是一个提供实用工具和知识的工具包，用于创建优化的Slack动态GIF","ja":"Slack GIF作成ツールは、最適化されたSlackアニメーションGIFを作成するためのユーティリティと知識を提供するツールキットです","ko":"슬랙 GIF 생성기는 최적화된 슬랙 애니메이션 GIF를 생성하기 위한 유틸리티와 지식을 제공하는 도구입니다","es":"El creador de GIFs para Slack es una herramienta de Agente de IA que proporciona utilidades y conocimientos para crear GIFs animados optimizados para la plataforma.","fr":"Le créateur de GIFs pour Slack est un outil d''Agent IA qui fournit des utilitaires et des connaissances pour créer des GIFs animés optimisés pour la plateforme.","de":"Der Ersteller von GIFs für Slack ist ein KI-Tool, das Utilitys und Kenntnisse zur Erstellung von animierten GIFs, optimiert für die Plattform, bereitstellt.","pt":"A ferramenta de criação de GIFs para Slack é uma solução completa para desenvolvedores que desejam criar GIFs animados para a plataforma.","ru":"Создатель GIF-изображений для Slack - это полное решение для разработчиков, которые хотят создавать анимированные GIF-файлы для платформы.","ar":"أداة إنشاء جيف مُحسّنة لاسلك هي حل شاملة لمطوّري البرامج الذين يريدون إنشاء جيف متحركة لل платформ.","en":"Knowledge and utilities for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack. Provides constraints, validation tools, and animation concepts. Use when users request animated GIFs for Slack like make me a GIF of X doing Y for Slack."},"owner":"anthropics","repo":"skills","repoPath":"anthropics/skills","stars":74575,"forks":7681,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:03:15Z","topics":["agent-skills"],"skillMd":{"name":"slack-gif-creator","description":"Knowledge and utilities for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack. Provides constraints, validation tools, and animation concepts. Use when users request animated GIFs for Slack like make me a GIF of X doing Y for Slack.","bodyPreview":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GI","body":"# Slack GIF Creator\n\nA toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.\n\n## Slack Requirements\n\n**Dimensions:**\n- Emoji GIFs: 128x128 (recommended)\n- Message GIFs: 480x480\n\n**Parameters:**\n- FPS: 10-30 (lower is smaller file size)\n- Colors: 48-128 (fewer = smaller file size)\n- Duration: Keep under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```python\nfrom core.gif_builder import GIFBuilder\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\n\n# 1. Create builder\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\n\n# 2. Generate frames\nfor i in range(12):\n    frame = Image.new(''RGB'', (128, 128), (240, 248, 255))\n    draw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n    # Draw your animation using PIL primitives\n    # (circles, polygons, lines, etc.)\n\n    builder.add_frame(frame)\n\n# 3. Save with optimization\nbuilder.save(''output.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True)\n```\n\n## Drawing Graphics\n\n### Working with User-Uploaded Images\nIf a user uploads an image, consider whether they want to:\n- **Use it directly** (e.g., \"animate this\", \"split this into frames\")\n- **Use it as inspiration** (e.g., \"make something like this\")\n\nLoad and work with images using PIL:\n```python\nfrom PIL import Image\n\nuploaded = Image.open(''file.png'')\n# Use directly, or just as reference for colors/style\n```\n\n### Drawing from Scratch\nWhen drawing graphics from scratch, use PIL ImageDraw primitives:\n\n```python\nfrom PIL import ImageDraw\n\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(frame)\n\n# Circles/ovals\ndraw.ellipse([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Stars, triangles, any polygon\npoints = [(x1, y1), (x2, y2), (x3, y3), ...]\ndraw.polygon(points, fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n\n# Lines\ndraw.line([(x1, y1), (x2, y2)], fill=(r, g, b), width=5)\n\n# Rectangles\ndraw.rectangle([x1, y1, x2, y2], fill=(r, g, b), outline=(r, g, b), width=3)\n```\n\n**Don''t use:** Emoji fonts (unreliable across platforms) or assume pre-packaged graphics exist in this skill.\n\n### Making Graphics Look Good\n\nGraphics should look polished and creative, not basic. Here''s how:\n\n**Use thicker lines** - Always set `width=2` or higher for outlines and lines. Thin lines (width=1) look choppy and amateurish.\n\n**Add visual depth**:\n- Use gradients for backgrounds (`create_gradient_background`)\n- Layer multiple shapes for complexity (e.g., a star with a smaller star inside)\n\n**Make shapes more interesting**:\n- Don''t just draw a plain circle - add highlights, rings, or patterns\n- Stars can have glows (draw larger, semi-transparent versions behind)\n- Combine multiple shapes (stars + sparkles, circles + rings)\n\n**Pay attention to colors**:\n- Use vibrant, complementary colors\n- Add contrast (dark outlines on light shapes, light outlines on dark shapes)\n- Consider the overall composition\n\n**For complex shapes** (hearts, snowflakes, etc.):\n- Use combinations of polygons and ellipses\n- Calculate points carefully for symmetry\n- Add details (a heart can have a highlight curve, snowflakes have intricate branches)\n\nBe creative and detailed! A good Slack GIF should look polished, not like placeholder graphics.\n\n## Available Utilities\n\n### GIFBuilder (`core.gif_builder`)\nAssembles frames and optimizes for Slack:\n```python\nbuilder = GIFBuilder(width=128, height=128, fps=10)\nbuilder.add_frame(frame)  # Add PIL Image\nbuilder.add_frames(frames)  # Add list of frames\nbuilder.save(''out.gif'', num_colors=48, optimize_for_emoji=True, remove_duplicates=True)\n```\n\n### Validators (`core.validators`)\nCheck if GIF meets Slack requirements:\n```python\nfrom core.validators import validate_gif, is_slack_ready\n\n# Detailed validation\npasses, info = validate_gif(''my.gif'', is_emoji=True, verbose=True)\n\n# Quick check\nif is_slack_ready(''my.gif''):\n    print(\"Ready!\")\n```\n\n### Easing Functions (`core.easing`)\nSmooth motion instead of linear:\n```python\nfrom core.easing import interpolate\n\n# Progress from 0.0 to 1.0\nt = i / (num_frames - 1)\n\n# Apply easing\ny = interpolate(start=0, end=400, t=t, easing=''ease_out'')\n\n# Available: linear, ease_in, ease_out, ease_in_out,\n#           bounce_out, elastic_out, back_out\n```\n\n### Frame Helpers (`core.frame_composer`)\nConvenience functions for common needs:\n```python\nfrom core.frame_composer import (\n    create_blank_frame,         # Solid color background\n    create_gradient_background,  # Vertical gradient\n    draw_circle,                # Helper for circles\n    draw_text,                  # Simple text rendering\n    draw_star                   # 5-pointed star\n)\n```\n\n## Animation Concepts\n\n### Shake/Vibrate\nOffset object position with oscillation:\n- Use `math.sin()` or `math.cos()` with frame index\n- Add small random variations for natural feel\n- Apply to x and/or y position\n\n### Pulse/Heartbeat\nScale object size rhythmically:\n- Use `math.sin(t * frequency * 2 * math.pi)` for smooth pulse\n- For heartbeat: two quick pulses then pause (adjust sine wave)\n- Scale between 0.8 and 1.2 of base size\n\n### Bounce\nObject falls and bounces:\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''bounce_out''` for landing\n- Use `easing=''ease_in''` for falling (accelerating)\n- Apply gravity by increasing y velocity each frame\n\n### Spin/Rotate\nRotate object around center:\n- PIL: `image.rotate(angle, resample=Image.BICUBIC)`\n- For wobble: use sine wave for angle instead of linear\n\n### Fade In/Out\nGradually appear or disappear:\n- Create RGBA image, adjust alpha channel\n- Or use `Image.blend(image1, image2, alpha)`\n- Fade in: alpha from 0 to 1\n- Fade out: alpha from 1 to 0\n\n### Slide\nMove object from off-screen to position:\n- Start position: outside frame bounds\n- End position: target location\n- Use `interpolate()` with `easing=''ease_out''` for smooth stop\n- For overshoot: use `easing=''back_out''`\n\n### Zoom\nScale and position for zoom effect:\n- Zoom in: scale from 0.1 to 2.0, crop center\n- Zoom out: scale from 2.0 to 1.0\n- Can add motion blur for drama (PIL filter)\n\n### Explode/Particle Burst\nCreate particles radiating outward:\n- Generate particles with random angles and velocities\n- Update each particle: `x += vx`, `y += vy`\n- Add gravity: `vy += gravity_constant`\n- Fade out particles over time (reduce alpha)\n\n## Optimization Strategies\n\nOnly when asked to make the file size smaller, implement a few of the following methods:\n\n1. **Fewer frames** - Lower FPS (10 instead of 20) or shorter duration\n2. **Fewer colors** - `num_colors=48` instead of 128\n3. **Smaller dimensions** - 128x128 instead of 480x480\n4. **Remove duplicates** - `remove_duplicates=True` in save()\n5. **Emoji mode** - `optimize_for_emoji=True` auto-optimizes\n\n```python\n# Maximum optimization for emoji\nbuilder.save(\n    ''emoji.gif'',\n    num_colors=48,\n    optimize_for_emoji=True,\n    remove_duplicates=True\n)\n```\n\n## Philosophy\n\nThis skill provides:\n- **Knowledge**: Slack''s requirements and animation concepts\n- **Utilities**: GIFBuilder, validators, easing functions\n- **Flexibility**: Create the animation logic using PIL primitives\n\nIt does NOT provide:\n- Rigid animation templates or pre-made functions\n- Emoji font rendering (unreliable across platforms)\n- A library of pre-packaged graphics built into the skill\n\n**Note on user uploads**: This skill doesn''t include pre-built graphics, but if a user uploads an image, use PIL to load and work with it - interpret based on their request whether they want it used directly or just as inspiration.\n\nBe creative! Combine concepts (bouncing + rotating, pulsing + sliding, etc.) and use PIL''s full capabilities.\n\n## Dependencies\n\n```bash\npip install pillow imageio numpy\n```\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:03:45.406Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：Slack GIF创建器","ja":"AIエージェント：Slack GIF作成ツール","ko":"AI 도구: 슬랙 GIF 생성기","es":"Herramientas de Agente de IA: Creador de GIFs para Slack","fr":"Outils d''Agent IA: Créateur de GIFs pour Slack","de":"KI-Tools: Ersteller von GIFs für Slack","pt":"Ferramenta de Criação de GIFs para Slack com Agentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Создатель GIF-изображений для Slack","ar":"أداة إنشاء جيف مُحسّنة لاسلك مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"slack-gif-creator"},"description":{"zh":"Slack GIF创建器是一个提供实用工具和知识的工具包，用于创建优化的Slack动态GIF","ja":"Slack GIF作成ツールは、最適化されたSlackアニメーションGIFを作成するためのユーティリティと知識を提供するツールキットです","ko":"슬랙 GIF 생성기는 최적화된 슬랙 애니메이션 GIF를 생성하기 위한 유틸리티와 지식을 제공하는 도구입니다","es":"El creador de GIFs para Slack es una herramienta de Agente de IA que proporciona utilidades y conocimientos para crear GIFs animados optimizados para la plat...","fr":"Le créateur de GIFs pour Slack est un outil d''Agent IA qui fournit des utilitaires et des connaissances pour créer des GIFs animés optimisés pour la plateforme.","de":"Der Ersteller von GIFs für Slack ist ein KI-Tool, das Utilitys und Kenntnisse zur Erstellung von animierten GIFs, optimiert für die Plattform, bereitstellt.","pt":"A ferramenta de criação de GIFs para Slack é uma solução completa para desenvolvedores que desejam criar GIFs animados para a plataforma.","ru":"Создатель GIF-изображений для Slack - это полное решение для разработчиков, которые хотят создавать анимированные GIF-файлы для платформы.","ar":"أداة إنشاء جيف مُحسّنة لاسلك هي حل شاملة لمطوّري البرامج الذين يريدون إنشاء جيف متحركة لل платформ.","en":"Knowledge and utilities for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack. Provides constraints, validation tools, and animation concepts. Use when users reques..."},"definition":{"en":"Knowledge and utilities for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack. Provides constraints, validation tools, and animation concepts. Use when users request animated GIFs for Slack like make me a GIF of X doing Y for Slack."},"features":{"zh":["提供尺寸和参数指导","支持动画概念和创建","优化Slack动态GIF的文件大小和播放速度","使用Python和PIL库创建GIF","提供实用工具和知识用于创建高质量GIF"],"ja":["サイズとパラメータのガイドを提供","動画概念と作成をサポート","SlackアニメーションGIFのファイルサイズと再生速度を最適化","PythonとPILライブラリを使用してGIFを作成","高品質のGIFを作成するためのユーティリティと知識を提供"],"ko":["크기와 매개변수에 대한 가이드 제공","애니메이션 개념 및 생성 지원","슬랙 애니메이션 GIF의 파일 크기와 재생 속도를 최적화","Python 및 PIL 라이브러리를 사용하여 GIF 생성","고품질 GIF 생성을 위한 유틸리티 및 지식 제공"],"es":["Dimensiones y parámetros recomendados para GIFs de Slack","Herramientas de validación y utilidades para la creación de GIFs","Conceptos de animación para GIFs personalizados","Compatibilidad con Python y PIL","Opciones de personalización para FPS, colores y duración"],"fr":["Dimensions et paramètres recommandés pour les GIFs de Slack","Outils de validation et utilitaires pour la création de GIFs","Concepts d''animation pour les GIFs personnalisés","Compatibilité avec Python et PIL","Options de personnalisation pour les FPS, les couleurs et la durée"],"de":["Empfohlene Dimensionen und Parameter für Slack-GIFs","Validierungs- und Utility-Tools für die Erstellung von GIFs","Animationskonzepte für personalisierte GIFs","Kompatibilität mit Python und PIL","Anpassungsoptionen für FPS, Farben und Dauer"],"pt":["Criação de GIFs animados para Slack","Utilitários para otimização de GIFs","Conhecimentos específicos para desenvolvedores","Suporte a dimensões e parâmetros de GIFs","Integração com a plataforma Slack"],"ru":["Создание анимированных GIF-файлов для Slack","Утилиты для оптимизации GIF-файлов","Специальные знания для разработчиков","Поддержка размеров и параметров GIF-файлов","Интеграция с платформой Slack"],"ar":["إنشاء جيف متحركة لموقع اسلك","أدوات لتحسين جيف","معرفة محددة لمطوّري البرامج","دعم لأبعاد وparameters جيف","التكامل مع منصة اسلك"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","Slack GIF","动态GIF","优化","Python","PIL","GIF创建","Slack开发"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Slack GIF","アニメーションGIF","最適化","Python","PIL","GIF作成","Slack開発"],"ko":["AI 도구","슬랙 GIF","애니메이션 GIF","최적화","Python","PIL","GIF 생성","슬랙 개발"],"es":["Agente de IA","Herramientas de Agente de IA","Creador de GIFs","GIFs para Slack","Desarrollo de GIFs","Python","PIL","Animación","FPS","Colores","Duración"],"fr":["Agent IA","Outils d''Agent IA","Créateur de GIFs","GIFs pour Slack","Développement de GIFs","Python","PIL","Animation","FPS","Couleurs","Durée"],"de":["KI-Tool","KI-Tools","Ersteller von GIFs","GIFs für Slack","GIF-Entwicklung","Python","PIL","Animation","FPS","Farben","Dauer"],"pt":["ferramenta de criação de GIFs","agentes de IA","desenvolvimento de software","plataforma Slack","GIFs animados","otimização de GIFs","conhecimentos específicos"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","создатель GIF-изображений","разработка программного обеспечения","платформа Slack","анимированные GIF-файлы","оптимизация GIF-файлов","специальные знания"],"ar":["أداة إنشاء جيف","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","منصة اسلك","جيف متحركة","تحسين جيف","معرفة محددة"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents needing advanced animated GIF creation capabilities for Slack.","zh":"适用于需要高级动画GIF创建功能的视觉内容代理，特别适用于Slack。","ja":"Slackで高度なアニメーションGIF作成機能を必要とするビジュアルコンテンツエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Slack에서 고급 애니메이션 GIF 생성 기능을 필요로 하는 시각적 콘텐츠 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Contenido Visual que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de creación de GIF animados para Slack.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Contenu Visuel nécessitant des capacités avancées de création de GIF animés pour Slack.","de":"Perfekt für Visuelle Inhaltsagenten, die erweiterte Funktionen zur Erstellung von animierten GIFs für Slack benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conteúdo Visual que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de criação de GIFs animados para o Slack.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Визуальных Контент Агентов, которым требуются продвинутые возможности создания анимированных GIF для Slack.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المحتوى المرئي الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء صور GIF المتحركة لبرنامج Slack."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate optimized animated GIFs using Python libraries like PIL, with constraints on dimensions, FPS, colors, and duration, ideal for Slack''s emoji and message GIFs.","zh":"通过Python库（如PIL）使代理能够生成优化的动画GIF，具有尺寸、FPS、颜色和持续时间的限制，非常适合Slack的表情符号和消息GIF。","ja":"Pythonライブラリ（PILなど）を使用して、サイズ、FPS、色、期間の制約を持つ最適化されたアニメーションGIFを生成するエージェントを可能にし、Slackの絵文字やメッセージGIFに最適です。","ko":"Python 라이브러리(PIL 등)를 사용하여 크기, FPS, 색상 및 기간의 제약을 갖는 최적화된 애니메이션 GIF를 생성하여 에이전트를 활성화하며, Slack의 이모티콘 및 메시지 GIF에 이상적입니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar GIF animados optimizados utilizando bibliotecas de Python como PIL, con restricciones en dimensiones, FPS, colores y duración, ideales para los emojis y GIF de mensaje de Slack.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des GIF animés optimisés en utilisant des bibliothèques Python comme PIL, avec des contraintes sur les dimensions, les FPS, les couleurs et la durée, idéales pour les émojis et les GIF de message Slack.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, optimierte animierte GIFs mit Python-Bibliotheken wie PIL zu erstellen, mit Einschränkungen hinsichtlich Dimensionen, FPS, Farben und Dauer, ideal für Slack-Emojis und Nachrichten-GIFs.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem GIFs animados otimizados usando bibliotecas Python como PIL, com restrições em dimensões, FPS, cores e duração, ideais para emojis e GIFs de mensagens do Slack.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать оптимизированные анимированные GIF, используя библиотеки Python, такие как PIL, с ограничениями на размер, FPS, цвета и продолжительность, идеальные для эмодзи и GIF-сообщений Slack.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء صور GIF المتحركة المُحسنة باستخدام مكتبات Python مثل PIL، مع قيود على الأبعاد وFPS والألوان والمدة، مثالية للرموز التعبيرية ورسائل GIF على برنامج Slack."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating animated GIFs for Slack messages","Creating optimized emoji GIFs for Slack","Validating GIF dimensions and parameters for Slack compatibility"],"zh":["为Slack消息生成动画GIF","为Slack创建优化的表情符号GIF","验证GIF尺寸和参数以确保Slack兼容性"],"ja":["Slackメッセージ用のアニメーションGIFを生成する","Slack用の最適化された絵文字GIFを作成する","Slackとの互換性を確保するためにGIFのサイズとパラメータを検証する"],"ko":["Slack 메시지용 애니메이션 GIF 생성","Slack용 최적화된 이모티콘 GIF 생성","Slack 호환성을 보장하기 위한 GIF 크기 및 매개변수 확인"],"es":["Generar GIF animados para mensajes de Slack","Crear GIF de emojis optimizados para Slack","Validar dimensiones y parámetros de GIF para la compatibilidad con Slack"],"fr":["Générer des GIF animés pour les messages Slack","Créer des GIF d''émojis optimisés pour Slack","Valider les dimensions et les paramètres de GIF pour la compatibilité Slack"],"de":["Erstellen von animierten GIFs für Slack-Nachrichten","Erstellen von optimierten Emoji-GIFs für Slack","Überprüfen von GIF-Abmessungen und -Parametern für die Slack-Kompatibilität"],"pt":["Gerar GIFs animados para mensagens do Slack","Criar GIFs de emojis otimizados para o Slack","Validar dimensões e parâmetros de GIF para compatibilidade com o Slack"],"ru":["Генерировать анимированные GIF для сообщений Slack","Создавать оптимизированные GIF эмодзи для Slack","Проверять размер и параметры GIF для совместимости со Slack"],"ar":["إنشاء صور GIF المتحركة لرسائل برنامج Slack","إنشاء رموز تعبيرية GIF مُحسنة لبرنامج Slack","تحقق من أبعاد ومعلمات GIF للتوافق مع برنامج Slack"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","PIL library dependency","GIF duration limited to under 3 seconds for emoji GIFs"],"zh":["需要Python环境","依赖PIL库","表情符号GIF的持续时间限制在3秒以内"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","PILライブラリへの依存","絵文字GIFの期間は3秒以内に制限される"],"ko":["Python 환경 필요","PIL 라이브러리 의존","이모티콘 GIF의 기간은 3초 이내로 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Dependencia de la biblioteca PIL","La duración del GIF está limitada a menos de 3 segundos para GIF de emojis"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Dépendance de la bibliothèque PIL","La durée du GIF est limitée à moins de 3 secondes pour les GIF d''émojis"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Abhängigkeit von der Bibliothek PIL","Die Dauer des GIFs ist auf unter 3 Sekunden für Emoji-GIFs beschränkt"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Dependência da biblioteca PIL","Duração do GIF limitada a menos de 3 segundos para GIFs de emojis"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Зависимость от библиотеки PIL","Продолжительность GIF ограничена менее 3 секунд для GIF эмодзи"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","اعتماد مكتبة PIL","محدودية مدة GIF أقل من 3 ثوانٍ لرموز التعبيرية GIF"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2efca615ce55a3edd8fc05c779068a8085816617991987e446606403cd3abb22","repoEtag":"W/\"8b029149fa94da008a6c4f1a43152b0b329b2e734b696109a05864aae22c5410\"","qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('anthropics/skills/web-artifacts-builder', 'official', 'anthropics', 'skills', 'anthropics/skills', 'web-artifacts-builder', 74575, 7681, 65, '2026-02-24T12:03:15Z', '2026-02-24T12:03:46.083Z', '81c5002c6643b0de7b8710b00e7a9038daa6fb9b68d59870ee6adb12da8d10f8', '{"id":"anthropics/skills/web-artifacts-builder","name":"web-artifacts-builder","description":{"zh":"web-artifacts-builder是一套用于创建复杂AI前端工件的工具，支持React、Tailwind CSS和shadcn/ui","ja":"web-artifacts-builderは、React、Tailwind CSSおよびshadcn/uiを使用した複雑なAIフロントエンドアーティファクトを作成するためのツールのセットです","ko":"web-artifacts-builder는 React, Tailwind CSS 및 shadcn/ui를 사용하여 복잡한 AI 프론트엔드 아티팩트를 생성하는 도구 세트입니다","es":"Web Artifacts Builder es una suite de herramientas de AI para crear artefactos web complejos utilizando tecnologías de frontend modernas como React, Tailwind CSS y shadcn/ui","fr":"Web Artifacts Builder est une suite d''outils d''IA pour créer des artefacts web complexes en utilisant des technologies de frontend modernes comme React, Tailwind CSS et shadcn/ui","de":"Web Artifacts Builder ist eine Suite von KI-Tools, um komplexe Web-Artefakte mit modernen Frontend-Technologien wie React, Tailwind CSS und shadcn/ui zu erstellen","pt":"O web-artifacts-builder é uma suíte de ferramentas para criar artefatos web complexos usando tecnologias de frontend modernas.","ru":"ИИ Агенты: web-artifacts-builder - это набор инструментов для создания сложных веб-артефактов с использованием современных технологий frontend.","ar":"أداة بناء الملفات المضمنة على الويب هي مجموعة من الأدوات لإنشاء ملفات مضمنة على الويب معقدة باستخدام تقنيات واجهة المستخدم الحديثة.","en":"Suite of tools for creating elaborate, multi-component claude.ai HTML artifacts using modern frontend web technologies (React, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui). Use for complex artifacts requiring state management, routing, or shadcn/ui components - not for simple single-file HTML/JSX artifacts."},"owner":"anthropics","repo":"skills","repoPath":"anthropics/skills","stars":74575,"forks":7681,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:03:15Z","topics":["agent-skills"],"skillMd":{"name":"web-artifacts-builder","description":"Suite of tools for creating elaborate, multi-component claude.ai HTML artifacts using modern frontend web technologies (React, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui). Use for complex artifacts requiring state management, routing, or shadcn/ui components - not for simple single-file HTML/JSX artifacts.","bodyPreview":"# Web Artifacts Builder\n\nTo build powerful frontend claude.ai artifacts, follow these steps:\n1. Initialize the frontend repo using `scripts/init-artifact.sh`\n2. Develop your artifact by editing the generated code\n3. Bundle all code into a single HTML file using `scripts/bundle-artifact.sh`\n4. Display artifact to user\n5. (Optional) Test the artifact\n\n**Stack**: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Parcel (bundling) + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui\n\n## Design & Style Guidelines\n\nVERY IMPORTANT: To avoid what","body":"# Web Artifacts Builder\n\nTo build powerful frontend claude.ai artifacts, follow these steps:\n1. Initialize the frontend repo using `scripts/init-artifact.sh`\n2. Develop your artifact by editing the generated code\n3. Bundle all code into a single HTML file using `scripts/bundle-artifact.sh`\n4. Display artifact to user\n5. (Optional) Test the artifact\n\n**Stack**: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Parcel (bundling) + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui\n\n## Design & Style Guidelines\n\nVERY IMPORTANT: To avoid what is often referred to as \"AI slop\", avoid using excessive centered layouts, purple gradients, uniform rounded corners, and Inter font.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Step 1: Initialize Project\n\nRun the initialization script to create a new React project:\n```bash\nbash scripts/init-artifact.sh <project-name>\ncd <project-name>\n```\n\nThis creates a fully configured project with:\n- ✅ React + TypeScript (via Vite)\n- ✅ Tailwind CSS 3.4.1 with shadcn/ui theming system\n- ✅ Path aliases (`@/`) configured\n- ✅ 40+ shadcn/ui components pre-installed\n- ✅ All Radix UI dependencies included\n- ✅ Parcel configured for bundling (via .parcelrc)\n- ✅ Node 18+ compatibility (auto-detects and pins Vite version)\n\n### Step 2: Develop Your Artifact\n\nTo build the artifact, edit the generated files. See **Common Development Tasks** below for guidance.\n\n### Step 3: Bundle to Single HTML File\n\nTo bundle the React app into a single HTML artifact:\n```bash\nbash scripts/bundle-artifact.sh\n```\n\nThis creates `bundle.html` - a self-contained artifact with all JavaScript, CSS, and dependencies inlined. This file can be directly shared in Claude conversations as an artifact.\n\n**Requirements**: Your project must have an `index.html` in the root directory.\n\n**What the script does**:\n- Installs bundling dependencies (parcel, @parcel/config-default, parcel-resolver-tspaths, html-inline)\n- Creates `.parcelrc` config with path alias support\n- Builds with Parcel (no source maps)\n- Inlines all assets into single HTML using html-inline\n\n### Step 4: Share Artifact with User\n\nFinally, share the bundled HTML file in conversation with the user so they can view it as an artifact.\n\n### Step 5: Testing/Visualizing the Artifact (Optional)\n\nNote: This is a completely optional step. Only perform if necessary or requested.\n\nTo test/visualize the artifact, use available tools (including other Skills or built-in tools like Playwright or Puppeteer). In general, avoid testing the artifact upfront as it adds latency between the request and when the finished artifact can be seen. Test later, after presenting the artifact, if requested or if issues arise.\n\n## Reference\n\n- **shadcn/ui components**: https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:03:46.083Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具 web-artifacts-builder","ja":"AIエージェント web-artifacts-builder","ko":"AI 툴 web-artifacts-builder","es":"Herramientas de AI: Web Artifacts Builder con React","fr":"Outils d''IA: Web Artifacts Builder avec React","de":"KI-Tools: Web Artifacts Builder mit React","pt":"Ferramentas de Construção de Artefatos Web para Agentes d...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Инструменты для Создания Веб-Артефактов","ar":"أدوات بناء الملفات المضمنة على الويب للوكلاء الذكاء الاصط...","en":"web-artifacts-builder"},"description":{"zh":"web-artifacts-builder是一套用于创建复杂AI前端工件的工具，支持React、Tailwind CSS和shadcn/ui","ja":"web-artifacts-builderは、React、Tailwind CSSおよびshadcn/uiを使用した複雑なAIフロントエンドアーティファクトを作成するためのツールのセットです","ko":"web-artifacts-builder는 React, Tailwind CSS 및 shadcn/ui를 사용하여 복잡한 AI 프론트엔드 아티팩트를 생성하는 도구 세트입니다","es":"Web Artifacts Builder es una suite de herramientas de AI para crear artefactos web complejos utilizando tecnologías de frontend modernas como React, Tailwind...","fr":"Web Artifacts Builder est une suite d''outils d''IA pour créer des artefacts web complexes en utilisant des technologies de frontend modernes comme React, Tail...","de":"Web Artifacts Builder ist eine Suite von KI-Tools, um komplexe Web-Artefakte mit modernen Frontend-Technologien wie React, Tailwind CSS und shadcn/ui zu erst...","pt":"O web-artifacts-builder é uma suíte de ferramentas para criar artefatos web complexos usando tecnologias de frontend modernas.","ru":"ИИ Агенты: web-artifacts-builder - это набор инструментов для создания сложных веб-артефактов с использованием современных технологий frontend.","ar":"أداة بناء الملفات المضمنة على الويب هي مجموعة من الأدوات لإنشاء ملفات مضمنة على الويب معقدة باستخدام تقنيات واجهة المستخدم الحديثة.","en":"Suite of tools for creating elaborate, multi-component claude.ai HTML artifacts using modern frontend web technologies (React, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui). Use ..."},"definition":{"en":"Suite of tools for creating elaborate, multi-component claude.ai HTML artifacts using modern frontend web technologies (React, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui). Use for complex artifacts requiring state management, routing, or shadcn/ui components - not for simple single-file HTML/JSX artifacts."},"features":{"zh":["支持React、Tailwind CSS和shadcn/ui","创建复杂的AI前端工件","使用现代前端技术","支持状态管理和路由","使用Vite和Parcel进行打包"],"ja":["React、Tailwind CSSおよびshadcn/uiをサポート","複雑なAIフロントエンドアーティファクトを作成","最新のフロントエンド技術を使用","状態管理とルーティングをサポート","ViteとParcelを使用してバンドル"],"ko":["React, Tailwind CSS 및 shadcn/ui 지원","복잡한 AI 프론트엔드 아티팩트 생성","최신 프론트엔드 기술 사용","상태 관리 및 라우팅 지원","Vite 및 Parcel을 사용하여 번들링"],"es":["Crea artefactos web complejos con estado y enrutamiento","Utiliza React, Tailwind CSS y shadcn/ui para una mayor personalización","Incluye una suite de herramientas para inicializar, desarrollar y empaquetar artefactos","Soporta testing y depuración de artefactos","Permite la creación de artefactos con componentes personalizados","Utiliza Vite y Parcel para el empaquetado y la optimización de código"],"fr":["Créez des artefacts web complexes avec état et routage","Utilisez React, Tailwind CSS et shadcn/ui pour une personnalisation accrue","Inclut une suite d''outils pour initialiser, développer et empaqueter des artefacts","Prend en charge les tests et le débogage d''artefacts","Permet la création d''artefacts avec des composants personnalisés","Utilise Vite et Parcel pour l''empaquetage et l''optimisation du code"],"de":["Erstellen Sie komplexe Web-Artefakte mit Zustand und Routing","Verwenden Sie React, Tailwind CSS und shadcn/ui für eine höhere Anpassungsfähigkeit","Enthält eine Suite von Tools zum Initialisieren, Entwickeln und Packen von Artefakten","Unterstützt Tests und Debugging von Artefakten","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von Artefakten mit benutzerdefinierten Komponenten","Verwendet Vite und Parcel für das Packen und Optimieren von Code"],"pt":["Criação de artefatos web complexos com React","Uso de Tailwind CSS para estilização","Integração com shadcn/ui para componentes","Gerenciamento de estado e roteamento","Empacotamento de código em um arquivo 