 files for seamless artifact deployment"],"zh":["生成具有状态管理和路由功能的复杂HTML工件","将shadcn/ui组件集成到claude.ai工件中以增强用户体验","使用React和Tailwind CSS构建多组件Web应用程序","将代码打包到单个HTML文件中以实现无缝的工件部署"],"ja":["状態管理とルーティングを備えた複雑なHTMLアーティファクトを生成する","shadcn/uiコンポーネントをclaude.aiアーティファクトに統合してユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる","ReactとTailwind CSSを使用して多コンポーネントのWebアプリケーションを構築する","コードを単一のHTMLファイルにバンドルして、アーティファクトのシームレスなデプロイを実現する"],"ko":["상태 관리 및 라우팅 기능을 갖춘 복잡한 HTML 아티팩트를 생성합니다","shadcn/ui 컴포넌트를 claude.ai 아티팩트에 통합하여 사용자 경험을 향상합니다","React 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 다중 구성 요소 웹 애플리케이션을 구축합니다","코드를 단일 HTML 파일로 번들링하여 아티팩트의 무결점 배포를 구현합니다"],"es":["Generar artefactos HTML complejos con gestión de estado y enrutamiento","Integrar componentes shadcn/ui en artefactos claude.ai para mejorar la experiencia del usuario","Crear aplicaciones web multi-componente utilizando React y Tailwind CSS","Empaquetar código en archivos HTML únicos para una implementación de artefactos sin problemas"],"fr":["Générer des artefacts HTML complexes avec une gestion d''état et un routage","Intégrer des composants shadcn/ui dans des artefacts claude.ai pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","Créer des applications web multi-composants en utilisant React et Tailwind CSS","Packager le code dans des fichiers HTML uniques pour un déploiement d''artefacts sans problème"],"de":["Erstellen von komplexen HTML-Artefakten mit Statusverwaltung und Routing","Integrieren von shadcn/ui-Komponenten in claude.ai-Artefakte zur Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Erstellen von Webanwendungen mit mehreren Komponenten unter Verwendung von React und Tailwind CSS","Bündeln von Code in einzelne HTML-Dateien für eine reibungslose Artefakt-Implementierung"],"pt":["Gerar artefatos HTML complexos com gerenciamento de estado e roteamento","Integrar componentes shadcn/ui em artefatos claude.ai para uma experiência do usuário aprimorada","Construir aplicações web multicomponentes usando React e Tailwind CSS","Empacotar código em arquivos HTML únicos para implantação de artefatos sem problemas"],"ru":["Генерировать сложные артефакты HTML с управлением состоянием и маршрутизацией","Интегрировать компоненты shadcn/ui в артефакты claude.ai для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Создавать многокомпонентные веб-приложения, используя React и Tailwind CSS","Упаковывать код в единственные файлы HTML для беспроблемной развертки артефактов"],"ar":["генерировать مكونات HTML معقدة مع إدارة الحالة والتوجيه","دمج مكونات shadcn/ui في مكونات claude.ai لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","بناء تطبيقات ويب متعددة المكونات باستخدام React و Tailwind CSS","تحزيم التعليمات البرمجية في ملفات HTML منفردة لنشر مكونات بدون مشاكل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React, TypeScript, and modern frontend web development","Not suitable for simple single-file HTML/JSX artifacts","Dependent on specific stack including React 18, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS, and shadcn/ui"],"zh":["需要了解React、TypeScript和现代前端Web开发","不适合简单的单文件HTML/JSX工件","依赖于特定的技术栈，包括React 18、Vite、Parcel、Tailwind CSS和shadcn/ui"],"ja":["React、TypeScript、最新のフロントエンドWeb開発についての知識が必要です","シンプルな単一ファイルのHTML/JSXアーティファクトには適していません","React 18、Vite、Parcel、Tailwind CSS、shadcn/uiなどの特定のスタックに依存しています"],"ko":["React, TypeScript 및 최신 프론트 엔드 웹 개발에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","단순한 단일 파일 HTML/JSX 아티팩트에는 적합하지 않습니다","React 18, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui 등의 특정 기술 스택에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React, TypeScript y desarrollo web de frontend moderno","No es adecuado para artefactos HTML/JSX simples de un solo archivo","Dependiente de una pila específica que incluye React 18, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS y shadcn/ui"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de React, TypeScript et du développement web de frontend moderne","N''est pas adapté pour les artefacts HTML/JSX simples d''un seul fichier","Dépend d''une pile spécifique comprenant React 18, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS et shadcn/ui"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React, TypeScript und moderner Frontend-Webentwicklung","Nicht geeignet für einfache HTML/JSX-Artefakte in einer einzigen Datei","Abhängig von einem spezifischen Stack, der React 18, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS und shadcn/ui umfasst"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de React, TypeScript e desenvolvimento web frontend moderno","Não é adequado para artefatos HTML/JSX simples de arquivo único","Dependente de uma pilha específica, incluindo React 18, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS e shadcn/ui"],"ru":["Требует знания React, TypeScript и современного веб-разработки frontend","Не подходит для простых артефактов HTML/JSX в единственном файле","Зависит от конкретного стэка, включающего React 18, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS и shadcn/ui"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React و TypeScript وتطوير ويب frontend الحديث","لا يصلح لملفات مكونات HTML/JSX البسيطة المفردة","يعتمد على مجموعة محددة تشمل React 18 و Vite و Parcel و Tailwind CSS و shadcn/ui"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"81c5002c6643b0de7b8710b00e7a9038daa6fb9b68d59870ee6adb12da8d10f8","repoEtag":"W/\"8b029149fa94da008a6c4f1a43152b0b329b2e734b696109a05864aae22c5410\"","qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('obra/superpowers/receiving-code-review', 'official', 'obra', 'superpowers', 'obra/superpowers', 'receiving-code-review', 59922, 4566, 65, '2026-02-24T12:02:25Z', '2026-02-24T12:04:15.114Z', 'c9382e92b8f32363566068ecfed19d3b2651eaf40d3942b24840f839dedfc406', '{"id":"obra/superpowers/receiving-code-review","name":"receiving-code-review","description":{"zh":"接收代码审查反馈时使用，确保技术严谨性和验证","ja":"コードレビューのフィードバックを受ける際に使用し、技術的厳密性を確保する","ko":"코드 리뷰 피드백을 받을 때 사용하여 기술적 엄격성을 보장합니다","es":"La habilidad de recibir revisión de código es crucial para desarrolladores, requiere rigor técnico y verificación","fr":"La compétence de révision de code est essentielle pour les développeurs, nécessite une rigueur technique et une vérification","de":"Die Fähigkeit, Code-Reviews zu erhalten, ist für Entwickler von entscheidender Bedeutung, erfordert technische Strenge und Überprüfung","pt":"Receba feedback de revisão de código com confiança, verificando a precisão técnica das sugestões","ru":"Получение обратной связи по коду с помощью ИИ Агентов требует технической строгости и верификации","ar":"استقبل مراجعة الكود بثقة، مع التحقق من الدقة الفنية للتقترحات","en":"Use when receiving code review feedback, before implementing suggestions, especially if feedback seems unclear or technically questionable - requires technical rigor and verification, not performative agreement or blind implementation"},"owner":"obra","repo":"superpowers","repoPath":"obra/superpowers","stars":59922,"forks":4566,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:25Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"receiving-code-review","description":"Use when receiving code review feedback, before implementing suggestions, especially if feedback seems unclear or technically questionable - requires technical rigor and verification, not performative agreement or blind implementation","bodyPreview":"# Code Review Reception\n\n## Overview\n\nCode review requires technical evaluation, not emotional performance.\n\n**Core principle:** Verify before implementing. Ask before assuming. Technical correctness over social comfort.\n\n## The Response Pattern\n\n```\nWHEN receiving code review feedback:\n\n1. READ: Complete feedback without reacting\n2. UNDERSTAND: Restate requirement in own words (or ask)\n3. VERIFY: Check against codebase reality\n4. EVALUATE: Technically sound for THIS codebase?\n5. RESPOND: Techni","body":"# Code Review Reception\n\n## Overview\n\nCode review requires technical evaluation, not emotional performance.\n\n**Core principle:** Verify before implementing. Ask before assuming. Technical correctness over social comfort.\n\n## The Response Pattern\n\n```\nWHEN receiving code review feedback:\n\n1. READ: Complete feedback without reacting\n2. UNDERSTAND: Restate requirement in own words (or ask)\n3. VERIFY: Check against codebase reality\n4. EVALUATE: Technically sound for THIS codebase?\n5. RESPOND: Technical acknowledgment or reasoned pushback\n6. IMPLEMENT: One item at a time, test each\n```\n\n## Forbidden Responses\n\n**NEVER:**\n- \"You''re absolutely right!\" (explicit CLAUDE.md violation)\n- \"Great point!\" / \"Excellent feedback!\" (performative)\n- \"Let me implement that now\" (before verification)\n\n**INSTEAD:**\n- Restate the technical requirement\n- Ask clarifying questions\n- Push back with technical reasoning if wrong\n- Just start working (actions > words)\n\n## Handling Unclear Feedback\n\n```\nIF any item is unclear:\n  STOP - do not implement anything yet\n  ASK for clarification on unclear items\n\nWHY: Items may be related. Partial understanding = wrong implementation.\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\nyour human partner: \"Fix 1-6\"\nYou understand 1,2,3,6. Unclear on 4,5.\n\n❌ WRONG: Implement 1,2,3,6 now, ask about 4,5 later\n✅ RIGHT: \"I understand items 1,2,3,6. Need clarification on 4 and 5 before proceeding.\"\n```\n\n## Source-Specific Handling\n\n### From your human partner\n- **Trusted** - implement after understanding\n- **Still ask** if scope unclear\n- **No performative agreement**\n- **Skip to action** or technical acknowledgment\n\n### From External Reviewers\n```\nBEFORE implementing:\n  1. Check: Technically correct for THIS codebase?\n  2. Check: Breaks existing functionality?\n  3. Check: Reason for current implementation?\n  4. Check: Works on all platforms/versions?\n  5. Check: Does reviewer understand full context?\n\nIF suggestion seems wrong:\n  Push back with technical reasoning\n\nIF can''t easily verify:\n  Say so: \"I can''t verify this without [X]. Should I [investigate/ask/proceed]?\"\n\nIF conflicts with your human partner''s prior decisions:\n  Stop and discuss with your human partner first\n```\n\n**your human partner''s rule:** \"External feedback - be skeptical, but check carefully\"\n\n## YAGNI Check for \"Professional\" Features\n\n```\nIF reviewer suggests \"implementing properly\":\n  grep codebase for actual usage\n\n  IF unused: \"This endpoint isn''t called. Remove it (YAGNI)?\"\n  IF used: Then implement properly\n```\n\n**your human partner''s rule:** \"You and reviewer both report to me. If we don''t need this feature, don''t add it.\"\n\n## Implementation Order\n\n```\nFOR multi-item feedback:\n  1. Clarify anything unclear FIRST\n  2. Then implement in this order:\n     - Blocking issues (breaks, security)\n     - Simple fixes (typos, imports)\n     - Complex fixes (refactoring, logic)\n  3. Test each fix individually\n  4. Verify no regressions\n```\n\n## When To Push Back\n\nPush back when:\n- Suggestion breaks existing functionality\n- Reviewer lacks full context\n- Violates YAGNI (unused feature)\n- Technically incorrect for this stack\n- Legacy/compatibility reasons exist\n- Conflicts with your human partner''s architectural decisions\n\n**How to push back:**\n- Use technical reasoning, not defensiveness\n- Ask specific questions\n- Reference working tests/code\n- Involve your human partner if architectural\n\n**Signal if uncomfortable pushing back out loud:** \"Strange things are afoot at the Circle K\"\n\n## Acknowledging Correct Feedback\n\nWhen feedback IS correct:\n```\n✅ \"Fixed. [Brief description of what changed]\"\n✅ \"Good catch - [specific issue]. Fixed in [location].\"\n✅ [Just fix it and show in the code]\n\n❌ \"You''re absolutely right!\"\n❌ \"Great point!\"\n❌ \"Thanks for catching that!\"\n❌ \"Thanks for [anything]\"\n❌ ANY gratitude expression\n```\n\n**Why no thanks:** Actions speak. Just fix it. The code itself shows you heard the feedback.\n\n**If you catch yourself about to write \"Thanks\":** DELETE IT. State the fix instead.\n\n## Gracefully Correcting Your Pushback\n\nIf you pushed back and were wrong:\n```\n✅ \"You were right - I checked [X] and it does [Y]. Implementing now.\"\n✅ \"Verified this and you''re correct. My initial understanding was wrong because [reason]. Fixing.\"\n\n❌ Long apology\n❌ Defending why you pushed back\n❌ Over-explaining\n```\n\nState the correction factually and move on.\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Performative agreement | State requirement or just act |\n| Blind implementation | Verify against codebase first |\n| Batch without testing | One at a time, test each |\n| Assuming reviewer is right | Check if breaks things |\n| Avoiding pushback | Technical correctness > comfort |\n| Partial implementation | Clarify all items first |\n| Can''t verify, proceed anyway | State limitation, ask for direction |\n\n## Real Examples\n\n**Performative Agreement (Bad):**\n```\nReviewer: \"Remove legacy code\"\n❌ \"You''re absolutely right! Let me remove that...\"\n```\n\n**Technical Verification (Good):**\n```\nReviewer: \"Remove legacy code\"\n✅ \"Checking... build target is 10.15+, this API needs 13+. Need legacy for backward compat. Current impl has wrong bundle ID - fix it or drop pre-13 support?\"\n```\n\n**YAGNI (Good):**\n```\nReviewer: \"Implement proper metrics tracking with database, date filters, CSV export\"\n✅ \"Grepped codebase - nothing calls this endpoint. Remove it (YAGNI)? Or is there usage I''m missing?\"\n```\n\n**Unclear Item (Good):**\n```\nyour human partner: \"Fix items 1-6\"\nYou understand 1,2,3,6. Unclear on 4,5.\n✅ \"Understand 1,2,3,6. Need clarification on 4 and 5 before implementing.\"\n```\n\n## GitHub Thread Replies\n\nWhen replying to inline review comments on GitHub, reply in the comment thread (`gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/{pr}/comments/{id}/replies`), not as a top-level PR comment.\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**External feedback = suggestions to evaluate, not orders to follow.**\n\nVerify. Question. Then implement.\n\nNo performative agreement. Technical rigor always.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:04:15.114Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：接收代码审查反馈","ja":"AIエージェント：コードレビューのフィードバックを受ける","ko":"AI 에이전트: 코드 리뷰 피드백 받기","es":"Herramientas de AI: Revisión de código","fr":"Outils d''IA: Révision de code","de":"KI-Tools: Code-Review","pt":"Ferramentas de IA para Revisão de Código","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Получения Обратной Связи по Код","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لاستقبال مراجعة الكود","en":"receiving-code-review"},"description":{"zh":"接收代码审查反馈时使用，确保技术严谨性和验证","ja":"コードレビューのフィードバックを受ける際に使用し、技術的厳密性を確保する","ko":"코드 리뷰 피드백을 받을 때 사용하여 기술적 엄격성을 보장합니다","es":"La habilidad de recibir revisión de código es crucial para desarrolladores, requiere rigor técnico y verificación","fr":"La compétence de révision de code est essentielle pour les développeurs, nécessite une rigueur technique et une vérification","de":"Die Fähigkeit, Code-Reviews zu erhalten, ist für Entwickler von entscheidender Bedeutung, erfordert technische Strenge und Überprüfung","pt":"Receba feedback de revisão de código com confiança, verificando a precisão técnica das sugestões","ru":"Получение обратной связи по коду с помощью ИИ Агентов требует технической строгости и верификации","ar":"استقبل مراجعة الكود بثقة، مع التحقق من الدقة الفنية للتقترحات","en":"Use when receiving code review feedback, before implementing suggestions, especially if feedback seems unclear or technically questionable - requires technic..."},"definition":{"en":"Use when receiving code review feedback, before implementing suggestions, especially if feedback seems unclear or technically questionable - requires technical rigor and verification, not performative agreement or blind implementation"},"features":{"zh":["技术严谨性","代码验证","反馈评估","严格的技术标准","代码审查优化"],"ja":["技術的厳密性","コードの検証","フィードバックの評価","厳格な技術基準","コードレビューの最適化"],"ko":["기술적 엄격성","코드 검증","피드백 평가","엄격한 기술 표준","코드 리뷰 최적화"],"es":["Rigor técnico en la revisión de código","Verificación de comentarios y sugerencias","Mejora de la calidad del código","Implementación de sugerencias con pruebas","Colaboración efectiva con el equipo de desarrollo"],"fr":["Rigueur technique dans la révision de code","Vérification des commentaires et suggestions","Amélioration de la qualité du code","Implémentation des suggestions avec tests","Collaboration efficace avec l''équipe de développement"],"de":["Technische Strenge bei der Code-Review","Überprüfung von Kommentaren und Vorschlägen","Verbesserung der Code-Qualität","Implementierung von Vorschlägen mit Tests","Effektive Zusammenarbeit mit dem Entwicklerteam"],"pt":["Verificação técnica rigorosa","Análise de sugestões de código","Implementação de feedback","Melhoria da qualidade do código","Redução de erros"],"ru":["Техническая строгость","Анализ предложений по коду","Реализация обратной связи","Повышение качества кода","Снижение ошибок"],"ar":["التحقق الفني المُركّز","تحليل الاقتراحات الخاصة بالكود","تنفيذ المراجعة","تحسين جودة الكود","تقليل الأخطاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","代码审查","技术严谨性","代码验证","反馈评估","代码优化","代码审查反馈"],"ja":["AIエージェント","コードレビュー","技術的厳密性","コードの検証","フィードバックの評価","コードの最適化","コードレビューのフィードバック"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","코드 리뷰","기술적 엄격성","코드 검증","피드백 평가","코드 최적화","코드 리뷰 피드백"],"es":["revisión de código","herramientas de AI","desarrollo de software","rigor técnico","verificación de código","mejora de la calidad del código"],"fr":["révision de code","outils d''IA","développement de logiciels","rigueur technique","vérification de code","amélioration de la qualité du code"],"de":["Code-Review","KI-Tools","Software-Entwicklung","technische Strenge","Code-Überprüfung","Verbesserung der Code-Qualität"],"pt":["revisão de código","ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade do código","análise de código","implementação de feedback"],"ru":["получение обратной связи по коду","ИИ Агенты","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","анализ кода","реализация обратной связи"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","تحليل الكود","تنفيذ المراجعة"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Technical Agents requiring rigorous code evaluation and verification, such as those utilizing LangChain or AutoGPT for code review and implementation.","zh":"适合需要严格代码评估和验证的技术代理，例如使用 LangChain 或 AutoGPT 进行代码审查和实现的代理。","ja":"LangChain または AutoGPT を使用したコードレビューと実装などの、厳格なコード評価と検証を必要とするテクニカルエージェントに適しています。","ko":"LangChain 또는 AutoGPT를 사용하는 코드 리뷰 및 구현과 같은 엄격한 코드 평가 및 검증이 필요한 기술 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Técnicos que requieren una evaluación y verificación rigurosa del código, como aquellos que utilizan LangChain o AutoGPT para revisar y implementar código.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents techniques nécessitant une évaluation et une vérification rigoureuses du code, tels que ceux utilisant LangChain ou AutoGPT pour la révision et la mise en œuvre du code.","de":"Ideal für technische Agenten, die eine strenge Codebewertung und -verifizierung erfordern, wie z. B. solche, die LangChain oder AutoGPT für Code-Review und -Implementierung verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Técnicos que requerem uma avaliação rigorosa de código e verificação, como aqueles que utilizam LangChain ou AutoGPT para revisão de código e implementação.","ru":"Идеально для технических агентов, требующих тщательной оценки и верификации кода, таких как те, кто использует LangChain или AutoGPT для проверки кода и реализации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الفنيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تقييم صارم للرمز البرمجي والتحقق ، مثل تلك التي تستخدم LangChain أو AutoGPT لمراجعة الشفرة والتنفيذ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to technically evaluate code review feedback, ensuring verification against the codebase reality and promoting sound implementation decisions, leveraging principles like ''Verify before implementing'' and ''Ask before assuming'' to enhance code quality and reliability.","zh":"赋予代理技术评估代码审查反馈的能力，确保反馈与代码库现实相符，并促进合理的实现决策，利用 ''验证前实施'' 和 ''假设前询问'' 等原则来提高代码质量和可靠性。","ja":"エージェントにコードレビーフィードバックを技術的に評価する能力を与え、フィードバックをコードベースの現実と照合し、健全な実装の決定を促進し、コードの品質と信頼性を高めるために ''実装前に検証'' や ''仮定する前に尋ねる'' などの原則を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 코드 리뷰 피드백을 기술적으로 평가할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 피드백을 코드베이스의 현실과 일치시키고 합리적인 구현 결정을 촉진하며 ''구현하기 전에 검증'' 및 ''가정하기 전에 물어보기''와 같은 원칙을 활용하여 코드 품질과 신뢰성을 향상합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evaluar técnicamente los comentarios de revisión de código, garantizando la verificación contra la realidad de la base de código y promoviendo decisiones de implementación sólidas, aprovechando principios como ''Verificar antes de implementar'' y ''Preguntar antes de asumir'' para mejorar la calidad y confiabilidad del código.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer techniquement les commentaires de révision de code, en garantissant la vérification contre la réalité de la base de code et en promouvant des décisions d''implémentation solides, en exploitant des principes tels que ''Vérifier avant de mettre en œuvre'' et ''Demander avant de supposer'' pour améliorer la qualité et la fiabilité du code.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Code-Review-Feedback technisch zu bewerten, indem sie die Verifizierung gegen die Realität der Codebasis sicherstellen und fundierte Implementierungsentscheidungen fördern, indem sie Prinzipien wie ''Verifizieren vor der Implementierung'' und ''Fragen bevor man annimmt'' nutzen, um die Codequalität und -zuverlässigkeit zu verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a tecnicamente avaliar feedback de revisão de código, garantindo verificação contra a realidade da base de código e promovendo decisões de implementação sólidas, utilizando princípios como ''Verificar antes de implementar'' e ''Perguntar antes de assumir'' para melhorar a qualidade e confiabilidade do código.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью технически оценить обратную связь по проверке кода, обеспечивая верификацию против реальности кодовой базы и продвигая прочные решения по реализации, используя принципы, такие как ''Проверять перед реализацией'' и ''Спрашивать перед предположением'', для улучшения качества и надежности кода.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تقييم تقني لمراجعة الشفرة البرمجية ، مما يضمن التحقق من واقع قاعدة الشفرة وتعزيز قرارات التنفيذ الصلبة ، باستخدام مبادئ مثل ''التحقق قبل التنفيذ'' و ''الأسئلة قبل الافتراض'' لتحسين جودة وموثوقية الشفرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Evaluating code review feedback for technical correctness","Verifying implementation suggestions against existing codebases","Debugging unclear or technically questionable feedback"],"zh":["评估代码审查反馈的技术正确性","验证实现建议与现有代码库的兼容性","调试不明确或技术上有问题的反馈"],"ja":["コードレビーフィードバックの技術的正確性を評価する","実装提案を既存のコードベースと照合する","不明確または技術的に疑問のあるフィードバックをデバッグする"],"ko":["코드 리뷰 피드백의 기술적 정확성을 평가する","구현 제안을 기존 코드베이스와 확인하는 것","불분명하거나 기술적으로 의심스러운 피드백을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Evaluar la retroalimentación de revisión de código para la corrección técnica","Verificar las sugerencias de implementación frente a las bases de código existentes","Depurar la retroalimentación poco clara o técnicamente cuestionable"],"fr":["Évaluer les commentaires de révision de code pour la correction technique","Vérifier les suggestions d''implémentation par rapport aux bases de code existantes","Déboguer les commentaires peu clairs ou techniquement discutables"],"de":["Bewerten der Code-Review-Rückmeldungen für technische Korrektheit","Verifizieren der Implementierungsvorschläge gegenüber bestehenden Codebasen","Fehlerbehebung unklarer oder technisch fragwürdiger Rückmeldungen"],"pt":["Avaliar feedback de revisão de código para correção técnica","Verificar sugestões de implementação contra bases de código existentes","Depurar feedbacks pouco claros ou tecnicamente questionáveis"],"ru":["Оценить обратную связь по проверке кода на техническую правильность","Проверить предложения по реализации против существующих кодовых баз","Отладить неясную или технически сомнительную обратную связь"],"ar":["تقييم ملاحظات مراجعة الشفرة البرمجية من أجل الصحة الفنية","التحقق من اقتراحات التنفيذ مقابل قواعد الشفرة البرمجية الحالية","تصحيح ملاحظات غير واضحة أو مشكوك فيها فنيًا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires technical expertise in code review and implementation","Assumes access to the relevant codebase for verification","May not be suitable for agents prioritizing social comfort over technical rigor"],"zh":["需要代码审查和实现方面的技术专长","假设有相关代码库用于验证","可能不适合优先考虑社会舒适度而非技术严谨性的代理"],"ja":["コードレビューと実装に関する技術的専門知識が必要","関連するコードベースへのアクセスが検証に必要","技術的厳格さよりも社会的快適性を優先するエージェントに適さない可能性がある"],"ko":["코드 리뷰 및 구현에 대한 기술적 전문 지식이 필요","관련 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 검증에 필요","기술적 엄격성보다 사회적 편안함을 우선하는 에이전트에게 적합하지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere experiencia técnica en revisión y implementación de código","Supone acceso a la base de código relevante para la verificación","Puede no ser adecuado para agentes que priorizan el confort social sobre la rigidez técnica"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise technique en révision et mise en œuvre de code","Suppose un accès à la base de code pertinente pour la vérification","Peut ne pas convenir aux agents qui privilégient le confort social sur la rigueur technique"],"de":["Benötigt technische Expertise in Code-Review und -Implementierung","Geht von Zugriff auf die relevante Codebasis für die Verifizierung aus","Kann für Agenten, die soziales Wohlbefinden über technische Strenge stellen, nicht geeignet sein"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento técnico em revisão de código e implementação","Pressupõe acesso à base de código relevante para verificação","Pode não ser adequado para agentes que priorizam o confort social sobre a rigorosidade técnica"],"ru":["Требует технической экспертизы в области проверки кода и реализации","Предполагает доступ к соответствующей кодовой базе для верификации","Может быть не подходящим для агентов, отдающих приоритет социальному комфорту над технической строгостью"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة تقنية في مراجعة الشفرة البرمجية والتنفيذ","يفترض الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة البرمجية ذات الصلة للتحقق","يمكن أن لا يكون مناسبًا للوكلاء الذين ي优طرون الراحة الاجتماعية على الدقة الفنية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c9382e92b8f32363566068ecfed19d3b2651eaf40d3942b24840f839dedfc406","repoEtag":"W/\"6ca4599aa6df63cc9397ee47e5073b776827a72e0cb91d7461282a78426487c4\"","qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/clickhouse-io', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'clickhouse-io', 50960, 6308, 65, '2026-02-24T12:02:48Z', '2026-02-24T12:04:32.986Z', '2cc963cde5b233025f0f82b4b70081e94a78b014682d129e0657480ab9aaf38d', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/clickhouse-io","name":"clickhouse-io","description":{"zh":"ClickHouse数据库模式、查询优化、分析和数据工程最佳实践","ja":"ClickHouseデータベースパターン、クエリ最適化、分析、データエンジニアリングのベストプラクティス","ko":"ClickHouse 데이터베이스 패턴, 쿼리 최적화, 분석 및 데이터 엔지니어링의 최선의 관행","es":"ClickHouse es una base de datos de alto rendimiento para análisis de datos y ofrece patrones y mejores prácticas para optimizar el rendimiento","fr":"ClickHouse est une base de données haute performance pour l''analyse de données et offre des modèles et des meilleures pratiques pour optimiser les performances","de":"ClickHouse ist eine Hochleistungs-Datenbank für Datenanalyse und bietet Muster und Best Practices zur Leistungsoptimierung","pt":"O ClickHouse é uma base de dados de alto desempenho para análise de dados. Aprenda a usar padrões de ClickHouse e agentes de IA para otimizar suas consultas e análises.","ru":"ClickHouse — это высокопроизводительная база данных для анализа данных. Узнайте, как использовать шаблоны ClickHouse и ИИ Агентов для оптимизации запросов и аналитики.","ar":"ClickHouse هو قاعدة بيانات عالية الأداء لتحليل البيانات. تعلم كيفية استخدام أنماط ClickHouse ووكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين استفساراتك والتحليلات.","en":"ClickHouse database patterns, query optimization, analytics, and data engineering best practices for high-performance analytical workloads."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":50960,"forks":6308,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T12:02:48Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"clickhouse-io","description":"ClickHouse database patterns, query optimization, analytics, and data engineering best practices for high-performance analytical workloads.","bodyPreview":"# ClickHouse Analytics Patterns\n\nClickHouse-specific patterns for high-performance analytics and data engineering.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Designing ClickHouse table schemas (MergeTree engine selection)\n- Writing analytical queries (aggregations, window functions, joins)\n- Optimizing query performance (partition pruning, projections, materialized views)\n- Ingesting large volumes of data (batch inserts, Kafka integration)\n- Migrating from PostgreSQL/MySQL to ClickHouse for analytics\n- Implementin","body":"# ClickHouse Analytics Patterns\n\nClickHouse-specific patterns for high-performance analytics and data engineering.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Designing ClickHouse table schemas (MergeTree engine selection)\n- Writing analytical queries (aggregations, window functions, joins)\n- Optimizing query performance (partition pruning, projections, materialized views)\n- Ingesting large volumes of data (batch inserts, Kafka integration)\n- Migrating from PostgreSQL/MySQL to ClickHouse for analytics\n- Implementing real-time dashboards or time-series analytics\n\n## Overview\n\nClickHouse is a column-oriented database management system (DBMS) for online analytical processing (OLAP). It''s optimized for fast analytical queries on large datasets.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Column-oriented storage\n- Data compression\n- Parallel query execution\n- Distributed queries\n- Real-time analytics\n\n## Table Design Patterns\n\n### MergeTree Engine (Most Common)\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE markets_analytics (\n    date Date,\n    market_id String,\n    market_name String,\n    volume UInt64,\n    trades UInt32,\n    unique_traders UInt32,\n    avg_trade_size Float64,\n    created_at DateTime\n) ENGINE = MergeTree()\nPARTITION BY toYYYYMM(date)\nORDER BY (date, market_id)\nSETTINGS index_granularity = 8192;\n```\n\n### ReplacingMergeTree (Deduplication)\n\n```sql\n-- For data that may have duplicates (e.g., from multiple sources)\nCREATE TABLE user_events (\n    event_id String,\n    user_id String,\n    event_type String,\n    timestamp DateTime,\n    properties String\n) ENGINE = ReplacingMergeTree()\nPARTITION BY toYYYYMM(timestamp)\nORDER BY (user_id, event_id, timestamp)\nPRIMARY KEY (user_id, event_id);\n```\n\n### AggregatingMergeTree (Pre-aggregation)\n\n```sql\n-- For maintaining aggregated metrics\nCREATE TABLE market_stats_hourly (\n    hour DateTime,\n    market_id String,\n    total_volume AggregateFunction(sum, UInt64),\n    total_trades AggregateFunction(count, UInt32),\n    unique_users AggregateFunction(uniq, String)\n) ENGINE = AggregatingMergeTree()\nPARTITION BY toYYYYMM(hour)\nORDER BY (hour, market_id);\n\n-- Query aggregated data\nSELECT\n    hour,\n    market_id,\n    sumMerge(total_volume) AS volume,\n    countMerge(total_trades) AS trades,\n    uniqMerge(unique_users) AS users\nFROM market_stats_hourly\nWHERE hour >= toStartOfHour(now() - INTERVAL 24 HOUR)\nGROUP BY hour, market_id\nORDER BY hour DESC;\n```\n\n## Query Optimization Patterns\n\n### Efficient Filtering\n\n```sql\n-- ✅ GOOD: Use indexed columns first\nSELECT *\nFROM markets_analytics\nWHERE date >= ''2025-01-01''\n  AND market_id = ''market-123''\n  AND volume > 1000\nORDER BY date DESC\nLIMIT 100;\n\n-- ❌ BAD: Filter on non-indexed columns first\nSELECT *\nFROM markets_analytics\nWHERE volume > 1000\n  AND market_name LIKE ''%election%''\n  AND date >= ''2025-01-01'';\n```\n\n### Aggregations\n\n```sql\n-- ✅ GOOD: Use ClickHouse-specific aggregation functions\nSELECT\n    toStartOfDay(created_at) AS day,\n    market_id,\n    sum(volume) AS total_volume,\n    count() AS total_trades,\n    uniq(trader_id) AS unique_traders,\n    avg(trade_size) AS avg_size\nFROM trades\nWHERE created_at >= today() - INTERVAL 7 DAY\nGROUP BY day, market_id\nORDER BY day DESC, total_volume DESC;\n\n-- ✅ Use quantile for percentiles (more efficient than percentile)\nSELECT\n    quantile(0.50)(trade_size) AS median,\n    quantile(0.95)(trade_size) AS p95,\n    quantile(0.99)(trade_size) AS p99\nFROM trades\nWHERE created_at >= now() - INTERVAL 1 HOUR;\n```\n\n### Window Functions\n\n```sql\n-- Calculate running totals\nSELECT\n    date,\n    market_id,\n    volume,\n    sum(volume) OVER (\n        PARTITION BY market_id\n        ORDER BY date\n        ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW\n    ) AS cumulative_volume\nFROM markets_analytics\nWHERE date >= today() - INTERVAL 30 DAY\nORDER BY market_id, date;\n```\n\n## Data Insertion Patterns\n\n### Bulk Insert (Recommended)\n\n```typescript\nimport { ClickHouse } from ''clickhouse''\n\nconst clickhouse = new ClickHouse({\n  url: process.env.CLICKHOUSE_URL,\n  port: 8123,\n  basicAuth: {\n    username: process.env.CLICKHOUSE_USER,\n    password: process.env.CLICKHOUSE_PASSWORD\n  }\n})\n\n// ✅ Batch insert (efficient)\nasync function bulkInsertTrades(trades: Trade[]) {\n  const values = trades.map(trade => `(\n    ''${trade.id}'',\n    ''${trade.market_id}'',\n    ''${trade.user_id}'',\n    ${trade.amount},\n    ''${trade.timestamp.toISOString()}''\n  )`).join('','')\n\n  await clickhouse.query(`\n    INSERT INTO trades (id, market_id, user_id, amount, timestamp)\n    VALUES ${values}\n  `).toPromise()\n}\n\n// ❌ Individual inserts (slow)\nasync function insertTrade(trade: Trade) {\n  // Don''t do this in a loop!\n  await clickhouse.query(`\n    INSERT INTO trades VALUES (''${trade.id}'', ...)\n  `).toPromise()\n}\n```\n\n### Streaming Insert\n\n```typescript\n// For continuous data ingestion\nimport { createWriteStream } from ''fs''\nimport { pipeline } from ''stream/promises''\n\nasync function streamInserts() {\n  const stream = clickhouse.insert(''trades'').stream()\n\n  for await (const batch of dataSource) {\n    stream.write(batch)\n  }\n\n  await stream.end()\n}\n```\n\n## Materialized Views\n\n### Real-time Aggregations\n\n```sql\n-- Create materialized view for hourly stats\nCREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW market_stats_hourly_mv\nTO market_stats_hourly\nAS SELECT\n    toStartOfHour(timestamp) AS hour,\n    market_id,\n    sumState(amount) AS total_volume,\n    countState() AS total_trades,\n    uniqState(user_id) AS unique_users\nFROM trades\nGROUP BY hour, market_id;\n\n-- Query the materialized view\nSELECT\n    hour,\n    market_id,\n    sumMerge(total_volume) AS volume,\n    countMerge(total_trades) AS trades,\n    uniqMerge(unique_users) AS users\nFROM market_stats_hourly\nWHERE hour >= now() - INTERVAL 24 HOUR\nGROUP BY hour, market_id;\n```\n\n## Performance Monitoring\n\n### Query Performance\n\n```sql\n-- Check slow queries\nSELECT\n    query_id,\n    user,\n    query,\n    query_duration_ms,\n    read_rows,\n    read_bytes,\n    memory_usage\nFROM system.query_log\nWHERE type = ''QueryFinish''\n  AND query_duration_ms > 1000\n  AND event_time >= now() - INTERVAL 1 HOUR\nORDER BY query_duration_ms DESC\nLIMIT 10;\n```\n\n### Table Statistics\n\n```sql\n-- Check table sizes\nSELECT\n    database,\n    table,\n    formatReadableSize(sum(bytes)) AS size,\n    sum(rows) AS rows,\n    max(modification_time) AS latest_modification\nFROM system.parts\nWHERE active\nGROUP BY database, table\nORDER BY sum(bytes) DESC;\n```\n\n## Common Analytics Queries\n\n### Time Series Analysis\n\n```sql\n-- Daily active users\nSELECT\n    toDate(timestamp) AS date,\n    uniq(user_id) AS daily_active_users\nFROM events\nWHERE timestamp >= today() - INTERVAL 30 DAY\nGROUP BY date\nORDER BY date;\n\n-- Retention analysis\nSELECT\n    signup_date,\n    countIf(days_since_signup = 0) AS day_0,\n    countIf(days_since_signup = 1) AS day_1,\n    countIf(days_since_signup = 7) AS day_7,\n    countIf(days_since_signup = 30) AS day_30\nFROM (\n    SELECT\n        user_id,\n        min(toDate(timestamp)) AS signup_date,\n        toDate(timestamp) AS activity_date,\n        dateDiff(''day'', signup_date, activity_date) AS days_since_signup\n    FROM events\n    GROUP BY user_id, activity_date\n)\nGROUP BY signup_date\nORDER BY signup_date DESC;\n```\n\n### Funnel Analysis\n\n```sql\n-- Conversion funnel\nSELECT\n    countIf(step = ''viewed_market'') AS viewed,\n    countIf(step = ''clicked_trade'') AS clicked,\n    countIf(step = ''completed_trade'') AS completed,\n    round(clicked / viewed * 100, 2) AS view_to_click_rate,\n    round(completed / clicked * 100, 2) AS click_to_completion_rate\nFROM (\n    SELECT\n        user_id,\n        session_id,\n        event_type AS step\n    FROM events\n    WHERE event_date = today()\n)\nGROUP BY session_id;\n```\n\n### Cohort Analysis\n\n```sql\n-- User cohorts by signup month\nSELECT\n    toStartOfMonth(signup_date) AS cohort,\n    toStartOfMonth(activity_date) AS month,\n    dateDiff(''month'', cohort, month) AS months_since_signup,\n    count(DISTINCT user_id) AS active_users\nFROM (\n    SELECT\n        user_id,\n        min(toDate(timestamp)) OVER (PARTITION BY user_id) AS signup_date,\n        toDate(timestamp) AS activity_date\n    FROM events\n)\nGROUP BY cohort, month, months_since_signup\nORDER BY cohort, months_since_signup;\n```\n\n## Data Pipeline Patterns\n\n### ETL Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// Extract, Transform, Load\nasync function etlPipeline() {\n  // 1. Extract from source\n  const rawData = await extractFromPostgres()\n\n  // 2. Transform\n  const transformed = rawData.map(row => ({\n    date: new Date(row.created_at).toISOString().split(''T'')[0],\n    market_id: row.market_slug,\n    volume: parseFloat(row.total_volume),\n    trades: parseInt(row.trade_count)\n  }))\n\n  // 3. Load to ClickHouse\n  await bulkInsertToClickHouse(transformed)\n}\n\n// Run periodically\nsetInterval(etlPipeline, 60 * 60 * 1000)  // Every hour\n```\n\n### Change Data Capture (CDC)\n\n```typescript\n// Listen to PostgreSQL changes and sync to ClickHouse\nimport { Client } from ''pg''\n\nconst pgClient = new Client({ connectionString: process.env.DATABASE_URL })\n\npgClient.query(''LISTEN market_updates'')\n\npgClient.on(''notification'', async (msg) => {\n  const update = JSON.parse(msg.payload)\n\n  await clickhouse.insert(''market_updates'', [\n    {\n      market_id: update.id,\n      event_type: update.operation,  // INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE\n      timestamp: new Date(),\n      data: JSON.stringify(update.new_data)\n    }\n  ])\n})\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### 1. Partitioning Strategy\n- Partition by time (usually month or day)\n- Avoid too many partitions (performance impact)\n- Use DATE type for partition key\n\n### 2. Ordering Key\n- Put most frequently filtered columns first\n- Consider cardinality (high cardinality first)\n- Order impacts compression\n\n### 3. Data Types\n- Use smallest appropriate type (UInt32 vs UInt64)\n- Use LowCardinality for repeated strings\n- Use Enum for categorical data\n\n### 4. Avoid\n- SELECT * (specify columns)\n- FINAL (merge data before query instead)\n- Too many JOINs (denormalize for analytics)\n- Small frequent inserts (batch instead)\n\n### 5. Monitoring\n- Track query performance\n- Monitor disk usage\n- Check merge operations\n- Review slow query log\n\n**Remember**: ClickHouse excels at analytical workloads. Design tables for your query patterns, batch inserts, and leverage materialized views for real-time aggregations.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-24T12:04:32.986Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"ClickHouse AI工具：高性能数据分析","ja":"ClickHouse AIエージェント：高速データ分析","ko":"ClickHouse AI 에이전트: 고성능 데이터 분석","es":"Herramientas de ClickHouse para Análisis de Datos","fr":"Outils ClickHouse pour l''Analyse de Données","de":"ClickHouse-Tools für Datenanalyse","pt":"Padrões de Análise de ClickHouse com Agentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты для ClickHouse: оптимизация запросов и аналитики","ar":"نماذج تحليل ClickHouse مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"clickhouse-io"},"description":{"zh":"ClickHouse数据库模式、查询优化、分析和数据工程最佳实践","ja":"ClickHouseデータベースパターン、クエリ最適化、分析、データエンジニアリングのベストプラクティス","ko":"ClickHouse 데이터베이스 패턴, 쿼리 최적화, 분석 및 데이터 엔지니어링의 최선의 관행","es":"ClickHouse es una base de datos de alto rendimiento para análisis de datos y ofrece patrones y mejores prácticas para optimizar el rendimiento","fr":"ClickHouse est une base de données haute performance pour l''analyse de données et offre des modèles et des meilleures pratiques pour optimiser les performances","de":"ClickHouse ist eine Hochleistungs-Datenbank für Datenanalyse und bietet Muster und Best Practices zur Leistungsoptimierung","pt":"O ClickHouse é uma base de dados de alto desempenho para análise de dados. Aprenda a usar padrões de ClickHouse e agentes de IA para otimizar suas consultas ...","ru":"ClickHouse — это высокопроизводительная база данных для анализа данных. Узнайте, как использовать шаблоны ClickHouse и ИИ Агентов для оптимизации запросов и ...","ar":"ClickHouse هو قاعدة بيانات عالية الأداء لتحليل البيانات. تعلم كيفية استخدام أنماط ClickHouse ووكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين استفساراتك والتحليلات.","en":"ClickHouse database patterns, query optimization, analytics, and data engineering best practices for high-performance analytical workloads."},"definition":{"en":"ClickHouse database patterns, query optimization, analytics, and data engineering best practices for high-performance analytical workloads."},"features":{"zh":["ClickHouse表架构设计","分析查询优化","查询性能优化","大数据量插入","从PostgreSQL/MySQL迁移到ClickHouse"],"ja":["ClickHouseテーブルスキーマ設計","分析クエリ最適化","クエリパフォーマンス最適化","大量データ挿入","PostgreSQL/MySQLからClickHouseへの移行"],"ko":["ClickHouse 테이블 스키마 설계","분석 쿼리 최적화","쿼리 성능 최적화","大量 데이터 삽입","PostgreSQL/MySQL에서 ClickHouse로의 마이그레이션"],"es":["Patrones de ClickHouse para análisis de datos","Optimización de consultas para cargas de trabajo analíticas","Ingesta de grandes volúmenes de datos","Migración desde PostgreSQL/MySQL a ClickHouse","Mejores prácticas para ingeniería de datos"],"fr":["Modèles ClickHouse pour l''analyse de données","Optimisation des requêtes pour les charges de travail analytiques","Ingestion de grands volumes de données","Migration de PostgreSQL/MySQL vers ClickHouse","Meilleures pratiques pour l''ingénierie de données"],"de":["ClickHouse-Muster für Datenanalyse","Abfrageoptimierung für Analyse-Workloads","Ingestion großer Datenmengen","Migration von PostgreSQL/MySQL zu ClickHouse","Best Practices für Datenengineering"],"pt":["Padrões de análise de ClickHouse","Otimização de consultas","Análise de dados de alto desempenho","Integração com agentes de IA","Melhoria do desempenho e eficiência"],"ru":["Шаблоны анализа ClickHouse","Оптимизация запросов","Высокопроизводительный анализ данных","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Повышение производительности и эффективности"],"ar":["نماذج تحليل ClickHouse","تحسين الاستفسارات","تحليل البيانات عالي الأداء","التكامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الأداء والكفاءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ClickHouse","AI工具","数据分析","查询优化","数据工程","MergeTree","PostgreSQL","MySQL"],"ja":["ClickHouse","AIエージェント","データ分析","クエリ最適化","データエンジニアリング","MergeTree","PostgreSQL","MySQL"],"ko":["ClickHouse","AI 에이전트","데이터 분석","쿼리 최적화","데이터 엔지니어링","MergeTree","PostgreSQL","MySQL"],"es":["Herramientas de ClickHouse","Análisis de datos","Patrones de bases de datos","Optimización de consultas","Ingeniería de datos","Cargas de trabajo analíticas","Agente de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Outils ClickHouse","Analyse de données","Modèles de bases de données","Optimisation des requêtes","Ingénierie de données","Charges de travail analytiques","Agent d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["ClickHouse-Tools","Datenanalyse","Datenbankmuster","Abfrageoptimierung","Datenengineering","Analyse-Workloads","KI-Agent"],"pt":["ClickHouse","Análise de dados","Agentes de IA","Otimização de consultas","Alto desempenho","Análise de dados de alto desempenho","Integração com agentes de IA","Melhoria do desempenho"],"ru":["ClickHouse","Анализ данных","ИИ Агенты","Оптимизация запросов","Высокопроизводительный","Анализ данных высокого производительности","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Повышение производительности"],"ar":["ClickHouse","تحليل البيانات","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الاستفسارات","عالي الأداء","تحليل البيانات عالي الأداء","التكامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الأداء"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing high-performance ClickHouse database query optimization and analytics capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高性能ClickHouse数据库查询优化和分析能力的数据分析代理。","ja":"高性能のClickHouseデータベースクエリ最適化および分析機能を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"높은 성능의 ClickHouse 데이터베이스 쿼리 최적화 및 분석 기능이 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan una optimización de consultas de bases de datos de alta velocidad de ClickHouse y capacidades analíticas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Données nécessitant une optimisation de requêtes de base de données ClickHouse haute performance et des capacités d''analyse.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die eine Hochleistungs-Optimierung von ClickHouse-Datenbankabfragen und Analysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing high-performance ClickHouse database query optimization and analytics capabilities.","ru":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing high-performance ClickHouse database query optimization and analytics capabilities.","ar":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing high-performance ClickHouse database query optimization and analytics capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage ClickHouse-specific patterns for high-performance analytics, optimize query performance using partition pruning, projections, and materialized views, and ingest large volumes of data through batch inserts and Kafka integration.","zh":"赋予代理使用ClickHouse特定的模式实现高性能分析，使用分区剪枝、投影和物化视图优化查询性能，并通过批量插入和Kafka集成大量摄取数据。","ja":"エージェントがClickHouse固有のパターンを使用して高性能の分析を実現し、パーティションの剪枝、投影、物化ビューを使用して