signing efficient ClickHouse table schemas using MergeTree engine","Migrating analytics workloads from PostgreSQL/MySQL to ClickHouse"],"zh":["优化ClickHouse查询性能以适应分析工作负载","使用MergeTree引擎设计高效的ClickHouse表格模式","将分析工作负载从PostgreSQL/MySQL迁移到ClickHouse"],"ja":["分析ワークロードのためのClickHouseクエリのパフォーマンスを最適化する","MergeTreeエンジンを使用して効率的なClickHouseテーブルスキーマを設計する","分析ワークロードをPostgreSQL/MySQLからClickHouseに移行する"],"ko":["분석 워크로드를 위한 ClickHouse 쿼리 성능 최적화","MergeTree 엔진을 사용하여 효율적인 ClickHouse 테이블 스키마 설계","분석 워크로드를 PostgreSQL/MySQL에서 ClickHouse로 마이그레이션"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de las consultas de ClickHouse para cargas de trabajo analíticas","Diseñar esquemas de tabla de ClickHouse eficientes utilizando el motor MergeTree","Migrar cargas de trabajo de análisis de PostgreSQL/MySQL a ClickHouse"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances des requêtes ClickHouse pour les charges de travail analytiques","Concevoir des schémas de table ClickHouse efficaces en utilisant le moteur MergeTree","Migrer les charges de travail d''analyse de PostgreSQL/MySQL vers ClickHouse"],"de":["Optimieren des Abfrageleistungsverhaltens von ClickHouse für analytische Arbeitslasten","Entwerfen effizienter ClickHouse-Tabellenschemata unter Verwendung des MergeTree-Motors","Migration von Analyse-Arbeitslasten von PostgreSQL/MySQL zu ClickHouse"],"pt":["Optimizing ClickHouse query performance for analytical workloads","Designing efficient ClickHouse table schemas using MergeTree engine","Migrating analytics workloads from PostgreSQL/MySQL to ClickHouse"],"ru":["Optimizing ClickHouse query performance for analytical workloads","Designing efficient ClickHouse table schemas using MergeTree engine","Migrating analytics workloads from PostgreSQL/MySQL to ClickHouse"],"ar":["Optimizing ClickHouse query performance for analytical workloads","Designing efficient ClickHouse table schemas using MergeTree engine","Migrating analytics workloads from PostgreSQL/MySQL to ClickHouse"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ClickHouse database setup","ClickHouse-specific knowledge and configuration needed"],"zh":["需要ClickHouse数据库设置","需要ClickHouse特定的知识和配置"],"ja":["ClickHouseデータベースの設定が必要","ClickHouse特有の知識と設定が必要"],"ko":["ClickHouse 데이터베이스 설정이 필요","ClickHouse 고유의 지식과 구성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de base de datos de ClickHouse","Conocimiento y configuración específicos de ClickHouse necesarios"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de base de données ClickHouse","Connaissances et configuration spécifiques à ClickHouse nécessaires"],"de":["Benötigt ClickHouse-Datenbank-Setup","ClickHouse-spezifisches Wissen und Konfiguration erforderlich"],"pt":["Requires ClickHouse database setup","ClickHouse-specific knowledge and configuration needed"],"ru":["Requires ClickHouse database setup","ClickHouse-specific knowledge and configuration needed"],"ar":["Requires ClickHouse database setup","ClickHouse-specific knowledge and configuration needed"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2cc963cde5b233025f0f82b4b70081e94a78b014682d129e0657480ab9aaf38d","repoEtag":"W/\"364f268e25511efbc6f9c2152da6805d934c8ccbaa49ea479a3da0f27c55af07\"","qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('huggingface/skills/hugging-face-cli', 'official', 'huggingface', 'skills', 'huggingface/skills', 'hugging-face-cli', 2623, 186, 65, '2026-02-23T01:07:27Z', '2026-02-23T01:07:33.665Z', 'c011e33ff672d5b1ec80fd280f245ff0c15e8dac3b8a0d146c8973a596185878', '{"id":"huggingface/skills/hugging-face-cli","name":"hugging-face-cli","description":{"zh":"Hugging Face CLI提供了命令行接口来下载、上传和管理Hugging Face Hub的模型、数据集和仓库","ja":"Hugging Face CLIは、Hugging Face Hubのモデル、データセット、リポジトリをダウンロード、アップロード、管理するためのコマンドラインインターフェースを提供します","ko":"Hugging Face CLI는 Hugging Face Hub의 모델, 데이터셋, 리포지토리를 다운로드, 업로드, 관리하기 위한 명령줄 인터페이스를 제공합니다","es":"El comando hugging-face-cli ofrece acceso directo a Hugging Face Hub para descargar, subir y gestionar repositorios, caché y recursos de computación","fr":"La commande hugging-face-cli offre un accès direct à Hugging Face Hub pour télécharger, uploader et gérer des référentiels, du cache et des ressources de calcul","de":"Der Befehl hugging-face-cli bietet direkten Zugriff auf den Hugging Face Hub zum Herunterladen, Hochladen und Verwalten von Repositories, Cache und Rechenressourcen","pt":"O Hugging Face CLI é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para interagir com o Hugging Face Hub","ru":"Hugging Face CLI - это инструмент командной строки для взаимодействия с Hugging Face Hub","ar":"Hugging Face CLI هو أداة سطر أوامر للتفاعل مع Hugging Face Hub","en":"Execute Hugging Face Hub operations using the `hf` CLI. Use when the user needs to download models/datasets/spaces, upload files to Hub repositories, create repos, manage local cache, or run compute jobs on HF infrastructure. Covers authentication, file transfers, repository creation, cache opera..."},"owner":"huggingface","repo":"skills","repoPath":"huggingface/skills","stars":2623,"forks":186,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T01:07:27Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"hugging-face-cli","description":"Execute Hugging Face Hub operations using the `hf` CLI. Use when the user needs to download models/datasets/spaces, upload files to Hub repositories, create repos, manage local cache, or run compute jobs on HF infrastructure. Covers authentication, file transfers, repository creation, cache operations, and cloud compute.","bodyPreview":"# Hugging Face CLI\n\nThe `hf` CLI provides direct terminal access to the Hugging Face Hub for downloading, uploading, and managing repositories, cache, and compute resources.\n\n## Quick Command Reference\n\n| Task | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Login | `hf auth login` |\n| Download model | `hf download <repo_id>` |\n| Download to folder | `hf download <repo_id> --local-dir ./path` |\n| Upload folder | `hf upload <repo_id> . .` |\n| Create repo | `hf repo create <name>` |\n| Create tag | `hf repo tag cr","body":"# Hugging Face CLI\n\nThe `hf` CLI provides direct terminal access to the Hugging Face Hub for downloading, uploading, and managing repositories, cache, and compute resources.\n\n## Quick Command Reference\n\n| Task | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Login | `hf auth login` |\n| Download model | `hf download <repo_id>` |\n| Download to folder | `hf download <repo_id> --local-dir ./path` |\n| Upload folder | `hf upload <repo_id> . .` |\n| Create repo | `hf repo create <name>` |\n| Create tag | `hf repo tag create <repo_id> <tag>` |\n| Delete files | `hf repo-files delete <repo_id> <files>` |\n| List cache | `hf cache ls` |\n| Remove from cache | `hf cache rm <repo_or_revision>` |\n| List models | `hf models ls` |\n| Get model info | `hf models info <model_id>` |\n| List datasets | `hf datasets ls` |\n| Get dataset info | `hf datasets info <dataset_id>` |\n| List spaces | `hf spaces ls` |\n| Get space info | `hf spaces info <space_id>` |\n| List endpoints | `hf endpoints ls` |\n| Run GPU job | `hf jobs run --flavor a10g-small <image> <cmd>` |\n| Environment info | `hf env` |\n\n## Core Commands\n\n### Authentication\n```bash\nhf auth login                    # Interactive login\nhf auth login --token $HF_TOKEN  # Non-interactive\nhf auth whoami                   # Check current user\nhf auth list                     # List stored tokens\nhf auth switch                   # Switch between tokens\nhf auth logout                   # Log out\n```\n\n### Download\n```bash\nhf download <repo_id>                              # Full repo to cache\nhf download <repo_id> file.safetensors             # Specific file\nhf download <repo_id> --local-dir ./models         # To local directory\nhf download <repo_id> --include \"*.safetensors\"    # Filter by pattern\nhf download <repo_id> --repo-type dataset          # Dataset\nhf download <repo_id> --revision v1.0              # Specific version\n```\n\n### Upload\n```bash\nhf upload <repo_id> . .                            # Current dir to root\nhf upload <repo_id> ./models /weights              # Folder to path\nhf upload <repo_id> model.safetensors              # Single file\nhf upload <repo_id> . . --repo-type dataset        # Dataset\nhf upload <repo_id> . . --create-pr                # Create PR\nhf upload <repo_id> . . --commit-message=\"msg\"     # Custom message\n```\n\n### Repository Management\n```bash\nhf repo create <name>                              # Create model repo\nhf repo create <name> --repo-type dataset          # Create dataset\nhf repo create <name> --private                    # Private repo\nhf repo create <name> --repo-type space --space_sdk gradio  # Gradio space\nhf repo delete <repo_id>                           # Delete repo\nhf repo move <from_id> <to_id>                     # Move repo to new namespace\nhf repo settings <repo_id> --private true          # Update repo settings\nhf repo list --repo-type model                     # List repos\nhf repo branch create <repo_id> release-v1         # Create branch\nhf repo branch delete <repo_id> release-v1         # Delete branch\nhf repo tag create <repo_id> v1.0                  # Create tag\nhf repo tag list <repo_id>                         # List tags\nhf repo tag delete <repo_id> v1.0                  # Delete tag\n```\n\n### Delete Files from Repo\n```bash\nhf repo-files delete <repo_id> folder/             # Delete folder\nhf repo-files delete <repo_id> \"*.txt\"             # Delete with pattern\n```\n\n### Cache Management\n```bash\nhf cache ls                      # List cached repos\nhf cache ls --revisions          # Include individual revisions\nhf cache rm model/gpt2           # Remove cached repo\nhf cache rm <revision_hash>      # Remove cached revision\nhf cache prune                   # Remove detached revisions\nhf cache verify gpt2             # Verify checksums from cache\n```\n\n### Browse Hub\n```bash\n# Models\nhf models ls                                        # List top trending models\nhf models ls --search \"MiniMax\" --author MiniMaxAI  # Search models\nhf models ls --filter \"text-generation\" --limit 20  # Filter by task\nhf models info MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.1               # Get model info\n\n# Datasets\nhf datasets ls                                      # List top trending datasets\nhf datasets ls --search \"finepdfs\" --sort downloads # Search datasets\nhf datasets info HuggingFaceFW/finepdfs             # Get dataset info\n\n# Spaces\nhf spaces ls                                        # List top trending spaces\nhf spaces ls --filter \"3d\" --limit 10               # Filter by 3D modeling spaces\nhf spaces info enzostvs/deepsite                    # Get space info\n```\n\n### Jobs (Cloud Compute)\n```bash\nhf jobs run python:3.12 python script.py           # Run on CPU\nhf jobs run --flavor a10g-small <image> <cmd>      # Run on GPU\nhf jobs run --secrets HF_TOKEN <image> <cmd>       # With HF token\nhf jobs ps                                         # List jobs\nhf jobs logs <job_id>                              # View logs\nhf jobs cancel <job_id>                            # Cancel job\n```\n\n### Inference Endpoints\n```bash\nhf endpoints ls                                     # List endpoints\nhf endpoints deploy my-endpoint \\\n  --repo openai/gpt-oss-120b \\\n  --framework vllm \\\n  --accelerator gpu \\\n  --instance-size x4 \\\n  --instance-type nvidia-a10g \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --vendor aws\nhf endpoints describe my-endpoint                   # Show endpoint details\nhf endpoints pause my-endpoint                      # Pause endpoint\nhf endpoints resume my-endpoint                     # Resume endpoint\nhf endpoints scale-to-zero my-endpoint              # Scale to zero\nhf endpoints delete my-endpoint --yes               # Delete endpoint\n```\n**GPU Flavors:** `cpu-basic`, `cpu-upgrade`, `cpu-xl`, `t4-small`, `t4-medium`, `l4x1`, `l4x4`, `l40sx1`, `l40sx4`, `l40sx8`, `a10g-small`, `a10g-large`, `a10g-largex2`, `a10g-largex4`, `a100-large`, `h100`, `h100x8`\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Download and Use Model Locally\n```bash\n# Download to local directory for deployment\nhf download meta-llama/Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct --local-dir ./model\n\n# Or use cache and get path\nMODEL_PATH=$(hf download meta-llama/Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct --quiet)\n```\n\n### Publish Model/Dataset\n```bash\nhf repo create my-username/my-model --private\nhf upload my-username/my-model ./output . --commit-message=\"Initial release\"\nhf repo tag create my-username/my-model v1.0\n```\n\n### Sync Space with Local\n```bash\nhf upload my-username/my-space . . --repo-type space \\\n  --exclude=\"logs/*\" --delete=\"*\" --commit-message=\"Sync\"\n```\n\n### Check Cache Usage\n```bash\nhf cache ls                      # See all cached repos and sizes\nhf cache rm model/gpt2           # Remove a repo from cache\n```\n\n## Key Options\n\n- `--repo-type`: `model` (default), `dataset`, `space`\n- `--revision`: Branch, tag, or commit hash\n- `--token`: Override authentication\n- `--quiet`: Output only essential info (paths/URLs)\n\n## References\n\n- **Complete command reference**: See [references/commands.md](references/commands.md)\n- **Workflow examples**: See [references/examples.md](references/examples.md)\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:07:33.665Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Hugging Face CLI AI工具","ja":"Hugging Face CLI AIエージェント","ko":"Hugging Face CLI AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de AI: hugging-face-cli para desarrolladores","fr":"Outils IA: hugging-face-cli pour les développeurs","de":"KI-Tools: hugging-face-cli für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Hugging Face CLI","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Hugging Face CLI","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Hugging Face CLI","en":"hugging-face-cli"},"description":{"zh":"Hugging Face CLI提供了命令行接口来下载、上传和管理Hugging Face Hub的模型、数据集和仓库","ja":"Hugging Face CLIは、Hugging Face Hubのモデル、データセット、リポジトリをダウンロード、アップロード、管理するためのコマンドラインインターフェースを提供します","ko":"Hugging Face CLI는 Hugging Face Hub의 모델, 데이터셋, 리포지토리를 다운로드, 업로드, 관리하기 위한 명령줄 인터페이스를 제공합니다","es":"El comando hugging-face-cli ofrece acceso directo a Hugging Face Hub para descargar, subir y gestionar repositorios, caché y recursos de computación","fr":"La commande hugging-face-cli offre un accès direct à Hugging Face Hub pour télécharger, uploader et gérer des référentiels, du cache et des ressources de calcul","de":"Der Befehl hugging-face-cli bietet direkten Zugriff auf den Hugging Face Hub zum Herunterladen, Hochladen und Verwalten von Repositories, Cache und Rechenres...","pt":"O Hugging Face CLI é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para interagir com o Hugging Face Hub","ru":"Hugging Face CLI - это инструмент командной строки для взаимодействия с Hugging Face Hub","ar":"Hugging Face CLI هو أداة سطر أوامر للتفاعل مع Hugging Face Hub","en":"Execute Hugging Face Hub operations using the `hf` CLI. Use when the user needs to download models/datasets/spaces, upload files to Hub repositories, create ..."},"definition":{"en":"Execute Hugging Face Hub operations using the `hf` CLI. Use when the user needs to download models/datasets/spaces, upload files to Hub repositories, create repos, manage local cache, or run compute jobs on HF infrastructure. Covers authentication, file transfers, repository creation, cache operations, and cloud compute."},"features":{"zh":["模型下载","模型上传","仓库管理","缓存管理","云计算"],"ja":["モデルダウンロード","モデルアップロード","リポジトリ管理","キャッシュ管理","クラウドコンピューティング"],"ko":["모델 다운로드","모델 업로드","리포지토리 관리","캐시 관리","클라우드 컴퓨팅"],"es":["Autenticación con Hugging Face Hub","Descarga de modelos y datasets","Carga de archivos en repositorios","Creación de repositorios y etiquetas","Gestión de caché local","Ejecución de trabajos de computación en la nube"],"fr":["Authentification avec Hugging Face Hub","Téléchargement de modèles et de datasets","Chargement de fichiers dans des référentiels","Création de référentiels et d''étiquettes","Gestion du cache local","Exécution de tâches de calcul dans le cloud"],"de":["Authentifizierung mit Hugging Face Hub","Herunterladen von Modellen und Datasets","Hochladen von Dateien in Repositories","Erstellen von Repositories und Tags","Verwaltung des lokalen Caches","Ausführen von Compute-Aufträgen in der Cloud"],"pt":["Baixar modelos e conjuntos de dados","Fazer upload de arquivos para repositórios","Criar e gerenciar repositórios","Gerenciar cache local","Executar trabalhos de computação em nuvem"],"ru":["Загрузка моделей и наборов данных","Выгрузка файлов в репозитории","Создание и управление репозиториями","Управление локальным кэшем","Выполнение вычислительных задач в облаке"],"ar":["تنزيل النماذج والمجموعات البيانية","رفع الملفات إلى المستودعات","إنشاء وإدارة المستودعات","إدارة الذاكرة المؤقتة المحلية","تشغيل مهام الحوسبة السحابية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Hugging Face CLI","AI工具","模型下载","模型上传","仓库管理","缓存管理","云计算"],"ja":["Hugging Face CLI","AIエージェント","モデルダウンロード","モデルアップロード","リポジトリ管理","キャッシュ管理","クラウドコンピューティング"],"ko":["Hugging Face CLI","AI 에이전트","모델 다운로드","모델 업로드","리포지토리 관리","캐시 관리","클라우드 컴퓨팅"],"es":["hugging face cli","herramientas de ai","desarrollo de ia","hugging face hub","modelos de ia","datasets de ia","computación en la nube"],"fr":["hugging face cli","outils ia","développement ia","hugging face hub","modèles ia","datasets ia","calcul dans le cloud"],"de":["hugging face cli","ki-tools","ki-entwicklung","hugging face hub","ki-modelle","ki-datasets","cloud-computing"],"pt":["Hugging Face CLI","Ferramentas de IA","Modelos de IA","Repositórios de IA","Gerenciamento de cache","Computação em nuvem"],"ru":["Hugging Face CLI","ИИ Агенты","Модели ИИ","Репозитории ИИ","Управление кэшем","Облачные вычисления"],"ar":["Hugging Face CLI","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي","مستودعات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إدارة الذاكرة المؤقتة","حوسبة سحابية"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing seamless integration with Hugging Face Hub for model and dataset management.","zh":"适合需要与 Hugging Face Hub 无缝集成的 AI Agents，用于模型和数据集管理。","ja":"Hugging Face Hub とのシームレスな統合が必要な AI エージェントに最適です。モデルおよびデータセットの管理に使用されます。","ko":"Hugging Face Hub와의 무결점 통합이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 모델 및 데이터셋 관리를 위해 사용됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una integración sin problemas con Hugging Face Hub para la gestión de modelos y conjuntos de datos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA nécessitant une intégration transparente avec Hugging Face Hub pour la gestion de modèles et de jeux de données.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit Hugging Face Hub für Modell- und Datensatzverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de integração sem problemas com o Hugging Face Hub para gerenciamento de modelos e conjuntos de dados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция с Hugging Face Hub для управления моделями и наборами данных.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متكامل مع هوجينغ فايس هاب لإدارة النماذج ومجموعات البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute Hugging Face Hub operations using the `hf` CLI, enabling authentication, file transfers, repository creation, cache operations, and cloud compute jobs, all while leveraging Hugging Face infrastructure and protocols like repository tagging and compute job management.","zh":"赋予代理执行 Hugging Face Hub 操作的能力，使用 `hf` CLI，实现身份验证、文件传输、存储库创建、缓存操作和云计算作业，同时利用 Hugging Face 基础设施和协议，如存储库标记和计算作业管理。","ja":"エージェントが `hf` CLI を使用して Hugging Face Hub 操作を実行する機能を提供します。認証、ファイル転送、リポジトリの作成、キャッシュ操作、およびクラウドコンピューティングジョブを可能にし、リポジトリタグ付けやコンピューティングジョブ管理などの Hugging Face インフラストラクチャとプロトコルを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 `hf` CLI를 사용하여 Hugging Face Hub 작업을 실행할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. 인증, 파일 전송, 저장소 생성, 캐시 작업 및 클라우드 컴퓨팅 작업을 가능하게 하며 저장소 태그 지정 및 컴퓨팅 작업 관리와 같은 Hugging Face 인프라 및 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar operaciones de Hugging Face Hub utilizando el `hf` CLI, permitiendo la autenticación, las transferencias de archivos, la creación de repositorios, las operaciones de caché y los trabajos de computación en la nube, todo mientras aprovecha la infraestructura y los protocolos de Hugging Face como el etiquetado de repositorios y la gestión de trabajos de computación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des opérations Hugging Face Hub en utilisant le `hf` CLI, permettant l''authentification, le transfert de fichiers, la création de référentiels, les opérations de cache et les travaux de calcul cloud, le tout en exploitant l''infrastructure et les protocoles Hugging Face tels que l''étiquetage de référentiels et la gestion de travaux de calcul.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Hugging Face Hub-Operationen mit dem `hf` CLI auszuführen, wodurch Authentifizierung, Dateitransfers, Repository-Erstellung, Cache-Operationen und Cloud-Compute-Jobs ermöglicht werden, und zwar unter Ausnutzung der Hugging Face-Infrastruktur und -Protokolle wie Repository-Tagging und Compute-Job-Verwaltung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar operações do Hugging Face Hub usando o `hf` CLI, permitindo autenticação, transferências de arquivos, criação de repositórios, operações de cache e trabalhos de computação em nuvem, tudo isso aproveitando a infraestrutura e os protocolos do Hugging Face, como marcação de repositórios e gerenciamento de trabalhos de computação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять операции Hugging Face Hub с помощью `hf` CLI, обеспечивая аутентификацию, передачу файлов, создание репозиториев, операции кэша и облачные вычислительные задания, все это при использовании инфраструктуры и протоколов Hugging Face, таких как тегирование репозиториев и управление вычислительными заданиями.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ عمليات هوجينغ فايس هاب باستخدام `hf` CLI، مما يسمح بالتحقق من الهوية ونقل الملفات وإنشاء مستودعات وعمليات ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت ووظائف الحوسبة السحابية، كل ذلك مع الاستفادة من البنية التحتية لبروتوكولات هوجينغ فايس مثل علامات المستودع وإدارة وظائف الحوسبة."},"useCases":{"en":["Downloading models and datasets from the Hugging Face Hub","Uploading files to Hub repositories for collaboration and version control","Managing local cache for efficient model and dataset storage"],"zh":["从 Hugging Face Hub 下载模型和数据集","将文件上传到 Hub 存储库以实现协作和版本控制","管理本地缓存以实现高效的模型和数据集存储"],"ja":["Hugging Face Hub からモデルおよびデータセットをダウンロードする","ファイルを Hub リポジトリにアップロードしてコラボレーションおよびバージョン管理を行う","ローカルキャッシュを管理してモデルおよびデータセットの効率的なストレージを実現する"],"ko":["Hugging Face Hub에서 모델 및 데이터셋을 다운로드합니다","파일을 Hub 저장소에 업로드하여 협업 및 버전 제어를 수행합니다","로컬 캐시를 관리하여 모델 및 데이터셋의 효율적인 저장소를 실현합니다"],"es":["Descargar modelos y conjuntos de datos de Hugging Face Hub","Subir archivos a los repositorios de Hub para la colaboración y el control de versiones","Gestionar la caché local para un almacenamiento eficiente de modelos y conjuntos de datos"],"fr":["Télécharger des modèles et des jeux de données à partir de Hugging Face Hub","Téléverser des fichiers vers les référentiels de Hub pour la collaboration et la gestion de versions","Gérer la mémoire cache locale pour un stockage efficace de modèles et de jeux de données"],"de":["Modelle und Datensätze von Hugging Face Hub herunterladen","Dateien in Hub-Repositorys hochladen für die Zusammenarbeit und Versionskontrolle","Lokale Cache für effizientes Modell- und Datensatzspeichern verwalten"],"pt":["Baixar modelos e conjuntos de dados do Hugging Face Hub","Carregar arquivos em repositórios do Hub para colaboração e controle de versão","Gerenciar cache local para armazenamento eficiente de modelos e conjuntos de dados"],"ru":["Скачивание моделей и наборов данных из Hugging Face Hub","Загрузка файлов в репозитории Hub для сотрудничества и контроля версий","Управление локальным кэшем для эффективного хранения моделей и наборов данных"],"ar":["تنزيل النماذج ومجموعات البيانات من هوجينغ فايس هاب","تحميل الملفات إلى مستودعات هاب للتعاون ومراقبة الإصدار","إدارة ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت المحلية لتخزين النماذج ومجموعات البيانات بفعالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Hugging Face account for authentication","Dependent on `hf` CLI tool installation and configuration","Limited to Hugging Face Hub operations and infrastructure"],"zh":["需要 Hugging Face 账户进行身份验证","依赖于 `hf` CLI 工具的安装和配置","仅限于 Hugging Face Hub 操作和基础设施"],"ja":["認証のために Hugging Face アカウントが必要","`hf` CLI ツールのインストールおよび構成に依存","Hugging Face Hub 操作およびインフラストラクチャに限定"],"ko":["인증을 위해 Hugging Face 계정이 필요합니다","`hf` CLI 도구의 설치 및 구성에 의존합니다","Hugging Face Hub 작업 및 인프라에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Hugging Face para la autenticación","Depende de la instalación y configuración de la herramienta `hf` CLI","Limitado a operaciones y infraestructura de Hugging Face Hub"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Hugging Face pour l''authentification","Dépend de l''installation et de la configuration de l''outil `hf` CLI","Limité aux opérations et à l''infrastructure de Hugging Face Hub"],"de":["Benötigt ein Hugging Face-Konto für die Authentifizierung","Hängt von der Installation und Konfiguration des `hf` CLI-Tools ab","Begrenzt auf Hugging Face Hub-Operationen und -Infrastruktur"],"pt":["Exige conta do Hugging Face para autenticação","Depende da instalação e configuração da ferramenta `hf` CLI","Limitado às operações e infraestrutura do Hugging Face Hub"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи Hugging Face для аутентификации","Зависит от установки и настройки инструмента `hf` CLI","Ограничен операциями и инфраструктурой Hugging Face Hub"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب هوجينغ فايس للتحقق من الهوية","يعتمد على تثبيت أداة `hf` CLI وضبطها","محدود bằng عمليات وبنية هوجينغ فايس هاب"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c011e33ff672d5b1ec80fd280f245ff0c15e8dac3b8a0d146c8973a596185878","repoEtag":"W/\"d4d9459564f81c1ff31ac7f0c8bef3b09fd0bddb85b49126293f0deb1bf630b8\"","qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('google-labs-code/stitch-skills/react-components', 'official', 'google-labs-code', 'stitch-skills', 'google-labs-code/stitch-skills', 'react:components', 1902, 219, 65, '2026-02-22T23:11:02Z', '2026-02-23T01:07:34.466Z', 'f0473659edcdda6edf9aa78fb705c01937196034fac1a76d24b8700b24481c03', '{"id":"google-labs-code/stitch-skills/react-components","name":"react:components","description":{"zh":"该AI工具可以将Stitch设计转换为模块化的Vite和React组件，使用系统级网络和AST基于验证","ja":"このAIエージェントはStitchデザインをモジュラーなViteとReactコンポーネントに変換することができます","ko":"이 AI 에이전트는 스티치 디자인을 모듈화된 vite와 리액트 컴포넌트로 변환할 수 있습니다","es":"react:components transforma diseños Stitch en componentes React modulares y limpios utilizando enfoques automatizados para garantizar la calidad del código","fr":"react:components transforme les conceptions Stitch en composants React modulaires et propres en utilisant des outils automatisés pour assurer la qualité du code","de":"react:components wandelt Stitch- Designs in modulare und saubere React-Komponenten um, indem es automatisierte Ansätze zur Gewährleistung der Codequalität verwendet","pt":"O react:components é uma ferramenta de IA que converte designs em componentes React modulares e limpos","ru":"ИИ Агент react:components преобразует дизайны в модульные и чистые компоненты React","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي react:components تحول التصاميم إلى مكونات رياكت موديلرية ونظيفة","en":"Converts Stitch designs into modular Vite and React components using system-level networking and AST-based validation."},"owner":"google-labs-code","repo":"stitch-skills","repoPath":"google-labs-code/stitch-skills","stars":1902,"forks":219,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T23:11:02Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"react:components","description":"Converts Stitch designs into modular Vite and React components using system-level networking and AST-based validation.","bodyPreview":"# Stitch to React Components\n\nYou are a frontend engineer focused on transforming designs into clean React code. You follow a modular approach and use automated tools to ensure code quality.\n\n## Retrieval and networking\n1. **Namespace discovery**: Run `list_tools` to find the Stitch MCP prefix. Use this prefix (e.g., `stitch:`) for all subsequent calls.\n2. **Metadata fetch**: Call `[prefix]:get_screen` to retrieve the design JSON.\n3. **High-reliability download**: Internal AI fetch tools can fai","body":"# Stitch to React Components\n\nYou are a frontend engineer focused on transforming designs into clean React code. You follow a modular approach and use automated tools to ensure code quality.\n\n## Retrieval and networking\n1. **Namespace discovery**: Run `list_tools` to find the Stitch MCP prefix. Use this prefix (e.g., `stitch:`) for all subsequent calls.\n2. **Metadata fetch**: Call `[prefix]:get_screen` to retrieve the design JSON.\n3. **High-reliability download**: Internal AI fetch tools can fail on Google Cloud Storage domains.\n   - Use the `Bash` tool to run: `bash scripts/fetch-stitch.sh \"[htmlCode.downloadUrl]\" \"temp/source.html\"`.\n   - This script handles the necessary redirects and security handshakes.\n4. **Visual audit**: Check `screenshot.downloadUrl` to confirm the design intent and layout details.\n\n## Architectural rules\n* **Modular components**: Break the design into independent files. Avoid large, single-file outputs.\n* **Logic isolation**: Move event handlers and business logic into custom hooks in `src/hooks/`.\n* **Data decoupling**: Move all static text, image URLs, and lists into `src/data/mockData.ts`.\n* **Type safety**: Every component must include a `Readonly` TypeScript interface named `[ComponentName]Props`.\n* **Project specific**: Focus on the target project''s needs and constraints. Leave Google license headers out of the generated React components.\n* **Style mapping**:\n    * Extract the `tailwind.config` from the HTML `<head>`.\n    * Sync these values with `resources/style-guide.json`.\n    * Use theme-mapped Tailwind classes instead of arbitrary hex codes.\n\n## Execution steps\n1. **Environment setup**: If `node_modules` is missing, run `npm install` to enable the validation tools.\n2. **Data layer**: Create `src/data/mockData.ts` based on the design content.\n3. **Component drafting**: Use `resources/component-template.tsx` as a base. Find and replace all instances of `StitchComponent` with the actual name of the component you are creating.\n4. **Application wiring**: Update the project entry point (like `App.tsx`) to render the new components.\n5. **Quality check**:\n    * Run `npm run validate <file_path>` for each component.\n    * Verify the final output against the `resources/architecture-checklist.md`.\n    * Start the dev server with `npm run dev` to verify the live result.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n* **Fetch errors**: Ensure the URL is quoted in the bash command to prevent shell errors.\n* **Validation errors**: Review the AST report and fix any missing interfaces or hardcoded styles."},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:07:34.466Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：React组件转换","ja":"AIエージェント：Reactコンポーネント生成","ko":"AI 에이전트: 리액트 컴포넌트 변환","es":"Herramientas AI: react:components para diseños modulares","fr":"Outils IA: react:components pour conceptions modulaires","de":"KI-Tools: react:components für modulare Designs","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: react:components para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: react:components для Разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: react:components لمطوري التطبيقات","en":"react:components"},"description":{"zh":"该AI工具可以将Stitch设计转换为模块化的Vite和React组件，使用系统级网络和AST基于验证","ja":"このAIエージェントはStitchデザインをモジュラーなViteとReactコンポーネントに変換することができます","ko":"이 AI 에이전트는 스티치 디자인을 모듈화된 vite와 리액트 컴포넌트로 변환할 수 있습니다","es":"react:components transforma diseños Stitch en componentes React modulares y limpios utilizando enfoques automatizados para garantizar la calidad del código","fr":"react:components transforme les conceptions Stitch en composants React modulaires et propres en utilisant des outils automatisés pour assurer la qualité du code","de":"react:components wandelt Stitch- Designs in modulare und saubere React-Komponenten um, indem es automatisierte Ansätze zur Gewährleistung der Codequalität ve...","pt":"O react:components é uma ferramenta de IA que converte designs em componentes React modulares e limpos","ru":"ИИ Агент react:components преобразует дизайны в модульные и чистые компоненты React","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي react:components تحول التصاميم إلى مكونات رياكت موديلرية ونظيفة","en":"Converts Stitch designs into modular Vite and React components using system-level networking and AST-based validation."},"definition":{"en":"Converts Stitch designs into modular Vite and React components using system-level networking and AST-based validation."},"features":{"zh":["将Stitch设计转换为模块化的Vite和React组件","使用系统级网络和AST基于验证","支持高可靠性下载","提供命名空间发现和元数据获取功能"],"ja":["StitchデザインをモジュラーなViteとReactコンポーネントに変換","システムレベルのネットワークとASTベースの検証を使用","高可靠性ダウンロードをサポート","名前空間の発見とメタデータの取得機能を提供"],"ko":["스티치 디자인을 모듈화된 vite와 리액트 컴포넌트로 변환","시스템 레벨의 네트워크와 AST 기반의 검증을 사용","고신뢰성 다운로드를 지원","네임스페이스 발견과 메타데이터获取 기능을 제공"],"es":["Conversión de diseños Stitch en componentes React modulares","Validación basada en AST para garantizar la calidad del código","Enfoque automatizado para la creación de componentes","Integración con Vite para un desarrollo más rápido","Uso de system-level networking para una mayor eficiencia"],"fr":["Conversion de conceptions Stitch en composants React modulaires","Validation basée sur AST pour assurer la qualité du code","Approche automatisée pour la création de composants","Intégration avec Vite pour un développement plus rapide","Utilisation de system-level networking pour une plus grande efficacité"],"de":["Umwandlung von Stitch-Designs in modulare React-Komponenten","AST-basierte Validierung zur Gewährleistung der Codequalität","Automatisierter Ansatz für die Komponenten-Erstellung","Integration mit Vite für eine schnellere Entwicklung","Verwendung von system-level networking für eine höhere Effizienz"],"pt":["Conversão de designs em componentes React modulares","Validação baseada em AST para garantir a qualidade do código","Networking de sistema para fetch de metadados","Suporte à descoberta de namespace","Download de alta confiabilidade"],"ru":["Преобразование дизайнов в модульные компоненты React","Валидация на основе AST для обеспечения качества кода","Системное сетевое взаимодействие для получения метаданных","Поддержка обнаружения namespace","Скачивание с высокой надежностью"],"ar":["تحويل التصاميم إلى مكونات رياكت موديلرية","التحقق من صحة AST لضمان جودة الكود","تواصل الشبكة لتجهيز البيانات الوصفية","دعم اكتشاف المساحة التسمية","تنزيل عالية الموثوقية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","React组件","Stitch设计","Vite","模块化","系统级网络","AST基于验证"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Reactコンポーネント","Stitchデザイン","Vite","モジュラー","システムレベルのネットワーク","ASTベースの検証"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","리액트 컴포넌트","스티치 디자인","vite","모듈화","시스템 레벨의 네트워크","AST 기반의 검증"],"es":["react:components","Herramientas AI","Diseños modulares","React","Vite","AST","Validación de código","Desarrollo de software"],"fr":["react:components","Outils IA","Conceptions modulaires","React","Vite","AST","Validation de code","Développement de logiciels"],"de":["react:components","KI-Tools","Modulare Designs","React","Vite","AST","Code-Validierung","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["react:components","Ferramentas de IA","Desenvolvimento de software","Componentes React","Validação de código","Networking de sistema"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","react:components","Разработка программного обеспечения","Компоненты React","Валидация кода","Системное сетевое взаимодействие"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","react:components","تطوير البرمجيات","مكونات رياكت","التحقق من صحة الكود","تواصل الشبكة"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring seamless conversion of Stitch designs into modular React components with Vite integration.","zh":"适用于需要将Stitch设计无缝转换为模块化React组件且具有Vite集成的前端代理。","ja":"StitchデザインをモジュラーのReactコンポーネントにシームレスに変換する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。Vite統合も含まれます。","ko":"Stitch 디자인을 모듈화된 React 컴포넌트로 무결점으로 변환해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, Vite 통합도 포함됩니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que requieren una conversión sin problemas de diseños de Stitch en componentes modulares de React con integración de Vite.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant une conversion transparente des conceptions de Stitch en composants modulaires React avec intégration de Vite.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine nahtlose Umwandlung von Stitch-Designs in modulare React-Komponenten mit Vite-Integration erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem conversão sem problemas de designs do Stitch em componentes modulares React com integração Vite.","ru":"Идеально для Фронтенд-Агентов, требующих бесшовного преобразования дизайнов Stitch в модульные компоненты React с интеграцией Vite.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يتطلبون تحويلًا بدون مشاكل لتصاميم Stitch إلى مكونات React مع مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع تكامل Vite."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert Stitch designs into modular Vite and React components using system-level networking and AST-based validation, ensuring high-quality code with automated tools like namespace discovery and metadata fetch via protocols.","zh":"赋予代理将Stitch设计转换为模块化的Vite和React组件的能力，利用系统级网络和基于AST的验证，确保高质量的代码，并通过协议实现命名空间发现和元数据获取等自动化工具。","ja":"エージェントがStitchデザインをモジュラーのViteとReactコンポーネントに変換できるようにし、システムレベルのネットワーキングとASTベースのバリデーションを使用して、高品質のコードを保証します。名前空間の発見やメタデータの取得などの自動化ツールをプロトコルで利用できます。","ko":"에이전트가 Stitch 디자인을 모듈화된 Vite 및 React 컴포넌트로 변환할 수 있도록 하여, 시스템 수준의 네트워킹 및 AST 기반의 유효성 검사를 사용하여 고품질의 코드를 보장합니다. 프로토콜을 통해 이름공간 발견 및 메타데이터 가져오기와 같은 자동화 도구를 사용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir diseños de Stitch en componentes modulares de Vite y React utilizando la conectividad de nivel de sistema y la validación basada en AST, lo que garantiza un código de alta calidad con herramientas automatizadas como el descubrimiento de espacios de nombres y la recuperación de metadatos a través de protocolos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des conceptions de Stitch en composants modulaires Vite et React en utilisant la connectivité au niveau du système et la validation basée sur AST, garantissant ainsi un code de haute qualité avec des outils automatisés tels que la découverte d''espaces de noms et la récupération de métadonnées via des protocoles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Stitch-Entwürfe in modulare Vite- und React-Komponenten umzuwandeln, indem sie System-Netzwerkfunktionen und AST-basierte Validierung verwenden, um einen hochwertigen Code mit automatisierten Tools wie Namensraumerkennung und Metadatenermittlung über Protokolle sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter designs do Stitch em componentes modulares Vite e React usando networking de nível de sistema e validação baseada em AST, garantindo um código de alta qualidade com ferramentas automatizadas como descoberta de namespace e fetch de metadados via protocolos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать дизайны Stitch в модульные компоненты Vite и React с использованием системного сетевого взаимодействия и валидации на основе AST, обеспечивая высококачественный код с автоматизированными инструментами, такими как обнаружение namespace и получение метаданных через протоколы.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحويل تصاميم Stitch إلى مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام Vite و React باستخدام شبكات مستوى النظام والتحقق القائم على AST، مما يضمن代码 عالي الجودة مع أدوات تلقائية مثل اكتشاف المساحة الاسمية و استرجاع البيانات الوصفية عبر البروتوكولات."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting Stitch designs into reusable React components","Automating code validation with AST-based tools","Generating modular Vite configurations for React projects"],"zh":["将Stitch设计转换为可重用的React组件","使用AST 기반工具自动化代码验证","为React项目生成模块化的Vite配置"],"ja":["Stitchデザインを再利用可能なReactコンポーネントに変換する","ASTベースのツールを使用してコードのバリデーションを自動化する","Reactプロジェクト用のモジュラーなVite構成を生成する"],"ko":["Stitch 디자인을 재사용 가능한 React 컴포넌트로 변환하는 것","AST 기반 도구를 사용하여 코드 유효성 검사를 자동화하는 것","React 프로젝트를 위한 모듈화된 Vite 구성 생성"],"es":["Conversión de diseños de Stitch en componentes de React reutilizables","Automatización de la validación de código con herramientas basadas en AST","Generación de configuraciones de Vite modulares para proyectos de React"],"fr":["Conversion de conceptions de Stitch en composants React réutilisables","Automation de la validation de code avec des outils basés sur AST","Génération de configurations Vite modulaires pour les projets React"],"de":["Umwandlung von Stitch-Designs in wiederverwendbare React-Komponenten","Automatisierung der Code-Validierung mit AST-basierten Tools","Generierung von modularen Vite-Konfigurationen für React-Projekte"],"pt":["Conversão de designs do Stitch em componentes React reutilizáveis","Automação da validação de código com ferramentas baseadas em AST","Geração de configurações Vite modulares para projetos React"],"ru":["Преобразование дизайнов Stitch в многоразовые компоненты React","Автоматизация валидации кода с помощью инструментов на основе AST","Генерация модульных конфигураций Vite для проектов React"],"ar":["تحويل تصاميم Stitch إلى مكونات React قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تأتمتة التحقق من صحة الكود باستخدام أدوات قائمة على AST","توليد تكوينات Vite القابلة للتشغيل للمشاريع React"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Stitch MCP prefix discovery","Dependent on internal AI fetch tools for high-reliability downloads"],"zh":["需要Stitch MCP前缀发现","依赖于内部AI获取工具以实现高可靠性下载"],"ja":["Stitch MCPプレフィックスの発見が必要","内部AIフェッチツールに依存して、高信頼性のダウンロードを実現"],"ko":["Stitch MCP 프리픽스 발견이 필요","내부 AI 가져오기 도구에 의존하여 고효율 다운로드를 구현"],"es":["Requiere el descubrimiento del prefijo MCP de Stitch","Dependiente de herramientas de recuperación de AI internas para descargas de alta confiabilidad"],"fr":["Nécessite la découverte du préfixe MCP de Stitch","Dépendante d''outils de récupération d''IA internes pour des téléchargements à haute fiabilité"],"de":["Erfordert die Erkennung des MCP-Präfix von Stitch","Abhängig von internen AI-Abfrage-Tools für hochzuverlässige Downloads"],"pt":["Exige a descoberta de prefixo MCP do Stitch","Depende de ferramentas de fetch de IA internas para downloads de alta confiabilidade"],"ru":["Требует обнаружения префикса MCP дизайна Stitch","Зависит от внутренних инструментов fetch ИИ для скачиваний с высокой надежностью"],"ar":["يتطلب اكتشاف بادئة MCP لتصميم Stitch","يعتمد على أدوات استرجاع الذكاء الاصطناعي الداخلية للتنزيلات عالية الموثوقية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f0473659edcdda6edf9aa78fb705c01937196034fac1a76d24b8700b24481c03","repoEtag":"W/\"97396f88dec05911887e095e3b912a4db53ced027333efd2abb67102273debbc\"","qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cloudflare/skills/agents-sdk', 'official', 'cloudflare', 'skills', 'cloudflare/skills', 'agents-sdk', 341, 32, 65, '2026-02-23T00:27:49Z', '2026-02-23T01:07:35.211Z', '6ee0d50d51db67e5fe338101cbdb787c0914938d7c319dd276392b9f2535619c', '{"id":"cloudflare/skills/agents-sdk","name":"agents-sdk","description":{"zh":"Cloudflare Agents SDK是一个用于构建AI智能代理的开发工具包，支持实时WebSocket应用、状态管理和工作流集成","ja":"Cloudflare Agents SDKはAIエージェントを構築するための開発ツールキットであり、リアルタイムのWebSocketアプリケーション、状態管理、ワークフロー統合をサポート","ko":"Cloudflare Agents SDK는 AI 에이전트를 구축하기 위한 개발 도구 키트로서 실시간 WebSocket 애플리케이션, 상태 관리 및 워크플로우 통합을 지원","es":"El Agents SDK de Cloudflare permite crear agentes de IA en Cloudflare Workers con características como gestión de estado y callable RPC","fr":"Le Agents SDK de Cloudflare permet de créer des agents d''IA sur Cloudflare Workers avec des fonctionnalités comme la gestion d''état et callable RPC","de":"Das Agents SDK von Cloudflare ermöglicht die Erstellung von KI-Agents auf Cloudflare Workers mit Funktionen wie Zustandsverwaltung und callable RPC","pt":"O Agents SDK da Cloudflare permite criar agentes de IA stateful, fluxos de trabalho duráveis e aplicativos WebSocket em tempo real","ru":"Agents SDK от Cloudflare позволяет создавать государственных агентов, долговечные рабочие процессы и приложения WebSocket в реальном времени","ar":"يسمح SDK وكلاء Cloudflare بإنشاء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي ذوي حالة، وعمليات عمل متينة، وتطبيقات WebSocket في الوقت الفعلي","en":"Build AI agents on Cloudflare Workers using the Agents SDK. Load when creating stateful agents, durable workflows, real-time WebSocket apps, scheduled tasks, MCP servers, or chat applications. Covers Agent class, state management, callable RPC, Workflows integration, and React hooks."},"owner":"cloudflare","repo":"skills","repoPath":"cloudflare/skills","stars":341,"forks":32,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T00:27:49Z","topics":["agents","cloudflare","skills","workers"],"skillMd":{"name":"agents-sdk","description":"Build AI agents on Cloudflare Workers using the Agents SDK. Load when creating stateful agents, durable workflows, real-time WebSocket apps, scheduled tasks, MCP servers, or chat applications. Covers Agent class, state management, callable RPC, Workflows integration, and React hooks.","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare Agents SDK\n\n**STOP.** Your knowledge of the Agents SDK may be outdated. Prefer retrieval over pre-training for any Agents SDK task.\n\n## Documentation\n\nFetch current docs from `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` before implementing.\n\n| Topic | Doc | Use for |\n|-------|-----|---------|\n| Getting started | `docs/getting-started.md` | First agent, project setup |\n| State | `docs/state.md` | `setState`, `validateStateChange`, persistence |\n| Routing | `docs/routing.md`","body":"# Cloudflare Agents SDK\n\n**STOP.** Your knowledge of the Agents SDK may be outdated. Prefer retrieval over pre-training for any Agents SDK task.\n\n## Documentation\n\nFetch current docs from `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` before implementing.\n\n| Topic | Doc | Use for |\n|-------|-----|---------|\n| Getting started | `docs/getting-started.md` | First agent, project setup |\n| State | `docs/state.md` | `setState`, `validateStateChange`, persistence |\n| Routing | `docs/routing.md` | URL patterns, `routeAgentRequest`, `basePath` |\n| Callable methods | `docs/callable-methods.md` | `@callable`, RPC, streaming, timeouts |\n| Scheduling | `docs/scheduling.md` | `schedule()`, `scheduleEvery()`, cron |\n| Workflows | `docs/workflows.md` | `AgentWorkflow`, durable multi-step tasks |\n| HTTP/WebSockets | `docs/http-websockets.md` | Lifecycle hooks, hibernation |\n| Email | `docs/email.md` | Email routing, secure reply resolver |\n| MCP client | `docs/mcp-client.md` | Connecting to MCP servers |\n| MCP server | `docs/mcp-servers.md` | Building MCP servers with `McpAgent` |\n| Client SDK | `docs/client-sdk.md` | `useAgent`, `useAgentChat`, React hooks |\n| Human-in-the-loop | `docs/human-in-the-loop.md` | Approval flows, pausing workflows |\n| Resumable streaming | `docs/resumable-streaming.md` | Stream recovery on disconnect |\n\nCloudflare docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/\n\n## Capabilities\n\nThe Agents SDK provides:\n\n- **Persistent state** - SQLite-backed, auto-synced to clients\n- **Callable RPC** - `@callable()` methods invoked over WebSocket\n- **Scheduling** - One-time, recurring (`scheduleEvery`), and cron tasks\n- **Workflows** - Durable multi-step background processing via `AgentWorkflow`\n- **MCP integration** - Connect to MCP servers or build your own with `McpAgent`\n- **Email handling** - Receive and reply to emails with secure routing\n- **Streaming chat** - `AIChatAgent` with resumable streams\n- **React hooks** - `useAgent`, `useAgentChat` for client apps\n\n## FIRST: Verify Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm ls agents  # Should show agents package\n```\n\nIf not installed:\n```bash\nnpm install agents\n```\n\n## Wrangler Configuration\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"durable_objects\": {\n    \"bindings\": [{ \"name\": \"MyAgent\", \"class_name\": \"MyAgent\" }]\n  },\n  \"migrations\": [{ \"tag\": \"v1\", \"new_sqlite_classes\": [\"MyAgent\"] }]\n}\n```\n\n## Agent Class\n\n```typescript\nimport { Agent, routeAgentRequest, callable } from \"agents\";\n\ntype State = { count: number };\n\nexport class Counter extends Agent<Env, State> {\n  initialState = { count: 0 };\n\n  // Validation hook - runs before state persists (sync, throwing rejects the update)\n  validateStateChange(nextState: State, source: Connection | \"server\") {\n    if (nextState.count < 0) throw new Error(\"Count cannot be negative\");\n  }\n\n  // Notification hook - runs after state persists (async, non-blocking)\n  onStateUpdate(state: State, source: Connection | \"server\") {\n    console.log(\"State updated:\", state);\n  }\n\n  @callable()\n  increment() {\n    this.setState({ count: this.state.count + 1 });\n    return this.state.count;\n  }\n}\n\nexport default {\n  fetch: (req, env) => routeAgentRequest(req, env) ?? new Response(\"Not found\", { status: 404 })\n};\n```\n\n## Routing\n\nRequests route to `/agents/{agent-name}/{instance-name}`:\n\n| Class | URL |\n|-------|-----|\n| `Counter` | `/agents/counter/user-123` |\n| `ChatRoom` | `/agents/chat-room/lobby` |\n\nClient: `useAgent({ agent: \"Counter\", name: \"user-123\" })`\n\n## Core APIs\n\n| Task | API |\n|------|-----|\n| Read state | `this.state.count` |\n| Write state | `this.setState({ count: 1 })` |\n| SQL query | `` this.sql`SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ${id}` `` |\n| Schedule (delay) | `await this.schedule(60, \"task\", payload)` |\n| Schedule (cron) | `await this.schedule(\"0 * * * *\", \"task\", payload)` |\n| Schedule (interval) | `await this.scheduleEvery(30, \"poll\")` |\n| RPC method | `@callable() myMethod() { ... }` |\n| Streaming RPC | `@callable({ streaming: true }) stream(res) { ... }` |\n| Start workflow | `await this.runWorkflow(\"ProcessingWorkflow\", params)` |\n\n## React Client\n\n```tsx\nimport { useAgent } from \"agents/react\";\n\nfunction App() {\n  const [state, setLocalState] = useState({ count: 0 });\n\n  const agent = useAgent({\n    agent: \"Counter\",\n    name: \"my-instance\",\n    onStateUpdate: (newState) => setLocalState(newState),\n    onIdentity: (name, agentType) => console.log(`Connected to ${name}`)\n  });\n\n  return (\n    <button onClick={() => agent.setState({ count: state.count + 1 })}>\n      Count: {state.count}\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## References\n\n- **[references/workflows.md](references/workflows.md)** - Durable Workflows integration\n- **[references/callable.md](references/callable.md)** - RPC methods, streaming, timeouts\n- **[references/state-scheduling.md](references/state-scheduling.md)** - State persistence, scheduling\n- **[references/streaming-chat.md](references/streaming-chat.md)** - AIChatAgent, resumable streams\n- **[references/mcp.md](references/mcp.md)** - MCP server integration\n- **[references/email.md](references/email.md)** - Email routing and handling\n- **[references/codemode.md](references/codemode.md)** - Code Mode (experimental)\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:07:35.211Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理 Cloudflare Agents SDK","ja":"AIエージェント開発用 Cloudflare Agents SDK","ko":"AI 에이전트 개발을 위한 Cloudflare Agents SDK","es":"Herramientas de Agentes de IA en Cloudflare","fr":"Outils d''Agents d''IA sur Cloudflare","de":"KI-Agenten-Tools auf Cloudflare","pt":"Construa Agentes de IA com o SDK de Agentes da Cloudflare","ru":"ИИ Агенты на Cloudflare Workers с помощью Agents SDK","ar":"ابني وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي مع SDK وكلاء Cloudflare","en":"agents-sdk"},"description":{"zh":"Cloudflare Agents SDK是一个用于构建AI智能代理的开发工具包，支持实时WebSocket应用、状态管理和工作流集成","ja":"Cloudflare Agents SDKはAIエージェントを構築するための開発ツールキットであり、リアルタイムのWebSocketアプリケーション、状態管理、ワークフロー統合をサポート","ko":"Cloudflare Agents SDK는 AI 에이전트를 구축하기 위한 개발 도구 키트로서 실시간 WebSocket 애플리케이션, 상태 관리 및 워크플로우 통합을 지원","es":"El Agents SDK de Cloudflare permite crear agentes de IA en Cloudflare Workers con características como gestión de estado y callable RPC","fr":"Le Agents SDK de Cloudflare permet de créer des agents d''IA sur Cloudflare Workers avec des fonctionnalités comme la gestion d''état et callable RPC","de":"Das Agents SDK von Cloudflare ermöglicht die Erstellung von KI-Agents auf Cloudflare Workers mit Funktionen wie Zustandsverwaltung und callable RPC","pt":"O Agents SDK da Cloudflare permite criar agentes de IA stateful, fluxos de trabalho duráveis e aplicativos WebSocket em tempo real","ru":"Agents SDK от Cloudflare позволяет создавать государственных агентов, долговечные рабочие процессы и приложения WebSocket в реальном времени","ar":"يسمح SDK وكلاء Cloudflare بإنشاء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي ذوي حالة، وعمليات عمل متينة، وتطبيقات WebSocket في الوقت الفعلي","en":"Build AI agents on Cloudflare Workers using the Agents SDK. Load when creating stateful agents, durable workflows, real-time WebSocket apps, scheduled tasks,..."},"definition":{"en":"Build AI agents on Cloudflare Workers using the Agents SDK. Load when creating stateful agents, durable workflows, real-time WebSocket apps, scheduled tasks, MCP servers, or chat applications. Covers Agent class, state management, callable RPC, Workflows integration, and React hooks."},"features":{"zh":["支持实时WebSocket应用","状态管理和持久化","工作流集成和可调用RPC","React Hooks支持","Cloudflare Workers集成"],"ja":["リアルタイムのWebSocketアプリケーションをサポート","状態管理と永続化","ワークフロー統合とcallable RPC","React Hooksをサポート","Cloudflare Workersをサポート"],"ko":["실시간 WebSocket 애플리케이션 지원","상태 관리 및 영속성","워크플로우 통합 및 callable RPC","React Hooks 지원","Cloudflare Workers 지원"],"es":["Clase de Agentes para crear agentes de IA personalizados","Gestión de estado para persistir datos","Callable RPC para comunicación entre agentes","Integración con Workflows para flujos de trabajo automatizados","React hooks para integración con aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Classe d''Agents pour créer des agents d''IA personnalisés","Gestion d''état pour persister des données","Callable RPC pour la communication entre agents","Intégration avec Workflows pour des flux de travail automatisés","React hooks pour l''intégration avec des applications web"],"de":["Agentenklasse für die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten KI-Agents","Zustandsverwaltung für die Persistenz von Daten","Callable RPC für die Kommunikation zwischen Agents","Integration mit Workflows für automatisierte Workflows","React hooks für die Integration mit Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Crie agentes de IA stateful","Desenvolva fluxos de trabalho duráveis","Construa aplicativos WebSocket em tempo real","Integre com o React","Gerencie estado com setState e validateStateChange"],"ru":["Создавайте государственных агентов","Разрабатывайте долговечные рабочие процессы","Создавайте приложения WebSocket в реальном времени","Интегрируйте с React","Управляйте состоянием с помощью setState и validateStateChange"],"ar":["ابني وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي ذوي حالة","طور عمليات عمل متينة","ابني تطبيقات WebSocket في الوقت الفعلي","ادمج مع React","ادير الحالة باستخدام setState و validateStateChange"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Cloudflare Agents SDK","实时WebSocket应用","状态管理","工作流集成","React Hooks","Cloudflare Workers","AI开发工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Cloudflare Agents SDK","リアルタイムのWebSocketアプリケーション","状態管理","ワークフロー統合","React Hooks","Cloudflare Workers","AI開発ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Cloudflare Agents SDK","실시간 WebSocket 애플리케이션","상태 관리","워크플로우 통합","React Hooks","Cloudflare Workers","AI 개발 도구"],"es":["agentes de ia","cloudflare workers","agents sdk","desarrollo de ia","automatización de tareas","inteligencia artificial","programación de ia"],"fr":["agents d''ia","cloudflare workers","agents sdk","développement d''ia","automatisation de tâches","intelligence artificielle","programmation d''ia"],"de":["ki-agents","cloudflare workers","agents sdk","entwicklung von ki","automatisierung von aufgaben","künstliche intelligenz","programmierung von ki"],"pt":["agentes de ia","cloudflare workers","sdk de agentes","desenvolvimento de ia","aplicativos websocket","fluxos de trabalho duráveis"],"ru":["ии агенты","cloudflare workers","agents sdk","разработка ии","приложения websocket","долговечные рабочие процессы"],"ar":["وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي","cloudflare workers","sdk وكلاء","تطوير ذكاء اصطناعي","تطبيقات websocket","عمليات عمل متينة"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloudflare-focused AI Agents seeking to build stateful applications, durable workflows, and real-time WebSocket apps using the Agents SDK.","zh":"适合于Cloudflare专注的AI代理，旨在使用Agents SDK构建有状态应用程序、持久工作流和实时WebSocket应用程序。","ja":"Cloudflareに焦点を当てたAIエージェント向けに、Agents SDKを使用してステートフルなアプリケーション、耐久性のあるワークフロー、リアルタイムのWebSocketアプリケーションを構築することが理想的です。","ko":"Cloudflare에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트를 위한 것으로, Agents SDK를 사용하여 상태가 있는 응용 프로그램, 지속적인 워크플로 및 실시간 WebSocket 응용 프로그램을 구축하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial de Cloudflare que buscan crear aplicaciones con estado, flujos de trabajo duraderos y aplicaciones WebSocket en tiempo real utilizando el SDK de Agentes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle Cloudflare qui souhaitent créer des applications à état, des flux de travail durables et des applications WebSocket en temps réel à l''aide du SDK d''Agents.","de":"Ideal für Cloudflare-AI-Agents, die stateful-Anwendungen, dauerhafte Workflows und Echtzeit-WebSocket-Apps mit dem Agents-SDK erstellen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA do Cloudflare que buscam criar aplicações stateful, fluxos de trabalho duráveis e aplicações WebSocket em tempo real usando o Agents SDK.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ Cloudflare, стремящихся создавать приложения со сохранением состояния, прочные рабочие процессы и приложения WebSocket в режиме реального времени с помощью Agents SDK.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي في Cloudflare الذين يسعون إلى بناء تطبيقات بحالة، وتدفقات عمل متينة، وتطبيقات WebSocket في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام Agents SDK."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create scalable and persistent applications using Cloudflare Workers, with features like state management through `setState` and `validateStateChange`, callable RPC, Workflows integration, and React hooks, all while leveraging WebSocket protocols for real-time communication.","zh":"赋予代理创建可扩展且持久的应用程序的能力，使用Cloudflare Workers，具有通过`setState`和`validateStateChange`进行状态管理、可调用RPC、Workflows集成和React hooks等功能，同时利用WebSocket协议进行实时通信。","ja":"エージェントが、Cloudflare Workersを使用してスケーラブルで耐久性のあるアプリケーションを作成できるようにし、`setState`と`validateStateChange`によるステート管理、呼び出し可能なRPC、Workflows統合、React hooksなどの機能を提供し、リアルタイム通信にはWebSocketプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 확장 가능하고 지속적인 응용 프로그램을 만들 수 있도록 하며, `setState`와 `validateStateChange`를 통한 상태 관리, 호출 가능한 RPC, Workflows 통합 및 React hooks 등의 기능을 제공하며, 실시간 통신에는 WebSocket 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones escalables y persistentes utilizando Cloudflare Workers, con características como administración de estado a través de `setState` y `validateStateChange`, RPC callable, integración de Workflows y ganchos de React, todo mientras se aprovechan los protocolos WebSocket para la comunicación en tiempo real.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications escalables et persistantes à l''aide de Cloudflare Workers, avec des fonctionnalités telles que la gestion d''état via `setState` et `validateStateChange`, RPC appelable, intégration de Workflows et crochets de React, le tout en exploitant les protocoles WebSocket pour la communication en temps réel.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, skalierbare und beständige Anwendungen mit Cloudflare Workers zu erstellen, mit Funktionen wie Zustandsverwaltung durch `setState` und `validateStateChange`, callable RPC, Workflows-Integration und React-Hooks, alles unter Ausnutzung der WebSocket-Protokolle für die Echtzeitkommunikation.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar aplicações escaláveis e persistentes usando Cloudflare Workers, com recursos como gerenciamento de estado por meio de `setState` e `validateStateChange`, RPC chamável, integração de Workflows e ganchos React, tudo isso aproveitando os protocolos WebSocket para comunicação em tempo real.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать масштабируемые и устойчивые приложения с помощью Cloudflare Workers, с функциями, такими как управление состоянием через `setState` и `validateStateChange`, вызываемый RPC, интеграция Workflows и крючки React, все это при помощи протоколов WebSocket для общения в реальном времени.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع ومتينة باستخدام Cloudflare Workers، مع ميزات مثل إدارة الحالة من خلال `setState` و `validateStateChange`، وبروتوكول RPC القابل للاتصال، وتكامل Workflows، وأقواس React، كل ذلك بالاستفادة من بروتوكولات WebSocket للاتصال في الوقت الفعلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Building stateful agents with durable workflows","Creating real-time WebSocket applications","Implementing scheduled tasks and MCP servers","Developing chat applications with React hooks"],"zh":["构建具有持久工作流的有状态代理","创建实时WebSocket应用程序","实现定时任务和MCP服务器","使用React hooks开发聊天应用程序"],"ja":["耐久性のあるワークフローを備えたステートフルなエージェントの構築","リアルタイムのWebSocketアプリケーションの作成","スケジュールされたタスクとMCPサーバーの実装","React hooksを使用したチャットアプリケーションの開発"],"ko":["지속적인 워크플로를 갖춘 상태가 있는 에이전트 구축","실시간 WebSocket 응용 프로그램 생성","예약된 작업 및 MCP 서버 구현","React hooks를 사용한 채팅 응용 프로그램 개발"],"es":["Creación de agentes con estado y flujos de trabajo duraderos","Creación de aplicaciones WebSocket en tiempo real","Implementación de tareas programadas y servidores MCP","Desarrollo de aplicaciones de chat con ganchos de React"],"fr":["Création d''agents à état et de flux de travail durables","Création d''applications WebSocket en temps réel","Mise en œuvre de tâches planifiées et de serveurs MCP","Développement d''applications de chat avec des crochets de React"],"de":["Erstellung von Agents mit Zustand und dauerhaften Workflows","Erstellung von Echtzeit-WebSocket-Anwendungen","Implementierung von geplanten Aufgaben und MCP-Servern","Entwicklung von Chat-Anwendungen mit React-Hooks"],"pt":["Construir agentes stateful com fluxos de trabalho duráveis","Criar aplicações WebSocket em tempo real","Implementar tarefas agendadas e servidores MCP","Desenvolver aplicações de chat com ganchos React"],"ru":["Создание агентов со сохранением состояния и прочными рабочими процессами","Разработка приложений WebSocket в режиме реального времени","Реализация запланированных задач и серверов MCP","Разработка приложений чата с крючками React"],"ar":["بناء وكلاء بحالة مع تدفقات عمل متينة","إنشاء تطبيقات WebSocket في الوقت الفعلي","تنفيذ المهام المجدولة وخادم MCP","تطوير تطبيقات الدردشة مع أقواس React"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cloudflare Workers setup","Knowledge of Agents SDK documentation from `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` is mandatory","Prefer retrieval over pre-training for any Agents SDK task"],"zh":["需要Cloudflare Workers设置","必须了解Agents SDK文档，见`https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs`","对于任何Agents SDK任务，优先使用检索而不是预训练"],"ja":["Cloudflare Workersの設定が必要","Agents SDKのドキュメントの知識が必須、`https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs`を参照","Agents SDKのタスクでは、事前トレーニングよりも取得を優先する"],"ko":["Cloudflare Workers 설정이 필요","Agents SDK 문서에 대한 지식이 필수, `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` 참조","에이전트 SDK 작업에서는 사전 교육보다 검색을 우선"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Cloudflare Workers","Conocimiento de la documentación del SDK de Agentes desde `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` es obligatorio","Preferir la recuperación sobre la preformación para cualquier tarea del SDK de Agentes"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Cloudflare Workers","Connaissance de la documentation du SDK d''Agents depuis `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` est obligatoire","Préférer la récupération à la préformation pour toute tâche du SDK d''Agents"],"de":["Erfordert Cloudflare-Workers-Setup","Kenntnisse der Agents-SDK-Dokumentation von `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` sind obligatorisch","Bevorzugung der Abrufung gegenüber der Vorbereitung für jede Agents-SDK-Aufgabe"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Cloudflare Workers","Conhecimento da documentação do Agents SDK de `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` é obrigatório","Preferir recuperação em vez de pré-treinamento para qualquer tarefa do Agents SDK"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Cloudflare Workers","Знание документации Agents SDK с `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` является обязательным","Предпочтение извлечения над предварительной подготовкой для любой задачи Agents SDK"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Cloudflare Workers","معرفة وثائق Agents SDK من `https://github.com/cloudflare/agents/tree/main/docs` أمر إلزامي","ال تفضيل استرجاع على التدريب المسبق لأي مهمة من مهام Agents SDK"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6ee0d50d51db67e5fe338101cbdb787c0914938d7c319dd276392b9f2535619c","repoEtag":"W/\"d80154fd9ed8586078af8bf4b067aaef85c0af6b0931f4dceda13fbdd08d77f7\"","qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('vercel/next.js/update-docs', 'official', 'vercel', 'next.js', 'vercel/next.js', 'update-docs', 137906, 30508, 65, '2026-02-23T00:04:20Z', '2026-02-23T01:08:22.169Z', '0f46c6e76a222cfa4008d16cdb1dfa37c413901db2b304a49cce829ef4c7ad71', '{"id":"vercel/next.js/update-docs","name":"update-docs","description":{"zh":"update-docs AI智能工具提供了一个指导性的工作流程，用于根据代码更改更新Next.js文档","ja":"update-docs AIエージェントは、コード変更に基づいてNext.jsのドキュメントを更新するためのガイド付きワークフローを提供","ko":"update-docs AI 에이전트는 코드 변경에 따라 Next.js 문서를 업데이트하는 데 도움이 되는 가이드 워크플로를 제공","es":"Actualiza documentación de Next.js con update-docs, una habilidad de IA que proporciona un flujo de trabajo guiado","fr":"Mettez à jour la documentation Next.js avec update-docs, un outil d''IA qui propose un flux de travail guidé","de":"Aktualisieren Sie die Next.js-Dokumentation mit update-docs, einem KI-Tool mit einem guidierten Workflow","pt":"O update-docs é uma habilidade de IA que ajuda a manter a documentação de Next.js atualizada com base nas alterações de código.","ru":"ИИ Агент update-docs помогает поддерживать документацию Next.js в актуальном состоянии на основе изменений кода.","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي update-docs تساعد في الحفاظ على توثيق Next.js محدث بناءً على تغييرات الكود.","en":"This skill should be used when the user asks to update documentation for my changes, check docs for this PR, what docs need updating, sync docs with code, scaffold docs for this feature, document this feature, review docs completeness, add docs for this change, what documentation is affected, doc..."},"owner":"vercel","repo":"next.js","repoPath":"vercel/next.js","stars":137906,"forks":30508,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T00:04:20Z","topics":["blog","browser","compiler","components","hybrid","nextjs","node","react","server-rendering","ssg","static","static-site-generator","universal","vercel"],"skillMd":{"name":"update-docs","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to update documentation for my changes, check docs for this PR, what docs need updating, sync docs with code, scaffold docs for this feature, document this feature, review docs completeness, add docs for this change, what documentation is affected, docs impact, or mentions docs/, docs/01-app, docs/02-pages, MDX, documentation update, API reference, .mdx files. Provides guided workflow for updating Next.js documentation based on code changes.","bodyPreview":"# Next.js Documentation Updater\n\nGuides you through updating Next.js documentation based on code changes on the active branch. Designed for maintainers reviewing PRs for documentation completeness.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Analyze changes**: Run `git diff canary...HEAD --stat` to see what files changed\n2. **Identify affected docs**: Map changed source files to documentation paths\n3. **Review each doc**: Walk through updates with user confirmation\n4. **Validate**: Run `pnpm lint` to check formatting","body":"# Next.js Documentation Updater\n\nGuides you through updating Next.js documentation based on code changes on the active branch. Designed for maintainers reviewing PRs for documentation completeness.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Analyze changes**: Run `git diff canary...HEAD --stat` to see what files changed\n2. **Identify affected docs**: Map changed source files to documentation paths\n3. **Review each doc**: Walk through updates with user confirmation\n4. **Validate**: Run `pnpm lint` to check formatting\n5. **Commit**: Stage documentation changes\n\n## Workflow: Analyze Code Changes\n\n### Step 1: Get the diff\n\n```bash\n# See all changed files on this branch\ngit diff canary...HEAD --stat\n\n# See changes in specific areas\ngit diff canary...HEAD -- packages/next/src/\n```\n\n### Step 2: Identify documentation-relevant changes\n\nLook for changes in these areas:\n\n| Source Path                            | Likely Doc Impact           |\n| -------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `packages/next/src/client/components/` | Component API reference     |\n| `packages/next/src/server/`            | Function API reference      |\n| `packages/next/src/shared/lib/`        | Varies by export            |\n| `packages/next/src/build/`             | Configuration or build docs |\n| `packages/next/src/lib/`               | Various features            |\n\n### Step 3: Map to documentation files\n\nUse the code-to-docs mapping in `references/CODE-TO-DOCS-MAPPING.md` to find corresponding documentation files.\n\nExample mappings:\n\n- `src/client/components/image.tsx` → `docs/01-app/03-api-reference/02-components/image.mdx`\n- `src/server/config-shared.ts` → `docs/01-app/03-api-reference/05-config/`\n\n## Workflow: Update Existing Documentation\n\n### Step 1: Read the current documentation\n\nBefore making changes, read the existing doc to understand:\n\n- Current structure and sections\n- Frontmatter fields in use\n- Whether it uses `<AppOnly>` / `<PagesOnly>` for router-specific content\n\n### Step 2: Identify what needs updating\n\nCommon updates include:\n\n- **New props/options**: Add to the props table and create a section explaining usage\n- **Changed behavior**: Update descriptions and examples\n- **Deprecated features**: Add deprecation notices and migration guidance\n- **New examples**: Add code blocks following conventions\n\n### Step 3: Apply updates with confirmation\n\nFor each change:\n\n1. Show the user what you plan to change\n2. Wait for confirmation before editing\n3. Apply the edit\n4. Move to the next change\n\n### Step 4: Check for shared content\n\nIf the doc uses the `source` field pattern (common for Pages Router docs), the source file is the one to edit. Example:\n\n```yaml\n# docs/02-pages/... file with shared content\n---\nsource: app/building-your-application/optimizing/images\n---\n```\n\nEdit the App Router source, not the Pages Router file.\n\n### Step 5: Validate changes\n\n```bash\npnpm lint          # Check formatting\npnpm prettier-fix  # Auto-fix formatting issues\n```\n\n## Workflow: Scaffold New Feature Documentation\n\nUse this when adding documentation for entirely new features.\n\n### Step 1: Determine the doc type\n\n| Feature Type        | Doc Location                                        | Template         |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| New component       | `docs/01-app/03-api-reference/02-components/`       | API Reference    |\n| New function        | `docs/01-app/03-api-reference/04-functions/`        | API Reference    |\n| New config option   | `docs/01-app/03-api-reference/05-config/`           | Config Reference |\n| New concept/guide   | `docs/01-app/02-guides/`                            | Guide            |\n| New file convention | `docs/01-app/03-api-reference/03-file-conventions/` | File Convention  |\n\n### Step 2: Create the file with proper naming\n\n- Use kebab-case: `my-new-feature.mdx`\n- Add numeric prefix if ordering matters: `05-my-new-feature.mdx`\n- Place in the correct directory based on feature type\n\n### Step 3: Use the appropriate template\n\n**API Reference Template:**\n\n```mdx\n---\ntitle: Feature Name\ndescription: Brief description of what this feature does.\n---\n\n{/* The content of this doc is shared between the app and pages router. You can use the `<PagesOnly>Content</PagesOnly>` component to add content that is specific to the Pages Router. Any shared content should not be wrapped in a component. */}\n\nBrief introduction to the feature.\n\n## Reference\n\n### Props\n\n<div style={{ overflowX: ''auto'', width: ''100%'' }}>\n\n| Prop                    | Example            | Type   | Status   |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------ | ------ | -------- |\n| [`propName`](#propname) | `propName=\"value\"` | String | Required |\n\n</div>\n\n#### `propName`\n\nDescription of the prop.\n\n\\`\\`\\`tsx filename=\"app/example.tsx\" switcher\n// TypeScript example\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n\\`\\`\\`jsx filename=\"app/example.js\" switcher\n// JavaScript example\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\n**Guide Template:**\n\n```mdx\n---\ntitle: How to do X in Next.js\nnav_title: X\ndescription: Learn how to implement X in your Next.js application.\n---\n\nIntroduction explaining why this guide is useful.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nWhat the reader needs to know before starting.\n\n## Step 1: First Step\n\nExplanation and code example.\n\n\\`\\`\\`tsx filename=\"app/example.tsx\" switcher\n// Code example\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Step 2: Second Step\n\nContinue with more steps...\n\n## Next Steps\n\nRelated topics to explore.\n```\n\n### Step 4: Add related links\n\nUpdate frontmatter with related documentation:\n\n```yaml\nrelated:\n  title: Next Steps\n  description: Learn more about related features.\n  links:\n    - app/api-reference/functions/related-function\n    - app/guides/related-guide\n```\n\n## Documentation Conventions\n\nSee `references/DOC-CONVENTIONS.md` for complete formatting rules.\n\n### Quick Reference\n\n**Frontmatter (required):**\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: Page Title (2-3 words)\ndescription: One or two sentences describing the page.\n---\n```\n\n**Code blocks:**\n\n```\n\\`\\`\\`tsx filename=\"app/page.tsx\" switcher\n// TypeScript first\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n\\`\\`\\`jsx filename=\"app/page.js\" switcher\n// JavaScript second\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\n**Router-specific content:**\n\n```mdx\n<AppOnly>Content only for App Router docs.</AppOnly>\n\n<PagesOnly>Content only for Pages Router docs.</PagesOnly>\n```\n\n**Notes:**\n\n```mdx\n> **Good to know**: Single line note.\n\n> **Good to know**:\n>\n> - Multi-line note point 1\n> - Multi-line note point 2\n```\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\nBefore committing documentation changes:\n\n- [ ] Frontmatter has `title` and `description`\n- [ ] Code blocks have `filename` attribute\n- [ ] TypeScript examples use `switcher` with JS variant\n- [ ] Props tables are properly formatted\n- [ ] Related links point to valid paths\n- [ ] `pnpm lint` passes\n- [ ] Changes render correctly (if preview available)\n\n## References\n\n- `references/DOC-CONVENTIONS.md` - Complete frontmatter and formatting rules\n- `references/CODE-TO-DOCS-MAPPING.md` - Source code to documentation mapping\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-02-23T01:08:22.169Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：update-docs 文档更新","ja":"AIエージェント：update-docs ドキュメント更新","ko":"AI 에이전트: update-docs 문서 업데이트","es":"Herramientas de IA: Actualiza Documentos con update-docs","fr":"Outils d''IA : Mettre à jour les documents avec update-docs","de":"KI-Tools: Dokumente mit update-docs aktualisieren","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Atualize Documentação com update-docs","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Обновите Документацию с update-docs","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: تحديث الوثائق باستخدام update-docs","en":"update-docs"},"description":{"zh":"update-docs AI智能工具提供了一个指导性的工作流程，用于根据代码更改更新Next.js文档","ja":"update-docs AIエージェントは、コード変更に基づいてNext.jsのドキュメントを更新するためのガイド付きワークフローを提供","ko":"update-docs AI 에이전트는 코드 변경에 따라 Next.js 문서를 업데이트하는 데 도움이 되는 가이드 워크플로를 제공","es":"Actualiza documentación de Next.js con update-docs, una habilidad de IA que proporciona un flujo de trabajo guiado","fr":"Mettez à jour la documentation Next.js avec update-docs, un outil d''IA qui propose un flux de travail guidé","de":"Aktualisieren Sie die Next.js-Dokumentation mit update-docs, einem KI-Tool mit einem guidierten Workflow","pt":"O update-docs é uma habilidade de IA que ajuda a manter a documentação de Next.js atualizada com base nas alterações de código.","ru":"ИИ Агент update-docs помогает поддерживать документацию Next.js в актуальном состоянии на основе изменений кода.","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي update-docs تساعد في الحفاظ على توثيق Next.js محدث بناءً على تغييرات الكود.","en":"This skill should be used when the user asks to update documentation for my changes, check docs for this PR, what docs need updating, sync docs with code, sc..."},"definition":{"en":"This skill should be used when the user asks to update documentation for my changes, check docs for this PR, what docs need updating, sync docs with code, scaffold docs for this feature, document this feature, review docs completeness, add docs for this change, what documentation is affected, docs impact, or mentions docs/, docs/01-app, docs/02-pages, MDX, documentation update, API reference, .mdx files. Provides guided workflow for updating Next.js documentation based on code changes."},"features":{"zh":["自动更新Next.js文档","根据代码更改更新文档","支持MDX和API参考文档","提供文档完整性审查","支持多种文档格式"],"ja":["Next.jsのドキュメントを自動更新","コード変更に基づいてドキュメントを更新","MDXおよびAPIリファレンスドキュメントをサポート","ドキュメントの完全性を確認","複数のドキュメント形式をサポート"],"ko":["Next.js 문서 자동 업데이트","코드 변경에 따라 문서 업데이트하기","MDX 및 API 참조 문서 지원","문서 완전성 검토 제공","다중 문서 형식 지원"],"es":["Flujo de trabajo guiado para actualizar documentación","Compatibilidad con Next.js y React","Actualización de documentación basada en cambios de código","Soporte para MDX y archivos .mdx","Revisión de la completitud de la documentación"],"fr":["Flux de travail guidé pour la mise à jour de la documentation","Compatibilité avec Next.js et React","Mise à jour de la documentation basée sur les modifications de code","Prise en charge de MDX et de fichiers .mdx","Vérification de l''exhaustivité de la documentation"],"de":["Guidierter Workflow für die Aktualisierung von Dokumentation","Kompatibilität mit Next.js und React","Aktualisierung der Dokumentation basierend auf Codeänderungen","Unterstützung für MDX und .mdx-Dateien","Überprüfung der Vollständigkeit der Dokumentation"],"pt":["Atualiza a documentação de Next.js com base nas alterações de código","Fornece um fluxo de trabalho guiado para manter a documentação atualizada","Suporta MDX e arquivos .mdx","Verifica a documentação para garantir a completude","Identifica os documentos afetados pelas alterações de código"],"ru":["Обновляет документацию Next.js на основе изменений