T, and LangChain that need structured workflows for collaborative documentation tasks."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to guide users through Context Gathering, Refinement & Structure, and Reader Testing stages, leveraging iterative content refinement and verification protocols to produce high-quality documentation, including PRDs, design docs, decision docs, and RFCs.","zh":"Empowers agents to guide users through Context Gathering, Refinement & Structure, and Reader Testing stages, leveraging iterative content refinement and verification protocols to produce high-quality documentation, including PRDs, design docs, decision docs, and RFCs.","ja":"Empowers agents to guide users through Context Gathering, Refinement & Structure, and Reader Testing stages, leveraging iterative content refinement and verification protocols to produce high-quality documentation, including PRDs, design docs, decision docs, and RFCs.","ko":"Empowers agents to guide users through Context Gathering, Refinement & Structure, and Reader Testing stages, leveraging iterative content refinement and verification protocols to produce high-quality documentation, including PRDs, design docs, decision docs, and RFCs.","es":"Empowers agents to guide users through Context Gathering, Refinement & Structure, and Reader Testing stages, leveraging iterative content refinement and verification protocols to produce high-quality documentation, including PRDs, design docs, decision docs, and RFCs.","fr":"Empowers agents to guide users through Context Gathering, Refinement & Structure, and Reader Testing stages, leveraging iterative content refinement and verification protocols to produce high-quality documentation, including PRDs, design docs, decision docs, and RFCs.","de":"Empowers agents to guide users through Context Gathering, Refinement & Structure, and Reader Testing stages, leveraging iterative content refinement and verification protocols to produce high-quality documentation, including PRDs, 